{"item_id": "B004N5XUE6", "title": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Ketalist 1-Person Cookset", "description": "The GSI Glacier Stainless Ketalist is the ultimate, integrated, campfire cooking and eating solution for ultralight backpacking. If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on cooking, Glacier Stainless is for you. Each piece is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last. A major leap forward in clean and green plastics, Infinity is an ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-free alternative to polycarbonate resins. With exceptional clarity, jewel-like brilliance and 25% weight savings over polycarbonate, its beauty is truly inspired. Furthermore, Infinity will not absorb food odors like other plastics and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into food or beverage. It's dishwasher safe and becomes more stain-resistant with every wash.Classic, low profile design provides the capacity of a 1 liter Glacier Stainless boiler in the easy-to-pour profile of a tea kettle for boiling water or melting snow on solo adventures..Convenient folding handle locks into place to save finger tips from burns..Unique bowl + mug solution with low center of gravity and Sip-It lid virtually eliminate spills, while the insulating sleeve keeps your drinks hot..Stuff sack's nylon bottom panel and short sides help to keep soot and char off your clothes and other gear..1.0 L Kettle. 14 fl insulated mug; 14 oz bowl; sip top; telescoping foon; stuff sack.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Glacier Stainless Ketalist 1-Person Cookset The GSI Glacier Stainless Ketalist is the ultimate, integrated, campfire cooking and eating solution for ultralight backpacking. If you need kitchenware that can take a beating and keep on cooking, Glacier Stainless is for you. Each piece is made of high-grade 18/8 stainless steel and built to last. A major leap forward in clean and green plastics, Infinity is an ultra-lightweight, completely recyclable, BPA-free alternative to polycarbonate resins. With exceptional clarity, jewel-like brilliance and 25% weight savings over polycarbonate, its beauty is truly inspired. Furthermore, Infinity will not absorb food odors like other plastics and will not leach plasticizers or other chemicals into food or beverage. It's dishwasher safe and becomes more stain-resistant with every wash.Classic, low profile design provides the capacity of a 1 liter Glacier Stainless boiler in the easy-to-pour profile of a tea kettle for boiling water or melting snow on solo adventures..Convenient folding handle locks into place to save finger tips from burns..Unique bowl + mug solution with low center of gravity and Sip-It lid virtually eliminate spills, while the insulating sleeve keeps your drinks hot..Stuff sack's nylon bottom panel and short sides help to keep soot and char off your clothes and other gear..1.0 L Kettle. 14 fl insulated mug; 14 oz bowl; sip top; telescoping foon; stuff sack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fXmaTE%2BRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N5XUE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 39.25}}
{"item_id": "B004N628E8", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Convertible Jacket", "description": "ELITE Barrier Convertible Jacket The venerable Barrier Convertible Jacket returns; updated with the same great features, fabric and more aggressive look. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct-Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth One hand pull elastic draw cord at waist with welded, reinforced exit point One back pocket and two hand pockets Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Barrier Convertible Jacket ELITE Barrier Convertible Jacket The venerable Barrier Convertible Jacket returns; updated with the same great features, fabric and more aggressive look. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct-Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth One hand pull elastic draw cord at waist with welded, reinforced exit point One back pocket and two hand pockets Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Gk8A7t77L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N628E8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N6295G", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Convertible Jacket", "description": "ELITE Thermal Convertible Jacket With a tight-knit fleece that resists wind and removable sleeves to convert it into a vest, this jacket can adapt to a wide range of conditions. ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric provides superior moisture transfer and warmth Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and cuffs Three back pockets Reflective elements for low-light visibility Zip-off sleeves", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Convertible Jacket ELITE Thermal Convertible Jacket With a tight-knit fleece that resists wind and removable sleeves to convert it into a vest, this jacket can adapt to a wide range of conditions. ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric provides superior moisture transfer and warmth Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and cuffs Three back pockets Reflective elements for low-light visibility Zip-off sleeves", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4172ckb0qkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N6295G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N629DS", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Long Sleeve Jersey", "description": "ELITE Thermal LS Jersey Ideal used on its own for early spring or late fall rides when you want constant warmth throughout your ride, or with one of our Barrier styles for wind resistance on colder days. ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric provides superior moisture transfer and warmth Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and cuffs Three back pockets with hidden sweat-proof pocket Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Elite Thermal Long Sleeve Jersey ELITE Thermal LS Jersey Ideal used on its own for early spring or late fall rides when you want constant warmth throughout your ride, or with one of our Barrier styles for wind resistance on colder days. ELITE Thermal Fleece fabric provides superior moisture transfer and warmth Full-length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth Elasticized hem and cuffs Three back pockets with hidden sweat-proof pocket Reflective elements for low-light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FK9HIsIDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N629DS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
