{"item_id": "B004N62BWW", "title": "Pearl Izumi Women's Elite Barrier Vest", "description": "W ELITE Barrier Vest Windproof and water resistant, the comfortable and highly breathable Women’s ELITE Barrier Vest provides lightweight, packable core protection. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct–Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth One hand pull elastic draw cord at waist with welded, reinforced exit point One zippered back pocket Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Women's Elite Barrier Vest W ELITE Barrier Vest Windproof and water resistant, the comfortable and highly breathable Women’s ELITE Barrier Vest provides lightweight, packable core protection. ELITE Barrier fabric provides superior wind protection and water resistance Direct–Vent panels provide superior ventilation Full length internal draft flap with zipper garage seals in warmth One hand pull elastic draw cord at waist with welded, reinforced exit point One zippered back pocket Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416cej1IhCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62BWW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Vests"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N62HJ4", "title": "Pearl Izumi Pro Softshell Lobster Glove", "description": "P.R.O. Softshell Lobster Glove If it’s cold and dry outside, choose our classic Lobster winter cycling glove, updated with Primaloft® insulation for optimal warmth without bulk. P.R.O. Softshell provides wind and water protection Primaloft® insulation provides optimal warmth without bulk Waterproof insert provides an extra degree of warmth and weather protection Fleece lined Pittards® WR 100X Natural Carbon Leather palm provides superior softness and durability Hook and loop closure Anatomic fit maximizes finger dexterity for shifting and braking Soft fleece wiping surface on thumb Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Pro Softshell Lobster Glove P.R.O. Softshell Lobster Glove If it’s cold and dry outside, choose our classic Lobster winter cycling glove, updated with Primaloft® insulation for optimal warmth without bulk. P.R.O. Softshell provides wind and water protection Primaloft® insulation provides optimal warmth without bulk Waterproof insert provides an extra degree of warmth and weather protection Fleece lined Pittards® WR 100X Natural Carbon Leather palm provides superior softness and durability Hook and loop closure Anatomic fit maximizes finger dexterity for shifting and braking Soft fleece wiping surface on thumb Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416ZTlhiyOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62HJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]], "price": 75.0}}
{"item_id": "B004N62HYY", "title": "Pearl Izumi Shine Wind Mitt", "description": "Shine Wind Mitt The Shine Wind Mitt’s stowable wind mitt delivers versatility for changing conditions as well as a handy key pocket on the wrist. P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric provides optimal warmth in mild conditions Stowable mitt keeps fingers out of the wind Silicone screened palm for a performance grip One easy access envelope pocket Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Shine Wind Mitt Shine Wind Mitt The Shine Wind Mitt’s stowable wind mitt delivers versatility for changing conditions as well as a handy key pocket on the wrist. P.R.O. Thermal Lite fabric provides optimal warmth in mild conditions Stowable mitt keeps fingers out of the wind Silicone screened palm for a performance grip One easy access envelope pocket Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41W829wjn0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62HYY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Mittens"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N62I1G", "title": "Pearl Izumi Men's Thermal Glove,Black,Small", "description": "Thermal Glove Thermal Gloves are the ultimate cool weather glove, utilizing MineraleTM technology to provide optimal warmth and moisture transfer. P.R.O. Thermal fabric with Minerale™ provides optimal insulation, moisture transfer, dry time and odor–resistance Clarino ™ synthetic leather strategically placed in high–wear areas Soft fleece wiping surface on thumb Silicone screened palm for a performance grip Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Men's Thermal Glove,Black,Small Thermal Glove Thermal Gloves are the ultimate cool weather glove, utilizing MineraleTM technology to provide optimal warmth and moisture transfer. P.R.O. Thermal fabric with Minerale™ provides optimal insulation, moisture transfer, dry time and odor–resistance Clarino ™ synthetic leather strategically placed in high–wear areas Soft fleece wiping surface on thumb Silicone screened palm for a performance grip Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vnEJsyEeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62I1G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
