{"item_id": "B004N62JK6", "title": "Pearl Izumi Elite Barrier Mtb Shoe Cover", "description": "ELITE Barrier MTB Shoe Cover Our best selling MTB shoe covers are back with all new paneling, rear closure, and Kevlar® bottom providing exceptional warmth and weather protection. 3mm neoprene construction is fleece lined to provide optimal warmth and protection Innovative power band secures front of shoe cover under toes Two stage hook and loop closure provides both sleek fit and easy on and off Anatomic paneling for a performance fit Kevlar® mountain bike bottom spreads open for easy on and off while providing superior durability Recommended for mountain bike shoes For X–Alp compatibility, use shoe cover that is equivalent to your X–Alp shoe plus one shoe size Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Elite Barrier Mtb Shoe Cover ELITE Barrier MTB Shoe Cover Our best selling MTB shoe covers are back with all new paneling, rear closure, and Kevlar® bottom providing exceptional warmth and weather protection. 3mm neoprene construction is fleece lined to provide optimal warmth and protection Innovative power band secures front of shoe cover under toes Two stage hook and loop closure provides both sleek fit and easy on and off Anatomic paneling for a performance fit Kevlar® mountain bike bottom spreads open for easy on and off while providing superior durability Recommended for mountain bike shoes For X–Alp compatibility, use shoe cover that is equivalent to your X–Alp shoe plus one shoe size Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ax-fMFyXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62JK6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N62JWY", "title": "Pearl Izumi Barrier Lite Shoe Cover", "description": "Barrier Lite Shoe Cover The lightweight and protective Barrier Lite Shoe Covers are ideal in cool, windy weather. P.R.O. Barrier Lite fabric provides lightweight wind protection and water resistance Wind tunnel tested for aerodynamics Simple pull–on design with hook and loop ankle tab Recommended for road shoes with external cleats", "text": "Pearl Izumi Barrier Lite Shoe Cover Barrier Lite Shoe Cover The lightweight and protective Barrier Lite Shoe Covers are ideal in cool, windy weather. P.R.O. Barrier Lite fabric provides lightweight wind protection and water resistance Wind tunnel tested for aerodynamics Simple pull–on design with hook and loop ankle tab Recommended for road shoes with external cleats", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TOby5Cj3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62JWY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004N62K3C", "title": "Pearl Izumi Pro Thermal Toe Cover", "description": "P.R.O. Thermal Toe Cover P.R.O. Thermal Toe Covers feature an easy on and off design with road or mountain bike shoe compatibility. P.R.O. Softshell provides optimal wind and water protection Innovative power band secures front of shoe cover under toes Kevlar® bottom with hook and loop closure allows easy on and off Recommended for road or mountain bike shoes For X–Alp compatibility, use shoe cover that is equivalent to your X–Alp shoe plus one shoe size Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "text": "Pearl Izumi Pro Thermal Toe Cover P.R.O. Thermal Toe Cover P.R.O. Thermal Toe Covers feature an easy on and off design with road or mountain bike shoe compatibility. P.R.O. Softshell provides optimal wind and water protection Innovative power band secures front of shoe cover under toes Kevlar® bottom with hook and loop closure allows easy on and off Recommended for road or mountain bike shoes For X–Alp compatibility, use shoe cover that is equivalent to your X–Alp shoe plus one shoe size Reflective elements for low–light visibility", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eA%2BSGLqzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N62K3C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearl iZUMi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 28.24}}
{"item_id": "B004N6ZVX8", "title": "ezShade Canopy Sun Shield (Award Winning) BLOCKS 99% UVA/UVB rays - DOUBLES shade, keeps you COOLER, and INSTANTLY ATTACHES to the FABRIC of ANY nylon/poly canopy. CANOPY NOT INCLUDED", "description": "Thank you for shopping small businesses. Your support keeps small businesses like ours alive. We couldn't do it without you and are very thankful for your business. The ezShade is the ONLY portable sun shield that blocks over 99% UVA/UVB rays and INSTANTLY ATTACHES to ANY portable CANOPY. DOUBLES your SHADE and keeps you COOLER. Purchase includes 1 sidewall. CANOPY NOT INCLUDED. Please note that this may not fit Coleman brand canopies. Up to 1/3 of CANCER causing UV rays can reach your skin while you are sitting under a basic canopy. The researchers of this study concluded that shade structures with side-on walls or other side protection provide the greatest shelter from the sun's rays. The ezShade is the only portable sun shield that helps to block those reflected UV rays . Sets up in seconds with peel and stick hook strips. Multiple panels can be added to create a portable privacy enclosure. Weight bottom pocket with sand, water bottles or other lightweight objects to stabilize your canopy. Weighs less than 16 ounces & comes with a matching tote. invented by a mom. Endorsements: Outstanding Product Award from Disney's iParenting Media Award Endorsed by the Melanoma International Foundation Winner of the Huggies' MomInspired Grant Program", "text": "ezShade Canopy Sun Shield (Award Winning) BLOCKS 99% UVA/UVB rays - DOUBLES shade, keeps you COOLER, and INSTANTLY ATTACHES to the FABRIC of ANY nylon/poly canopy. CANOPY NOT INCLUDED Thank you for shopping small businesses. Your support keeps small businesses like ours alive. We couldn't do it without you and are very thankful for your business. The ezShade is the ONLY portable sun shield that blocks over 99% UVA/UVB rays and INSTANTLY ATTACHES to ANY portable CANOPY. DOUBLES your SHADE and keeps you COOLER. Purchase includes 1 sidewall. CANOPY NOT INCLUDED. Please note that this may not fit Coleman brand canopies. Up to 1/3 of CANCER causing UV rays can reach your skin while you are sitting under a basic canopy. The researchers of this study concluded that shade structures with side-on walls or other side protection provide the greatest shelter from the sun's rays. The ezShade is the only portable sun shield that helps to block those reflected UV rays . Sets up in seconds with peel and stick hook strips. Multiple panels can be added to create a portable privacy enclosure. Weight bottom pocket with sand, water bottles or other lightweight objects to stabilize your canopy. Weighs less than 16 ounces & comes with a matching tote. invented by a mom. Endorsements: Outstanding Product Award from Disney's iParenting Media Award Endorsed by the Melanoma International Foundation Winner of the Huggies' MomInspired Grant Program", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MMWIv-%2BOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N6ZVX8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]]}}
