{"item_id": "B004N8OJYS", "title": "Genuine Innovations Deluxe Tire Repair and Inflation Wallet", "description": "Our deluxe kit offers a complete solution for all your flat tire needs. Comes with everything needed to repair & inflate multiple flat tires. After patching your damaged tube, inflation is a breeze. Built-in Trigger lock prevents accidental activation. Push-on for Presta, screw-on for Schrader. Really easy to use. Simply drop the CO2 cartridge into the cup, screw on the head, attach to valve, unlock safety latch, attach to valve stem and pull trigger to release gas. So quick and easy you’ll be back to riding your bike in no time!", "text": "Genuine Innovations Deluxe Tire Repair and Inflation Wallet Our deluxe kit offers a complete solution for all your flat tire needs. Comes with everything needed to repair & inflate multiple flat tires. After patching your damaged tube, inflation is a breeze. Built-in Trigger lock prevents accidental activation. Push-on for Presta, screw-on for Schrader. Really easy to use. Simply drop the CO2 cartridge into the cup, screw on the head, attach to valve, unlock safety latch, attach to valve stem and pull trigger to release gas. So quick and easy you’ll be back to riding your bike in no time!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X80HiN2zL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N8OJYS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 27.89}}
{"item_id": "B004N969J0", "title": "Profile Design Legacy Aero Bar", "description": "Split extension with low armrest bridges and three mount positions. Anodized matte black clamp. Fits 26.0-Millimeter and 31.8-Millimeter bars. Weight 475-Grams.", "text": "Profile Design Legacy Aero Bar Split extension with low armrest bridges and three mount positions. Anodized matte black clamp. Fits 26.0-Millimeter and 31.8-Millimeter bars. Weight 475-Grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411a%2BUz5T4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N969J0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Profile Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 78.0}}
{"item_id": "B004N96GAW", "title": "Michelin Airstop 700c x 18-23mm 40mm Presta Valve Tube", "description": "Item DescriptionStandard .9mm wall thickness butyl tube. 90-175gItem Specificationstire size: 700ctire width: 18-23cvalve: Presta (smooth)length: 40mm:", "text": "Michelin Airstop 700c x 18-23mm 40mm Presta Valve Tube Item DescriptionStandard .9mm wall thickness butyl tube. 90-175gItem Specificationstire size: 700ctire width: 18-23cvalve: Presta (smooth)length: 40mm:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Qpfx39V-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004N96GAW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Michelin", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]], "price": 5.42}}
{"item_id": "B004NB9GH0", "title": "Therm-a-rest NeoAir All Season Air Mattress", "description": "The Therm-a-Rest NeoAir All Season air mattress offers warmth, thick padding, and a durable design for year-round use. Patent-pending multiple-layer design of its Reflective Barrier layer creates added warmth by reflecting heat back to the camper's body and reducing convective heat loss with the ground. In addition to minimizing air movement and convective cooling, the patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix creates an internal truss system that virtually eliminates the instability generally found on large tube-based air mattresses, and rugged fabrics provide added protection from abrasion.Patent-pending NeoAir technology traps warm air for a high degree of warmth.FeaturesYear-round Warmth:Patent-pending design traps warm air to provide a high degree of warmthLight and Compact:NeoAir technology allows the All Season mattress to be lighter and more packable than mattresses filled with conventional insulationExtra Comfort:Stable construction and 2.5-inch thickness offer greater comfort for a full night of sleepLasting Performance:The All Season mattress can be inflated directly without worry of exhaled moisture wetting insulation and decreasing performanceSpecificationsAll sizes:2.5-inch thickness4.9 R-value75-denier polyester top fabric70-denier nylon bottom fabricNylon corePump sack and repair kit includedSize M:One-pound, two-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 66 inches (W x D)Measures 4.75 by eight inches (W x D) packed3,300-cubic-inch volumeSize R:One-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 72 inches (W x D)Measures 4.75 by eight inches (W x D) packed3,600-cubic-inch volumeSize L:One-pounce, nine-ounce weightMeasures 25 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 4.8 by 11 inches (W x D) packed4,813-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "text": "Therm-a-rest NeoAir All Season Air Mattress The Therm-a-Rest NeoAir All Season air mattress offers warmth, thick padding, and a durable design for year-round use. Patent-pending multiple-layer design of its Reflective Barrier layer creates added warmth by reflecting heat back to the camper's body and reducing convective heat loss with the ground. In addition to minimizing air movement and convective cooling, the patent-pending Triangular Core Matrix creates an internal truss system that virtually eliminates the instability generally found on large tube-based air mattresses, and rugged fabrics provide added protection from abrasion.Patent-pending NeoAir technology traps warm air for a high degree of warmth.FeaturesYear-round Warmth:Patent-pending design traps warm air to provide a high degree of warmthLight and Compact:NeoAir technology allows the All Season mattress to be lighter and more packable than mattresses filled with conventional insulationExtra Comfort:Stable construction and 2.5-inch thickness offer greater comfort for a full night of sleepLasting Performance:The All Season mattress can be inflated directly without worry of exhaled moisture wetting insulation and decreasing performanceSpecificationsAll sizes:2.5-inch thickness4.9 R-value75-denier polyester top fabric70-denier nylon bottom fabricNylon corePump sack and repair kit includedSize M:One-pound, two-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 66 inches (W x D)Measures 4.75 by eight inches (W x D) packed3,300-cubic-inch volumeSize R:One-pound, three-ounce weightMeasures 20 by 72 inches (W x D)Measures 4.75 by eight inches (W x D) packed3,600-cubic-inch volumeSize L:One-pounce, nine-ounce weightMeasures 25 by 77 inches (W x D)Measures 4.8 by 11 inches (W x D) packed4,813-cubic-inch volumeLifetime WarrantyTherm-A-Rest products include a limited lifetime warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Therm-A-RestTherm-A-Rest is part of a company named Cascade Designs, started by three friends and former Boeing engineers -- Jim Lea, Neil Anderson, and John Burroughs -- who were laid off from the aeronautics giant in 1971. Outdoor enthusiasts looking for the next great gear idea, they went on to design the world's first self-inflating mattress, the Therm-A-Rest. Today, Cascade Designs remains a private, family-owned company that has grown to be one of the most respected outdoor manufacturers in the world.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YVj6w91WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NB9GH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004NBF9Z8", "title": "Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit", "description": "FEATURES of the Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit Turn any bag into a mattress inflation system Choose the included lightweight plastic bags, or go with a more permanent option-simply pierce the bottom of any air-tight bag with the piercing tip and attach the valve coupler Loft the bag, seal and roll, filling any NeoAir mattress with near zero effort or additional weight in your pack An included cap maintains waterproof performance of lightweight stuffsacks with tap permanently in place SPECIFICATIONS of the Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit Weight: 1 oz / 30 g", "text": "Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit FEATURES of the Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit Turn any bag into a mattress inflation system Choose the included lightweight plastic bags, or go with a more permanent option-simply pierce the bottom of any air-tight bag with the piercing tip and attach the valve coupler Loft the bag, seal and roll, filling any NeoAir mattress with near zero effort or additional weight in your pack An included cap maintains waterproof performance of lightweight stuffsacks with tap permanently in place SPECIFICATIONS of the Therm-A-Rest AirTap Pump Kit Weight: 1 oz / 30 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tv5ruuEKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NBF9Z8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Therm-A-Rest", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B004NC17VM", "title": "Weaver Gunsmith Entry Level Compact Tool Kit", "description": "This kit is designed to address the most common firearm maintenance tasks. It includes a magnetic-tipped hex bit driver and a variety of tool bits to service different fasteners. Lengthening attachments make many hard-to-reach adjustments possible. All these crucial components are contained in a rugged, latched case for easy storage and transport. Whatever your skill level. Whatever your needs. Weaver has the gunsmith tool kit for you. Weaver offers three different gun care kits. Choose from among Compact, Multi Bit and Deluxe for any of your home gunsmithing needs. If professional grade tools for home gun work, check out the Multi Bit kit. This edition adds a large assortment of flat bits to the Compact Kit for more versatility to fit a wider variety of screw heads used on firearms.", "text": "Weaver Gunsmith Entry Level Compact Tool Kit This kit is designed to address the most common firearm maintenance tasks. It includes a magnetic-tipped hex bit driver and a variety of tool bits to service different fasteners. Lengthening attachments make many hard-to-reach adjustments possible. All these crucial components are contained in a rugged, latched case for easy storage and transport. Whatever your skill level. Whatever your needs. Weaver has the gunsmith tool kit for you. Weaver offers three different gun care kits. Choose from among Compact, Multi Bit and Deluxe for any of your home gunsmithing needs. If professional grade tools for home gun work, check out the Multi Bit kit. This edition adds a large assortment of flat bits to the Compact Kit for more versatility to fit a wider variety of screw heads used on firearms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ks3SwJ0eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NC17VM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.89}}
{"item_id": "B004NC188O", "title": "Weaver Deluxe Gunsmith Tool Kit", "description": "The Deluxe Tool Kit enables you to turn your workbench into a professional Gunsmithing station. Whether mounting an accessory, punching out pins to replace a trigger, or separating a stock from a receiver; the Deluxe Kit offers the exact tools for the tasks at hand. The complete set gathers together all the essentials, plus an impressive array of bits and punches. As well as a driver, hammer and much more. or find a dealer Whatever your skill level. Whatever your needs. Weaver has the gunsmith tool kit for you. Weaver offers three different gun care kits. Choose from among Compact, Multi Bit and Deluxe for any of your home gunsmithing needs. If professional grade tools for home gun work, check out the Multi Bit kit. This edition adds a large assortment of flat bits to the Compact Kit for more versatility to fit a wider variety of screw heads used on firearms.", "text": "Weaver Deluxe Gunsmith Tool Kit The Deluxe Tool Kit enables you to turn your workbench into a professional Gunsmithing station. Whether mounting an accessory, punching out pins to replace a trigger, or separating a stock from a receiver; the Deluxe Kit offers the exact tools for the tasks at hand. The complete set gathers together all the essentials, plus an impressive array of bits and punches. As well as a driver, hammer and much more. or find a dealer Whatever your skill level. Whatever your needs. Weaver has the gunsmith tool kit for you. Weaver offers three different gun care kits. Choose from among Compact, Multi Bit and Deluxe for any of your home gunsmithing needs. If professional grade tools for home gun work, check out the Multi Bit kit. This edition adds a large assortment of flat bits to the Compact Kit for more versatility to fit a wider variety of screw heads used on firearms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2B3joiqY5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NC188O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 67.99}}
{"item_id": "B004NC3B84", "title": "Weaver Gunsmithing Hammer and Punch Set", "description": "Trick out your gunsmithing bench with professional tools from Weaver. The new Gunsmith Hammer & Punch Set includes (8) steel punches to fit just about any pin and a hammer with brass and plastic faces. For fast, easy, gentle disassembly and reassembly of firearms, work like a pro with Weaver's new Gunsmith Hammer & Punch Set. Skilled shooters can now become skilled gunsmiths. Tackle any Gunsmithing task with Weaver's quality tools and comprehensive kits. Designed to elevate your workbench into a professional-grade gunsmithing station, these quality tools and accessories enable you to service your firearm with precision.", "text": "Weaver Gunsmithing Hammer and Punch Set Trick out your gunsmithing bench with professional tools from Weaver. The new Gunsmith Hammer & Punch Set includes (8) steel punches to fit just about any pin and a hammer with brass and plastic faces. For fast, easy, gentle disassembly and reassembly of firearms, work like a pro with Weaver's new Gunsmith Hammer & Punch Set. Skilled shooters can now become skilled gunsmiths. Tackle any Gunsmithing task with Weaver's quality tools and comprehensive kits. Designed to elevate your workbench into a professional-grade gunsmithing station, these quality tools and accessories enable you to service your firearm with precision.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CCmfEZiQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NC3B84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
