{"item_id": "B004NFQ516", "title": "Allen Company Ruger Compact Molded Handgun Case", "description": "Have a Ruger handgun you want to safely store and protect? This compact, low-profile case is just the ticket! Full protection, lockable zippers, and no unnecessary bulk.", "text": "Allen Company Ruger Compact Molded Handgun Case Have a Ruger handgun you want to safely store and protect? This compact, low-profile case is just the ticket! Full protection, lockable zippers, and no unnecessary bulk.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51b1WS%2B5JKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NFQ516.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004NFRMT0", "title": "Allen Company Denali Cartridge Neoprene Sling with Rifle Cartridge Loops", "description": "Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling With Swivels solves sling slips and keeps reloads close at hand. Finally a sling that stays put! The Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling features a tacky \"sharkskin\" back to hold fast on your shoulder, solve the slipping and sliding struggles you're used to dealing with on traditional slings. All with a nice wide shoulder pad that won't dig in as the miles pile up AND 5 cartridge loops for fast reloads. Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. Sling this: Tacky \"sharkskin\" back keeps the sling from slipping off your shoulder; Extra-wide neoprene shoulder pad for comfort; 5 cartridge loops for fast reloads; Heavy-duty 1\" webbing; Allen quick detachable swivels with locking system included. Shoulder the load in comfort! State Color. Order Today! Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling With Swivels", "text": "Allen Company Denali Cartridge Neoprene Sling with Rifle Cartridge Loops Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling With Swivels solves sling slips and keeps reloads close at hand. Finally a sling that stays put! The Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling features a tacky \"sharkskin\" back to hold fast on your shoulder, solve the slipping and sliding struggles you're used to dealing with on traditional slings. All with a nice wide shoulder pad that won't dig in as the miles pile up AND 5 cartridge loops for fast reloads. Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. Sling this: Tacky \"sharkskin\" back keeps the sling from slipping off your shoulder; Extra-wide neoprene shoulder pad for comfort; 5 cartridge loops for fast reloads; Heavy-duty 1\" webbing; Allen quick detachable swivels with locking system included. Shoulder the load in comfort! State Color. Order Today! Allen Denali Neoprene Cartridge Sling With Swivels", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZFAgERcdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NFRMT0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 14.89}}
{"item_id": "B004NFVIHM", "title": "Allen Company Eliminator Single Box Shell Carrier with Molded Frame", "description": "Conveniently carries your shot shells while on the course.", "text": "Allen Company Eliminator Single Box Shell Carrier with Molded Frame Conveniently carries your shot shells while on the course.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E3wCFgUaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NFVIHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B004NJ2ETY", "title": "Buck Ranger Skinner Hunting Knife", "description": "Originally created as a limited edition model, the 113 Ranger Skinner is a stylish and performance oriented combination of Buck?s famous Ranger and the classic Buck Vanguard . Streamlined to be smaller, yet designed to be effective, this knife will get any job done in the field. The classic look, ergonomic handle and ease-of-use design guarantee that you will come to rely upon it. This design fills the need for a sturdy, compact knife with a versatile skinning blade.", "text": "Buck Ranger Skinner Hunting Knife Originally created as a limited edition model, the 113 Ranger Skinner is a stylish and performance oriented combination of Buck?s famous Ranger and the classic Buck Vanguard . Streamlined to be smaller, yet designed to be effective, this knife will get any job done in the field. The classic look, ergonomic handle and ease-of-use design guarantee that you will come to rely upon it. This design fills the need for a sturdy, compact knife with a versatile skinning blade.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31QURDDBnSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NJ2ETY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 46.7}}
{"item_id": "B004NJ3H1I", "title": "Buck PakLite Large Skinner Hunting Knife", "description": "The PakLite Skinner is ideal for meeting a hunter?s most difficult field dressing demands, anywhere from skinning to cutting joints. The larger design and re-curved skinner style allows a hunter to perform any task with confidence. The finger grip cutouts offer ultimate control, while the minimalist design makes it lightweight and easy to carry in a heavy- duty nylon sheath. It's great for packing into the field when light weight counts. The 420HC stainless steel blade and frame of 420HC steel ensure corrosion resistance and make the knife easy to clean. This skinner is an essential piece to any hunter's gear and will perform when called upon.", "text": "Buck PakLite Large Skinner Hunting Knife The PakLite Skinner is ideal for meeting a hunter?s most difficult field dressing demands, anywhere from skinning to cutting joints. The larger design and re-curved skinner style allows a hunter to perform any task with confidence. The finger grip cutouts offer ultimate control, while the minimalist design makes it lightweight and easy to carry in a heavy- duty nylon sheath. It's great for packing into the field when light weight counts. The 420HC stainless steel blade and frame of 420HC steel ensure corrosion resistance and make the knife easy to clean. This skinner is an essential piece to any hunter's gear and will perform when called upon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fN6fggc5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NJ3H1I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 22.12}}
{"item_id": "B004NJ3HRW", "title": "Buck Bones Hunting Knife", "description": "This is a frame-lock knife with smooth and reliable deployment, innovative tactical coatings, and the quality of a Buck knife for an affordable price. The Bones is a modern and high-tech design, with special attention to ergonomics, including a curved handle with grip points. These grip points are built-in at three critical pressure points to ensure a secure grasp. To keep this knife at its lightest, the skeletal framework minimizes material weight, while maintaining strength. The blade is partially serrated for added performance. The knife features a one-hand ambidextrous open blade deployment with a thumb stud. It is available in two sizes and colors for convenience.", "text": "Buck Bones Hunting Knife This is a frame-lock knife with smooth and reliable deployment, innovative tactical coatings, and the quality of a Buck knife for an affordable price. The Bones is a modern and high-tech design, with special attention to ergonomics, including a curved handle with grip points. These grip points are built-in at three critical pressure points to ensure a secure grasp. To keep this knife at its lightest, the skeletal framework minimizes material weight, while maintaining strength. The blade is partially serrated for added performance. The knife features a one-hand ambidextrous open blade deployment with a thumb stud. It is available in two sizes and colors for convenience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BR7rIaldL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NJ3HRW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004NJS7VS", "title": "Israeli Civilian Gas Mask with NBC NATO Filter and Drinking Hydration Tube", "description": "This authentic, never-issued Israeli gas mask is constructed of heavy-duty rubber and offers full-face coverage with dual eye-openings for a clear view and adjustable rubber straps to fit an adult head. Includes drinking tube and sealed filter. Order today, while supplies last!!!", "text": "Israeli Civilian Gas Mask with NBC NATO Filter and Drinking Hydration Tube This authentic, never-issued Israeli gas mask is constructed of heavy-duty rubber and offers full-face coverage with dual eye-openings for a clear view and adjustable rubber straps to fit an adult head. Includes drinking tube and sealed filter. Order today, while supplies last!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nnAAnQbwL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NJS7VS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shalon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 27.9}}
{"item_id": "B004NK75Y2", "title": "Bushnell Banner Illuminated Centerfire 500 Reticle Riflescope, 3-9x 40mm", "description": "Ask any trophy hunter or taxidermist, and he or she will tell you more tags are filled in the low-light hours than any other time. Enter the Bushnell Banner 3-9x40 riflescope, which is designed to excel in early morning and late evening light. With its Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multicoated lenses--which add clarity and brightness when the sun is low or under heavy cloud cover--the Banner scope adds precious minutes to every hunting day. The scope also includes an Illuminated CF 500 reticle that switches from red to green on your command (red is ideal for bright conditions, green works better when it's dim). With aiming points out to 500 yards, the reticle is optimized for center-fire rifles.Other details include a one-piece tube design, a 100-percent waterproof and fogproof construction, 1/4 MOA fingertip resettable windage and elevation adjustments, and a fast-focus eyepiece. Whether you're gearing up for big game or little varmints, the Banner riflescope is a terrific low-light choice.SpecificationsFinish: MatteMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: Illuminated CF 500Field of view: 40 feet @ 100 yards (3x), 14 feet @ 100 yards (9x)Eye relief: 4 inchesExit pupil: 13mm (3x), 4.4mm (9x)Click value: 1/4 MOAAdjustment range: 60 inches @ 100 yardsMounting length: 5.8 inchesLength: 12 inchesWeight: 13 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "text": "Bushnell Banner Illuminated Centerfire 500 Reticle Riflescope, 3-9x 40mm Ask any trophy hunter or taxidermist, and he or she will tell you more tags are filled in the low-light hours than any other time. Enter the Bushnell Banner 3-9x40 riflescope, which is designed to excel in early morning and late evening light. With its Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multicoated lenses--which add clarity and brightness when the sun is low or under heavy cloud cover--the Banner scope adds precious minutes to every hunting day. The scope also includes an Illuminated CF 500 reticle that switches from red to green on your command (red is ideal for bright conditions, green works better when it's dim). With aiming points out to 500 yards, the reticle is optimized for center-fire rifles.Other details include a one-piece tube design, a 100-percent waterproof and fogproof construction, 1/4 MOA fingertip resettable windage and elevation adjustments, and a fast-focus eyepiece. Whether you're gearing up for big game or little varmints, the Banner riflescope is a terrific low-light choice.SpecificationsFinish: MatteMagnification: 3-9xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: Illuminated CF 500Field of view: 40 feet @ 100 yards (3x), 14 feet @ 100 yards (9x)Eye relief: 4 inchesExit pupil: 13mm (3x), 4.4mm (9x)Click value: 1/4 MOAAdjustment range: 60 inches @ 100 yardsMounting length: 5.8 inchesLength: 12 inchesWeight: 13 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HkJzD6QjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NK75Y2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 92.97}}
{"item_id": "B004NK8SFM", "title": "Bushnell Banner Illuminated Crossfire 500 Reticle Riflescope, 4-16x 40mm", "description": "Ask any trophy hunter or taxidermist, and he or she will tell you more tags are filled in the low-light hours than any other time. Enter the Bushnell Banner 4-16x40 riflescope, which is designed to excel in early morning and late evening light. With its Dusk & Dawn Brightness (DDB) multicoated lenses--which add clarity and brightness when the sun is low or under heavy cloud cover--the Banner scope adds precious minutes to every hunting day. The scope also includes an Illuminated CF 500 reticle that switches from red to green on your command (red is ideal for bright conditions, green works better when it's dim). With aiming points out to 500 yards, the reticle is optimized for center-fire rifles.Other details include a one-piece tube design, a 100-percent waterproof and fogproof construction, 1/4 MOA fingertip resettable windage and elevation adjustments, and a fast-focus eyepiece. Whether you're gearing up for big game or little varmints, the Banner riflescope is a terrific low-light choice.SpecificationsFinish: MatteMagnification: 4-16xObjective lens: 40mmReticle: Illuminated CF 500Field of view: 22 feet @ 100 yards (4x), 6 feet @ 100 yards (16x)Eye relief: 3.3 inchesExit pupil: 10mm (4x), 2.5mm (16x)Click value: 1/4 MOAAdjustment range: 70 inches @ 100 yardsMounting length: 5.8 inchesLength: 14 inchesWeight: 16 ouncesAbout BushnellBushnell has been the industry leader in high-performance sports optics for more than 50 years. The company's guiding principle is to provide the highest quality, most reliable, and most affordable sports optics products on the market. Bushnell product lines enhance the enjoyment of every outdoor pursuit, including nature study, hunting, fishing, birding, and stargazing. Indoors, the company's binoculars bring the audience closer to the action in fast-moving sports or the fine arts at theaters and concerts.", "te