/317qfQmyonL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NK8SFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 114.55}}
{"item_id": "B004NKRZEC", "title": "Mil Spec AR-15 M4 Rear Flip-up Sight", "description": "Flip-up Tactical Rear Sight Complete with Dual Aiming Aperture, Windage Adjustment and Picatinny Mounting Deck", "text": "Mil Spec AR-15 M4 Rear Flip-up Sight Flip-up Tactical Rear Sight Complete with Dual Aiming Aperture, Windage Adjustment and Picatinny Mounting Deck", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Phz-2faEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKRZEC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B004NKSPR8", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Gel - Police Strength - Professional Size with Flip Top, Belt Holster & 18' Range", "description": "Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Protection at a safe distance is a huge advantage of pepper spray. Pepper Gel increase safety with its 18 foot range! Less affected by weather conditions, Pepper Gel’s velocity and consistency covers your threat and reduces cross contamination. SABRE RED’s Pepper Gel is the same size canister used by the NYPD & LA County Sheriff’s. Protect yourself and your family at a safe distance with Pepper Gel. Free Holster Included!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Gel - Police Strength - Professional Size with Flip Top, Belt Holster & 18' Range Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Protection at a safe distance is a huge advantage of pepper spray. Pepper Gel increase safety with its 18 foot range! Less affected by weather conditions, Pepper Gel’s velocity and consistency covers your threat and reduces cross contamination. SABRE RED’s Pepper Gel is the same size canister used by the NYPD & LA County Sheriff’s. Protect yourself and your family at a safe distance with Pepper Gel. Free Holster Included!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z-H9m9WSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKSPR8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 6.0}}
{"item_id": "B004NKSPXC", "title": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray -Police Strength - Pink Runner with Hand Strap (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more)", "description": "\"Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Perfect for the palm of your hand when running or walking, SABRE's runner pepper spray is equipped with a convenient hand strap for immediate deployment. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back and permits distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide, including the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department & US Marshals!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "text": "SABRE RED Pepper Spray -Police Strength - Pink Runner with Hand Strap (Max Protection - 35 shots, up to 5x's more) \"Making Grown Men Cry Since 1975\", SABRE is the number one pepper spray used worldwide by both police and general public for personal safety. Perfect for the palm of your hand when running or walking, SABRE's runner pepper spray is equipped with a convenient hand strap for immediate deployment. Providing extremely practical protection, SABRE delivers a strong ballistic stream to reduce wind blow back and permits distance from your threat with its ten (10) foot range. Protect yourself and your loved ones with the same brand used by public safety officers worldwide, including the NYPD, LA County Sheriff’s Department & US Marshals!. Expiration Date: 4 years from date of manufacture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h2zEX9LeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKSPXC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sabre", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B004NKSQXG", "title": "Troy Industries Ambidextrous Safety Selector Semi Auto", "description": "Ambidextrous selector with no screws or threading to come loose or strip; utilizes stainless steel detent plungers to lock levers into place. The traditional lever side has been built for a more positive feel. The right side features a lower profile lever and will not interfere with trigger operation for right handed shooters. Rugged machined billet tool steel construction. - Black, Semi-Auto", "text": "Troy Industries Ambidextrous Safety Selector Semi Auto Ambidextrous selector with no screws or threading to come loose or strip; utilizes stainless steel detent plungers to lock levers into place. The traditional lever side has been built for a more positive feel. The right side features a lower profile lever and will not interfere with trigger operation for right handed shooters. Rugged machined billet tool steel construction. - Black, Semi-Auto", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HCmtOOyUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKSQXG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 52.83}}
