{"item_id": "B004NKU64I", "title": "Kershaw 1080 Fixed Blade Skinning Knife", "description": "This Kershaw skinner is part of our American-Made Hunters series. It features strong, simple design that functions extremely well. High-performance Sandvik 14C28N blade steel and full-tang construction makes it durable and corrosion resistant. G-10 handle scales-in basic black-ensure hunters get a secure grip every time, in all outdoor conditions. Field-tested by hunting pros, this made-in-the-USA hunting knife is sure to become a go-to knife for the quality-minded hunter. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1080 Fixed Blade Skinning Knife This Kershaw skinner is part of our American-Made Hunters series. It features strong, simple design that functions extremely well. High-performance Sandvik 14C28N blade steel and full-tang construction makes it durable and corrosion resistant. G-10 handle scales-in basic black-ensure hunters get a secure grip every time, in all outdoor conditions. Field-tested by hunting pros, this made-in-the-USA hunting knife is sure to become a go-to knife for the quality-minded hunter. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313O879zZnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKU64I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B004NKU6RA", "title": "Bushnell Elite 2-6X32 Handgun Scope", "description": "Max your effective range with Elite.. Handgun cartridges and technology have come a long way: see exactly how far by topping yours with some of the best optics in the business. With multi-coated optics delivering 90% light transmission, plus the all-weather assurance of RainGuard(R) HD, it's ready to stretch the limits when you are. Our rugged one-piece tube construction and extreme recoil testing makes this handgun scope ideal for the meanest cartridges, including the .454 Casull. And getting on target is intuitive thanks for our special, extra-long 20\" constant eye relief. This scope features a one piece aluminum tube and is 100% waterproof, fog proof, and shockproof. 1/4 MOA audible/resettable windage and elevation adjustment Fast-focus eyepiece. Features include Multi-X reticle with Power/Obj. Lens (mm) 2-6x 32. It comes with the Elite Lifetime Limited warranty.", "text": "Bushnell Elite 2-6X32 Handgun Scope Max your effective range with Elite.. Handgun cartridges and technology have come a long way: see exactly how far by topping yours with some of the best optics in the business. With multi-coated optics delivering 90% light transmission, plus the all-weather assurance of RainGuard(R) HD, it's ready to stretch the limits when you are. Our rugged one-piece tube construction and extreme recoil testing makes this handgun scope ideal for the meanest cartridges, including the .454 Casull. And getting on target is intuitive thanks for our special, extra-long 20\" constant eye relief. This scope features a one piece aluminum tube and is 100% waterproof, fog proof, and shockproof. 1/4 MOA audible/resettable windage and elevation adjustment Fast-focus eyepiece. Features include Multi-X reticle with Power/Obj. Lens (mm) 2-6x 32. It comes with the Elite Lifetime Limited warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mCzwl%2B5dL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKU6RA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 270.0}}
{"item_id": "B004NKW7C2", "title": "LaserLyte 22-50 Caliber Mini Bore Sight", "description": "Save time, money and ammunition with the LaserLyte Laser Bore Sight. Incorporating LaserLyte's patented one-piece design and caliber-fitting systems the new Laser Bore Sight is fifty percent smaller than the previous model. This easy-to-use product can get a shooter within three to four inches of the bull's-eye at 100 yards in about three shots. Constructed from tough T6 aluminum, the Laser Bore Sight comes in a sleek red finish and works great on any weapon with at least three inches of barrel length. The Laser Bore Sight makes sight-in sessions a breeze for scopes, lasers or iron sights on any firearm from .22 to .50 caliber with included adapters. For maximum versatility the system also works with new accessories (sold separately), including a shotgun adapter for .50 to .75 caliber and improved scope leveler. The Laser Bore Sight activates with a roll switch and is powered by three 393 batteries that provide one and a half hours of continuous use. This unit is also excellent for modern rifles and its modest design works great with most flash suppressors and muzzle breaks.", "text": "LaserLyte 22-50 Caliber Mini Bore Sight Save time, money and ammunition with the LaserLyte Laser Bore Sight. Incorporating LaserLyte's patented one-piece design and caliber-fitting systems the new Laser Bore Sight is fifty percent smaller than the previous model. This easy-to-use product can get a shooter within three to four inches of the bull's-eye at 100 yards in about three shots. Constructed from tough T6 aluminum, the Laser Bore Sight comes in a sleek red finish and works great on any weapon with at least three inches of barrel length. The Laser Bore Sight makes sight-in sessions a breeze for scopes, lasers or iron sights on any firearm from .22 to .50 caliber with included adapters. For maximum versatility the system also works with new accessories (sold separately), including a shotgun adapter for .50 to .75 caliber and improved scope leveler. The Laser Bore Sight activates with a roll switch and is powered by three 393 batteries that provide one and a half hours of continuous use. This unit is also excellent for modern rifles and its modest design works great with most flash suppressors and muzzle breaks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31q6mdy%2B3%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKW7C2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 44.71}}
{"item_id": "B004NKWCMC", "title": "Simmons RedDot 1x 20mm 5-MOA Dot, Red Illuminated Scope", "description": "Improve your shooting at the speed of light. The ultimate in quick target acquisition and low-light precision, Simmons RedDot scopes are a lightning-fast shooting upgrade for virtually any firearm.", "text": "Simmons RedDot 1x 20mm 5-MOA Dot, Red Illuminated Scope Improve your shooting at the speed of light. The ultimate in quick target acquisition and low-light precision, Simmons RedDot scopes are a lightning-fast shooting upgrade for virtually any firearm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jo6qYtmxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKWCMC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 51.66}}
{"item_id": "B004NKY22K", "title": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer .45 ACP Cartridge", "description": "The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to match popular calibers in .45 ACP, the Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.", "text": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer .45 ACP Cartridge The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to match popular calibers in .45 ACP, the Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CWUzoiw%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKY22K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics"]], "price": 79.9}}
{"item_id": "B004NKY23E", "title": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer 9-mm Cartridge", "description": "The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to match popular calibers in 9mm, the Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.Note:Please note that this device CANNOT be used in a brightly lit location or the laser will appear very dim.", "text": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer 9-mm Cartridge The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to match popular calibers in 9mm, the Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.Note:Please note that this device CANNOT be used in a brightly lit location or the laser will appear very dim.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415t7QL1INL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKY23E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 79.9}}
{"item_id": "B004NKY6B2", "title": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove with Ruger Lcp and Taurus Tcp", "description": "Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits Ruger LCP, Taurus TCP, Kel-Tec P3AT & P32.", "text": "Pachmayr Tactical Grip Glove with Ruger Lcp and Taurus Tcp Custom molded slip on grip designed specifically for individual handgun model. Fits Ruger LCP, Taurus TCP, Kel-Tec P3AT & P32.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41exwb00aYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKY6B2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pachmayr", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B004NKY6DU", "title": "Bushnell Elite Tactical Mil-Dot SFP Reticle LRS Riflescope, 10x40mm", "description": "Developed with law enforcement and military experts nationwide, the Elite Tactical family of riflescopes from Bushnell is built for unfailing reliability and optical precision with the addition of application-specific features. This fixed power, 10x magnification, 40-millimeter Tactical Scope features a Mil Dot aiming reticle and target turrets for quick and precise target acquisition. Ultra Wide Band Coating improves light transmission to boost brightness at dawn and dusk, while fully multi-coated optics ensure crisp, clear views. Meanwhile, Bushnell's exclusive RainGuard HD exterior coating keeps your lens clear in any conditions and blacked-out finishes help you blend in. Built to last, the riflescope features a sturdy, one-inch body tube, is argon purged for long-term reliability, and carries a limited lifetime warranty.Key FeaturesMil Dot aiming reticleFixed-power target scopeTarget turretsRainGuard HD breaks up moisture and keeps lens clearerUltra Wide Band CoatingFully multi-coated opticsArgon purgedOne-inch body tubeBlacked-Out cosmeticsSpecificationsModel: ET1040Finish: MatteMagnification Power: 10xObjective Lens Size: 40 millimetersField of View: 11 feet at 100 yards / 3.7 meters at 100 metersEye Relief: 3.5 inches / 89 millimetersExit Pupil: 4 millimetersClick Value: 0.25 inches at 100 yards / 7 millimeters at 100 metersAdjustment Range: 80 inches at 100 yards / 2 meters at 100 meters 1.7Mounting Length: 6 inches / 152 millimetersWeight: 15.9 ounces / 451 gramsLength: 11.5 inches / 292 millimeters", "text": "Bushnell Elite Tactical Mil-Dot SFP Reticle LRS Riflescope, 10x40mm Developed with law enforcement and military experts nationwide, the Elite Tactical family of riflescopes from Bushnell is built for unfailing reliability and optical precision with the addition of application-specific features. This fixed power, 10x magnification, 40-millimeter Tactical Scope features a Mil Dot aiming reticle and target turrets for quick and precise target acquisition. Ultra Wide Band Coating improves light transmission to boost brightness at dawn and dusk, while fully multi-coated optics ensure crisp, clear views. Meanwhile, Bushnell's exclusive RainGuard HD exterior coating keeps your lens clear in any conditions and blacked-out finishes help you blend in. Built to last, the riflescope features a sturdy, one-inch body tube, is argon purged for long-term reliability, and carries a limited lifetime warranty.Key FeaturesMil Dot aiming reticleFixed-power target scopeTarget turretsRainGuard HD breaks up moisture and keeps lens clearerUltra Wide Band CoatingFully multi-coated opticsArgon purgedOne-inch body tubeBlacked-Out cosmeticsSpecificationsModel: ET1040Finish: MatteMagnification Power: 10xObjective Lens Size: 40 millimetersField of View: 11 feet at 100 yards / 3.7 meters at 100 metersEye Relief: 3.5 inches / 89 millimetersExit Pupil: 4 millimetersClick Value: 0.25 inches at 100 yards / 7 millimeters at 100 metersAdjustment Range: 80 inches at 100 yards / 2 meters at 100 meters 1.7Mounting Length: 6 inches / 152 millimetersWeight: 15.9 ounces / 451 gramsLength: 11.5 inches / 292 millimeters", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VoeR751xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NKY6DU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 212.99}}
