{"item_id": "B004NNTWAO", "title": "Harbinger FlexFit Ultra WristWrap Lifting Gloves (Large)", "description": "The FlexFit Ultra Wristwrap from Harbinger Fitness features two new technologies that take fitness gloves to a new level of performance and responsiveness. The first, Tri-Flex Palm provides three dimensional movement to your hand, mimicking the hand's natural motion for the best possible fitting glove. The benefit of the Tri-Flex Palm is that it allows the hand to move naturally and comfortably when training, maximizing control and feel of the training surface. It's the perfect union of comfort and performance. The second new innovation, the Adaptive Cushioning System features ACS pads which grab and morph both to the shape of the hand and the training surface, giving a customized and controlled grip. The benefit of the Adaptive Cushioning System is the combination of the perfect ergonomic placement of the ACS pads and the cushioning material within them. This proprietary material softens with body heat, and as it softens, adapts to the shape of the hand, and the training surface, without taking a permanent set. When the grip is changed or a new piece of equipment is used, the ACS pads will adapt to that change, continuously customizing the fit of the glove to the training environment. The patented graduated WristWrap with “Fit Lock”, insures a customized fit while maintaining the proper positioning of the glove, wrist and hand during lifting. The ergonomic curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand increasing flexibility and comfort and the extended ¾ finger length maximizes hand protection. Hand washing/air drying removes salts and oils, maintaining suppleness, the original fit, and helps the gloves last longer. Improve your workout with the latest advances in fitness gloves from the #1 workout glove manufacturer, Harbinger.", "text": "Harbinger FlexFit Ultra WristWrap Lifting Gloves (Large) The FlexFit Ultra Wristwrap from Harbinger Fitness features two new technologies that take fitness gloves to a new level of performance and responsiveness. The first, Tri-Flex Palm provides three dimensional movement to your hand, mimicking the hand's natural motion for the best possible fitting glove. The benefit of the Tri-Flex Palm is that it allows the hand to move naturally and comfortably when training, maximizing control and feel of the training surface. It's the perfect union of comfort and performance. The second new innovation, the Adaptive Cushioning System features ACS pads which grab and morph both to the shape of the hand and the training surface, giving a customized and controlled grip. The benefit of the Adaptive Cushioning System is the combination of the perfect ergonomic placement of the ACS pads and the cushioning material within them. This proprietary material softens with body heat, and as it softens, adapts to the shape of the hand, and the training surface, without taking a permanent set. When the grip is changed or a new piece of equipment is used, the ACS pads will adapt to that change, continuously customizing the fit of the glove to the training environment. The patented graduated WristWrap with “Fit Lock”, insures a customized fit while maintaining the proper positioning of the glove, wrist and hand during lifting. The ergonomic curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand increasing flexibility and comfort and the extended ¾ finger length maximizes hand protection. Hand washing/air drying removes salts and oils, maintaining suppleness, the original fit, and helps the gloves last longer. Improve your workout with the latest advances in fitness gloves from the #1 workout glove manufacturer, Harbinger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fsEoSsSzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NNTWAO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004NNTXV2", "title": "Harbinger FlexFit Classic WristWrap Lifting Gloves (Medium)", "description": "The FlexFit Classic Wristwrap from Harbinger Fitness features a new technology that takes fitness gloves to a new level of performance and responsiveness. The innovative Tri-Flex Palm provides three dimensional movement to your hand, mimicking the hand's natural motion for the best possible fitting glove. The benefit of the Tri-Flex Palm is that it allows the hand to move naturally and comfortably when training, maximizing control and feel of the training surface. It's the perfect union of comfort and performance. The patented graduated WristWrap with “Fit Lock”, insures a customized fit while maintaining the proper positioning of the glove, wrist and hand during lifting. A “Close Contact” design minimizes bulk, supporting and protecting hands for maximum “feel” on the bar. The ergonomic curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand increasing flexibility and comfort and the extended ¾ finger length maximizes hand protection. Exclusive Wash & Dry leathers and Comfort Tech fabrics stay supple, breathable and last longer. Improve your workout with the latest advances in fitness gloves from the #1 workout glove manufacturer, Harbinger.", "text": "Harbinger FlexFit Classic WristWrap Lifting Gloves (Medium) The FlexFit Classic Wristwrap from Harbinger Fitness features a new technology that takes fitness gloves to a new level of performance and responsiveness. The innovative Tri-Flex Palm provides three dimensional movement to your hand, mimicking the hand's natural motion for the best possible fitting glove. The benefit of the Tri-Flex Palm is that it allows the hand to move naturally and comfortably when training, maximizing control and feel of the training surface. It's the perfect union of comfort and performance. The patented graduated WristWrap with “Fit Lock”, insures a customized fit while maintaining the proper positioning of the glove, wrist and hand during lifting. A “Close Contact” design minimizes bulk, supporting and protecting hands for maximum “feel” on the bar. The ergonomic curved finger design fits the natural shape of the hand increasing flexibility and comfort and the extended ¾ finger length maximizes hand protection. Exclusive Wash & Dry leathers and Comfort Tech fabrics stay supple, breathable and last longer. Improve your workout with the latest advances in fitness gloves from the #1 workout glove manufacturer, Harbinger.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oWbIvE3-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NNTXV2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004NQ94EK", "title": "Topeak Modula Java Bottle Cage", "description": "The Modula Java Cage is the perfect solution for carrying a hot cup of coffee on your early morning cycling commute. Constructed of engineering grade plastic, its frame is fully adjustable to accommodate varying size coffee travel mugs.", "text": "Topeak Modula Java Bottle Cage The Modula Java Cage is the perfect solution for carrying a hot cup of coffee on your early morning cycling commute. Constructed of engineering grade plastic, its frame is fully adjustable to accommodate varying size coffee travel mugs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tArx%2BRY5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NQ94EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 15.95}}
