{"item_id": "B004NT4BRW", "title": "Yakima KingJoe Pro 2-Bike Rack", "description": "The KingJoe Pro 2-Bike Rack is designed with optimized geometry for a better fit and more stability on the trunk of your vehicle. The KingJoe Pro delivers protection for both your bikes and your vehicle with solid steel construction, integrated StableCradles to hold the bikes firmly in place and prevent bike-on-bike or bike-on-vehicle damage, one-piece premium padded feet, and labeled padded metal buckles to protect your car's paint job. Thanks to the QuickTrigger hub system install is fast and easy, and the KingJoe Pro arms fold away conveniently when the rack is not in use. The rack's narrow arm design fits a wide variety of bike frames and as an added bonus, the rack features integrated bottle opener's for drink access at the tailgate. Manufactured under Yakima's Planet Packback Initiative and backed by a limited lifetime warranty, the KingJoe offer's Yakima's top of the line construction.The King Joe Rack has integrated StableCradles that hold the bikes securely and prevent bike on bike or bike on vehicle damage.Features and Specifications:Capacity: 2 bikesIntegrated StableCradles hold bikes firmly in placeNarrow arm design fits a wide variety of bike framesFolding arms for easy storageQuickTrigger hub system for fast and easy installationGeometry designed for a better fit and more stabilityStable one-piece premium padded feetLabeled padded metal bucklesGlass hatch hooks included for glass trunk or gate mountsIntegrated bottle openersYakima Planet Payback:Yakima strives to create less waste and consume less energy with their Planet Payback Initiative. In order to reduce environmental impact: uses up to 85 percent post-consumer recycled content and water-based inks; never uses white cardboard, which contaminates water processing facilities with chlorine; and uses a minimum of 30 percent FSC-certified recycled paper in all printed materials. Yakima cargo boxes are made from up to 80 percent recycled ABS plastic. Steel and plastic parts on all of Yakima's hitch products are 100 percent recyclable. All plastic factory scrap is recycled on-site--resulting in decreased downstream waste and 20 percent recycled content is used in all plastic parts.", "text": "Yakima KingJoe Pro 2-Bike Rack The KingJoe Pro 2-Bike Rack is designed with optimized geometry for a better fit and more stability on the trunk of your vehicle. The KingJoe Pro delivers protection for both your bikes and your vehicle with solid steel construction, integrated StableCradles to hold the bikes firmly in place and prevent bike-on-bike or bike-on-vehicle damage, one-piece premium padded feet, and labeled padded metal buckles to protect your car's paint job. Thanks to the QuickTrigger hub system install is fast and easy, and the KingJoe Pro arms fold away conveniently when the rack is not in use. The rack's narrow arm design fits a wide variety of bike frames and as an added bonus, the rack features integrated bottle opener's for drink access at the tailgate. Manufactured under Yakima's Planet Packback Initiative and backed by a limited lifetime warranty, the KingJoe offer's Yakima's top of the line construction.The King Joe Rack has integrated StableCradles that hold the bikes securely and prevent bike on bike or bike on vehicle damage.Features and Specifications:Capacity: 2 bikesIntegrated StableCradles hold bikes firmly in placeNarrow arm design fits a wide variety of bike framesFolding arms for easy storageQuickTrigger hub system for fast and easy installationGeometry designed for a better fit and more stabilityStable one-piece premium padded feetLabeled padded metal bucklesGlass hatch hooks included for glass trunk or gate mountsIntegrated bottle openersYakima Planet Payback:Yakima strives to create less waste and consume less energy with their Planet Payback Initiative. In order to reduce environmental impact: uses up to 85 percent post-consumer recycled content and water-based inks; never uses white cardboard, which contaminates water processing facilities with chlorine; and uses a minimum of 30 percent FSC-certified recycled paper in all printed materials. Yakima cargo boxes are made from up to 80 percent recycled ABS plastic. Steel and plastic parts on all of Yakima's hitch products are 100 percent recyclable. All plastic factory scrap is recycled on-site--resulting in decreased downstream waste and 20 percent recycled content is used in all plastic parts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jEHGdNVkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NT4BRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Yakima", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 164.8}}
{"item_id": "B004NVVTDY", "title": "Portable 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern with Compass (colors vary)", "description": "Super bright latnern withbuilt-in compass and convenient handleProductInformationThe 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern features a modern designand a convenient compass on the top. Great for campingoutdoor activities or even emergency use this lantern's 24 SuperBright LED bulbs have a lifetime of up to 100000 hours. Thecompass on the lantern's top and convenient built-in handle make it aneven more practical light source for your outdoor activities and more. Get a bright light to extend your outdoor time or to help outin an emergency with the 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern.Product Features 24 LED Super Bright Bulbs Compass on Top Efficient LED Lamp with Lifetime of 100000 Hours Runs on 4 'D' Batteries (not included) Built-in handle Colors VarySpecifications Color: Varies (RedGreen Silver and Blue) Light Source: 24Super Bright LED Bulbs Power Source: 4 'D' Batteries (not included) Dimensions: 8.5\" x5\" x 5\" (H x W x D)", "text": "Portable 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern with Compass (colors vary) Super bright latnern withbuilt-in compass and convenient handleProductInformationThe 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern features a modern designand a convenient compass on the top. Great for campingoutdoor activities or even emergency use this lantern's 24 SuperBright LED bulbs have a lifetime of up to 100000 hours. Thecompass on the lantern's top and convenient built-in handle make it aneven more practical light source for your outdoor activities and more. Get a bright light to extend your outdoor time or to help outin an emergency with the 24 LED Super Bright Deluxe Camping Lantern.Product Features 24 LED Super Bright Bulbs Compass on Top Efficient LED Lamp with Lifetime of 100000 Hours Runs on 4 'D' Batteries (not included) Built-in handle Colors VarySpecifications Color: Varies (RedGreen Silver and Blue) Light Source: 24Super Bright LED Bulbs Power Source: 4 'D' Batteries (not included) Dimensions: 8.5\" x5\" x 5\" (H x W x D)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mXTRNJkBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004NVVTDY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Omaha", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 6.77}}
{"item_id": "B004O0DR48", "title": "Scotty Baitcaster/Spinning Rod Holder without Mount", "description": "Scotty's #279 Bait Caster/Spinning Rod Holder holds a bait caster reel in a cushioned cradle. A slot in the front of the rod holder allows for a spinning reel to be securely held in position. The rod holder design has a side mounted flange, which leaves the bottom open. This allows for the rod holder to accommodate trigger grips. Pistol grip rod butts easily clear the sides of the rod holder for quick rod retrieval. Rod can be secured in holder with a soft latching strap which snaps over the top. No mount included.", "text": "Scotty Baitcaster/Spinning Rod Holder without Mount Scotty's #279 Bait Caster/Spinning Rod Holder holds a bait caster reel in a cushioned cradle. A slot in the front of the rod holder allows for a spinning reel to be securely held in position. The rod holder design has a side mounted flange, which leaves the bottom open. This allows for the rod holder to accommodate trigger grips. Pistol grip rod butts easily clear the sides of the rod holder for quick rod retrieval. Rod can be secured in holder with a soft latching strap which snaps over the top. No mount included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mP6Nz%2BNvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O0DR48.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scotty", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Storage", "Rod Racks"]], "price": 17.26}}
{"item_id": "B004O27OUE", "title": "Tech Toyz CPL-049 Mini 7\" Crank Powered Lantern w/ 6-LEDs", "description": "No batteries? No problem! The Tech Toyz Crank Powered Lantern can light up your life with a flip of the wrist! This handy lantern features a special crank mechanism that generates power simply by being turned. The crank arm folds into the body when not in use. The 6 super bright LEDs provide plenty of illumination, perfect for reading in the dark. The on/off button offers added control, and the convenient metal hanger-handle makes transport easy. This compact lantern stands just 7\" tall, so it's perfect for camping or backpacking. Since it never needs batteries, you can carry it anywhere! Don't get caught in the dark. Light up your life by hand with the Tech Toyz Crank Powered Lantern!", "text": "Tech Toyz CPL-049 Mini 7\" Crank Powered Lantern w/ 6-LEDs No batteries? No problem! The Tech Toyz Crank Powered Lantern can light up your life with a flip of the wrist! This handy lantern features a special crank mechanism that generates power simply by being turned. The crank arm folds into the body when not in use. The 6 super bright LEDs provide plenty of illumination, perfect for reading in the dark. The on/off button offers added control, and the convenient metal hanger-handle makes transport easy. This compact lantern stands just 7\" tall, so it's perfect for camping or backpacking. Since it never needs batteries, you can carry it anywhere! Don't get caught in the dark. Light up your life by hand with the Tech Toyz Crank Powered Lantern!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UP%2Bpec%2B7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O27OUE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lanterns"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B004O2V24S", "title": "Spalding TF-1000 Legacy Indoor Composite Basketball", "description": "The Spalding TF 1000 Legacy Basketball is designed for high caliber competitive indoor play. Newly designed exclusive ZK cover material with advanced moisture management provides improved dry and wet grip. Soft carcass offers softer feel and durability. Optimized deep channel design adds improved grip and control. NFHS approved. Ships inflated.", "text": "Spalding TF-1000 Legacy Indoor Composite Basketball The Spalding TF 1000 Legacy Basketball is designed for high caliber competitive indoor play. Newly designed exclusive ZK cover material with advanced moisture management provides improved dry and wet grip. Soft carcass offers softer feel and durability. Optimized deep channel design adds improved grip and control. NFHS approved. Ships inflated.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KpesX83YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O2V24S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Basketball", "Basketballs"]]}}
