{"item_id": "B004O5IDHE", "title": "Highland 1375500 SportWing Hitch Mounted 4 Bike Carrier", "description": "The Highland Sportwing bike carriers are the ultimate solution for carrying all styles of bikes from extreme style frames to kids bikes. The adjustable cradles support the bike by the wheels and provide instant adjustability for any styled bike frame.", "text": "Highland 1375500 SportWing Hitch Mounted 4 Bike Carrier The Highland Sportwing bike carriers are the ultimate solution for carrying all styles of bikes from extreme style frames to kids bikes. The adjustable cradles support the bike by the wheels and provide instant adjustability for any styled bike frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KnXZcdqRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O5IDHE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Bike Racks"]], "price": 145.99}}
{"item_id": "B004O6347M", "title": "Nite Ize Clip Case Sideways - Retail Packaging - Black", "description": "This case is designed to keep your phone safe and at-hand on your belt, in a fixed horizontal position. Large size fits the new larger screen smart phones and other devices that you normally carry with a protective form fit case.", "text": "Nite Ize Clip Case Sideways - Retail Packaging - Black This case is designed to keep your phone safe and at-hand on your belt, in a fixed horizontal position. Large size fits the new larger screen smart phones and other devices that you normally carry with a protective form fit case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gWhKqq4aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6347M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Cases", "Holsters & Clips"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 10.02}}
{"item_id": "B004O64HZ0", "title": "Nite Ize Clip Case Cargo - Retail Packaging - Black", "description": "Large-screen smart phones (iPhone, Motorola Droid X, HTC Evo, and Samsung Epic 4G, to name a few) have beautiful, bigger displays that call for proper protection. Our Clip Case Cargo Tall answers that call (no pun intended). The convenience and durability of our popular Clip Case Cargo, re-designed to accommodate the deluxe dimensions of large-screen smart phones with or without form fit covers. (Works great for smaller-sized GPS units as well!)", "text": "Nite Ize Clip Case Cargo - Retail Packaging - Black Large-screen smart phones (iPhone, Motorola Droid X, HTC Evo, and Samsung Epic 4G, to name a few) have beautiful, bigger displays that call for proper protection. Our Clip Case Cargo Tall answers that call (no pun intended). The convenience and durability of our popular Clip Case Cargo, re-designed to accommodate the deluxe dimensions of large-screen smart phones with or without form fit covers. (Works great for smaller-sized GPS units as well!)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4130xNBxDtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O64HZ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Cell Phones & Accessories", "Cases", "Basic Cases"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B004O6AHWM", "title": "Global Military Gear Mauser K98 Rifle Aluminum Picatinny Scout Scope Mount", "description": "Anodized aluminum Picatinny scout mount for mounting long eye relief scopes on M98 Mauser rifles. Requires no permanent alteration of the rifle.", "text": "Global Military Gear Mauser K98 Rifle Aluminum Picatinny Scout Scope Mount Anodized aluminum Picatinny scout mount for mounting long eye relief scopes on M98 Mauser rifles. Requires no permanent alteration of the rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gt4ziNZ1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6AHWM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B004O6CBSA", "title": "Mako Polymer Magazine Pouch with Belt Paddle for 5.56mm Magazines", "description": "Comfortable mag pouch for M16/AR-15-type magazines. Great for grab and go, undercover, or any other situation in which a magazine clipped onto the belt is an advantage. Holds magazines securely. MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer. Magazines not included.", "text": "Mako Polymer Magazine Pouch with Belt Paddle for 5.56mm Magazines Comfortable mag pouch for M16/AR-15-type magazines. Great for grab and go, undercover, or any other situation in which a magazine clipped onto the belt is an advantage. Holds magazines securely. MIL-SPEC reinforced polymer. Magazines not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cv%2BYo5paL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6CBSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B004O6CDV0", "title": "Mako Universal Picatinny Rail Mount Fits Most Pistols", "description": "Fits most handgun models with a front Picatinny-type accessory rail. Accepts all sights designed to fit a standard Picatinny rail. Original sights remain usable. Facilitates prompt sight alignment. Adds a front underside accessory rail in place of the original that was used for the installation. Easy to install. Made from 6061 T6 Aluminum.", "text": "Mako Universal Picatinny Rail Mount Fits Most Pistols Fits most handgun models with a front Picatinny-type accessory rail. Accepts all sights designed to fit a standard Picatinny rail. Original sights remain usable. Facilitates prompt sight alignment. Adds a front underside accessory rail in place of the original that was used for the installation. Easy to install. Made from 6061 T6 Aluminum.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ygViI4zkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6CDV0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 57.64}}
{"item_id": "B004O6CF7M", "title": "Global Military Gear Aluminum Tactical Harris Bipod Adapter Stud Mount", "description": "Adapts Harris bipods to attach to Picatinny rails. Works with any sling swivel-mounted bipod. Also works as a sling swivel.", "text": "Global Military Gear Aluminum Tactical Harris Bipod Adapter Stud Mount Adapts Harris bipods to attach to Picatinny rails. Works with any sling swivel-mounted bipod. Also works as a sling swivel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ANDss7WEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6CF7M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Global Military Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 10.05}}
{"item_id": "B004O6EMLE", "title": "Global Military Gear Recoil Pad with Precision Monopod for M4-Style Stocks", "description": "This rubber recoil pad is a drop-in fit for M4-style collapsible AR-15 stocks. Features a rubber recoil pad with a built in steel monopod. The monopod deploys to the desired height with the touch of a button and is finger-adjustable for elevation.", "text": "Global Military Gear Recoil Pad with Precision Monopod for M4-Style Stocks This rubber recoil pad is a drop-in fit for M4-style collapsible AR-15 stocks. Features a rubber recoil pad with a built in steel monopod. The monopod deploys to the desired height with the touch of a button and is finger-adjustable for elevation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XgK7aoI6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6EMLE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004O6EUJ8", "title": "Mako M16/M4/AR-15 Quick Release Front Grip and Magazine Holder", "description": "Enables carry of spare magazine, ready to use, on the weapon, while serving as ergonomic foregrip. Quick release with backup locking screw. Button similar to the AR-15/M16 magazine release quickly releases spare magazine. Works as foregrip with or without magazine inserted.", "text": "Mako M16/M4/AR-15 Quick Release Front Grip and Magazine Holder Enables carry of spare magazine, ready to use, on the weapon, while serving as ergonomic foregrip. Quick release with backup locking screw. Button similar to the AR-15/M16 magazine release quickly releases spare magazine. Works as foregrip with or without magazine inserted.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ggAlyz%2BXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6EUJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mako Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 39.6}}
{"item_id": "B004O6TXVS", "title": "Exerpeutic 400XL Folding Recumbent Bike", "description": "Recumbent exercise bikes have long been terrific workout accessories, but they're usually somewhat bulky, making them inconvenient for people with small homes or apartments. Enter the Exerpeutic 400XL recumbent bike, which folds up for easy storage and fits inside a closet, corner, or other compact space. It's the easiest way to enjoy the benefits of a recumbent workout without dedicating an entire room to your exercise equipment.Despite the space-saving design, the 400XL is plenty powerful, with a precision-balanced flywheel and a quiet V-belt double-drive transmission system. The bike also includes an eight-level magnetic tension control system so you can find the right resistance for your training goals. It's easy to monitor your workout progress via the easy-to-read LCD display, which tracks your distance, calories burned, time, speed, scan, and heart rate. Best of all for frequent exercisers, the 400XL's semi-recumbent design is inviting and comfortable, making it ideal for people who dislike upright-style bikes or who are recovering from injury. Add in a large seat cushion and backrest and you have a great bike for riders of any size and body type.Other details include extendable leg stabilizers; a hand pulse sensor for reading your heart rate; a three-piece, high-torque crank system that provides a smooth, consistent pedaling motion; large pedals with safety straps; and transport wheels for mobility.SpecificationsCapacity: 300 poundsUser height: 5 feet 2 inches to 6 feet 2 inchesDimensions: 19 by 46 by 33 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 39 poundsWarranty: 1 year limited", "text": "Exerpeutic 400XL Folding Recumbent Bike Recumbent exercise bikes have long been terrific workout accessories, but they're usually somewhat bulky, making them inconvenient for people with small homes or apartments. Enter the Exerpeutic 400XL recumbent bike, which folds up for easy storage and fits inside a closet, corner, or other compact space. It's the easiest way to enjoy the benefits of a recumbent workout without dedicating an entire room to your exercise equipment.Despite the space-saving design, the 400XL is plenty powerful, with a precision-balanced flywheel and a quiet V-belt double-drive transmission system. The bike also includes an eight-level magnetic tension control system so you can find the right resistance for your training goals. It's easy to monitor your workout progress via the easy-to-read LCD display, which tracks your distance, calories burned, time, speed, scan, and heart rate. Best of all for frequent exercisers, the 400XL's semi-recumbent design is inviting and comfortable, making it ideal for people who dislike upright-style bikes or who are recovering from injury. Add in a large seat cushion and backrest and you have a great bike for riders of any size and body type.Other details include extendable leg stabilizers; a hand pulse sensor for reading your heart rate; a three-piece, high-torque crank system that provides a smooth, consistent pedaling motion; large pedals with safety straps; and transport wheels for mobility.SpecificationsCapacity: 300 poundsUser height: 5 feet 2 inches to 6 feet 2 inchesDimensions: 19 by 46 by 33 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 39 poundsWarranty: 1 year limited", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HRWRAnPuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O6TXVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Exerpeutic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 141.35}}
{"item_id": "B004O844DS", "title": "Curt 18115 Roof Mounted Cargo Rack", "description": "Whether it’s a road trip with friends or holiday traveling with family, you’ll want extra space the CURT Roof-Mounted Cargo Rack can provide. This rack mounts to most roof racks and is lightweight. The two-piece design makes this rack simple and easy to install. You can also add 21 inches of storage space with the CURT Roof Rack Extension that easily connects to your CURT Roof Mounted Cargo Rack.", "text": "Curt 18115 Roof Mounted Cargo Rack Whether it’s a road trip with friends or holiday traveling with family, you’ll want extra space the CURT Roof-Mounted Cargo Rack can provide. This rack mounts to most roof racks and is lightweight. The two-piece design makes this rack simple and easy to install. You can also add 21 inches of storage space with the CURT Roof Rack Extension that easily connects to your CURT Roof Mounted Cargo Rack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dDY%2BMTy7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O844DS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Curt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Car Surfboard Racks"]], "price": 120.63}}
{"item_id": "B004O844EM", "title": "Curt 18117 Roof Mounted Cargo Rack Extension", "description": "Wherever you're headed and whatever toys and equipment you need to carry along, a Curt roof rack will help you bring everything you need. Curt cargo management products are easy to assemble and install. A durable powder coat finish keeps the Curt roof rack looking great trip after trip.", "text": "Curt 18117 Roof Mounted Cargo Rack Extension Wherever you're headed and whatever toys and equipment you need to carry along, a Curt roof rack will help you bring everything you need. Curt cargo management products are easy to assemble and install. A durable powder coat finish keeps the Curt roof rack looking great trip after trip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Gt1msMQpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O844EM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Curt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Car Surfboard Racks"]], "price": 49.8}}
{"item_id": "B004O8YLGS", "title": "Zumba Exhilarate Body Shaping System DVD Set", "description": "Bigger, bolder, and edgier, the Zumba® Fitness Exhilarate DVD collection is revolutionizing the at-home fitness experience by combining raw energy with cutting-edge design, lights, and sounds to take you on an unforgettable, exhilarating journey to a healthy and happy lifestyle.The Activate DVD features a 45-minute workout sure to rev up your metabolism.As Jam-packed with red-hot dance steps, pulsating Latin and international rhythms, and feel-it-to-the-core routines, this invigorating dance-fitness party will have you movin', rockin', and shakin' the weight off to the exotic rhythms of salsa, cumbia, samba, reggaeton, merengue, and more. With music-video style visuals and live musical accompaniment, these multisensory fitness DVDs put you right in the middle of a Zumba® Fitness-Party. And thanks to its nonstop, easy-to-follow choreography and muscle-engaging routines, you'll torch hundreds of calories per hour and sculpt your body from head to toe--without feeling like you’re working out.The seven-disc DVD collection features seven total-body workouts and each routine utilizes varying levels of intensity to deliver a body-energizing workout that you'll want to move to again and again. The set includes breakdowns of basic steps, a 20-minute \"Rush\" workout, a 45-minute \"Activate\" workout, the \"Ripped\" workout featuring the Zumba® Toning program and breakthrough Zumba Sentao program, a 60-minute \"Exhilarate\" dance-fitness party, the \"Mix\" workout featuring rhythms from all over the world, and a massive Zumbathon® Fitness-Concert live class.About Zumba FitnessZumba Fitness is a global lifestyle brand that fuses fitness, entertainment, and culture into an exhilarating dance-party workout. Coined \"fitness-parties,\" Zumba classes blend upbeat world rhythms with easy-to-follow choreography, which provide effective, total-body workouts. Founded in 2001, the company is now the largest branded fitness program in the world -- reporting more than 12 million weekly class participants, in over 110,000 locations, across more than 125 countries. In addition to its original Zumba® program, the company also offers a range of specialty classes, including Zumba Gold® (for active older adults), Zumba® Toning (body-sculpting class that uses maraca-like Toning Sticks), Aqua Zumba® (the ultimate “pool party” workout), Zumbatomic® (Zumba routines for kids), Zumba Sentao™ (chair-based Zumba class that strengthens, balances and stabilizes the core) and Zumba® in the Circuit (a 30-minute workout that combines signature Zumba® moves with circuit training at timed intervals). The Zumba® fitness lifestyle is rounded out by the company’s many consumer product offerings, including DVD sets, music collections, multi-seasonal apparel and footwear, video games, Fitness-Concert™ events and a lifestyle magazine. For more information about Zumba Fitness programs and products, or to find a live class, visit zumba.com and find us on Facebook and Twitter.", "text": "Zumba Exhilarate Body Shaping System DVD Set Bigger, bolder, and edgier, the Zumba® Fitness Exhilarate DVD collection is revolutionizing the at-home fitness experience by combining raw energy with cutting-edge design, lights, and sounds to take you on an unforgettable, exhilarating journey to a healthy and happy lifestyle.The Activate DVD features a 45-minute workout sure to rev up your metabolism.As Jam-packed with red-hot dance steps, pulsating Latin and international rhythms, and feel-it-to-the-core routines, this invigorating dance-fitness party will have you movin', rockin', and shakin' the weight off to the exotic rhythms of salsa, cumbia, samba, reggaeton, merengue, and more. With music-video style visuals and live musical accompaniment, these multisensory fitness DVDs put you right in the middle of a Zumba® Fitness-Party. And thanks to its nonstop, easy-to-follow choreography and muscle-engaging routines, you'll torch hundreds of calories per hour and sculpt your body from head to toe--without feeling like you’re working out.The seven-disc DVD collection features seven total-body workouts and each routine utilizes varying levels of intensity to deliver a body-energizing workout that you'll want to move to again and again. The set includes breakdowns of basic steps, a 20-minute \"Rush\" workout, a 45-minute \"Activate\" workout, the \"Ripped\" workout featuring the Zumba® Toning program and breakthrough Zumba Sentao program, a 60-minute \"Exhilarate\" dance-fitness party, the \"Mix\" workout featuring rhythms from all over the world, and a massive Zumbathon® Fitness-Concert live class.About Zumba FitnessZumba Fitness is a global lifestyle brand that fuses fitness, entertainment, and culture into an exhilarating dance-party workout. Coined \"fitness-parties,\" Zumba classes blend upbeat world rhythms with easy-to-follow choreography, which provide effective, total-body workouts. Founded in 2001, the company is now the largest branded fitness program in the world -- reporting more than 12 million weekly class participants, in over 110,000 locations, across more than 125 countries. In addition to its original Zumba® program, the company also offers a range of specialty classes, including Zumba Gold® (for active older adults), Zumba® Toning (body-sculpting class that uses maraca-like Toning Sticks), Aqua Zumba® (the ultimate “pool party” workout), Zumbatomic® (Zumba routines for kids), Zumba Sentao™ (chair-based Zumba class that strengthens, balances and stabilizes the core) and Zumba® in the Circuit (a 30-minute workout that combines signature Zumba® moves with circuit training at timed intervals). The Zumba® fitness lifestyle is rounded out by the company’s many consumer product offerings, including DVD sets, music collections, multi-seasonal apparel and footwear, video games, Fitness-Concert™ events and a lifestyle magazine. For more information about Zumba Fitness programs and products, or to find a live class, visit zumba.com and find us on Facebook and Twitter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r1dCGIlJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O8YLGS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zumba Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Exercise Videos"]], "price": 54.75}}
{"item_id": "B004O990KO", "title": "Malone Downloader Folding J-Style Universal Car Rack Kayak Carrier with Bow and Stern Lines", "description": "The J-DownLoader with Bow and Stern includes everything you need to carry one kayak vertically on your roof top. When not in use, the carrier folds down to create more overhead clearance. The built in loading ramps help load and unload the kayak while oversized padding helps protect the boat once strapped down. The Malone universal JAWZ mounting hardware fits round, square and factory oval cross rails.", "text": "Malone Downloader Folding J-Style Universal Car Rack Kayak Carrier with Bow and Stern Lines The J-DownLoader with Bow and Stern includes everything you need to carry one kayak vertically on your roof top. When not in use, the carrier folds down to create more overhead clearance. The built in loading ramps help load and unload the kayak while oversized padding helps protect the boat once strapped down. The Malone universal JAWZ mounting hardware fits round, square and factory oval cross rails.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417D3ZXA9NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O990KO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Malone Auto Racks", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Car Sports Racks", "Kayak & Canoe Racks"]], "price": 143.95}}
{"item_id": "B004O9AGSE", "title": "Picatinny Barrel Band for the Ruger 10/22 - Black Nylon by Superior Concepts", "description": "Does your 10/22 aspire to be something more than it is? Step up to the tactical level with the new custom Accessory Mount, and make the most of your 10/22! The all new nylon/advanced composite Accessory Mount and replacement barrel band has 3 Picatinny rails so you can attach any accessory you have to it! Replaces the factory barrel band on the Ruger 10/22 rifle with a lightweight & strong band that has 3 Picatinny rails for attachment of lasers, lights, and other rail-type accessories with no modification to the stock. Made from high strength glass filled nylon, Made in the USA", "text": "Picatinny Barrel Band for the Ruger 10/22 - Black Nylon by Superior Concepts Does your 10/22 aspire to be something more than it is? Step up to the tactical level with the new custom Accessory Mount, and make the most of your 10/22! The all new nylon/advanced composite Accessory Mount and replacement barrel band has 3 Picatinny rails so you can attach any accessory you have to it! Replaces the factory barrel band on the Ruger 10/22 rifle with a lightweight & strong band that has 3 Picatinny rails for attachment of lasers, lights, and other rail-type accessories with no modification to the stock. Made from high strength glass filled nylon, Made in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31OyvxIJggL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O9AGSE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B004O9D8QG", "title": "Continental GP 4000S Chili Compound Folding Tire, Black, 700cm x 18/25-Inch", "description": "The Grand Prix 4000 S boasts global appeal as the best all round race bike tire on the market. Not only is it fast and super grippy, thanks to its state of the art Black Chili rubber compound, but it is also tough with a healthy tread layer and of course our Vectran anti puncture breaker layer underneath. So for reliability, longevity and all out performance for your race machine, the GP 4000s is the only choice.", "text": "Continental GP 4000S Chili Compound Folding Tire, Black, 700cm x 18/25-Inch The Grand Prix 4000 S boasts global appeal as the best all round race bike tire on the market. Not only is it fast and super grippy, thanks to its state of the art Black Chili rubber compound, but it is also tough with a healthy tread layer and of course our Vectran anti puncture breaker layer underneath. So for reliability, longevity and all out performance for your race machine, the GP 4000s is the only choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41By74MbNuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O9D8QG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Continental", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]], "price": 62.18}}
{"item_id": "B004O9MIE4", "title": "Hultafors 380020 Heavy Duty Knife GK Green Handle with Sheath", "description": "Heavy Duty Knife GK - A powerful and durable ground knife suitable for tough tasks such as prizing, breaking and hacking. It features a unique function for attaching the holster around a button on your work clothes so that it does not come loose whilst still being easy to remove. The blade is made from Japanese knife steel, 3 mm carbon steel that has been hardened to 58-60 HRC. The holster can be attached to both a belt and a button on your work clothes. If your belt is thick, cut away the small pin on the cover.", "text": "Hultafors 380020 Heavy Duty Knife GK Green Handle with Sheath Heavy Duty Knife GK - A powerful and durable ground knife suitable for tough tasks such as prizing, breaking and hacking. It features a unique function for attaching the holster around a button on your work clothes so that it does not come loose whilst still being easy to remove. The blade is made from Japanese knife steel, 3 mm carbon steel that has been hardened to 58-60 HRC. The holster can be attached to both a belt and a button on your work clothes. If your belt is thick, cut away the small pin on the cover.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PkSEC6bAL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O9MIE4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hultafors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 14.9}}
{"item_id": "B004O9W29K", "title": "Ruger 10/22 Bolt Handle - Blued Matte", "description": "The Custom Bolt Handle was designed specifically for your Ruger 10/22, allowing you to operate the action with minimal resistance and also being comfortable to use! The Custom Bolt Handle is a complete assembly ready to drop into your 10/22 with no modifications necessary. The guide rod is machined to an exacting tolerance of within 0.001\" and has a smooth surface for the handle to ride on, increasing reliability during operation. The spring is designed to work flawlessy with the handle and guide rod, ensuring proper lock time for the 22LR and giving the 10/22 smoother cycling. All of these parts are manufactured and assembled in the USA. CNC Machined from highest quality steel, with a polished guide rod and a precision spring, the Custom Bolt Handle assembly comes ready to drop into your 10/22 action with no fitting or gunsmithing required! This part will not work with the Ruger SR-22 chassis. CNC Machined from 1144 stressproof steel, Made in the USA Manufactured by: Superior Concepts Inc.", "text": "Ruger 10/22 Bolt Handle - Blued Matte The Custom Bolt Handle was designed specifically for your Ruger 10/22, allowing you to operate the action with minimal resistance and also being comfortable to use! The Custom Bolt Handle is a complete assembly ready to drop into your 10/22 with no modifications necessary. The guide rod is machined to an exacting tolerance of within 0.001\" and has a smooth surface for the handle to ride on, increasing reliability during operation. The spring is designed to work flawlessy with the handle and guide rod, ensuring proper lock time for the 22LR and giving the 10/22 smoother cycling. All of these parts are manufactured and assembled in the USA. CNC Machined from highest quality steel, with a polished guide rod and a precision spring, the Custom Bolt Handle assembly comes ready to drop into your 10/22 action with no fitting or gunsmithing required! This part will not work with the Ruger SR-22 chassis. CNC Machined from 1144 stressproof steel, Made in the USA Manufactured by: Superior Concepts Inc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315XkJtVtTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004O9W29K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B004OC9YS4", "title": "Leatherman MUT Accessory Kit", "description": "MUT Accessory Kit includes all the replaceable parts on the MUT in one easy-to-use kitIncludes: Carbon Scraper Firearm Disassembly Punch Strap Cutter Insert - 154CM Wire Cutter Inserts - 154CM Torx #8 Driver 4 ScrewsNOTE: On the \"black\" version, the punch, and screws are all blackNOTE: All these parts will fit on the MUT EOD version (except the wire cutter inserts), with the dissassembly punch threading onto the post intended for the C4 punch. The Disassembly punch will not seat exactly flush, but it does not stick out to catch on anything", "text": "Leatherman MUT Accessory Kit MUT Accessory Kit includes all the replaceable parts on the MUT in one easy-to-use kitIncludes: Carbon Scraper Firearm Disassembly Punch Strap Cutter Insert - 154CM Wire Cutter Inserts - 154CM Torx #8 Driver 4 ScrewsNOTE: On the \"black\" version, the punch, and screws are all blackNOTE: All these parts will fit on the MUT EOD version (except the wire cutter inserts), with the dissassembly punch threading onto the post intended for the C4 punch. The Disassembly punch will not seat exactly flush, but it does not stick out to catch on anything", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y72b14HtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OC9YS4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 15.75}}
{"item_id": "B004OD73VS", "title": "Concealed Belt Holster, Fits Compact & Subcompact Pistols, Black", "description": "Concealed Belt Holster, Fits Compact & Subcompact Pistols, Black -- PY-A-3546 UTG concealed belt holster Fits compact & sub-compact pistols Padded polyester won't mar gun's finish Front arch design to easily reholster Elastic thumb break Clip slips over belt waistband 0.2 lbs Black For concealed carry for firearms. Also useful for airsoft shooters who want to conceal an airsoft pistol during skirmishes. Clip this onto your belt to stow a spare sidearm the other side can't see!", "text": "Concealed Belt Holster, Fits Compact & Subcompact Pistols, Black Concealed Belt Holster, Fits Compact & Subcompact Pistols, Black -- PY-A-3546 UTG concealed belt holster Fits compact & sub-compact pistols Padded polyester won't mar gun's finish Front arch design to easily reholster Elastic thumb break Clip slips over belt waistband 0.2 lbs Black For concealed carry for firearms. Also useful for airsoft shooters who want to conceal an airsoft pistol during skirmishes. Clip this onto your belt to stow a spare sidearm the other side can't see!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iY5AFsFpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OD73VS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004OECM4U", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat (Large 750)", "description": "Add an ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat to the bottom of your sleeping bag to improve the level of comfort. The foam mats are all extremely lightweight so you won't be hauling along too much extra weight on your next hike, but will be adding enough padding to make a noticeable difference in how well you sleep at night. The textured foam insulates to keep you warmer and also keeps the mat from sliding around. Each foam mat comes with straps so when you're finished, you can roll it up and easily transport and store it. Dense closed cell textured foam, Protects and insulates. Six sizes available: Regular 375 (#7551007), Regular 625 (#7552011), Regular 750 (#7552999), Large 625 (#7553011), Large 750 (#7553999), Extra Large 625 (#7554011). Refer to sizing chart for dimensions.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat (Large 750) Add an ALPS Mountaineering Foam Camping Mat to the bottom of your sleeping bag to improve the level of comfort. The foam mats are all extremely lightweight so you won't be hauling along too much extra weight on your next hike, but will be adding enough padding to make a noticeable difference in how well you sleep at night. The textured foam insulates to keep you warmer and also keeps the mat from sliding around. Each foam mat comes with straps so when you're finished, you can roll it up and easily transport and store it. Dense closed cell textured foam, Protects and insulates. Six sizes available: Regular 375 (#7551007), Regular 625 (#7552011), Regular 750 (#7552999), Large 625 (#7553011), Large 750 (#7553999), Extra Large 625 (#7554011). Refer to sizing chart for dimensions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hdUUpUDTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OECM4U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 30.79}}
{"item_id": "B004OHWXQY", "title": "Aqua Quest 'Mariner' Waterproof Backpack Dry Bag Day Pack - 10 L / 600 cu in. - Green Model", "description": "The Aqua Quest Mariner Series, Available in 10L, 20L, & 30L Carrying Capacities, is Designed to Provide Waterproof Protection in an Easy to Carry Bag. Inspired by Kayakers, Canoeists, Boaters & Sailors, but Designed to Meet The Needs of Anybody Who is Heading Outdoors for Any Reason. These Bags offer Welded Seam Construction, Sleek Single-Compartment Design, and an Enhanced Traditional 'Roll-Down' Closure with Dual-Integrated Stiffeners for Easy Handling. The PVC-Coated Tarpaulin Fabric is Very Tough, and Resistant to Abrasion. These Bags are Equipped with Accessory Shoulder Straps and a Duffel-Style Side Handle, Making the 'Mariner' One of the Most Versatile & Multi-Functional Waterproof Backpacks on The Planet, at a Price that Can't Be Beat!", "text": "Aqua Quest 'Mariner' Waterproof Backpack Dry Bag Day Pack - 10 L / 600 cu in. - Green Model The Aqua Quest Mariner Series, Available in 10L, 20L, & 30L Carrying Capacities, is Designed to Provide Waterproof Protection in an Easy to Carry Bag. Inspired by Kayakers, Canoeists, Boaters & Sailors, but Designed to Meet The Needs of Anybody Who is Heading Outdoors for Any Reason. These Bags offer Welded Seam Construction, Sleek Single-Compartment Design, and an Enhanced Traditional 'Roll-Down' Closure with Dual-Integrated Stiffeners for Easy Handling. The PVC-Coated Tarpaulin Fabric is Very Tough, and Resistant to Abrasion. These Bags are Equipped with Accessory Shoulder Straps and a Duffel-Style Side Handle, Making the 'Mariner' One of the Most Versatile & Multi-Functional Waterproof Backpacks on The Planet, at a Price that Can't Be Beat!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41P9jEoSMSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OHWXQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]], "price": 29.0}}
{"item_id": "B004OI8QKK", "title": "Picnic Time Portable Ventura Reclining Seat", "description": "Perfect for camping, outdoor concerts, sporting events, picnics or days at the beach, this Picnic Time Ventura portable recliner features a durable polyester-covered padded cushion mounted on a sturdy steel frame. The design is so unique, and adjusts simply by folding the top and the bottom toward one another, into six assorted positions, for your maximum comfort. The integrated armrests automatically fold as you change the recliner positioning. The adjustable backpack-style shoulder straps allow for easy transport on your outing, and a small zippered pocket in the back will house your keys, cell phone and other small incidentals. Comes in assorted colors.", "text": "Picnic Time Portable Ventura Reclining Seat Perfect for camping, outdoor concerts, sporting events, picnics or days at the beach, this Picnic Time Ventura portable recliner features a durable polyester-covered padded cushion mounted on a sturdy steel frame. The design is so unique, and adjusts simply by folding the top and the bottom toward one another, into six assorted positions, for your maximum comfort. The integrated armrests automatically fold as you change the recliner positioning. The adjustable backpack-style shoulder straps allow for easy transport on your outing, and a small zippered pocket in the back will house your keys, cell phone and other small incidentals. Comes in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-z2w96ISL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OI8QKK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Picnic Time", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Playing Field Equipment", "Stadium Seats & Cushions"]], "price": 55.95}}
{"item_id": "B004OKCGGI", "title": "Boker Plus Vox Access Tool", "description": "Together with Jesper Voxnaes Boker Plus brings you this handy tool. Great for prying tasks, but also works great as a bottle opener, nail puller, shackle opener and carabiner. Overall length: 3 5/8-Inch. Weight: 0.7 oz.", "text": "Boker Plus Vox Access Tool Together with Jesper Voxnaes Boker Plus brings you this handy tool. Great for prying tasks, but also works great as a bottle opener, nail puller, shackle opener and carabiner. Overall length: 3 5/8-Inch. Weight: 0.7 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DSqb25o0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OKCGGI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "B&ouml;ker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 23.88}}
