{"item_id": "B004OOMVBO", "title": "6\" to 9\" Heavy Duty Pivot Bipod Notch Leg Swivel Stud Mount Come with YHM Style Harris Bipod Adapter", "description": "Hunting or target practice can't get any more simple with this 6\"-9\" heavy duty swivel bipod. Accuracy guaranteed!", "text": "6\" to 9\" Heavy Duty Pivot Bipod Notch Leg Swivel Stud Mount Come with YHM Style Harris Bipod Adapter Hunting or target practice can't get any more simple with this 6\"-9\" heavy duty swivel bipod. Accuracy guaranteed!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516UUVdgGAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OOMVBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]]}}
