{"item_id": "B004OUHKWS", "title": "Mil-Comm MC2500 Firearm Lubricant 2oz Spray", "description": "MC2500 oil is Mil-Comm Products' synthetic blend that is based on the same technology and delivers the same exceptional performance as TW25B grease. The lower viscosity of MC2500 oil allows for easy migration to hard to reach weapon parts while its liquidity allows the user the ability to pour or pump the lubricant easily. These special characteristics of MC2500 oil make it outstanding for lubricating close-fitted, high-speed, extreme pressure precision parts. MC2500 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The convenient 2 fluid ounce plastic bottle is a favorite for refilling the MC2500 0.50 fluid ounce syringe.", "text": "Mil-Comm MC2500 Firearm Lubricant 2oz Spray MC2500 oil is Mil-Comm Products' synthetic blend that is based on the same technology and delivers the same exceptional performance as TW25B grease. The lower viscosity of MC2500 oil allows for easy migration to hard to reach weapon parts while its liquidity allows the user the ability to pour or pump the lubricant easily. These special characteristics of MC2500 oil make it outstanding for lubricating close-fitted, high-speed, extreme pressure precision parts. MC2500 is proudly MADE IN THE U.S.A. The convenient 2 fluid ounce plastic bottle is a favorite for refilling the MC2500 0.50 fluid ounce syringe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ibNV1A72L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OUHKWS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 13.84}}
{"item_id": "B004OV0USI", "title": "Ruger LCR Pocket Holster ***MADE IN U.S.A.***", "description": "This holster is ideal for concealed carry of your small auto. It breaks up the outline of your small auto and allows the user to experience comfortable carry in the pants or jacket pocket. It features a lined interior to protect the finish of your gun, solid nylon construction, and a no-slip exterior that keeps this holster in your pocket for a secure draw of your small auto when needed.", "text": "Ruger LCR Pocket Holster ***MADE IN U.S.A.*** This holster is ideal for concealed carry of your small auto. It breaks up the outline of your small auto and allows the user to experience comfortable carry in the pants or jacket pocket. It features a lined interior to protect the finish of your gun, solid nylon construction, and a no-slip exterior that keeps this holster in your pocket for a secure draw of your small auto when needed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v8ZS5GGSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OV0USI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B004OVJ3TA", "title": "XMark 45 Degree Ab Back Hyperextension Roman Chair XM-4428", "description": "XMark 45 Degree Ab Back Hyperextension Roman Chair XM-4428Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, the XMark 45 Degree Hyperextension XM-4428 focuses on developing your lower back, abdominals, and obliques. This state-of-the-art equipment with its twelve levels of adjustments decompresses the back. Enhance your stretching routine with the XMark 45 Degree Hyperextension as you improve flexibility, range of motion, and circulation. The quality of the XM-4428 ensures your joints and muscles get the most out of each workout session. Sculpt, build and define your body with XMark, the mark of excellence.Features:- Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty- Heavy duty 14-gauge steel construction- Mainframe built using 2” x 3” rectangular steel- Focus on developing your lower back, abdominals, and obliques- Features tricep dip handles- Wide, horseshoe shaped base- 12 pad height adjustments- 2.5” thick Hi-density mid-section pads covered with tear and sweat resistant Duraguard vinyl- Oversized 8” x 4” contoured rollers- Angled rubber grip handlebars- Baked powder coat finish- Recommended for home use", "text": "XMark 45 Degree Ab Back Hyperextension Roman Chair XM-4428 XMark 45 Degree Ab Back Hyperextension Roman Chair XM-4428Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, the XMark 45 Degree Hyperextension XM-4428 focuses on developing your lower back, abdominals, and obliques. This state-of-the-art equipment with its twelve levels of adjustments decompresses the back. Enhance your stretching routine with the XMark 45 Degree Hyperextension as you improve flexibility, range of motion, and circulation. The quality of the XM-4428 ensures your joints and muscles get the most out of each workout session. Sculpt, build and define your body with XMark, the mark of excellence.Features:- Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty- Heavy duty 14-gauge steel construction- Mainframe built using 2” x 3” rectangular steel- Focus on developing your lower back, abdominals, and obliques- Features tricep dip handles- Wide, horseshoe shaped base- 12 pad height adjustments- 2.5” thick Hi-density mid-section pads covered with tear and sweat resistant Duraguard vinyl- Oversized 8” x 4” contoured rollers- Angled rubber grip handlebars- Baked powder coat finish- Recommended for home use", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I%2BlCfXqXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OVJ3TA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XMark Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]], "price": 148.44}}
