{"item_id": "B004OYWTKW", "title": "XMark FID Flat Incline Decline Weight Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419", "description": "XMark Flat Incline Decline (FID) Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, XMark FID Weight Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419 will effectively build and strengthen your body in flat, incline, and decline positions. Multiple adjustments allow you to work your entire upper body as well as your lower body and abdominals (in the decline position) in a variety of positions and angles. Attachments included are a dedicated removable preacher curl with curl bar catch for bicep work and a removable leg developer for leg extensions and curls.Features:- Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty- 8 pop-pin adjustments from decline to military press position- 4 vertical preacher curl adjustment- Removable integrated preacher curl bar- Dual leg developer for leg curls and extensions- Preacher curl bar/ leg developer for use with standard or Olympic plate weights- Olympic adaptor included- Extra thick 2.5” Hi-density cushions- Double stitched, sweat and tear resistant Duraguard Vinyl- Oversized 4” contoured knee and ankle pads- Horseshoe shaped base for stability- Skid resistant rubber feet- Scratch resistant baked powder coat finishSpecifications:- Seat cushion dimensions: 16” L x 14” W- Back cushion dimenstions: 30.5” L x 12” W- Total weight capacity: 600 lbs.- Assembled dimensions: 75” x 27” W x 49.5” H- Heavy-duty 14-gauge steel construction", "text": "XMark FID Flat Incline Decline Weight Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419 XMark Flat Incline Decline (FID) Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, XMark FID Weight Bench with Leg Extension and Preacher Curl XM-4419 will effectively build and strengthen your body in flat, incline, and decline positions. Multiple adjustments allow you to work your entire upper body as well as your lower body and abdominals (in the decline position) in a variety of positions and angles. Attachments included are a dedicated removable preacher curl with curl bar catch for bicep work and a removable leg developer for leg extensions and curls.Features:- Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty- 8 pop-pin adjustments from decline to military press position- 4 vertical preacher curl adjustment- Removable integrated preacher curl bar- Dual leg developer for leg curls and extensions- Preacher curl bar/ leg developer for use with standard or Olympic plate weights- Olympic adaptor included- Extra thick 2.5” Hi-density cushions- Double stitched, sweat and tear resistant Duraguard Vinyl- Oversized 4” contoured knee and ankle pads- Horseshoe shaped base for stability- Skid resistant rubber feet- Scratch resistant baked powder coat finishSpecifications:- Seat cushion dimensions: 16” L x 14” W- Back cushion dimenstions: 30.5” L x 12” W- Total weight capacity: 600 lbs.- Assembled dimensions: 75” x 27” W x 49.5” H- Heavy-duty 14-gauge steel construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Pgcsxz1sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004OYWTKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XMark Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Benches"]], "price": 236.09}}
{"item_id": "B004P0DSLY", "title": "Hammers Wide View Electronic Reflex Airgun Crossbow Red Dot Sight", "description": "For sale here is a Hammers wide view electronic reflex red dot sight. This inexpensive dot sight is a good sighting choice for air rifles, airsoft guns and crossbows. The sight will fit onto 3/8\" dovetail rails or groove receivers, or Weaver rails with included Weaver side plate installed. Fully adjustable for windage and elevation. On/Off switch.Brand: HammersEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 5moaSight overall length: 4 1/2\"Center height(line of sight): approximately 35mmBattery used: CR2032 button cell ( included)Accessories included: Weaver rail side plates", "text": "Hammers Wide View Electronic Reflex Airgun Crossbow Red Dot Sight For sale here is a Hammers wide view electronic reflex red dot sight. This inexpensive dot sight is a good sighting choice for air rifles, airsoft guns and crossbows. The sight will fit onto 3/8\" dovetail rails or groove receivers, or Weaver rails with included Weaver side plate installed. Fully adjustable for windage and elevation. On/Off switch.Brand: HammersEye relief: UnlimitedDot size: 5moaSight overall length: 4 1/2\"Center height(line of sight): approximately 35mmBattery used: CR2032 button cell ( included)Accessories included: Weaver rail side plates", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FBILEKdUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P0DSLY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hammers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 8.98}}
{"item_id": "B004P24GOK", "title": "Bell Infant Sprout Bike Helmet (Love Bugs/Pink) Size : 47-52cm", "description": "Keep little ones' heads protected while they're riding in child carriers, bike trailers, or just starting to learn on their own bikes, with this youth helmet from Bell. A True Fit feature offers simple, custom sizing every time, while seven top vents keep kids' heads cool. High-impact reflectors improve visibility, and a Pinchguard buckle means no tears when Mom and Dad are snapping the helmet into place. Grow With Me padding lets you size up your purchase, and let your little one's noggin grow into it over time.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "text": "Bell Infant Sprout Bike Helmet (Love Bugs/Pink) Size : 47-52cm Keep little ones' heads protected while they're riding in child carriers, bike trailers, or just starting to learn on their own bikes, with this youth helmet from Bell. A True Fit feature offers simple, custom sizing every time, while seven top vents keep kids' heads cool. High-impact reflectors improve visibility, and a Pinchguard buckle means no tears when Mom and Dad are snapping the helmet into place. Grow With Me padding lets you size up your purchase, and let your little one's noggin grow into it over time.About BellEaston-Bell Sports, Inc. is a leading designer, developer, and marketer of branded sporting equipment and accessories that enhance athletic performance and protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51mEuM8E7yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P24GOK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004P33I70", "title": "The Amazing Pocket Chair Portable Seat", "description": "The Amazing Pocket Chair lets you take a seat anywhere with a compact, pocket-sized chair. It supports up to 250 lbs, and opens and folds easily to provide the perfect seating anywhere. Take it to the park, golfing, the beach, camping, gardening and more. The Amazing Pocket Chair easily stows in your hand bag, glove box, napsack, gym bag, briefcase, or just about anywhere, so you can always have a place to sit no matter where you are, and it is sturdy enough to hold up to 250 lbs.", "text": "The Amazing Pocket Chair Portable Seat The Amazing Pocket Chair lets you take a seat anywhere with a compact, pocket-sized chair. It supports up to 250 lbs, and opens and folds easily to provide the perfect seating anywhere. Take it to the park, golfing, the beach, camping, gardening and more. The Amazing Pocket Chair easily stows in your hand bag, glove box, napsack, gym bag, briefcase, or just about anywhere, so you can always have a place to sit no matter where you are, and it is sturdy enough to hold up to 250 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ILSyVa55L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P33I70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allstar Marketing Group", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B004P3WP24", "title": "VP 399T Road Bike Pedals", "description": "The VP 399T Road Pedal is a single piece, integrated road pedal with a toe clip, nylon strap and reflector. A solid steel axle and ball bearing movement make this a sturdy road pedal great for beginner to intermediate riders. Body: One-piece PP Axle: Boron steel Bearings: Ball bearings Toe Clips: Nylon VP-710 & strap VP-702N Reflector: VP-R3 black TWSize: 140 x 95 mm Weight: 376 g/pr. inc toe clips & straps", "text": "VP 399T Road Bike Pedals The VP 399T Road Pedal is a single piece, integrated road pedal with a toe clip, nylon strap and reflector. A solid steel axle and ball bearing movement make this a sturdy road pedal great for beginner to intermediate riders. Body: One-piece PP Axle: Boron steel Bearings: Ball bearings Toe Clips: Nylon VP-710 & strap VP-702N Reflector: VP-R3 black TWSize: 140 x 95 mm Weight: 376 g/pr. inc toe clips & straps", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412UqTI-70L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P3WP24.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VP", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B004P4HH8U", "title": "Barnett Ghost 350 CRT Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 20-Inch Arrows and Illuminated 3x32mm Scope)", "description": "The Ghost 350 CRT is one of the lightest bows Barnett has ever produced, weighing just over 7.5 pounds thanks to Carbon Riser Technology (CRT), which removes front-end weight and places the center of gravity at the end of the stock, while also boasting a five-to-one safety factor. Consequently, the bow shoulders with greater comfort and is easier to carry. Power has certainly not been sacrificed, however, as the bow fires at an impressive 350-feet-per-second. Crosswire strings, Whiplash cams, and Anti-Dry Fire metal injection molding trigger provide smooth, quiet, precise shots in a compact fit. The bow, which is made in the USA, comes complete with three arrows, a quiver, and rope cocking device.Specifications:175-pound draw weight116-foot-pounds of energy12-inch power stroke350-feet-per-second (FPS) firing velocity20-inch arrow lengthMeasures 24 by 37 inches (W x D)7.6-pound weightWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "text": "Barnett Ghost 350 CRT Crossbow Package (Quiver, 3 - 20-Inch Arrows and Illuminated 3x32mm Scope) The Ghost 350 CRT is one of the lightest bows Barnett has ever produced, weighing just over 7.5 pounds thanks to Carbon Riser Technology (CRT), which removes front-end weight and places the center of gravity at the end of the stock, while also boasting a five-to-one safety factor. Consequently, the bow shoulders with greater comfort and is easier to carry. Power has certainly not been sacrificed, however, as the bow fires at an impressive 350-feet-per-second. Crosswire strings, Whiplash cams, and Anti-Dry Fire metal injection molding trigger provide smooth, quiet, precise shots in a compact fit. The bow, which is made in the USA, comes complete with three arrows, a quiver, and rope cocking device.Specifications:175-pound draw weight116-foot-pounds of energy12-inch power stroke350-feet-per-second (FPS) firing velocity20-inch arrow lengthMeasures 24 by 37 inches (W x D)7.6-pound weightWarrantyThis Barnett crossbow includes a limited five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About Barnett Precision CrossbowsBarnett is an industry leader in crossbow design and manufacture, and has sold well over one million crossbows to date. The company was established more than 50 years ago, with products designed by hunters, for hunters, and Barnett manufactures a range of crossbows that are lightweight, adjustable, and surprisingly powerful.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H%2B6erk0YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P4HH8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett Crossbows", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Crossbows"]], "price": 509.99}}
{"item_id": "B004P81FMU", "title": "AR-PEPR Scope mount 1\"", "description": "Proper Eye Position Ready for combat riflescopes, this mount provides 2\" of forward scope positioning on the M-4 and AR-15 platform. Ring bases are milled as a single, tough unit, and ring tops feature Picatinny tops for mounting additional accessories. - 1\" Rings", "text": "AR-PEPR Scope mount 1\" Proper Eye Position Ready for combat riflescopes, this mount provides 2\" of forward scope positioning on the M-4 and AR-15 platform. Ring bases are milled as a single, tough unit, and ring tops feature Picatinny tops for mounting additional accessories. - 1\" Rings", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TqukpL%2B0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P81FMU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 78.73}}
