{"item_id": "B004P88M4E", "title": "Ergon GR2 BioKork Bicycle Handlebar Grip", "description": "The new GR2 BioKork offers a different feel thanks to the use of natural cork, while offering all the ergonomic advantages of every Ergon Performance Comfort Series grip. The 3 finger angle adjustable bar end offers an additional hand position, and non-slip rubber inserts for a sure grip in all conditions.", "text": "Ergon GR2 BioKork Bicycle Handlebar Grip The new GR2 BioKork offers a different feel thanks to the use of natural cork, while offering all the ergonomic advantages of every Ergon Performance Comfort Series grip. The 3 finger angle adjustable bar end offers an additional hand position, and non-slip rubber inserts for a sure grip in all conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iLUdOZ0nL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P88M4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004P8ADH8", "title": "Under Armour Men's Armour® Stretch Fit Cap", "description": "Structured build maintains shape with a slightly higher crown. Stretch construction provides a comfortable fit. Built-in HeatGear® sweatband wicks away sweat to keep you cool and dry. Polyester. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's Armour® Stretch Fit Cap Structured build maintains shape with a slightly higher crown. Stretch construction provides a comfortable fit. Built-in HeatGear® sweatband wicks away sweat to keep you cool and dry. Polyester. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jGFAK9LoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P8ADH8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Baseball Caps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004P8BCWS", "title": "Ergon GS1 Leichtbau Bicycle Handlebar Grip", "description": "A lightweight grip for full-on racing. The underlying concept is based on our successful GP and GR series grips. The GX1 features a compact body with a significantly slimmer wing, and lower grip diameter in the mid section than the GP1. The grip is designed for quick hand position changes in challenging riding and racing conditions. Made from a lightweight rubber compound and combined with a highly secure lightweight clamp, the GX series is the most comfortable grip on the World Cup race circuit.", "text": "Ergon GS1 Leichtbau Bicycle Handlebar Grip A lightweight grip for full-on racing. The underlying concept is based on our successful GP and GR series grips. The GX1 features a compact body with a significantly slimmer wing, and lower grip diameter in the mid section than the GP1. The grip is designed for quick hand position changes in challenging riding and racing conditions. Made from a lightweight rubber compound and combined with a highly secure lightweight clamp, the GX series is the most comfortable grip on the World Cup race circuit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HKUdCnrdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P8BCWS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004P92WN0", "title": "Guide Gear Pop - up Privacy Shelter with Camp Shower", "description": "Guide Gear Pop - up Privacy Shelter, SAVE BIG! Superman could always find a convenient phone booth. But where are you going to find one of THOSE miles from civilization? Enter the Guide Gear Pop-up Privacy Shelter. It sets up in seconds and provides you with an instant personal space to swap your hiking outfit for a swimsuit. Or a swimsuit for pajamas. Of course, paired with a portable commode, it's also great for a \"nature call.\" In fact, it even comes complete with a 5-gallon PVC personal Camp Shower for quick clean-ups! It's just like having a personal locker room that goes wherever you do! Spring-loaded fiberglass frame pops up instantly; Perfect for changing, showering, restroom use and more; Includes nylon carrying and storage bag; Included Camp Shower holds 5 gallons, heats water with solar energy; 70-denier polyester fabric.; Deploys to a 4 x 4' footprint, stands 6'6\"h. 6 lbs., 8 ozs.; Order yours now! Guide Gear Pop-up Privacy Shelter with Camp Shower", "text": "Guide Gear Pop - up Privacy Shelter with Camp Shower Guide Gear Pop - up Privacy Shelter, SAVE BIG! Superman could always find a convenient phone booth. But where are you going to find one of THOSE miles from civilization? Enter the Guide Gear Pop-up Privacy Shelter. It sets up in seconds and provides you with an instant personal space to swap your hiking outfit for a swimsuit. Or a swimsuit for pajamas. Of course, paired with a portable commode, it's also great for a \"nature call.\" In fact, it even comes complete with a 5-gallon PVC personal Camp Shower for quick clean-ups! It's just like having a personal locker room that goes wherever you do! Spring-loaded fiberglass frame pops up instantly; Perfect for changing, showering, restroom use and more; Includes nylon carrying and storage bag; Included Camp Shower holds 5 gallons, heats water with solar energy; 70-denier polyester fabric.; Deploys to a 4 x 4' footprint, stands 6'6\"h. 6 lbs., 8 ozs.; Order yours now! Guide Gear Pop-up Privacy Shelter with Camp Shower", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LlSrNn1wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004P92WN0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Showers"]]}}
