{"item_id": "B004PHUMRU", "title": "LEM Products 575 Watt #8 Electric Meat Grinder", "description": "We hunted long and hard for a grinder that was capable of processing 1 to 2 deer a year and is built to last, and LEM Products 1113 575 Watt #8 Electric Meat Grinder is the one! The 575 watt motor is powerful, efficient and has forward and reverse speeds. Square aluminum meat tray holds a generous amount of meat to simplify processing. Die-cast aluminum grinder head is built to last. Easy to read power indicator. Includes two stainless steel plates (8mm and 4.8mm), a stuffing plate and knife, 7/8\" stuffing tube and meat stomper. Compact size for easy storage. UL approved.", "text": "LEM Products 575 Watt #8 Electric Meat Grinder We hunted long and hard for a grinder that was capable of processing 1 to 2 deer a year and is built to last, and LEM Products 1113 575 Watt #8 Electric Meat Grinder is the one! The 575 watt motor is powerful, efficient and has forward and reverse speeds. Square aluminum meat tray holds a generous amount of meat to simplify processing. Die-cast aluminum grinder head is built to last. Easy to read power indicator. Includes two stainless steel plates (8mm and 4.8mm), a stuffing plate and knife, 7/8\" stuffing tube and meat stomper. Compact size for easy storage. UL approved.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hVxT7FcJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PHUMRU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LEM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen"]], "price": 113.99}}
{"item_id": "B004PI2BHS", "title": "Lyman Turbo Sonic Case Cleaning Solution (16 Fl -Ounce)", "description": "Turbo Sonic Solution is specially formulated for cleaning Brass Cases.", "text": "Lyman Turbo Sonic Case Cleaning Solution (16 Fl -Ounce) Turbo Sonic Solution is specially formulated for cleaning Brass Cases.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KvHf4KC9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PI2BHS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 14.83}}
