{"item_id": "B004PP3FSA", "title": "ENO Double Deluxe Hammock", "description": "The Double Deluxe Hammock is ENO's largest hammock, with room for two and then some. The added width of the Double Deluxe allows you to recline, repose, rest, relax and spread out. The hammock is made of high-strength breathable woven nylon and strong nautical line crafted with high-grade nylon triple lock stitching for superior strength. The Double Deluxe Hammock holds a maximum weight of 400 pounds.Features and Specifications:Dimensions: 8 feet, 4 inches by 9 feet, 4 inchesHammock Weight: 29 ouncesMaximum Weight Capacity: 400 poundsHigh-strength breathable woven nylonStrong nautical lineHigh-grade nylon triple interlock stitching", "text": "ENO Double Deluxe Hammock The Double Deluxe Hammock is ENO's largest hammock, with room for two and then some. The added width of the Double Deluxe allows you to recline, repose, rest, relax and spread out. The hammock is made of high-strength breathable woven nylon and strong nautical line crafted with high-grade nylon triple lock stitching for superior strength. The Double Deluxe Hammock holds a maximum weight of 400 pounds.Features and Specifications:Dimensions: 8 feet, 4 inches by 9 feet, 4 inchesHammock Weight: 29 ouncesMaximum Weight Capacity: 400 poundsHigh-strength breathable woven nylonStrong nautical lineHigh-grade nylon triple interlock stitching", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hfM9elGrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PP3FSA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 84.95}}
{"item_id": "B004PP81GG", "title": "Boker Plus Kwaito Knife", "description": "Bud Nealy brings us this slim profile, comfortably worn knife. The ramps of the thumb and forefinger provide an excellent grip. Blade length: 4 1/8\". Overall length: 8 1/4\". Weight: 3.8 oz.", "text": "Boker Plus Kwaito Knife Bud Nealy brings us this slim profile, comfortably worn knife. The ramps of the thumb and forefinger provide an excellent grip. Blade length: 4 1/8\". Overall length: 8 1/4\". Weight: 3.8 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21vUdXWXEeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PP81GG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004PQNBKG", "title": "Smith and Wesson SW671 Extraction and Evasion Tomahawk Hatchet with Kraton Overlay and Sheath", "description": "This \"extraction tool\" is a formidable item. First you will notice the weight. It's heavy at 2 lbs. 11 oz.! The item is made from 3/8\" stock and most of it is that thick. The removable handle grips have a slight texture allowing for a secure grip. This is a great item to have at your side when you need it. The head cover is a thick canvas with snaps that allow easy removal. There is a belt loop, but the weight of the tomahawk may not make belt carry practical.", "text": "Smith and Wesson SW671 Extraction and Evasion Tomahawk Hatchet with Kraton Overlay and Sheath This \"extraction tool\" is a formidable item. First you will notice the weight. It's heavy at 2 lbs. 11 oz.! The item is made from 3/8\" stock and most of it is that thick. The removable handle grips have a slight texture allowing for a secure grip. This is a great item to have at your side when you need it. The head cover is a thick canvas with snaps that allow easy removal. There is a belt loop, but the weight of the tomahawk may not make belt carry practical.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317703l9khL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PQNBKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Smith &amp; Wesson", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 55.99}}
{"item_id": "B004PS3UIW", "title": "Past Mag Shield", "description": "The PAST original Mag Shield is designed to provide unparalleled recoil protection while sighting in your rifle, benchrest shooting, or participating in many other shooting activities.The size and shape of the Mag Shield creates the perfect combination of function and comfort. It can be worn on the left or right shoulder and attaches with an easily adjustable side closure for a secure fit. The leather on the front secures the gun in place, while the leather on the back of the shield provides a comfortable feel and prevents the shield from sliding around on your shoulder.", "text": "Past Mag Shield The PAST original Mag Shield is designed to provide unparalleled recoil protection while sighting in your rifle, benchrest shooting, or participating in many other shooting activities.The size and shape of the Mag Shield creates the perfect combination of function and comfort. It can be worn on the left or right shoulder and attaches with an easily adjustable side closure for a secure fit. The leather on the front secures the gun in place, while the leather on the back of the shield provides a comfortable feel and prevents the shield from sliding around on your shoulder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oSOd0Pp7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PS3UIW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Past", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 22.87}}
{"item_id": "B004PSOIVA", "title": "Nike Men's Crew Cut Moisture Management Socks 3 pack", "description": "", "text": "Nike Men's Crew Cut Moisture Management Socks 3 pack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nWQqPMNbL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PSOIVA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "N", "Nike"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Athletic Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004PX9KO0", "title": "40 pack 1/2\" Steel-Ball slingshot ammo (12 oz)", "description": "Long range steel-ball ammo. Optimized for Slingshot use, these precision steel balls shoot straight and hit hard. Suitable for slingshot hunting and slingshot target shooting. Perfectly round with no flat-spots. Slingshot ammo steel ammunition.", "text": "40 pack 1/2\" Steel-Ball slingshot ammo (12 oz) Long range steel-ball ammo. Optimized for Slingshot use, these precision steel balls shoot straight and hit hard. Suitable for slingshot hunting and slingshot target shooting. Perfectly round with no flat-spots. Slingshot ammo steel ammunition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kwVw%2BBFKL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PX9KO0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moore Ammo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 9.24}}
{"item_id": "B004PXMDCG", "title": "Bern 2012 Brentwood Helmet with Visor", "description": "The Brentwood uses a unique foam called Zipmold that has a higher strength to weight ratio than traditional EPS hard foams, allowing it to be thinner and lighter, while still hitting the Certifications for Head Protection. The result is the lid fits super low profile and sinks down on your head unlike other helmets that bring out the hugeness in your melon.", "text": "Bern 2012 Brentwood Helmet with Visor The Brentwood uses a unique foam called Zipmold that has a higher strength to weight ratio than traditional EPS hard foams, allowing it to be thinner and lighter, while still hitting the Certifications for Head Protection. The result is the lid fits super low profile and sinks down on your head unlike other helmets that bring out the hugeness in your melon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411qo9DImsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PXMDCG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004PYML90", "title": "Excalibur Axiom SMF Crossbow Kit", "description": "This superbly crafted crossbow is capable of producing arrow speeds in excess of 305 feet per second and like all Excalibur crossbows, its accuracy is amazing and its reliability is bulletproof. Generating plenty of horsepower, the Axiom SMF has what it takes to efficiently handle any of North America's largest game. Its 175 pound draw weight and 14.5\" power stroke make it comfortable to cock and the Axiom's light 6 pound mass weight make it a joy to carry on a long day afield. The Axiom SMF is sold only as a kit including a matching multiplex crossbow scope with mounting hardware, our rope cocking aid, our 4 arrow quiver plus 4 Firebolt arrows complete with field points. The Axiom SMF kit is designed as a budget priced option to help new and seasoned crossbow hunters enjoy Excalibur quality at a low cost, but make no mistake, this is one serious hunting combination! Quality of manufacture, reliability, and accuracy of this economical kit is comparable with our most expensive options.", "text": "Excalibur Axiom SMF Crossbow Kit This superbly crafted crossbow is capable of producing arrow speeds in excess of 305 feet per second and like all Excalibur crossbows, its accuracy is amazing and its reliability is bulletproof. Generating plenty of horsepower, the Axiom SMF has what it takes to efficiently handle any of North America's largest game. Its 175 pound draw weight and 14.5\" power stroke make it comfortable to cock and the Axiom's light 6 pound mass weight make it a joy to carry on a long day afield. The Axiom SMF is sold only as a kit including a matching multiplex crossbow scope with mounting hardware, our rope cocking aid, our 4 arrow quiver plus 4 Firebolt arrows complete with field points. The Axiom SMF kit is designed as a budget priced option to help new and seasoned crossbow hunters enjoy Excalibur quality at a low cost, but make no mistake, this is one serious hunting combination! Quality of manufacture, reliability, and accuracy of this economical kit is comparable with our most expensive options.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410WSDjkK2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PYML90.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Excalibur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 499.95}}
{"item_id": "B004PYS5CC", "title": "Excalibur S5 String Suppression System", "description": "Uses a combination of modern vibration reduction technology and common sense thinking to produce the most durable and effective shock and sound reduction possible. The new \"S5\" string shock and sound suppression system attaches easily and quickly to mounting holes in the riser of all 2004 or newer Excalibur Crossbows and will work either in conjunction with Excalibur's dissipator bar system or on its own to quiet shot noise and reduce vibration.", "text": "Excalibur S5 String Suppression System Uses a combination of modern vibration reduction technology and common sense thinking to produce the most durable and effective shock and sound reduction possible. The new \"S5\" string shock and sound suppression system attaches easily and quickly to mounting holes in the riser of all 2004 or newer Excalibur Crossbows and will work either in conjunction with Excalibur's dissipator bar system or on its own to quiet shot noise and reduce vibration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pHEpbFBIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PYS5CC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Excalibur", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 40.52}}
{"item_id": "B004PZ58C6", "title": "Crimson Trace Glock 17, 19, 22, 20SF and 21 SF", "description": "If you ever need to defend yourself with your firearm, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have Crimson Trace dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "text": "Crimson Trace Glock 17, 19, 22, 20SF and 21 SF If you ever need to defend yourself with your firearm, chances are it won’t be from a perfect shooting position. And it will all happen lightning fast. But on your side, you’ll have Crimson Trace dependable speed and accuracy. Whether it’s the amazingly quick targeting, or just the overall instinctive simplicity of use Crimson Trace helps you survive.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Fn6QfkVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004PZ58C6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crimson Trace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing"]], "price": 139.95}}
