{"item_id": "B004Q17CQY", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits Sol Slim Rescue Howler Whistle, 2 Count", "description": "The SOL slim rescue howler whistle weighs a fraction of an ounce yet packs a big punch. Whistle emits 100 decibels and can be heard from over a mile away Pea-less design works in all conditions and will never jam or freeze. Package of 2 SOL slim rescue howler whistles.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits Sol Slim Rescue Howler Whistle, 2 Count The SOL slim rescue howler whistle weighs a fraction of an ounce yet packs a big punch. Whistle emits 100 decibels and can be heard from over a mile away Pea-less design works in all conditions and will never jam or freeze. Package of 2 SOL slim rescue howler whistles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51btkDLu6rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q17CQY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.24}}
{"item_id": "B004Q2TBAI", "title": "STRIDER ST-3 No-Pedal Balance Bike", "description": "", "text": "STRIDER ST-3 No-Pedal Balance Bike", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418l0eBVMxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q2TBAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Strider Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Bikes"]], "price": 99.0}}
{"item_id": "B004Q2X082", "title": "Strider ST-3 KTM Balance Bike", "description": "If your toddler can walk, your toddler can ride a Strider PREbike™. The Strider PREbike™ teaches your child balance and coordination, developing glittering confidence. Trikes and bikes with training wheels simply can’t do this. Traditional bicycles place too much focus on learning to pedal - skimping on developing your child’s motor skills. And these bikes are heavy, clunky and difficult for toddlers to control. The Strider PREbikeTM is the natural progression from a ride-on or push toy. Yes, bike riding becomes a easy and fun when you teach your child balance and coordination before pedaling. With NO pedals and NO training wheels, your toddler powers the Strider PREbikeTM using their feet safely on the ground; allowing them to learn to balance a bike at their own pace. So ditch the tricycle and training wheels, and teach your child to ride a bike sooner and safer with a Strider PREbike™.", "text": "Strider ST-3 KTM Balance Bike If your toddler can walk, your toddler can ride a Strider PREbike™. The Strider PREbike™ teaches your child balance and coordination, developing glittering confidence. Trikes and bikes with training wheels simply can’t do this. Traditional bicycles place too much focus on learning to pedal - skimping on developing your child’s motor skills. And these bikes are heavy, clunky and difficult for toddlers to control. The Strider PREbikeTM is the natural progression from a ride-on or push toy. Yes, bike riding becomes a easy and fun when you teach your child balance and coordination before pedaling. With NO pedals and NO training wheels, your toddler powers the Strider PREbikeTM using their feet safely on the ground; allowing them to learn to balance a bike at their own pace. So ditch the tricycle and training wheels, and teach your child to ride a bike sooner and safer with a Strider PREbike™.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BICHWB3IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q2X082.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004Q3164G", "title": "Nylon Gun Holster Fits The S&W Bodyguard 380 with Laser", "description": "\"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break.Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. This Pro-Tech's holster fits the S&W; Bodyguard 380 pistol", "text": "Nylon Gun Holster Fits The S&W Bodyguard 380 with Laser \"The Intimidator\" - Belt and Clip on Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! The Intimidator holster by Pro-Tech is Ambidextrous has a webbing loop behind the metal clip for your belt. Has plastic adjustable spring action thumb break.Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining. Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. all velcro is hidden by webbing to prevent foreign debris. This Pro-Tech's holster fits the S&W; Bodyguard 380 pistol", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F1ryatrrL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q3164G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B004Q35GQU", "title": "Ankle concealed Holster Fits The S&W Bodyguard 380 with Laser", "description": "Pro-Tech's Ankle Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Has Elastic and Velcro closure. Adjustable nylon velcro strap to secure your weapon. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining.Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! FITS: The S&W; Bodyguard 380 with Laser \"Our Customers say this is the best ankle holster on the market!\" WHAT A FIELDTESTER HAD TO SAY This Pro-Tech ankle holster is one of the best all around ankle holster we've ever tested. The WANK holster exhibit quality throughout. I think, it also stacks up against the biggest competitors on the market.", "text": "Ankle concealed Holster Fits The S&W Bodyguard 380 with Laser Pro-Tech's Ankle Holster has a 30 day money back guarantee. Don't you buy no ugly holster! Has Elastic and Velcro closure. Adjustable nylon velcro strap to secure your weapon. Outer layer is cordura ballistic nylon,inside has a vinyl vapor barrier to keep moisture off your gun, foam padding and nylon lining.Stitched with strong bonded nylon and double stitched at pressure points. Edges turned under to prevent fraying. Make sure if your buying you buy from a Authorized Pro-Tech dealer. AS WITH MANY OTHER NAME BRAND PRODUCTS, THERE ARE LOOK-A-LIKE HOLSTERS. All Pro-Tech holsters have the Pro-Tech tag on the Holsters and come packaged in the Pro-Tech bag. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE, USA HOLSTER IS A AUTHORIZED PRO-TECH DEALER. 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!!!!!! FITS: The S&W; Bodyguard 380 with Laser \"Our Customers say this is the best ankle holster on the market!\" WHAT A FIELDTESTER HAD TO SAY This Pro-Tech ankle holster is one of the best all around ankle holster we've ever tested. The WANK holster exhibit quality throughout. I think, it also stacks up against the biggest competitors on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EvYnVCZLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q35GQU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B004Q3N08Q", "title": "Giordano Libero 1.6 White/Red Men's Road Bike-700c", "description": "[if gte mso 9]> 800x600 Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 st1\\:*{behavior:url(#ieooui) } /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} <![endif]The Giordano Libero 1.6 features a beautifully made hand crafted lightweight 6061 aluminum frame, precision 16 speed Shimano STI equipped drive train, and light but strong 700cc wheels all at an absolutely incredible value. This stunning Italian inspired road bike packs a powerful punch without breaking the bank and is certain to remain a favorite weapon for novice cyclists looking to speed past the competition. Available in Men’s Small, Medium and Large.Small- 50cm/20” fits riders 5'1\"-5'8\" with a stand over of 28\"-30\".Medium 56cm/22” fits riders 5'8\"-6'0\" with a stand over of 30\"-32\".Large 61cm/25infits riders 6'2\"-6'5\" with a stand over of 33\"-35\".MainFeatures: Lightweight hand crafted 6061 aluminum frame1 1/8” Threadless stem16-speed Shimano STI drive train Dual water bottle mounts Complete Specifications: Frame- 6061 Aluminum with replaceable derailleur hangerFork- High Tensile SteelHeadset- Steel Threadless 1 1/8”Handlebar- Alloy 42cm c/cStem- Uno Alloy Threadless 1 1/8” 100mm x -10 degShifters- Shimano ST2300 STI 16 Speed with integrated brake leversRear Derailleur- Shimano RD2300Front Derailleur- Shimano FDAO50Brakes- Alloy Side Pull Front and RearCrank- Prowheel Alloy Arms 170mm 42/52Bottom Bracket- VP Cartridge Square TaperCassette- Shimano CS HG30 8 Speed 11-30Rims- Vitesse Alloy 700c 32 hole High V-Profile SilverHubs- Alloy 32 hole front and rear with quick releaseTires- 700x25 Black Road ClincherSaddle- Velo Road Steel RailsSeat Post- 27.2 x 300mm Alloy BlackPedals- VP Plastic Body with Alloy CagesSeatpost Clam- Alloy BlackWeight- 24lbs Professional Assembly is recommended for your safety and riding enjoyment.Specifications are subject to change without prior notice.", "text": "Giordano Libero 1.6 White/Red Men's Road Bike-700c [if gte mso 9]> 800x600 Normal 0 false false false EN-US X-NONE X-NONE MicrosoftInternetExplorer4 st1\\:*{behavior:url(#ieooui) } /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-para-margin:0in; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\"; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} <![endif]The Giordano Libero 1.6 features a beautifully made hand crafted lightweight 6061 aluminum frame, precision 16 speed Shimano STI equipped drive train, and light but strong 700cc wheels all at an absolutely incredible value. This stunning Italian inspired road bike packs a powerful punch without breaking the bank and is certain to remain a favorite weapon for novice cyclists looking to speed past the competition. Available in Men’s Small, Medium and Large.Small- 50cm/20” fits riders 5'1\"-5'8\" with a stand over of 28\"-30\".Medium 56cm/22” fits riders 5'8\"-6'0\" with a stand over of 30\"-32\".Large 61cm/25infits riders 6'2\"-6'5\" with a stand over of 33\"-35\".MainFeatures: Lightweight hand crafted 6061 aluminum frame1 1/8” Threadless stem16-speed Shimano STI drive train Dual water bottle mounts Complete Specifications: Frame- 6061 Aluminum with replaceable derailleur hangerFork- High Tensile SteelHeadset- Steel Threadless 1 1/8”Handlebar- Alloy 42cm c/cStem- Uno Alloy Threadless 1 1/8” 100mm x -10 degShifters- Shimano ST2300 STI 16 Speed with integrated brake leversRear Derailleur- Shimano RD2300Front Derailleur- Shimano FDAO50Brakes- Alloy Side Pull Front and RearCrank- Prowheel Alloy Arms 170mm 42/52Bottom Bracket- VP Cartridge Square TaperCassette- Shimano CS HG30 8 Speed 11-30Rims- Vitesse Alloy 700c 32 hole High V-Profile SilverHubs- Alloy 32 hole front and rear with quick releaseTires- 700x25 Black Road ClincherSaddle- Velo Road Steel RailsSeat Post- 27.2 x 300mm Alloy BlackPedals- VP Plastic Body with Alloy CagesSeatpost Clam- Alloy BlackWeight- 24lbs Professional Assembly is recommended for your safety and riding enjoyment.Specifications are subject to change without prior notice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KkUyG2bSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q3N08Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Road Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004Q4HVVM", "title": "Primos Shawty - Hands Free Buck and Doe Call with 5-in-1 Grunt and Bleat Call", "description": "The Lil' Shawty Hands Free Buck & Doe is an adjustable reed call. Time and time again you will need a call that will allow you to call while keeping your hands on your gun or bow. The Lil' Shawty Hands-Free Buck & Doe is the perfect choice for those close encounters.", "text": "Primos Shawty - Hands Free Buck and Doe Call with 5-in-1 Grunt and Bleat Call The Lil' Shawty Hands Free Buck & Doe is an adjustable reed call. Time and time again you will need a call that will allow you to call while keeping your hands on your gun or bow. The Lil' Shawty Hands-Free Buck & Doe is the perfect choice for those close encounters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S9XD7eoQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q4HVVM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Deer"]], "price": 11.44}}
{"item_id": "B004Q58MNC", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Cocoon Pouch", "description": "Product Details Product Features Overall: 2 in diameter x 8 in long Attach: 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately), SlikClip (included) Reminiscent of a butterfly chrysalis, the MAXPEDITION Cocoon Pouch (#3301) was designed as a durable low-profile carry case for objects too long to fit in other MAXPEDITION waist packs or pockets. With an overall capacity of 8 inches and a full length opening zipper with paracord pull, the Cocoon Pouch will accommodate all your favorite oversized items: big fat permanent black markers and other writing utensils, titanium spork/chopsticks, even a toiletry kit with your toothbrush and shave kit. This elongated pocket also makes for a great flashlight or folding knife storage pouch. Loops throughout for tie-downs, key rings, SlikClips, or detachable 1-Inch quick release buckles. Also ALICE/MOLLE compatible using 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately). Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Cocoon Pouch Product Details Product Features Overall: 2 in diameter x 8 in long Attach: 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately), SlikClip (included) Reminiscent of a butterfly chrysalis, the MAXPEDITION Cocoon Pouch (#3301) was designed as a durable low-profile carry case for objects too long to fit in other MAXPEDITION waist packs or pockets. With an overall capacity of 8 inches and a full length opening zipper with paracord pull, the Cocoon Pouch will accommodate all your favorite oversized items: big fat permanent black markers and other writing utensils, titanium spork/chopsticks, even a toiletry kit with your toothbrush and shave kit. This elongated pocket also makes for a great flashlight or folding knife storage pouch. Loops throughout for tie-downs, key rings, SlikClips, or detachable 1-Inch quick release buckles. Also ALICE/MOLLE compatible using 3-Inch TacTie (sold separately). Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414bEfxFWzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q58MNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Cases"]], "price": 13.76}}
{"item_id": "B004Q5C4XQ", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Individual First Aid Pouch", "description": "Product Details Product Features Lightweight individual soldier combat first aid kit pouch 420-Denier nylon for weight reduction and increased mobility Also excellent for organizing computer cables or toiletries Overall size: 8 wide x 5 high x 2.5 thick Clamshell opening main compartment Internal mesh and see-thru plastic organizers External zippered mesh pocket Integral carry handle MOLLE compatible Attachment method: 3 TacTie Attachment Straps (sold separately) First aid supplies not included Product Materials 420-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Individual First Aid Pouch Product Details Product Features Lightweight individual soldier combat first aid kit pouch 420-Denier nylon for weight reduction and increased mobility Also excellent for organizing computer cables or toiletries Overall size: 8 wide x 5 high x 2.5 thick Clamshell opening main compartment Internal mesh and see-thru plastic organizers External zippered mesh pocket Integral carry handle MOLLE compatible Attachment method: 3 TacTie Attachment Straps (sold separately) First aid supplies not included Product Materials 420-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength Cleaning Instructions MAXPEDITION's nylon fabric is treated with Dupont Teflon for superb water and grime resistance. To clean, simply wipe down with a damp cloth. Allow gear to dry naturally. Do not machine wash. Do not use detergent or bleach.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fetHmrTUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q5C4XQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 26.09}}
{"item_id": "B004Q5UASW", "title": "Fully Stocked Stomp Medical First Aid Kit Back Pack", "description": "Fully Stocked Stomp Medical First Aid Kit Back Pack. This is the model FA140. (AVAILABLE IN BLACK, RED & TAN, please specify with payment). The Stomp Medical Kit has a variety of contents and is used by professionals including medics and army personnel. The backpack is available in three colors, black, coyote tan, and red. The bag contains many velcro and zippered compartments for easy access to over three hundred items inside.", "text": "Fully Stocked Stomp Medical First Aid Kit Back Pack Fully Stocked Stomp Medical First Aid Kit Back Pack. This is the model FA140. (AVAILABLE IN BLACK, RED & TAN, please specify with payment). The Stomp Medical Kit has a variety of contents and is used by professionals including medics and army personnel. The backpack is available in three colors, black, coyote tan, and red. The bag contains many velcro and zippered compartments for easy access to over three hundred items inside.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bYYIED6bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q5UASW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite First Aid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 338.39}}
