{"item_id": "B004Q7RWY0", "title": "Svord Black Suede Sheath for Peasant Knife", "description": "Svord Peasant Knives - Peasant Sheath with Brown Suede Construction. Model: SV134. Measures approximately 6 long x 2 1/8\" wide at mouth of sheath. Designed to fit the Svord Peasant knives. Brown suede construction with belt loop", "text": "Svord Black Suede Sheath for Peasant Knife Svord Peasant Knives - Peasant Sheath with Brown Suede Construction. Model: SV134. Measures approximately 6 long x 2 1/8\" wide at mouth of sheath. Designed to fit the Svord Peasant knives. Brown suede construction with belt loop", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s-B2MCCgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q7RWY0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Svord", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.24}}
{"item_id": "B004Q7T0FE", "title": "Sawmill Cutlery 9 Ark-N-Saw Bowie Fixed Blade Knife", "description": "Sawmill Cutlery Ark-N-Saw Bowie. 14 1/2\" overall. 9 1/2\" stainless blade. Full tang. Brass guard. Brown leather belt sheath.", "text": "Sawmill Cutlery 9 Ark-N-Saw Bowie Fixed Blade Knife Sawmill Cutlery Ark-N-Saw Bowie. 14 1/2\" overall. 9 1/2\" stainless blade. Full tang. Brass guard. Brown leather belt sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312eqjqmXlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q7T0FE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawmill", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 19.65}}
{"item_id": "B004Q8HVNQ", "title": "AK Cleaning Rod", "description": "Ak cleaning rod, ready to go!", "text": "AK Cleaning Rod Ak cleaning rod, ready to go!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21H8v9uDWzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q8HVNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 2.38}}
{"item_id": "B004Q8OCWY", "title": "Rapiddominance Camo Cuff Beanie", "description": "Classic Style Camouflage beanie with a Jacquard camouflage knit design. These long beanies have a rolled over cuff to help you stay warm, comfortable and are one-sized.", "text": "Rapiddominance Camo Cuff Beanie Classic Style Camouflage beanie with a Jacquard camouflage knit design. These long beanies have a rolled over cuff to help you stay warm, comfortable and are one-sized.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61nDa4Yw7pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Q8OCWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rapid Dominance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing Accessories", "Caps & Hats", "Skullies & Beanies"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B004QB3736", "title": "Under Armourbite Performance Mouthwear Lower Mouthguard", "description": "ArmourBite unlocks the power of the jaw so you can unleash your full potential as an athlete.", "text": "Under Armourbite Performance Mouthwear Lower Mouthguard ArmourBite unlocks the power of the jaw so you can unleash your full potential as an athlete.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZxYkdq45L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QB3736.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Football", "Protective Gear", "Mouthguards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004QBFLTY", "title": "Walther PPQ Pistol (Black, Medium)", "description": "Another version of the famous Walther P99 firearm, the PPQ (P99 Q) CO2 pistol is extremely realistic and a fun all-day shooter. Uses 12-Grams CO2 cartridge Semi-auto 8-shot rotary pellet mag 8-shot rotary BB mag Semi-auto Open sights. Accessory rail for laser or flashlight Textured grip with finger grooves Manual safety. The owner's manual incorrectly states how the BBs should be loaded. The correct way to load the magazines is from the side that does not have the ratchets.", "text": "Walther PPQ Pistol (Black, Medium) Another version of the famous Walther P99 firearm, the PPQ (P99 Q) CO2 pistol is extremely realistic and a fun all-day shooter. Uses 12-Grams CO2 cartridge Semi-auto 8-shot rotary pellet mag 8-shot rotary BB mag Semi-auto Open sights. Accessory rail for laser or flashlight Textured grip with finger grooves Manual safety. The owner's manual incorrectly states how the BBs should be loaded. The correct way to load the magazines is from the side that does not have the ratchets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e5eGleuZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QBFLTY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walther", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 64.99}}
{"item_id": "B004QC9IEM", "title": "Gymboss WRISTBAND", "description": "Brand new item from Gymboss Interval Timers! This is a durable elastic armband with a velcro closure to secure your Gymboss Interval Timer to your Bicep. Straps come individually wrapped in the little plastic packaging as shown in the picture. PLEASE NOTE: There is also a Gymboss ARMBAND sold seperately. The Armband and Wristband look identical, but are two different sizes. Also note that there are two official Gymboss retailers on Amazon, Gymboss and Slim Fitness. If ordering an armband or wristband, be sure to order from the same retailer from where you are ordering your timer or your items will not ship together.", "text": "Gymboss WRISTBAND Brand new item from Gymboss Interval Timers! This is a durable elastic armband with a velcro closure to secure your Gymboss Interval Timer to your Bicep. Straps come individually wrapped in the little plastic packaging as shown in the picture. PLEASE NOTE: There is also a Gymboss ARMBAND sold seperately. The Armband and Wristband look identical, but are two different sizes. Also note that there are two official Gymboss retailers on Amazon, Gymboss and Slim Fitness. If ordering an armband or wristband, be sure to order from the same retailer from where you are ordering your timer or your items will not ship together.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oVpVDsQFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QC9IEM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gymboss", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B004QCNUDW", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Eclipse Camp Table with Built-In Beverage Holders", "description": "If you are looking for a table that's quick and easy to set up, has room for your drinks and still room for games, and is lightweight, the Eclipse Table is the one for you. You simply buckle the straps at each corner and adjust them to allow the tautness that you prefer. Since there are two layers, you can use the lower level for drinks since it has 4 built in beverage holders and you won't have to worry about your drinks getting knocked over while you're eating or playing games. The top level is flat for your other activities and there’s no more worrying about your drinks spilling on your cards or being in the way of a fast paced game. When it's time to head home, unlatch the buckles and slide the table into the included carry bag and you're set for your next outing.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Eclipse Camp Table with Built-In Beverage Holders If you are looking for a table that's quick and easy to set up, has room for your drinks and still room for games, and is lightweight, the Eclipse Table is the one for you. You simply buckle the straps at each corner and adjust them to allow the tautness that you prefer. Since there are two layers, you can use the lower level for drinks since it has 4 built in beverage holders and you won't have to worry about your drinks getting knocked over while you're eating or playing games. The top level is flat for your other activities and there’s no more worrying about your drinks spilling on your cards or being in the way of a fast paced game. When it's time to head home, unlatch the buckles and slide the table into the included carry bag and you're set for your next outing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rdQh-usAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QCNUDW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B004QEYRJQ", "title": "Millett 4-16x 50mm TRS- 1 30mm Tactical Rifle Scope (A-TAC Camo)", "description": "Millett 4-16x 50mm Mil Dot Bar, 30mm Tube, .25 MOA Precision Tactical Rifle Scope (A-TAC Camo). The TRS precision tactical riflescope with illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle. Bright multi-coated optics and our illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle system clear the way through low light and over great distances to deliver your bullet with pinpoint accuracy. Add this scope’s virtually bulletproof design and precision controls, and you’re the master of any mission.", "text": "Millett 4-16x 50mm TRS- 1 30mm Tactical Rifle Scope (A-TAC Camo) Millett 4-16x 50mm Mil Dot Bar, 30mm Tube, .25 MOA Precision Tactical Rifle Scope (A-TAC Camo). The TRS precision tactical riflescope with illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle. Bright multi-coated optics and our illuminated Mil-DotBar reticle system clear the way through low light and over great distances to deliver your bullet with pinpoint accuracy. Add this scope’s virtually bulletproof design and precision controls, and you’re the master of any mission.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GQg61kftL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QEYRJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Millett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 284.99}}
