listed Currie Smart Charger with LED status displayTop Speed: 15 miles per hour/24 kilometers per hour (rider weight, rider input, and terrain contingent)Range: up to 15 to 22 miles/24 to 35 kilometers with normal pedaling (rider weight, rider input, and terrain contingent). Easily add an optional second battery pack to double the range.User Controls: power on/off switch, easy access charger port in removable battery pack, twist throttle with PAS+TAG function and battery gaugePAS/TAG (Twist and Go or Pedal Assist) System:User selects between two modes: PAS--pedal assist or TAG throttle activatedPAS: 50 percent of available power assist, conserving battery power and rider energy.Pedaling while Activating Throttle: user can go from 50 percent pedal assist to full power assist, with out pedaling, or anywhere in between.Bicycle Components and Specifications:Drivetrain: Shimano rear derailleur, SRAM grip shifter, Shimano 7-speed freewheelBrakes: alloy linear pull with alloy brake inhibit leverWheels: alloy 26-inch rimsTires: Currie Comfort Tires 26 by 2.0 inchesHandlebar/Stem: mid-rise bar and stemForks: suspensionSaddle: comfort design, Q/R alloy postFrame: exclusive Currie Hi-Ten Steel, bottle bosses, fender, and rack mountsCranks: alloy 44T crankset, double chainguardPedals: resin dual sided pedalsWeight: 68 pounds/31 kilogramsRider Age and Weight Limit: young adult to adult/do not exceed 240 pounds/109 kilograms", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fxQ1cMJ6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QHG17O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Electric Bicycles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004QHJWNO", "title": "High Sierra Sport Company 65 External Series Bobcat (Black)", "description": "High Sierra brings back the external frame pack with Bobcat 65. This 65 liter top load pack is lightweight but heavy on features. Weighing in at only 5.5 pounds this pack includes a mesh back panel, contoured backpack straps. front load sleeping bag compartment, bottom compression straps, sternum strap, hydration reservoir and convenient pockets.", "text": "High Sierra Sport Company 65 External Series Bobcat (Black) High Sierra brings back the external frame pack with Bobcat 65. This 65 liter top load pack is lightweight but heavy on features. Weighing in at only 5.5 pounds this pack includes a mesh back panel, contoured backpack straps. front load sleeping bag compartment, bottom compression straps, sternum strap, hydration reservoir and convenient pockets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41htXvm6ysL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QHJWNO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004QJ2IBU", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Crescent Lake Wide Mummy Sleeping Bag (36 x 84-Inch)", "description": "The Crescent Lake series sleeping bags are made with Techloft+ insulation. Techloft+ Insulation consists of multi-hole staple-length micro-denier fibers that have a siliconized finish for maximum insulation, loft, and compactness. The Crescent Lake uses a 2-layer offset construction, sometimes called a \"bag within a bag.\" The contoured hood and mummy shape helps seal up your warmth and keep you warmer. The Crescent Lake is a great backpacking sleeping bag to take along on your hikes that wonít take up all the space in your pack.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Crescent Lake Wide Mummy Sleeping Bag (36 x 84-Inch) The Crescent Lake series sleeping bags are made with Techloft+ insulation. Techloft+ Insulation consists of multi-hole staple-length micro-denier fibers that have a siliconized finish for maximum insulation, loft, and compactness. The Crescent Lake uses a 2-layer offset construction, sometimes called a \"bag within a bag.\" The contoured hood and mummy shape helps seal up your warmth and keep you warmer. The Crescent Lake is a great backpacking sleeping bag to take along on your hikes that wonít take up all the space in your pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31J1M7GDfbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QJ2IBU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004QJ2ZOK", "title": "1 1/4 lb. Grey Machined Olympic Plates (Pair)", "description": "Brand new but blemished. These 1 1/4's are just out of a case box from Ivanko's warehouse that I visit once a week. However, some minor casting imperfections may occur. Note: Machining means that the plates are flat. It does NOT mean that the plates are 100% accurate although the chances are likely that they will weigh 1 1/4 bs. each. Even Ivanko will not guarantee that the 1 1/4's are 100 % accurate in weight.", "text": "1 1/4 lb. Grey Machined Olympic Plates (Pair) Brand new but blemished. These 1 1/4's are just out of a case box from Ivanko's warehouse that I visit once a week. However, some minor casting imperfections may occur. Note: Machining means that the plates are flat. It does NOT mean that the plates are 100% accurate although the chances are likely that they will weigh 1 1/4 bs. each. Even Ivanko will not guarantee that the 1 1/4's are 100 % accurate in weight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JfGnTWn-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QJ2ZOK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Plates"]]}}
