{"item_id": "B004QOVA00", "title": "MagicShine Helmet Mount Kit", "description": "Compatible lights: MJ-808 MJ-808E MJ-816 MJ-838 MJ-838B MJ-856 MJ-858 MJ-868 MJ-870 MJ-872 MJ-880 A simple velcro strap mounts to any helmet quickly and easily.", "text": "MagicShine Helmet Mount Kit Compatible lights: MJ-808 MJ-808E MJ-816 MJ-838 MJ-838B MJ-856 MJ-858 MJ-868 MJ-870 MJ-872 MJ-880 A simple velcro strap mounts to any helmet quickly and easily.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TGu0MjBIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QOVA00.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagicShine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 11.98}}
