{"item_id": "B004QPE77M", "title": "SimplySleeper SS-FL89Q Flocked Top & Side Raised Queen Air Bed (Elevated 18\") w/ Built-in Fully Automatic Electric Pump and Sure Grip Bottom", "description": "NOTE: We ship next business day via UPS. Normally ships in 2-5 days. Raised height adds comfort and cushion like your regular bed at home. This air bed comes standard with a built-in extra powerful air pump that provides for quick and easy inflation/deflation. HIGHLIGHTS Features Secure Air System TM, this new structural design is engineered to prevent overnight PVC stretches and air leaks. Raised height adds cushion and comfort just like your regular bed, Flocked-top surface keeps sheets/bedding in place, Convenient carry bag included, Sure Grip Bottom prevents bed from sliding or flipping over when sitting on the edge of the bed, The SimplySleeper Queen Raised air bed is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or place into a comfortable bedroom in only a minute. The Trouble-Free Sleep Solution for All Occasions: HOLIDAY GUESTS. COLLEGE DORMS. KIDS. TRAVEL. 100% Leak Tested In addition to all of our quality inspections, we inflate every one of our airbeds for 24 hours prior to shipping to ensure the best quality air retention. Oval Coil Construction, Max weight support 650 pound, (Elevated 18-Inch).", "text": "SimplySleeper SS-FL89Q Flocked Top & Side Raised Queen Air Bed (Elevated 18\") w/ Built-in Fully Automatic Electric Pump and Sure Grip Bottom NOTE: We ship next business day via UPS. Normally ships in 2-5 days. Raised height adds comfort and cushion like your regular bed at home. This air bed comes standard with a built-in extra powerful air pump that provides for quick and easy inflation/deflation. HIGHLIGHTS Features Secure Air System TM, this new structural design is engineered to prevent overnight PVC stretches and air leaks. Raised height adds cushion and comfort just like your regular bed, Flocked-top surface keeps sheets/bedding in place, Convenient carry bag included, Sure Grip Bottom prevents bed from sliding or flipping over when sitting on the edge of the bed, The SimplySleeper Queen Raised air bed is a perfect sleeping solution for even the weariest traveler. Combining top-of-the-line quality and weightless comfort into one convenient package can turn any room or place into a comfortable bedroom in only a minute. The Trouble-Free Sleep Solution for All Occasions: HOLIDAY GUESTS. COLLEGE DORMS. KIDS. TRAVEL. 100% Leak Tested In addition to all of our quality inspections, we inflate every one of our airbeds for 24 hours prior to shipping to ensure the best quality air retention. Oval Coil Construction, Max weight support 650 pound, (Elevated 18-Inch).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31S4V60tmqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QPE77M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SimplySleeper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]], "price": 114.95}}
{"item_id": "B004QQRARU", "title": "Burris 410348 AR-F3 Fastfire Flattop Mount (Black)", "description": "The Burris AR-F3 Mount is the simplest and most effective way to mount the FastFire II on an AR flattop stand alone or as a co-witness to your iron sights. The FastFire sits inside the mount for extra protection. Item does not include optics. Burris item# 410348 is for the mount only.", "text": "Burris 410348 AR-F3 Fastfire Flattop Mount (Black) The Burris AR-F3 Mount is the simplest and most effective way to mount the FastFire II on an AR flattop stand alone or as a co-witness to your iron sights. The FastFire sits inside the mount for extra protection. Item does not include optics. Burris item# 410348 is for the mount only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414msBlQDJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QQRARU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Trophy Mounts"]], "price": 78.61}}
{"item_id": "B004QQSU3S", "title": "Bushnell Clip and Go Universal Golf Cart Mount for Laser Rangefinders", "description": "The Clip and Go Universal Mount from Bushnell secures your Bushnell laser rangefinder to virtually any golf cart or bag. The mount secures all Bushnell laser rangefinders with a positive locking inset and clamps to any size golf cart pillar--or to a bag--so that your rangefinder is always at the ready.", "text": "Bushnell Clip and Go Universal Golf Cart Mount for Laser Rangefinders The Clip and Go Universal Mount from Bushnell secures your Bushnell laser rangefinder to virtually any golf cart or bag. The mount secures all Bushnell laser rangefinders with a positive locking inset and clamps to any size golf cart pillar--or to a bag--so that your rangefinder is always at the ready.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fSX%2BYbgKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004QQSU3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bushnell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Cart Accessories"]], "price": 17.99}}
