{"item_id": "B004R120N8", "title": "Soft Air COLT M4 CQB Full Metal AEG (Black)", "description": "The Colt M4 CQB AEG is fully trademarked and licensed by Colt. Ready to deliver an impressive performance in the field, the gun boasts full metal construction including the CNC-machined front hand guard, steel gears, and reinforced metal gearbox. The powerful gun operates using a rechargeable battery and comes with battery and charger included.Specifications:Officially Licensed and trademarked COLT M4 CQB AEGOne-piece metal outer barrel, upper receiver, and lower receiverSteel gearsMetal gearboxCNC machined R.I.S. Hand guardMetal 350-round magazineRemovable metal rear sightAdjustable 6-position crane stockBattery powered1100mAh 8.4 volt rechargeable battery includedCharger included", "text": "Soft Air COLT M4 CQB Full Metal AEG (Black) The Colt M4 CQB AEG is fully trademarked and licensed by Colt. Ready to deliver an impressive performance in the field, the gun boasts full metal construction including the CNC-machined front hand guard, steel gears, and reinforced metal gearbox. The powerful gun operates using a rechargeable battery and comes with battery and charger included.Specifications:Officially Licensed and trademarked COLT M4 CQB AEGOne-piece metal outer barrel, upper receiver, and lower receiverSteel gearsMetal gearboxCNC machined R.I.S. Hand guardMetal 350-round magazineRemovable metal rear sightAdjustable 6-position crane stockBattery powered1100mAh 8.4 volt rechargeable battery includedCharger included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NZg1eba6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004R120N8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Colt", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 180.0}}
