{"item_id": "B004R1GXPO", "title": "Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit", "description": "The ultimate first aid kit for large groups or long treks, the Coleman Expedition contains 200 pieces housed in a durable, semi-hard case that fits easily in any pack. Need some small bandages for minor scratches? The Expedition comes with ten 1-by-3-inch plastic bandages, thirty 3/4-by-3-inch plastic bandages, sixty 3/8-by 1-1/2-inch plastic bandages, thirty butterfly bandages, and five knuckle bandages. Concerned about larger scuffs? The kit also includes ten 2-by-2 gauze pads and 5 yards of bandage tape.To help fix your wounds, the kit comes with two finger splints, a pair of metal scissors, plastic tweezers, four safety pins, and two pairs of vinyl latex-free gloves. And cleanliness is always a concern, which is why the Expedition offers five packets of antibiotic ointment, six sting-relief wipes, and fifteen antiseptic towelettes. Other items include one 5-by-6-inch instant cold pack, six tablets of diphen/antihistamine, eight tablets of ibuprofen, and a snaplight light stick for emergency signaling or night vision.To top it off, the Expedition includes an EZ Find system to keep the items organized. Designed to stand up to the elements, the 200-piece first aid kit is a must for your next overnight climb.", "text": "Coleman Expedition First Aid Kit The ultimate first aid kit for large groups or long treks, the Coleman Expedition contains 200 pieces housed in a durable, semi-hard case that fits easily in any pack. Need some small bandages for minor scratches? The Expedition comes with ten 1-by-3-inch plastic bandages, thirty 3/4-by-3-inch plastic bandages, sixty 3/8-by 1-1/2-inch plastic bandages, thirty butterfly bandages, and five knuckle bandages. Concerned about larger scuffs? The kit also includes ten 2-by-2 gauze pads and 5 yards of bandage tape.To help fix your wounds, the kit comes with two finger splints, a pair of metal scissors, plastic tweezers, four safety pins, and two pairs of vinyl latex-free gloves. And cleanliness is always a concern, which is why the Expedition offers five packets of antibiotic ointment, six sting-relief wipes, and fifteen antiseptic towelettes. Other items include one 5-by-6-inch instant cold pack, six tablets of diphen/antihistamine, eight tablets of ibuprofen, and a snaplight light stick for emergency signaling or night vision.To top it off, the Expedition includes an EZ Find system to keep the items organized. Designed to stand up to the elements, the 200-piece first aid kit is a must for your next overnight climb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W5Eks1bIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004R1GXPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 29.74}}
