{"item_id": "B004R7G33K", "title": "Tactical Entry Operation SWAT Police Military Law Enforcement Assault Vest - Right Handed Black Color", "description": "New Generation premium tactical entry operations vest. Superior tactical grade quality perfect for hunters, military, law enforcement, and camping. Rugged nylon black colored exterior with a quilted and padded interior for comfort and flexibility. Includes: Rear walkie talkie/first aid pouch, 4 shotgun shotshell holders, 5 rifle ammo shotshell holders, Dual vertical pistol magazine pouches, flashlight/baton pouch, radio pouch, heavy duty D-Ring, And thumb break pistol holster made to fit medium to large auto's. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult.", "text": "Tactical Entry Operation SWAT Police Military Law Enforcement Assault Vest - Right Handed Black Color New Generation premium tactical entry operations vest. Superior tactical grade quality perfect for hunters, military, law enforcement, and camping. Rugged nylon black colored exterior with a quilted and padded interior for comfort and flexibility. Includes: Rear walkie talkie/first aid pouch, 4 shotgun shotshell holders, 5 rifle ammo shotshell holders, Dual vertical pistol magazine pouches, flashlight/baton pouch, radio pouch, heavy duty D-Ring, And thumb break pistol holster made to fit medium to large auto's. One size fits most, fully adjustable in height and girth to fit from a small to X-Large adult.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512Kw2UNaeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004R7G33K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004R7L7YU", "title": "ALPS OutdoorZ Commander Freighter Frame Plus Pack Bag, 5250 Cubic Inches", "description": "When you get ALPS OutdoorZ Commander Pack Bag, you’re getting the Commander Freighter Frame PLUS a 5250 cubic inch Pack Bag. The Pack Bag is great for getting all your gear to your base camp. The Pack Bag includes a front pocket, spotting scope pocket, rifle holder, and two side accessory hinged pockets, in addition to the main compartment. Once you empty out your Pack Bag, it can be easily detached so the Commander can be used as a Freighter Frame also. The Commander Freighter Frame allows you to haul your meat from one place to the next. The Commander comes equipped with a unique lashing system to secure your meat. With as much weight as you’ll be carrying, padded waist belt and shoulder straps are a must. There are pockets for your flash light and knife, as well as a holder for your shooting stix on the lashing straps. With the Commander Pack Bag, you really get two products in one, a Pack Bag AND a Freighter Frame!", "text": "ALPS OutdoorZ Commander Freighter Frame Plus Pack Bag, 5250 Cubic Inches When you get ALPS OutdoorZ Commander Pack Bag, you’re getting the Commander Freighter Frame PLUS a 5250 cubic inch Pack Bag. The Pack Bag is great for getting all your gear to your base camp. The Pack Bag includes a front pocket, spotting scope pocket, rifle holder, and two side accessory hinged pockets, in addition to the main compartment. Once you empty out your Pack Bag, it can be easily detached so the Commander can be used as a Freighter Frame also. The Commander Freighter Frame allows you to haul your meat from one place to the next. The Commander comes equipped with a unique lashing system to secure your meat. With as much weight as you’ll be carrying, padded waist belt and shoulder straps are a must. There are pockets for your flash light and knife, as well as a holder for your shooting stix on the lashing straps. With the Commander Pack Bag, you really get two products in one, a Pack Bag AND a Freighter Frame!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E67xUOBgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004R7L7YU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "External Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 111.0}}
{"item_id": "B004R8M888", "title": "Burris 200433-FF Fullfield TAC30 1-4 x 24 with Fastfire II Scope (Black)", "description": "The Burris Fullfield TAC30 scopes are incredibly bright and rugged enough to handle the rigors of tactical work and mid-range precision. Precision, accuracy, and reliability at a value any operator or LE department can afford.", "text": "Burris 200433-FF Fullfield TAC30 1-4 x 24 with Fastfire II Scope (Black) The Burris Fullfield TAC30 scopes are incredibly bright and rugged enough to handle the rigors of tactical work and mid-range precision. Precision, accuracy, and reliability at a value any operator or LE department can afford.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415nEn8oakL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004R8M888.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 498.86}}
{"item_id": "B004RA03LK", "title": "Jetboil Sol Titanium Cooking System (Sand)", "description": "From the company that launched the revolutionary Jetboil PCS, the all new ultra-compact 8.5 ounce [without measuring cup] Sōl personal cooking system is barely noticed in your pack while assuring you’re prepared for the toughest conditions. In this true 4-season upright canister cooking system, Jetboil introduces advanced Jetboil Thermo-Regulate™ Burner Technology to deliver consistent heat output down to 20°F.", "text": "Jetboil Sol Titanium Cooking System (Sand) From the company that launched the revolutionary Jetboil PCS, the all new ultra-compact 8.5 ounce [without measuring cup] Sōl personal cooking system is barely noticed in your pack while assuring you’re prepared for the toughest conditions. In this true 4-season upright canister cooking system, Jetboil introduces advanced Jetboil Thermo-Regulate™ Burner Technology to deliver consistent heat output down to 20°F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41spQjn3E%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RA03LK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jetboil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 149.0}}
{"item_id": "B004RA2EDU", "title": "Jetboil Sol Aluminum Cooking System (Graph/Gold)", "description": "From the company that launched the revolutionary Jetboil PCS, the all new ultra-compact 10.5 ounce Sōl personal cooking system is barely noticed in your pack while assuring you’re prepared for the toughest conditions. In this true 4-season upright canister cooking system, Jetboil introduces advanced Jetboil Thermo-Regulate™ Burner Technology to deliver consistent heat output down to 20°F.", "text": "Jetboil Sol Aluminum Cooking System (Graph/Gold) From the company that launched the revolutionary Jetboil PCS, the all new ultra-compact 10.5 ounce Sōl personal cooking system is barely noticed in your pack while assuring you’re prepared for the toughest conditions. In this true 4-season upright canister cooking system, Jetboil introduces advanced Jetboil Thermo-Regulate™ Burner Technology to deliver consistent heat output down to 20°F.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uhag3HTLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RA2EDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jetboil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Mess Kits"]], "price": 119.0}}
{"item_id": "B004RC1OYI", "title": "Daiwa Beefstick Surf Spin Rod, 2 Piece", "description": "The Daiwa Beefstick Surf Spin Rod is made of super strong tubular fiberglass. This rod includes stainless hooded composite seat, Heavy framed, cut proof ceramic guides, and a non slip EVA grip rubber butt cap.", "text": "Daiwa Beefstick Surf Spin Rod, 2 Piece The Daiwa Beefstick Surf Spin Rod is made of super strong tubular fiberglass. This rod includes stainless hooded composite seat, Heavy framed, cut proof ceramic guides, and a non slip EVA grip rubber butt cap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21dfflDh99L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RC1OYI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rods", "Surf Fishing Rods"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004RD8CNS", "title": "Airsoft Half Face Mask With Wire Mesh Tan", "description": "", "text": "Airsoft Half Face Mask With Wire Mesh Tan", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VI9ZQw6%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RD8CNS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Other", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 5.0}}
{"item_id": "B004RDMOVY", "title": "Remington Men's Insulated Jacket (Realtree All Purpose, Large)", "description": "Insulated waist length bomber Jacket is made with Remtech lamination to make it waterproof, breathable and windproof. Spill-proof cargo packets with brushed poly hand warmer entry, contoured hood and storm flap covered front YKK zipper.", "text": "Remington Men's Insulated Jacket (Realtree All Purpose, Large) Insulated waist length bomber Jacket is made with Remtech lamination to make it waterproof, breathable and windproof. Spill-proof cargo packets with brushed poly hand warmer entry, contoured hood and storm flap covered front YKK zipper.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51usOLcfPOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RDMOVY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Clothing", "Polo Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004RDP2I6", "title": "Truglo Red-Dot Open Dual Color Sight, Black", "description": "The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has 5 MOA reticle for quick acquisition. 2 choices of reticle color for contrast against any target / background. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / compact design. Unlimited eye relief. Water and shock resistant. Click windage and elevation adjustment. Wide field of view. 24x34mm window for ultra-fast target acquisition. Anti-reflection coating on target side. Parallax free from 30 yards. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "text": "Truglo Red-Dot Open Dual Color Sight, Black The TRUGLO Red-Dot sight has 5 MOA reticle for quick acquisition. 2 choices of reticle color for contrast against any target / background. Adjustable rheostat for brightness control. Lightweight / compact design. Unlimited eye relief. Water and shock resistant. Click windage and elevation adjustment. Wide field of view. 24x34mm window for ultra-fast target acquisition. Anti-reflection coating on target side. Parallax free from 30 yards. Integrated Weaver-style mounting system. Battery included (3V-CR2032). Lifetime Limited Warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ysg0GG7lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RDP2I6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Truglo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 45.95}}
{"item_id": "B004RDQJ2O", "title": "SiteLite Ultra Mag Laser Professional Boresighter", "description": "The SL-150 uses a brighter red laser and has a 40 hour continuous battery. It's guaranteed more accurate than any other boresighter. That's why the US Navy and USMC selected our boresighters, over all others, for their Aviation Unit weapons from 5.56mm to the 20mm canon on the AH-1Z Cobra Attack Helicopter. In addition, the US Navy is using our boresighter, with our special adapter, for the 25mm Gatling Gun on the new F-35 Strike Fighter. The SL-150 includes all adapters to fit.22 cal. To.50 Cal. & 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The system also includes our Ballistic Targeting System software program to create a custom laser boresighting target for your specific rifle and ammo. All Sitelite Mag Laser Boresighters have a lifetime warranty. And, an optional app is available for your iPad and iPhone for use in the field.", "text": "SiteLite Ultra Mag Laser Professional Boresighter The SL-150 uses a brighter red laser and has a 40 hour continuous battery. It's guaranteed more accurate than any other boresighter. That's why the US Navy and USMC selected our boresighters, over all others, for their Aviation Unit weapons from 5.56mm to the 20mm canon on the AH-1Z Cobra Attack Helicopter. In addition, the US Navy is using our boresighter, with our special adapter, for the 25mm Gatling Gun on the new F-35 Strike Fighter. The SL-150 includes all adapters to fit.22 cal. To.50 Cal. & 20 and 12 ga. shotguns. The system also includes our Ballistic Targeting System software program to create a custom laser boresighting target for your specific rifle and ammo. All Sitelite Mag Laser Boresighters have a lifetime warranty. And, an optional app is available for your iPad and iPhone for use in the field.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3172JIUcV0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RDQJ2O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 146.15}}
{"item_id": "B004RDQT92", "title": "Stansport Propane Converter", "description": "The Propane Converter from Stansport converts liquid gas style stoves to propane. Easy to use.", "text": "Stansport Propane Converter The Propane Converter from Stansport converts liquid gas style stoves to propane. Easy to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oZPdo4cnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RDQT92.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "StanSport", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Replacement Fuel"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B004RDTJSA", "title": "9MM RELOADING BRASS 500 CASINGS LOT A+ # 22713", "description": "THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 9MM, 500 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE ARE APPROXIMATELY 112 CASING PER POUND. THERE COULD BE LESS THEN .1% OF 380'S OR MAKAROV CASINGS IF ANY MIXED IN WITH ANY 9MM'S SOLD. PLEASE DO NOT BID IF THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "text": "9MM RELOADING BRASS 500 CASINGS LOT A+ # 22713 THIS ITEM CONSISTS OF 9MM, 500 CASINGS OF RELOADING BRASS. THERE ARE APPROXIMATELY 112 CASING PER POUND. THERE COULD BE LESS THEN .1% OF 380'S OR MAKAROV CASINGS IF ANY MIXED IN WITH ANY 9MM'S SOLD. PLEASE DO NOT BID IF THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE. PLEASE READ THE ITEM DESCRIPTION CAREFULLY BEFORE PURCHASING. This is a generic sample picture of the reloading brass we sell on the internet. The brass is in excellent shape. It was taken from indoor ranges. When it was fired it never fell on the ground. It does not have any dirt, mud, grass, or weather stains from lying on the ground. There are different mixtures of manufactures case stamps in this lot. The brass can contain nickel plate casings along with solid brass casings. We cannot determine the ratio between the nickel coated and solid brass casings since the brass varies from shipment to shipment. The spent primers are still in the cases. This brass is ready to load after it is cleaned in a tumbler and the old primers are removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YrsiRE-%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RDTJSA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004RE783W", "title": "CatEye Urban Wireless Bicycle Computer CC-VT220W", "description": "The Urban Wireless is the wireless computer simplified. Nine functions and larger font sizes help you keep track of every detail of your ride. In addition to basic ride data, both carbon offset and calorie consumption information will not only help you feel better from your ride, but better about your impact on the environment, too!", "text": "CatEye Urban Wireless Bicycle Computer CC-VT220W The Urban Wireless is the wireless computer simplified. Nine functions and larger font sizes help you keep track of every detail of your ride. In addition to basic ride data, both carbon offset and calorie consumption information will not only help you feel better from your ride, but better about your impact on the environment, too!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t3HG0-4uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RE783W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CATEYE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]], "price": 44.9}}
