{"item_id": "B004RHPSMM", "title": "Esbit Brass Alcohol Burner Camping Stove with Variable Temperature Control", "description": "The Esbit Alcohol Burner is a extremely durable and efficient stove that is constructed of brass and weighs only 3.25 oz. It comes with a flame regulator with a fold-away handle. The stove has a screw top with rubber seal so fuel stores in the stove so separate storage is not required. It uses the most commonly available fuel, with fuel available in almost every town. Its great for backpackers or anyone who doesn't want to carry old canisters of gas.", "text": "Esbit Brass Alcohol Burner Camping Stove with Variable Temperature Control The Esbit Alcohol Burner is a extremely durable and efficient stove that is constructed of brass and weighs only 3.25 oz. It comes with a flame regulator with a fold-away handle. The stove has a screw top with rubber seal so fuel stores in the stove so separate storage is not required. It uses the most commonly available fuel, with fuel available in almost every town. Its great for backpackers or anyone who doesn't want to carry old canisters of gas.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NLPvi0O4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RHPSMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Esbit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 16.44}}
{"item_id": "B004RIK6F0", "title": "Bantam BLW Mossy Oak Pink Camo", "description": "The new Bantam BLW Mossy Oak and Pink Camo from Buck Knives is slightly larger than the BBW pocket knife but still light enough for your pocket. With a mid back locking system and textured handle this pocket knife will surely become your go to for every day needs. PRODUCT FEATURES: Easy handling and lightweight Slightly larger than the BBW, the BLW Has a mid-lockback design, ridges at the top for added gripping and also has a lanyard hole for easy attachment 0285CMS10-B , Buck Knives Bantam BLW Mossy Oak Pink Camo , buck knives bantam blw , buck knives bantam mossy oak , buck knives bantam pink camo , bantam buck knives , bantam buck knives pink camo , buck knives , buck knives warranty , buck folding knives , buck knives for sale , buck knives pocket knives , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , buck survival knives , buck knives review , buck knifes , best pocket knife , where are buck knives made , buck knife , pocket knives for sale , buck knives usa , vintage buck knives , buck knives direct , buck knives made in usa , buckknives , rescue knives , buck knives wiki , buck knives catalog , buck knives hunting knives , personalized buck knives , buck hunting knives , cheap buck knives , custom buck knives , cold steel , buckknives.com , buck knives repair , buck knives website , buck knives hunting knife , buck knives idaho , buck knives sharpening , pocket knives , buck pocket knives , pocket knives for sale , old timer pocket knives , best pocket knives , good pocket knives , classic pocket knives , buck knives , buck knife , fine pocket knives , high end pocket knives , custom made pocket knives , folding pocket knives , cool pocket knives , pocket knifes , small pocket knives , buck , buck knives", "text": "Bantam BLW Mossy Oak Pink Camo The new Bantam BLW Mossy Oak and Pink Camo from Buck Knives is slightly larger than the BBW pocket knife but still light enough for your pock