{"item_id": "B004RKICLS", "title": "Military Law Enforcement Triple MP5 Mag Magazine Pouch", "description": "he New Tactical Molle MP5 Triple Magazine Pouch can be added to your drop leg platform or tactical vest. Holds three 30-round MP5 or similar sized magazines. First both straight and curved mags. Molle compatible straps on back. Measures 6 7/8\" x 9 1/4\".", "text": "Military Law Enforcement Triple MP5 Mag Magazine Pouch he New Tactical Molle MP5 Triple Magazine Pouch can be added to your drop leg platform or tactical vest. Holds three 30-round MP5 or similar sized magazines. First both straight and curved mags. Molle compatible straps on back. Measures 6 7/8\" x 9 1/4\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513AwoQFFhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RKICLS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
