{"item_id": "B004RKKRN4", "title": "Military Law Enforcement Double M4 Mag Magazine Pouch Black also Fits AK47 Mag", "description": "This heavy duty magazine pouch holds four M4 M16 Magazine. A little snug but will also accommodate Magpul Mags.", "text": "Military Law Enforcement Double M4 Mag Magazine Pouch Black also Fits AK47 Mag This heavy duty magazine pouch holds four M4 M16 Magazine. A little snug but will also accommodate Magpul Mags.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413PjEe65FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RKKRN4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 18.23}}
