{"item_id": "B004RMB3HQ", "title": "Ocean Kayak Comfort Tech Seat Back for Sit-On-Top Kayak", "description": "Highly adjustable, supportive, and padded, the seat back boosts comfort on your paddling adventures.An upgrade from Ocean Kayak's Comfort Plus seat, the Comfort Tech Seat Back is an adjustable kayak seat with more padding, an added built-in ventilation system, reflective logos, and a taller seat back for additional support. UV-resistant nylon pack cloth construction ensures durability, while four-way adjustable mounting straps create perfect seating comfort. Reinforced stays add additional back support, and brass swivel buckles lock firmly into place.About Ocean KayakOcean Kayak certainly didn't invent the original sit-on-top kayak, but it has devoted itself to perfecting its design. Since the company's launch in 1971, it has focused on product innovation and safety, with improvements including:One of the first brands to manufacture and sell rotationally molded sit-on-top kayaksCompany's Malibu Two is the world's most popular sit-on-top kayak, thanks largely to patented overlapping foot wells that allow one, two, or three people to fit comfortably in a compact tandemVenus line offers the first sit-on-tops specifically designed for womenSome models' stackable hulls allow for easier storage", "text": "Ocean Kayak Comfort Tech Seat Back for Sit-On-Top Kayak Highly adjustable, supportive, and padded, the seat back boosts comfort on your paddling adventures.An upgrade from Ocean Kayak's Comfort Plus seat, the Comfort Tech Seat Back is an adjustable kayak seat with more padding, an added built-in ventilation system, reflective logos, and a taller seat back for additional support. UV-resistant nylon pack cloth construction ensures durability, while four-way adjustable mounting straps create perfect seating comfort. Reinforced stays add additional back support, and brass swivel buckles lock firmly into place.About Ocean KayakOcean Kayak certainly didn't invent the original sit-on-top kayak, but it has devoted itself to perfecting its design. Since the company's launch in 1971, it has focused on product innovation and safety, with improvements including:One of the first brands to manufacture and sell rotationally molded sit-on-top kayaksCompany's Malibu Two is the world's most popular sit-on-top kayak, thanks largely to patented overlapping foot wells that allow one, two, or three people to fit comfortably in a compact tandemVenus line offers the first sit-on-tops specifically designed for womenSome models' stackable hulls allow for easier storage", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KHOLXDFxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RMB3HQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ocean Kayak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Canoeing", "Canoe Seats & Thwarts"]], "price": 59.99}}
