{"item_id": "B004RNOW64", "title": "Camco 57549 Olympian GM-3X Gas Match", "description": "Camco's Olympian GM-3X Gas Match is a continuous ignition system where the flame will not blow out. Its long slender design lets you get at hard-to-reach places with total safety. It features a safety lock, fully adjustable flame and fuel viewing window. It uses one AA battery (included) and is CPSC certified. Refillable with butane lighter fluid (it arrives empty). The flex extender is 15\" long and the total length is 26\".", "text": "Camco 57549 Olympian GM-3X Gas Match Camco's Olympian GM-3X Gas Match is a continuous ignition system where the flame will not blow out. Its long slender design lets you get at hard-to-reach places with total safety. It features a safety lock, fully adjustable flame and fuel viewing window. It uses one AA battery (included) and is CPSC certified. Refillable with butane lighter fluid (it arrives empty). The flex extender is 15\" long and the total length is 26\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ryLmWhfkL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RNOW64.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 36.02}}
{"item_id": "B004ROT3LC", "title": "RAD Cycle Products Indoor Portable Magnetic Work Out Bicycle Trainer", "description": "Get off the couch and onto the state of the art MAG TRAINER by RAD Cycle Products. Out of all the trainers we tested, none of them compared to price and the quality of this trainer! Regardless of the weather outside you will be able to stay in shape. The MAG Trainer converts your bike into an indoor cycling trainer. It utilizes a state of the art magnet system which provides magnetic resistance. You can easily increase the resistance by shifting the gears on your bike! These are perfect for the beginner or the professional who wants to stay in shape all year long! This MAG Trainer is one of the quietest on the market--it is a premium quality unit. Now you can watch TV and ride your bike.", "text": "RAD Cycle Products Indoor Portable Magnetic Work Out Bicycle Trainer Get off the couch and onto the state of the art MAG TRAINER by RAD Cycle Products. Out of all the trainers we tested, none of them compared to price and the quality of this trainer! Regardless of the weather outside you will be able to stay in shape. The MAG Trainer converts your bike into an indoor cycling trainer. It utilizes a state of the art magnet system which provides magnetic resistance. You can easily increase the resistance by shifting the gears on your bike! These are perfect for the beginner or the professional who wants to stay in shape all year long! This MAG Trainer is one of the quietest on the market--it is a premium quality unit. Now you can watch TV and ride your bike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ETfXmwUyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ROT3LC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RAD Cycle Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Resistance Trainers"]], "price": 55.0}}
{"item_id": "B004ROZDZC", "title": "Carbon Express 20-Inch Maxima Hunter Crossbolt (6-Pack)", "description": "The Maxima Huntermaintains its heritage and adds the benefits of Dual Spine Weight Forward technology. It is the most proven and reliable premium grade 100% carbon arrow in the Carbon Expressline. The precision design Maxima Hunterseries is faster and offers tighter tolerances than traditional carbon arrows. The Maxima Hunteris the fastest camouflage arrow in the Carbon Expressline!", "text": "Carbon Express 20-Inch Maxima Hunter Crossbolt (6-Pack) The Maxima Huntermaintains its heritage and adds the benefits of Dual Spine Weight Forward technology. It is the most proven and reliable premium grade 100% carbon arrow in the Carbon Expressline. The precision design Maxima Hunterseries is faster and offers tighter tolerances than traditional carbon arrows. The Maxima Hunteris the fastest camouflage arrow in the Carbon Expressline!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2191up37chL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ROZDZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carbon Express", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Arrows & Shafts", "Crossbow Bolts"]], "price": 57.53}}
{"item_id": "B004RQEOUA", "title": "NAP 8 Inch Apache Stabilizer", "description": "New to the NAP Apache line-up for 2011 comes a stabilizer system offering the same solid construction and stealth qualities you've come to trust from the Apache drop-away arrow rest lineup. The NAP 8 Inch Apache Stabilizer features proprietary dampening materials to snuff out vibration and silence your bow at the shot. The Apache 8 inch Stabilizer comes with a removable 3 inch long, 2 oz carbon fiber accessory bar to help balance out your bow.", "text": "NAP 8 Inch Apache Stabilizer New to the NAP Apache line-up for 2011 comes a stabilizer system offering the same solid construction and stealth qualities you've come to trust from the Apache drop-away arrow rest lineup. The NAP 8 Inch Apache Stabilizer features proprietary dampening materials to snuff out vibration and silence your bow at the shot. The Apache 8 inch Stabilizer comes with a removable 3 inch long, 2 oz carbon fiber accessory bar to help balance out your bow.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Rwckkzq6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RQEOUA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "New Archery Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Stabilizers"]], "price": 34.13}}
{"item_id": "B004RQPM2O", "title": "Lockdown Magnetic Barrel Rest", "description": "Accessing a gun deep in the back of a vault can be challenging. Rather than juggling an armful of long guns, deploy the Lockdown Magnetic Barrel Rest. It conveniently secures to the outside of any vault and provides a perfect staging location. Overmolded contact points protect your gun’s finish.", "text": "Lockdown Magnetic Barrel Rest Accessing a gun deep in the back of a vault can be challenging. Rather than juggling an armful of long guns, deploy the Lockdown Magnetic Barrel Rest. It conveniently secures to the outside of any vault and provides a perfect staging location. Overmolded contact points protect your gun’s finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NO3vyrD%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RQPM2O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lockdown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 15.24}}
