{"item_id": "B004RUB8V4", "title": "Olive Drab M16 Field Cleaning Kit", "description": "This all-inclusive M16, or AR-15 cleaning kit includes everything you need to keep your rifle in tip-top shape. Included is an expandable cleaning rod, two screw up wire brushes, a hand-held hard bristled cleaning brush, travel oil dispensing bottle and a pack of cleaning cloths. Each kit is packaged in a durable OD green webbed-nylon sheath with snap button closures and belt loop.", "text": "Olive Drab M16 Field Cleaning Kit This all-inclusive M16, or AR-15 cleaning kit includes everything you need to keep your rifle in tip-top shape. Included is an expandable cleaning rod, two screw up wire brushes, a hand-held hard bristled cleaning brush, travel oil dispensing bottle and a pack of cleaning cloths. Each kit is packaged in a durable OD green webbed-nylon sheath with snap button closures and belt loop.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ru26GM2GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RUB8V4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MILITARIA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 15.37}}
{"item_id": "B004RUB8VE", "title": "Israeli Issue Gas Mask with Drinking Tube & Sealed Filter", "description": "This authentic, never-issued Israeli gas mask is constructed of heavy-duty rubber and offers full-face coverage with dual eye-openings for a clear view and adjustable rubber straps to fit an adult head. Includes drinking tube and sealed filter. Order today, while supplies last!!!", "text": "Israeli Issue Gas Mask with Drinking Tube & Sealed Filter This authentic, never-issued Israeli gas mask is constructed of heavy-duty rubber and offers full-face coverage with dual eye-openings for a clear view and adjustable rubber straps to fit an adult head. Includes drinking tube and sealed filter. Order today, while supplies last!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3166PAlA7BL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RUB8VE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 26.9}}
{"item_id": "B004RUHFIE", "title": "Ontario Knives Field Knife", "description": "The 10\" Field Knife features high carbon steel blades, full tang construction, brush finish and hardwood handles. It has an extra long blade length for agricultural and industrial cutting applications.", "text": "Ontario Knives Field Knife The 10\" Field Knife features high carbon steel blades, full tang construction, brush finish and hardwood handles. It has an extra long blade length for agricultural and industrial cutting applications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ik38ktYgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004RUHFIE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Moteng", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.77}}
