{"item_id": "B004S55H7O", "title": "On Guard Bulldog Mini DT Lock 5015", "description": "Bulldog Mini combined with a 4 foot fully coated, braided steel cable for extra locking versatility.", "text": "On Guard Bulldog Mini DT Lock 5015 Bulldog Mini combined with a 4 foot fully coated, braided steel cable for extra locking versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WAUZgtiML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S55H7O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004S5SR1W", "title": "LaserLyte Mini Tac-Tool Pistol Bayonet", "description": "Meet Mini Tac Tool, the latest addition to LaserLyte's unique line of Pistol Bayonets. LaserLyte, in association with Ka-Bar Knives, offers the new Mini Tac Tool that features a web cutter, serrated blade and unique chiseled edge. The Mini Tac Tool was specially designed by prominent knife maker Ethan Becker of Becker Knife and Tool, who has designed survival knives and tools for more than thirty years. The razor-sharp, 2.75 inch Ka-BarÒ blade fits on any medium to large pistol with rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. Its stainless steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black oxide coating for protection. Featuring a full tang design, the blade also comes with a custom polymer sheath. The blade handle is constructed from 30 percent glass-filled nylon for extra strength and durability. A LaserLyte original, this Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation - or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "text": "LaserLyte Mini Tac-Tool Pistol Bayonet Meet Mini Tac Tool, the latest addition to LaserLyte's unique line of Pistol Bayonets. LaserLyte, in association with Ka-Bar Knives, offers the new Mini Tac Tool that features a web cutter, serrated blade and unique chiseled edge. The Mini Tac Tool was specially designed by prominent knife maker Ethan Becker of Becker Knife and Tool, who has designed survival knives and tools for more than thirty years. The razor-sharp, 2.75 inch Ka-BarÒ blade fits on any medium to large pistol with rail and slides on and off easily with the press of two buttons. Its stainless steel blade is sharpened to a fine edge and finished with a black oxide coating for protection. Featuring a full tang design, the blade also comes with a custom polymer sheath. The blade handle is constructed from 30 percent glass-filled nylon for extra strength and durability. A LaserLyte original, this Pistol Bayonet is ready for any situation - or just looking cool on your favorite gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31m-Jx0s0AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S5SR1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 15.38}}
{"item_id": "B004S76WTE", "title": "Burris 410344 AR-PEPR 1-Inch Mount Quick Detach with Picatinny Tops (Black)", "description": "The Burris AR-P.E.P.R. Quick Detach Mount makes it easy to gear up for different applications or shooting disciplines. Two Quick Detach levers make it easy to change optics or switch to iron sights and still maintain return-to-zero reliability.", "text": "Burris 410344 AR-PEPR 1-Inch Mount Quick Detach with Picatinny Tops (Black) The Burris AR-P.E.P.R. Quick Detach Mount makes it easy to gear up for different applications or shooting disciplines. Two Quick Detach levers make it easy to change optics or switch to iron sights and still maintain return-to-zero reliability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418qVTF8QNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S76WTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 99.7}}
{"item_id": "B004S7F0IS", "title": "Enhanced Voodoo Tactical 42\" MOLLE Soft Rifle Case, Padded Weapon Bag", "description": "Whether you are carrying your rifle to the range or need to pack it in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry two long guns, two pistols and a great deal of related gear.The 42-inch (40.5-inches inside) padded case from Voodoo Tactical safely holds just about any compact rifle or carbine. If you are unsure if your firearm will fit, please contact us via email.Inside are adjustable tie downs so that you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The attention to detail and heavy thick foam on all six sides is a welcome change from the standard nylon case. It even features additional padding to protect your muzzle and the zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement.Behind the pouches, there's a second compartment with two padded pouches built in. Each is designed to hold a pistol, but you could also use these for optics or other accessories.This case comes with the three external pouches you see here, giving you plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits, your log book and other accessories. The three exterior pouches have gussets, making them hold far more than you would think. The two outside pouches can hold five or six magazines and the center pouch is even larger.This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.This listing is for the 42-inch padded rifle case.", "text": "Enhanced Voodoo Tactical 42\" MOLLE Soft Rifle Case, Padded Weapon Bag Whether you are carrying your rifle to the range or need to pack it in the field, this Voodoo Tactical brand padded weapons case is a terrific way to carry two long guns, two pistols and a great deal of related gear.The 42-inch (40.5-inches inside) padded case from Voodoo Tactical safely holds just about any compact rifle or carbine. If you are unsure if your firearm will fit, please contact us via email.Inside are adjustable tie downs so that you can be sure your optics are not going to get knocked about. The attention to detail and heavy thick foam on all six sides is a welcome change from the standard nylon case. It even features additional padding to protect your muzzle and the zippers are tough enough to meet the demanding conditions required by the military and law enforcement.Behind the pouches, there's a second compartment with two padded pouches built in. Each is designed to hold a pistol, but you could also use these for optics or other accessories.This case comes with the three external pouches you see here, giving you plenty of storage space for magazines, boxes of ammo, cleaning kits, your log book and other accessories. The three exterior pouches have gussets, making them hold far more than you would think. The two outside pouches can hold five or six magazines and the center pouch is even larger.This gun case features three carrying methods: A standard handle in center of the bag, a shoulder strap, and back-pack style shoulder harness. This backpack style carry is great for long distances. And if you use the PAL webbing to attach MOLLE or ALICE pouches, you can haul even more gear.This listing is for the 42-inch padded rifle case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yjVMQaW0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S7F0IS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 91.7}}
{"item_id": "B004S7G3FW", "title": "3 Piece Black Throwing Knives Set with Free Nylon Case", "description": "These throwing knives are great for practicing your throwing technique. The sport of throwing knives is becoming more and more popular as people realize the fun and excitement of being able to land a knife exactly where you want it. These inexpensive throwing knives are ideal for beginners and those just getting interested in the sport. They're sturdy enough and balanced enough to practice with. While perfecting your throwing technique, you will be able to make these knives stick whenever you want.", "text": "3 Piece Black Throwing Knives Set with Free Nylon Case These throwing knives are great for practicing your throwing technique. The sport of throwing knives is becoming more and more popular as people realize the fun and excitement of being able to land a knife exactly where you want it. These inexpensive throwing knives are ideal for beginners and those just getting interested in the sport. They're sturdy enough and balanced enough to practice with. While perfecting your throwing technique, you will be able to make these knives stick whenever you want.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZkVen-1-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S7G3FW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ace Martial Arts Supply", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B004S7SUDK", "title": "Food For Health Vegetarian Emergency Food Supply 275 Servings Up to a 20 Year Shelf Life Weather Proof Bucket", "description": "Ready to eat every day of the week! With all-new recipes made from high quality ingredients, all 275 servings burst with flavor and nutrition. Savor the comforting essence of Creamy Potato Soup or the family-pleasing Italian Tomato Pasta for lunch or dinner, or start the day off right with a heart-healthy bowl of oatmeal. These meals are no longer just long-term food supply but tasty enough for everyday use. Along with the enhanced flavors, Food for Health has also increased the nutritional value as well. Each entre is high in protein and offers no hydrogenated oils, trans fats, or added MSG. Making a healthy meal has never been so easy or affordable. Just add boiling water, and in 25 minutes, a mouth-watering meal is ready to serve; priced under 35 cents, Food For Health's Food Supply Kit easily fits into any budget. Although recommended for daily use, the 275 serving Food Kit is still the best choice for any outdoor activity and stocking your shelves with a long-term food supply.", "text": "Food For Health Vegetarian Emergency Food Supply 275 Servings Up to a 20 Year Shelf Life Weather Proof Bucket Ready to eat every day of the week! With all-new recipes made from high quality ingredients, all 275 servings burst with flavor and nutrition. Savor the comforting essence of Creamy Potato Soup or the family-pleasing Italian Tomato Pasta for lunch or dinner, or start the day off right with a heart-healthy bowl of oatmeal. These meals are no longer just long-term food supply but tasty enough for everyday use. Along with the enhanced flavors, Food for Health has also increased the nutritional value as well. Each entre is high in protein and offers no hydrogenated oils, trans fats, or added MSG. Making a healthy meal has never been so easy or affordable. Just add boiling water, and in 25 minutes, a mouth-watering meal is ready to serve; priced under 35 cents, Food For Health's Food Supply Kit easily fits into any budget. Although recommended for daily use, the 275 serving Food Kit is still the best choice for any outdoor activity and stocking your shelves with a long-term food supply.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zgtsk%2BOCL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S7SUDK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 159.99}}
{"item_id": "B004S82B8E", "title": "Crosspaq Black Forget Your Pockets on the Go! CrossBody Bag", "description": "CrossPaq combines the ease of a shoulder bag without the hassle of a hanging pouch. CrossPaq is designed for the active life style. Unlike other bags, CrossPaq allows you to be agile while staying organized. The pouch-less design of the bag promotes the natural hand movement while running, hiking or biking. CrossPaq distributes the content along your body to have everything right at your finger tips. While listening to your favorite tunes off of a digital player in one pocket, you have access to many essentials, gadgets and personal care articles across several pockets. No matter where you go, CrossPaq is the ideal companion to keep everything secure and right at hand.", "text": "Crosspaq Black Forget Your Pockets on the Go! CrossBody Bag CrossPaq combines the ease of a shoulder bag without the hassle of a hanging pouch. CrossPaq is designed for the active life style. Unlike other bags, CrossPaq allows you to be agile while staying organized. The pouch-less design of the bag promotes the natural hand movement while running, hiking or biking. CrossPaq distributes the content along your body to have everything right at your finger tips. While listening to your favorite tunes off of a digital player in one pocket, you have access to many essentials, gadgets and personal care articles across several pockets. No matter where you go, CrossPaq is the ideal companion to keep everything secure and right at hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413B3ssTE-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004S82B8E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004SBK4GM", "title": "M1 Bayonet Military Knife,Army,Marines", "description": "This M1 Bayonet by Szco Supplies is 15.75\" in overall length. The blade is made on black finish stainless steel and has a blood groove. The handle is black with fastening mechanism. This bayonet comes with a metal sheath.", "text": "M1 Bayonet Military Knife,Army,Marines This M1 Bayonet by Szco Supplies is 15.75\" in overall length. The blade is made on black finish stainless steel and has a blood groove. The handle is black with fastening mechanism. This bayonet comes with a metal sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C95RcyMeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SBK4GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CHINA MADE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 23.45}}
{"item_id": "B004SE6VJ8", "title": "5.11 Rush Tier System", "description": "This 5.11.56957 Rush tier system has many unique features including: connects any two styles of packs or bags with web platform on the sides, 4 straps and corresponding buckle hardware, allows for quick disconnect of packs or bags, user flexibility to quickly modify a kit, and is durable.", "text": "5.11 Rush Tier System This 5.11.56957 Rush tier system has many unique features including: connects any two styles of packs or bags with web platform on the sides, 4 straps and corresponding buckle hardware, allows for quick disconnect of packs or bags, user flexibility to quickly modify a kit, and is durable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4176u3N1acL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SE6VJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.0}}
{"item_id": "B004SEZ5KY", "title": "Ameristep Snow Poncho", "description": "Ameristep Snow Poncho", "text": "Ameristep Snow Poncho Ameristep Snow Poncho", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ARJvvqCBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SEZ5KY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004SGPLB0", "title": "Kershaw Tremor Folding Lock Back Knife", "description": "The affordable Kershaw Tremor pocket knife (model 1950) offers an ergonomically curved handle and aggressive index-finger jimping assure a solid grip. It's equipped with Kershaw's SpeedSafe assisted opening for smooth and easy opening using the built-in flipper or handy thumbstud. Heat-treated for high performance, the straight-edge blade is strong, hard, and takes and holds its edge extremely well. The handle's textured G-10 scales provide a secure grip and all-weather stability. Other features include a locking liner and pocket clip. The blade measures 3-3/4 inches long and the knife has an overall length of 9 inches (5-1/4 inches when closed). It weighs 6 ounces.", "text": "Kershaw Tremor Folding Lock Back Knife The affordable Kershaw Tremor pocket knife (model 1950) offers an ergonomically curved handle and aggressive index-finger jimping assure a solid grip. It's equipped with Kershaw's SpeedSafe assisted opening for smooth and easy opening using the built-in flipper or handy thumbstud. Heat-treated for high performance, the straight-edge blade is strong, hard, and takes and holds its edge extremely well. The handle's textured G-10 scales provide a secure grip and all-weather stability. Other features include a locking liner and pocket clip. The blade measures 3-3/4 inches long and the knife has an overall length of 9 inches (5-1/4 inches when closed). It weighs 6 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PL7j720uL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGPLB0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004SGTM3S", "title": "Kershaw Asset Assisted Opening Speed Safe Knife", "description": "Sporting a lightweight, maneuverable trailing-point blade and an assisted opening system, the Kershaw Asset folding knife is a real boon to your knife collection. The Asset is equipped with a high-quality 8CR13MoV stainless-steel blade, which opens easily thanks to the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system and the built-in flipper. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes the knife ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Asset's blade is also heat-treated for high performance, making it strong, hard, and capable of holding its edge extremely well. And users will love the Asset's textured, glass-filled nylon handle, which provides a secure grip every time.The Asset also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your knife.About the SpeedSafe SystemThe patented SpeedSafe knife-opening system helps users open the knife by applying manual pressure to the thumb stud or blade protrusion. The heart of the SpeedSafe system--which is built into many of Kershaw's best-selling knives--is its torsion bar, which keeps gravity from opening the knife. After the blade is out of the handle, the torsion bar moves along its half-moon track and takes over, smoothly opening the blade and locking it into position, ready for use. Although they may look similar at first glance, SpeedSafe knives arenotconsidered switchblades. Unlike a switchblade, SpeedSafe knives do not deploy with the push of a button in the handle or by gravity alone. Instead, the user must manually overcome the torsion bar's resistance, putting the knives outside the federal definition of a switchblade. However, it's the responsibility of the buyer to investigate and comply with the laws and regulations that apply in his or her specific area. Buyers should rest assured, however, that SpeedSafe knives are extremely safe, as they open only when the user manually deploys them, and lock securely into position when open so they don't close accidentally.SpecificationsBlade material: 8CR13MoV stainless steelHandle: Glass-filled nylonBlade length: 3-1/4 inchesClosed length: 4-5/8 inchesOverall length: 7-7/8 inchesWeight: 3.8 ounces", "text": "Kershaw Asset Assisted Opening Speed Safe Knife Sporting a lightweight, maneuverable trailing-point blade and an assisted opening system, the Kershaw Asset folding knife is a real boon to your knife collection. The Asset is equipped with a high-quality 8CR13MoV stainless-steel blade, which opens easily thanks to the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system and the built-in flipper. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes the knife ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Asset's blade is also heat-treated for high performance, making it strong, hard, and capable of holding its edge extremely well. And users will love the Asset's textured, glass-filled nylon handle, which provides a secure grip every time.The Asset also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your knife.About the SpeedSafe SystemThe patented SpeedSafe knife-opening system helps users open the knife by applying manual pressure to the thumb stud or blade protrusion. The heart of the SpeedSafe system--which is built into many of Kershaw's best-selling knives--is its torsion bar, which keeps gravity from opening the knife. After the blade is out of the handle, the torsion bar moves along its half-moon track and takes over, smoothly opening the blade and locking it into position, ready for use. Although they may look similar at first glance, SpeedSafe knives arenotconsidered switchblades. Unlike a switchblade, SpeedSafe knives do not deploy with the push of a button in the handle or by gravity alone. Instead, the user must manually overcome the torsion bar's resistance, putting the knives outside the federal definition of a switchblade. However, it's the responsibility of the buyer to investigate and comply with the laws and regulations that apply in his or her specific area. Buyers should rest assured, however, that SpeedSafe knives are extremely safe, as they open only when the user manually deploys them, and lock securely into position when open so they don't close accidentally.SpecificationsBlade material: 8CR13MoV stainless steelHandle: Glass-filled nylonBlade length: 3-1/4 inchesClosed length: 4-5/8 inchesOverall length: 7-7/8 inchesWeight: 3.8 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21tuhJaF-WL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGTM3S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B004SGXAPO", "title": "Kershaw G10 Tactical Speed Bump Folding Stud Lock Knife", "description": "Kershaw's Speed Bump features an innovative recurved blade with a unique look and high-performance function. The recurve provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations. The Speed Bump features Kershaw's famous SpeedSafe assisted opening system for easy opening and smooth operation. It also has the patented Stud-Lock, which keeps the blade safe and secure while in the open position. It offers a 8CR13MOV stainless-steel blade for toughness, durability, and excellent edge retention. With its sleek style, quality materials, and reliable function, the Speed Bump is an optimal cutting instrument.Specifications:8CR13MOV stainlesssteel blade; 410 stainless steel liner; Pocket clip; Index tabTextured Black G-10 Handle; Stud Lock; Speed Safe assisted opening system3 5/8-inch blade4 5/16 inches long in closed positionWeight: 5.2 ouncesAbout Kershaw KnivesSince the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty.", "text": "Kershaw G10 Tactical Speed Bump Folding Stud Lock Knife Kershaw's Speed Bump features an innovative recurved blade with a unique look and high-performance function. The recurve provides ideal leverage in tough cutting situations. The Speed Bump features Kershaw's famous SpeedSafe assisted opening system for easy opening and smooth operation. It also has the patented Stud-Lock, which keeps the blade safe and secure while in the open position. It offers a 8CR13MOV stainless-steel blade for toughness, durability, and excellent edge retention. With its sleek style, quality materials, and reliable function, the Speed Bump is an optimal cutting instrument.Specifications:8CR13MOV stainlesssteel blade; 410 stainless steel liner; Pocket clip; Index tabTextured Black G-10 Handle; Stud Lock; Speed Safe assisted opening system3 5/8-inch blade4 5/16 inches long in closed positionWeight: 5.2 ouncesAbout Kershaw KnivesSince the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wB%2BQP2x3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGXAPO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 34.03}}
{"item_id": "B004SGXARW", "title": "Kershaw Compound Folding Lock Back Knife", "description": "The Compound is a versatile utility knife equipped with SpeedSafe assisted opening and designed for excellent slicing ability and extra control. It opens easily with the built-in flipper. Kershaw heat-treats the 8CR13MoV blade steel to bring out its high-performance characteristics, the ability to take and hold an edge, strength and hardness. Glass-filled nylon handles make the Compound light enough for every day carry. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Compound Folding Lock Back Knife The Compound is a versatile utility knife equipped with SpeedSafe assisted opening and designed for excellent slicing ability and extra control. It opens easily with the built-in flipper. Kershaw heat-treats the 8CR13MoV blade steel to bring out its high-performance characteristics, the ability to take and hold an edge, strength and hardness. Glass-filled nylon handles make the Compound light enough for every day carry. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21HFcH-NKWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGXARW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 23.29}}
{"item_id": "B004SGZV2Y", "title": "Kershaw Compound Serrated Folding Lock Back Serrated Knife", "description": "Sporting a lightweight blade and an assisted opening system, the Kershaw Compound folding knife is a real boon to your knife collection. The Compound is equipped with a high-quality 8CR13MoV stainless-steel blade, which opens easily thanks to the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system and the built-in flipper. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes the knife ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Compound's blade is also heat-treated for high performance, making it strong, hard, and capable of holding its edge extremely well.The Compound also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your knife.About the SpeedSafe SystemThe patented SpeedSafe knife-opening system helps users open the knife by applying manual pressure to the thumb stud or blade protrusion. The heart of the SpeedSafe system--which is built into many of Kershaw's best-selling knives--is its torsion bar, which keeps gravity from opening the knife. After the blade is out of the handle, the torsion bar moves along its half-moon track and takes over, smoothly opening the blade and locking it into position, ready for use. Although they may look similar at first glance, SpeedSafe knives arenotconsidered switchblades. Unlike a switchblade, SpeedSafe knives do not deploy with the push of a button in the handle or by gravity alone. Instead, the user must manually overcome the torsion bar's resistance, putting the knives outside the federal definition of a switchblade. However, it's the responsibility of the buyer to investigate and comply with the laws and regulations that apply in his or her specific area. Buyers should rest assured, however, that SpeedSafe knives are extremely safe, as they open only when the user manually deploys them, and lock securely into position when open so they don't close accidentally.SpecificationsBlade material: 8CR13MoV stainless steelHandle: Glass-filled nylonBlade length: 3-1/2 inchesClosed length: 4-5/8 inchesOverall length: 8-1/8 inchesWeight: 3.8 ounces", "text": "Kershaw Compound Serrated Folding Lock Back Serrated Knife Sporting a lightweight blade and an assisted opening system, the Kershaw Compound folding knife is a real boon to your knife collection. The Compound is equipped with a high-quality 8CR13MoV stainless-steel blade, which opens easily thanks to the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system and the built-in flipper. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. This makes the knife ideal for sporting and work situations in which one-handed opening is easier and safer, such as when hunting, fishing, or working with your hands on the job site. The Compound's blade is also heat-treated for high performance, making it strong, hard, and capable of holding its edge extremely well.The Compound also comes with a Kershaw pocket clip, which is meant to be clipped with the handle on the inside of your pocket. The clip is not to be worn on a belt, as this is an unsafe way to carry your knife.About the SpeedSafe SystemThe patented SpeedSafe knife-opening system helps users open the knife by applying manual pressure to the thumb stud or blade protrusion. The heart of the SpeedSafe system--which is built into many of Kershaw's best-selling knives--is its torsion bar, which keeps gravity from opening the knife. After the blade is out of the handle, the torsion bar moves along its half-moon track and takes over, smoothly opening the blade and locking it into position, ready for use. Although they may look similar at first glance, SpeedSafe knives arenotconsidered switchblades. Unlike a switchblade, SpeedSafe knives do not deploy with the push of a button in the handle or by gravity alone. Instead, the user must manually overcome the torsion bar's resistance, putting the knives outside the federal definition of a switchblade. However, it's the responsibility of the buyer to investigate and comply with the laws and regulations that apply in his or her specific area. Buyers should rest assured, however, that SpeedSafe knives are extremely safe, as they open only when the user manually deploys them, and lock securely into position when open so they don't close accidentally.SpecificationsBlade material: 8CR13MoV stainless steelHandle: Glass-filled nylonBlade length: 3-1/2 inchesClosed length: 4-5/8 inchesOverall length: 8-1/8 inchesWeight: 3.8 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hfiIKWaNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGZV2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.98}}
{"item_id": "B004SGZVBA", "title": "Kershaw Tremor Serrated Folding Lock Back Serrated Knife", "description": "The affordable Kershaw Tremor pocket knife (model 1950) offers an ergonomically curved handle and aggressive index-finger jimping assure a solid grip. It's equipped with Kershaw's SpeedSafe assisted opening for smooth and easy opening using the built-in flipper or handy thumbstud. Heat-treated for high performance, the partially serrated blade is strong, hard, and takes and holds its edge extremely well. The handle's textured G-10 scales provide a secure grip and all-weather stability. Other features include a locking liner and pocket clip. The blade measures 3-3/4 inches long and the knife has an overall length of 9 inches (5-1/4 inches when closed). It weighs 6 ounces.", "text": "Kershaw Tremor Serrated Folding Lock Back Serrated Knife The affordable Kershaw Tremor pocket knife (model 1950) offers an ergonomically curved handle and aggressive index-finger jimping assure a solid grip. It's equipped with Kershaw's SpeedSafe assisted opening for smooth and easy opening using the built-in flipper or handy thumbstud. Heat-treated for high performance, the partially serrated blade is strong, hard, and takes and holds its edge extremely well. The handle's textured G-10 scales provide a secure grip and all-weather stability. Other features include a locking liner and pocket clip. The blade measures 3-3/4 inches long and the knife has an overall length of 9 inches (5-1/4 inches when closed). It weighs 6 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tQrQAU-5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SGZVBA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 21.53}}
{"item_id": "B004SH1I7U", "title": "UTG Low Profile Flip-up Front Sight with A2 Square Post Assembly", "description": "UTG Tactical Low Pro Flip-up Front Sight Complete w/A2 Square Post Assembly for Deployment on Rail Handguard, Robust Posi-Lock Design for Repeatable Flip-up Operation, Light Weight Rugged Aluminum/Steel Construction w/Matt Finish to Meet Combat Requirment", "text": "UTG Low Profile Flip-up Front Sight with A2 Square Post Assembly UTG Tactical Low Pro Flip-up Front Sight Complete w/A2 Square Post Assembly for Deployment on Rail Handguard, Robust Posi-Lock Design for Repeatable Flip-up Operation, Light Weight Rugged Aluminum/Steel Construction w/Matt Finish to Meet Combat Requirment", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ck2tplFaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SH1I7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 18.23}}
{"item_id": "B004SH1IES", "title": "UTG Combat Operation Quick Detach Aluminum Grip Light", "description": "UTG Combat Operation Aluminum Foregrip with Built-in Integral CREE LED Flashlight, Complete with Max Strength Lever Lock Quick Detach Picatinny/Weaver Integral Mounting Deck, 26mm 6V IRB CREE LED, Ambidextrous On/Off Switch and 2 Lithium Batteries", "text": "UTG Combat Operation Quick Detach Aluminum Grip Light UTG Combat Operation Aluminum Foregrip with Built-in Integral CREE LED Flashlight, Complete with Max Strength Lever Lock Quick Detach Picatinny/Weaver Integral Mounting Deck, 26mm 6V IRB CREE LED, Ambidextrous On/Off Switch and 2 Lithium Batteries", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41j13ibUyrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SH1IES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 74.58}}
