{"item_id": "B004SWX5N0", "title": "Hunter Safety System Ultra Lite X-treme Safety Harnesses", "description": "Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Vests/Harness are designed to provide hunters with the SAFEST, easiest to use, most comfortable vests/harnesses on the market today!", "text": "Hunter Safety System Ultra Lite X-treme Safety Harnesses Hunter Safety System is a leading designer and manufacturer of innovative deer hunting gear and hunting equipment for the serious hunter. HSS Vests/Harness are designed to provide hunters with the SAFEST, easiest to use, most comfortable vests/harnesses on the market today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2Bq1G7v-HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004SWX5N0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]]}}
