{"item_id": "B004T0Y0C6", "title": "BLACKHAWK! AR-15/M16 Oversized Trigger Guard", "description": "Get to your trigger faster and easier with the BLACKHAWK! AR-15/M16 Oversized Trigger Guard. This drop-in replacement is enlarged to allow better access to the trigger—even when wearing gloves—and eliminates the need to pivot open guard in cold conditions. The Oversized Trigger Guard also fills the gap found between pistol grip and rear of guard.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! AR-15/M16 Oversized Trigger Guard Get to your trigger faster and easier with the BLACKHAWK! AR-15/M16 Oversized Trigger Guard. This drop-in replacement is enlarged to allow better access to the trigger—even when wearing gloves—and eliminates the need to pivot open guard in cold conditions. The Oversized Trigger Guard also fills the gap found between pistol grip and rear of guard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dCS37KRQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T0Y0C6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004T0Y9ZY", "title": "BLACKHAWK! CQB / Rigger's Belt (1.5-Inch)", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! CQB / Rigger's Belt is perfect for casual/duty wear or with jeans or khakis. It offers parachute-grade buckles and adapters meet PIA-H-7195 standards and 1.5” webbing (7000-lb. tensile strength), polyethylene spine that supports gun holsters and equipment, and a hook and loop that secures running end. Sizing: Small (up to 34\"); Regular (up to 41\"); Large (41\"-51\")", "text": "BLACKHAWK! CQB / Rigger's Belt (1.5-Inch) The BLACKHAWK! CQB / Rigger's Belt is perfect for casual/duty wear or with jeans or khakis. It offers parachute-grade buckles and adapters meet PIA-H-7195 standards and 1.5” webbing (7000-lb. tensile strength), polyethylene spine that supports gun holsters and equipment, and a hook and loop that secures running end. Sizing: Small (up to 34\"); Regular (up to 41\"); Large (41\"-51\")", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31YS0MS0CSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T0Y9ZY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004T0YARG", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Enhanced Padded Patrol Belt Pad (belt with clasp not included)", "description": "BLACKHAWK! Enhanced Padded Patrol Belt features 3-D mesh and foam padding provide additional comfort and closed-cell foam padding that will not absorb moisture. If offers two rows of S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing for modular attachments and fits belts up to 2.75” wide (not included) Features: Convenient openings help guide belt through pad; HawkTex lining keeps pad in place; and is available in Coyote Tan and Multi Cam.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Enhanced Padded Patrol Belt Pad (belt with clasp not included) BLACKHAWK! Enhanced Padded Patrol Belt features 3-D mesh and foam padding provide additional comfort and closed-cell foam padding that will not absorb moisture. If offers two rows of S.T.R.I.K.E. webbing for modular attachments and fits belts up to 2.75” wide (not included) Features: Convenient openings help guide belt through pad; HawkTex lining keeps pad in place; and is available in Coyote Tan and Multi Cam.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4145-oQkYzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T0YARG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004T14ZZW", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Swivel Stud Picatinny Rail Adapter", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Swivel Stud Picatinny Rail Adapter mounts to rifle’s existing swivel stud and provides a Picatinny rail section for rail-mounted accessories. It is constructed of rugged 6061 T6 aluminum w/Type-III hard-coat anodized finish and contains a side swivel stud for continued use of sling.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Swivel Stud Picatinny Rail Adapter The BLACKHAWK! Swivel Stud Picatinny Rail Adapter mounts to rifle’s existing swivel stud and provides a Picatinny rail section for rail-mounted accessories. It is constructed of rugged 6061 T6 aluminum w/Type-III hard-coat anodized finish and contains a side swivel stud for continued use of sling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J8gT2R%2BGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T14ZZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Swivels"]], "price": 20.99}}
{"item_id": "B004T16HIU", "title": "BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel - 1-Inch, Blue", "description": "BLACKHAWK!'s LOK-DOWN Sling Swivels are precision machined and assembled to exacting tolerances for maximum performance and quiet carry. Made entirely in the USA from premium steel, LOK-DOWN swivels utilize a positive locking mechanism designed to keep the swivel attached to your gun until you remove it. Features: Detachable swivels only and positive locking mechanism.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! LOK-DOWN Sling Swivel - 1-Inch, Blue BLACKHAWK!'s LOK-DOWN Sling Swivels are precision machined and assembled to exacting tolerances for maximum performance and quiet carry. Made entirely in the USA from premium steel, LOK-DOWN swivels utilize a positive locking mechanism designed to keep the swivel attached to your gun until you remove it. Features: Detachable swivels only and positive locking mechanism.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mf76a6-vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T16HIU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Spotting Scopes"]], "price": 9.65}}
{"item_id": "B004T1FR36", "title": "BKL 12-Way Folding Scope Level, Fits 30mm dia. Scope Tube", "description": "12-way scope bubble level Fits 30mm dia. scope tube Easy installationEliminate cant with BKL's 12-way scope bubble level. Position the level above, below or off to the side depending on your needs. Reference the level before taking your shot, reposition your gun so it's level and then shoot. You should see a difference in accuracy, as a canted gun is not accurate. Included ring fits any 30mm scope tube.", "text": "BKL 12-Way Folding Scope Level, Fits 30mm dia. Scope Tube 12-way scope bubble level Fits 30mm dia. scope tube Easy installationEliminate cant with BKL's 12-way scope bubble level. Position the level above, below or off to the side depending on your needs. Reference the level before taking your shot, reposition your gun so it's level and then shoot. You should see a difference in accuracy, as a canted gun is not accurate. Included ring fits any 30mm scope tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31puebGKYVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T1FR36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BKL", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B004T1FRCC", "title": "Hawke Sport Optics Airmax EV 3-9x40 AO Rifle Scope, Map 6 Reticle, 1/4 MOA, 1 Tube", "description": "Rifle scope 3-9x magnification 40mm objective lens (adjustable objective) 1 matte black mono tube 1/4 MOA (1/4 click value @ 100 yds) Map 6 reticle 10 yds to infinity parallax adjustment 44.1' to 14.7' field of view @ 100 yds 3.2 eye relief 16 oz. 12.30 long Incl. flip-open lens caps & all weather zoom ringOther Features:• Fast focus eyebell Black matte finish Spring-gun rated Waterproof Shockproof Fogproof Whether you target shoot professionally or plink for fun in your backyard Hawke Sport Optics rifle scopes are great for improving the accuracy of air guns & air rifles. This scope is part of Hawke's Airmax EV series and is capable of giving you an extra 20% field of view compared with standard rifle scopes. The MAP 6 Multi-Aim-Point reticle is also calibrated to work with nearly any rifle trajectory. Pick one up for your favorite airgun or air rifle today!", "text": "Hawke Sport Optics Airmax EV 3-9x40 AO Rifle Scope, Map 6 Reticle, 1/4 MOA, 1 Tube Rifle scope 3-9x magnification 40mm objective lens (adjustable objective) 1 matte black mono tube 1/4 MOA (1/4 click value @ 100 yds) Map 6 reticle 10 yds to infinity parallax adjustment 44.1' to 14.7' field of view @ 100 yds 3.2 eye relief 16 oz. 12.30 long Incl. flip-open lens caps & all weather zoom ringOther Features:• Fast focus eyebell Black matte finish Spring-gun rated Waterproof Shockproof Fogproof Whether you target shoot professionally or plink for fun in your backyard Hawke Sport Optics rifle scopes are great for improving the accuracy of air guns & air rifles. This scope is part of Hawke's Airmax EV series and is capable of giving you an extra 20% field of view compared with standard rifle scopes. The MAP 6 Multi-Aim-Point reticle is also calibrated to work with nearly any rifle trajectory. Pick one up for your favorite airgun or air rifle today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31kqrKKinJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T1FRCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hawke Sport Optics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 159.99}}
{"item_id": "B004T1FS9Y", "title": "Gamo Combo Pack .22 Caliber Pellets (TS-22, Hunter, Magnum, Master Point)", "description": "This Combo Pack Contains 4 Types of .22 Cal. Pellets: Master Point, TS-22, Magnum and Hunter", "text": "Gamo Combo Pack .22 Caliber Pellets (TS-22, Hunter, Magnum, Master Point) This Combo Pack Contains 4 Types of .22 Cal. Pellets: Master Point, TS-22, Magnum and Hunter", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r7aKy8S2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T1FS9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gamo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 19.1}}
