{"item_id": "B004T3QJH2", "title": "Quality Archery Products HDX Arrow Rest", "description": "The Ultra Rest HDX is our top of the line model. With its sleek design and extra versatility with the latest bows you will not be disappointed. The HDX holds all the features of the HD model. If you are the archer that demands nothing but the top of the line with al the bells and whistles, this is the model for you. Sleek curved capture bar for more versatility. Features Advanced Vibration Technology, Lock Down Technology and Velocity Drop Away Technology. The mounting block design is more compatible than ever before. The advanced vibration system forces peak vibration amplitude to a minimum while durable molded rubber creates a quiet comfortable field. You can quickly adjust the timing cord to the proper length even after it is clamped to the buss cable. The full draw indicator marks insure proper launcher position at full draw.", "text": "Quality Archery Products HDX Arrow Rest The Ultra Rest HDX is our top of the line model. With its sleek design and extra versatility with the latest bows you will not be disappointed. The HDX holds all the features of the HD model. If you are the archer that demands nothing but the top of the line with al the bells and whistles, this is the model for you. Sleek curved capture bar for more versatility. Features Advanced Vibration Technology, Lock Down Technology and Velocity Drop Away Technology. The mounting block design is more compatible than ever before. The advanced vibration system forces peak vibration amplitude to a minimum while durable molded rubber creates a quiet comfortable field. You can quickly adjust the timing cord to the proper length even after it is clamped to the buss cable. The full draw indicator marks insure proper launcher position at full draw.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sI03NmXEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T3QJH2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Quality Archery Designs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Rests"]], "price": 98.61}}
{"item_id": "B004T4RG3M", "title": "Fuzion Fish Eyes Rod and Reel", "description": "A color LCD screen transmits footage from an underwater camera, letting you spot -- and catch -- fish attracted by an included bait basket.The FishEyes Rod and Reel, with a built-in underwater video camera, allows you to see exactly what's happening underwater, in real time. Ideal for locating and catching fish -- or simply having fun exploring the underwater world, the set includes one FishEyes Rod & Reel device, two sinkers, and ten line attachment clip sets.FeaturesUnderwater video camera transmits live footage to your LCD screenBuilt-in LED light to capture underwater images in all light conditionsFishEyes Depth Control cast systemRemovable sun shade for optimal viewingFull color, full motion LCD screenIncluded bait basket attracts fish to the viewing area25-foot lineSpecificationsMeasures 3.9 by 5.5 by 25 inches (W x H x D)1.8-pound weightRequires four AA batteries (not included)Recommended for users age eight and upSome assembly requiredHooks and lures not included", "text": "Fuzion Fish Eyes Rod and Reel A color LCD screen transmits footage from an underwater camera, letting you spot -- and catch -- fish attracted by an included bait basket.The FishEyes Rod and Reel, with a built-in underwater video camera, allows you to see exactly what's happening underwater, in real time. Ideal for locating and catching fish -- or simply having fun exploring the underwater world, the set includes one FishEyes Rod & Reel device, two sinkers, and ten line attachment clip sets.FeaturesUnderwater video camera transmits live footage to your LCD screenBuilt-in LED light to capture underwater images in all light conditionsFishEyes Depth Control cast systemRemovable sun shade for optimal viewingFull color, full motion LCD screenIncluded bait basket attracts fish to the viewing area25-foot lineSpecificationsMeasures 3.9 by 5.5 by 25 inches (W x H x D)1.8-pound weightRequires four AA batteries (not included)Recommended for users age eight and upSome assembly requiredHooks and lures not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CYNDHKuIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T4RG3M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Spinning Combos"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004T6S90Y", "title": "Liroyal Led Bicycle Bike Flash Light Lamp Head", "description": "If you want to add that personal touch to your car, bike - lighting is one of the best ways Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to set More energy-efficient,with light & motion sensors Durable, High Impact, Rust Resistant Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproof?", "text": "Liroyal Led Bicycle Bike Flash Light Lamp Head If you want to add that personal touch to your car, bike - lighting is one of the best ways Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to set More energy-efficient,with light & motion sensors Durable, High Impact, Rust Resistant Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproof?", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AoYjWPrTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T6S90Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bicycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 1.6}}
{"item_id": "B004T84R7G", "title": "Winchester by Daisy Outdoor Products 1000 Wood Break Barrel (Brown/Black, 46.25 Inch)", "description": "Bearing the famous Winchester name, this .177 caliber break-barrel pellet rifle sends pellets downrange at 1,000 foot per second velocity. at 46.25\" in length and weighing 6.6 lbs., it's obvious that this is an air rifle designed for young adults and adults. The solid hardwood stock has a checkered grip. Truglo(R) fiber optic front sights, and micro-adjustable Truglo fiber optic rear sights rear help you quickly acquire your target. A 4 X 32 fog-proof and shock-proof air rifle scope with adjustable objective is standard on this gun.", "text": "Winchester by Daisy Outdoor Products 1000 Wood Break Barrel (Brown/Black, 46.25 Inch) Bearing the famous Winchester name, this .177 caliber break-barrel pellet rifle sends pellets downrange at 1,000 foot per second velocity. at 46.25\" in length and weighing 6.6 lbs., it's obvious that this is an air rifle designed for young adults and adults. The solid hardwood stock has a checkered grip. Truglo(R) fiber optic front sights, and micro-adjustable Truglo fiber optic rear sights rear help you quickly acquire your target. A 4 X 32 fog-proof and shock-proof air rifle scope with adjustable objective is standard on this gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21psQDgGSKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T84R7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004T8G5H6", "title": "Ameristep 3-D Leafy Poncho (Solid Mesh/Non-Woven Leafy)", "description": "Blend seamlessly into the background while hunting with the Ameristep 3-D leafy poncho. The ultimate accessory to Ameristep's hunting blinds, the 3-D poncho features a multi-textured leafy pattern that looks just like a leaf-covered shrub. Wear the poncho and you'll disappear into any wooded terrain. Available in a one-size-fits-most design, the poncho is great for turkey and varmint hunting.", "text": "Ameristep 3-D Leafy Poncho (Solid Mesh/Non-Woven Leafy) Blend seamlessly into the background while hunting with the Ameristep 3-D leafy poncho. The ultimate accessory to Ameristep's hunting blinds, the 3-D poncho features a multi-textured leafy pattern that looks just like a leaf-covered shrub. Wear the poncho and you'll disappear into any wooded terrain. Available in a one-size-fits-most design, the poncho is great for turkey and varmint hunting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51UtUw-4oOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T8G5H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ameristep", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 69.95}}
