{"item_id": "B004T8RX22", "title": "Daisy Outdoor Products B52 Slingshot (Yellow/Black, 8 Inch)", "description": "The B52 provides all the support you need for extra power and accuracy. Features molded sure-grip handle and solid steel frame with extra-wide fork. Flexible wrist support provides steady, stable support, then folds away for compact storage. Surgical-grade tubing and rugged release pouch. Shoots 1/4\", 3/8\", and 1/2\" steel or glass shot.", "text": "Daisy Outdoor Products B52 Slingshot (Yellow/Black, 8 Inch) The B52 provides all the support you need for extra power and accuracy. Features molded sure-grip handle and solid steel frame with extra-wide fork. Flexible wrist support provides steady, stable support, then folds away for compact storage. Surgical-grade tubing and rugged release pouch. Shoots 1/4\", 3/8\", and 1/2\" steel or glass shot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EtW2EXyCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004T8RX22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Daisy", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Slingshots"]], "price": 11.48}}
{"item_id": "B004TA9J2C", "title": "Official US Military Collapsible 2 Quart Water Canteen with M1 Cap", "description": "Official US Military Collapsible Water Canteen with M1 Cap. NSN 8465-01-118-8173. Does not come with Canteen Cover.", "text": "Official US Military Collapsible 2 Quart Water Canteen with M1 Cap Official US Military Collapsible Water Canteen with M1 Cap. NSN 8465-01-118-8173. Does not come with Canteen Cover.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pDMdoy2HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TA9J2C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Government Contractor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 9.5}}
{"item_id": "B004TAATM6", "title": "Field Logic Classic 18 Archery Block Target 51100", "description": "The Block Classic is the original open-layered archery target. The heat generated by the friction caused as the arrow slides between layers literally grabs and stops the arrow. This heat quickly dissipates, releasing the arrow. The first archery target to offer both easy arrow removal and long target life, regardless of arrow tip. Allows you to shoot broadheads/expandables. The size is 18 inches by 18 inches by 16 inches. Weighs 13.5 pounds.", "text": "Field Logic Classic 18 Archery Block Target 51100 The Block Classic is the original open-layered archery target. The heat generated by the friction caused as the arrow slides between layers literally grabs and stops the arrow. This heat quickly dissipates, releasing the arrow. The first archery target to offer both easy arrow removal and long target life, regardless of arrow tip. Allows you to shoot broadheads/expandables. The size is 18 inches by 18 inches by 16 inches. Weighs 13.5 pounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WKzOlwOhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TAATM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Logic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 65.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TAB7ZO", "title": "Wheeler Professional Reticle Leveling System", "description": "The Wheeler Professional Reticle Leveling System is a precision tool and technique designed to allow a scope to be perfectly leveled on any firearm with ease. CNC machining, factory adjusted calibration set screws, anodized aluminum construction and protective molded case put this instrument in a class of its own. The Barrel Clamp Level is attached to the guns barrel while the smaller Reference Level is placed on scope base, bottom half of a ring or other flat surface perpendicular to the vertical axis of the gun. The gun is then rotated until the Reference Level is aligned. The tuning adjustment knob on the Barrel Clamp Level is then turned until its level is centered to match the Reference Level. At this point the Barrel Clamp Level is calibrated to the guns axis. The Scope can be installed loosely and the Reference Level placed on top of the scopes turret cap. The scope is rotated until the Reference Level is aligned with the Barrel Clamp Level and then simply secured in place. The Wheeler PRLS is the most effective instrument available for precision scope alignment.", "text": "Wheeler Professional Reticle Leveling System The Wheeler Professional Reticle Leveling System is a precision tool and technique designed to allow a scope to be perfectly leveled on any firearm with ease. CNC machining, factory adjusted calibration set screws, anodized aluminum construction and protective molded case put this instrument in a class of its own. The Barrel Clamp Level is attached to the guns barrel while the smaller Reference Level is placed on scope base, bottom half of a ring or other flat surface perpendicular to the vertical axis of the gun. The gun is then rotated until the Reference Level is aligned. The tuning adjustment knob on the Barrel Clamp Level is then turned until its level is centered to match the Reference Level. At this point the Barrel Clamp Level is calibrated to the guns axis. The Scope can be installed loosely and the Reference Level placed on top of the scopes turret cap. The scope is rotated until the Reference Level is aligned with the Barrel Clamp Level and then simply secured in place. The Wheeler PRLS is the most effective instrument available for precision scope alignment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a56Z1ZooL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TAB7ZO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Wheeler", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 34.95}}
{"item_id": "B004TABTWU", "title": "Lyman Case Prep Xpress (115-Volt)", "description": "The Case Prep Xpress is the only \"All-Inclusive-InchSystem offering all the most popular case prep accessories driven by a high torque gear motor. The dump pan provides easy clean up of brass shavings. The best part is that all accessories are included from the start, no need to have to separately purchase expensive additional accessories. Also includes Primer Pocket Reamers and Cleaners Large and Small, Case Neck Brushes and Lube, Removable Dump Pan and Clean-up Brush", "text": "Lyman Case Prep Xpress (115-Volt) The Case Prep Xpress is the only \"All-Inclusive-InchSystem offering all the most popular case prep accessories driven by a high torque gear motor. The dump pan provides easy clean up of brass shavings. The best part is that all accessories are included from the start, no need to have to separately purchase expensive additional accessories. Also includes Primer Pocket Reamers and Cleaners Large and Small, Case Neck Brushes and Lube, Removable Dump Pan and Clean-up Brush", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417idJGljML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TABTWU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 124.79}}
{"item_id": "B004TAD7AW", "title": "Tec9 Triathlon Aero Time Trial Tri TT Bars", "description": "Easy clip-on installation. 6061-T6 Alloy. Fits bars from 31.8 to 25.4/26.0mm with supplied sleeves. Weight: 570gNew model has longer bars.Features:Easy clip-on installation6061 Aluminum bars and forged brackets, new long barsFits bars from 31.8 to 25.4 with supplied sleevesArm rests have removable padsMulti adjustable: bar length, bar angle, bar width, arm rest angle", "text": "Tec9 Triathlon Aero Time Trial Tri TT Bars Easy clip-on installation. 6061-T6 Alloy. Fits bars from 31.8 to 25.4/26.0mm with supplied sleeves. Weight: 570gNew model has longer bars.Features:Easy clip-on installation6061 Aluminum bars and forged brackets, new long barsFits bars from 31.8 to 25.4 with supplied sleevesArm rests have removable padsMulti adjustable: bar length, bar angle, bar width, arm rest angle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31svlaCRQSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TAD7AW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B004TADJ1Y", "title": "Caldwell XLA Pivot Model Bipod (13.5 - 27-Inch)", "description": "The Caldwell Bipod XLAs provide a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button. The legs are notched for easy indexing to a specific height. There is a connection point for sling attachment and a multi section leg that collapses forward allowing for convenient carry of the firearm. Soft rubber feet provide enhanced stability, while the padded bipod base protects the firearm’s forend.", "text": "Caldwell XLA Pivot Model Bipod (13.5 - 27-Inch) The Caldwell Bipod XLAs provide a stable shooting support that conveniently attaches to almost any firearm with a sling swivel stud. The lightweight aluminum design adds minimal weight and deploys quickly, with legs that instantly spring out to the shooting position with the touch of a button. The legs are notched for easy indexing to a specific height. There is a connection point for sling attachment and a multi section leg that collapses forward allowing for convenient carry of the firearm. Soft rubber feet provide enhanced stability, while the padded bipod base protects the firearm’s forend.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oW-kdulNL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TADJ1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 54.17}}
{"item_id": "B004TBA2BI", "title": "MagicShine MJ-818 Bicycle Tail Light", "description": "You WILL be seen with this super bright tail light. 100+ hour run time per charge (flash mode) Quickly and easily mounted to seat post or frame. Set includes tail light, mounting rings, charger and 4400mA - 7.4V Li-ion Battery pack with an integrated protection circuit to prevent over-charging or over-discharging and to balance the charge between cells. These packs are built with cells from LG Chem, the battery supplier for the new Chevy Volt!", "text": "MagicShine MJ-818 Bicycle Tail Light You WILL be seen with this super bright tail light. 100+ hour run time per charge (flash mode) Quickly and easily mounted to seat post or frame. Set includes tail light, mounting rings, charger and 4400mA - 7.4V Li-ion Battery pack with an integrated protection circuit to prevent over-charging or over-discharging and to balance the charge between cells. These packs are built with cells from LG Chem, the battery supplier for the new Chevy Volt!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z3IpcgixL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TBA2BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagicShine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 46.99}}
{"item_id": "B004TBO3A4", "title": "Magpul MAG248 GEN2 MBUS Rear Back-Up Sight", "description": "FeaturesImpact resistant polymer construction provides light weight and resists operational abuseSpring-loaded flip up sight easily activated from either side or by pressing the topDetent and spring pressure keeps sight erect but allows for unobstructed folding under impact, etc.Clamps to most any MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny/STANAG 4694 railed hand guard and provides the same height-over-bore as standard A2 ironsSpecificationsWeight, w/ hardware: 1.2 oz.Height above rail, stowed: ~0.51 in.Length, stowed: 2.6 in.Length, deployed: 1.5 in.NEW Features for GEN 2Reduced size for greater optics compatibilitySpring-locking fromnt sight post holds consistent elevation", "text": "Magpul MAG248 GEN2 MBUS Rear Back-Up Sight FeaturesImpact resistant polymer construction provides light weight and resists operational abuseSpring-loaded flip up sight easily activated from either side or by pressing the topDetent and spring pressure keeps sight erect but allows for unobstructed folding under impact, etc.Clamps to most any MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny/STANAG 4694 railed hand guard and provides the same height-over-bore as standard A2 ironsSpecificationsWeight, w/ hardware: 1.2 oz.Height above rail, stowed: ~0.51 in.Length, stowed: 2.6 in.Length, deployed: 1.5 in.NEW Features for GEN 2Reduced size for greater optics compatibilitySpring-locking fromnt sight post holds consistent elevation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eZmyeys-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TBO3A4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 38.7}}
{"item_id": "B004TDIDW6", "title": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Sight QD Digital Switch", "description": "The Sightmark Ultra Shot QD digital switch reflex sight was created to satisfy shooters' demands for a lightweight, durable, and accurate sight. Ideal for close-range, fast-moving targets, the sight is equipped with a digital switch button on the side that allows you to adjust variable brightness settings. No more messing with a tedious dial; just press the button and the sight will respond.The Sightmark Ultra Shot QD features a quick-detach mount that's perfect for quick removal when using iron sights or other accessories. The sight also includes an aluminum shield hood for added protection, making it even more durable than the original Ultra Shot. And shooters will love the matte black finish, which eliminates reflection and provides a military-like, tactical look. Other features include a wide field of view, a single 3 MOA dot reticle, parallax correction, a water-resistant body, unlimited eye relief, and a Weaver mount.An alternative to expensive mil-spec models, the Ultra Shot QD carries a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsReticle type: 4 patternReticle color: RedIlluminated reticle: YesBrightness settings: 1-5 and offMagnification: 1xObjective aperture: 33 x 24mmField of view: 105 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: InfiniteElevation adjustment: 50 MOAWindage adjustment: 50 MOAMOA adjustment (1 click): 1Finish/color: Matte blackBody material: AluminumMaximum recoil: Up to .50 caliber/600 GsWater resistant: YesShockproof: YesFogproof: NoLens coatings: AR redMount type: Weaver quick detachBattery type: AG5 (3)Battery life: 25 hours (high)Included accessories: Rubber lens cap, adjustment tools, batteryWarranty: Limited lifetime", "text": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Sight QD Digital Switch The Sightmark Ultra Shot QD digital switch reflex sight was created to satisfy shooters' demands for a lightweight, durable, and accurate sight. Ideal for close-range, fast-moving targets, the sight is equipped with a digital switch button on the side that allows you to adjust variable brightness settings. No more messing with a tedious dial; just press the button and the sight will respond.The Sightmark Ultra Shot QD features a quick-detach mount that's perfect for quick removal when using iron sights or other accessories. The sight also includes an aluminum shield hood for added protection, making it even more durable than the original Ultra Shot. And shooters will love the matte black finish, which eliminates reflection and provides a military-like, tactical look. Other features include a wide field of view, a single 3 MOA dot reticle, parallax correction, a water-resistant body, unlimited eye relief, and a Weaver mount.An alternative to expensive mil-spec models, the Ultra Shot QD carries a limited lifetime warranty.SpecificationsReticle type: 4 patternReticle color: RedIlluminated reticle: YesBrightness settings: 1-5 and offMagnification: 1xObjective aperture: 33 x 24mmField of view: 105 feet @ 100 yardsEye relief: InfiniteElevation adjustment: 50 MOAWindage adjustment: 50 MOAMOA adjustment (1 click): 1Finish/color: Matte blackBody material: AluminumMaximum recoil: Up to .50 caliber/600 GsWater resistant: YesShockproof: YesFogproof: NoLens coatings: AR redMount type: Weaver quick detachBattery type: AG5 (3)Battery life: 25 hours (high)Included accessories: Rubber lens cap, adjustment tools, batteryWarranty: Limited lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uaubKMNvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDIDW6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 99.0}}
{"item_id": "B004TDIEZW", "title": "Sightmark 7x Tactical Reflex/Holographic Slide to Side Magnifier", "description": "The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier with the slide to side mount is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in one combination. The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight for greater sighting range and improves target recognition, especially at long range distances. The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition over 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 200 yards. The Sightmark Tactical Magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view for superior target acquisition and high quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity. The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier features high-magnification for long-distance target acquisition. Designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon and other brands the Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can be mounted on most picatinny and weaver mounts", "text": "Sightmark 7x Tactical Reflex/Holographic Slide to Side Magnifier The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier with the slide to side mount is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in one combination. The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight for greater sighting range and improves target recognition, especially at long range distances. The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition over 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 200 yards. The Sightmark Tactical Magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view for superior target acquisition and high quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity. The Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier features high-magnification for long-distance target acquisition. Designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon and other brands the Sightmark 7x Tactical Magnifier can be mounted on most picatinny and weaver mounts", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A4aAbok6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDIEZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 132.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPPR2", "title": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Pro Spec Sight NV QD", "description": "NOTE:Please wipes the glass and led off with an optics cleaning cloth before using it.", "text": "Sightmark Ultra Shot Pro Spec Sight NV QD NOTE:Please wipes the glass and led off with an optics cleaning cloth before using it.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41he92CXHzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPPR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 107.49}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPQ26", "title": "Sightmark Ultra Dual Shot Pro Spec NV Sight QD", "description": "SM14002 Features:Ultra shot pro spec reflex sight.-Interlock internal locking system.Aluminum body with metal protective shield.Wide field of view.Multi-reticle (4 patterns).Adjustable reticle brightness.Parallax corrected.Unlimited eye relief.Adjustable quick detach weaver-mount.Water-resistant and shockproof.SIDE-MOUNTED RED LASER.Low power consumption.Neoprene cover.Multiple night vision settings and integrated red laser, double-pane glass system.Dimensions: -Weight: 1 lb.-Dimensions: 5'' H x 3'' W x 3'' D.Troubleshooting:If the unit turns off during use: Tighten the battery cap to ensure the cap is fully sealed. Remove and reinstall the battery (see page 5 of user manual).If the reticle is blurry or out of focus: Make sure the lens is clean and does not have any film, fingerprints, or debris covering the surface.If the unit does not turn on/off: If the unit will not turn on, remove and reinstall the battery. To turn off the unit, the button must be pressed for 3 seconds.If the reticle has a halo: Decrease the brightness level of the reticle. The halo is caused by excess illumination than is required for the current environment.If the unit is not holding zero: Double-check that the mount screws are tight and secured.See instruction manual and troubleshooting guide (linked below) for additional details", "text": "Sightmark Ultra Dual Shot Pro Spec NV Sight QD SM14002 Features:Ultra shot pro spec reflex sight.-Interlock internal locking system.Aluminum body with metal protective shield.Wide field of view.Multi-reticle (4 patterns).Adjustable reticle brightness.Parallax corrected.Unlimited eye relief.Adjustable quick detach weaver-mount.Water-resistant and shockproof.SIDE-MOUNTED RED LASER.Low power consumption.Neoprene cover.Multiple night vision settings and integrated red laser, double-pane glass system.Dimensions: -Weight: 1 lb.-Dimensions: 5'' H x 3'' W x 3'' D.Troubleshooting:If the unit turns off during use: Tighten the battery cap to ensure the cap is fully sealed. Remove and reinstall the battery (see page 5 of user manual).If the reticle is blurry or out of focus: Make sure the lens is clean and does not have any film, fingerprints, or debris covering the surface.If the unit does not turn on/off: If the unit will not turn on, remove and reinstall the battery. To turn off the unit, the button must be pressed for 3 seconds.If the reticle has a halo: Decrease the brightness level of the reticle. The halo is caused by excess illumination than is required for the current environment.If the unit is not holding zero: Double-check that the mount screws are tight and secured.See instruction manual and troubleshooting guide (linked below) for additional details", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41USyG-sKpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPQ26.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 149.0}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPQCG", "title": "Sightmark Ghost Hunter 1x24 Night Vision Goggle Kit", "description": "Sightmark Ghost Hunter 1x24 Night Vision Monocular delivers high quality image and resolution to view any night time scenario. This monocular is equipped with a head mount for comfortable, long lasting hands free operation. The head mount allows for the monocular to be flipped up when the monocular is not being used or down for operation. The 1x magnification allows users to maintain depth perception and see images clearly while navigating. Sightmark products are protected by Sightmark’s Limited Lifetime Warranty. Sightmark-Make Your Mark!", "text": "Sightmark Ghost Hunter 1x24 Night Vision Goggle Kit Sightmark Ghost Hunter 1x24 Night Vision Monocular delivers high quality image and resolution to view any night time scenario. This monocular is equipped with a head mount for comfortable, long lasting hands free operation. The head mount allows for the monocular to be flipped up when the monocular is not being used or down for operation. The 1x magnification allows users to maintain depth perception and see images clearly while navigating. Sightmark products are protected by Sightmark’s Limited Lifetime Warranty. Sightmark-Make Your Mark!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BMLrL%2BevL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPQCG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 284.86}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPSGU", "title": "Sightmark Ghost Hunter 2x24 Night Vision Riflescope", "description": "The Sightmark Ghost Hunter 2x24 riflescope kit is a versatile choice for your nighttime vision needs. In its default mode, the Ghost Hunter acts as a night vision riflescope, with a high-quality resolution that allows you to locate your target quickly and accurately. However, the Ghost Hunter also doubles as a night vision monocular for observational purposes. Regardless of its use, the Ghost Hunter produces a crisp, clear picture.This riflescope features a built-in, high-power infrared illuminator that helps you see in low-ambient light conditions or total darkness. The riflescope is also well built, with a high-quality polymer construction protected by the Sightmark limited lifetime warranty. And to protect the night vision intensifier tube, the scope automatically shuts off when exposed to bright light, helping ensure longevity. Built with a low profile, the Ghost Hunter is designed to co-witness with a reflex sight or holographic sight. Other features include a quick power-up, a 1/4-inch socket for a tripod or accessories, a durable nylon carrying case, and a lens cloth.SpecificationsGeneration: 1Magnification: 2xLens diameter: 24mmResolution: 36mmField of view: 25 degreesMinimum focusing distance: 1mEye relief: 12mmDiopter adjustment: +/-5Battery: 2 AATripod mount: 1/4 inchBattery life (with IR): 20 hoursBattery life (without IR): 72 hoursDimensions: 5.5 by 2.2 by 2.9 inchesWeight: 8.8 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetime", "text": "Sightmark Ghost Hunter 2x24 Night Vision Riflescope The Sightmark Ghost Hunter 2x24 riflescope kit is a versatile choice for your nighttime vision needs. In its default mode, the Ghost Hunter acts as a night vision riflescope, with a high-quality resolution that allows you to locate your target quickly and accurately. However, the Ghost Hunter also doubles as a night vision monocular for observational purposes. Regardless of its use, the Ghost Hunter produces a crisp, clear picture.This riflescope features a built-in, high-power infrared illuminator that helps you see in low-ambient light conditions or total darkness. The riflescope is also well built, with a high-quality polymer construction protected by the Sightmark limited lifetime warranty. And to protect the night vision intensifier tube, the scope automatically shuts off when exposed to bright light, helping ensure longevity. Built with a low profile, the Ghost Hunter is designed to co-witness with a reflex sight or holographic sight. Other features include a quick power-up, a 1/4-inch socket for a tripod or accessories, a durable nylon carrying case, and a lens cloth.SpecificationsGeneration: 1Magnification: 2xLens diameter: 24mmResolution: 36mmField of view: 25 degreesMinimum focusing distance: 1mEye relief: 12mmDiopter adjustment: +/-5Battery: 2 AATripod mount: 1/4 inchBattery life (with IR): 20 hoursBattery life (without IR): 72 hoursDimensions: 5.5 by 2.2 by 2.9 inchesWeight: 8.8 ouncesWarranty: Limited lifetime", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ixXmRkUQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPSGU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 299.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPTRS", "title": "Sightmark D50mm L105.5mm Sun Shade for TD Riflescope Accessory", "description": "Sightmark D50mm L105.5mm Sun Shade for TD Riflescope SM19004", "text": "Sightmark D50mm L105.5mm Sun Shade for TD Riflescope Accessory Sightmark D50mm L105.5mm Sun Shade for TD Riflescope SM19004", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f%2BUQCZrVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPTRS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 19.0}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPV58", "title": "Sightmark Flip-to-Side 30mm Mount", "description": "Sightmark 30 mm Slide - to - side Ring. Fits 30 mm magnifiers! The slide-to-side motion of this unit was created so you can use your 30 mm magnifier for long-distance shots and quickly move it to the side to use the 1X magnification of a reflex sight. Quick-detach lever. Made of tough aluminum. Backed by Sightmark's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Order Now! Sightmark 30 mm Slide-to-side Ring, Matte BlackThe QD mount tension is adjustable. Flip it open and rotate it clockwise or counter clockwise. Rail mount sticks the may have it too tight. Or use gun oil and apply it to the moving parts of the QD mount. The tension on the slide to side is also adjustable by loosening or tightening the set screws on the front and back of the mount. May have been set too tight at the factory", "text": "Sightmark Flip-to-Side 30mm Mount Sightmark 30 mm Slide - to - side Ring. Fits 30 mm magnifiers! The slide-to-side motion of this unit was created so you can use your 30 mm magnifier for long-distance shots and quickly move it to the side to use the 1X magnification of a reflex sight. Quick-detach lever. Made of tough aluminum. Backed by Sightmark's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Order Now! Sightmark 30 mm Slide-to-side Ring, Matte BlackThe QD mount tension is adjustable. Flip it open and rotate it clockwise or counter clockwise. Rail mount sticks the may have it too tight. Or use gun oil and apply it to the moving parts of the QD mount. The tension on the slide to side is also adjustable by loosening or tightening the set screws on the front and back of the mount. May have been set too tight at the factory", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F8z8uz-jL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPV58.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 38.76}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPVBW", "title": "Sightmark 3x Tactical Magnifier Slide to Side", "description": "The Sightmark 3x tactical magnifier allows shooters to quickly acquire the target, and then move the magnifier out of the way without having to detach the unit. Inspired by military and law enforcement applications, the magnifier is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in combination.The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight, boosting sighting range and improving target recognition--especially at medium range distances. The Sightmark 3x tactical magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition up to 200 yards and accurate target shooting at 100 yards. The magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view, and high-quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity.The Sightmark 3x is compatible with most Picatinny and Weaver mounts, and is designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon, and other brands. In addition, the magnifier's lightweight, waterproof, fogproof, and shatterproof frame provides durability in all elements.SpecificationsMagnification: 3xObjective: 29mmEye relief: 55mmField of view: 7.5 degreesTube diameter: 30mmMaterial: AluminumColor: Matte blackDimensions: 4.72 by 1.9 by 1.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 6.7 ounces", "text": "Sightmark 3x Tactical Magnifier Slide to Side The Sightmark 3x tactical magnifier allows shooters to quickly acquire the target, and then move the magnifier out of the way without having to detach the unit. Inspired by military and law enforcement applications, the magnifier is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in combination.The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight, boosting sighting range and improving target recognition--especially at medium range distances. The Sightmark 3x tactical magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition up to 200 yards and accurate target shooting at 100 yards. The magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view, and high-quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity.The Sightmark 3x is compatible with most Picatinny and Weaver mounts, and is designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon, and other brands. In addition, the magnifier's lightweight, waterproof, fogproof, and shatterproof frame provides durability in all elements.SpecificationsMagnification: 3xObjective: 29mmEye relief: 55mmField of view: 7.5 degreesTube diameter: 30mmMaterial: AluminumColor: Matte blackDimensions: 4.72 by 1.9 by 1.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 6.7 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OJ3gInrBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPVBW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 94.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPVJO", "title": "Sightmark 5x Tactical Reflex/Holographic Slide to Side Magnifier", "description": "The Sightmark 5x tactical magnifier allows shooters to quickly acquire the target, and then move the magnifier out of the way without having to detach the unit. Inspired by military and law enforcement applications, the magnifier is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in combination.The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight, boosting sighting range and improving target recognition--especially at medium range distances. The Sightmark 5x tactical magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition up to 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 150 yards. The magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view, and high-quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity.The Sightmark 5x is compatible with most Picatinny and Weaver mounts, and is designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon, and other brands. In addition, the magnifier's lightweight, waterproof, fogproof, and shatterproof frame provides durability in all elements.SpecificationsMagnification: 5xObjective: 29mmEye relief: 53mmField of view: 6 degreesTube diameter: 30mmMaterial: AluminumColor: Matte blackDimensions: 5.1 by 1.9 by 1.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 7.3 ounces", "text": "Sightmark 5x Tactical Reflex/Holographic Slide to Side Magnifier The Sightmark 5x tactical magnifier allows shooters to quickly acquire the target, and then move the magnifier out of the way without having to detach the unit. Inspired by military and law enforcement applications, the magnifier is designed for use in conjunction with holographic, collimated reflex, and other compatible weapons sights, giving the shooter the benefit of a reflex sight and scope in combination.The magnifier increases the magnification of the accompanying sight, boosting sighting range and improving target recognition--especially at medium range distances. The Sightmark 5x tactical magnifier can assist in quick target acquisition up to 350 yards and accurate target shooting at 150 yards. The magnifier also features extended eye relief for comfort, a wide field of view, and high-quality multicoated optics for improved visibility and clarity.The Sightmark 5x is compatible with most Picatinny and Weaver mounts, and is designed to work with EOTech, Aimpoint, Trijicon, and other brands. In addition, the magnifier's lightweight, waterproof, fogproof, and shatterproof frame provides durability in all elements.SpecificationsMagnification: 5xObjective: 29mmEye relief: 53mmField of view: 6 degreesTube diameter: 30mmMaterial: AluminumColor: Matte blackDimensions: 5.1 by 1.9 by 1.8 inches (W x H x D)Weight: 7.3 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LSwIAuGgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPVJO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 113.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TDPZU4", "title": "Sightmark .22LR Boresight", "description": "The Sightmark Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles of all types. Simply chamber the bore sight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark laser bore sight is available in several calibers and gages for use with all the most popular rifles and shotguns.", "text": "Sightmark .22LR Boresight The Sightmark Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles of all types. Simply chamber the bore sight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark laser bore sight is available in several calibers and gages for use with all the most popular rifles and shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41C2UhlHSeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDPZU4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 34.39}}
{"item_id": "B004TDQ0WQ", "title": "Sightmark .380 Boresight", "description": "The Sightmark Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles of all types. Simply chamber the bore sight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark laser bore sight is available in several calibers and gages for use with all the most popular rifles and shotguns.", "text": "Sightmark .380 Boresight The Sightmark Laser Bore Sight provides the most convenient and accurate method for sighting in rifles of all types. Simply chamber the bore sight like a regular bullet and a laser dot will show exactly where the rifle is aiming; it’s easy to sight in any scope without firing a single shot. Live fire is only needed to fine tune the weapon being sighted in order to compensate for inconsistencies, such as bullet drop due to distance. Perfect for hunters, competitive shooters and law enforcement, the Sightmark laser bore sight is sure to take the frustration out of sighting in almost any gun. It’s easy to use and will quickly save both time and money by avoiding prolonged live fire tests at the range; use the extra ammo for honing those shooting skills and for the hunt. A lightweight carrying pouch protects the laser for convenient use in the field. The Sightmark laser bore sight is available in several calibers and gages for use with all the most popular rifles and shotguns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OoAp2cdaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TDQ0WQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sightmark", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 27.95}}
{"item_id": "B004TEZH6A", "title": "RCBS Advanced Powder Measure Stand", "description": "The RCBS Advanced Powder Measure Stand will raise most Powder Measures 9-1/2˝ (with standard 7/8”–14 thread) leaving plenty of space for positioning a powder scale pan or cases in a loading block under the drop tube. The stand bolts easily to a reloading bench or table. It also serves as a stand for holding a Piggyback II, Piggyback—3 or —4 when not in use. NOTE: Not for use with Little Dandy powder measure.", "text": "RCBS Advanced Powder Measure Stand The RCBS Advanced Powder Measure Stand will raise most Powder Measures 9-1/2˝ (with standard 7/8”–14 thread) leaving plenty of space for positioning a powder scale pan or cases in a loading block under the drop tube. The stand bolts easily to a reloading bench or table. It also serves as a stand for holding a Piggyback II, Piggyback—3 or —4 when not in use. NOTE: Not for use with Little Dandy powder measure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-5MVAVvWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TEZH6A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 29.78}}
{"item_id": "B004TGWUPE", "title": "Confidence Power Plus Motorized Electric Treadmill", "description": "Minute for minute, treadmills are the ultimate fat burning machine, eliminating up to 900 calories an hour. The Confidence Power Plus treadmill makes them an affordable machine for every household, so you can be burning fat without the hassle of having to go to the gym or bracing the weather. It is ideal for people new to running and those looking to shed a few extra pounds, and with it's folding design and wheels, it is easy to store and roll away. 600W power motor. Runway Size: 38.5\" x 14\". Full product size: 49\" x 24\" x 11\". Weight of machine: 53 lbs Weight & Size of delivered package: 50.5\" x 25.5\" x 11.5\" 57 lbs.", "text": "Confidence Power Plus Motorized Electric Treadmill Minute for minute, treadmills are the ultimate fat burning machine, eliminating up to 900 calories an hour. The Confidence Power Plus treadmill makes them an affordable machine for every household, so you can be burning fat without the hassle of having to go to the gym or bracing the weather. It is ideal for people new to running and those looking to shed a few extra pounds, and with it's folding design and wheels, it is easy to store and roll away. 600W power motor. Runway Size: 38.5\" x 14\". Full product size: 49\" x 24\" x 11\". Weight of machine: 53 lbs Weight & Size of delivered package: 50.5\" x 25.5\" x 11.5\" 57 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SOmZTR1WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TGWUPE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Treadmills"]], "price": 199.99}}
