{"item_id": "B004THD4VC", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Detach Folding Ergonomic Bipod Foregrip Front Grip Combination For Airsoft - Paintball With Weaver-Picatinny Rails", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Detach Vertical Ergonomic Bipod Folding Forward/Front Grip Combination -Handle designed to fit and lock securely and simply on any standard 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny rail,mount, or handguard. Rated for use on Airsoft and Paintball weapons. Textured to ensure no slipping, featuring a fast easy Quick Detach Locking/Unlocking Lever- this grip will provide the shooter a major tactical edge. This grip will produce a natural \"fighting stance\" hold on your weapon for better accuracy & control and will improve performance in reaction, on target time and muzzle. Compact and lightweight, and made of supremely durable high density composite.The folding feature will allow you to fold the grip under so it is out of the way when not in use which can also be quite useful in smaller cases and scabbards that normally would require you to remove the grip first in order to fit your weapon. Features Ambidextrous pressure pad housing slots (one on each side of the grip), as well as an inner storage compartment great for spare batteries or small tools etc. The bipod feature is spring loaded and truly adds to what already is a great grip - simply twist the bottom knob and your grip transforms into a bipod!", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Detach Folding Ergonomic Bipod Foregrip Front Grip Combination For Airsoft - Paintball With Weaver-Picatinny Rails Official Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Detach Vertical Ergonomic Bipod Folding Forward/Front Grip Combination -Handle designed to fit and lock securely and simply on any standard 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny rail,mount, or handguard. Rated for use on Airsoft and Paintball weapons. Textured to ensure no slipping, featuring a fast easy Quick Detach Locking/Unlocking Lever- this grip will provide the shooter a major tactical edge. This grip will produce a natural \"fighting stance\" hold on your weapon for better accuracy & control and will improve performance in reaction, on target time and muzzle. Compact and lightweight, and made of supremely durable high density composite.The folding feature will allow you to fold the grip under so it is out of the way when not in use which can also be quite useful in smaller cases and scabbards that normally would require you to remove the grip first in order to fit your weapon. Features Ambidextrous pressure pad housing slots (one on each side of the grip), as well as an inner storage compartment great for spare batteries or small tools etc. The bipod feature is spring loaded and truly adds to what already is a great grip - simply twist the bottom knob and your grip transforms into a bipod!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XS3nPGNVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004THD4VC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B004TJEA8Q", "title": "2x Anti-slip Ice Cleats Shoe Boot Tread Grips Traction Crampon Chain Spike Sharp Snow Walking Walker", "description": "Brand new anti slip Snow Grippers Traction Crampons CleatsSpecifications:• Package includes: a pair of shoe chain ice spike cleats with Pouch & 1 Carabiner• Size: Easily fit the shoes of US size 5-10 ( Europe Size: 35-44 )• Weight: 350 grams ( 0.77 Lb )• Material: steel• Color: YellowFeatures:• Simple rinse clean via the tap or hose• Reduce the risk of injury from slips and falls when walk on ice, snow, mud and wet grass or other poor conditions• Thermoplastic elastomer with excellent elastic & high density manganese steel to ensure the maximum durability• Securely attached to your footwear & these slip-on spikes can dig into all types of terrain - ice, packed snow, wet rocks, concrete, and scree• Easy on/off to fit boots, sneakers, casual and dress shoes-- Wrap the front around your toe section, then stretch the back around your heel• Perfect solution for your winter worries, solve the problem of 'how to stay on your feet on ice and snow• Increase the productivity and enjoyment of a day on the winter outdoor.( Camping Hiking Fishing Hunting etc. )• Great item for winter outdoor enthusiast sportsmen workers hunter hiker ice fisherman snowmobiler farmer construction worker airport ramper walking the dog or those shoveling snowKindly Notice: this biding is NOT included the shoe/boots, the pictures are only for showing more item details for your information", "text": "2x Anti-slip Ice Cleats Shoe Boot Tread Grips Traction Crampon Chain Spike Sharp Snow Walking Walker Brand new anti slip Snow Grippers Traction Crampons CleatsSpecifications:• Package includes: a pair of shoe chain ice spike cleats with Pouch & 1 Carabiner• Size: Easily fit the shoes of US size 5-10 ( Europe Size: 35-44 )• Weight: 350 grams ( 0.77 Lb )• Material: steel• Color: YellowFeatures:• Simple rinse clean via the tap or hose• Reduce the risk of injury from slips and falls when walk on ice, snow, mud and wet grass or other poor conditions• Thermoplastic elastomer with excellent elastic & high density manganese steel to ensure the maximum durability• Securely attached to your footwear & these slip-on spikes can dig into all types of terrain - ice, packed snow, wet rocks, concrete, and scree• Easy on/off to fit boots, sneakers, casual and dress shoes-- Wrap the front around your toe section, then stretch the back around your heel• Perfect solution for your winter worries, solve the problem of 'how to stay on your feet on ice and snow• Increase the productivity and enjoyment of a day on the winter outdoor.( Camping Hiking Fishing Hunting etc. )• Great item for winter outdoor enthusiast sportsmen workers hunter hiker ice fisherman snowmobiler farmer construction worker airport ramper walking the dog or those shoveling snowKindly Notice: this biding is NOT included the shoe/boots, the pictures are only for showing more item details for your information", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sx9HFjPUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TJEA8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Astra Depot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Snow & Ice Equipment", "Crampons"]], "price": 7.38}}
{"item_id": "B004TKB146", "title": "Northstar Tactical Operations Sleeping Bag Hooded Mummy L.T.R. 30 Degrees, Compression sack with straps (Green)", "description": "Northstar products come with one function that is common throughout all products. Uncompromising quality, a product is only as good as the worst zipper or button so we make sure every part of the product is Northstar Tough and ready for use. You can see it-feel it- and most importantly DEPEND ON the quality of each item.", "text": "Northstar Tactical Operations Sleeping Bag Hooded Mummy L.T.R. 30 Degrees, Compression sack with straps (Green) Northstar products come with one function that is common throughout all products. Uncompromising quality, a product is only as good as the worst zipper or button so we make sure every part of the product is Northstar Tough and ready for use. You can see it-feel it- and most importantly DEPEND ON the quality of each item.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31w5ZBNRBoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TKB146.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
