{"item_id": "B004TLQ0L4", "title": "Water Gear Fin Socks", "description": "Water Gear's Fin Socks are designed to be worn with fins to reduce rubbing. Padded boots allow for longer workouts. Soft neoprene construction and flat-lock stitching. Durable neoprene with reinforced ankle for long life. Color coded size stitching.", "text": "Water Gear Fin Socks Water Gear's Fin Socks are designed to be worn with fins to reduce rubbing. Padded boots allow for longer workouts. Soft neoprene construction and flat-lock stitching. Durable neoprene with reinforced ankle for long life. Color coded size stitching.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21KuuCYTuWL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TLQ0L4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]]}}
