{"item_id": "B004TMA582", "title": "Buck TOPS Fixed CSAR-T Knife", "description": "When a tactical professional puts themselves in harms way, they need a rugged and reliable blade. The no-nonsense TOPS/Buck CSAR-T (Combat Search & Rescue Tool) Fixed is designed for optimal performance in the field. It features a stout, full tang 420HC stainless steel modified Tanto blade, and a tough, grooved G-10 handle, with Rocky Mountain Tread for strength and a secure grip. Adding versatility to the TOPS/Buck CSAR-T, the handle contains a hex driver for various tools, and is coated with a non-reflective Zirblast finish. Meant for extreme use such as cutting, chopping, penetrating, prying or most other tasks, the 690 is as hard core as it gets. When survival is the only option, this knife will perform. Check out the compatible Hex Tool Set.", "text": "Buck TOPS Fixed CSAR-T Knife When a tactical professional puts themselves in harms way, they need a rugged and reliable blade. The no-nonsense TOPS/Buck CSAR-T (Combat Search & Rescue Tool) Fixed is designed for optimal performance in the field. It features a stout, full tang 420HC stainless steel modified Tanto blade, and a tough, grooved G-10 handle, with Rocky Mountain Tread for strength and a secure grip. Adding versatility to the TOPS/Buck CSAR-T, the handle contains a hex driver for various tools, and is coated with a non-reflective Zirblast finish. Meant for extreme use such as cutting, chopping, penetrating, prying or most other tasks, the 690 is as hard core as it gets. When survival is the only option, this knife will perform. Check out the compatible Hex Tool Set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Y0dqwOjwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TMA582.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 99.24}}
{"item_id": "B004TMNPE8", "title": "Champion Ballistic Passive Ears and Eyes Combo", "description": "Champion now offers a convenient combination package of shooting glasses paired with sound dampening ear muffs. These safe, stylish and practical combos contain our 26NRR passive muffs, coupled with shooting glasses that feature ballistic rated lenses providing four times greater impact protection than ANSI Z87.1; meeting military standard MIL-PRF-31013, 3.5.1.1 ballistic resistance. Two combo kits are available offering either dark-green or pink hearing protection muffs with non-slip, one-piece, clear lens shooting glasses.", "text": "Champion Ballistic Passive Ears and Eyes Combo Champion now offers a convenient combination package of shooting glasses paired with sound dampening ear muffs. These safe, stylish and practical combos contain our 26NRR passive muffs, coupled with shooting glasses that feature ballistic rated lenses providing four times greater impact protection than ANSI Z87.1; meeting military standard MIL-PRF-31013, 3.5.1.1 ballistic resistance. Two combo kits are available offering either dark-green or pink hearing protection muffs with non-slip, one-piece, clear lens shooting glasses.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v-lolQrEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TMNPE8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B004TNWD40", "title": "Morakniv Companion Fixed Blade Outdoor Knife with Sandvik Carbon Steel Blade, Military Green, 4.1-Inch", "description": "The Mora Companion is the all-in-one knife for outdoor enthusiasts. A patterned, high-friction grip makes this well-balanced knife easy to handle. The MG Carbon features a 4.1-inch high carbon steel blade that achieves high hardness, sharpens easily and is exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "text": "Morakniv Companion Fixed Blade Outdoor Knife with Sandvik Carbon Steel Blade, Military Green, 4.1-Inch The Mora Companion is the all-in-one knife for outdoor enthusiasts. A patterned, high-friction grip makes this well-balanced knife easy to handle. The MG Carbon features a 4.1-inch high carbon steel blade that achieves high hardness, sharpens easily and is exceptionally tough. High carbon steels are preferred in applications that demand durability and frequent regrinding. The material is harder than stainless steel, allowing it to hold a sharper and more durably acute edge. Mora Knives are made from high-quality Sandvik steel. Sandvik knife steels are characterized by ultra-fine carbides that result in superb forging and hardening properties. The absence of large carbide deposits promotes excellent edge sharpness for optimum cutting performance. Morakniv has been manufacturing the highest-quality knives in Mora, Sweden since 1891. Professionals worldwide trust the quality materials and fine craftsmanship of Mora Knives. Mora knives feature ergonomically-designed handles and employ premium-quality knife steel that is optimally adapted to the task for which the knife is intended.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RSOV7Bn4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TNWD40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morakniv", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 13.5}}
{"item_id": "B004TOFZX0", "title": "Vortex Optics Riflescope Bubble Level for 1in Riflescope Tube BL1", "description": "Compatible with: 1-inch Riflescope Tube", "text": "Vortex Optics Riflescope Bubble Level for 1in Riflescope Tube BL1 Compatible with: 1-inch Riflescope Tube", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/2120wqoAkoL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TOFZX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 34.14}}
{"item_id": "B004TORQ5A", "title": "3 Pack of 1 Liter Survival Water Bags - Whirl Closure", "description": "Originally designed for laboratory work, Whirl-Pak bags make great emergency water collection, purification, and storage bags, and are also great for storing food. They're completely sterile and food-safe, and will not leach harmful chemicals into your water or food supply. They are shipped sealed; you can always tell that your bag is completely sterile and has never been used, since you have to remove a perforated tab prior to use. Each bag has a writable area for you to add notes (\"non-potable\" for instance). Whirl-Pak bags are ideal for survival kits, because they roll to very compact dimensions, weigh very little, and are incredibly tough. Several US Military Kits specify Whirl-Pak bags for emergency water collection, treatment, and storage. They can even be used to make an improvised solar vegetation still. The 4.0 mil wall thickness means that this is a durable bag, extremely resistant to puncture or tearing. These bags stand on their own thanks the gusseted bottom construction. This means you're unlikely to spill precious sterilized water. They are safe for use with chlorine tablets, iodine tablets, or UV purification systems.", "text": "3 Pack of 1 Liter Survival Water Bags - Whirl Closure Originally designed for laboratory work, Whirl-Pak bags make great emergency water collection, purification, and storage bags, and are also great for storing food. They're completely sterile and food-safe, and will not leach harmful chemicals into your water or food supply. They are shipped sealed; you can always tell that your bag is completely sterile and has never been used, since you have to remove a perforated tab prior to use. Each bag has a writable area for you to add notes (\"non-potable\" for instance). Whirl-Pak bags are ideal for survival kits, because they roll to very compact dimensions, weigh very little, and are incredibly tough. Several US Military Kits specify Whirl-Pak bags for emergency water collection, treatment, and storage. They can even be used to make an improvised solar vegetation still. The 4.0 mil wall thickness means that this is a durable bag, extremely resistant to puncture or tearing. These bags stand on their own thanks the gusseted bottom construction. This means you're unlikely to spill precious sterilized water. They are safe for use with chlorine tablets, iodine tablets, or UV purification systems.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KTE2rd1EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TORQ5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nas-co", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 6.97}}
{"item_id": "B004TSPURC", "title": "Morrell Yellow Jacket Discharge Target", "description": "The Morrell Yellow Jacket Discharge Crossbow Target helps you easily and safely unload your crossbow. Carry one bolt with a field point in your quiver. When you`re finished hunting or shooting for the day, fire it into this target to safely unload. Dimensions: 10 x 16 x 8. Weight: 6 lbs. Mfg Item Number: 140-1", "text": "Morrell Yellow Jacket Discharge Target The Morrell Yellow Jacket Discharge Crossbow Target helps you easily and safely unload your crossbow. Carry one bolt with a field point in your quiver. When you`re finished hunting or shooting for the day, fire it into this target to safely unload. Dimensions: 10 x 16 x 8. Weight: 6 lbs. Mfg Item Number: 140-1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41n8iUU0bbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TSPURC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Morrell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Targets"]], "price": 16.99}}
