{"item_id": "B004TWMB5W", "title": "Light My Fire SporkCase with 1 Spork", "description": "The SporkCase makes it easier to bring along your Spork regardless of if it’s a hike, a trek or a trip to the beach. With its snap closure, the SporkCase keeps dirt out on the way out and in on the way home. Made of PP material, the case is as tough as it is attractive. Fits 1 or 2 Spork Original or Spork Lefty.", "text": "Light My Fire SporkCase with 1 Spork The SporkCase makes it easier to bring along your Spork regardless of if it’s a hike, a trek or a trip to the beach. With its snap closure, the SporkCase keeps dirt out on the way out and in on the way home. Made of PP material, the case is as tough as it is attractive. Fits 1 or 2 Spork Original or Spork Lefty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GzoKUB--L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TWMB5W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 8.79}}
{"item_id": "B004TXMFQQ", "title": "spyderco Paramilitary 2 plain blade silver", "description": "Spyderco Para-Military2 Black Blade ~ C81GBK2 STATE OF THE ART MSRP $209.95 length overall 8.281 \" (210 mm) blade length 3.438 \" (87 mm) blade steel CPM S30V length closed 4.812 \", (122 mm) cutting edge 3.078 \" (78 mm) weight 3.9 oz (111 g) blade thickness .141 \" (3.5 mm) handle material G-10 Spyderco Para Military2 Black Blade The Spyderco Para-Military2 was released in 2010 with several changes over the classic version. Implementation of a new Bushing Pivot System generates fluid action and more consistent manufacturing tolerances. The G-10 handle is narrowed at the end improving ergonomics. The handle and blade have been profile thinner to eliminate hard angles when in the pocket in a closed position. It features a Compression Lock and an ambidextrous-friendly four way clip which carries tip-up/tip-down, left/right-hand that rests deep in a pocket. The Para-Military2 has a high-performance CPM S30V full flat-ground blade but we've lengthened the blade's tip and added additional surface jimping to both the spine and finger choil, then we coated it in non-reflective DLC (Diamond-Like Coating). Screw-together handle components, the pocket clip and the blade are coated in black to inhibit the folder's reflective qualities. Overall construction refinements are not drastic or even visible to the eye, but from the G-10 textured handle to the CPM S30V steel full flat black blade, everything is sharper, smoother and guaranteed to provide performance and user comfort. Made in Golden, Colorado U.S.A.", "text": "spyderco Paramilitary 2 plain blade silver Spyderco Para-Military2 Black Blade ~ C81GBK2 STATE OF THE ART MSRP $209.95 length overall 8.281 \" (210 mm) blade length 3.438 \" (87 mm) blade steel CPM S30V length closed 4.812 \", (122 mm) cutting edge 3.078 \" (78 mm) weight 3.9 oz (111 g) blade thickness .141 \" (3.5 mm) handle material G-10 Spyderco Para Military2 Black Blade The Spyderco Para-Military2 was released in 2010 with several changes over the classic version. Implementation of a new Bushing Pivot System generates fluid action and more consistent manufacturing tolerances. The G-10 handle is narrowed at the end improving ergonomics. The handle and blade have been profile thinner to eliminate hard angles when in the pocket in a closed position. It features a Compression Lock and an ambidextrous-friendly four way clip which carries tip-up/tip-down, left/right-hand that rests deep in a pocket. The Para-Military2 has a high-performance CPM S30V full flat-ground blade but we've lengthened the blade's tip and added additional surface jimping to both the spine and finger choil, then we coated it in non-reflective DLC (Diamond-Like Coating). Screw-together handle components, the pocket clip and the blade are coated in black to inhibit the folder's reflective qualities. Overall construction refinements are not drastic or even visible to the eye, but from the G-10 textured handle to the CPM S30V steel full flat black blade, everything is sharper, smoother and guaranteed to provide performance and user comfort. Made in Golden, Colorado U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512dpFULNoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TXMFQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 149.99}}
{"item_id": "B004TZ86M6", "title": "Sawyer PointONE All in One Filter", "description": "FEATURES of the Sawyer PointONE All in One Filter Gives you the ability to use the Sawyer PointONE 0.10 Absolute Micron Water Filter attached to a squeeze pouch, attached to a standard 5 gallon bucket, or attached to your home faucet The \"build your own gravity system\" can yield up to 540 gallons of clean water per day from any fresh water source Kit includes: the Sawyer 0.1 Micron Absolute Micron Hollow Fiber Membrane Screw On/Off Filter, 32 oz Squeeze Pouch, 2 Pop-up Drinking Spouts, 1 bucket adapter kit, 1 faucet adapter, and 1 filter cleaner Life Expectancy: 1 Million Gallons Guaranteed Bucket not included", "text": "Sawyer PointONE All in One Filter FEATURES of the Sawyer PointONE All in One Filter Gives you the ability to use the Sawyer PointONE 0.10 Absolute Micron Water Filter attached to a squeeze pouch, attached to a standard 5 gallon bucket, or attached to your home faucet The \"build your own gravity system\" can yield up to 540 gallons of clean water per day from any fresh water source Kit includes: the Sawyer 0.1 Micron Absolute Micron Hollow Fiber Membrane Screw On/Off Filter, 32 oz Squeeze Pouch, 2 Pop-up Drinking Spouts, 1 bucket adapter kit, 1 faucet adapter, and 1 filter cleaner Life Expectancy: 1 Million Gallons Guaranteed Bucket not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IQO-zGt6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004TZ86M6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Purifiers"]], "price": 50.84}}
{"item_id": "B004U4H6EK", "title": "Redfield .22 See-Thru Dovetail Rings", "description": "These convenient See-Thru Rings are designed to utilize iron sights or your rimfire rifle scope for quick target acquisition. The easy-to-install rings deliver legendary holding power for 1-inch scopes. They are precision machined to tight tolerances for a secure fit. The rings feature aircraft-grade aluminum for strength and weight reduction, and quickly mount to 3/8-inch dovetail receivers.", "text": "Redfield .22 See-Thru Dovetail Rings These convenient See-Thru Rings are designed to utilize iron sights or your rimfire rifle scope for quick target acquisition. The easy-to-install rings deliver legendary holding power for 1-inch scopes. They are precision machined to tight tolerances for a secure fit. The rings feature aircraft-grade aluminum for strength and weight reduction, and quickly mount to 3/8-inch dovetail receivers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NHzISW2HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U4H6EK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U4H7NK", "title": "Redfield Top Mount Base Pair for Remington 700, Howa 1500", "description": "The rugged hold of Redfield is now available in front and rear bases for the most popular firearms. Redfield Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept top mount cross lock rings from Redfield, Weaver and Simmons.", "text": "Redfield Top Mount Base Pair for Remington 700, Howa 1500 The rugged hold of Redfield is now available in front and rear bases for the most popular firearms. Redfield Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept top mount cross lock rings from Redfield, Weaver and Simmons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bOGb55gqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U4H7NK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 6.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U4H8S4", "title": "Redfield Top Mount Base Pair for Marlin Lever Actions 336, 30", "description": "The rugged hold of Redfield is now available in front and rear bases for the most popular firearms. Redfield Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept top mount cross lock rings from Redfield, Weaver and Simmons.", "text": "Redfield Top Mount Base Pair for Marlin Lever Actions 336, 30 The rugged hold of Redfield is now available in front and rear bases for the most popular firearms. Redfield Base Pairs feature tough, lightweight aluminum construction to hold up to the most powerful recoil. The cross lock design means a tight, secure fit on your firearm. These bases accept top mount cross lock rings from Redfield, Weaver and Simmons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lS-9-b8yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U4H8S4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Redfield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 6.88}}
{"item_id": "B004U5PV5A", "title": "Planet Bike SuperFlash Turbo Tail Light", "description": "1 Watt Power LED plus 2 red LEDs for visibility up to 1 mile. Highly visible, even in day light.", "text": "Planet Bike SuperFlash Turbo Tail Light 1 Watt Power LED plus 2 red LEDs for visibility up to 1 mile. Highly visible, even in day light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415deugWlzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U5PV5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Planet Bike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 27.9}}
{"item_id": "B004U6C8D2", "title": "G.I. Trioxane Heating Fuel Bars", "description": "Trioxane Heating Fuel & Fire Starters - Originally Used To Heat Meal Rations In The Field. Each Box Contains 3 Individually Wrapped Bars. US Surplus.", "text": "G.I. Trioxane Heating Fuel Bars Trioxane Heating Fuel & Fire Starters - Originally Used To Heat Meal Rations In The Field. Each Box Contains 3 Individually Wrapped Bars. US Surplus.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BBjqq1q0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U6C8D2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Numrich Gun Parts Corp.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 5.9}}
{"item_id": "B004U6HYSQ", "title": "Spyderco byrd Robin2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Robin2 folding knife, from the affordably-priced byrd line of knives produced by innovative cutlery company Spyderco, is a solid, versatile, mid-sized knife. A full flat-ground blade is made of high-carbon 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, with a convenient comet-shaped hole for fast and easy one-handed opening.Steady grip is essential when using a knife, which is why Spyderco placed cross-hatched jimping along the spine, creating nonslip grip where your thumb rests, for tactile resistance that ensures safe, accurate cutting. The handle is made of G-10, an epoxy-filled laminate with a weave-texture similar to cloth, which provides secure and steady grip when cutting, and resists chemicals, oil and temperature extremes. A four-way steel clip and lanyard hole offer a variety of carrying configurations, while the back lock has a David Boye cut-away dent, a safety feature allowing tight gripping without accidentally releasing the lock.Specifications5.7-inch open length3.3-inch closed length2.4-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade1.875-inch cutting edge0.4-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.4-ounce weightG-10 handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "text": "Spyderco byrd Robin2 Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife The Robin2 folding knife, from the affordably-priced byrd line of knives produced by innovative cutlery company Spyderco, is a solid, versatile, mid-sized knife. A full flat-ground blade is made of high-carbon 8Cr13MoV stainless steel, with a convenient comet-shaped hole for fast and easy one-handed opening.Steady grip is essential when using a knife, which is why Spyderco placed cross-hatched jimping along the spine, creating nonslip grip where your thumb rests, for tactile resistance that ensures safe, accurate cutting. The handle is made of G-10, an epoxy-filled laminate with a weave-texture similar to cloth, which provides secure and steady grip when cutting, and resists chemicals, oil and temperature extremes. A four-way steel clip and lanyard hole offer a variety of carrying configurations, while the back lock has a David Boye cut-away dent, a safety feature allowing tight gripping without accidentally releasing the lock.Specifications5.7-inch open length3.3-inch closed length2.4-inch 8Cr13MoV steel blade1.875-inch cutting edge0.4-inch blade hole0.09-inch blade thickness2.4-ounce weightG-10 handle materialWarrantySypderco knives include a limited manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About SpydercoThinking beyond established knife industry practices has allowed Spyderco to introduce new innovations, including one-hand opening, serrations on a folder, and a clip to attach a knife to a pocket. Spyderco remains dedicated to researching and developing improved, better-performing materials with function and reliability, and its unique cutlery line is a result of designing ergonomic, functional tools. The company puts its new products through rigorous testing prior to release, examining edge retention with a CATRA machine, looking for rust development with Q-FOG, checking the force needed to open and close a knife, and analyzing numerous other technical details.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KBUu5qfwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U6HYSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B004U6OVZU", "title": "Spyderco Ladybug3 FRN H-1 Hawkbill, Yellow", "description": "A longstanding bestseller and the smallest locking folder in the Spyderco family, is the Ladybug. You are veiwing a variant of the standard Ladybug with an H-1 steel Hawkbill blade, congratulations. H-1 folders and fixed blades are a collection of water-friendly knives Spyderco calls their Salt Series. As part of this series the Ladybug3 Salt Hawkbill uses H-1 which is a nitrogen-based blade alloy rather than carbon-based. The elimination of carbon in the steel renders it one-hundred percent rust proof but like its carbon-steel cousins, H-1 takes a hard sharpened cutting edge and earns high marks for edge retention. Similar to an extended cat’s claw the blade wraps around what you’re cutting, functionally drawing the cut object in closer and in continuous contact with the sharp edge while the curved hook restrains material from sliding off/away from the blade. The H-1 hollow ground blade is a SpyderEdge configuration. The Hawkbill shape metamorphosis a keychain-sized folder into an impressive cutting tool. Its lightweight FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with Bi-Directional Texturing which resists slipping in the hand and is high-visibility Marine Yellow making it easily spotted on the ground or in water. The Ladybug Hawkbill Salt is clip-less with a lanyard hole for threading through a thong or key-ring.", "text": "Spyderco Ladybug3 FRN H-1 Hawkbill, Yellow A longstanding bestseller and the smallest locking folder in the Spyderco family, is the Ladybug. You are veiwing a variant of the standard Ladybug with an H-1 steel Hawkbill blade, congratulations. H-1 folders and fixed blades are a collection of water-friendly knives Spyderco calls their Salt Series. As part of this series the Ladybug3 Salt Hawkbill uses H-1 which is a nitrogen-based blade alloy rather than carbon-based. The elimination of carbon in the steel renders it one-hundred percent rust proof but like its carbon-steel cousins, H-1 takes a hard sharpened cutting edge and earns high marks for edge retention. Similar to an extended cat’s claw the blade wraps around what you’re cutting, functionally drawing the cut object in closer and in continuous contact with the sharp edge while the curved hook restrains material from sliding off/away from the blade. The H-1 hollow ground blade is a SpyderEdge configuration. The Hawkbill shape metamorphosis a keychain-sized folder into an impressive cutting tool. Its lightweight FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with Bi-Directional Texturing which resists slipping in the hand and is high-visibility Marine Yellow making it easily spotted on the ground or in water. The Ladybug Hawkbill Salt is clip-less with a lanyard hole for threading through a thong or key-ring.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518yxInq4vL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U6OVZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U6Q5YA", "title": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Black VTAC-MK2-BK", "description": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Black VTAC-MK2-BK", "text": "Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Black VTAC-MK2-BK Viking Tactics Wide Padded Sling, Black VTAC-MK2-BK", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31f5qE%2BEgeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U6Q5YA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Viking Tactics", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B004U8CP88", "title": "Ultralight Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Piezo Ignition 3.9oz", "description": "Ultralight Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Piezo Ignition 3.9oz", "text": "Ultralight Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Piezo Ignition 3.9oz Ultralight Backpacking Canister Camp Stove with Piezo Ignition 3.9oz", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d1VuVFfmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8CP88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Housweety", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 5.74}}
{"item_id": "B004U8I6N6", "title": "Champion DuraSeal Double Spinner Target", "description": "This durable Champion Spinning Double Target is now available in our wire ground mount. Just like the rest of our existing DuraSeal line, this target is easy to use and provides hours of target practice. DuraSeal is constructed of a non-metal, self-sealing material that absorbs hundreds of rounds from even the largest caliber rifles and handguns and still keeps its shape. Weighing 80% less than metal targets, these auto resetting targets let bullets pass through with minimal damage—prolonging the life of the target.", "text": "Champion DuraSeal Double Spinner Target This durable Champion Spinning Double Target is now available in our wire ground mount. Just like the rest of our existing DuraSeal line, this target is easy to use and provides hours of target practice. DuraSeal is constructed of a non-metal, self-sealing material that absorbs hundreds of rounds from even the largest caliber rifles and handguns and still keeps its shape. Weighing 80% less than metal targets, these auto resetting targets let bullets pass through with minimal damage—prolonging the life of the target.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eBKLR4EGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8I6N6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 15.19}}
{"item_id": "B004U8IEOC", "title": "Champion LE 24x45-Inch Green Police B27FSA Silhouette Target (Pack of 10)", "description": "Practice your personal-defense or law enforcement skills with our 10-pack of green B-27 Silhouette Targets. These large, 45\"x24\", paper targets from Champion feature a high contrast green silhouette, precision scoring rings, and a data table to make tracking progress easy. Our LE B-27 Silhouette targets are ideal range targets for realistic practice to hone your precision shooting skills.", "text": "Champion LE 24x45-Inch Green Police B27FSA Silhouette Target (Pack of 10) Practice your personal-defense or law enforcement skills with our 10-pack of green B-27 Silhouette Targets. These large, 45\"x24\", paper targets from Champion feature a high contrast green silhouette, precision scoring rings, and a data table to make tracking progress easy. Our LE B-27 Silhouette targets are ideal range targets for realistic practice to hone your precision shooting skills.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WOOkIYJwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8IEOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Champion", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S07S", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Brass Jag Kit (13-Piece)", "description": "Hoppes Deluxe Jag Kit Orange 13 Piece, Clam", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Brass Jag Kit (13-Piece) Hoppes Deluxe Jag Kit Orange 13 Piece, Clam", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PE%2BGB068L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S07S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Jags"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S0D2", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Deluxe Pistol Cleaning Kit (9-Piece)", "description": "Great compact cleaning kit for the bench or field. Includes .22, .357, .40, and .45 caliber convenient storage case/handle.", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Deluxe Pistol Cleaning Kit (9-Piece) Great compact cleaning kit for the bench or field. Includes .22, .357, .40, and .45 caliber convenient storage case/handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AEiwr5VBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S0D2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 12.33}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S0K0", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil Aerosol (10-Ounce)", "description": "Convenient 10-ounce aerosol can of Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil is a necessity in the field when caring for your firearm. Its formulated to perfection with a refined high-viscosity oil. Use on your firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. Extra-long lasting and does not harden, gum, or expire. Compact and lightweight for easy transport.", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil Aerosol (10-Ounce) Convenient 10-ounce aerosol can of Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil is a necessity in the field when caring for your firearm. Its formulated to perfection with a refined high-viscosity oil. Use on your firearms, fishing reels, and other precision mechanisms. Extra-long lasting and does not harden, gum, or expire. Compact and lightweight for easy transport.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Mr-NJXYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S0K0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 14.68}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S0OG", "title": "Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil Wipes (60-Count)", "description": "Convenient lubricating gun oil wipes to take out in the field with you. Ideal for quick application. Drives out moisture and reduces rust. Wipes lubricate by leaving a thin layer of oil.", "text": "Hoppe's No. 9 Lubricating Oil Wipes (60-Count) Convenient lubricating gun oil wipes to take out in the field with you. Ideal for quick application. Drives out moisture and reduces rust. Wipes lubricate by leaving a thin layer of oil.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sMdF8eE1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S0OG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 5.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S12C", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Zippered Storage Case", "description": "BoreSnake Zippered Black Case fits all BoreSnakes and includes bonus pull handle. Secure zippered case secures and stores your BoreSnake (not included). Extremely packable.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Zippered Storage Case BoreSnake Zippered Black Case fits all BoreSnakes and includes bonus pull handle. Secure zippered case secures and stores your BoreSnake (not included). Extremely packable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gVAl1H-eL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S12C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S20I", "title": "Hoppe's Elite Gun Oil with T3, 4-Ounce Bottle", "description": "The Hoppe's Elite cleaning line was designed with the active hunter and shooter in mind. This advanced high-tech performance technology outperforms the standard cleaners and oils on the shelf today. Take it to the next level, the ELITE level. Elite Pillow Packs are single use gun oil in field ready tubes. Spout tip for precise application on each tube. Now with special T3 additive which contains liquid molybdenum and liquid PTFE. Elite PTFE has the highest coefficient of friction know to man. Developed from dental drill oil which spins up to 1.5 million RPM. Thin coat technology will not separate or breakdown. Long-lasting corrosion protection.", "text": "Hoppe's Elite Gun Oil with T3, 4-Ounce Bottle The Hoppe's Elite cleaning line was designed with the active hunter and shooter in mind. This advanced high-tech performance technology outperforms the standard cleaners and oils on the shelf today. Take it to the next level, the ELITE level. Elite Pillow Packs are single use gun oil in field ready tubes. Spout tip for precise application on each tube. Now with special T3 additive which contains liquid molybdenum and liquid PTFE. Elite PTFE has the highest coefficient of friction know to man. Developed from dental drill oil which spins up to 1.5 million RPM. Thin coat technology will not separate or breakdown. Long-lasting corrosion protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tQETob43L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S20I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 10.5}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S294", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Venom Gun Oil with T3, 4-Ounce Bottle", "description": "There is a reason they say \"slippery as a snake.\" The new gun oil for BoreSnake contains a special T3 additive which contains liquid molybdenum and liquid PTFE. Elite PTFE has the highest coefficient of friction known to man. Developed from dental drill oil which spins up to 1.5 million RPM. Thin coat technology that will not separate or breakdown. Long-lasting corrosion protection.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Venom Gun Oil with T3, 4-Ounce Bottle There is a reason they say \"slippery as a snake.\" The new gun oil for BoreSnake contains a special T3 additive which contains liquid molybdenum and liquid PTFE. Elite PTFE has the highest coefficient of friction known to man. Developed from dental drill oil which spins up to 1.5 million RPM. Thin coat technology that will not separate or breakdown. Long-lasting corrosion protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QgDLW7yfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S294.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.49}}
{"item_id": "B004U8S2HQ", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Venom Gun Cleaner, 4-Ounce Bottle", "description": "How do you make the worlds fastest bore cleaner faster? Give it some bite! Introducing BoreSnake Venom Gun Cleaner. Formulated to work with the unique BoreSnake design to remove more carbon and other fouling in one pass.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Venom Gun Cleaner, 4-Ounce Bottle How do you make the worlds fastest bore cleaner faster? Give it some bite! Introducing BoreSnake Venom Gun Cleaner. Formulated to work with the unique BoreSnake design to remove more carbon and other fouling in one pass.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NgO8M1S8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U8S2HQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 5.59}}
{"item_id": "B004U995N0", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FP3-L Field Pup, 4-Inch Fixed Blade Knife with Leather Sheath, Satin", "description": "", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FP3-L Field Pup, 4-Inch Fixed Blade Knife with Leather Sheath, Satin", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/212Nttm1%2BiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U995N0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B004U9KIUE", "title": "Zero Friction Tour 3-Prong Golf Tees", "description": "The Zero Friction Original 3-Prong Golf Tee has LESS RESISTANCE, which means MORE DISTANCE on the course. Our unique designed tee has a 3-prong top that significantly reduces the contact area between the golf ball and the tee, providing maximum distance and accuracy. Zero Friction has established itself as the No. 1 Performance Golf Tee on the PGA Tour with over 70 TOUR victories and more than 370 top-ten finishes. The Zero Friction Golf Tee is manufactured using bio-composite materials. for optimum performance, place one prong towards the target.", "text": "Zero Friction Tour 3-Prong Golf Tees The Zero Friction Original 3-Prong Golf Tee has LESS RESISTANCE, which means MORE DISTANCE on the course. Our unique designed tee has a 3-prong top that significantly reduces the contact area between the golf ball and the tee, providing maximum distance and accuracy. Zero Friction has established itself as the No. 1 Performance Golf Tee on the PGA Tour with over 70 TOUR victories and more than 370 top-ten finishes. The Zero Friction Golf Tee is manufactured using bio-composite materials. for optimum performance, place one prong towards the target.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41v-vnt1GCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004U9KIUE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004UASB3E", "title": "Faulk's Walnut Crow Call", "description": "Crow call in walnut with cherry tip. Excellent tone for adult crows. Apply slight pressure on tips to get tone of young crows.", "text": "Faulk's Walnut Crow Call Crow call in walnut with cherry tip. Excellent tone for adult crows. Apply slight pressure on tips to get tone of young crows.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/317sKLgmoAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UASB3E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Faulk&#39;s Game Calls", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls"]], "price": 13.29}}
{"item_id": "B004UB5PG4", "title": "G.I. 7 Pocket Bandoleer", "description": "This is a military surplus, olive drab bandoleer with seven pockets, carry strap and safety pin. Manufactured under various military contracts, therefore actual material types, markings and dates vary. We cannot sort specific styles, but most of our bandoleers are nylon. It measures 28\" long x 6-1/4\" high.", "text": "G.I. 7 Pocket Bandoleer This is a military surplus, olive drab bandoleer with seven pockets, carry strap and safety pin. Manufactured under various military contracts, therefore actual material types, markings and dates vary. We cannot sort specific styles, but most of our bandoleers are nylon. It measures 28\" long x 6-1/4\" high.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31bv7Z5BnZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UB5PG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Numrich Gun Parts Corp.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 3.45}}
