{"item_id": "B004UBWYWC", "title": "Ulimate Cliploader UCL22 Mag Loader", "description": "Easy to use. Saves your thumbs. Saves time and aggravation. The Ultimate Cliploader will load a 10 round magazine in as little as 3 seconds. Empty a 50 round box of 22 rimfire ammunition into the hopper, insert a magazine and 10 rounds are automatically loaded into the magazine.", "text": "Ulimate Cliploader UCL22 Mag Loader Easy to use. Saves your thumbs. Saves time and aggravation. The Ultimate Cliploader will load a 10 round magazine in as little as 3 seconds. Empty a 50 round box of 22 rimfire ammunition into the hopper, insert a magazine and 10 rounds are automatically loaded into the magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IcLDCdLYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UBWYWC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Cliploader", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 12.36}}
{"item_id": "B004UDLVC4", "title": "Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack", "description": "FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack Sturdy bicycle storage for your home or garage Independently adjustable arms to hold all bikes Mounts directly to wall stud Soft rubber cradles won't damage frame's finish Durable mounting hardware included Assembly required SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack Load Capacity: 70 lbs Mount Dimensions: 11.8 x 3.6 x 0.38\" / 300 x 92 x 11 mm Cradle Distance to Wall: 13.5\" / 343 mm", "text": "Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack FEATURES of the Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack Sturdy bicycle storage for your home or garage Independently adjustable arms to hold all bikes Mounts directly to wall stud Soft rubber cradles won't damage frame's finish Durable mounting hardware included Assembly required SPECIFICATIONS of the Feedback Sports Velo Wall Rack Load Capacity: 70 lbs Mount Dimensions: 11.8 x 3.6 x 0.38\" / 300 x 92 x 11 mm Cradle Distance to Wall: 13.5\" / 343 mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CIdJH5gVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UDLVC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags"]], "price": 27.0}}
