{"item_id": "B004UJ6QBO", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Universal Reloading Tray", "description": "The Universal Reloading Tray is highly versatile. It can be used with a wide variety of rifle cartridges from .17 caliber up to .458 caliber. Also works well for handgun cartridges 9 mm to 500 S&W.; 50 round capacity. Conveniently holds brass during different stages of reloading process.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Universal Reloading Tray The Universal Reloading Tray is highly versatile. It can be used with a wide variety of rifle cartridges from .17 caliber up to .458 caliber. Also works well for handgun cartridges 9 mm to 500 S&W.; 50 round capacity. Conveniently holds brass during different stages of reloading process.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ZpWQALQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UJ6QBO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 8.92}}
{"item_id": "B004UJ877A", "title": "Buck Commander Pistol Range Bag", "description": "The Buck Commander Pistol Range Bag is sized to fit two large frame semi-auto pistols or revolvers. This high-quality soft-case bag has a large, wide-open space that can be customized with gear dividers based on your needs and preferences. The bag offers a main interior pocket that has a dual slider opening for easy access to contents and two dual zippered slash pockets with flannel pockets to store handguns. Buck Commander Range Bags offer heavy-duty, weather-resistant, 600D Polyester construction and a lockable zipper and security loops for adding your own padlock to keep your case, and its contents, secure. The bag has heavy-binding seams with two rows of locked stitching for extra durability and long-lasting, wrap-around webbing handles for additional support. Zippers are heavyweight and durable and have large, easy-access zipper pulls. The adjustable shoulder strap is made of strong, tactical webbing. The large main compartment offers multiple internal and external pockets. The Pistol Range Bag has MOLLE compatible sewn-in webbing on the back of the bag for attaching Speed Clip Accessory Pouches on the outside of the bag for even more storage. Protect and transport your handguns and other range-day gear with Buck Commander high-quality soft-case bags. Each of the three different sized bags in the lineup have unique configurations, year are roomy enough to store ammunition, tools, targets, binoculars, gun care supplies or nearly anything else you want to take to the range. Check out the Shooter's Bag, the Pistol Range Bag, or the Deluxe Range Bag.", "text": "Buck Commander Pistol Range Bag The Buck Commander Pistol Range Bag is sized to fit two large frame semi-auto pistols or revolvers. This high-quality soft-case bag has a large, wide-open space that can be customized with gear dividers based on your needs and preferences. The bag offers a main interior pocket that has a dual slider opening for easy access to contents and two dual zippered slash pockets with flannel pockets to store handguns. Buck Commander Range Bags offer heavy-duty, weather-resistant, 600D Polyester construction and a lockable zipper and security loops for adding your own padlock to keep your case, and its contents, secure. The bag has heavy-binding seams with two rows of locked stitching for extra durability and long-lasting, wrap-around webbing handles for additional support. Zippers are heavyweight and durable and have large, easy-access zipper pulls. The adjustable shoulder strap is made of strong, tactical webbing. The large main compartment offers multiple internal and external pockets. The Pistol Range Bag has MOLLE compatible sewn-in webbing on the back of the bag for attaching Speed Clip Accessory Pouches on the outside of the bag for even more storage. Protect and transport your handguns and other range-day gear with Buck Commander high-quality soft-case bags. Each of the three different sized bags in the lineup have unique configurations, year are roomy enough to store ammunition, tools, targets, binoculars, gun care supplies or nearly anything else you want to take to the range. Check out the Shooter's Bag, the Pistol Range Bag, or the Deluxe Range Bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MDUyOsF8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UJ877A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004ULM5QM", "title": "Genuine Innovations Proflate Elite Inflator", "description": "The best CO2 inflator we have NOW works with more CO2 cartridge sizes (12 gram threaded, 16 gram threaded & non-threaded, 20 gram threaded, 25 gram threaded). From our EZ Connect Technology to our built in all weather nozzle cover, the new Proflate Elite is loaded with features that makes inflation safer and easier. Simply drop the cartridge into the cup (or screw cartridge into the head of inflator), attach the head, press onto valve stem, pull trigger and begin controllable inflation. Easy enough to use with one hand, it will get your tire up to desired pressure in seconds. You’ll be back to your ride in no time.", "text": "Genuine Innovations Proflate Elite Inflator The best CO2 inflator we have NOW works with more CO2 cartridge sizes (12 gram threaded, 16 gram threaded & non-threaded, 20 gram threaded, 25 gram threaded). From our EZ Connect Technology to our built in all weather nozzle cover, the new Proflate Elite is loaded with features that makes inflation safer and easier. Simply drop the cartridge into the cup (or screw cartridge into the head of inflator), attach the head, press onto valve stem, pull trigger and begin controllable inflation. Easy enough to use with one hand, it will get your tire up to desired pressure in seconds. You’ll be back to your ride in no time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419enUQxqVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ULM5QM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innovations", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 26.61}}
{"item_id": "B004UMA57W", "title": "Millett Pre-tapped Multi-Slot Picatinny Rail Receivers for Remington 870 Shotgun", "description": "Millett's multi-slot Picatinny-style rail is easy to install on your shotgun with pre-tapped receivers. It provides a rock solid foundation for your scope or red dot sight, and is custom styled for your shotgun. The lines are smooth and trim, with every bit of excess bulk removed.", "text": "Millett Pre-tapped Multi-Slot Picatinny Rail Receivers for Remington 870 Shotgun Millett's multi-slot Picatinny-style rail is easy to install on your shotgun with pre-tapped receivers. It provides a rock solid foundation for your scope or red dot sight, and is custom styled for your shotgun. The lines are smooth and trim, with every bit of excess bulk removed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Scch7IUrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMA57W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Millett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 18.01}}
{"item_id": "B004UMAEQE", "title": "Leupold 110290 Mark 2 IMS 1\"", "description": "Leupold Mark 2 IMS Integral Mounting System Matte, 1 inch Ring 110290", "text": "Leupold 110290 Mark 2 IMS 1\" Leupold Mark 2 IMS Integral Mounting System Matte, 1 inch Ring 110290", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pzGh1fNhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMAEQE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leupold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 96.39}}
