{"item_id": "B004UMBEPE", "title": "Vortex Optics SM-01 Swing Mount for the VMX3 Scope Magnifier", "description": "Go from 1x to 3x in one quick move with the Vortex Optics Swing Mount for VMX3 Magnifier (SM-01). This accessory offers the ultimate in magnified versatility for red dot sights. Once mounted, a specialized cam on the Swing Mount allows you to swing and lock the VMX3 magnifier in place behind your red dot sight, then choose magnified or unmagnified views at will.The quick-detach design allows you to quickly add or remove the system from your rail with ease and without tools. Machined aluminum construction and hard-coat anodization make the Swing Mount one tough, lightweight accessory - for both right- and left-handed shooters.", "text": "Vortex Optics SM-01 Swing Mount for the VMX3 Scope Magnifier Go from 1x to 3x in one quick move with the Vortex Optics Swing Mount for VMX3 Magnifier (SM-01). This accessory offers the ultimate in magnified versatility for red dot sights. Once mounted, a specialized cam on the Swing Mount allows you to swing and lock the VMX3 magnifier in place behind your red dot sight, then choose magnified or unmagnified views at will.The quick-detach design allows you to quickly add or remove the system from your rail with ease and without tools. Machined aluminum construction and hard-coat anodization make the Swing Mount one tough, lightweight accessory - for both right- and left-handed shooters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31xAW1BtLEL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMBEPE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 134.99}}
{"item_id": "B004UMC110", "title": "Nashbar Trekking Mountain Bike Handlebar", "description": "With its multiple bends the Nashbar Trekking Mountain Bike Handlebar allows you to place your hands in various positions to relieve fatigue in the arms and shoulders. The extra hand positions are great for long rides All aluminum construction is light and durable for a responsive feel 580mm wide at the widest point, 550mm wide at the narrower cross section.", "text": "Nashbar Trekking Mountain Bike Handlebar With its multiple bends the Nashbar Trekking Mountain Bike Handlebar allows you to place your hands in various positions to relieve fatigue in the arms and shoulders. The extra hand positions are great for long rides All aluminum construction is light and durable for a responsive feel 580mm wide at the widest point, 550mm wide at the narrower cross section.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31a0gfWyoTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMC110.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B004UMC70A", "title": "Nashbar Leg Band Set with VELCRO brand fasteners", "description": "The cycling leg band set is a real essential for anyone who values their pants. Using it is a simple and effective means of keeping pant legs out of your chain and gears Elastic straps with gripper similar to bicycle shorts have VELCRO brand fasteners sewn on for adjustability Sold as a pairVELCRO is a registered trademark of Velcro Industries B.V.", "text": "Nashbar Leg Band Set with VELCRO brand fasteners The cycling leg band set is a real essential for anyone who values their pants. Using it is a simple and effective means of keeping pant legs out of your chain and gears Elastic straps with gripper similar to bicycle shorts have VELCRO brand fasteners sewn on for adjustability Sold as a pairVELCRO is a registered trademark of Velcro Industries B.V.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lazn5apBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMC70A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pack Accessories"]], "price": 3.99}}
