{"item_id": "B004UMEQH2", "title": "YogaRat 100% Microfiber HOT YOGA TOWELS - Available separately in two sizes: Mat Length (25\" x 72\") and Hand Size (16\" x 25\")", "description": "YogaRat's 100% Microfiber Hot Yoga Towels are made for those who like their yoga in a heated studio environment or who simply prefer a thicker, even more absorbent towel.At 600 gsm weight, these ultra thick, plush, and light Hot Yoga Towels aim to be your perfect practice companion, whether or not your yogic explorations include the hot zone.Hot Yoga Mat Towels, sized at a generous 25\" x 72\", work great with longer mats as well as standard-length mats.Hot Yoga Hand Towels, sized at 16\" x 25\", are made from the same super-absorbent, fast-drying microfiber material as our mat-length Hot Yoga Towels. They're great next to your yoga mat, at the gym, and even around the house!These towels are machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors only, no bleach or fabric softener; tumble dry) for easy care, and they'll keep looking stylish over the long haul.Pleasecheck out our other Amazon listingsif you're in need of a new yoga mat, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits", "text": "YogaRat 100% Microfiber HOT YOGA TOWELS - Available separately in two sizes: Mat Length (25\" x 72\") and Hand Size (16\" x 25\") YogaRat's 100% Microfiber Hot Yoga Towels are made for those who like their yoga in a heated studio environment or who simply prefer a thicker, even more absorbent towel.At 600 gsm weight, these ultra thick, plush, and light Hot Yoga Towels aim to be your perfect practice companion, whether or not your yogic explorations include the hot zone.Hot Yoga Mat Towels, sized at a generous 25\" x 72\", work great with longer mats as well as standard-length mats.Hot Yoga Hand Towels, sized at 16\" x 25\", are made from the same super-absorbent, fast-drying microfiber material as our mat-length Hot Yoga Towels. They're great next to your yoga mat, at the gym, and even around the house!These towels are machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors only, no bleach or fabric softener; tumble dry) for easy care, and they'll keep looking stylish over the long haul.Pleasecheck out our other Amazon listingsif you're in need of a new yoga mat, accessories, or towels for other active pursuits", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uM81UJluL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMEQH2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004UMM4QC", "title": "Power Rack NEW Squat Deadlift HD Lift Cage Bench Racks Chrome Safety", "description": "This solid well built power rack will help you work out safely and efficiently while performing squats, military press, bench press, curls, shrugs, and more. With a wide walk-in design that offers plenty of side-to-side movement for a variety of total body exercises. In addition the rack offers a total of 28 positions, helping it accommodate a ton of different heights and exercises. A chin up bar on top, with light knurling for a good grip, also adds variety. The plate holders in back are great for storage and stability. This power rack makes your routines easy and safe. So get one and take your workouts to the next level. NEW, the long pins are now chrome plated. The bar holder will be J-hooks (see picture). We sell extra J-Hooks, weight holder attachments, and dip attachments for this rack. Dimensions: See pictures. Front inside opening- 44\". Front outside opening- 48\". Height- 83\". Inside workout space- 26\" from inside front to rear. Chin up bar- 1 1/4\" diameter with knurling, 80\" high, 44\" wide. Floor space- 59\" x 48\". Olympic plate storage holders- 9\" to rack. Distance floor to center of bottom hole- 12.5\". VERY IMPORTANT NOTE: Due to a design change, the bar holder will be J-Hooks as seen in fifth picture, not the short pins as shown in first picture. Response to FAQ1: This power rack was designed to be sold at an affordable price , as such extra features such as numbering of the holes was not included. Some simple suggestions would be to use a magic marker or stick on. PLEASE NOTE THE RACK WEIGHS 137 LBS., THE SHIPPING WEIGHT LISTED BELOW IS USED ONLY FOR REALISTIC SHIPPING CHARGE CALCULATIONS.", "text": "Power Rack NEW Squat Deadlift HD Lift Cage Bench Racks Chrome Safety This solid well built power rack will help you work out safely and efficiently while performing squats, military press, bench press, curls, shrugs, and more. With a wide walk-in design that offers plenty of side-to-side movement for a variety of total body exercises. In addition the rack offers a total of 28 positions, helping it accommodate a ton of different heights and exercises. A chin up bar on top, with light knurling for a good grip, also adds variety. The plate holders in back are great for storage and stability. This power rack makes your routines easy and safe. So get one and take your workouts to the next level. NEW, the long pins are now chrome plated. The bar holder will be J-hooks (see picture). We sell extra J-Hooks, weight holder attachments, and dip attachments for this rack. Dimensions: See pictures. Front inside opening- 44\". Front outside opening- 48\". Height- 83\". Inside workout space- 26\" from inside front to rear. Chin up bar- 1 1/4\" diameter with knurling, 80\" high, 44\" wide. Floor space- 59\" x 48\". Olympic plate storage holders- 9\" to rack. Distance floor to center of bottom hole- 12.5\". VERY IMPORTANT NOTE: Due to a design change, the bar holder will be J-Hooks as seen in fifth picture, not the short pins as shown in first picture. Response to FAQ1: This power rack was designed to be sold at an affordable price , as such extra features such as numbering of the holes was not included. Some simple suggestions would be to use a magic marker or stick on. PLEASE NOTE THE RACK WEIGHS 137 LBS., THE SHIPPING WEIGHT LISTED BELOW IS USED ONLY FOR REALISTIC SHIPPING CHARGE CALCULATIONS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4165BMdR6WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UMM4QC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment"]]}}
