{"item_id": "B004UOPZ9S", "title": "Shoreline Marine Pump Lower Unit Fill", "description": "Avoid smelly lubricant running down your arm! Fits quart bottles of lower unit lubricant and allows for \"mess free\" lube changes. Simply thread the fitting in the lower drain hole and pump until filled.", "text": "Shoreline Marine Pump Lower Unit Fill Avoid smelly lubricant running down your arm! Fits quart bottles of lower unit lubricant and allows for \"mess free\" lube changes. Simply thread the fitting in the lower drain hole and pump until filled.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-54c8b13L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UOPZ9S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shoreline Marine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Plumbing", "Bilge Pumps"]], "price": 7.35}}
