{"item_id": "B004UR0KEA", "title": "Barska CO11538 3-9X 40mm Colorado Riflescope with Silver Finish", "description": "Now you can have more for less. Accuracy, precision and dependability at a popular price. The 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope is the perfect choice for serious shooters or hunters who want a wealth of features and performance but don't want to spend a fortune. The Colorado scopes combine high quality optics and rugged construction with accuracy and ease of use. This scope features fully-coated optics for bright, clear, distortion-free views, a 30/30 reticle and rugged 1 Inch monotube construction. If you're looking for a premium riflescope at an affordable price, look no farther than the 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope. Protected by BARSKA's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Specifications: Magnification 3-9x; Objective Lens 40mm; Reticle: 30/30; Exit Pupil: 13.33-4.44mm; Optical Coating: Fully Coated; Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m):12.04 ft-37.35 ft.; Focus Type: Eye Bell; Tube Diameter: 1 Inch; Included Accessories: Scope Caps and Lens Cloth.", "text": "Barska CO11538 3-9X 40mm Colorado Riflescope with Silver Finish Now you can have more for less. Accuracy, precision and dependability at a popular price. The 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope is the perfect choice for serious shooters or hunters who want a wealth of features and performance but don't want to spend a fortune. The Colorado scopes combine high quality optics and rugged construction with accuracy and ease of use. This scope features fully-coated optics for bright, clear, distortion-free views, a 30/30 reticle and rugged 1 Inch monotube construction. If you're looking for a premium riflescope at an affordable price, look no farther than the 3-9x40 Colorado Riflescope. Protected by BARSKA's Limited Lifetime Warranty. Specifications: Magnification 3-9x; Objective Lens 40mm; Reticle: 30/30; Exit Pupil: 13.33-4.44mm; Optical Coating: Fully Coated; Field of View (ft@100yds/m@100m):12.04 ft-37.35 ft.; Focus Type: Eye Bell; Tube Diameter: 1 Inch; Included Accessories: Scope Caps and Lens Cloth.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dFSgfeaDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UR0KEA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barska", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 38.89}}
{"item_id": "B004UR767O", "title": "Evans Sports Unassembled Gun Rack", "description": "The Evans Gun Rack measuring 21\"x4\"x24\" is made of solid native pine. It holds four guns and has a tray to hold shells or other accessories. Assembly required with all finishing and mounting hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "text": "Evans Sports Unassembled Gun Rack The Evans Gun Rack measuring 21\"x4\"x24\" is made of solid native pine. It holds four guns and has a tray to hold shells or other accessories. Assembly required with all finishing and mounting hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WrEfquHiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UR767O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 33.98}}
{"item_id": "B004UR76K6", "title": "Evans Sports Standing Rifle Rack", "description": "The Evans Standing Rifle Rack measuring 31\"x 10\"x 35 1/2\" is made of solid native pine. It holds up to seven long guns. Assembly Required with all assembly hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "text": "Evans Sports Standing Rifle Rack The Evans Standing Rifle Rack measuring 31\"x 10\"x 35 1/2\" is made of solid native pine. It holds up to seven long guns. Assembly Required with all assembly hardware included. Recommended for indoor use only. Made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z%2BSh5-zSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UR76K6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Evans Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 52.0}}
{"item_id": "B004UR7FP2", "title": "Evans Sports Standard Ammo Box", "description": "The Evans Ammo/Accessory Case measuring 16\" x 8 1/4\" x 10 1/2\" is a finely detail case made of solid native pine and features notched finger-joint construction and rugged hardware. This case is functional for storage of hunting or cleaning supplies, as well as adding attractive decor for your home or office. It comes printed with our Deer print. Proudly made in the USA.", "text": "Evans Sports Standard Ammo Box The Evans Ammo/Accessory Case measuring 16\" x 8 1/4\" x 10 1/2\" is a finely detail case made of solid native pine and features notched finger-joint construction and rugged hardware. This case is functional for storage of hunting or cleaning supplies, as well as adding attractive decor for your home or office. It comes printed with our Deer print. Proudly made in the USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bl6NecctL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UR7FP2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 34.5}}
