{"item_id": "B004UT3H3E", "title": "Bally Thigh Toner (Pink)", "description": "The targeted resistance of the Thigh Toner firms muscles without adding bulk. Strong tension lets you build your strength and increase firmness. Foam covered for maximum comfort, the Thigh Toner is easy to use, transport and store.", "text": "Bally Thigh Toner (Pink) The targeted resistance of the Thigh Toner firms muscles without adding bulk. Strong tension lets you build your strength and increase firmness. Foam covered for maximum comfort, the Thigh Toner is easy to use, transport and store.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tzcEDzVVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UT3H3E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Leg Machines"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004UTNHE8", "title": "2mm Neoprene Snorkeling Fin Sock", "description": "2mm thick fin sock, Use with full foot fins, Perfect for diving or snorkeling, Sizes: XS, S, M, L, XL*** NOLOGO Socks are exactly the same as the H20 Socks without the silk screening on the sides", "text": "2mm Neoprene Snorkeling Fin Sock 2mm thick fin sock, Use with full foot fins, Perfect for diving or snorkeling, Sizes: XS, S, M, L, XL*** NOLOGO Socks are exactly the same as the H20 Socks without the silk screening on the sides", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-qXHnXB8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UTNHE8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Fins"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004UVP7D0", "title": "Sentry Solutions Marine Tuf-Glide Pump Spray, 4-Ounce", "description": "Marine Tuf-Glide is designed to protect your guns, knives and tactical gear during for ocean use, extreme conditions and long term storage. Based on Tuf-Glide but formulated with additional ingredients to enhance protection against highly corrosive saltwater and high humidity. Use Marine Tuf-Glide when your gear is faced with extreme conditions or long-term storage. The liquid partner for Marine Tuf-Cloth. Use with MARINE TUF-CLOTH, for 100% oil-free protection. Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Perfect for long term storage - dust free, drip free dry protection.", "text": "Sentry Solutions Marine Tuf-Glide Pump Spray, 4-Ounce Marine Tuf-Glide is designed to protect your guns, knives and tactical gear during for ocean use, extreme conditions and long term storage. Based on Tuf-Glide but formulated with additional ingredients to enhance protection against highly corrosive saltwater and high humidity. Use Marine Tuf-Glide when your gear is faced with extreme conditions or long-term storage. The liquid partner for Marine Tuf-Cloth. Use with MARINE TUF-CLOTH, for 100% oil-free protection. Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Perfect for long term storage - dust free, drip free dry protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IfVqQhiIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UVP7D0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sentry Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Maintenance Supplies", "Cleaners"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B004UVP7EE", "title": "Sentry Solutions TUF-CLOTH Screw Top Jar, 12 x 12-Inch", "description": "Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone rags; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Spill-proof pack; long-lasting, lint-free impregnated cloth. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "text": "Sentry Solutions TUF-CLOTH Screw Top Jar, 12 x 12-Inch Oil-free technology provides a revolutionary upgrade from oil and silicone rags; delivers lubrication and protection for today's firearms, knives, tactical gear and collectibles. Quick clean on your gun bench, the range or in the field. Spill-proof pack; long-lasting, lint-free impregnated cloth. Slick action in any temperature - won't thicken from cold or thin out from heat Stops rust Micro-bonded shield Displaces moisture Gives metal a non-stick barrier Grit-free reliability Great for all conditions, metals & finishes, safe for wood and plastic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Pho32ETLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UVP7EE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sentry Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B004UVPDUM", "title": "Jetboil Zip Cooking System", "description": "Rely on Jetboil Zip to provide hot food and drinks quickly and conveniently when you want them the most. Distilled from the flagship Jetboil PCS design, Zip provides the essential function and features you expect from Jetboil. Zip is so compact and light-weight, you'll keep it on hand for day trips close to home and overnight adventures alike.", "text": "Jetboil Zip Cooking System Rely on Jetboil Zip to provide hot food and drinks quickly and conveniently when you want them the most. Distilled from the flagship Jetboil PCS design, Zip provides the essential function and features you expect from Jetboil. Zip is so compact and light-weight, you'll keep it on hand for day trips close to home and overnight adventures alike.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uX9ri7HkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UVPDUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Jetboil", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 65.49}}
