{"item_id": "B004UW95LY", "title": "Kubotan, Polymer, Self-Defense Keychain Stick", "description": "This solid polycarbonate kubaton/kubotan has a flat end and is grooved to provide a more solid grip. Excellent for jabs and enhancing compliance moves and joint locks. The keyring is solidly attached to allow you to use as a key flail. Includes two split rings for attaching keys. 5.5 inches long. Although non-metal, this kubaton has the same impact on human tissue and bone.", "text": "Kubotan, Polymer, Self-Defense Keychain Stick This solid polycarbonate kubaton/kubotan has a flat end and is grooved to provide a more solid grip. Excellent for jabs and enhancing compliance moves and joint locks. The keyring is solidly attached to allow you to use as a key flail. Includes two split rings for attaching keys. 5.5 inches long. Although non-metal, this kubaton has the same impact on human tissue and bone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Fdyd3WSZL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004UW95LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ACE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Batons"]], "price": 2.97}}
