{"item_id": "B004V2ACD8", "title": "Shimano ST-EF51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo (3x7 Speed)", "description": "The Shimano EF-51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo is designed to make shifting and braking a seamless process for easier biking. Compatible with 7-speed cassettes/freewheels and triple cranks and with V-brake systems, this combination pair replace separate brake lever and gear shift systems. Designed for ease of use, the unit has an easy-to-read gear indicator. Made by Shimano, the EF-51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo carries a two-year warranty to be free of defects in material and workmanship.", "text": "Shimano ST-EF51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo (3x7 Speed) The Shimano EF-51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo is designed to make shifting and braking a seamless process for easier biking. Compatible with 7-speed cassettes/freewheels and triple cranks and with V-brake systems, this combination pair replace separate brake lever and gear shift systems. Designed for ease of use, the unit has an easy-to-read gear indicator. Made by Shimano, the EF-51 Shifter/Brake Lever Combo carries a two-year warranty to be free of defects in material and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nRC%2BF69OL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V2ACD8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Shifters"]], "price": 31.77}}
{"item_id": "B004V2IIV6", "title": "Maxpedition Kodiak S-type Gearslinger", "description": "Left-side carry version of the famous Kodiak Gearslinger. Single shoulder backpack designed to maximize utility when rotated towards front of body.", "text": "Maxpedition Kodiak S-type Gearslinger Left-side carry version of the famous Kodiak Gearslinger. Single shoulder backpack designed to maximize utility when rotated towards front of body.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wF3f5ETDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V2IIV6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 149.0}}
{"item_id": "B004V2IJ7E", "title": "Maxpedition Typhoon Backpack", "description": "1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric. Teflona fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance. YKK high strength zippers and zipper tracks. UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closures. Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance. High tensile strength nylon webbing. High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread). AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protection. Internal seams taped and finished. Paracord zipper pulls. Stress points double stitched, Bartacked or Box-and-X stitched for added strength. Product features, main compartment: 13 x 9.5 x 4.5-Inch, internal mesh divider and zipper pocket, YKK zipper closure. Front upper pocket 8 x 3.5 x 2-Inch. Front lower pocket 8 x 7 x 2-Inch with divider and organizer pockets. Side pocket 4 x 3 x 1.5-Inch zipper opening. Side sheath 5 x 2 x 1-Inch zipper opening. Modular webbing front, sides and on shoulder straps - see pictures for configurations. Shoulder strap double backpack straps with 3/4-Inch sternum strap. Handle reinforced drag handle design. Approximate overall volume 750-Cubic Inch. Hydration fits up to 50-Ounce and reservoir (not included).", "text": "Maxpedition Typhoon Backpack 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric. Teflona fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance. YKK high strength zippers and zipper tracks. UTX-Duraflex nylon buckles for low sound closures. Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance. High tensile strength nylon webbing. High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread). AS-100 high grade closed-cell foam padding material for superior shock protection. Internal seams taped and finished. Paracord zipper pulls. Stress points double stitched, Bartacked or Box-and-X stitched for added strength. Product features, main compartment: 13 x 9.5 x 4.5-Inch, internal mesh divider and zipper pocket, YKK zipper closure. Front upper pocket 8 x 3.5 x 2-Inch. Front lower pocket 8 x 7 x 2-Inch with divider and organizer pockets. Side pocket 4 x 3 x 1.5-Inch zipper opening. Side sheath 5 x 2 x 1-Inch zipper opening. Modular webbing front, sides and on shoulder straps - see pictures for configurations. Shoulder strap double backpack straps with 3/4-Inch sternum strap. Handle reinforced drag handle design. Approximate overall volume 750-Cubic Inch. Hydration fits up to 50-Ounce and reservoir (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5182UULfwAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V2IJ7E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 106.87}}
