{"item_id": "B004V2OWFM", "title": "niceeshop(TM) 40KG Portable Digital Fishing Hook Luggage Scale", "description": "Rugged die cast metal construction and built-in tape measure.A vertical weighing solution that you can easily take with you anywhere.with high accuracy, high performance price ratio.Stainless steel hook for long lifetime using.Automatic calculation with digital readout when weight.Travel Digital Micro Luggage Scale,eliminating the worry of being charged overweight fees when checking your bags.Color:show as picture.Package include:1 x fishing scalesPlease note:1> niceeshop(TM) is a registered trademark and the only authorized seller of niceeshop branded products.2> niceeshop provide you various kinds of great products at the lowest possible prices, welcome to our store and get what you want !!!3> niceeshop highly appriciate all customers' opinions to improve the selling ,also if anything you unsatisfied, pls contact our customer service department for probable best solution.", "text": "niceeshop(TM) 40KG Portable Digital Fishing Hook Luggage Scale Rugged die cast metal construction and built-in tape measure.A vertical weighing solution that you can easily take with you anywhere.with high accuracy, high performance price ratio.Stainless steel hook for long lifetime using.Automatic calculation with digital readout when weight.Travel Digital Micro Luggage Scale,eliminating the worry of being charged overweight fees when checking your bags.Color:show as picture.Package include:1 x fishing scalesPlease note:1> niceeshop(TM) is a registered trademark and the only authorized seller of niceeshop branded products.2> niceeshop provide you various kinds of great products at the lowest possible prices, welcome to our store and get what you want !!!3> niceeshop highly appriciate all customers' opinions to improve the selling ,also if anything you unsatisfied, pls contact our customer service department for probable best solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PSb%2BAiHmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V2OWFM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "niceEshop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Fish Scales"]], "price": 3.99}}
