{"item_id": "B004V3UEQM", "title": "Louisville Slugger 2012 TPS FP12X (-10) Xeno Fastpitch Softball Bat; 33in./23oz.", "description": "TPS Louisville Slugger FP12X -10 Xeno Fastpitch Bat. This state of the art fastpitch bat utilizes Swing 1 inner Disc Barrel Technology that allows the barrel to flex to its maximum allowable performance level from the first swing. This bat is \"game ready\" from the time you take off the wrapper. iST Inner Socket Technology joins the barrel and handle together and provides players with a great solid feel and larger sweet spot. iST features a solid connection between the handle and barrel, giving players maximum performance even on inside hits.", "text": "Louisville Slugger 2012 TPS FP12X (-10) Xeno Fastpitch Softball Bat; 33in./23oz. TPS Louisville Slugger FP12X -10 Xeno Fastpitch Bat. This state of the art fastpitch bat utilizes Swing 1 inner Disc Barrel Technology that allows the barrel to flex to its maximum allowable performance level from the first swing. This bat is \"game ready\" from the time you take off the wrapper. iST Inner Socket Technology joins the barrel and handle together and provides players with a great solid feel and larger sweet spot. iST features a solid connection between the handle and barrel, giving players maximum performance even on inside hits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21syLXgnkFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V3UEQM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Softball", "Player Equipment", "Bats", "Fast-Pitch Softball Bats"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004V4KRYU", "title": "SGT KNOTS® Paracord Zipper Pull - 3 Pack", "description": "SGT KNOTS easy grab zipper pulls - great to use on those zippers that you may need fast access to. Best of all each zipper pull is made of approximately 3 feet of US made of 7 strand 550 pound test paracord. Each zipper pull is hand tied in the US.", "text": "SGT KNOTS® Paracord Zipper Pull - 3 Pack SGT KNOTS easy grab zipper pulls - great to use on those zippers that you may need fast access to. Best of all each zipper pull is made of approximately 3 feet of US made of 7 strand 550 pound test paracord. Each zipper pull is hand tied in the US.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QoYT0tI5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V4KRYU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B004V4OJ2G", "title": "Aqua Vessel Insulated Filtration Water Bottle with 100-Gallon Filter", "description": "The Aqua Vessel Insulated Filter Bottle is the first of its kind--a bottle that not only keeps your water cold, but also filters as you drink. Our sustainable plant-based filter attaches easily to the straw top, so every sip you take is cleaned on its way to your mouth. It is tested to remove 99.9% of Giardia and Cryptosporidium, and its activated coconut shell carbon reduces toxic chemicals, heavy metals, microscopic pathogens, chlorine, sediment and dirt. Our MiraGuard antimicrobial technology even keeps the filter clean and free of mold, so you can be sure that whether you're using tap water or river water, you're drinking the freshest water around. As always, Eco Vessel uses nothing but the highest quality, premium stainless steel to make our bottles. Our vacuum seal insulation technology ensures that your water will stay cold, but your bottle won't sweat. The new straw top makes it easy to drink out of when you're on the go--on the trails, on the golf course, at the gym, or just around town--and it closes tight to prevent spills and leaks.", "text": "Aqua Vessel Insulated Filtration Water Bottle with 100-Gallon Filter The Aqua Vessel Insulated Filter Bottle is the first of its kind--a bottle that not only keeps your water cold, but also filters as you drink. Our sustainable plant-based filter attaches easily to the straw top, so every sip you take is cleaned on its way to your mouth. It is tested to remove 99.9% of Giardia and Cryptosporidium, and its activated coconut shell carbon reduces toxic chemicals, heavy metals, microscopic pathogens, chlorine, sediment and dirt. Our MiraGuard antimicrobial technology even keeps the filter clean and free of mold, so you can be sure that whether you're using tap water or river water, you're drinking the freshest water around. As always, Eco Vessel uses nothing but the highest quality, premium stainless steel to make our bottles. Our vacuum seal insulation technology ensures that your water will stay cold, but your bottle won't sweat. The new straw top makes it easy to drink out of when you're on the go--on the trails, on the golf course, at the gym, or just around town--and it closes tight to prevent spills and leaks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fWI338-yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V4OJ2G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004V5XJD0", "title": "Double Trouble 2 Blade Kubaton", "description": "Double-edge stealthy, concealable daggers offer adequate protection to keep you safe! Can be worn on the forearm or lower leg for quick use. So slim and light you'll never notice you're wearing them. The nylon belt sheath offers velcro closures to hold the blades in place until they need to be drawn.", "text": "Double Trouble 2 Blade Kubaton Double-edge stealthy, concealable daggers offer adequate protection to keep you safe! Can be worn on the forearm or lower leg for quick use. So slim and light you'll never notice you're wearing them. The nylon belt sheath offers velcro closures to hold the blades in place until they need to be drawn.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416Sb3wa8ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V5XJD0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tiger", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Ninja Weapons"]], "price": 6.88}}
{"item_id": "B004V5XKCA", "title": "Steel Serpent Kubaton", "description": "You always have your keys with you, so why not always have a defense weapon as well. This mean steel serpent kubaton looks like a harmless keychain even though the steel spike is far from harmless, but unscrew the end and it sheaths a 2 1/2\" dagger that flips around and screws in the end to make it 6 1/2\" overall. It's the perfect solution to never having anywhere to carry a defense weapon. Blade is made from stainless steel and the body of the item is of another metal alloy.", "text": "Steel Serpent Kubaton You always have your keys with you, so why not always have a defense weapon as well. This mean steel serpent kubaton looks like a harmless keychain even though the steel spike is far from harmless, but unscrew the end and it sheaths a 2 1/2\" dagger that flips around and screws in the end to make it 6 1/2\" overall. It's the perfect solution to never having anywhere to carry a defense weapon. Blade is made from stainless steel and the body of the item is of another metal alloy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41spsxub0HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V5XKCA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Batons"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004V5XNB8", "title": "CIA Defense Tool Set", "description": "Never get caught off guard again with 4 different styles of CIA non-metal defense weapons. The set includes two 7\" double-edged daggers, an 8\" kubaton spike and an ice scraper with built in knuckle guard. You wont find this complete of a set at a lower price anywhere!", "text": "CIA Defense Tool Set Never get caught off guard again with 4 different styles of CIA non-metal defense weapons. The set includes two 7\" double-edged daggers, an 8\" kubaton spike and an ice scraper with built in knuckle guard. You wont find this complete of a set at a lower price anywhere!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516ign-XK4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V5XNB8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Training Equipment", "Training Sticks"]], "price": 12.87}}
{"item_id": "B004V5XNQS", "title": "German 4 Piece Stainless Steel Eating Utensil", "description": "Military surplus makes expensive items inexpensive for you. This used German 4-pc. Utensil set makes eating at the campsite a lot easier. A knife, fork, spoon and can opener all snap together in a convenient unit that easily comes apart for dining.", "text": "German 4 Piece Stainless Steel Eating Utensil Military surplus makes expensive items inexpensive for you. This used German 4-pc. Utensil set makes eating at the campsite a lot easier. A knife, fork, spoon and can opener all snap together in a convenient unit that easily comes apart for dining.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419oTpqQ8%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V5XNQS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 13.99}}
