{"item_id": "B004V8ZNHM", "title": "Big Game Ez-On Basic Safety Harness", "description": "The EZ-ON Basic Harness is comfortable, padded shoulder straps for all day comfort. Fall arrest harness includes tree belt, lineman's belt and SRD strap. Quick-release buckles on leg straps make adjusting harness fast and easy. One size fits most.", "text": "Big Game Ez-On Basic Safety Harness The EZ-ON Basic Harness is comfortable, padded shoulder straps for all day comfort. Fall arrest harness includes tree belt, lineman's belt and SRD strap. Quick-release buckles on leg straps make adjusting harness fast and easy. One size fits most.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GSrIcb0hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V8ZNHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BIG GAME", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Safety Belts & Harnesses"]], "price": 42.47}}
