{"item_id": "B004V90PAG", "title": "Center Point 1 x25mm Muli-Tac Quick Aim Sight with Rings", "description": "The CenterPoint Multi-TAC Quick-Aim sight offers four different reticle options in one sight, making it versitile enough for all your shooting needs. It's red/green illumination options offer the ultimate in convenience for all light conditions and can be fixed to various brightness settings.", "text": "Center Point 1 x25mm Muli-Tac Quick Aim Sight with Rings The CenterPoint Multi-TAC Quick-Aim sight offers four different reticle options in one sight, making it versitile enough for all your shooting needs. It's red/green illumination options offer the ultimate in convenience for all light conditions and can be fixed to various brightness settings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4182zwS%2Ba7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V90PAG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Center Point", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 62.99}}
{"item_id": "B004V956P0", "title": "Crosman Optimus Break Barrel Air Rifle (.177)", "description": "The Optimus break barrel is both powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a relatively light cocking force and a two-stage adjustable trigger the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 1200 fps with alloy pellets. The barrel incorporates a micro-adjustable rear sight and fiber optic front sight.", "text": "Crosman Optimus Break Barrel Air Rifle (.177) The Optimus break barrel is both powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a relatively light cocking force and a two-stage adjustable trigger the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 1200 fps with alloy pellets. The barrel incorporates a micro-adjustable rear sight and fiber optic front sight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21fiNzBxADL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V956P0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 91.98}}
{"item_id": "B004V9577M", "title": "Crosman Optimus .177 Claiber/1200 FPS Break Barrel Pellet Air Rifle with Hardwood Stock and Scope", "description": "The Optimus break barrel is powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a reletively light coking force and two-stage adjustable trigger, the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 1200fps. THe", "text": "Crosman Optimus .177 Claiber/1200 FPS Break Barrel Pellet Air Rifle with Hardwood Stock and Scope The Optimus break barrel is powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a reletively light coking force and two-stage adjustable trigger, the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 1200fps. THe", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21CnNtiU7aL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V9577M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 119.95}}
{"item_id": "B004V957DG", "title": "Optimus Air Rifle (.22) with Scope", "description": "The Optimus break barrel is both powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a relatively light cocking force and a two-stage adjustable trigger the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 950 fps with alloy pellets. The barrel incorporates a micro-adjustable rear sight and fiber optic front sight. It's topped with a CenterPoint® 4x32mm precision scope.", "text": "Optimus Air Rifle (.22) with Scope The Optimus break barrel is both powerful and elegant. It features a handsome, ambidextrous hardwood stock. With a relatively light cocking force and a two-stage adjustable trigger the Optimus is built to get the job done with velocities of up to 950 fps with alloy pellets. The barrel incorporates a micro-adjustable rear sight and fiber optic front sight. It's topped with a CenterPoint® 4x32mm precision scope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/216yAV3WAwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V957DG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 119.0}}
