{"item_id": "B004V959WK", "title": "Benjamin Trail NP All Weather Air Rifle (.177)", "description": "The Trail NP All Weather break barrel features a durable, all weather synthetic stock. These rugged break barrels boast impressive muzzle and downrange energy, plenty for rabbit-sized game up to 30 yards. Benjamin Nitro Piston powered break barrels produce 70% less noise than spring powered airguns, and with a smooth cocking effort, less recoil and less noise, a successful day of hunting is within reach. One simple cocking motion and your followup shots are fast, quiet and easy. Each Benjamin Trail NP break barrel comes with a 3-9x40 mm CenterPoint precision scope, featuring and adjustable objective and range estimating reticle. Trail NP air rifles feature a bull barrel, picatinny mounting rail system, installed sling mounts and a ventilated rubber recoil pad.", "text": "Benjamin Trail NP All Weather Air Rifle (.177) The Trail NP All Weather break barrel features a durable, all weather synthetic stock. These rugged break barrels boast impressive muzzle and downrange energy, plenty for rabbit-sized game up to 30 yards. Benjamin Nitro Piston powered break barrels produce 70% less noise than spring powered airguns, and with a smooth cocking effort, less recoil and less noise, a successful day of hunting is within reach. One simple cocking motion and your followup shots are fast, quiet and easy. Each Benjamin Trail NP break barrel comes with a 3-9x40 mm CenterPoint precision scope, featuring and adjustable objective and range estimating reticle. Trail NP air rifles feature a bull barrel, picatinny mounting rail system, installed sling mounts and a ventilated rubber recoil pad.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21ktjlJ4UtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V959WK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 215.15}}
{"item_id": "B004V95ADI", "title": "Benjamin Trail NP All Weather Air Rifle with Realtree APG Camo", "description": "This Trail NP all weather break barrel features durable, all weather camouflage synthetic stock decorated with Realtree™ APG. This rugged break barrel boast impressive muzzle and downrange energy, plenty for ground hog-sized game up to 25 yards. Benjamin Nitro Piston powered break barrels produce 70% less noise than spring powered airguns, and with a smooth cocking effort, less recoil and less noise, a successful day of hunting is within reach. One simple cocking motion and your followup shots are fast, quiet and easy. Each Benjamin Trail NP break barrel comes with a 3-9x40 mm CenterPoint precision scope, featuring and adjustable objective and range estimating reticle. Trail NP air rifles feature a bull barrel, picatinny mounting rail system, installed sling mounts and a ventilated rubber recoil pad.", "text": "Benjamin Trail NP All Weather Air Rifle with Realtree APG Camo This Trail NP all weather break barrel features durable, all weather camouflage synthetic stock decorated with Realtree™ APG. This rugged break barrel boast impressive muzzle and downrange energy, plenty for ground hog-sized game up to 25 yards. Benjamin Nitro Piston powered break barrels produce 70% less noise than spring powered airguns, and with a smooth cocking effort, less recoil and less noise, a successful day of hunting is within reach. One simple cocking motion and your followup shots are fast, quiet and easy. Each Benjamin Trail NP break barrel comes with a 3-9x40 mm CenterPoint precision scope, featuring and adjustable objective and range estimating reticle. Trail NP air rifles feature a bull barrel, picatinny mounting rail system, installed sling mounts and a ventilated rubber recoil pad.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VsFQjF7wL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V95ADI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 236.96}}
{"item_id": "B004V95AYW", "title": "Crosman 1377C / PC77, Black air pistol", "description": "Crosman 1377C air pistol Multi-pump pneumatic Bolt-action Single-shot Textured plastic grip & pump arm Ambidextrous grip with thumbrests on both sides 1-10 pumps Manual safety Fixed front sight, fully adj. rear Click the AMMO link to stock up on quality pellets. Check the ACCESSORIES link for the 459 MT intermount, rings, red dots, targets and safety glasses.... ...", "text": "Crosman 1377C / PC77, Black air pistol Crosman 1377C air pistol Multi-pump pneumatic Bolt-action Single-shot Textured plastic grip & pump arm Ambidextrous grip with thumbrests on both sides 1-10 pumps Manual safety Fixed front sight, fully adj. rear Click the AMMO link to stock up on quality pellets. Check the ACCESSORIES link for the 459 MT intermount, rings, red dots, targets and safety glasses.... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315yHPhoL4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V95AYW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 54.95}}
