{"item_id": "B004V95JAC", "title": "CenterPoint Laser BoresighterFits .17 cal to .50 cal plus 12,16 & 20 gauge.", "description": "The CenterPoint All-In-One Laser Boresighter eliminates the need to use more than one box of ammo to sight in your scopes and open sights. Sent from the same line as your barrel, the laser shows exactly where your shot should land when zeroing in - saving you time and money by precisely sighting-in. This quick and easy scope and sight alignment tool is battery-powered, and works on handguns, rifles and shotguns. Rated at 100 yds. of visibility at night and 25 yds. in daylight.", "text": "CenterPoint Laser BoresighterFits .17 cal to .50 cal plus 12,16 & 20 gauge. The CenterPoint All-In-One Laser Boresighter eliminates the need to use more than one box of ammo to sight in your scopes and open sights. Sent from the same line as your barrel, the laser shows exactly where your shot should land when zeroing in - saving you time and money by precisely sighting-in. This quick and easy scope and sight alignment tool is battery-powered, and works on handguns, rifles and shotguns. Rated at 100 yds. of visibility at night and 25 yds. in daylight.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hE4udeqML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V95JAC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Center Point", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 37.95}}
{"item_id": "B004V95TYI", "title": "Shag Practice 96 Ball Bag with Assorted Brands and Models - Used", "description": "Nitro Shag Practice balls are recycled which means savings! You get quality name brand golf balls for less, each ball is washed, cleaned and inspected, and performance is not compromised. Satisfaction guaranteed.", "text": "Shag Practice 96 Ball Bag with Assorted Brands and Models - Used Nitro Shag Practice balls are recycled which means savings! You get quality name brand golf balls for less, each ball is washed, cleaned and inspected, and performance is not compromised. Satisfaction guaranteed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51yWsnAVr7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V95TYI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Practice Balls"]], "price": 22.89}}
{"item_id": "B004V95XSU", "title": "Assorted Bridgestone B Grade Recycled Golf Balls (Value Pack of 48)", "description": "Nitro Recycled Golf Balls are recycled to the highest standards possible. 48 assorted Bridgestone styles and models offer you a wide range of features in one easy purchase. A great value of the super Bridgestone brand.", "text": "Assorted Bridgestone B Grade Recycled Golf Balls (Value Pack of 48) Nitro Recycled Golf Balls are recycled to the highest standards possible. 48 assorted Bridgestone styles and models offer you a wide range of features in one easy purchase. A great value of the super Bridgestone brand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51rwekBfulL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V95XSU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nitro", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Balls", "Recycled & Used Balls"]], "price": 51.89}}
{"item_id": "B004V98T2W", "title": "Summit Viper SD Treestand", "description": "Weighing in at just 20 pounds, the Viper SD is Summit Treestand's lightest climbing treestand stand. Designed to provide a perfect balance of roominess, comfort, versatility, and low weight, the Viper SD is a solid choice for rifle or bow hunting--and for hunters who would like a more portable stand. The Viper SD features a comfortable foam-padded seat that can be raised for bow hunting and lowered for hunting with a gun. The solid front bar makes climbing easier and works well as a gun rest. The Viper SD is also highly portable with a frame that nests together and packs on your back.The Viper SD provides a comfortable vantage point for effective targeting in the woods.A popular climbing treestand since its introduction in 1998, the Viper SD has been noted for its unique blending of shape, innovative cable attachment system, ease of use, and portability. The original Viper has been updated with aluminum construction, a more comfortable seat, QuickDraw cable attachment, RapidClimb Stirrups, Bent Cable arms--and--the most recent innovation--sound deadening (SD) technology to minimize noise that may compromise your concealment.The Viper SD comes complete with a 4-point safety harness, RapidClimb Stirrups, and all necessary pads, hardware, ropes and straps. Built to last, the Viper HD is covered by Summit's Five Year Limited Warranty.Summit's Dead MetalSound DeadeningSD Technology:Every little bit of noise reduction goes a long way in keeping you concealed. Summit's Dead Metal sound deadening technology works by filling in critical parts of the platform with a custom engineered expanding foam to reduce unintentional noises caused by movement on the platform.Complete, Assembled Treestand includes the following:Aluminum 5-Channel Platform Frame with Dead Metal, Sound Deadening (SD) TechnologyAluminum Seat/Climber FrameFoam Seat with BackrestTwo Coated, Steel Climbing CablesFour-Point FAS (harness) with safety strap and attached SRS strapRapidClimb Stirrups72-inch Camo Arm PadCamo Backpack StrapsGreen Utility StrapStand Umbilical RopeWritten Instructions and Safety/Instructional DVDSpecifications:Stand Weight: 20 poundsConstruction: AluminumTree Size: 8 to 20 inches in diameterSeat Height: AdjustableSeat Base Dimensions: 18 by 12 inches (WxL)Backrest Dimensions: 12 by 20 inches (WxL)Overall Dimensions: 20 by 36 inches (WxL)Platform Area: 20 by 28.75 inches (WxL)Seat Frame Size: 19.75 by 26.5 inches (WxL)Maximum Weight Capacity: 300 pounds", "text": "Summit Viper SD Treestand Weighing in at just 20 pounds, the Viper SD is Summit Treestand's lightest climbing treestand stand. Designed to provide a perfect balance of roominess, comfort, versatility, and low weight, the Viper SD is a solid choice for rifle or bow hunting--and for hunters who would like a more portable stand. The Viper SD features a comfortable foam-padded seat that can be raised for bow hunting and lowered for hunting with a gun. The solid front bar makes climbing easier and works well as a gun rest. The Viper SD is also highly portable with a frame that nests together and packs on your back.The Viper SD provides a comfortable vantage point for effective targeting in the woods.A popular climbing treestand since its introduction in 1998, the Viper SD has been noted for its unique blending of shape, innovative cable attachment system, ease of use, and portability. The original Viper has been updated with aluminum construction, a more comfortable seat, QuickDraw cable attachment, RapidClimb Stirrups, Bent Cable arms--and--the most recent innovation--sound deadening (SD) technology to minimize noise that may compromise your concealment.The Viper SD comes complete with a 4-point safety harness, RapidClimb Stirrups, and all necessary pads, hardware, ropes and straps. Built to last, the Viper HD is covered by Summit's Five Year Limited Warranty.Summit's Dead MetalSound DeadeningSD Technology:Every little bit of noise reduction goes a long way in keeping you concealed. Summit's Dead Metal sound deadening technology works by filling in critical parts of the platform with a custom engineered expanding foam to reduce unintentional noises caused by movement on the platform.Complete, Assembled Treestand includes the following:Aluminum 5-Channel Platform Frame with Dead Metal, Sound Deadening (SD) TechnologyAluminum Seat/Climber FrameFoam Seat with BackrestTwo Coated, Steel Climbing CablesFour-Point FAS (harness) with safety strap and attached SRS strapRapidClimb Stirrups72-inch Camo Arm PadCamo Backpack StrapsGreen Utility StrapStand Umbilical RopeWritten Instructions and Safety/Instructional DVDSpecifications:Stand Weight: 20 poundsConstruction: AluminumTree Size: 8 to 20 inches in diameterSeat Height: AdjustableSeat Base Dimensions: 18 by 12 inches (WxL)Backrest Dimensions: 12 by 20 inches (WxL)Overall Dimensions: 20 by 36 inches (WxL)Platform Area: 20 by 28.75 inches (WxL)Seat Frame Size: 19.75 by 26.5 inches (WxL)Maximum Weight Capacity: 300 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515xkVifbpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V98T2W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Summit Treestands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stands"]], "price": 254.9}}
{"item_id": "B004V9EW9Q", "title": "50 Pack - 8\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun Targets and Rifle Targets - Glow Shot - Seach Glowshot for all our 6\" 8\" and 10\" Target Packs", "description": "GlowShot 8\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Targets come in 25, 50 and 100 Packs. Seach GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\" and 10\" Target Packs", "text": "50 Pack - 8\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Multi Color - See Your Hits Instantly - Gun Targets and Rifle Targets - Glow Shot - Seach Glowshot for all our 6\" 8\" and 10\" Target Packs GlowShot 8\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Targets come in 25, 50 and 100 Packs. Seach GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\" and 10\" Target Packs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512FQ3-96vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V9EW9Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004V9F5SS", "title": "Summit Openshot SD Treestand", "description": "The Openshot SD Climbing Treestand from Summit is designed for hunters who like to pack into the deepest woods. Weighing in at just 15 pounds, the Openshot SD is designed to be compact and portable without sacrificing comfort when you settle down to hunt. The Openshot SD's open front affords all-direction visibility, making the OpenShot treestand a good choice for bow hunting--and it is equipped with a unique folding seat inside the frame that folds up easily when you want to stand up against the tree. The folded seat then becomes a cushion for your back, allowing you to stand more comfortably for longer periods of time. For maximum concealment, the Openshot features sound deadening (SD) technology to minimize startling noises in the field.The Openshot SD provides a comfortable, deep woods vantage point for effective targeting.The Openshot SD comes complete with a 4-point safety harness, RapidClimb Stirrups, and all necessary pads, hardware, ropes and straps. Built to last, the Openshot SD is covered by Summit's Five Year Limited Warranty.Summit's Dead MetalSound DeadeningSD Technology:Every little bit of noise reduction goes a long way in keeping you concealed. Summit's Dead Metal sound deadening technology works by filling in critical parts of the platform with a custom engineered expanding foam to reduce unintentional noises caused by movement on the platform.Complete, Assembled Treestand, Includes the Following:Aluminum 4-Channel Platform Frame with Dead Metal, Sound Deadening (SD) TechnologyAluminum Seat/Climber FrameFoam Seat PadTwo Coated, Steel Climbing CablesFour-Point FAS (harness) with safety strap and attached SRS strapRapidClimb StirrupsCamo Backpack StrapsGreen Utility StrapStand Umbilical RopeWritten Instructions and Safety/Instructional DVDSpecifications:Stand Weight: 15 poundsConstruction: AluminumTree Size: 8 to 20 inches in diameterSeat Height: AdjustableSeat Base Pad Dimensions: 16 by 10 inches (WxL)Overall Dimensions: 20 by 32 inches (WxL)Platform Area: 20 by 24.75 inches (WxL)Seat Frame Size: 19.25 by 14 inches (WxL)Maximum Weight Capacity: 300 pounds", "text": "Summit Openshot SD Treestand The Openshot SD Climbing Treestand from Summit is designed for hunters who like to pack into the deepest woods. Weighing in at just 15 pounds, the Openshot SD is designed to be compact and portable without sacrificing comfort when you settle down to hunt. The Openshot SD's open front affords all-direction visibility, making the OpenShot treestand a good choice for bow hunting--and it is equipped with a unique folding seat inside the frame that folds up easily when you want to stand up against the tree. The folded seat then becomes a cushion for your back, allowing you to stand more comfortably for longer periods of time. For maximum concealment, the Openshot features sound deadening (SD) technology to minimize startling noises in the field.The Openshot SD provides a comfortable, deep woods vantage point for effective targeting.The Openshot SD comes complete with a 4-point safety harness, RapidClimb Stirrups, and all necessary pads, hardware, ropes and straps. Built to last, the Openshot SD is covered by Summit's Five Year Limited Warranty.Summit's Dead MetalSound DeadeningSD Technology:Every little bit of noise reduction goes a long way in keeping you concealed. Summit's Dead Metal sound deadening technology works by filling in critical parts of the platform with a custom engineered expanding foam to reduce unintentional noises caused by movement on the platform.Complete, Assembled Treestand, Includes the Following:Aluminum 4-Channel Platform Frame with Dead Metal, Sound Deadening (SD) TechnologyAluminum Seat/Climber FrameFoam Seat PadTwo Coated, Steel Climbing CablesFour-Point FAS (harness) with safety strap and attached SRS strapRapidClimb StirrupsCamo Backpack StrapsGreen Utility StrapStand Umbilical RopeWritten Instructions and Safety/Instructional DVDSpecifications:Stand Weight: 15 poundsConstruction: AluminumTree Size: 8 to 20 inches in diameterSeat Height: AdjustableSeat Base Pad Dimensions: 16 by 10 inches (WxL)Overall Dimensions: 20 by 32 inches (WxL)Platform Area: 20 by 24.75 inches (WxL)Seat Frame Size: 19.25 by 14 inches (WxL)Maximum Weight Capacity: 300 pounds", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GwzqXGFVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004V9F5SS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Summit Treestands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Tree Stands & Accessories", "Tree Stands"]], "price": 230.98}}
{"item_id": "B004VA9510", "title": "NEOSLING, Adjustable Neoprene Bottle Holder,", "description": "NEOSLING Insulating Adjustable Bottle Holder - available in multiple colors", "text": "NEOSLING, Adjustable Neoprene Bottle Holder, NEOSLING Insulating Adjustable Bottle Holder - available in multiple colors", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vaSjcJlQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VA9510.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004VAABZ4", "title": "NEOSLING, Adjustable Neoprene Bottle Holder, Racecar Red", "description": "The NEOSLING was designed to hold all popular stainless steel bottles, as well as sports drinks or other popular beverages. With a wide, soft and stretchy Neoprene Adjustable Strap, the NEOSLING fits all body types comfortably over the shoulder or around the waist without digging in or chafing. The neoprene (think 'wet suit') material in the NEOSLING insulates bottles in all seasons from heat or cold, keeping your water or beverage at the temperature you expect it to be for up to four hours.", "text": "NEOSLING, Adjustable Neoprene Bottle Holder, Racecar Red The NEOSLING was designed to hold all popular stainless steel bottles, as well as sports drinks or other popular beverages. With a wide, soft and stretchy Neoprene Adjustable Strap, the NEOSLING fits all body types comfortably over the shoulder or around the waist without digging in or chafing. The neoprene (think 'wet suit') material in the NEOSLING insulates bottles in all seasons from heat or cold, keeping your water or beverage at the temperature you expect it to be for up to four hours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VwFjhM8lL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VAABZ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NEOSLING", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 11.99}}
