{"item_id": "B004VD8PMM", "title": "Timbuk2 3 Way Accessory Bag", "description": "Answer pressing calls mid-ride with the Timbuk2 3Way. This unisex accessory case offers a plush-paneled interior that cleans your screen or camera lens as it protects. A stretch front pocket shelters accessories like headphones from the elements. This Timbuk2 case fits most smart-phones. The Timbuk2 3Way is a top-loading, cushy hideaway for smart-phones and extras.", "text": "Timbuk2 3 Way Accessory Bag Answer pressing calls mid-ride with the Timbuk2 3Way. This unisex accessory case offers a plush-paneled interior that cleans your screen or camera lens as it protects. A stretch front pocket shelters accessories like headphones from the elements. This Timbuk2 case fits most smart-phones. The Timbuk2 3Way is a top-loading, cushy hideaway for smart-phones and extras.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iQwupr6aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VD8PMM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004VFDWSC", "title": "U.S. Divers Adult Starbuck II Purge LX Mask/Paradise Dry LX Snorkel/Hingeflex II Fins/Pro Bag", "description": "1-Window purge mask with easy-to-adjust buckles, submersible snorkel with silicone mouthpiece flex and purge, Pivot-flex technology fin with comfo strap, Travel Bag Packaging", "text": "U.S. Divers Adult Starbuck II Purge LX Mask/Paradise Dry LX Snorkel/Hingeflex II Fins/Pro Bag 1-Window purge mask with easy-to-adjust buckles, submersible snorkel with silicone mouthpiece flex and purge, Pivot-flex technology fin with comfo strap, Travel Bag Packaging", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IhsePDr2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VFDWSC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004VFQK3Q", "title": "Primos Truth DPS 'Deer Positioning System Trail and Game Camera", "description": "Get the low down on your favorite hunting spots with the Primos Truth Deer Positioning System (DPS). The DPS is actually a trail and game camera that records an entire day's activity in 5- to 10-second intervals. Nothing has to walk in front of the DPS to capture a photo; the camera does it all on its own. Later, you can review the entire day's worth of photos in less than three minutes. The system is terrific for gauging where and when deer are entering and exiting a food plot, so you can plan your next hunting trip accordingly.The DPS--which offers constant daylight surveillance--includes a built-in LCD screen for adjusting the settings and a rugged carrying case. The DPS is also bundled with image software that allows you to save individual photos or email shorts clips of photos to your friends.", "text": "Primos Truth DPS 'Deer Positioning System Trail and Game Camera Get the low down on your favorite hunting spots with the Primos Truth Deer Positioning System (DPS). The DPS is actually a trail and game camera that records an entire day's activity in 5- to 10-second intervals. Nothing has to walk in front of the DPS to capture a photo; the camera does it all on its own. Later, you can review the entire day's worth of photos in less than three minutes. The system is terrific for gauging where and when deer are entering and exiting a food plot, so you can plan your next hunting trip accordingly.The DPS--which offers constant daylight surveillance--includes a built-in LCD screen for adjusting the settings and a rugged carrying case. The DPS is also bundled with image software that allows you to save individual photos or email shorts clips of photos to your friends.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lS2v1KpKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VFQK3Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 49.99}}
{"item_id": "B004VFR6HA", "title": "Primos 20-20 Mount - Universal Game Camera Mount", "description": "The Primos 20/20 Mount gives every camera better vision by allowing it to easily rotate to get the perfect shot at the perfect angle. The 20/20 Mount fits all camera brands and features a magnetic connection socket that allows the camera to quickly attach/detach from tree. For better viewing and security, Primos recommends mounting and installing your camera high in the tree for better view and security. Includes T-Post adaptor for surveillance without trees.Features:Gives your mounted camera better visionEasily rotate your camera to get the perfect shotFits all camera brandsMagnetic connection socket allows camera to quickly attach/detach from treeIncludes T-Post adapter for surveillance without treesTip: Install camera high in tree for better view and security", "text": "Primos 20-20 Mount - Universal Game Camera Mount The Primos 20/20 Mount gives every camera better vision by allowing it to easily rotate to get the perfect shot at the perfect angle. The 20/20 Mount fits all camera brands and features a magnetic connection socket that allows the camera to quickly attach/detach from tree. For better viewing and security, Primos recommends mounting and installing your camera high in the tree for better view and security. Includes T-Post adaptor for surveillance without trees.Features:Gives your mounted camera better visionEasily rotate your camera to get the perfect shotFits all camera brandsMagnetic connection socket allows camera to quickly attach/detach from treeIncludes T-Post adapter for surveillance without treesTip: Install camera high in tree for better view and security", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iEO-jyP2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VFR6HA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 17.24}}
{"item_id": "B004VFXZH0", "title": "Sof Sole Fit Series", "description": "The Sof Sole Fit Series Neutral Arch Insoles have a 3.0cm arch height and 60 durometer EVA, which provides ideal arch height and density levels to promote a natural range of motion for end-users with neutral arches. These particular insoles feature an anatomical nylon plate and a CK mesh top cover. This plate offers torsional stability while maintaining flexibility and range of motion. The nylon plate's durability offers resistance to cracking and compression, while the CK mesh top cover is an abrasion resistant material, making this insole the ultimate in comfort and performance.", "text": "Sof Sole Fit Series The Sof Sole Fit Series Neutral Arch Insoles have a 3.0cm arch height and 60 durometer EVA, which provides ideal arch height and density levels to promote a natural range of motion for end-users with neutral arches. These particular insoles feature an anatomical nylon plate and a CK mesh top cover. This plate offers torsional stability while maintaining flexibility and range of motion. The nylon plate's durability offers resistance to cracking and compression, while the CK mesh top cover is an abrasion resistant material, making this insole the ultimate in comfort and performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lSGvcXhSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VFXZH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Ice Hockey", "Accessories", "Skate Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004VG77R8", "title": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 Brithish Racing Green FRN ZDP-189 PlainEdge Knife", "description": "C.Q.I.-Constant Quality Improvement is a process Spyderco uses to evaluate and refine longstanding established knife models. Sometime C.Q.I. changes are large and noticeable, sometimes they’re smaller refinements. Recently we applied C.Q.I. to the classic Dragonfly creating a new Dragonfly2. The Dragonfly2 upgrades some notable features over the classic while keeping the important basics. Features carrying-over to the new version are the tried and tested mid-sized blade and ergonomic handle along with a front-finger choil and spine cusp. Also staying is the blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points which make the Dragonfly cut and feel like a much larger large knife when in the hand. New refinements include: the addition of a left/right tip-up wire clip, patented Bi-Directional Texturing™ on the handle, choil and spine jimping and screw together handle construction. The blade is a high-performance flat-grind ZDP-189. The position of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot leads to smooth opening and the FRN (fiberglass reinforce nylon) handle fits the hand ergonomically with a series of grip angles and leveraging spots.", "text": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 Brithish Racing Green FRN ZDP-189 PlainEdge Knife C.Q.I.-Constant Quality Improvement is a process Spyderco uses to evaluate and refine longstanding established knife models. Sometime C.Q.I. changes are large and noticeable, sometimes they’re smaller refinements. Recently we applied C.Q.I. to the classic Dragonfly creating a new Dragonfly2. The Dragonfly2 upgrades some notable features over the classic while keeping the important basics. Features carrying-over to the new version are the tried and tested mid-sized blade and ergonomic handle along with a front-finger choil and spine cusp. Also staying is the blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points which make the Dragonfly cut and feel like a much larger large knife when in the hand. New refinements include: the addition of a left/right tip-up wire clip, patented Bi-Directional Texturing™ on the handle, choil and spine jimping and screw together handle construction. The blade is a high-performance flat-grind ZDP-189. The position of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot leads to smooth opening and the FRN (fiberglass reinforce nylon) handle fits the hand ergonomically with a series of grip angles and leveraging spots.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JHI7d6bJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VG77R8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 65.84}}
