{"item_id": "B004VLKLJE", "title": "Husqvarna Hatchet (1.2 lbs) with 15\" Handle", "description": "Sturdy little hatchet with that \"feel good\" weight in the hand. The cutting edge of the Hatchet is convex and slightly widened to chop or split firewood. The handle is curved with a Husqvarna logo and a convenient lanyard hole. Made from Swedish steel and solid hickory. Comes with its own leather sheath. Dimensions Weight of Head 1.21 lbs. (0.55 kg) Length of Head: 5-3/4\" Face of Head: 3\" Back of Head Length: 2\" Handle: 15\"", "text": "Husqvarna Hatchet (1.2 lbs) with 15\" Handle Sturdy little hatchet with that \"feel good\" weight in the hand. The cutting edge of the Hatchet is convex and slightly widened to chop or split firewood. The handle is curved with a Husqvarna logo and a convenient lanyard hole. Made from Swedish steel and solid hickory. Comes with its own leather sheath. Dimensions Weight of Head 1.21 lbs. (0.55 kg) Length of Head: 5-3/4\" Face of Head: 3\" Back of Head Length: 2\" Handle: 15\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dXUInk46L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VLKLJE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Husqvarna", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 44.75}}
{"item_id": "B004VMLMVE", "title": "AR-PEPR QD Scope Mount", "description": "The Burris AR-PEPR 30 millimeter Quick Detach Scope Mount with Picatinny Tops make it easy to gear up for different applications or shooting disciplines. The PEPR stands for Proper Eye Position Ready for combat. The ring bases are milled as a single, tough unit. The top of the rings feature the Picatinny rails for mounting additional accessories. The two Quick Detach levers make it easy to change optics or switch to iron sights and still maintain return to zero reliability.", "text": "AR-PEPR QD Scope Mount The Burris AR-PEPR 30 millimeter Quick Detach Scope Mount with Picatinny Tops make it easy to gear up for different applications or shooting disciplines. The PEPR stands for Proper Eye Position Ready for combat. The ring bases are milled as a single, tough unit. The top of the rings feature the Picatinny rails for mounting additional accessories. The two Quick Detach levers make it easy to change optics or switch to iron sights and still maintain return to zero reliability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-guZ%2BXRpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VMLMVE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 103.99}}
