{"item_id": "B004VNOTHM", "title": "Sea to Summit Solution Gear Tie Down Straps with Neoprene Buckle Cover (Pairs) - 18 Ft", "description": "With features like more rigid webbing and a larger cam buckle, this tie down is one of the easiest to feed on the market. Protection features like AS / NZS safety standards and thick neoprene cam cover to protect your car. Suitable for all types of canoes, kayaks, rafts and the excess trailer load.", "text": "Sea to Summit Solution Gear Tie Down Straps with Neoprene Buckle Cover (Pairs) - 18 Ft With features like more rigid webbing and a larger cam buckle, this tie down is one of the easiest to feed on the market. Protection features like AS / NZS safety standards and thick neoprene cam cover to protect your car. Suitable for all types of canoes, kayaks, rafts and the excess trailer load.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4177y0p7vcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VNOTHM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Transportation & Storage", "Car Rack Accessories"]]}}
