{"item_id": "B004VQNAEM", "title": "Digital Hanging/Fishing/Luggage Scale", "description": "Product Introduction: This portable digital fishing scale offers 2 choices of locking function: Automatic lock in of reading when weight is stabilize or No Automatic lock like spring scales. Feature: ABS Engineering Plastic Low Battery & Overload Indicator Tare Full Capacity Auto-Off Function Specification: Scale weight up to 40 kg, 88 lbs, 1,210 oz Minimum weight: 20 grams, 0.04 lb, .7 oz 3 Unit Selection: kg / lb / oz High accuracy: 10 gram / 0.02 pound / 0.5 ounces Package Content: 1 x Digital Fishing Scale", "text": "Digital Hanging/Fishing/Luggage Scale Product Introduction: This portable digital fishing scale offers 2 choices of locking function: Automatic lock in of reading when weight is stabilize or No Automatic lock like spring scales. Feature: ABS Engineering Plastic Low Battery & Overload Indicator Tare Full Capacity Auto-Off Function Specification: Scale weight up to 40 kg, 88 lbs, 1,210 oz Minimum weight: 20 grams, 0.04 lb, .7 oz 3 Unit Selection: kg / lb / oz High accuracy: 10 gram / 0.02 pound / 0.5 ounces Package Content: 1 x Digital Fishing Scale", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BlbBDvQXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VQNAEM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Fish Scales"]]}}
