{"item_id": "B004VRMW7C", "title": "Beretta 92 FS Durable Electric Airsoft Blowback Pistol", "description": "AirRattle is bringing you a fully licensed and trademarked 92F with Beretta! I really cannot go into enough detail about how good this airsoft pistol looks. This M92F airsoft pistol has a blow back feature where the top slide will kick back when fired. Our AEP 92F can fire in semi-auto to conserve ammo using the double tap method. Battery operated guns are best for a buyer willing to trade some FPS of gas and CO2 guns for convenience of a battery system. This is a 1:1 scale so it will fit in any real holster design for a 92F. A must have side arm for your collection!", "text": "Beretta 92 FS Durable Electric Airsoft Blowback Pistol AirRattle is bringing you a fully licensed and trademarked 92F with Beretta! I really cannot go into enough detail about how good this airsoft pistol looks. This M92F airsoft pistol has a blow back feature where the top slide will kick back when fired. Our AEP 92F can fire in semi-auto to conserve ammo using the double tap method. Battery operated guns are best for a buyer willing to trade some FPS of gas and CO2 guns for convenience of a battery system. This is a 1:1 scale so it will fit in any real holster design for a 92F. A must have side arm for your collection!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ymuMSGXjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VRMW7C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Umarex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 24.32}}
{"item_id": "B004VS05E8", "title": "Buck Hood Hoodlum Hunting Knife", "description": "The Hoodlum is built for ultimate survival. Based on Ron Hood's design and built to Buck's quality standards, the Hoodlum helps ensure survival in extreme conditions. It is light enough to carry in a sheath, but heavy duty enough for any task out in the wilderness. The handle is built with a Shock Mitigation System (SMS) to alleviate shock and wasted energy when chopping. It has a large finger choil for providing control while whittling or other detailed activities. A groove is cut into the blade spine for scoring bone, bending wire, removing pots from a camp fire, or other small tasks. Also, the Micarta handles can be removed to create a spear by lashing a branch to the tang of the blade. There is an integrated hammer and lanyard hole in the butt of the handle and it comes with a heavy duty nylon sheath. The Hoodlum will serve all your survival needs from protection to food prep while out in the wilderness.", "text": "Buck Hood Hoodlum Hunting Knife The Hoodlum is built for ultimate survival. Based on Ron Hood's design and built to Buck's quality standards, the Hoodlum helps ensure survival in extreme conditions. It is light enough to carry in a sheath, but heavy duty enough for any task out in the wilderness. The handle is built with a Shock Mitigation System (SMS) to alleviate shock and wasted energy when chopping. It has a large finger choil for providing control while whittling or other detailed activities. A groove is cut into the blade spine for scoring bone, bending wire, removing pots from a camp fire, or other small tasks. Also, the Micarta handles can be removed to create a spear by lashing a branch to the tang of the blade. There is an integrated hammer and lanyard hole in the butt of the handle and it comes with a heavy duty nylon sheath. The Hoodlum will serve all your survival needs from protection to food prep while out in the wilderness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Rin32pBTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VS05E8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 120.97}}
{"item_id": "B004VS0G60", "title": "Buck B&C Hunt Fair Chase General Hunting Knife", "description": "In what is a natural joining of American traditions, Buck Knives and Boone and Crockett Club have worked together to create a special line of knives to honor the heroes of conservation. This collection pays tribute to men like Theodore Roosevelt who gave rise to the American conservation movement and forever changed the way we view our wildlife resources. Buck is committed to helping protect America's wildlife resources and hunting heritage through the Boone and Crockett Club's principals of Fair Chase and conservation.", "text": "Buck B&C Hunt Fair Chase General Hunting Knife In what is a natural joining of American traditions, Buck Knives and Boone and Crockett Club have worked together to create a special line of knives to honor the heroes of conservation. This collection pays tribute to men like Theodore Roosevelt who gave rise to the American conservation movement and forever changed the way we view our wildlife resources. Buck is committed to helping protect America's wildlife resources and hunting heritage through the Boone and Crockett Club's principals of Fair Chase and conservation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314Q5SRV4PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VS0G60.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004VS2LUO", "title": "Spyderco Stretch British ZDP-189 Racing Green FRN PlainEdge Knife", "description": "The Spyderco Stretch has changed over the years much like watching one of your kids grow up. What started as a small basic Hunter model in the 1980s matured/stretched into an elegant high performance drop point folder available in a variety of handle materials and blade steels. The latest is a lightweight model with a Brithish Racing Green FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle. The ZDP-189 modified drop-point blade is ground thin and fully-flat with an arcing belly, installing itself as a winner for outdoor endeavors and carrying everyday. Turned-out with a mid-spine positioned back lock the FRN handle is injection molded and surfaced with Bi-Directional Texturing® When the palm meets the texturing tactile resistance results, stopping in its tracks forward or backward sliding under harsh, wet or slippery cutting circumstances. The steel pocket clip screws into pre-drilled holes on both sides and both ends of the knife making four possible carry options: left/right-handed and tip-up or tip-down.", "text": "Spyderco Stretch British ZDP-189 Racing Green FRN PlainEdge Knife The Spyderco Stretch has changed over the years much like watching one of your kids grow up. What started as a small basic Hunter model in the 1980s matured/stretched into an elegant high performance drop point folder available in a variety of handle materials and blade steels. The latest is a lightweight model with a Brithish Racing Green FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle. The ZDP-189 modified drop-point blade is ground thin and fully-flat with an arcing belly, installing itself as a winner for outdoor endeavors and carrying everyday. Turned-out with a mid-spine positioned back lock the FRN handle is injection molded and surfaced with Bi-Directional Texturing® When the palm meets the texturing tactile resistance results, stopping in its tracks forward or backward sliding under harsh, wet or slippery cutting circumstances. The steel pocket clip screws into pre-drilled holes on both sides and both ends of the knife making four possible carry options: left/right-handed and tip-up or tip-down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E6pfegCmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VS2LUO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 101.96}}
{"item_id": "B004VSDXQK", "title": "ShedRays by ShedRain 3148 Silver 62-Inch Arc Manual Open vented Golf Umbrella with UPF 50+ Sun Protection", "description": "Play it safe in the rain or sun with this 62 inch arc vented golf umbrella featuring a polyurethane canopy that provides an ultraviolet protection factor (UPF) of 50+, the highest possible rating. All elements of the umbrella are designed to hold up in adverse weather conditions as well as withstand the stresses of use over time.", "text": "ShedRays by ShedRain 3148 Silver 62-Inch Arc Manual Open vented Golf Umbrella with UPF 50+ Sun Protection Play it safe in the rain or sun with this 62 inch arc vented golf umbrella featuring a polyurethane canopy that provides an ultraviolet protection factor (UPF) of 50+, the highest possible rating. All elements of the umbrella are designed to hold up in adverse weather conditions as well as withstand the stresses of use over time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ti0ogYZiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VSDXQK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]], "price": 29.9}}
{"item_id": "B004VSEB8O", "title": "Black Leather Belt Holster for Ruger LCP .380", "description": "Pro-Tech's leather holsters are made with top grade leather. Hand crafted with strong Bonded nylon thread. This black leather gun holster Fits the Ruger LCP .380 30 Day Money Back Guarantee. Right Hand Only A WORD FROM PRO-TECH OUTDOORS Quality and customer satisfaction is our primary focus! We are committed to producing the finest leather holsters available on today's market and offer affordable holsters produced from the highest quality material. We offer quality warranties on all our products... that tells our customers that we take pride in producing the highest quality leather holsters possible!! Our goal is simple; quality first above sales, with customer satisfaction guaranteed!!! PRO-TECH IS ON YOUR \"SIDE\".", "text": "Black Leather Belt Holster for Ruger LCP .380 Pro-Tech's leather holsters are made with top grade leather. Hand crafted with strong Bonded nylon thread. This black leather gun holster Fits the Ruger LCP .380 30 Day Money Back Guarantee. Right Hand Only A WORD FROM PRO-TECH OUTDOORS Quality and customer satisfaction is our primary focus! We are committed to producing the finest leather holsters available on today's market and offer affordable holsters produced from the highest quality material. We offer quality warranties on all our products... that tells our customers that we take pride in producing the highest quality leather holsters possible!! Our goal is simple; quality first above sales, with customer satisfaction guaranteed!!! PRO-TECH IS ON YOUR \"SIDE\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412mdcurMYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004VSEB8O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.97}}
