{"item_id": "B004W2KOL2", "title": "Allen Company Crossbow Double Handle Cocking Device", "description": "Universal Crossbow Cocking Harness. Don't go off half cocked! Universal Cocking Harness reduces crossbow cocking effort by 50%! Of course, it provides full draw, just much easier. Fits in a standard jacket pocket. Adjusts for use with all crossbows. Compact, lightweight at just 14 ozs. Act Now! Universal Crossbow Cocking Harness", "text": "Allen Company Crossbow Double Handle Cocking Device Universal Crossbow Cocking Harness. Don't go off half cocked! Universal Cocking Harness reduces crossbow cocking effort by 50%! Of course, it provides full draw, just much easier. Fits in a standard jacket pocket. Adjusts for use with all crossbows. Compact, lightweight at just 14 ozs. Act Now! Universal Crossbow Cocking Harness", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FeKrY%2BXlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W2KOL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Releases & Aids", "Cocking Devices"]], "price": 17.68}}
