{"item_id": "B004W2KTJE", "title": "Allen Company Pink Camo Pistol Rug", "description": "Allen Pistol Rug pads your handgun with a little pink camo attitude to spare. Smart protection, sharp attitude color! Perfect for under a car seat, in a glove compartment or a small drawer, this Allen Pistol Rug sports tough nylon construction and foam lining to soak up the bumps, keep your pistol from rattling around during transport. Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. One tough customer: Durable nylon outer shell with pink camo print for good measure; 1/2\" foam padding offers heavy-duty protection for your gun while you travel; Durable, convenient zipper closure. Dependable storage and transport for your weapon! State Size. Order Today! Allen Pistol Rug", "text": "Allen Company Pink Camo Pistol Rug Allen Pistol Rug pads your handgun with a little pink camo attitude to spare. Smart protection, sharp attitude color! Perfect for under a car seat, in a glove compartment or a small drawer, this Allen Pistol Rug sports tough nylon construction and foam lining to soak up the bumps, keep your pistol from rattling around during transport. Skip the retail store price and save some cash with volume pricing. One tough customer: Durable nylon outer shell with pink camo print for good measure; 1/2\" foam padding offers heavy-duty protection for your gun while you travel; Durable, convenient zipper closure. Dependable storage and transport for your weapon! State Size. Order Today! Allen Pistol Rug", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51fjw4iJ%2BAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W2KTJE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004W2KU3Y", "title": "Allen Company Handgun Cleaning Kit in Compact Molded Carry Case for .22-.45 Caliber", "description": "Allen Company Handgun Ready-Kit features: 16 piece cleaning kit; Durable Case with Allen Logo; 10 Inch Brass Cleaning Rod; Brushes and swabs for .22, .38, .357, .44, .45 cal. and 9mm.", "text": "Allen Company Handgun Cleaning Kit in Compact Molded Carry Case for .22-.45 Caliber Allen Company Handgun Ready-Kit features: 16 piece cleaning kit; Durable Case with Allen Logo; 10 Inch Brass Cleaning Rod; Brushes and swabs for .22, .38, .357, .44, .45 cal. and 9mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pB05LbugL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W2KU3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Allen Allen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 16.11}}
{"item_id": "B004W2XO1Y", "title": "Spyderco ParaMilitary2 Camo G-10 Black Blade PlainEdge Knife", "description": "Digital camouflage is the result of applying engineering psychology with the study of visual biophysics and human visual performance. Digital camouflage pattern is a mosaic of small connected micro-patterns, optically reducing the eye’s ability to detect and discern an object. Digital patterns were developed to enhance concealment for our men and women of the U.S. Military going into harm’s way protecting our freedom. The Para-Military2 has several changes over the classic version. The G-10 handle is narrowed at the end improving the ergonomics. The handle and blade have been profiled thinner; removing uncomfortable angles when in the closed position. It features a Compression Lock and an ambidextrous-friendly four way clip which carries tip-up/tip-down, left/right-hand and rests deeper in a pocket. We kept the same high-performance CPM-S30V full flat-ground blade but we’ve also lengthened the blade’s tip and added additional surface jimping to both the spine and finger choil. Implementation of a new Bushing Pivot System generates fluid action and more consistent manufacturing tolerances. Larger lanyard gives more options for carry. Refinements to overall construction may not be drastic or even visible to the eye but from the G-10 textured handle to the CPM-S30V steel full flat blade, everything is sharper, smoother and guaranteed to provide performance and user comfort.", "text": "Spyderco ParaMilitary2 Camo G-10 Black Blade PlainEdge Knife Digital camouflage is the result of applying engineering psychology with the study of visual biophysics and human visual performance. Digital camouflage pattern is a mosaic of small connected micro-patterns, optically reducing the eye’s ability to detect and discern an object. Digital patterns were developed to enhance concealment for our men and women of the U.S. Military going into harm’s way protecting our freedom. The Para-Military2 has several changes over the classic version. The G-10 handle is narrowed at the end improving the ergonomics. The handle and blade have been profiled thinner; removing uncomfortable angles when in the closed position. It features a Compression Lock and an ambidextrous-friendly four way clip which carries tip-up/tip-down, left/right-hand and rests deeper in a pocket. We kept the same high-performance CPM-S30V full flat-ground blade but we’ve also lengthened the blade’s tip and added additional surface jimping to both the spine and finger choil. Implementation of a new Bushing Pivot System generates fluid action and more consistent manufacturing tolerances. Larger lanyard gives more options for carry. Refinements to overall construction may not be drastic or even visible to the eye but from the G-10 textured handle to the CPM-S30V steel full flat blade, everything is sharper, smoother and guaranteed to provide performance and user comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NWQMxAbvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W2XO1Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004W3S8KU", "title": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Water Bottle 40 oz.", "description": "Dishwasher-safe, eco-friendly, high-quality stainless steel water bottles from Klean Kanteen offer a great alternative to plastic and lined metal bottles. Constructed of food-grade #304 stainless steel, Kleen Kanteen bottles are BPA-free and 100 percent recyclable.An all-stainless steel interior, 18/8 stainless caps, and stainless steel threads mean the bottles won't retain or leach flavors, so you get a fresh, clean, crisp drink every time. Because Klean Kanteen bottles are constructed of food-grade stainless steel, they're not coated with a plastic or epoxy lining like aluminum bottles.The new wide mouth line of bottles have an opening more than two inches in diameter, which makes filling, pouring, and cleaning the bottle a cinch, and the universal thread design works with most standard backcountry water filters without an adapter. With the Klean Kanteen Wide, you have even more earth- and body-friendly choices.They come in five sizes, ranging from 12 to 64 ounces, and all come in pure, shiny brushed stainless steel. The wide bottles are shorter and more compact than Klean Kanteen Classic bottles but incorporate the same slim design, meaning sizes up to 27 ounces fit in most cup holders. They also come standard with the Stainless Loop Cap, which works seamlessly with the S-Biner, so it's a snap to clip it right onto a shoulder strap or pack.", "text": "Klean Kanteen Wide Mouth Water Bottle 40 oz. Dishwasher-safe, eco-friendly, high-quality stainless steel water bottles from Klean Kanteen offer a great alternative to plastic and lined metal bottles. Constructed of food-grade #304 stainless steel, Kleen Kanteen bottles are BPA-free and 100 percent recyclable.An all-stainless steel interior, 18/8 stainless caps, and stainless steel threads mean the bottles won't retain or leach flavors, so you get a fresh, clean, crisp drink every time. Because Klean Kanteen bottles are constructed of food-grade stainless steel, they're not coated with a plastic or epoxy lining like aluminum bottles.The new wide mouth line of bottles have an opening more than two inches in diameter, which makes filling, pouring, and cleaning the bottle a cinch, and the universal thread design works with most standard backcountry water filters without an adapter. With the Klean Kanteen Wide, you have even more earth- and body-friendly choices.They come in five sizes, ranging from 12 to 64 ounces, and all come in pure, shiny brushed stainless steel. The wide bottles are shorter and more compact than Klean Kanteen Classic bottles but incorporate the same slim design, meaning sizes up to 27 ounces fit in most cup holders. They also come standard with the Stainless Loop Cap, which works seamlessly with the S-Biner, so it's a snap to clip it right onto a shoulder strap or pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319Yras8TYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W3S8KU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 29.4}}
{"item_id": "B004W3UEZW", "title": "Blackhawk Men's Advanced Boonie Hat Multicam", "description": "BLACKHAWK! Has taken the proven boonie design and modernized it to meet the needs of today’s warrior. Choose between DM3 Desert Digital and Multi Cam patterns to wear in conjunction with their uniforms. Features: Lightweight and crushable; flat top with floppy brim; self fabric brim lining; soft mesh side vents, crown lining, and hidden mesh map pockets; square VELCRO brand loop on crown for attaching badges, etc.; self fabric side-band branch loops; drawstring with cord lock at back can be used as chin strap and cinching cord to keep secure; and it's available in DM3 Desert Digital and Multi Cam . To find your correct size, measure around your head where your hat normally sits and follow these guidelines: 90AB00DD-700 Circumference: 22” 90AB00DD-725 Circumference: 22-3/4” 90AB00DD-750 Circumference: 23-1/2” 90AB00DD-775 Circumference: 24-1/4” 90AB00DD-800 Circumference: 25” 90AB00MC-700 Circumference: 22” 90AB00MC-725 Circumference: 22-3/4” 90AB00MC-750 Circumference: 23-1/2” 90AB00MC-775 Circumference: 24-1/4” 90AB00MC-800 Circumference: 25”", "text": "Blackhawk Men's Advanced Boonie Hat Multicam BLACKHAWK! Has taken the proven boonie design and modernized it to meet the needs of today’s warrior. Choose between DM3 Desert Digital and Multi Cam patterns to wear in conjunction with their uniforms. Features: Lightweight and crushable; flat top with floppy brim; self fabric brim lining; soft mesh side vents, crown lining, and hidden mesh map pockets; square VELCRO brand loop on crown for attaching badges, etc.; self fabric side-band branch loops; drawstring with cord lock at back can be used as chin strap and cinching cord to keep secure; and it's available in DM3 Desert Digital and Multi Cam . To find your correct size, measure around your head where your hat normally sits and follow these guidelines: 90AB00DD-700 Circumference: 22” 90AB00DD-725 Circumference: 22-3/4” 90AB00DD-750 Circumference: 23-1/2” 90AB00DD-775 Circumference: 24-1/4” 90AB00DD-800 Circumference: 25” 90AB00MC-700 Circumference: 22” 90AB00MC-725 Circumference: 22-3/4” 90AB00MC-750 Circumference: 23-1/2” 90AB00MC-775 Circumference: 24-1/4” 90AB00MC-800 Circumference: 25”", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KIB56aOKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W3UEZW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 20.89}}
{"item_id": "B004W3WC84", "title": "Plano Ammo Can (Field Box)", "description": "A very economical way to store and transport ammunition. Buy one for every caliber.", "text": "Plano Ammo Can (Field Box) A very economical way to store and transport ammunition. Buy one for every caliber.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fbPv-TXSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W3WC84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Plano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 11.7}}
{"item_id": "B004W40G1S", "title": "Wild Game Innovations Red 6 Infrared Digital Scouting Camera", "description": "This 6-megapixel trail camera features a 36-piece high-intensity infrared flash which takes clear day and night time pictures and videos. The Red 6 has rapid trigger speeds and a PIR sensor range of up to 50 feet. Its large LCD screen makes it easy to view and easy to program and onboard batteries retain date and time settings from use to use.Features:36 Piece high intensity Infrared flashFlash range is up to 50 feetDay and Night time video capabilityLarge LCD programming screenRapid trigger speedUp to 16GB HDSC Card - not includedUSB Cable and bungee cords includedOnboard batteries to retain date and time settingsExternal battery port - for use with EBXFour C Sized Batteries - not included", "text": "Wild Game Innovations Red 6 Infrared Digital Scouting Camera This 6-megapixel trail camera features a 36-piece high-intensity infrared flash which takes clear day and night time pictures and videos. The Red 6 has rapid trigger speeds and a PIR sensor range of up to 50 feet. Its large LCD screen makes it easy to view and easy to program and onboard batteries retain date and time settings from use to use.Features:36 Piece high intensity Infrared flashFlash range is up to 50 feetDay and Night time video capabilityLarge LCD programming screenRapid trigger speedUp to 16GB HDSC Card - not includedUSB Cable and bungee cords includedOnboard batteries to retain date and time settingsExternal battery port - for use with EBXFour C Sized Batteries - not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CsOr4jRRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W40G1S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 75.18}}
{"item_id": "B004W4I5BQ", "title": "Spalding Robinson Cano Youth Mesh I-Web Fielding Glove", "description": "A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "text": "Spalding Robinson Cano Youth Mesh I-Web Fielding Glove A Division of Russell Brands, LLC, Spalding is the largest basketball equipment supplier in the world, and America's first baseball company. Spalding is the official basketball of the National Basketball Association (NBA) and Women's National Basketball Association (WNBA), the official backboard of the NBA and NCAA, the official baseball of the Little League World Series, the official volleyball of the King of the Beach Volleyball Tour and of the \"Pro Beach Series\" and the official football of Pop Warner. In addition to being a leading producer and marketer of basketballs, footballs, volleyballs and soccer balls, Spalding produces softballs under the Dudley brand. The SPALDING® and DUDLEY® trademarks are owned by Russell Brands, LLC.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51MjL8V9mKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W4I5BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spalding", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Infielder's Gloves"]], "price": 38.79}}
{"item_id": "B004W4P5CS", "title": "Tenn Lightweight Cycling Waterproof Breathable Trousers", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured and brought to you by Tenn Outdoors. Top quality waterproof trousers specificallydesigned for all types of cycling and walking, constructed with tough rip-stop fabric. All the seams are fully taped, meaning that these are fully waterproof. The waist is fully elasticated and really comfortable. The outside of both legs incorporate full length high visibility reflective trim for improved night visibility and safety, meaning you will be seen at night.25cm ankle zips allow these trousers to be unzipped at the ankle and slipped over your shoes or boots. Great when you're in a hurry! The bottom of the trousers can be made tighter with the adjustable tab fastening, which also incorporates highly reflective logos. Pocket flaps on the hips allow easy access to your own trouser pockets. Velcro fastenings allow the pocket flaps to be sealed. Averaging around 210g, these are light enough to go anywhere for cyclists who need to work hard but stay dry. These can be worn either as a trouser or over-trouser dependant on the temperature conditions. Available in 2 colours (Navy and Black) and various sizes up to 4XL.", "text": "Tenn Lightweight Cycling Waterproof Breathable Trousers Another outstanding value product manufactured and brought to you by Tenn Outdoors. Top quality waterproof trousers specificallydesigned for all types of cycling and walking, constructed with tough rip-stop fabric. All the seams are fully taped, meaning that these are fully waterproof. The waist is fully elasticated and really comfortable. The outside of both legs incorporate full length high visibility reflective trim for improved night visibility and safety, meaning you will be seen at night.25cm ankle zips allow these trousers to be unzipped at the ankle and slipped over your shoes or boots. Great when you're in a hurry! The bottom of the trousers can be made tighter with the adjustable tab fastening, which also incorporates highly reflective logos. Pocket flaps on the hips allow easy access to your own trouser pockets. Velcro fastenings allow the pocket flaps to be sealed. Averaging around 210g, these are light enough to go anywhere for cyclists who need to work hard but stay dry. These can be worn either as a trouser or over-trouser dependant on the temperature conditions. Available in 2 colours (Navy and Black) and various sizes up to 4XL.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HxmpymNsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W4P5CS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Pants"]], "price": 29.99}}
