{"item_id": "B004W83H5Q", "title": "Military Style Nylon Rip-Stop Warm Adult Outdoor Poncho Liner - 62\" x 82\"", "description": "Military Style Nylon Rip-Stop Warm Adult Outdoor Poncho Liner (62\" x 82\") - This poncho liner consists of rip-stop nylon outershell, encasing a polyester loft filling. With string ties. GI Government Issued Style. Fits under many ponchos. Originating in the United States Military and was intended to provide warmth in mild temperatures used as an expedient sleeping bag when attached to the standard issue poncho. Troops generally hold the poncho liner in high regard, as a very useful piece of equipment. Light & packable, yet reasonably warm. Not USA Made. Import. Dimensions: 62\" x 82\" (Inches).Fits Adult Size Ponchos. Made from 100% Nylon Material. Quilted With Fiberfill Insulation. Strings Attached. Many People Use This Item For Fishing, Camping, Hiking, Traveling, Everyday Use, however it is not limited to just these things. Extremely durable & high quality & made to last. Unisex, Great for both men & women. One size fits most.Choose from: ACU Digital Camouflage, Black, Desert Digital Camouflage, Woodland Digital Camouflage, Olive Drab & Woodland Camouflage.", "text": "Military Style Nylon Rip-Stop Warm Adult Outdoor Poncho Liner - 62\" x 82\" Military Style Nylon Rip-Stop Warm Adult Outdoor Poncho Liner (62\" x 82\") - This poncho liner consists of rip-stop nylon outershell, encasing a polyester loft filling. With string ties. GI Government Issued Style. Fits under many ponchos. Originating in the United States Military and was intended to provide warmth in mild temperatures used as an expedient sleeping bag when attached to the standard issue poncho. Troops generally hold the poncho liner in high regard, as a very useful piece of equipment. Light & packable, yet reasonably warm. Not USA Made. Import. Dimensions: 62\" x 82\" (Inches).Fits Adult Size Ponchos. Made from 100% Nylon Material. Quilted With Fiberfill Insulation. Strings Attached. Many People Use This Item For Fishing, Camping, Hiking, Traveling, Everyday Use, however it is not limited to just these things. Extremely durable & high quality & made to last. Unisex, Great for both men & women. One size fits most.Choose from: ACU Digital Camouflage, Black, Desert Digital Camouflage, Woodland Digital Camouflage, Olive Drab & Woodland Camouflage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aLWbK6TtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004W83H5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 42.46}}
{"item_id": "B004WA63C8", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Better BDU Belt 1.5-Inch", "description": "Features & Benefits: STRONG AND DURABLE. The new BATTLE BUCKLE (patent pending) is tough enough to withstand the most rigorous battle conditions. NON-MAGNETIC. Won’t set off metal detectors and is safe for EOD use. LOAD-BEARING CAPACITY. The first Nylon pants belt webbing specifically engineered for increased gear carrying capacity. COMFORTABLE . “Micro-adjustable” buckle for greater comfort and a perfect fit. FAST AND EASY. Unique “Flip-Tab” buckle design allows quick, easy belt sizing and adjustment. TWO WIDTHS AND THREE WAIST SIZES. Available in 1.5” and 1.75” widths and three waist sizes: Regular 24-36 inches, Large, 36-46 inches, and X-Large 46-54 inches. SIX COLORS. Black, Olive, Tan, Coyote Brown, Air Force Blue and Gray (approved for the USMC Martial Arts Program). • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE!", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Better BDU Belt 1.5-Inch Features & Benefits: STRONG AND DURABLE. The new BATTLE BUCKLE (patent pending) is tough enough to withstand the most rigorous battle conditions. NON-MAGNETIC. Won’t set off metal detectors and is safe for EOD use. LOAD-BEARING CAPACITY. The first Nylon pants belt webbing specifically engineered for increased gear carrying capacity. COMFORTABLE . “Micro-adjustable” buckle for greater comfort and a perfect fit. FAST AND EASY. Unique “Flip-Tab” buckle design allows quick, easy belt sizing and adjustment. TWO WIDTHS AND THREE WAIST SIZES. Available in 1.5” and 1.75” widths and three waist sizes: Regular 24-36 inches, Large, 36-46 inches, and X-Large 46-54 inches. SIX COLORS. Black, Olive, Tan, Coyote Brown, Air Force Blue and Gray (approved for the USMC Martial Arts Program). • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NmU3T1bbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WA63C8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Belts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WA67HE", "title": "Vilano Fixed Gear Bike Fixie Single Speed Road Bike", "description": "Your Bike - Your Style! This Fixed Gear / Single Speed is completely unbranded. No permanent logos or graphics, just solid color. The frame and fork is hi-ten steel with alloy seat post and stem. It comes equipped a flip-flop rear hub for easy conversion from single speed to fixed gear (just flip the rear wheel).Available in many color styles.Full Specs:Frame: Fixed Gear Tig welded (120mm rear spacing)Fork: 700c 1 1/8\" ThreadlessWheels: 700c Double walled w/ CNC machined sidesRear Hub: Flip-Flop Freewheel / FixedTires: 700c x 25cCrankset: Alloy with replaceable 46T ChainringBrakes: Caliper - front and rear drop bar version, rear riser bar versionHeadset: Alloy ThreadlessStem: Alloy Threadless 25.4Handlebar: AlloySaddle: Urban", "text": "Vilano Fixed Gear Bike Fixie Single Speed Road Bike Your Bike - Your Style! This Fixed Gear / Single Speed is completely unbranded. No permanent logos or graphics, just solid color. The frame and fork is hi-ten steel with alloy seat post and stem. It comes equipped a flip-flop rear hub for easy conversion from single speed to fixed gear (just flip the rear wheel).Available in many color styles.Full Specs:Frame: Fixed Gear Tig welded (120mm rear spacing)Fork: 700c 1 1/8\" ThreadlessWheels: 700c Double walled w/ CNC machined sidesRear Hub: Flip-Flop Freewheel / FixedTires: 700c x 25cCrankset: Alloy with replaceable 46T ChainringBrakes: Caliper - front and rear drop bar version, rear riser bar versionHeadset: Alloy ThreadlessStem: Alloy Threadless 25.4Handlebar: AlloySaddle: Urban", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519E46WE-ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WA67HE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Fixed Gear Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WB0T36", "title": "Gould & Goodrich B890-G27 Concealment Inside Trouser Holster (Black) Fits Glock 26, 27, 33 and Taurus PT111", "description": "Compact leather holster provides inside-waistband concealment. Clips to pants or skirt, or to belt up to 1-3/4 in. Open top. Fits Glock 26, 27, 33 and Taurus PT111", "text": "Gould & Goodrich B890-G27 Concealment Inside Trouser Holster (Black) Fits Glock 26, 27, 33 and Taurus PT111 Compact leather holster provides inside-waistband concealment. Clips to pants or skirt, or to belt up to 1-3/4 in. Open top. Fits Glock 26, 27, 33 and Taurus PT111", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418v9GFDNJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WB0T36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gould &amp; Goodrich", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 24.73}}
{"item_id": "B004WB0U5S", "title": "Gould & Goodrich B830-0 Gold Line Magazine Case (Black) Fits KAHR ARMS P380; KEL-TEC P3AT, P32; RUGER LCP; SIG P238; SW BODYGUARD 380", "description": "Compact magazine pouch has a tension screw to adjust to your preference. Easy-on, easy-off paddle. The Gold Line offers the best quality leather concealment products. See the deep molding and polishing. The Gold Line feels right...definitely. KAHR ARMS P380; KEL-TEC P3AT, P32; RUGER LCP; SIG P238; SW BODYGUARD 380", "text": "Gould & Goodrich B830-0 Gold Line Magazine Case (Black) Fits KAHR ARMS P380; KEL-TEC P3AT, P32; RUGER LCP; SIG P238; SW BODYGUARD 380 Compact magazine pouch has a tension screw to adjust to your preference. Easy-on, easy-off paddle. The Gold Line offers the best quality leather concealment products. See the deep molding and polishing. The Gold Line feels right...definitely. KAHR ARMS P380; KEL-TEC P3AT, P32; RUGER LCP; SIG P238; SW BODYGUARD 380", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gttFZHUdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WB0U5S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 29.11}}
{"item_id": "B004WB0ZEE", "title": "Gould & Goodrich 803-195 Gold Line Three Slot Pancake Holster (Chestnut Brown) Fits most 1911-type pistols with 4.75 in. to 5.0 in. bbl incl. BROWNING Hi-Power; COLT Elite, Gold Cup, Gov?t, 1911A1; KIMBER Custom, Target, Gold Match, Royal; PARA-ORDNANCE P14 .45, P16 .40; SPRINGFIELD 1911A1", "description": "Deep definition molding and unsurpassed quality. Wear tilted or straight up. Place on belt up to 1-3/4 in. Gold Line...The finest genuine leather holsters in the world. Fits most 1911-type pistols with 4.75 in. to 5.0 in. bbl incl. BROWNING Hi-Power; COLT Elite, Gold Cup, Gov’t, 1911A1; KIMBER Custom, Target, Gold Match, Royal; PARA-ORDNANCE P14 .45, P16 .40; SPRINGFIELD 1911A1", "text": "Gould & Goodrich 803-195 Gold Line Three Slot Pancake Holster (Chestnut Brown) Fits most 1911-type pistols with 4.75 in. to 5.0 in. bbl incl. BROWNING Hi-Power; COLT Elite, Gold Cup, Gov?t, 1911A1; KIMBER Custom, Target, Gold Match, Royal; PARA-ORDNANCE P14 .45, P16 .40; SPRINGFIELD 1911A1 Deep definition molding and unsurpassed quality. Wear tilted or straight up. Place on belt up to 1-3/4 in. Gold Line...The finest genuine leather holsters in the world. Fits most 1911-type pistols with 4.75 in. to 5.0 in. bbl incl. BROWNING Hi-Power; COLT Elite, Gold Cup, Gov’t, 1911A1; KIMBER Custom, Target, Gold Match, Royal; PARA-ORDNANCE P14 .45, P16 .40; SPRINGFIELD 1911A1", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AFJ4Rp3kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WB0ZEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gould &amp; Goodrich", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 64.93}}
{"item_id": "B004WB5ZX0", "title": "Gould & Goodrich B890-C40 Concealment Inside Trouser Holster (Black) Fits H&K USP 9 Compact, USP 40 Compact, USP 45 Compact, USP 357 Compact, H&K P2000, H&K P2000SK, H&K P3000 and S&W M&P Compact", "description": "Compact leather holster provides inside-waistband concealment. Clips to pants or skirt, or to belt up to 1-3/4 in. Open top. Fits H&K; USP 9 Compact, USP 40 Compact, USP 45 Compact, USP 357 Compact, H&K; P2000, H&K; P2000SK, H&K; P3000 and S&W; M&P; Compact", "text": "Gould & Goodrich B890-C40 Concealment Inside Trouser Holster (Black) Fits H&K USP 9 Compact, USP 40 Compact, USP 45 Compact, USP 357 Compact, H&K P2000, H&K P2000SK, H&K P3000 and S&W M&P Compact Compact leather holster provides inside-waistband concealment. Clips to pants or skirt, or to belt up to 1-3/4 in. Open top. Fits H&K; USP 9 Compact, USP 40 Compact, USP 45 Compact, USP 357 Compact, H&K; P2000, H&K; P2000SK, H&K; P3000 and S&W; M&P; Compact", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418v9GFDNJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WB5ZX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gould &amp; Goodrich", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 28.57}}
