{"item_id": "B004WBL5PW", "title": "Gerber 31-000594 Swagger Drop Point Knife Partially Serrated Edge", "description": "A dual G-10/Stainless Steel handle gives the Swagger grip and strength. Its unique machine styled blade earns its name.", "text": "Gerber 31-000594 Swagger Drop Point Knife Partially Serrated Edge A dual G-10/Stainless Steel handle gives the Swagger grip and strength. Its unique machine styled blade earns its name.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31a1xMSchsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WBL5PW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 22.38}}
{"item_id": "B004WBNGR2", "title": "Gerber LMF II ASEK - Coyote Brown Bx", "description": "Down behind enemy lines? Left to fend for yourself? These are the scenarios that inspired the LMF II. Former military man. Jeff Freeman led the charge to engineer this fearless new 10\" survival knife. And we field-tested with the troops.This knife is as adaptable as the personnel who carry it. Use it to cut through the skin of a fuselage. Or sever a seat belt. Or egress through the Plexiglas of a chopper. Plus. the LMF II does a slick job cutting firewood and building shelter.The over-molded handle successfully limits blistering. There is complete separation between the tang and butt cap. so the knife absorbs the shocks from hammering and prevents the shocks of electricity. Smartly situated grooves and lashing holes let the LMF II convert to a spear. The low-profile sheath facilitates movement. limits noise. works for parachuting. and attaches to a belt or Molle vest. The patented. integrated sharpener means edge retention in the field. Overall Length: 10.59\" Length of Blade: 4.84\" Weight: 11.4 oz. Blade Material: 420HC Stainless Handle Material: Glass-filled nylon with TPV overmold Blade Style: Drop Point Sheath Material: Ballistic nylon with fire retardant coating Blade Type: Serrated Safety cutter knife w/ sheath included!!!", "text": "Gerber LMF II ASEK - Coyote Brown Bx Down behind enemy lines? Left to fend for yourself? These are the scenarios that inspired the LMF II. Former military man. Jeff Freeman led the charge to engineer this fearless new 10\" survival knife. And we field-tested with the troops.This knife is as adaptable as the personnel who carry it. Use it to cut through the skin of a fuselage. Or sever a seat belt. Or egress through the Plexiglas of a chopper. Plus. the LMF II does a slick job cutting firewood and building shelter.The over-molded handle successfully limits blistering. There is complete separation between the tang and butt cap. so the knife absorbs the shocks from hammering and prevents the shocks of electricity. Smartly situated grooves and lashing holes let the LMF II convert to a spear. The low-profile sheath facilitates movement. limits noise. works for parachuting. and attaches to a belt or Molle vest. The patented. integrated sharpener means edge retention in the field. Overall Length: 10.59\" Length of Blade: 4.84\" Weight: 11.4 oz. Blade Material: 420HC Stainless Handle Material: Glass-filled nylon with TPV overmold Blade Style: Drop Point Sheath Material: Ballistic nylon with fire retardant coating Blade Type: Serrated Safety cutter knife w/ sheath included!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VVRRb37RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WBNGR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 79.3}}
{"item_id": "B004WDYXCC", "title": "Military Survival Paracord Bracelet (9\", Olive Drab)", "description": "7 strand Polyester cord. 3/4\" width. 7/16\" black plastic side release buckle. Available in 3 sizes: 7\", 8\" & 9\". Import. Our survival bracelets enable you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. Basically, every inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord.", "text": "Military Survival Paracord Bracelet (9\", Olive Drab) 7 strand Polyester cord. 3/4\" width. 7/16\" black plastic side release buckle. Available in 3 sizes: 7\", 8\" & 9\". Import. Our survival bracelets enable you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. Basically, every inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Lx-dku9nL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WDYXCC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 4.4}}
