{"item_id": "B004WF51Q2", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Master Knife Sheath 8- Inch Blade (Long)", "description": "Features & Benefits: Fully adjustable utility / tool pouch. \"550-cord\" tie-down and leg-loop rigging. Unique \"MULTI-FIT\" KYDEX liner securely holds most blade widths and thicknesses (removable for cleaning). Tie-down loops on underside. Web loop at bottom for tie-down to packs, leg-loop, etc. Extra durability with double-layered 1000D Cordura fabric used throughout. Mil-spec. Grommet tie-downs along sides of sheath body. Jump-ready with redundant tie-down for knife handle and additional secure-down points along body and backside of sheath. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Master Knife Sheath 8- Inch Blade (Long) Features & Benefits: Fully adjustable utility / tool pouch. \"550-cord\" tie-down and leg-loop rigging. Unique \"MULTI-FIT\" KYDEX liner securely holds most blade widths and thicknesses (removable for cleaning). Tie-down loops on underside. Web loop at bottom for tie-down to packs, leg-loop, etc. Extra durability with double-layered 1000D Cordura fabric used throughout. Mil-spec. Grommet tie-downs along sides of sheath body. Jump-ready with redundant tie-down for knife handle and additional secure-down points along body and backside of sheath. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uK2VT1XJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WF51Q2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 46.8}}
{"item_id": "B004WF5428", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Master Knife Sheath 6-Inch Blade (Short)", "description": "Features & Benefits: Fully adjustable utility / tool pouch. \"550-cord\" tie-down and leg-loop rigging. Unique \"MULTI-FIT\" KYDEX liner securely holds most blade widths and thicknesses (removable for cleaning). Tie-down loops on underside. Web loop at bottom for tie-down to packs, leg-loop, etc. Extra durability with double-layered 1000D Cordura fabric used throughout. Mil-spec. Grommet tie-downs along sides of sheath body. Jump-ready with redundant tie-down for knife handle and additional secure-down points along body and backside of sheath. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand Combat Master Knife Sheath 6-Inch Blade (Short) Features & Benefits: Fully adjustable utility / tool pouch. \"550-cord\" tie-down and leg-loop rigging. Unique \"MULTI-FIT\" KYDEX liner securely holds most blade widths and thicknesses (removable for cleaning). Tie-down loops on underside. Web loop at bottom for tie-down to packs, leg-loop, etc. Extra durability with double-layered 1000D Cordura fabric used throughout. Mil-spec. Grommet tie-downs along sides of sheath body. Jump-ready with redundant tie-down for knife handle and additional secure-down points along body and backside of sheath. • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HG93HGNUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WF5428.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 46.8}}
{"item_id": "B004WF8LA0", "title": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Wallet Mini", "description": "Features & Benefits: • Big enough to hold all of your daily essentials like cash, credit cards, and ID, yet small enough to be comfortably carried in a shirt pocket, front pants pocket, or worn around the neck. • Our exclusive “SHARK-BITETM,” an ultra-secure closure that has no hook & loop, buckles or snaps to wear out (or make noise). • Super-durable! Made from Cordura 1000D. Nylon fabric and Nylon pack cloth (double stitched and bar-tacked at critical stress points). • Mil-spec grommets to facilitate around the neck carry with Dog Tag Chain or 550 Cord neck lanyard (chain and 550 cord not included) • Measures 4.5” x 3.75” x 0.75” • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "text": "Spec-Ops Brand T.H.E. Wallet Mini Features & Benefits: • Big enough to hold all of your daily essentials like cash, credit cards, and ID, yet small enough to be comfortably carried in a shirt pocket, front pants pocket, or worn around the neck. • Our exclusive “SHARK-BITETM,” an ultra-secure closure that has no hook & loop, buckles or snaps to wear out (or make noise). • Super-durable! Made from Cordura 1000D. Nylon fabric and Nylon pack cloth (double stitched and bar-tacked at critical stress points). • Mil-spec grommets to facilitate around the neck carry with Dog Tag Chain or 550 Cord neck lanyard (chain and 550 cord not included) • Measures 4.5” x 3.75” x 0.75” • 100% Made In The U.S.A. - GUARANTEED FOR LIFE! Available in assorted colors.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YhwE0PDrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WF8LA0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spec.-Ops. Brand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B004WFYG0Y", "title": "Vortex 8x36 R/T Tactical Monocular with MRAD Ranging Reticle", "description": "Vortex Solo Tactical R/T 8x36 Monocular with Reticle Focus Ultra-compact and lightweight, the Solo Tactical R/T monocular delivers big-time optical quality in a palm-sized package. Built to exceed your expectations with generous eye relief and optical performance normally reserved for binoculars, the Solo R/T delivers bright, clear views anywhere. The R/T ranging reticle for precise target range estimation features mrad-based subtensions also includes a secondary quick-ranging system with silhouettes. The reticle focus ensures a sharp reticle iamge at all distances. Optical Features Fully Multi-Coated Lenses Increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces. Construction Features Waterproof Optics are sealed with O-rings to prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the monocular. Fogproof Nitrogen gas purging delivers fogproof and waterproof performance. Rubber Armor Provides a secure, non-slip grip, and durable external protection. Convenience Features Reticle Focus Ensures a sharp reticle image at all distances. Utility Clip Allows for multiple attachment points and quick field access. Flared Eyecup Blocks stray light and folds up and down for comfortable viewing with or without eyeglasses. Ultra Compact and Lightweight. Ranging reticle for holdover and windage corrections. Waterproof and Fogproof. Reticle Focus for sharp reticle image. Flared Eyecup blocks stray light.", "text": "Vortex 8x36 R/T Tactical Monocular with MRAD Ranging Reticle Vortex Solo Tactical R/T 8x36 Monocular with Reticle Focus Ultra-compact and lightweight, the Solo Tactical R/T monocular delivers big-time optical quality in a palm-sized package. Built to exceed your expectations with generous eye relief and optical performance normally reserved for binoculars, the Solo R/T delivers bright, clear views anywhere. The R/T ranging reticle for precise target range estimation features mrad-based subtensions also includes a secondary quick-ranging system with silhouettes. The reticle focus ensures a sharp reticle iamge at all distances. Optical Features Fully Multi-Coated Lenses Increase light transmission with multiple anti-reflective coatings on all air-to-glass surfaces. Construction Features Waterproof Optics are sealed with O-rings to prevent moisture, dust, and debris from getting inside the monocular. Fogproof Nitrogen gas purging delivers fogproof and waterproof performance. Rubber Armor Provides a secure, non-slip grip, and durable external protection. Convenience Features Reticle Focus Ensures a sharp reticle image at all distances. Utility Clip Allows for multiple attachment points and quick field access. Flared Eyecup Blocks stray light and folds up and down for comfortable viewing with or without eyeglasses. Ultra Compact and Lightweight. Ranging reticle for holdover and windage corrections. Waterproof and Fogproof. Reticle Focus for sharp reticle image. Flared Eyecup blocks stray light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B-rV7gBjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WFYG0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vortex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 119.0}}
{"item_id": "B004WFYQJA", "title": "Spyderco Superleaf Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife", "description": "Original CLIPIT knives from the early 1980s, set side-by-side against new models, reveal a definite trend in Spyderco’s design history, the leaf-shape blade. It has emerged as a CLIPIT signature due to the blade shape which has proven it functions efficiently in nearly all cutting applications, while offering enough breadth-of-blade to accommodate the Spyderco Round Hole. Requests for a super-sized Spyderco leaf-shaped blade keep coming and in response, the new SuperLeaf fills the order with its broad VG-10 PlainEdge flat-ground blade and black G-10 handle. Located at the blade’s spine and choil is jimping (texturing) which works in conjunction with an expanded pommel on the handle, coordinating grip on the handle and dexterous control over the sharpened edge while cutting. Tucked inside the scales is a Compression Lock® locking mechanism, skeletonized full liners, a piped lanyard hole, and a secure-attachment left/right-hand, tip-up wire clip. Pretty may be an option. Sharpness and performance are not, making it a positive attribute that the SuperLeaf has both.", "text": "Spyderco Superleaf Black G-10 PlainEdge Knife Original CLIPIT knives from the early 1980s, set side-by-side against new models, reveal a definite trend in Spyderco’s design history, the leaf-shape blade. It has emerged as a CLIPIT signature due to the blade shape which has proven it functions efficiently in nearly all cutting applications, while offering enough breadth-of-blade to accommodate the Spyderco Round Hole. Requests for a super-sized Spyderco leaf-shaped blade keep coming and in response, the new SuperLeaf fills the order with its broad VG-10 PlainEdge flat-ground blade and black G-10 handle. Located at the blade’s spine and choil is jimping (texturing) which works in conjunction with an expanded pommel on the handle, coordinating grip on the handle and dexterous control over the sharpened edge while cutting. Tucked inside the scales is a Compression Lock® locking mechanism, skeletonized full liners, a piped lanyard hole, and a secure-attachment left/right-hand, tip-up wire clip. Pretty may be an option. Sharpness and performance are not, making it a positive attribute that the SuperLeaf has both.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fwAQl1nqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WFYQJA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WHY5JY", "title": "Pro Shot Gun Care Flannel Gun Cleaning 750 Count Patches (.38-.45Caliber/.20-.410Ga. 21/4SQ.)", "description": "Pro-Shot 2-1/4\" square patches are best suited for cleaning .38 -.45 caliber firearms as well as .410 -20 gauge shotguns, and they ship 750 count per package. Pro-Shot 100% Cotton Flannel Patches have become known worldwide for their superior cleaning ability.", "text": "Pro Shot Gun Care Flannel Gun Cleaning 750 Count Patches (.38-.45Caliber/.20-.410Ga. 21/4SQ.) Pro-Shot 2-1/4\" square patches are best suited for cleaning .38 -.45 caliber firearms as well as .410 -20 gauge shotguns, and they ship 750 count per package. Pro-Shot 100% Cotton Flannel Patches have become known worldwide for their superior cleaning ability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ehsU6u7OL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WHY5JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Shot Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 20.39}}
{"item_id": "B004WHY6U2", "title": "Pro Shot Gun Care Flannel Gun Cleaning 500 Count Patches (12-16- Gauge, 3-Inch SQ.)", "description": "Pro-Shot 3\" square patches are best suited for cleaning .45 caliber firearms as well as 16 -12 gauge shotguns, and they ship 500 count per package. Pro-Shot 100% Cotton Flannel Patches have become known worldwide for their superior cleaning ability.", "text": "Pro Shot Gun Care Flannel Gun Cleaning 500 Count Patches (12-16- Gauge, 3-Inch SQ.) Pro-Shot 3\" square patches are best suited for cleaning .45 caliber firearms as well as 16 -12 gauge shotguns, and they ship 500 count per package. Pro-Shot 100% Cotton Flannel Patches have become known worldwide for their superior cleaning ability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RKhT9ampL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WHY6U2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pro Shot Gun Care", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 20.49}}
{"item_id": "B004WI05EW", "title": "Kawasaki DX226FS Dual Suspension Bike (Silver/Black, 26 X 19-Inch)", "description": "The Kawasaki DX226FS is packed with tough and reliable features. Features include an aluminum dual suspension frame, Shimano drivetrain, 21 speeds, double wall alloy rims, front disc brake, and quick release seat.", "text": "Kawasaki DX226FS Dual Suspension Bike (Silver/Black, 26 X 19-Inch) The Kawasaki DX226FS is packed with tough and reliable features. Features include an aluminum dual suspension frame, Shimano drivetrain, 21 speeds, double wall alloy rims, front disc brake, and quick release seat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lN%2BOLrmFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WI05EW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Dual Suspension"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WIU21I", "title": "Primos The Third Degree Xtra Loud Cottontail Predator Call by Randy Anderson", "description": "Give cottontails the third degree with the Third Degree predator call. Designed by Team Primos member Randy Anderson, the Third Degree jars 'em loose with an irresistible, raspy distress call that you can take to a super high pitch. The Third Degree is perfect for calling coyotes in from a distance.", "text": "Primos The Third Degree Xtra Loud Cottontail Predator Call by Randy Anderson Give cottontails the third degree with the Third Degree predator call. Designed by Team Primos member Randy Anderson, the Third Degree jars 'em loose with an irresistible, raspy distress call that you can take to a super high pitch. The Third Degree is perfect for calling coyotes in from a distance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VuigqkZeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WIU21I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Predator"]], "price": 14.16}}
{"item_id": "B004WIU59M", "title": "Primos Sit N Spin Crazy Critter Predator Decoy", "description": "The Primos Sit N' Spin Crazy Critter provides realistic flaring & scrappin' motion to draw in predators. It has intermittent 360 degree motion, which you can adjust to go as fast or slow as you want. A realistic fur ball critter decoy with three eye catching white tipped tails. Small, packable design with integrated ground stake holder.", "text": "Primos Sit N Spin Crazy Critter Predator Decoy The Primos Sit N' Spin Crazy Critter provides realistic flaring & scrappin' motion to draw in predators. It has intermittent 360 degree motion, which you can adjust to go as fast or slow as you want. A realistic fur ball critter decoy with three eye catching white tipped tails. Small, packable design with integrated ground stake holder.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318YhXX0XGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WIU59M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Predator"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B004WJGXAQ", "title": "Husqvarna Multi-Purpose Forest Axe (1.9 Lbs) With 26\" Handle", "description": "Hand forged axe from Husqvarna. Multi-Purpose Forest axes are best suited for felling smaller trees and limbing logs. The blade is hand forged and made of high quality Swedish steel. Curved handle with Husqvarna logo is made of solid hickory. Like all Husqvarna axes this one comes with a full grain leather sheath for protection. Dimensions Weight of Head 1.9 lbs. Total Weight Head 2.7 lbs. Length of Head: 6-3/4\" Face of Head: 3-1/2\" Back of Head Length: 2-1/4\" Handle: 26\" Ed. Note 2013 : Due to changes with Husqvarna's axe supplier in 2010, this axe was formerly known simply as the Forest axe in some circles. Indeed Husqvarna refers to this axe currently as Traditional Multi-Purpose Axe.", "text": "Husqvarna Multi-Purpose Forest Axe (1.9 Lbs) With 26\" Handle Hand forged axe from Husqvarna. Multi-Purpose Forest axes are best suited for felling smaller trees and limbing logs. The blade is hand forged and made of high quality Swedish steel. Curved handle with Husqvarna logo is made of solid hickory. Like all Husqvarna axes this one comes with a full grain leather sheath for protection. Dimensions Weight of Head 1.9 lbs. Total Weight Head 2.7 lbs. Length of Head: 6-3/4\" Face of Head: 3-1/2\" Back of Head Length: 2-1/4\" Handle: 26\" Ed. Note 2013 : Due to changes with Husqvarna's axe supplier in 2010, this axe was formerly known simply as the Forest axe in some circles. Indeed Husqvarna refers to this axe currently as Traditional Multi-Purpose Axe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316c-Wi%2BjFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WJGXAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Husqvarna", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 85.0}}
{"item_id": "B004WKHLDI", "title": "YOCAHER BLANK & Graphic Complete Longboard PINTAIL skateboard w/ 71mm wheels", "description": "What you're looking at is a Plunked Pintail Longboard. The pintail teardrop-shaped deck is the most suitable for beginners. The shape prevents the wheel from contacting with the board while still providing ample footspace. Pintails also make excellent campus cruisers.", "text": "YOCAHER BLANK & Graphic Complete Longboard PINTAIL skateboard w/ 71mm wheels What you're looking at is a Plunked Pintail Longboard. The pintail teardrop-shaped deck is the most suitable for beginners. The shape prevents the wheel from contacting with the board while still providing ample footspace. Pintails also make excellent campus cruisers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZKrQpOa-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WKHLDI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Standard Skateboards & Longboards", "Longboards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WLCLQY", "title": "Wide Angle Lens for MagicShine, Gemini, and many other Bike Lights / Headlight. Includes O-Ring", "description": "With the stock lens and reflector these lights produce about a 10 degree beam angle. This allows the light to penetrate far down the road. But for some uses the beam on these lights is too tight. Our Wide Angle Lens changes the standard 10 degree beam into a 10 degree by 30 degree beam. It spreads the light only horizontally, not up in the trees were you don't need it. This keeps the brightness up and lights the full width of the road or trail in front of you. It installs by simply unscrewing the bezel that holds the current lens and replacing it with the new wide angle lens. It's easy to switch back and forth if needed. The lens was designed for the Magicshine MJ-808 (all versions) which comes with an approximately 1mm thick tempered glass lens. Many other copies of this light come with a thicker plain glass lens. To take up the extra thickness for these lights and insure a snug, waterproof fit, an O-ring is included with your lens to place behind the lens. Want a total flood (horizontal and vertical) Install 2 lenses back to back with the ribs at 90 degrees to each other. It produces a 30 degree by 30 degree square beam. Manufactured by Action LED Lights in the USA", "text": "Wide Angle Lens for MagicShine, Gemini, and many other Bike Lights / Headlight. Includes O-Ring With the stock lens and reflector these lights produce about a 10 degree beam angle. This allows the light to penetrate far down the road. But for some uses the beam on these lights is too tight. Our Wide Angle Lens changes the standard 10 degree beam into a 10 degree by 30 degree beam. It spreads the light only horizontally, not up in the trees were you don't need it. This keeps the brightness up and lights the full width of the road or trail in front of you. It installs by simply unscrewing the bezel that holds the current lens and replacing it with the new wide angle lens. It's easy to switch back and forth if needed. The lens was designed for the Magicshine MJ-808 (all versions) which comes with an approximately 1mm thick tempered glass lens. Many other copies of this light come with a thicker plain glass lens. To take up the extra thickness for these lights and insure a snug, waterproof fit, an O-ring is included with your lens to place behind the lens. Want a total flood (horizontal and vertical) Install 2 lenses back to back with the ribs at 90 degrees to each other. It produces a 30 degree by 30 degree square beam. Manufactured by Action LED Lights in the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wSe%2BiZouL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WLCLQY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 4.95}}
{"item_id": "B004WMDME8", "title": "2 Person Reflective Emergency Sleeping Bag, 64 x 84 inches, Emergency Zone, Survival Reflective Blanket", "description": "This reflective sleeping bag can save your life. The key to survival is conserving body heat. This bag reflects body heat but unlike other sleeping bags, this is double the size and can easily fit two people. Since it is waterproof, it can also act as a liner for a snow cave. One double sized sleeping bag is better than two regular ones.", "text": "2 Person Reflective Emergency Sleeping Bag, 64 x 84 inches, Emergency Zone, Survival Reflective Blanket This reflective sleeping bag can save your life. The key to survival is conserving body heat. This bag reflects body heat but unlike other sleeping bags, this is double the size and can easily fit two people. Since it is waterproof, it can also act as a liner for a snow cave. One double sized sleeping bag is better than two regular ones.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WJKEsaFiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WMDME8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B004WMFI0Y", "title": "Condor Tool and Knife Mini Bushlore 3-Inch Drop Point Blade, Walnut Handle, Black Leather Sheath", "description": "CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "text": "Condor Tool and Knife Mini Bushlore 3-Inch Drop Point Blade, Walnut Handle, Black Leather Sheath CONDOR TOOL & KNIFE traces its proud history back to 1787, the year GERB WEYESBERG COMPANY was founded in Solingen, Germany. The quality of the swords, military knives, agricultural tools and household cutlery they manufactured made Solingen the cutlery capital of the world. Over the generations, the world’s largest manufacturer of swords and knives found it necessary to expand operations to other countries to better serve its customers. In 1964, the company formed IMACASA with a new plant in Santa Ana, El Salvador and filled it with state of the art German equipment. Some of the original local employees who were sent to Solingen for extensive training forty years ago are still working in the factory today, turning out the finest quality machetes, shovels and other hand tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BeqJTrRpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WMFI0Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Tools &amp; Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 32.24}}
