{"item_id": "B004WN7OGE", "title": "ProActive ProMark Stencil", "description": "The easy-to-use ProActive ProMark stencil lets you personalize your golf ball with letters, numbers, and symbols, so you can identify your ball anywhere on the course. The ProMark--which doubles as a ball liner--keeps the ball still as the stencil rotates around, with unlimited mark combinations for labeling. The stencil is also smudge-proof, so your mark will stay on the ball throughout your round.", "text": "ProActive ProMark Stencil The easy-to-use ProActive ProMark stencil lets you personalize your golf ball with letters, numbers, and symbols, so you can identify your ball anywhere on the course. The ProMark--which doubles as a ball liner--keeps the ball still as the stencil rotates around, with unlimited mark combinations for labeling. The stencil is also smudge-proof, so your mark will stay on the ball throughout your round.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KICDjJo8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WN7OGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProActive", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Ball Markers"]], "price": 10.86}}
{"item_id": "B004WO11B2", "title": "Fox Head Men's Reflex Gel Glove, Charcoal, Medium", "description": "Through the strategic use of our exclusive gel palm insert, we have created the ultimate glove that makes those grueling rides just a bit more bearable.", "text": "Fox Head Men's Reflex Gel Glove, Charcoal, Medium Through the strategic use of our exclusive gel palm insert, we have created the ultimate glove that makes those grueling rides just a bit more bearable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZdcewiD6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WO11B2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WO3CVE", "title": "Reflex Gel Short Glove [Black] L(10)", "description": "You asked for a shorty version of our Reflex gel glove, and here it is: complete pressure distribution with extra wiggle room for your digits.", "text": "Reflex Gel Short Glove [Black] L(10) You asked for a shorty version of our Reflex gel glove, and here it is: complete pressure distribution with extra wiggle room for your digits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ML-8CYoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WO3CVE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WOERL8", "title": "Giro Aeon Road Bike Helmet", "description": "", "text": "Giro Aeon Road Bike Helmet", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516NmSggN9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WOERL8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WOERVS", "title": "Shimano PD-M780 XT Race Pedal", "description": "This is the second generation of Shimano's XT branded pedals. And as usual, the workhorse XT parts get some trickledown from Shimano's flagship XTR line. For this version you'll save a handful of grams per pedal over the older XT PD-M770 pedals, but most importantly, the design of the XT PD-M780 Pedals offers more platform to support your foot on the pedal body. Like all other Shimano SPD pedals, it's a two-sided design so you can have easy access with the stomp of your foot. The two-bolt SH-51 cleats (included) have 4 degrees of float to allow some movement in your ankle as you pedal. At a glance it looks almost identical to the XTR pedals, but material differences make the XTR about 30 grams lighter. Function-wise you'd be hard pressed to tell them apart. The XT pedals are all about performance per dollar. The Shimano XT PD-M780 Pedals are Dark Grey and have an aluminum body that relies on sealed cartridge bearings to spin on a plated chromoly axle. The retention mechanism can be adjusted on both sides to accommodate your preferred release tension.", "text": "Shimano PD-M780 XT Race Pedal This is the second generation of Shimano's XT branded pedals. And as usual, the workhorse XT parts get some trickledown from Shimano's flagship XTR line. For this version you'll save a handful of grams per pedal over the older XT PD-M770 pedals, but most importantly, the design of the XT PD-M780 Pedals offers more platform to support your foot on the pedal body. Like all other Shimano SPD pedals, it's a two-sided design so you can have easy access with the stomp of your foot. The two-bolt SH-51 cleats (included) have 4 degrees of float to allow some movement in your ankle as you pedal. At a glance it looks almost identical to the XTR pedals, but material differences make the XTR about 30 grams lighter. Function-wise you'd be hard pressed to tell them apart. The XT pedals are all about performance per dollar. The Shimano XT PD-M780 Pedals are Dark Grey and have an aluminum body that relies on sealed cartridge bearings to spin on a plated chromoly axle. The retention mechanism can be adjusted on both sides to accommodate your preferred release tension.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tYwYFiK6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WOERVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 69.95}}
{"item_id": "B004WPWU34", "title": "617 Speed Loader 10 Shot", "description": "Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? With the Smith & Wesson 617 10 Shot Speed Loader, your revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. When used with an optional loading block, just a simple push of the loader clicks in 10 rounds! Loading is a snap! Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and give yourself more shooting satisfaction. Tough and durable, it's ready to survive the abuse of Steel Challenge or just a fun day at the range. Buy your Smith & Wesson 617 10 Shot Speed Loader today and head to the range and unload!", "text": "617 Speed Loader 10 Shot Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? With the Smith & Wesson 617 10 Shot Speed Loader, your revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. When used with an optional loading block, just a simple push of the loader clicks in 10 rounds! Loading is a snap! Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and give yourself more shooting satisfaction. Tough and durable, it's ready to survive the abuse of Steel Challenge or just a fun day at the range. Buy your Smith & Wesson 617 10 Shot Speed Loader today and head to the range and unload!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vhS6leYCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WPWU34.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B004WSU948", "title": "Fobus TAJD Right-Handed Holster Fits: Taurus Judge, Black", "description": "Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "text": "Fobus TAJD Right-Handed Holster Fits: Taurus Judge, Black Lifetime Warranty - All Fobus products carry a 100% Customer Satisfaction \"no questions asked\" policy.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414w0cQHqKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WSU948.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fobus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 20.89}}
{"item_id": "B004WTKTII", "title": "Rothco The Paracord Bracelet in Black,Jewelry for Men", "description": "7 strand Polyester cord. 3/4\" width. 7/16\" black plastic side release buckle. Our survival bracelets enable you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. Basically, every inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord.", "text": "Rothco The Paracord Bracelet in Black,Jewelry for Men 7 strand Polyester cord. 3/4\" width. 7/16\" black plastic side release buckle. Our survival bracelets enable you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. Basically, every inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zWYNu4PBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WTKTII.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]]}}
