{"item_id": "B004WUNH8Q", "title": "5 Round Two Pack QuickStrips T0814", "description": "TuffTM QuickStripsTM help to speed your reload and are proven to be the most compact and convenient way to carry and store spare ammo to reload revolvers, single shot rifles and shotguns. Injection molded from a black flexible urethane material and loads two at a time. Each Set contains 2 QuickStripsTM", "text": "5 Round Two Pack QuickStrips T0814 TuffTM QuickStripsTM help to speed your reload and are proven to be the most compact and convenient way to carry and store spare ammo to reload revolvers, single shot rifles and shotguns. Injection molded from a black flexible urethane material and loads two at a time. Each Set contains 2 QuickStripsTM", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SbW8LuhGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WUNH8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
