{"item_id": "B004WUNKB0", "title": "Tuff Quickstrip Orange 6 Round - Pack of 2 (.38/.357 Caliber)", "description": "Tuff QuickStrips help to speed your reload and are proven to be the most compact and convenient way to carry and store spare ammo to reload revolvers, single shot rifles and shotguns. Injection molded from a black flexible urethane material and loads two at a time. For an even better way to carry up to 2 loaded QuickStrips try the discreetly designed Tuff QuickStrip Pouch which easily wraps around belts up to 2\". Sold in packs of two, and proudly MADE IN THE USA!", "text": "Tuff Quickstrip Orange 6 Round - Pack of 2 (.38/.357 Caliber) Tuff QuickStrips help to speed your reload and are proven to be the most compact and convenient way to carry and store spare ammo to reload revolvers, single shot rifles and shotguns. Injection molded from a black flexible urethane material and loads two at a time. For an even better way to carry up to 2 loaded QuickStrips try the discreetly designed Tuff QuickStrip Pouch which easily wraps around belts up to 2\". Sold in packs of two, and proudly MADE IN THE USA!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e2wVvnx8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WUNKB0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tuff Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 9.53}}
