{"item_id": "B004WYGZDG", "title": "Hogue Rubber Grip Handall Tactical Grip Sleeve", "description": "Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "text": "Hogue Rubber Grip Handall Tactical Grip Sleeve Hogue rubber grips are molded from a durable synthetic rubber that is not spongy or tacky, but gives that soft recoil absorbing feel, without affecting accuracy. This modern rubber requires a completely different molding process than ordinary neoprene and results in a much superior grip. The material we use does not come apart or deteriorate and is resistant to all solvents and oils used around firearms. Hogue Grips give you a lasting precision fit and durability that will provide years of dependable service. The flexibility of our materials and molding process has allowed us to produce superior rubber grips with features that out perform all other makes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413T6S4dJPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WYGZDG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004WZ62F6", "title": "SPRI Step360 Pro Trainer", "description": "The 360 Pro training experience is designed to enhance the body's ability to react to a more demanding conditioning stimulus, thus heightening its training response. Ideal for all fitness levels, the unique Step360 Pro provides effective workout sessions for all fitness levels and skill sets. A flat, stable platform sits atop two independently inflated Step360 Pro air chambers that allow you to adjust the air to modify the height of the platform while varying the rotational oscillation by 360 degrees. The durable, non-slip platform withstands jumping, landing, and bouncing activities. Platform tubing anchors allow for combined strength and balance exercise moves.Step360 ProThe Step360 step aerobics platform is the revolutionary way to burn calories and lose weight at home. This unique platform is set on two adjustable air chambers designed to create instability. As you use the equipment, your body is forced to utilize both large and small muscle groups to find balance. More calories are burned, making weight loss easier. Realize a more effective total body workout in less time than a traditional step aerobics platform with the Step360.Step360 Pro Training DVDIncluded with the Step360 Pro is an instructional DVD led by well-known fitness experts Robert Sherman and Abbie Appel, who conduct two 18-minute Step360 Pro session training programs comprised of 3-minute routines performed within 6 training phases with zero rest (3-6-0). Bonus sections includeGet To Know Your Step360,Science Behind The 360 Training Experience, andStep360 Teaching Excellence.Step360 Pro Training Wall ChartOptions with the Step360 Pro are limitless while performing both traditional and functional cardio, strength, and balance movements. This round at-a-glance training chart showcases some of the most popular Step360 Pro movements, featuring two movements from each of the six training phases.What's in the Box?Step360 Pro, training wall chart, instructional DVD with two 18-minute training programs, hand pump", "text": "SPRI Step360 Pro Trainer The 360 Pro training experience is designed to enhance the body's ability to react to a more demanding conditioning stimulus, thus heightening its training response. Ideal for all fitness levels, the unique Step360 Pro provides effective workout sessions for all fitness levels and skill sets. A flat, stable platform sits atop two independently inflated Step360 Pro air chambers that allow you to adjust the air to modify the height of the platform while varying the rotational oscillation by 360 degrees. The durable, non-slip platform withstands jumping, landing, and bouncing activities. Platform tubing anchors allow for combined strength and balance exercise moves.Step360 ProThe Step360 step aerobics platform is the revolutionary way to burn calories and lose weight at home. This unique platform is set on two adjustable air chambers designed to create instability. As you use the equipment, your body is forced to utilize both large and small muscle groups to find balance. More calories are burned, making weight loss easier. Realize a more effective total body workout in less time than a traditional step aerobics platform with the Step360.Step360 Pro Training DVDIncluded with the Step360 Pro is an instructional DVD led by well-known fitness experts Robert Sherman and Abbie Appel, who conduct two 18-minute Step360 Pro session training programs comprised of 3-minute routines performed within 6 training phases with zero rest (3-6-0). Bonus sections includeGet To Know Your Step360,Science Behind The 360 Training Experience, andStep360 Teaching Excellence.Step360 Pro Training Wall ChartOptions with the Step360 Pro are limitless while performing both traditional and functional cardio, strength, and balance movements. This round at-a-glance training chart showcases some of the most popular Step360 Pro movements, featuring two movements from each of the six training phases.What's in the Box?Step360 Pro, training wall chart, instructional DVD with two 18-minute training programs, hand pump", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418wmpXuf8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004WZ62F6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SPRI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Balance Trainers", "Balance Boards"]], "price": 120.0}}
{"item_id": "B004X166VO", "title": "CAP Barbell Standard 1-inch Threaded EZ Curl Bar", "description": "Isolate and intensify the the development of the upper arm muscles with CAP's 47\" EZ curl bar. Diamond knurled handgrips improve gripping power, while high quality steel adds durablity and sleekness. Designed with threaded ends. Collars are included. 200 lb weight capacity. Accomodates 1\" plates.", "text": "CAP Barbell Standard 1-inch Threaded EZ Curl Bar Isolate and intensify the the development of the upper arm muscles with CAP's 47\" EZ curl bar. Diamond knurled handgrips improve gripping power, while high quality steel adds durablity and sleekness. Designed with threaded ends. Collars are included. 200 lb weight capacity. Accomodates 1\" plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lJkgJeYgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X166VO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 24.65}}
{"item_id": "B004X1674A", "title": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Combo Hex Bar", "description": "CAP Barbell's Combo Hex Bar combines the raised handle of the high hex bar and the flush handle of the regular hex bar creating a multi-functional exercise bar. Collars are not included. 750 lb weight capacity. Made of solid steel.", "text": "CAP Barbell Olympic 2-Inch Combo Hex Bar CAP Barbell's Combo Hex Bar combines the raised handle of the high hex bar and the flush handle of the regular hex bar creating a multi-functional exercise bar. Collars are not included. 750 lb weight capacity. Made of solid steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iIWqvKURL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X1674A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 108.77}}
{"item_id": "B004X167A4", "title": "Cap Barbell Weight Bar 2-Inch Zinc Plated Mega Hex Bar Olympic", "description": "Built for the biggest and strongest lifters, CAP Barbell's Mega Hex Bar combines the handle placement of the high hex bar and the regular hex bar. Simply flip over to change exercise starting position. 1000 lb weight capacity. Collars are not included. Accomodates 2\" plates.", "text": "Cap Barbell Weight Bar 2-Inch Zinc Plated Mega Hex Bar Olympic Built for the biggest and strongest lifters, CAP Barbell's Mega Hex Bar combines the handle placement of the high hex bar and the regular hex bar. Simply flip over to change exercise starting position. 1000 lb weight capacity. Collars are not included. Accomodates 2\" plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fXE9TuQsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X167A4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 98.36}}
{"item_id": "B004X167PO", "title": "Tone Fitness Aerobic Stepper", "description": "Step up to a total body workout at home with the Tone Fitness Aerobic Stepper. Target gluts and hamstrings with alternating lunges, or strengthen chest and back with adjustable position pushups. This is the ideal tool to help lose weight and boost your workout routine. Improve your overall fitness by adding in the stepper for an extra calorie bun. The stepper has a secure, non-slip surface and is adjustable for two height levels: 4\" or 6\" heights. Includes an exercise chart for added instruction.", "text": "Tone Fitness Aerobic Stepper Step up to a total body workout at home with the Tone Fitness Aerobic Stepper. Target gluts and hamstrings with alternating lunges, or strengthen chest and back with adjustable position pushups. This is the ideal tool to help lose weight and boost your workout routine. Improve your overall fitness by adding in the stepper for an extra calorie bun. The stepper has a secure, non-slip surface and is adjustable for two height levels: 4\" or 6\" heights. Includes an exercise chart for added instruction.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D8zfwndOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X167PO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tone Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Step Platforms"]], "price": 18.83}}
{"item_id": "B004X168VW", "title": "Cap Barbell Weight Bar 47-Inch Olympic Ez Curl Bar", "description": "CAP Barbell's Olympic EZ curl bar isolates and intensifies the the development of the biceps and forearm muscles, a proven favorite of bodybuilders everywhere. Designed with diamond knurled handgrips and rotating sleeves. Collars are included. 200 lb weight capacity. Made of solid cast iron and chrome finish. Accomodates 2\" plates.", "text": "Cap Barbell Weight Bar 47-Inch Olympic Ez Curl Bar CAP Barbell's Olympic EZ curl bar isolates and intensifies the the development of the biceps and forearm muscles, a proven favorite of bodybuilders everywhere. Designed with diamond knurled handgrips and rotating sleeves. Collars are included. 200 lb weight capacity. Made of solid cast iron and chrome finish. Accomodates 2\" plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NZLpA1VBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X168VW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Bars"]], "price": 24.19}}
{"item_id": "B004X1B1HS", "title": "Buck TOPS Nighthawk Hunting Knife (Black Oxide)", "description": "Rugged, reliable and durable. A full-sized, fixed blade knife with dramatic, ergonomically designed non-slip grip handle.", "text": "Buck TOPS Nighthawk Hunting Knife (Black Oxide) Rugged, reliable and durable. A full-sized, fixed blade knife with dramatic, ergonomically designed non-slip grip handle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314mOUPxfJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X1B1HS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Buck Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 61.38}}
{"item_id": "B004X237KQ", "title": "Helle Temagami Carbon Knife", "description": "FEATURES of the Helle Temagami Carbon Knife Semi-full tang Tang is exposed on the top and pommel end, but is covered by the wood of the handle on the finger side which protects the fingers from direct contact with the steel in cold weather Drop point style blade is made of triple laminated carbon steel that provides excellent edge holding toughness and ease for sharpening Handle has a bit of a finger guard to help keep your hand off the edge when slippery Comes with a Scandinavian style pouch sheath retaining the knife securely without the need for snaps or straps SPECIFICATIONS of the Helle Temagami Carbon Knife Weight: 155 g Blade Material: Triple laminated carbon steel Blade Thickness: 3,0 mm Blade Length: 110 mm Handle Material: Curly birch Handle Length: 120 mm Sheath Material: Genuine leather Sheath Weight: 60 g", "text": "Helle Temagami Carbon Knife FEATURES of the Helle Temagami Carbon Knife Semi-full tang Tang is exposed on the top and pommel end, but is covered by the wood of the handle on the finger side which protects the fingers from direct contact with the steel in cold weather Drop point style blade is made of triple laminated carbon steel that provides excellent edge holding toughness and ease for sharpening Handle has a bit of a finger guard to help keep your hand off the edge when slippery Comes with a Scandinavian style pouch sheath retaining the knife securely without the need for snaps or straps SPECIFICATIONS of the Helle Temagami Carbon Knife Weight: 155 g Blade Material: Triple laminated carbon steel Blade Thickness: 3,0 mm Blade Length: 110 mm Handle Material: Curly birch Handle Length: 120 mm Sheath Material: Genuine leather Sheath Weight: 60 g", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31uTgvx60UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X237KQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Helle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 169.0}}
{"item_id": "B004X55KJ4", "title": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle, Wide Mouth, 40-Ounce", "description": "Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "text": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle, Wide Mouth, 40-Ounce Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tvhv8FlUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X55KJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 31.49}}
