{"item_id": "B004X6DHNY", "title": "OD Israeli Wool Blanket 72\" x 56\", 100% Wool (USED) Military Surplus", "description": "Genuine Israeli Military Blanket 100% wool, super warm blanket features reinforced whipped stitched edges measures 76\" x 56\" Surplus used, good condition It comes in mix colors Grey, Brown and O.D", "text": "OD Israeli Wool Blanket 72\" x 56\", 100% Wool (USED) Military Surplus Genuine Israeli Military Blanket 100% wool, super warm blanket features reinforced whipped stitched edges measures 76\" x 56\" Surplus used, good condition It comes in mix colors Grey, Brown and O.D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aO9SaAr5L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X6DHNY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Blankets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004X6UENK", "title": "Olive Drab Army Issue Foam Sleeping Pad Mat - 24 x 72 x 3/8, Survival/Camping", "description": "Olive Drab Government Issued Foam Sleeping Pad. Closed-Cell Foam, Includes Strap. In Camping, A Ground Pad, Sleeping Pad, Sleeping Mat Or Roll Mat Is A Simple Device Often Used In Conjunction With A Sleeping Bag. Its Purpose Is To Provide Padding And Thermal Insulation. All Types Currently Available Use Air As Their Primary Form Of Insulation. Do Not Require Any Inflation. Replica Army, Military, Police, Security. Many People Use This Item For Backpacking, Fishing, Camping, Hiking, Traveling, Everyday Home Use. Not Limited To These. High Quality And Made To Last. Size: 24 x 72 x 3/8 Inches.", "text": "Olive Drab Army Issue Foam Sleeping Pad Mat - 24 x 72 x 3/8, Survival/Camping Olive Drab Government Issued Foam Sleeping Pad. Closed-Cell Foam, Includes Strap. In Camping, A Ground Pad, Sleeping Pad, Sleeping Mat Or Roll Mat Is A Simple Device Often Used In Conjunction With A Sleeping Bag. Its Purpose Is To Provide Padding And Thermal Insulation. All Types Currently Available Use Air As Their Primary Form Of Insulation. Do Not Require Any Inflation. Replica Army, Military, Police, Security. Many People Use This Item For Backpacking, Fishing, Camping, Hiking, Traveling, Everyday Home Use. Not Limited To These. High Quality And Made To Last. Size: 24 x 72 x 3/8 Inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e%2Bz8l2c0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X6UENK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Foam Pads"]], "price": 24.36}}
{"item_id": "B004X6ZLMO", "title": "Sprint Short Sleeve Cycling Jersey Black", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our short sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from an amazingly effective genuine high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. The fabric in this jersey is recycled polyester. It also has excellent odour control properties and offers the wearer added UV-Protection. Incorporating a non-slip zip and exceptional silicone waist grippers with extended rear drop. Three elasticated rear pockets and a front mobile phone holder zipped pocket, provide the wearer with ample storage options.With safety in mind these jerseys include reflective print on the front and rear logo's and a reflective trim on the bottom of the rear pockets.These are not 'second skin' jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and colours.", "text": "Sprint Short Sleeve Cycling Jersey Black Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our short sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from an amazingly effective genuine high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. The fabric in this jersey is recycled polyester. It also has excellent odour control properties and offers the wearer added UV-Protection. Incorporating a non-slip zip and exceptional silicone waist grippers with extended rear drop. Three elasticated rear pockets and a front mobile phone holder zipped pocket, provide the wearer with ample storage options.With safety in mind these jerseys include reflective print on the front and rear logo's and a reflective trim on the bottom of the rear pockets.These are not 'second skin' jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and colours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kubj8maCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004X6ZLMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]], "price": 21.99}}
