{"item_id": "B004XCI4EA", "title": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Enlarged EMT/First Aid Pouch", "description": "The standard Voodoo Tactical MOLLE EMT pouch has been very popular, but users wanted more space. So we've responded with this new, enlarged MOLLE EMT pouch. Designed to securely hold your first aid gear, including a battle dressing, Quik Clot, or blood stopper kit. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself. 10\" tall x 7\" wide x 3\" deep.Fits on your MOLLE compatible tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, belt, or other equipment.", "text": "Voodoo Tactical MOLLE Compatible Enlarged EMT/First Aid Pouch The standard Voodoo Tactical MOLLE EMT pouch has been very popular, but users wanted more space. So we've responded with this new, enlarged MOLLE EMT pouch. Designed to securely hold your first aid gear, including a battle dressing, Quik Clot, or blood stopper kit. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself. 10\" tall x 7\" wide x 3\" deep.Fits on your MOLLE compatible tactical vest, chest rig, gear bag, belt, or other equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tjYHem0%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XCI4EA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.45}}
{"item_id": "B004XCLH1W", "title": "XMark Commercial FID Ab Versa Weight Bench XM-7629", "description": "XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Weight Bench XM-7629Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, the XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Bench XM-7629 is engineered to give you the comfort and support you need for a hard-core strength training workout. With a 1500 lb. weight capacity, this bench is not only fully adjustable from decline to full military press position but also doubles as a full ab decline bench with oversized 4.33” vinyl-covered ankle and knee rollers. The weight bench features extra thick 3” Duracraft padding covered in sweat and tear resistant Duraguard Vinyl, a 7 position adjustable back pad, an ergonomic 6 position adjustable seat and vertically adjusted 4 position knee and ankle rollers. Train harder, longer and better with XMark, the mark of excellence.The XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Bench XM-7629 also includes built-in transport wheels for quick storage as well as easy in and out under power cages, cable machines, etc., commercial 11 gauge 3” x 2” steel construction and bolted on, skid resistant feet.Features:- LIFETIME in-home warranty- Combines ab and upper body strength training workouts into one- 7 position ladder back adjustments from decline to military press position- Ergonomic 6 position adjustable seat- 4 position vertical adjustable knee and ankle rollers- Extra thick 3” Duraguard cushions- Double stitched, tear and sweat resistant Duraguard vinyl- Oversized 4.33” vinyl-covered knee and ankle rollers- Bolted on, skid resistant feet- Built-in transport wheels- Scratch resistant, baked powder coat finish- Recommended for commercial, light institutional and home useSpecifications:- Weight capacity: 1500 lbs.- Seat Cushion: 14” L x 11.50 “ W- Back Cushion: 33.50” L x 11.50” W- Assembled Dimensions: 58” L x 22.25” W x 50.25” H- Heavy duty 11 gauge 2” x 3” commercial grade construction", "text": "XMark Commercial FID Ab Versa Weight Bench XM-7629 XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Weight Bench XM-7629Backed by a LIFETIME in-home warranty, the XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Bench XM-7629 is engineered to give you the comfort and support you need for a hard-core strength training workout. With a 1500 lb. weight capacity, this bench is not only fully adjustable from decline to full military press position but also doubles as a full ab decline bench with oversized 4.33” vinyl-covered ankle and knee rollers. The weight bench features extra thick 3” Duracraft padding covered in sweat and tear resistant Duraguard Vinyl, a 7 position adjustable back pad, an ergonomic 6 position adjustable seat and vertically adjusted 4 position knee and ankle rollers. Train harder, longer and better with XMark, the mark of excellence.The XMark Commercial FID and Ab Versa Bench XM-7629 also includes built-in transport wheels for quick storage as well as easy in and out under power cages, cable machines, etc., commercial 11 gauge 3” x 2” steel construction and bolted on, skid resistant feet.Features:- LIFETIME in-home warranty- Combines ab and upper body strength training workouts into one- 7 position ladder back adjustments from decline to military press position- Ergonomic 6 position adjustable seat- 4 position vertical adjustable knee and ankle rollers- Extra thick 3” Duraguard cushions- Double stitched, tear and sweat resistant Duraguard vinyl- Oversized 4.33” vinyl-covered knee and ankle rollers- Bolted on, skid resistant feet- Built-in transport wheels- Scratch resistant, baked powder coat finish- Recommended for commercial, light institutional and home useSpecifications:- Weight capacity: 1500 lbs.- Seat Cushion: 14” L x 11.50 “ W- Back Cushion: 33.50” L x 11.50” W- Assembled Dimensions: 58” L x 22.25” W x 50.25” H- Heavy duty 11 gauge 2” x 3” commercial grade construction", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/518uR6mQrpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XCLH1W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XMark Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Weights"]], "price": 313.45}}
{"item_id": "B004XD8RBO", "title": "Franklin Sports Night Lightning Football", "description": "Our Franklin Sports Night Lightning Football has high visibility neon green panels that glow in the dark. The cover combines glow in the dark PVC with a high tack cage mesh for extra grip. It also has a long lasting air retention bladder. Great fun night and day!", "text": "Franklin Sports Night Lightning Football Our Franklin Sports Night Lightning Football has high visibility neon green panels that glow in the dark. The cover combines glow in the dark PVC with a high tack cage mesh for extra grip. It also has a long lasting air retention bladder. Great fun night and day!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418dKrudo2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XD8RBO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Football Equipment", "Footballs"]]}}
