{"item_id": "B004XNN5HU", "title": "Topeak Tribag without Rain Cover (Black)", "description": "The TriBag quickly mounts to the top tube of your bike for a quick and easy access to essentials that you need within reach. Material: 600 Denier Polyester, Inner: Waterproofed, 70 Denier Ripstop Nylon. Added Features Good for holding: PDAMobile Phone/Energy barsWallets/Tools", "text": "Topeak Tribag without Rain Cover (Black) The TriBag quickly mounts to the top tube of your bike for a quick and easy access to essentials that you need within reach. Material: 600 Denier Polyester, Inner: Waterproofed, 70 Denier Ripstop Nylon. Added Features Good for holding: PDAMobile Phone/Energy barsWallets/Tools", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ir6EkOCQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XNN5HU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]], "price": 14.95}}
{"item_id": "B004XNQLB2", "title": "", "description": "Camco's RV Awning Repair Tape is a permanent repair for rips and punctures on your RV awning. Use it for RV, boat sails, canvas, tents, rain wear, backpacks, popup campers and more. It has an aggressive adhesive and resists tearing in any direction. The roll is 3\"Wide by 15' long.", "text": "Camco's RV Awning Repair Tape is a permanent repair for rips and punctures on your RV awning. Use it for RV, boat sails, canvas, tents, rain wear, backpacks, popup campers and more. It has an aggressive adhesive and resists tearing in any direction. The roll is 3\"Wide by 15' long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JSidRBLJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XNQLB2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Automotive", "RV Parts & Accessories", "Awnings, Screens & Accessories"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Covers"], ["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]], "price": 14.63}}
