{"item_id": "B004XTDM0O", "title": "FURY Tactical Griffin GRIP Concealable Control Device (Black Polymer)", "description": "Crushing, Powerful and Covert are the words to describe the Fury Griffin Grip, a concealable pressure point defense device. Use it on key body pressure points or with an open handed slap. You will not only get someone's attention, you will control the situation. Ideal for anyone trained in the basics of self defense. Learn more today on www.FuryTraining.com.", "text": "FURY Tactical Griffin GRIP Concealable Control Device (Black Polymer) Crushing, Powerful and Covert are the words to describe the Fury Griffin Grip, a concealable pressure point defense device. Use it on key body pressure points or with an open handed slap. You will not only get someone's attention, you will control the situation. Ideal for anyone trained in the basics of self defense. Learn more today on www.FuryTraining.com.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ok3aazQCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XTDM0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Fly Tying Tools & Materials", "Fly Tying Equipment"]], "price": 10.41}}
