{"item_id": "B004XTK85G", "title": "Stanley Utility Water Bottle 24 ounce", "description": "Stanley® Utility line For the Tough Commutes to Long Days Solid and practical, the Stanley Utility collection works from tough commutes to long days at work. Whether laboring for steady paychecks or ticking off weekend tasks in foul weather, these mugs and bottles are made to get the job done. All Utility products are BPA-free and come with a 5-year Warranty. Soda, sport drink or tap water, this stainless bottle holds enough fluid to quench one serious thirst. The wide opening allows for quick refills at any fountain or faucet and the flip-open spout helps you empty it fast. Since 1913, we have been delivering superior food and beverage gear for rugged, active lifestyles and remain dedicated to this simple promise: buy STANLEY products, get quality gear. Building quality products that last is why we’re still around nearly 100 years later. You expect the best and we deliver the best. All Stanley Utility products come with a five year warranty to protect your investment for years to come. Item number: 10-01188-001", "text": "Stanley Utility Water Bottle 24 ounce Stanley® Utility line For the Tough Commutes to Long Days Solid and practical, the Stanley Utility collection works from tough commutes to long days at work. Whether laboring for steady paychecks or ticking off weekend tasks in foul weather, these mugs and bottles are made to get the job done. All Utility products are BPA-free and come with a 5-year Warranty. Soda, sport drink or tap water, this stainless bottle holds enough fluid to quench one serious thirst. The wide opening allows for quick refills at any fountain or faucet and the flip-open spout helps you empty it fast. Since 1913, we have been delivering superior food and beverage gear for rugged, active lifestyles and remain dedicated to this simple promise: buy STANLEY products, get quality gear. Building quality products that last is why we’re still around nearly 100 years later. You expect the best and we deliver the best. All Stanley Utility products come with a five year warranty to protect your investment for years to come. Item number: 10-01188-001", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311ZKiShwRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XTK85G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
