{"item_id": "B004XUNDX4", "title": "Igloo Glide PRO Cooler (110-Quart, White)", "description": "On a hot day at the park or beach, a cold soda is worth its weight in gold. That weight adds up, but this rolling cooler keeps the transportation easy. Slide-and-Lock handle is ideal for pulling and also makes for easy storing, and the oversized rally wheels can roll in any terrain. Extreme cooling is accomplished with Ultratherm insulated body and Cool Riser Technology, which can keep ice for up to five days when it's 90 degrees Fahrenheit outside. Zinc-hinges and rugged design will keep this thing going for a long, long time. And a fish scale is molded in for your convenience.", "text": "Igloo Glide PRO Cooler (110-Quart, White) On a hot day at the park or beach, a cold soda is worth its weight in gold. That weight adds up, but this rolling cooler keeps the transportation easy. Slide-and-Lock handle is ideal for pulling and also makes for easy storing, and the oversized rally wheels can roll in any terrain. Extreme cooling is accomplished with Ultratherm insulated body and Cool Riser Technology, which can keep ice for up to five days when it's 90 degrees Fahrenheit outside. Zinc-hinges and rugged design will keep this thing going for a long, long time. And a fish scale is molded in for your convenience.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YWO2dfKxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XUNDX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Igloo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 137.95}}
{"item_id": "B004XUQ1UQ", "title": "Shimano Road Shift Cable and Housing Set (Black)", "description": "Shimano has spent countless hours researching and developing shift cables and housing that will optimize the performance of their shifters and derailleurs. The PTFE(Teflon) coated derailleur cable set is the most advanced cable set they have ever produced.", "text": "Shimano Road Shift Cable and Housing Set (Black) Shimano has spent countless hours researching and developing shift cables and housing that will optimize the performance of their shifters and derailleurs. The PTFE(Teflon) coated derailleur cable set is the most advanced cable set they have ever produced.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ouXrmSp4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XUQ1UQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Shift Cables & Housing"]], "price": 8.62}}
