{"item_id": "B004XVL5YC", "title": "Cold Steel Tanto Lite Knife", "description": "A durable and convenient Cordura sheath is also included.Following the popularity and success of the Pendleton Lite Hunter knife, innovative cutlery company Cold Steel decided to make a more affordable version. Similar to the company's Tanto and Outdoorsman knives, the Tanto Lite has a two-piece handle with polypropylene guard, pommel, and core, which totally envelopes the full tangs. The core is then over-molded in a highly textured Kraton material for nonslip use and remarkably long-lasting durability. The knife cleans easily in soap and water, and a convenient, pouch-style Cordura sheath with belt loop is also included.Specifications11.375-inch overall lengthSix-inch bladeThree-millimeter blade thickness5.375-inch polypropylene and Kray-Ex handleGerman 4116 stainless steel5.7-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheath with belt loopWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "text": "Cold Steel Tanto Lite Knife A durable and convenient Cordura sheath is also included.Following the popularity and success of the Pendleton Lite Hunter knife, innovative cutlery company Cold Steel decided to make a more affordable version. Similar to the company's Tanto and Outdoorsman knives, the Tanto Lite has a two-piece handle with polypropylene guard, pommel, and core, which totally envelopes the full tangs. The core is then over-molded in a highly textured Kraton material for nonslip use and remarkably long-lasting durability. The knife cleans easily in soap and water, and a convenient, pouch-style Cordura sheath with belt loop is also included.Specifications11.375-inch overall lengthSix-inch bladeThree-millimeter blade thickness5.375-inch polypropylene and Kray-Ex handleGerman 4116 stainless steel5.7-ounce weightIncludes Cor-Ex sheath with belt loopWarrantyAll Cold Steel knifes are warranted against defects in materials and workmanship. Details are included with your purchase.About Cold SteelCold Steel, Incorporated was founded in 1980, with the goal of making the strongest, sharpest cutlery in the world for knife enthusiasts. Over the last three-plus decades, the company has been at the forefront of many design innovations that have helped innovate the knife industry, including introduction of checked Kraton handles, and the tanto point blade styles which have become industry hallmarks of quality and sophistication.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21UbwzMF5sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XVL5YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.17}}
{"item_id": "B004XW1YK6", "title": "PROPPER F560375 Adult's Tactical Belt 100% Nylon", "description": "", "text": "PROPPER F560375 Adult's Tactical Belt 100% Nylon", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VQfLYw2GL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XW1YK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Propper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Accessories", "Belts"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B004XW7IHE", "title": "Fury Tactical Tempest Folding Knife", "description": "The Fury 32218 Tempest from Joy Enterprises feels like a folding knife but when opened it has all of the advantages of a fixed blade. Unique action in the handle allows the blade to be concealed in the handle when folded but when unfolded the knife has the feel and safety of a fixed blade. This is not a butterfly (gravity knife) instead the handles click into place to safely store the blade or open from a handle on which the blade cannot close. A true safety knife, giving you all that you need from both a folder and a fixed blade. Fury . . . Value by Design", "text": "Fury Tactical Tempest Folding Knife The Fury 32218 Tempest from Joy Enterprises feels like a folding knife but when opened it has all of the advantages of a fixed blade. Unique action in the handle allows the blade to be concealed in the handle when folded but when unfolded the knife has the feel and safety of a fixed blade. This is not a butterfly (gravity knife) instead the handles click into place to safely store the blade or open from a handle on which the blade cannot close. A true safety knife, giving you all that you need from both a folder and a fixed blade. Fury . . . Value by Design", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/315QGPSZH4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XW7IHE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 12.26}}
{"item_id": "B004XW7IMY", "title": "Fury Tactical Shiver Double Folding Knife", "description": "The Fury 32219 Shiver Double Folding Knife from Joy Enterprises was originally designed during World War II for use by German Military paratroopers. A completely unique fold over concealed blade handle is a great piece of engineering. When in the closed position, press on the shorter interior handle, one complete rotation and the blade is exposed. Ultimate safety when closed and great strength when opened. All topped off with a tactical crown, use as a window punch or to make a statement. A must for every knife collection!", "text": "Fury Tactical Shiver Double Folding Knife The Fury 32219 Shiver Double Folding Knife from Joy Enterprises was originally designed during World War II for use by German Military paratroopers. A completely unique fold over concealed blade handle is a great piece of engineering. When in the closed position, press on the shorter interior handle, one complete rotation and the blade is exposed. Ultimate safety when closed and great strength when opened. All topped off with a tactical crown, use as a window punch or to make a statement. A must for every knife collection!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e5k1HJIUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XW7IMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 13.05}}
{"item_id": "B004XW7KEK", "title": "Fury Tactical Extreme Dive Knife", "description": "The Fury 11847 Extreme Dive Knife from Joy Enterprises custom designed to kill fish with its extreme spear point blade with serrated and razor edge blade. The all black body and blade allows for complete concealment. Custom Kraton sheath with rubber strapping for mounting on hose or BCD. Manufactured in Taiwan using high grade German 420 stainless steel.", "text": "Fury Tactical Extreme Dive Knife The Fury 11847 Extreme Dive Knife from Joy Enterprises custom designed to kill fish with its extreme spear point blade with serrated and razor edge blade. The all black body and blade allows for complete concealment. Custom Kraton sheath with rubber strapping for mounting on hose or BCD. Manufactured in Taiwan using high grade German 420 stainless steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B6H745S%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XW7KEK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 19.15}}
{"item_id": "B004XXB4FK", "title": "Cold Steel Stun Dart .625 Magnum (50 Pack) Recreational", "description": "Cold Steel .625 Magnum Stun Dart. 50 pack. Two piece composition construction including orange cone and black dart. Some assembly required.", "text": "Cold Steel Stun Dart .625 Magnum (50 Pack) Recreational Cold Steel .625 Magnum Stun Dart. 50 pack. Two piece composition construction including orange cone and black dart. Some assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3162pNW1HLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XXB4FK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 8.5}}
{"item_id": "B004XXGYXW", "title": "LockDown 222144 Large Handgun Security Vault", "description": "The Lockdown Large Gun Vault is also extremely portable; the gun safe can be mounted to virtually any flat surface with the included mounting equipment, and it's small enough to fit in your glove box.", "text": "LockDown 222144 Large Handgun Security Vault The Lockdown Large Gun Vault is also extremely portable; the gun safe can be mounted to virtually any flat surface with the included mounting equipment, and it's small enough to fit in your glove box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31c5e%2BCFPRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XXGYXW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lockdown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 21.51}}
{"item_id": "B004XZF490", "title": "Polymag Predator Air Gun Pellets", "description": "Polymag .177 Caliber is an 8 grain ballistic tip, hallow head designed pellet that offers reliable accuracy and maximum take down abilities. Never again let your prey fly or crawl away!", "text": "Polymag Predator Air Gun Pellets Polymag .177 Caliber is an 8 grain ballistic tip, hallow head designed pellet that offers reliable accuracy and maximum take down abilities. Never again let your prey fly or crawl away!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RBAusZBxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004XZF490.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]]}}
