{"item_id": "B004Y27DVY", "title": "Glock Magazine Speed Loader for 9mm / .40 / .357 / .380 Auto / .45 GAP Mags - Model 483", "description": "Stop busting your fingers loading Glock Magazines. This handy convenient tool allows for fast, pain free loading. You'll find this to be especially useful with the super high capacity magazines. Sturdy design made of Glock polymer, slides readily over all Glock magazines for the following calibers: 9mm (9 x 19) / .40 / .357 / .380 Auto & .45 GAP (Not for 45 Auto, G42 Single Stack .380 or 10mm).", "text": "Glock Magazine Speed Loader for 9mm / .40 / .357 / .380 Auto / .45 GAP Mags - Model 483 Stop busting your fingers loading Glock Magazines. This handy convenient tool allows for fast, pain free loading. You'll find this to be especially useful with the super high capacity magazines. Sturdy design made of Glock polymer, slides readily over all Glock magazines for the following calibers: 9mm (9 x 19) / .40 / .357 / .380 Auto & .45 GAP (Not for 45 Auto, G42 Single Stack .380 or 10mm).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dpYrCCntL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y27DVY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 7.88}}
{"item_id": "B004Y3NMK4", "title": "Caldwell 800888 Medium High Rear Bag - Filled", "description": "These Caldwell Universal Deluxe Rear Shooting Rest Bags are constructed of high-quality leather and Cordura construction. The traditional leather top surface provides a smooth, non-marring rest, and the Cordura sides will not stretch or sag to maintain the bag's original shape.", "text": "Caldwell 800888 Medium High Rear Bag - Filled These Caldwell Universal Deluxe Rear Shooting Rest Bags are constructed of high-quality leather and Cordura construction. The traditional leather top surface provides a smooth, non-marring rest, and the Cordura sides will not stretch or sag to maintain the bag's original shape.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519Iy5qKYvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y3NMK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Caldwell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Snowmobiling Equipment"]], "price": 36.32}}
{"item_id": "B004Y5FA5C", "title": "JOGR 8 Pack Ultralight Aluminum Alloy Tent Stakes Y Beam", "description": "8 pack of Ultralight Y-beam aluminum tent stakes!These stakes are 7\" or 9\" long and are nearly identical to MSR groundhog pegs. They are Ultralight!Ultralight, ultrastrong! These are the tent stakes I use in the BWCA and they are awesome.You are buying a pack of 8.", "text": "JOGR 8 Pack Ultralight Aluminum Alloy Tent Stakes Y Beam 8 pack of Ultralight Y-beam aluminum tent stakes!These stakes are 7\" or 9\" long and are nearly identical to MSR groundhog pegs. They are Ultralight!Ultralight, ultrastrong! These are the tent stakes I use in the BWCA and they are awesome.You are buying a pack of 8.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SrA83upAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y5FA5C.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B004Y69MO6", "title": "DeSantis Speed Scabbard S&W Governor Right Hand Black", "description": "The Speed Scabbard is designed to meet the needs of plainclothes professionals preferring a holster without a thumb break while still providing firearm retention. This is accomplished with precise molding and a tension screw device on most models. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide. Some models come with two belt slots and without a tension device.", "text": "DeSantis Speed Scabbard S&W Governor Right Hand Black The Speed Scabbard is designed to meet the needs of plainclothes professionals preferring a holster without a thumb break while still providing firearm retention. This is accomplished with precise molding and a tension screw device on most models. Available in black or tan unlined leather. Belt slots are 1 3/4-Inch wide. Some models come with two belt slots and without a tension device.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413e7fWGCzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y69MO6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 42.6}}
{"item_id": "B004Y69QX8", "title": "Topeak Modula Waterbottle Cage 2", "description": "Innovative diameter adjustment system makes adapting the Modula Cage from traditional cycling water bottle sizes to store bought bottled water containers quick and simple", "text": "Topeak Modula Waterbottle Cage 2 Innovative diameter adjustment system makes adapting the Modula Cage from traditional cycling water bottle sizes to store bought bottled water containers quick and simple", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g%2BVpIKVjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y69QX8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B004Y6YH3W", "title": "Lee Precision Lead Hardness Test Kit", "description": "Lee Lead Hardness Test Kit will determine the exact Brinnell Number of an alloy in a simple 6 step process. Included is the Lee Pocket Micro Scope", "text": "Lee Precision Lead Hardness Test Kit Lee Lead Hardness Test Kit will determine the exact Brinnell Number of an alloy in a simple 6 step process. Included is the Lee Pocket Micro Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XcpKBneDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004Y6YH3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 55.64}}
