{"item_id": "B004YD7BTW", "title": "Casino 6 Deck Automatic Card Shuffler by Brybelly", "description": "Card shufflers have always been popular amongst the avid card player and amateur alike. One reason they are popular is that it tends to move the game along and give you a professional shuffle, something not everyone is able to do for a variety of reasons (elderly, children, novices). Another reason for the popularity of shufflers is that they can literally be used with any playing card for any card game. So whether its poker night with the guys, bridge night with the girls, or a battle between magic the gathering players, shufflers are definitely here to stay.Featured in this listing is the Casino 6 Deck Automatic Card Shuffler by Brybelly. This product easily handles up to 6 decks of cards and shuffles them in seconds! It is also battery operated, making it easy to operate and portable. Our Casino 6 Deck Automatic Card Shuffler is specifically styled to mimic those that you'd see in casinos or other professional establishments. So not only do you get an excellent quality product that performs well but also a stylish, professional looking shuffler that all of your friends will envy. Because poker night isn't poker night without a Casino quality Card Shuffler!Brybelly Shufflers are especially noted for their high quality. Brybelly shufflers are fun to play with and easy to use. In general, the Brybelly brand is known throughout the home casino gaming market as the number one choice among gaming experts. Their long history of satisfied customers and innovative products has made Brybelly the number one choice among poker players and gamers alike.So if you're looking for a card shuffler that will not only work for years to come but also look good doing it look no further. Brybelly's 6 Deck Card Shuffler is of excellent quality and one of our top selling products. We know you will be happy with your purchase for years to come and look forward to having a long and growi