ng a long and growing relationship with you as one of our many valued customers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wpMGZXheL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004YD7BTW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Brybelly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Cards & Equipment", "Card Shufflers"]], "price": 14.99}}
