{"item_id": "B004YZD1C6", "title": "Cap Barbell 40-Pounds Cement Dumbbell Set (Black)", "description": "Dumbbells are a workout essential, offering a variety of versatile and challenging resistance training exercises. This adjustable 40-pound set includes:Four 2.5-pound platesFour 7.5-pound platesTwo 14-inch dumbbell handlesFour spring clip collarsThe cement plates are vinyl-coated to protect you and your floors, while also avoiding rust. A convenient workout chart is also included.WarrantyThis CAP Barbell product includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About CAP BarbellCAP Barbell has been a leading fitness equipment maker for more than 25 years. Originally producing only free weights and benches, the company now carries upwards of 600 products across more than ten categories, and its brands include CAP Barbell, Velocity Exercise, Tone Fitness, and CAP Strength.", "text": "Cap Barbell 40-Pounds Cement Dumbbell Set (Black) Dumbbells are a workout essential, offering a variety of versatile and challenging resistance training exercises. This adjustable 40-pound set includes:Four 2.5-pound platesFour 7.5-pound platesTwo 14-inch dumbbell handlesFour spring clip collarsThe cement plates are vinyl-coated to protect you and your floors, while also avoiding rust. A convenient workout chart is also included.WarrantyThis CAP Barbell product includes a limited 30-day manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About CAP BarbellCAP Barbell has been a leading fitness equipment maker for more than 25 years. Originally producing only free weights and benches, the company now carries upwards of 600 products across more than ten categories, and its brands include CAP Barbell, Velocity Exercise, Tone Fitness, and CAP Strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AWDTetkJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004YZD1C6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CAP Barbell", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Arm Machines"]], "price": 7.48}}
