{"item_id": "B004ZENRTI", "title": "Emergency Thermal Blankets - Grizzly Gear - Folds to 52\" X 84\"", "description": "This compact blanket provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Emergency thermal blanket to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "text": "Emergency Thermal Blankets - Grizzly Gear - Folds to 52\" X 84\" This compact blanket provides warmth (retains and reflects up to 90 of body heat), a waterproof and windproof shelter barrier, and a covering to help reduce shock when someone is injured. Emergency thermal blanket to be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GIdo0hg3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ZENRTI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]]}}
