{"item_id": "B004ZP83H8", "title": "Scotchgard Outdoor Water Shield, 10.5-Ounce", "description": "Scotchgard Leather Protector for Suede and Nubuck is water and oil repellent and helps to minimize salt stains. Repels rain, snow and moisture. For use on all types and colors of Suede and Nubuck leather items. Keep your possessions looking good longer.", "text": "Scotchgard Outdoor Water Shield, 10.5-Ounce Scotchgard Leather Protector for Suede and Nubuck is water and oil repellent and helps to minimize salt stains. Repels rain, snow and moisture. For use on all types and colors of Suede and Nubuck leather items. Keep your possessions looking good longer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pJ4FGgfZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ZP83H8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scotchgard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care"]], "price": 10.59}}
