{"item_id": "B004ZZH2N4", "title": "Nashbar Reduced Radius Rollers", "description": "Cycling rollers have long been used to sharpen form and improve bike handling skills. Click for Instruction Manual The Nashbar Reduced Radius Rollers feature CNC machined aluminum drums measuring 85mm in diameter and sealed cartridge bearings for quiet, smooth operation The bicycle roller trainer's steel frame measures 50\" long by 18\" wide and has 9 settings to accommodate just about any wheelbase The frame has 3 sets of feet equipped with non-marring plastic fittings to protect floor finishes The connecting belt is constructed of polyurethane for long life The Reduced Radius Rollers come out of the box assembled and ready to ride Click for Instruction Manual", "text": "Nashbar Reduced Radius Rollers Cycling rollers have long been used to sharpen form and improve bike handling skills. Click for Instruction Manual The Nashbar Reduced Radius Rollers feature CNC machined aluminum drums measuring 85mm in diameter and sealed cartridge bearings for quiet, smooth operation The bicycle roller trainer's steel frame measures 50\" long by 18\" wide and has 9 settings to accommodate just about any wheelbase The frame has 3 sets of feet equipped with non-marring plastic fittings to protect floor finishes The connecting belt is constructed of polyurethane for long life The Reduced Radius Rollers come out of the box assembled and ready to ride Click for Instruction Manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wU26qkosL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B004ZZH2N4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Trainers & Accessories", "Rollers"]], "price": 149.99}}
{"item_id": "B00501M8UY", "title": "Tenn Cycling Bib Front Shorts Professional Padded", "description": "Another outstanding value product brought to you by Tenn Outdoors. Manufactured in heavy duty Spandex/Nylon these bib shorts for men have been technically designed for serious cyclists. The professional construction and modern design with contract stitching allows the shorts plenty of curvature, for exceptional performance and comfort. Anatomically designed with our professional anti-bacterial moulded single layer pad for superior comfort at an affordable price. A perfect blend of high density fibres ensures that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. The high performance, high density, low-sheen finish fabric supports you in all the right places. Flat stitched seams to avoid chafing and a fine gauge mesh back construction for optimum air circulation. Superior silicone leg grippers prevent garment ride-up whilst riding or exercising.Extensive reflective logo's and prints on the sides of legs and back of thighs ensure exceptional visibility and assist in road safety.", "text": "Tenn Cycling Bib Front Shorts Professional Padded Another outstanding value product brought to you by Tenn Outdoors. Manufactured in heavy duty Spandex/Nylon these bib shorts for men have been technically designed for serious cyclists. The professional construction and modern design with contract stitching allows the shorts plenty of curvature, for exceptional performance and comfort. Anatomically designed with our professional anti-bacterial moulded single layer pad for superior comfort at an affordable price. A perfect blend of high density fibres ensures that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. The high performance, high density, low-sheen finish fabric supports you in all the right places. Flat stitched seams to avoid chafing and a fine gauge mesh back construction for optimum air circulation. Superior silicone leg grippers prevent garment ride-up whilst riding or exercising.Extensive reflective logo's and prints on the sides of legs and back of thighs ensure exceptional visibility and assist in road safety.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QX1Sd2WfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00501M8UY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005063IGW", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Drop Leg First Aid Pouch", "description": "Designed to securely hold your first aid kit. Hangs from your belt and straps to your thigh with one adjustable strap. This modular first aid pouch has zippered compartment with elastic loops to hold your medical gear. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself.7\" tall x 7\" wide x 3\" deep", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Drop Leg First Aid Pouch Designed to securely hold your first aid kit. Hangs from your belt and straps to your thigh with one adjustable strap. This modular first aid pouch has zippered compartment with elastic loops to hold your medical gear. This pouch is empty -- you have to add the contents of the kit yourself.7\" tall x 7\" wide x 3\" deep", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ho8%2BvbS4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005063IGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B00506D6O6", "title": "Kershaw Leek Serrated Edge Folding Knife -", "description": "Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. All Leeks include a safety tip-lock and reversible/removable pocket clip. Designed to go anywhere and do just about anything, the Leek is the ideal carrying knife.", "text": "Kershaw Leek Serrated Edge Folding Knife - Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. All Leeks include a safety tip-lock and reversible/removable pocket clip. Designed to go anywhere and do just about anything, the Leek is the ideal carrying knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BXslDerpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00506D6O6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B00507AJ40", "title": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 FRN H-1 Plain Edge Knife, Yellow", "description": "The Spyderco Dragonfly2 is now being offered with an H-1 blade option, called the Dragonfly2 Salt. What makes the Dragonfly a bestseller is its mid-sized blade, ergonomic handle with a front-finger choil and a spine cusp. Its blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points fill a gripping hand, making it feel like you're cutting with a much larger knife. Its FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with a grip pattern called Bi-Directional Texturing' that ergonomically fills the hand with a series of angles and leveraging spots and is available in Marine Yellow. The addition of textured jimping on the choil, spine and screw-together handle construction and a left/right tip-up wire clip make pocket carry effortless and convenient. Precise positioning of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot makes opening/closing smooth. Hollow-ground for high cutting performance, the blade comes in a PlainEdge or SpyderEdge configuration.", "text": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 FRN H-1 Plain Edge Knife, Yellow The Spyderco Dragonfly2 is now being offered with an H-1 blade option, called the Dragonfly2 Salt. What makes the Dragonfly a bestseller is its mid-sized blade, ergonomic handle with a front-finger choil and a spine cusp. Its blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points fill a gripping hand, making it feel like you're cutting with a much larger knife. Its FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with a grip pattern called Bi-Directional Texturing' that ergonomically fills the hand with a series of angles and leveraging spots and is available in Marine Yellow. The addition of textured jimping on the choil, spine and screw-together handle construction and a left/right tip-up wire clip make pocket carry effortless and convenient. Precise positioning of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot makes opening/closing smooth. Hollow-ground for high cutting performance, the blade comes in a PlainEdge or SpyderEdge configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4172dbnFNfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00507AJ40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 52.22}}
{"item_id": "B00507AJI6", "title": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 FRN H-1 Spyder Edge Knife, Yellow", "description": "The Spyderco Dragonfly2 is now being offered with an H-1 blade option, called the Dragonfly2 Salt. What makes the Dragonfly a bestseller is its mid-sized blade, ergonomic handle with a front-finger choil and a spine cusp. Its blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points fill a gripping hand, making it feel like you're cutting with a much larger knife. Its FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with a grip pattern called Bi-Directional Texturing' that ergonomically fills the hand with a series of angles and leveraging spots and is available in Marine Yellow. The addition of textured jimping on the choil, spine and screw-together handle construction and a left/right tip-up wire clip make pocket carry effortless and convenient. Precise positioning of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot makes opening/closing smooth. Hollow-ground for high cutting performance, the blade comes in a PlainEdge or SpyderEdge configuration.", "text": "Spyderco Dragonfly2 FRN H-1 Spyder Edge Knife, Yellow The Spyderco Dragonfly2 is now being offered with an H-1 blade option, called the Dragonfly2 Salt. What makes the Dragonfly a bestseller is its mid-sized blade, ergonomic handle with a front-finger choil and a spine cusp. Its blade-to-handle geometry and leveraging points fill a gripping hand, making it feel like you're cutting with a much larger knife. Its FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handle is molded with a grip pattern called Bi-Directional Texturing' that ergonomically fills the hand with a series of angles and leveraging spots and is available in Marine Yellow. The addition of textured jimping on the choil, spine and screw-together handle construction and a left/right tip-up wire clip make pocket carry effortless and convenient. Precise positioning of the enlarged Spyderco Round Opening Hole in relation to the pivot makes opening/closing smooth. Hollow-ground for high cutting performance, the blade comes in a PlainEdge or SpyderEdge configuration.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cXRTUwLZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00507AJI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B00507S5V4", "title": "Ab Rocket Twister Abdominal Trainer", "description": "Offering a revolutionary way to work your lower abs, upper abs, and obliques, the Ab Rocket will give you the body you've always wanted. The Ab Rocket looks somewhat like a new age chair, but with massage rollers across the head and back rather than a traditional backrest. The similarities end there, however, as the Ab Rocket is designed to pivot with your body as you move forward and backward in a crunching motion, or twist and turn with your body as you maneuver the padded swivel seat. With the Ab Rocket, a mere five minutes per day of traditional crunches, reverse crunches, and oblique exercises can turn your abs from flab to fab. The Ab Rocket offers three resistance levels, giving you the perfect amount of pushback for a mild or serious challenge. And thanks to the built-in cushion supports and massage rollers, you won't experience neck and back pain during the workout.As a bonus, the Ab Rocket comes with a free fat-blasting system, which includes a low-calorie meal plan filled with easy-to-make, mouthwatering low-calorie recipes and four fat-blasting DVD workouts to help melt away the pounds. The Ab Rocket, which folds away for easy storage, weighs only 10 pounds and comes with a 30-day money-back guarantee.", "text": "Ab Rocket Twister Abdominal Trainer Offering a revolutionary way to work your lower abs, upper abs, and obliques, the Ab Rocket will give you the body you've always wanted. The Ab Rocket looks somewhat like a new age chair, but with massage rollers across the head and back rather than a traditional backrest. The similarities end there, however, as the Ab Rocket is designed to pivot with your body as you move forward and backward in a crunching motion, or twist and turn with your body as you maneuver the padded swivel seat. With the Ab Rocket, a mere five minutes per day of traditional crunches, reverse crunches, and oblique exercises can turn your abs from flab to fab. The Ab Rocket offers three resistance levels, giving you the perfect amount of pushback for a mild or serious challenge. And thanks to the built-in cushion supports and massage rollers, you won't experience neck and back pain during the workout.As a bonus, the Ab Rocket comes with a free fat-blasting system, which includes a low-calorie meal plan filled with easy-to-make, mouthwatering low-calorie recipes and four fat-blasting DVD workouts to help melt away the pounds. The Ab Rocket, which folds away for easy storage, weighs only 10 pounds and comes with a 30-day money-back guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OHIg5DflL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00507S5V4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Equipment", "Baseball Equipment", "Baseball Bats"]], "price": 99.95}}
{"item_id": "B00508TE40", "title": "2PCS Red LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light", "description": "If you want to add that personal touch to your car, bike - lighting is one of the best ways Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to set More energy-efficient,with light & motion sensors Durable, High Impact, Rust Resistant Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproof include:2*LED Flash light", "text": "2PCS Red LED Flash Tyre Wheel Valve Cap Light for Car Bike bicycle Motorbicycle Wheel Light Tire Light If you want to add that personal touch to your car, bike - lighting is one of the best ways Single Color Wheel Light, Easy to set More energy-efficient,with light & motion sensors Durable, High Impact, Rust Resistant Auto shining No switch, 100% waterproof include:2*LED Flash light", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41o9Ix53oHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00508TE40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bicycle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 1.65}}
{"item_id": "B0050BRU5C", "title": "Tomahawk Compact Full Tang Axe With Spike For Camping & Hiking", "description": "Tomahawk Compact Full Tang Axe With Spike For Camping & Hiking", "text": "Tomahawk Compact Full Tang Axe With Spike For Camping & Hiking Tomahawk Compact Full Tang Axe With Spike For Camping & Hiking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EY6mWBApL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050BRU5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 15.33}}
{"item_id": "B0050D539U", "title": "Kershaw Leek Plain Edge Folding Knife -", "description": "Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. All Leeks include a safety tip-lock and reversible/removable pocket clip. Designed to go anywhere and do just about anything, the Leek is the ideal carrying knife.", "text": "Kershaw Leek Plain Edge Folding Knife - Kershaw's Leeks offer Ken Onion's distinctive design as well as the SpeedSafe ambidextrous assisted opening system. With SpeedSafe, the user can smoothly and easily deploy the blade with one hand, either left or right. All Leeks include a safety tip-lock and reversible/removable pocket clip. Designed to go anywhere and do just about anything, the Leek is the ideal carrying knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21OSgE0E%2BwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050D539U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 34.99}}
