{"item_id": "B0050EIE9U", "title": "Podsacs Compression Sac", "description": "Round base Nylon stuffsac with 2 compression straps to reduce pack size. Fits up to: 7 L (SM), 10 L (MD), 15 L (LG), 20 L (XL). Size: 6.7\" x 11.8\" (SM), 7.5\" x 13.8\" (MD), 8.7\" x 15.7\" (LG), 9.4\" x 17.7\" (XL). Wt: 4.2 oz. (MD).", "text": "Podsacs Compression Sac Round base Nylon stuffsac with 2 compression straps to reduce pack size. Fits up to: 7 L (SM), 10 L (MD), 15 L (LG), 20 L (XL). Size: 6.7\" x 11.8\" (SM), 7.5\" x 13.8\" (MD), 8.7\" x 15.7\" (LG), 9.4\" x 17.7\" (XL). Wt: 4.2 oz. (MD).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41K2%2B%2Btj5aL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050EIE9U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Compression Sacks"]], "price": 19.07}}
{"item_id": "B0050GFCSY", "title": "Speedfeed Remington IV 13-Inch Tactical Short Stock Pull (870, 1100, 11-87 12 gauge)", "description": "A special model with shortened pull (13\") includes all the features of the SPEEDFEED IV Solid Stock. Perfect for small frame shooters and tactical law enforcement requirements.", "text": "Speedfeed Remington IV 13-Inch Tactical Short Stock Pull (870, 1100, 11-87 12 gauge) A special model with shortened pull (13\") includes all the features of the SPEEDFEED IV Solid Stock. Perfect for small frame shooters and tactical law enforcement requirements.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31axUiRGT%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050GFCSY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedfeed", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stocks"]], "price": 77.81}}
{"item_id": "B0050GH25A", "title": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Reflex Open Top Holster", "description": "Its father has been on duty and mission ready for 15 years. Its mother was the first injection molded Kydex concealment holster on the market. Born out of real world performance, the Reflex Holster combines the best technology and design have to offer. Precision engineered by the Uncle Mike's team, the Reflex Holster was designed to meet the challenged of performing with gross motor skill function in almost any condition.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Tactical Reflex Open Top Holster Its father has been on duty and mission ready for 15 years. Its mother was the first injection molded Kydex concealment holster on the market. Born out of real world performance, the Reflex Holster combines the best technology and design have to offer. Precision engineered by the Uncle Mike's team, the Reflex Holster was designed to meet the challenged of performing with gross motor skill function in almost any condition.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VC4oEM9sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050GH25A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0050GW5BQ", "title": "Break-Free CLP Gun Cleans Lubricates Prevent Aerosol Can 12 Ounce BF-CLP12", "description": "When the United States Military issued PD-48, a purchase description of properties for a single, multi-purpose product to maintain their weaponry, it became known as the \"impossible specification\" because of its severe requirements. The first product to meet the challenge - Break-Free CLP. Break-Free's flagship product, CLP is a unique formulation of synthetic oils and individual proprietary ingredients which synergize in combination to do three important tasks simultaneously: Effectively Clean, Lubricate and Protect metal. Break-Free CLP is now recognized around the world as the standard by which maximum metal performance and protection is ensured.", "text": "Break-Free CLP Gun Cleans Lubricates Prevent Aerosol Can 12 Ounce BF-CLP12 When the United States Military issued PD-48, a purchase description of properties for a single, multi-purpose product to maintain their weaponry, it became known as the \"impossible specification\" because of its severe requirements. The first product to meet the challenge - Break-Free CLP. Break-Free's flagship product, CLP is a unique formulation of synthetic oils and individual proprietary ingredients which synergize in combination to do three important tasks simultaneously: Effectively Clean, Lubricate and Protect metal. Break-Free CLP is now recognized around the world as the standard by which maximum metal performance and protection is ensured.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Fb0PYLGyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050GW5BQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BreakFree", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 12.99}}
