{"item_id": "B0050NE2G0", "title": "3/6/9/12/50 Bite Alarm Fishing Rod Pole Twin Ring Bells w Clip Green", "description": "Descriptions:100% brand new and high working performanceCome with 2 bellsClip on your fishing rod easily With twin bells bite alarmWill ring when fish strikeGreat for professional and occasional fishermen Specifications:Color: Green and silverMaterial: Plastic and metalSize:Total Length:4.5cmClip Length: 2.3cmClip width: 1.2cmBell size: 1.5 X 1.2cm (L * W) Package includes3/6/9/12/50x Fishing Bells Alarm(The Quantity For Your Choice)", "text": "3/6/9/12/50 Bite Alarm Fishing Rod Pole Twin Ring Bells w Clip Green Descriptions:100% brand new and high working performanceCome with 2 bellsClip on your fishing rod easily With twin bells bite alarmWill ring when fish strikeGreat for professional and occasional fishermen Specifications:Color: Green and silverMaterial: Plastic and metalSize:Total Length:4.5cmClip Length: 2.3cmClip width: 1.2cmBell size: 1.5 X 1.2cm (L * W) Package includes3/6/9/12/50x Fishing Bells Alarm(The Quantity For Your Choice)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EeJuF9OkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050NE2G0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Safety Gear"]]}}
