{"item_id": "B0050P218Y", "title": "TG 23 Gram Steel Tip Dart Set With Case Darts", "description": "These TG™ brand Tungsten-Look darts have the appearance of a Tungsten Alloy dart set for a fraction of the cost. High performance flights, deluxe slimpack case and high quality shafts make this a must have set.", "text": "TG 23 Gram Steel Tip Dart Set With Case Darts These TG™ brand Tungsten-Look darts have the appearance of a Tungsten Alloy dart set for a fraction of the cost. High performance flights, deluxe slimpack case and high quality shafts make this a must have set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XkgBn3dIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050P218Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Darts & Equipment", "Darts"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B0050PM62K", "title": "SGT KNOTS® Paracord Boot Laces - 54\"", "description": "Get rid of those cheap boot laces that you are currently using and replace them with genuine US made SGT KNOTS paracord. These laces are one of a kind, paracord cut to bootlace length and finished with metal tips. Great way to ensure you always have some life-saving paracord with you.", "text": "SGT KNOTS® Paracord Boot Laces - 54\" Get rid of those cheap boot laces that you are currently using and replace them with genuine US made SGT KNOTS paracord. These laces are one of a kind, paracord cut to bootlace length and finished with metal tips. Great way to ensure you always have some life-saving paracord with you.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d-4h1%2BlFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050PM62K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 5.95}}
