{"item_id": "B0050V5EVE", "title": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife with Straight Edge Folding 2.25-Inch Stainless Steel Blade and Handle, Bead Blasted Finish", "description": "The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife is conveniently key chain ready and showcases SOG's refined style and quality construction, hiding in your pocket and appearing at whim. Made of 420 stainless steel with an attractive bead blasted finish, the 2.25-inch straight edge, folding blade has a clip point shape that allows a quicker and deeper puncture upon insertion, sharpens easily and makes quick work of any task. This knife features a Lockback mechanism, which uses a lockbar with spring tension to hold the blade safely in the open position. The ergonomically contoured and well-balanced handle is made of stainless steel with SOG cut-out design and a silver finish that fits comfortably in your hand. This knife has a closed length of 2.75-inches, overall length of 5-inches, blade thickness of 0.075-inches and weighs 1.4-ounces. The SOG FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife comes with a limited lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Each SOG product is created with the help of company founder and chief engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "text": "SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife with Straight Edge Folding 2.25-Inch Stainless Steel Blade and Handle, Bead Blasted Finish The SOG Specialty Knives & Tools FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife is conveniently key chain ready and showcases SOG's refined style and quality construction, hiding in your pocket and appearing at whim. Made of 420 stainless steel with an attractive bead blasted finish, the 2.25-inch straight edge, folding blade has a clip point shape that allows a quicker and deeper puncture upon insertion, sharpens easily and makes quick work of any task. This knife features a Lockback mechanism, which uses a lockbar with spring tension to hold the blade safely in the open position. The ergonomically contoured and well-balanced handle is made of stainless steel with SOG cut-out design and a silver finish that fits comfortably in your hand. This knife has a closed length of 2.75-inches, overall length of 5-inches, blade thickness of 0.075-inches and weighs 1.4-ounces. The SOG FF93-CP Micron 2.0 Knife comes with a limited lifetime warranty that protects against defects in manufacturing and materials. Each SOG product is created with the help of company founder and chief engineer, Spencer Frazer. Known for their uncompromising style and performance, these knives and tools showcase innovation, dependability and a unique, futuristic style that has garnered awards and recognition worldwide. SOG products have also won favor among law enforcement, military and industrial customers that rely on their tools to perform flawlessly in the toughest, most adverse conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313StlGCrwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050V5EVE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOG Specialty Knives", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.33}}
{"item_id": "B0050VMD8Q", "title": "Traditions Performance Firearms Aluminum Shotgun Snap Cap (20 Gauge)", "description": "Snap Caps are made to protect your firearms by relieving the stress on your firing pins and firing pin springs. When you safely store your unloaded...", "text": "Traditions Performance Firearms Aluminum Shotgun Snap Cap (20 Gauge) Snap Caps are made to protect your firearms by relieving the stress on your firing pins and firing pin springs. When you safely store your unloaded...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oyzpRNdCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050VMD8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Traditions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 10.39}}
{"item_id": "B0050Z5A6E", "title": "Lee Precision Breech Lock Hand Press Kit", "description": "The perfect portable reloading press kit. Begin reloading at once. No wasted time mounting to a work bench. Pack it all in the box when finished. Great for apartment dwellers or loading at the range. Includes Breech Lock Hand Press, Ram Prime, Powder Funnel, Case Lube and one Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing. Order a set of dies to complete. Maximum overall length this reloading press can accept is 3.650 inches.", "text": "Lee Precision Breech Lock Hand Press Kit The perfect portable reloading press kit. Begin reloading at once. No wasted time mounting to a work bench. Pack it all in the box when finished. Great for apartment dwellers or loading at the range. Includes Breech Lock Hand Press, Ram Prime, Powder Funnel, Case Lube and one Breech Lock Quick Change Bushing. Order a set of dies to complete. Maximum overall length this reloading press can accept is 3.650 inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YuDzQnyhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0050Z5A6E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 57.81}}
{"item_id": "B005127IEI", "title": "Hunten Outdoors 21 LED 2.0 MP Day/1.3 MP Night Infrared Flash Camera", "description": "The New GSC35-20IR has a 1 second trigger speed. . It has a 10 second delay option to ensure that you will not miss wild game. The GSC35-20IR has a port made for our Solar Panel and External Battery Pack.", "text": "Hunten Outdoors 21 LED 2.0 MP Day/1.3 MP Night Infrared Flash Camera The New GSC35-20IR has a 1 second trigger speed. . It has a 10 second delay option to ensure that you will not miss wild game. The GSC35-20IR has a port made for our Solar Panel and External Battery Pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qESgdgn9L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005127IEI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hunten Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 67.71}}
{"item_id": "B00515H7XC", "title": "Security Box Fits Bushnell Trophy Cam Black LED Trail Cameras", "description": "Fits Bushnell Trophy Cam 119466C And 119467C Blackflash Cameras. - Manufactured With All Steel Construction To Provide Exact Camera Fit. This Allows Camera To Be Taken In And Out And Still Point Back To Same Spot. (Unlike Competitors Shoe Box Design) - Powder Coated With A Camo Break-up Paint Applied - Helps To Protect Your Camera From Natures Elements - Stops Animals From Chewing On Your Camera - Theft Deterrent - Can Be Lagbolted, Bungeed, Or Belted To The Tree - Allows Use Of Padlock Or Python Cable - Manufactured By CAMLOCKbox. You won't reget pushasing this box. Also look for the universal swivel bracket by CAMLOCKbox which is available now at PB Supply. This sale is for the security box only. Camera and cable are not included. Features: Fits new Black LED Bushnell Trophy Cams Steel Construction Python Cable compatible Theft Deterrent Powder coat finish Purchase is for the Security Box ONLY", "text": "Security Box Fits Bushnell Trophy Cam Black LED Trail Cameras Fits Bushnell Trophy Cam 119466C And 119467C Blackflash Cameras. - Manufactured With All Steel Construction To Provide Exact Camera Fit. This Allows Camera To Be Taken In And Out And Still Point Back To Same Spot. (Unlike Competitors Shoe Box Design) - Powder Coated With A Camo Break-up Paint Applied - Helps To Protect Your Camera From Natures Elements - Stops Animals From Chewing On Your Camera - Theft Deterrent - Can Be Lagbolted, Bungeed, Or Belted To The Tree - Allows Use Of Padlock Or Python Cable - Manufactured By CAMLOCKbox. You won't reget pushasing this box. Also look for the universal swivel bracket by CAMLOCKbox which is available now at PB Supply. This sale is for the security box only. Camera and cable are not included. Features: Fits new Black LED Bushnell Trophy Cams Steel Construction Python Cable compatible Theft Deterrent Powder coat finish Purchase is for the Security Box ONLY", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZiGJKfB2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00515H7XC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CamLockBox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 33.79}}
