{"item_id": "B0051OYLKA", "title": "Coyote Brown Modular 1 Quart Canteen Cover (Army, Military, Police, & Security Type)", "description": "Coyote Brown Modular 1 Quart Canteen Cover. Constructed Of Rugged Tactical Polyester. Includes: Modular Compatible. Quick-Release Buckle. Internal Drawstring With Cord Lock. Two Side Pouches With Velcro Closure For Water Purification Tablets. Grommet Hole. Size: 6 1/2\" X 5 1/2\" X 3 1/2\"", "text": "Coyote Brown Modular 1 Quart Canteen Cover (Army, Military, Police, & Security Type) Coyote Brown Modular 1 Quart Canteen Cover. Constructed Of Rugged Tactical Polyester. Includes: Modular Compatible. Quick-Release Buckle. Internal Drawstring With Cord Lock. Two Side Pouches With Velcro Closure For Water Purification Tablets. Grommet Hole. Size: 6 1/2\" X 5 1/2\" X 3 1/2\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GShaNH6tL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051OYLKA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Outdoor Shopping", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 42.0}}
