{"item_id": "B0051OZMEE", "title": "Field Operator's Action Pack / Computer Backpack", "description": "The Field Operator's Action Pack is constructed of rugged tactical polyester with a four compartment configuration. Key features include: One main compartment with large pocket ideal for hydration bladder or laptop computer. Front compartment with a multitude of accessory pockets. Secondary compartment includes dual mesh pockets. Padded back panel compartment with pocket that is suitable for a laptop computer, hydration bladder or other items that require quick access. Modular attachment points included on front and two sides. Fully padded ventilated back panel, adjustable & padded shoulder straps with smart phone case, heavy duty zippers with pull cords and side cinch straps, molded top carry handle and hanging hook. Waist belt includes dual zippered pockets. Approximate size: 19 1/2\"H x 12W\" x 12\"D", "text": "Field Operator's Action Pack / Computer Backpack The Field Operator's Action Pack is constructed of rugged tactical polyester with a four compartment configuration. Key features include: One main compartment with large pocket ideal for hydration bladder or laptop computer. Front compartment with a multitude of accessory pockets. Secondary compartment includes dual mesh pockets. Padded back panel compartment with pocket that is suitable for a laptop computer, hydration bladder or other items that require quick access. Modular attachment points included on front and two sides. Fully padded ventilated back panel, adjustable & padded shoulder straps with smart phone case, heavy duty zippers with pull cords and side cinch straps, molded top carry handle and hanging hook. Waist belt includes dual zippered pockets. Approximate size: 19 1/2\"H x 12W\" x 12\"D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JivMH4fRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051OZMEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 51.91}}
{"item_id": "B0051T7JXQ", "title": "Troy Industries Q.D. 360 Push Button Rail Mount without Swivel", "description": "The Troy 360 Rail mount is a low profile rock solid attachment for battlerails and sling mounts. No swivel. - Black Only", "text": "Troy Industries Q.D. 360 Push Button Rail Mount without Swivel The Troy 360 Rail mount is a low profile rock solid attachment for battlerails and sling mounts. No swivel. - Black Only", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414DzatCt0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051T7JXQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 27.0}}
{"item_id": "B0051T8Q88", "title": "Troy Industries TRX Rail", "description": "2\" Quick-Attach Rail Section for TRX Extreme. Durable, versatile and easy to install, Troy Quick-Attach Rail Sections install solidly and accommodate a full range of accessories. - Black", "text": "Troy Industries TRX Rail 2\" Quick-Attach Rail Section for TRX Extreme. Durable, versatile and easy to install, Troy Quick-Attach Rail Sections install solidly and accommodate a full range of accessories. - Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oBYKKniTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051T8Q88.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.02}}
{"item_id": "B0051TNHMI", "title": "Troy Di-Optic Aperture Rear Fixed Battle Sight", "description": "Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Fixed Rear Sight Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industriesí new Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) fixed sights. Looking for rock solid stability and dead-on accuracy in a fixed sight? Troy Industries Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) fixed sights get the job done with an advanced design, superior sighting ability and battle-ready toughness.. This permanent, rail-mounted alternative to a standard A2 sight allows limitless mounting options on all-length rails with a serrated ramp to eliminate glare. Provides a continuous zero, unflinching durability and peace of mind. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered Di-optic apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 550 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Count on it. Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "text": "Troy Di-Optic Aperture Rear Fixed Battle Sight Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) Fixed Rear Sight Advanced design, superior sighting and battle-ready toughness define Troy Industriesí new Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) fixed sights. Looking for rock solid stability and dead-on accuracy in a fixed sight? Troy Industries Di-Optic Aperture (DOA) fixed sights get the job done with an advanced design, superior sighting ability and battle-ready toughness.. This permanent, rail-mounted alternative to a standard A2 sight allows limitless mounting options on all-length rails with a serrated ramp to eliminate glare. Provides a continuous zero, unflinching durability and peace of mind. These sights provide lightning fast target acquisition and are manufactured to exceed military specs. The optically engineered Di-optic apertures center your eyes instantly and effortlessly providing a clearer target picture than with round apertures. The sights feature two settings, one for up to 300 meters and a second for up to 550 meters. This versatility makes the DOA ideal for military, law enforcement and home defense applications. These advanced sights have been extensively field-tested and, like all Troy Industries products, are Battle Ready. Count on it. Note: Sight is designed to work on same plane rail systems only. Will not work with a railed gasblock that is higher or lower than the receiver.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-MBsOm5SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051TNHMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Troy Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 62.1}}
