{"item_id": "B0051W6CQ8", "title": "Tactical 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For Compact Pistols Fits Beretta PX4 M9A1 Glock 19 23 25 SR9 XD Compact Taurus 24/7 SIG P250 S&W SW99", "description": "Features: Made by AIM Sports, Color: Matte black, Weight: 2.5 Ounces, Length: 2-5/8\", Height: 1-5/8\", Body Width: 1\", Total Width 1-1/2\", Output: Approx 150 lumens.", "text": "Tactical 150 Lumen LED Flashlight For Compact Pistols Fits Beretta PX4 M9A1 Glock 19 23 25 SR9 XD Compact Taurus 24/7 SIG P250 S&W SW99 Features: Made by AIM Sports, Color: Matte black, Weight: 2.5 Ounces, Length: 2-5/8\", Height: 1-5/8\", Body Width: 1\", Total Width 1-1/2\", Output: Approx 150 lumens.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rh-q4ReLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051W6CQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Aim Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 25.4}}
{"item_id": "B0051XIBTI", "title": "Steel Tent Stake 10 pack 10.5\" (Various Colors)", "description": "These 10.5\" tent stakes are perfect for either replacement parts or as an upgrade to the plastic stakes that come with your tent. With galvanized steel for corrosion resistance and a diameter of 8mm to insures that the stakes do not bend. The colorful T top allows for easy visibility of the outer area of your tent which can often be tripped over at night when the glow of the fire does not reveal your tent lines.", "text": "Steel Tent Stake 10 pack 10.5\" (Various Colors) These 10.5\" tent stakes are perfect for either replacement parts or as an upgrade to the plastic stakes that come with your tent. With galvanized steel for corrosion resistance and a diameter of 8mm to insures that the stakes do not bend. The colorful T top allows for easy visibility of the outer area of your tent which can often be tripped over at night when the glow of the fire does not reveal your tent lines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UNT1mxLGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051XIBTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NRC Motorsports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Stakes"]], "price": 14.15}}
{"item_id": "B0051XJ8BI", "title": "Gas Mask Canteen - Fits Israeli M15 and Civilian", "description": "GAS MASK CANTEEN, INCLUDES LONGER 36\" DRINKING TUBE, MADE IN THE USA INCLUDES BELT CLIP ON CANTEEN", "text": "Gas Mask Canteen - Fits Israeli M15 and Civilian GAS MASK CANTEEN, INCLUDES LONGER 36\" DRINKING TUBE, MADE IN THE USA INCLUDES BELT CLIP ON CANTEEN", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41E4SJafRGL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0051XJ8BI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IDF", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 14.55}}
{"item_id": "B005200JBS", "title": "Schwinn Boys' 12-Inch Grit Bike", "description": "The Schwinn 12\" Boy's Grit is an ideal bike for the beginner rider, equipped with a parent push handle that actually steers the bike while the child learns how to steer and pedal. This push handle easily is removed when the child learns how to ride alone. Wide street tires make the bike very stable and gives a comfortable ride. The fully enclosed chaingusrd keeps the child clean and safe. Heavy duty training wheels for stability and a quick release saddle adjustment for growing children. Front and rear fenders keep the road grit off the rider. Includes a watter bottle and cage mounted on the push bar.", "text": "Schwinn Boys' 12-Inch Grit Bike The Schwinn 12\" Boy's Grit is an ideal bike for the beginner rider, equipped with a parent push handle that actually steers the bike while the child learns how to steer and pedal. This push handle easily is removed when the child learns how to ride alone. Wide street tires make the bike very stable and gives a comfortable ride. The fully enclosed chaingusrd keeps the child clean and safe. Heavy duty training wheels for stability and a quick release saddle adjustment for growing children. Front and rear fenders keep the road grit off the rider. Includes a watter bottle and cage mounted on the push bar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51H0fTMsOOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005200JBS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Schwinn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Kids' Bikes & Accessories", "Kids' Bikes"]], "price": 98.5}}
{"item_id": "B00520G3U4", "title": "NcStar AK Side Rail Optics Mount", "description": "AK Side Mount Dual Weaver RailAK Side Rail Optics Mount lets you set up your AK Style Rifle with Weaver Style Mount Optics. One Top Rail for you Scope or Red Dot and a Side Rail for Flashlight, Laser, or Other Accessories. Mount Slides on to Side Mount Rail and Clamps down securely with three allen screws.Mil Specs:Metal AK mountrequires AK Side Mount Base (not included)Top and Side Weaver RailWeight: 7 ounces", "text": "NcStar AK Side Rail Optics Mount AK Side Mount Dual Weaver RailAK Side Rail Optics Mount lets you set up your AK Style Rifle with Weaver Style Mount Optics. One Top Rail for you Scope or Red Dot and a Side Rail for Flashlight, Laser, or Other Accessories. Mount Slides on to Side Mount Rail and Clamps down securely with three allen screws.Mil Specs:Metal AK mountrequires AK Side Mount Base (not included)Top and Side Weaver RailWeight: 7 ounces", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Wfr-2BTpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00520G3U4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 19.99}}
