{"item_id": "B00526UH8M", "title": "Ybike Glider- Deluxe Scooter", "description": "The practical design of this scooter, with two front 12cm PU wheels, wide rear 9cm PU wheel, strong ribbed deck and aluminium handlebar, makes it a great scooter for children to learn coordination and balance. Children lean with their bodies to steer and step on the back wheel cover to brake. Your child will enjoy freedom and adventure, all the while building skills and self-confidence. The Glider is suitable for children from 2 years onwards.", "text": "Ybike Glider- Deluxe Scooter The practical design of this scooter, with two front 12cm PU wheels, wide rear 9cm PU wheel, strong ribbed deck and aluminium handlebar, makes it a great scooter for children to learn coordination and balance. Children lean with their bodies to steer and step on the back wheel cover to brake. Your child will enjoy freedom and adventure, all the while building skills and self-confidence. The Glider is suitable for children from 2 years onwards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31neOkBQZWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00526UH8M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters"]], "price": 85.0}}
