{"item_id": "B0052G6HD6", "title": "Aim Sports 2-7X32 Pistol Scope with Rings", "description": "AIM Sports 2-7x32 Pistol Scope brings tack-driving performance to your handgun. Bullets to the bull's eye! Get a much better fix on your target than relying on old-school iron sights with this sleek AIM Sports 2-7x32mm Pistol Scope. Loaded for bear with 1-Pc. construction and high-quality multi-coated glass, the AIM Sports crew even throw in rings... $15.00 value FREE! Ready, aim fire: Milled from one solid piece of aircraft grade aluminum to withstand constant heavy recoil; Fog proof and shock-resistant housing; Waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof nitrogen charged construction; F.O.V. @ 100 yds.: 14-4.6'; Blue fused multi-coated lens provides superior light transmission, resolution and scratch resistance; Classic Duplex reticle gets you on target; 1/4 MOA windage and elevation adjustment; 8 1/2 - 10 1/2\" eye relief is ready for your handgunning; Includes 1\" rings; Matte black housing; 10 1/2\" long, 1\" tube. Weighs 9 ozs. Take the shot with confidence. Order Today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. AIM Sports 2-7x32 Pistol Scope", "text": "Aim Sports 2-7X32 Pistol Scope with Rings AIM Sports 2-7x32 Pistol Scope brings tack-driving performance to your handgun. Bullets to the bull's eye! Get a much better fix on your target than relying on old-school iron sights with this sleek AIM Sports 2-7x32mm Pistol Scope. Loaded for bear with 1-Pc. construction and high-quality multi-coated glass, the AIM Sports crew even throw in rings... $15.00 value FREE! Ready, aim fire: Milled from one solid piece of aircraft grade aluminum to withstand constant heavy recoil; Fog proof and shock-resistant housing; Waterproof, shockproof, and fogproof nitrogen charged construction; F.O.V. @ 100 yds.: 14-4.6'; Blue fused multi-coated lens provides superior light transmission, resolution and scratch resistance; Classic Duplex reticle gets you on target; 1/4 MOA windage and elevation adjustment; 8 1/2 - 10 1/2\" eye relief is ready for your handgunning; Includes 1\" rings; Matte black housing; 10 1/2\" long, 1\" tube. Weighs 9 ozs. Take the shot with confidence. Order Today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. AIM Sports 2-7x32 Pistol Scope", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s7ucd0J%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0052G6HD6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Handgun Scopes"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B0052G6HPE", "title": "Aim Sports 4X32 Dual III. Scope with Fiber Optic Sight", "description": "This high performance optical scope with fiber optic sight from aptly named AIM Sports has a 4X magnification power and 32-millimeter objective lens.Specifications4X magnificationFiber optic scope with green coatingSix-inch total length30-millimeter tube diameter32-millimeter objective lens3.5-inch eye reliefEight-millimeter exit pupil36.6-foot field of view at 100 yards16.4-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Aim Sports 4X32 Dual III. Scope with Fiber Optic Sight This high performance optical scope with fiber optic sight from aptly named AIM Sports has a 4X magnification power and 32-millimeter objective lens.Specifications4X magnificationFiber optic scope with green coatingSix-inch total length30-millimeter tube diameter32-millimeter objective lens3.5-inch eye reliefEight-millimeter exit pupil36.6-foot field of view at 100 yards16.4-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyAIM Sports scope products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413-eHTkN0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0052G6HPE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes"]], "price": 94.95}}
