{"item_id": "B0052Y8FFG", "title": "Gunzilla 8 oz Pump Spray BC-10", "description": "Gunzilla's revolutionary formula provides lightning fast cleaning by natural based chemicals leaving a micro-thin coating for superior corrosion protection and lubrication. Gunzilla breaks down carbon which allows for quick release of various metal and plastic deposits inside the gun. It contains a natural base which penetrates and cleans better than water based products and cleaners containing petroleum based solvents.", "text": "Gunzilla 8 oz Pump Spray BC-10 Gunzilla's revolutionary formula provides lightning fast cleaning by natural based chemicals leaving a micro-thin coating for superior corrosion protection and lubrication. Gunzilla breaks down carbon which allows for quick release of various metal and plastic deposits inside the gun. It contains a natural base which penetrates and cleans better than water based products and cleaners containing petroleum based solvents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wq0K1BAdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0052Y8FFG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunzilla", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 18.5}}
{"item_id": "B0052ZV8S6", "title": "L&M Tactical XD-4 3X Magnifier with Flip to Side Mount", "description": "The XD-4 3X Magnifying Module can be used in conjunction w/ all AP sights for long-range aiming, alternatively whenever the situation needs closer or more detailed aiming capability.The 3Xmag can also be used as a hand-held 3X observation device. The 3Xmag has no reticle itself but uses the red dot in the AP sight as the aiing reticle,thus eliminating the need for re-zeoeing when shifting from non-magnified to magnified aiming and vice versa. Optication System Magnification: 3X Focus: Adjustable Objective diameter: 20mm Field of view FOV: 7\" Exit pupil diameter: 7mm Eye relief : at 5 FOV 40-90 mm at full FOV 60-65 mm Dioptric adjustment: Fixed-1.0D Photopic, integal transmission: >80% Spectral transmission: >60%(700-1000nm) Resolution (Ip/mrad): >12 Dimensions: 11.8 x 44 x 38 mm (4.5\"x1.7\"x1.5\") Weight : 200 g. (7,1 ounces) Material housing: Anodized aluminum, darj grey rubber covered black Temperature Range: -45degree C to +70Degree C in operation and storage Humidity: 0-100% condensing or non-condensing Immersion: 20 meters (67 ft)", "text": "L&M Tactical XD-4 3X Magnifier with Flip to Side Mount The XD-4 3X Magnifying Module can be used in conjunction w/ all AP sights for long-range aiming, alternatively whenever the situation needs closer or more detailed aiming capability.The 3Xmag can also be used as a hand-held 3X observation device. The 3Xmag has no reticle itself but uses the red dot in the AP sight as the aiing reticle,thus eliminating the need for re-zeoeing when shifting from non-magnified to magnified aiming and vice versa. Optication System Magnification: 3X Focus: Adjustable Objective diameter: 20mm Field of view FOV: 7\" Exit pupil diameter: 7mm Eye relief : at 5 FOV 40-90 mm at full FOV 60-65 mm Dioptric adjustment: Fixed-1.0D Photopic, integal transmission: >80% Spectral transmission: >60%(700-1000nm) Resolution (Ip/mrad): >12 Dimensions: 11.8 x 44 x 38 mm (4.5\"x1.7\"x1.5\") Weight : 200 g. (7,1 ounces) Material housing: Anodized aluminum, darj grey rubber covered black Temperature Range: -45degree C to +70Degree C in operation and storage Humidity: 0-100% condensing or non-condensing Immersion: 20 meters (67 ft)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rfGsypsfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0052ZV8S6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 53.99}}
{"item_id": "B0052ZYMI4", "title": "Browning Buckmark Holster w/Mag Pouch", "description": "Buck Mark Pistol Holster with Magazine Pouch. Tough ballistic nylon construction. Closed cell padding. Fits most Buck Mark pistols. Oversized model available will accommodate a small scope or reflex sight. Magazine Pouch keeps a magazine handy. Belt loop. Rubberized Buckmark logo.", "text": "Browning Buckmark Holster w/Mag Pouch Buck Mark Pistol Holster with Magazine Pouch. Tough ballistic nylon construction. Closed cell padding. Fits most Buck Mark pistols. Oversized model available will accommodate a small scope or reflex sight. Magazine Pouch keeps a magazine handy. Belt loop. Rubberized Buckmark logo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ticxv0BwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0052ZYMI4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.99}}
