{"item_id": "B0053EQN54", "title": "UTG 1-Inch 3-12X40 Full Size AO Mil-dot RGB Zero Locking/Resetting Scope", "description": "Smart Spherical Structure simplifies and strengthens inner/outer tube interaction for sharp, precise telescoping and W/E adjustment.This precise, range estimating illuminated riflescope from UTG is built on the company's renowned True Strength Platform for maximum durability, and has been completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof use. Emerald-coated lenses achieve optimal light transmission and clarity, while a mil-dot range estimating reticle assists in long-range shooting accuracy. The versatile scope comes complete with Picatinny and Weaver mounting rings, and a flip-open lens cap.FeaturesTrue Strength Platform:Uses Smart Spherical Structure to achieve a simple, strong inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive windage and elevation adjustments, and tough recoil resistanceSWAT Illumination:Side wheel adjustable turret opposite the windage adjustment turret controls red and green illumination brightness in the reticle, or turns it off to return to standard black reticle, depending on light conditionsRing-lock Target Turrets:Windage and elevation target turrets with locking ring to lock-in or reset zero, which serve to align marking after zeroing in the scopeFront AO:Adjustable control ring on objective tube for close range to infinity parallax adjustmentRange Estimating:Innovative reticle design provides reference points for quick range estimation during shootingVariable Power:Scope magnification is adjustableSpecifications3 to 12X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter34-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnification8.5-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification3.3- to 3-millimeter eye relief13.1- to 3.3-millimeter exit pupil331-millimeter total length18.5-ounce weightFive yards to infinite parallax settingMounting accessories includedLifetime WarrantyLeapers \"5th Generation\" brand tactical scopes include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About UTGUTG is a brand owned by Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan. Leapers has supplied shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company maintains manufacturing operations in the USA, and continues to focus on emerging market trends and customer feedback in designing its extensive product line.", "text": "UTG 1-Inch 3-12X40 Full Size AO Mil-dot RGB Zero Locking/Resetting Scope Smart Spherical Structure simplifies and strengthens inner/outer tube interaction for sharp, precise telescoping and W/E adjustment.This precise, range estimating illuminated riflescope from UTG is built on the company's renowned True Strength Platform for maximum durability, and has been completely sealed and nitrogen-filled for shock-, fog-, and rain-proof use. Emerald-coated lenses achieve optimal light transmission and clarity, while a mil-dot range estimating reticle assists in long-range shooting accuracy. The versatile scope comes complete with Picatinny and Weaver mounting rings, and a flip-open lens cap.FeaturesTrue Strength Platform:Uses Smart Spherical Structure to achieve a simple, strong inner and outer tube interaction for precise and responsive windage and elevation adjustments, and tough recoil resistanceSWAT Illumination:Side wheel adjustable turret opposite the windage adjustment turret controls red and green illumination brightness in the reticle, or turns it off to return to standard black reticle, depending on light conditionsRing-lock Target Turrets:Windage and elevation target turrets with locking ring to lock-in or reset zero, which serve to align marking after zeroing in the scopeFront AO:Adjustable control ring on objective tube for close range to infinity parallax adjustmentRange Estimating:Innovative reticle design provides reference points for quick range estimation during shootingVariable Power:Scope magnification is adjustableSpecifications3 to 12X magnificationOne-inch tube diameter40-millimeter objective diameter34-foot field of view at 100 yards at 3X magnification8.5-foot field of view at 100 yards at 12X magnification3.3- to 3-millimeter eye relief13.1- to 3.3-millimeter exit pupil331-millimeter total length18.5-ounce weightFive yards to infinite parallax settingMounting accessories includedLifetime WarrantyLeapers \"5th Generation\" brand tactical scopes include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About UTGUTG is a brand owned by Leapers, Inc., headquartered in Michigan. Leapers has supplied shooting, hunting, and outdoor gear since 1991. The company maintains manufacturing operations in the USA, and continues to focus on emerging market trends and customer feedback in designing its extensive product line.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hiw7ijRvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053EQN54.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scopes"]]}}
