{"item_id": "B0053GVRWQ", "title": "Stackable Water Container - WaterBrick 3.5 Gallon Portable Food Grade Storage, BPA Free", "description": "WaterBrick 3.5 Gallon Stackable Water Container KitPortable: Easy to Carry and Secure in Cars, Boats or ATV's30% Less Carry Weight: Our 3.5 gallon container filled with water weighs 30 pounds; 30% less carry weight than a standard 5 gallon container.Comfortable Easy Grip Carrying Handle: Helps distribute the weight on your hand.Easy to Secure in Transit: Cross stack to secure in a car or boat or tie down easily with a bungee cord through the designed column hole in the container.Stackable: Securely Stacks or Grab & GoBetter than Other Containers: Standard size WaterBricks can cross stack and interlock up to 4 feet high (stacking of half bricks is not recommended unless intermingled between standard size WaterBricks). Other containers on the market claim to be stackable but many stores will tell you they are not safe as they can easily be knocked over and they can not stack more than 2 containers high.Better than Other Bulk Storage Drums or Tanks: WaterBricks stack like bulk storage but are individually easy to move for Grab & Go taking your water where you need it. Compare WaterBrick to typical filled 55 gallon drums or tanks that are impossible to move or take with you if you are forced to leave your home during an emergency.Customizable: To Maximize Limited Storage SpaceStack & Store Any Where, Any How You Need: Perfect for small spaces or for those that want to keep their water containers discrete; put them where other containers, drums and tanks can not, or use them to make space you did not have before (a coffee table base like in the above picture for example).-Up to 25 years shelf life.-Made in the USA. Dimensions: -6'' H x 9'' W x 18'' D, 2.52 lbs", "text": "Stackable Water Container - WaterBrick 3.5 Gallon Portable Food Grade Storage, BPA Free WaterBrick 3.5 Gallon Stackable Water Container KitPortable: Easy to Carry and Secure in Cars, Boats or ATV's30% Less Carry Weight: Our 3.5 gallon container filled with water weighs 30 pounds; 30% less carry weight than a standard 5 gallon container.Comfortable Easy Grip Carrying Handle: Helps distribute the weight on your hand.Easy to Secure in Transit: Cross stack to secure in a car or boat or tie down easily with a bungee cord through the designed column hole in the container.Stackable: Securely Stacks or Grab & GoBetter than Other Containers: Standard size WaterBricks can cross stack and interlock up to 4 feet high (stacking of half bricks is not recommended unless intermingled between standard size WaterBricks). Other containers on the market claim to be stackable but many stores will tell you they are not safe as they can easily be knocked over and they can not stack more than 2 containers high.Better than Other Bulk Storage Drums or Tanks: WaterBricks stack like bulk storage but are individually easy to move for Grab & Go taking your water where you need it. Compare WaterBrick to typical filled 55 gallon drums or tanks that are impossible to move or take with you if you are forced to leave your home during an emergency.Customizable: To Maximize Limited Storage SpaceStack & Store Any Where, Any How You Need: Perfect for small spaces or for those that want to keep their water containers discrete; put them where other containers, drums and tanks can not, or use them to make space you did not have before (a coffee table base like in the above picture for example).-Up to 25 years shelf life.-Made in the USA. Dimensions: -6'' H x 9'' W x 18'' D, 2.52 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bOR0O%2BYOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053GVRWQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WaterBrick", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration"]], "price": 20.59}}
{"item_id": "B0053HKYMY", "title": "Mil-Comm TW25B grease 0.5 oz syringe - NRA® Licensed Gun Care System", "description": "NRA Licensed GUN CARE SYSTEM's TW25B Light Synthetic GUN GREASE is Mil-Comm's original formula and a top-selling, extreme performance firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions (sand, dirt, high-humidity, salt-water and extreme temperature environments) has made it the choice of the U.S. Military, leading law enforcement agencies and sport shooters worldwide. Provides ultimate lubrication protection for all wear parts and the bore; eliminates galling, short-stroking; improves bore accuracy; increases muzzle velocity...best choice for extreme pressure, heavy load bearing conditions. EXCELLENT for long-term storage, maintaining firearms in fire-ready condition. All-synthetic, non-toxic.", "text": "Mil-Comm TW25B grease 0.5 oz syringe - NRA® Licensed Gun Care System NRA Licensed GUN CARE SYSTEM's TW25B Light Synthetic GUN GREASE is Mil-Comm's original formula and a top-selling, extreme performance firearms lubricant worldwide. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions (sand, dirt, high-humidity, salt-water and extreme temperature environments) has made it the choice of the U.S. Military, leading law enforcement agencies and sport shooters worldwide. Provides ultimate lubrication protection for all wear parts and the bore; eliminates galling, short-stroking; improves bore accuracy; increases muzzle velocity...best choice for extreme pressure, heavy load bearing conditions. EXCELLENT for long-term storage, maintaining firearms in fire-ready condition. All-synthetic, non-toxic.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313BL93jnSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053HKYMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mil-Comm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 9.99}}
