{"item_id": "B0053QU1U0", "title": "Olive Drab 2 Quart Canteen Bladder Cover - 2 QT Water Carrier. Includes Shoulder Strap", "description": "Made of rugged synthetic material. Superior quality. Velcro pocket for water tabs, drain hole. Two slide locks, adjustable strap. Pile lined interior.", "text": "Olive Drab 2 Quart Canteen Bladder Cover - 2 QT Water Carrier. Includes Shoulder Strap Made of rugged synthetic material. Superior quality. Velcro pocket for water tabs, drain hole. Two slide locks, adjustable strap. Pile lined interior.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gi1VCw6TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053QU1U0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fox Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0053RW6EI", "title": "Under Armour Draft 24 Ounce Tritan Bottle with Flip Top Lid", "description": "The Under Armour hydration bottle line from Thermos was built with the active athlete in mind. The insulated bottles feature Thermos vacuum insulated technology for ultimate performance. All lids are interchangeable across all bodies and we've included innovative features to make proper hydration easier than ever. Interchangeable lid system options include the screw top, quick shot, straw top and the flip top lid. Interchangeable bottle material options include the squeeze, tritan and vacuum insulated stainless steel. These options allow athletes to have a personal, meaningful connection to their \"gear\". The cool aesthetic and sleek design of Under Armour branded Thermos hydration bottles will encourage athletes to carry reusable bottles and reduce their impact on the environment.", "text": "Under Armour Draft 24 Ounce Tritan Bottle with Flip Top Lid The Under Armour hydration bottle line from Thermos was built with the active athlete in mind. The insulated bottles feature Thermos vacuum insulated technology for ultimate performance. All lids are interchangeable across all bodies and we've included innovative features to make proper hydration easier than ever. Interchangeable lid system options include the screw top, quick shot, straw top and the flip top lid. Interchangeable bottle material options include the squeeze, tritan and vacuum insulated stainless steel. These options allow athletes to have a personal, meaningful connection to their \"gear\". The cool aesthetic and sleek design of Under Armour branded Thermos hydration bottles will encourage athletes to carry reusable bottles and reduce their impact on the environment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VILbvZzLL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053RW6EI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0053RWBSO", "title": "Under Armour Dominate 24 Ounce Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Bottle with Flip Top Lid", "description": "The Under Armour hydration bottle line from Thermos was built with the active athlete in mind. The insulated bottles feature Thermos vacuum insulated technology for ultimate performance. All lids are interchangeable across all bodies and we've included innovative features to make proper hydration easier than ever. Interchangeable lid system options include the screw top, quick shot, straw top and the flip top lid. Interchangeable bottle material options include the squeeze, tritan and vacuum insulated stainless steel. These options allow athletes to have a personal, meaningful connection to their \"gear\". The cool aesthetic and sleek design of Under Armour branded Thermos hydration bottles will encourage athletes to carry reusable bottles and reduce their impact on the environment.", "text": "Under Armour Dominate 24 Ounce Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Bottle with Flip Top Lid The Under Armour hydration bottle line from Thermos was built with the active athlete in mind. The insulated bottles feature Thermos vacuum insulated technology for ultimate performance. All lids are interchangeable across all bodies and we've included innovative features to make proper hydration easier than ever. Interchangeable lid system options include the screw top, quick shot, straw top and the flip top lid. Interchangeable bottle material options include the squeeze, tritan and vacuum insulated stainless steel. These options allow athletes to have a personal, meaningful connection to their \"gear\". The cool aesthetic and sleek design of Under Armour branded Thermos hydration bottles will encourage athletes to carry reusable bottles and reduce their impact on the environment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31SR13g5KfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053RWBSO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", 