{"item_id": "B0053ZAIYU", "title": "Wrap-Around Band LED Bike Lights - Front & Rear - 2 Super-Bright LED - Lithium Wafer Batteries Included", "description": "Specifications Key Features :Bicycle Tail Light, Rear Lamp Battery :2 x CR2032 battery (not included) LEDs :2 LEDs Function :Waterproof 4 Kinds of Switch :Full light, flash, slow flash, off Button: One-Touch switch design, easy operation Body Material: Flexible waterproof silicone Lit Time :All the sustainable use of light 35 hours Scintillation sustainable use of 160 hours Body Color: Black Weight: 0.78 oz Dimension :3.62\" x 1.18\" x 1.18\" (L x W x H) You can use it for :Outdoor activities, like biking / hiking", "text": "Wrap-Around Band LED Bike Lights - Front & Rear - 2 Super-Bright LED - Lithium Wafer Batteries Included Specifications Key Features :Bicycle Tail Light, Rear Lamp Battery :2 x CR2032 battery (not included) LEDs :2 LEDs Function :Waterproof 4 Kinds of Switch :Full light, flash, slow flash, off Button: One-Touch switch design, easy operation Body Material: Flexible waterproof silicone Lit Time :All the sustainable use of light 35 hours Scintillation sustainable use of 160 hours Body Color: Black Weight: 0.78 oz Dimension :3.62\" x 1.18\" x 1.18\" (L x W x H) You can use it for :Outdoor activities, like biking / hiking", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-GolDl6UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0053ZAIYU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sly", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 3.98}}
