{"item_id": "B00541YOMK", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery Anchored Eagle Survival Knife With Sheath", "description": "The anchored eagle is a complete survival kit contained in the sheath and knife. A must for any adventurer or military professional. Everything you need to survive in any situation. A true staple, anchor for your survival gear. Handle sure grip with finger protectors and waterproof survival. Survival kit compass, matches, strike, tweezers, pencil, fishing kit, needle thread, and razor blade. Sheath massive impact resistant double pouch with belt loop and lag straps. nylon cord wrapped on sheath for camping etc. plus fire lighting tablets. Also it contains survival knife two. Full tang hunting knife with bottle opener and cord cutter, flint and signal mirror and Slingshot.", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery Anchored Eagle Survival Knife With Sheath The anchored eagle is a complete survival kit contained in the sheath and knife. A must for any adventurer or military professional. Everything you need to survive in any situation. A true staple, anchor for your survival gear. Handle sure grip with finger protectors and waterproof survival. Survival kit compass, matches, strike, tweezers, pencil, fishing kit, needle thread, and razor blade. Sheath massive impact resistant double pouch with belt loop and lag straps. nylon cord wrapped on sheath for camping etc. plus fire lighting tablets. Also it contains survival knife two. Full tang hunting knife with bottle opener and cord cutter, flint and signal mirror and Slingshot.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416oovjU69L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00541YOMK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 32.44}}
