{"item_id": "B00544LLDM", "title": "Tour Hockey THOR BX-PRO Inline Hockey Skate", "description": "Tour Thor BX Pro Kids Inline Hockey Skates - The Tour Thor BX Pro Inline Hockey Skates are a high performance, high quality pair of skates. Labeda Millennium wheels with ABEC 9 bearings will have you flying around the rink like you were shot out of a cannon. The Millennium wheels are soft and offer Super grip and max speed. The Memory foam on the inside offers you a soft, comfortable fit and the Dri-Bic Quick dry lining will help keep your feet cool during even the most heated moments of the game. . Tongue: Felt, Lining Material: Dri-Bic Quick Dry, Skate Type: Roller Hockey, Special Features: Vorrac Support System Heel Support, Wheel Brand: Labeda Millennium, Wheel Configuration: Size 3-4: 72mm - 72mm - 72mm - 72mm, Wheel Configuration: Size 5: 76mm - 76mm - 76mm - 76mm, Wheel Durometer: Soft Grip, Bearing Type: ABEC 9, Bearing Size: 608 - Standard, Frame Material: Labeda Hum Er Extreme, Closure System: Laces, Special Features: Direct Power System, Wheel Type: Indoor Single Durometer, Outsole Material: Composite, Exterior Material: IDT Ultra Light Quarter Panels, Bearing Grade: High Performance, Front Wheel Size: Size 3-4: 72mm / Size 5: 76mm, Ventilation: Yes, Number of Wheels: 4, Maximum Wheel Size: Size 3-4: 72mm / Size 5: 76mm, Wheel Size: 70-79mm, Skate Frame Material: Performance Composite, Skate Closure System: Traditional Laces, Skate Cuff Height: High, Brake Included: No, Skill Range: Advanced Intermediate - Expert, Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 227932, Model Number: 85 TA 3, GTIN: 0049288030880", "text": "Tour Hockey THOR BX-PRO Inline Hockey Skate Tour Thor BX Pro Kids Inline Hockey Skates - The Tour Thor BX Pro Inline Hockey Skates are a high performance, high quality pair of skates. Labeda Millennium wheels with ABEC 9 bearings will have you flying around the rink like you were shot out of a cannon. The Millennium wheels are soft and offer Super grip and max speed. The Memory foam on the inside offers you a soft, comfortable fit and the Dri-Bic Quick dry lining will help keep your feet cool during even the most heated moments of the game. . Tongue: Felt, Lining Material: Dri-Bic Quick Dry, Skate Type: Roller Hockey, Special Features: Vorrac Support System Heel Support, Wheel Brand: Labeda Millennium, Wheel Configuration: Size 3-4: 72mm - 72mm - 72mm - 72mm, Wheel Configuration: Size 5: 76mm - 76mm - 76mm - 76mm, Wheel Durometer: Soft Grip, Bearing Type: ABEC 9, Bearing Size: 608 - Standard, Frame Material: Labeda Hum Er Extreme, Closure System: Laces, Special Features: Direct Power System, Wheel Type: Indoor Single Durometer, Outsole Material: Composite, Exterior Material: IDT Ultra Light Quarter Panels, Bearing Grade: High Performance, Front Wheel Size: Size 3-4: 72mm / Size 5: 76mm, Ventilation: Yes, Number of Wheels: 4, Maximum Wheel Size: Size 3-4: 72mm / Size 5: 76mm, Wheel Size: 70-79mm, Skate Frame Material: Performance Composite, Skate Closure System: Traditional Laces, Skate Cuff Height: High, Brake Included: No, Skill Range: Advanced Intermediate - Expert, Model Year: 2012, Product ID: 227932, Model Number: 85 TA 3, GTIN: 0049288030880", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51y3BBOpndL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00544LLDM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Roller Hockey", "Skates"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005454JYO", "title": "Kershaw Drone Folding Knife", "description": "Kershaw Drone. 4 1/8\" closed linerlock. 2 7/8\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs, stonewashed finish and extended tang. Speed-Safe assisted opening. Black textured G-10 handles. Lanyard hole. Stainless pocket clip. Hang packaged.", "text": "Kershaw Drone Folding Knife Kershaw Drone. 4 1/8\" closed linerlock. 2 7/8\" 8Cr13MoV stainless blade with dual thumb studs, stonewashed finish and extended tang. Speed-Safe assisted opening. Black textured G-10 handles. Lanyard hole. Stainless pocket clip. Hang packaged.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21rbhZYtn8L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005454JYO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00545P4YS", "title": "Tenn 8 Panel Viper Professional Cycling Shorts with Superior Pad", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our new Viper Shorts for Spring Summer for this year, are the next step up from our ever popular 8 Panel Shorts. Still featuring an 8 panel construction for a professional fit, the Viper Shorts have been designed with medium to long distance riding in mind. We are using a brand new superior professional moulded foam pad in a vibrant Orange colour. The new pad is a 3 layer multi density construction, which gives wider and longer coverage in the saddle areas. The depth is an impressive 15 mm at the rear, tapering to a modest 8 mm at the front. The pad features an over-locking stitch construction all the way around the edge to prevent chafing. In other words, the pad edges are sealed flat so there are no harsh edges to rub against your skin.This thoroughly modern and striking design features vibrant contrast colour stitching options in Yellow, Orange and Blue. Our plain Black option is just as impressive. With safety in mind for low light conditions, we have introduced strikingly reflective heat transfers on the rear of both legs, along with our manufacturer's logo which will get you noticed.The fabric is the same high quality as our standard 8 Panel Shorts options, with 20% Spandex to allow the fabric to stretch in four directions in the right areas. These are technically designed for serious cyclists, allowing the shorts more curvature offering the cyclist better performance and comfort. Flat stitched seams again prevent chafing while riding. Silicone leg grippers prevent the garment riding up the leg, while the blend of high density Nylon and Spandex fibres ensure that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. Mens shorts are available in various sizes and colours.", "text": "Tenn 8 Panel Viper Professional Cycling Shorts with Superior Pad Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our new Viper Shorts for Spring Summer for this year, are the next step up from our ever popular 8 Panel Shorts. Still featuring an 8 panel construction for a professional fit, the Viper Shorts have been designed with medium to long distance riding in mind. We are using a brand new superior professional moulded foam pad in a vibrant Orange colour. The new pad is a 3 layer multi density construction, which gives wider and longer coverage in the saddle areas. The depth is an impressive 15 mm at the rear, tapering to a modest 8 mm at the front. The pad features an over-locking stitch construction all the way around the edge to prevent chafing. In other words, the pad edges are sealed flat so there are no harsh edges to rub against your skin.This thoroughly modern and striking design features vibrant contrast colour stitching options in Yellow, Orange and Blue. Our plain Black option is just as impressive. With safety in mind for low light conditions, we have introduced strikingly reflective heat transfers on the rear of both legs, along with our manufacturer's logo which will get you noticed.The fabric is the same high quality as our standard 8 Panel Shorts options, with 20% Spandex to allow the fabric to stretch in four directions in the right areas. These are technically designed for serious cyclists, allowing the shorts more curvature offering the cyclist better performance and comfort. Flat stitched seams again prevent chafing while riding. Silicone leg grippers prevent the garment riding up the leg, while the blend of high density Nylon and Spandex fibres ensure that your muscles are kept insulated, supported and ready for action. Mens shorts are available in various sizes and colours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EskgP2ojL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00545P4YS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]], "price": 52.99}}
{"item_id": "B005461U9U", "title": "Olive Drab BDU Quick Release Pistol Belt Extender - One Size Fits All, Marine Corps", "description": "Olive Drab BDU Quick Release Pistol Belt Extender. Attaches To New Style QR (Quick Release) Marine Corps Pistol Belt. Replica Army, Military, Police & Security Type. High Quality And Made To Last. For Both Men and Women. Size: One Size Fits All.", "text": "Olive Drab BDU Quick Release Pistol Belt Extender - One Size Fits All, Marine Corps Olive Drab BDU Quick Release Pistol Belt Extender. Attaches To New Style QR (Quick Release) Marine Corps Pistol Belt. Replica Army, Military, Police & Security Type. High Quality And Made To Last. For Both Men and Women. Size: One Size Fits All.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ohHQOCE3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005461U9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OUTDOOR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 3.38}}
{"item_id": "B005467UHQ", "title": "Kevlar® Braided Cord for Speargun Reel Line 400lb Test", "description": "Small diameter and high strength make this line is perfect for stretching the capacity of your reel for blue water. Kevlar has the high strength and cut resistance you want in a speargun line. This line is excellent for a multitude of applications including model rocketry, survival cord and fire poi. The general characteristics of Kevlar are: High Modulus, High LASE (Load At Specified Elongation), High Tensile Strength at Low Weight, Low Elongation to Break High Modulus, (Structural Rigidity) Low Electrical Conductivity, High Chemical Resistance, Low Thermal Shrinkage, High Toughness (Work-To-Break), Excellent Dimensional Stability High Cut Resistance, Flame Resistant, Self-Extinguishing WARNING: NOT FOR USE WHERE FAILURE COULD RESULT IN BODILY INJURY OR PROPERTY DAMAGE. NOT FOR CLIMBING.", "text": "Kevlar® Braided Cord for Speargun Reel Line 400lb Test Small diameter and high strength make this line is perfect for stretching the capacity of your reel for blue water. Kevlar has the high strength and cut resistance you want in a speargun line. This line is excellent for a multitude of applications including model rocketry, survival cord and fire poi. The general characteristics of Kevlar are: High Modulus, High LASE (Load At Specified Elongation), High Tensile Strength at Low Weight, Low Elongation to Break High Modulus, (Structural Rigidity) Low Electrical Conductivity, High Chemical Resistance, Low Thermal Shrinkage, High Toughness (Work-To-Break), Excellent Dimensional Stability High Cut Resistance, Flame Resistant, Self-Extinguishing WARNING: NOT FOR USE WHERE FAILURE COULD RESULT IN BODILY INJURY OR PROPERTY DAMAGE. NOT FOR CLIMBING.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JeOKSOtPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005467UHQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Ice Fishing Accessories", "Ice Spearing Equipment"]]}}
