{"item_id": "B0054GLCDE", "title": "Rothco Compact Commando Axe", "description": "Rothco's 35 Commando Axe is perfect for camping or hiking. Its ultra compact 3 piece design fits into a 6\" belt pouch, yet when assembled, extends to 13\" long. Its handle is metal and the OD green belt pouch is included.", "text": "Rothco Compact Commando Axe Rothco's 35 Commando Axe is perfect for camping or hiking. Its ultra compact 3 piece design fits into a 6\" belt pouch, yet when assembled, extends to 13\" long. Its handle is metal and the OD green belt pouch is included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yHjhPDXlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054GLCDE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Axes"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0054GOA92", "title": "Bagmaster Six Pocket Magazine Pouch - Belt", "description": "Multiple magazine pouches provide easy access to your extra handgun magazines. Black with six indivdual mag pockets with velcro closure. Multiple magazine pouches provide easy access to your extra handgun magazines. Made with a Cordura nylon body and a padded back panel. Dual belt loops securely hold Mag Pouches in place. Dual belt loops securely hold Mag Pouches in place.", "text": "Bagmaster Six Pocket Magazine Pouch - Belt Multiple magazine pouches provide easy access to your extra handgun magazines. Black with six indivdual mag pockets with velcro closure. Multiple magazine pouches provide easy access to your extra handgun magazines. Made with a Cordura nylon body and a padded back panel. Dual belt loops securely hold Mag Pouches in place. Dual belt loops securely hold Mag Pouches in place.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415kpDnLv4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054GOA92.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0054GRPVM", "title": "SE - Safety Light - Flasher w/Bicycle Att., 5 Red LED, Red Body - FL26RY25", "description": "This safety light flasher with bicycle attachment has a red body and comes with an arm strap, and a belt clip. It features a 120 rotatable bike attachment. It features 5 super bright red LED bulbs that have 8 functions: all LEDs on, all LEDs flashing fast, all LEDs flashing slow, all LEDs flashing in a pattern from left to right, LEDS flashing fast in a pattern from left to right, LEDs flashing in a pattern from left to right then right to left, all LEDs off. Requires 2AA batteries (batteries not included).", "text": "SE - Safety Light - Flasher w/Bicycle Att., 5 Red LED, Red Body - FL26RY25 This safety light flasher with bicycle attachment has a red body and comes with an arm strap, and a belt clip. It features a 120 rotatable bike attachment. It features 5 super bright red LED bulbs that have 8 functions: all LEDs on, all LEDs flashing fast, all LEDs flashing slow, all LEDs flashing in a pattern from left to right, LEDS flashing fast in a pattern from left to right, LEDs flashing in a pattern from left to right then right to left, all LEDs off. Requires 2AA batteries (batteries not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51YFE57vBGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054GRPVM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 1.2}}
