{"item_id": "B0054KVD4S", "title": "Led Lenser P3 LED Flashlight", "description": "Led Lenser's high end P3 LED Flashlight includes the Rapid Focus System™ allowing you to transition from a circular, spill-beam to a focused, long-distance beam, quickly with just one-hand. Thanks to the special prismatic structure of the lenses the blue spectrum is separated from the white allowing for clean white light to read by with a mellow blue circle to frame the reading area. Small and light weight, it's equipped with state-of-the-art electronics and constructed using all the same design features and high-end materials such as anodized aluminum casing as Led Lenser's larger lights. This flashlight requires only one AAA battery for hours of light and is exceptionally bright for its size.Distance (Max/Min) 31 m.Battery Life (Max/Min) 6 hr 30 min.Water Resistance: IPX 4.Size: Length 3.72 \".Weight: 1.48 oz..Battery: 1 AAA.", "text": "Led Lenser P3 LED Flashlight Led Lenser's high end P3 LED Flashlight includes the Rapid Focus System™ allowing you to transition from a circular, spill-beam to a focused, long-distance beam, quickly with just one-hand. Thanks to the special prismatic structure of the lenses the blue spectrum is separated from the white allowing for clean white light to read by with a mellow blue circle to frame the reading area. Small and light weight, it's equipped with state-of-the-art electronics and constructed using all the same design features and high-end materials such as anodized aluminum casing as Led Lenser's larger lights. This flashlight requires only one AAA battery for hours of light and is exceptionally bright for its size.Distance (Max/Min) 31 m.Battery Life (Max/Min) 6 hr 30 min.Water Resistance: IPX 4.Size: Length 3.72 \".Weight: 1.48 oz..Battery: 1 AAA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319kIFObo2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054KVD4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LED Lenser", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 13.69}}
{"item_id": "B0054KZ4WU", "title": "LED Lenser 880006 T7 Tatical LED Flashlight, Black", "description": "The LED Lenser T7 is a milestone in our company history. This lamp features our Dynamic Switch technology and the Advanced Focus System. Measuring 5.4-Inch and weighing less than 7-Ounce, the T7 is lightweight, but its brightness is very impressive-175 lumens-turning night into day.", "text": "LED Lenser 880006 T7 Tatical LED Flashlight, Black The LED Lenser T7 is a milestone in our company history. This lamp features our Dynamic Switch technology and the Advanced Focus System. Measuring 5.4-Inch and weighing less than 7-Ounce, the T7 is lightweight, but its brightness is very impressive-175 lumens-turning night into day.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412pW7qzKJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054KZ4WU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LED Lenser", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 36.9}}
{"item_id": "B0054L04WY", "title": "LED Lenser 880028 V2 LED Flashlight, Black", "description": "The lightweight and ergonomic housing of the V2 model is only the beginning. This powerful light is only 3.6-Ounce but it can produce an amazing 95 lumens for a distance of 740-Feet.", "text": "LED Lenser 880028 V2 LED Flashlight, Black The lightweight and ergonomic housing of the V2 model is only the beginning. This powerful light is only 3.6-Ounce but it can produce an amazing 95 lumens for a distance of 740-Feet.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417ZzApI7XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054L04WY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LED Lenser", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 22.89}}
{"item_id": "B0054LT4K2", "title": "BLACKHAWK! Sportster Modular Weapons Case, 36 -Inch Long, Black", "description": "The BLACKHAWK! Sportster Modular Weapons Case is made of durable 600 denier polyester with heavy-duty tactical webbing. The modular case is discreet and comes with a removable, padded divider to separate two firearms or one firearm and a full set of pouches. Full MOLLE or Speed Clip compatible webbing on both interior walls for maximum configuration of mag pouches and other accessories inside the case.", "text": "BLACKHAWK! Sportster Modular Weapons Case, 36 -Inch Long, Black The BLACKHAWK! Sportster Modular Weapons Case is made of durable 600 denier polyester with heavy-duty tactical webbing. The modular case is discreet and comes with a removable, padded divider to separate two firearms or one firearm and a full set of pouches. Full MOLLE or Speed Clip compatible webbing on both interior walls for maximum configuration of mag pouches and other accessories inside the case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aPr0wLxSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054LT4K2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BLACK HAWK INC.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 42.77}}
{"item_id": "B0054N48WY", "title": "MagicShine MJ-872 LED Cycling Bike Light with Improved MJ-828 LCD Battery Pack, 1600-Lumen, Black", "description": "If your looking for a light gives the brightest, widest, fullest beam look no further. This state of the art MagicShine MJ-872 cycle light boasts absolutely incredible power despite its compact size and super-lightweight characteristics. Finished in anodized satin black/silver and completely sealed with 'O' rings making it waterproof as well as being very tough wearing. MJ-872 Bicycle light Specification: LED: 4*XP-G Luminous flux: 1600LM LED lifespan: Above 50,000 hours Lens: Optical lens (toughened glass) Reflector: Orange peel reflector Case Material: 6061-T6 Aluminum alloy Surface treatment: Type Ⅲ hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Switch: Click switch Working modes: 100%-75%-50%-30% brightness Run time: 3.5 hours with MJ-828 battery pack Waterproof Level: IPX-4 Accessories: Battery pack, Charger, O-rings Product size: ø42*50MM Working temperature: -10℃40℃ Storage temperature: 10℃-25℃ Warranty: light head has 1 year warranty, all other accessories carry 180 days warranty from the manufacturer.", "text": "MagicShine MJ-872 LED Cycling Bike Light with Improved MJ-828 LCD Battery Pack, 1600-Lumen, Black If your looking for a light gives the brightest, widest, fullest beam look no further. This state of the art MagicShine MJ-872 cycle light boasts absolutely incredible power despite its compact size and super-lightweight characteristics. Finished in anodized satin black/silver and completely sealed with 'O' rings making it waterproof as well as being very tough wearing. MJ-872 Bicycle light Specification: LED: 4*XP-G Luminous flux: 1600LM LED lifespan: Above 50,000 hours Lens: Optical lens (toughened glass) Reflector: Orange peel reflector Case Material: 6061-T6 Aluminum alloy Surface treatment: Type Ⅲ hard-anodized anti-abrasive finish Switch: Click switch Working modes: 100%-75%-50%-30% brightness Run time: 3.5 hours with MJ-828 battery pack Waterproof Level: IPX-4 Accessories: Battery pack, Charger, O-rings Product size: ø42*50MM Working temperature: -10℃40℃ Storage temperature: 10℃-25℃ Warranty: light head has 1 year warranty, all other accessories carry 180 days warranty from the manufacturer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qEth%2BThHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054N48WY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagicShine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 102.99}}
