{"item_id": "B0054PB898", "title": "AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope Matte Black", "description": "AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope. Accuracy improved! Enjoy long-distance bull's eyes that used to be pure guesswork. The secret is a built-in bullet-drop rangefinding compensation system with precise trajectory adjustments. Our special buy shoots BIG BUCKS OFF! Look: Bullet-drop compensation grid for precise adjustments; Multi-coated optics for clarity; 1/4\" M.O.A.; Waterproof; Fogproof; Shockproof; 26.5' F.O.V. @ 100 yds.; 3 1/2\" eye relief. ; 1\" tube is 7 1/2\"l. Weighs 18 ozs. Comes with rings. Order Now! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope, Matte Black", "text": "AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope Matte Black AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope. Accuracy improved! Enjoy long-distance bull's eyes that used to be pure guesswork. The secret is a built-in bullet-drop rangefinding compensation system with precise trajectory adjustments. Our special buy shoots BIG BUCKS OFF! Look: Bullet-drop compensation grid for precise adjustments; Multi-coated optics for clarity; 1/4\" M.O.A.; Waterproof; Fogproof; Shockproof; 26.5' F.O.V. @ 100 yds.; 3 1/2\" eye relief. ; 1\" tube is 7 1/2\"l. Weighs 18 ozs. Comes with rings. Order Now! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. AIM Sports 4x32 mm Rangefinding Reticle Scope, Matte Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a3qQdt4RL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054PB898.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 29.98}}
{"item_id": "B0054PCZLS", "title": "Skins A200 Men's Compression Long Tights", "description": "Whatever your sport, our A200 Men’s Compression Long Tights will boost your circulation, bringing more oxygen-rich blood to your muscles so you can perform better for longer. Improved circulation also means blood lactate is re-circulated more effectively.By strategically wrapping and supporting your muscles, SKINS clothing also reduces muscle vibration, so there’s less risk of injury. Whether you’re a dedicated sports fiend or an active outdoors man every weekend, you’ll be sure to notice the difference.The A200 Men’s Compression Long Tights also feature an internal key pocket and a tailored crotch for greater comfort, along with a shaped inseam to avoid abrasion between knees. The tights have bold SKINS stitching and all-new raised tactile logos on the waistband", "text": "Skins A200 Men's Compression Long Tights Whatever your sport, our A200 Men’s Compression Long Tights will boost your circulation, bringing more oxygen-rich blood to your muscles so you can perform better for longer. Improved circulation also means blood lactate is re-circulated more effectively.By strategically wrapping and supporting your muscles, SKINS clothing also reduces muscle vibration, so there’s less risk of injury. Whether you’re a dedicated sports fiend or an active outdoors man every weekend, you’ll be sure to notice the difference.The A200 Men’s Compression Long Tights also feature an internal key pocket and a tailored crotch for greater comfort, along with a shaped inseam to avoid abrasion between knees. The tights have bold SKINS stitching and all-new raised tactile logos on the waistband", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L5gcZAFDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054PCZLS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Tights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0054SLXF4", "title": "Four Banger Taurus 94 H&R 9 Shot Speed Block", "description": "With a Loading Block for the H&R; or Taurus 94 9 Shot Speedloader you can pre stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple twist on HKS Speedloader secures in 9 rounds in less than 3 seconds.... transfer them to the cylinder.... twist again and your 9 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 7 seconds. The Four Banger Speed Block holds 36 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 9 rounds in your HKS Speedloader and 36 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 45 rounds ready to twist into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it!", "text": "Four Banger Taurus 94 H&R 9 Shot Speed Block With a Loading Block for the H&R; or Taurus 94 9 Shot Speedloader you can pre stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple twist on HKS Speedloader secures in 9 rounds in less than 3 seconds.... transfer them to the cylinder.... twist again and your 9 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 7 seconds. The Four Banger Speed Block holds 36 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 9 rounds in your HKS Speedloader and 36 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 45 rounds ready to twist into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lgmuRD0UL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054SLXF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B0054SQJZS", "title": "RUGER 22 CLIP LOADER", "description": "I love this gizmo save your aching thumb with this affordable simple and easy to use clip loader for the Ruger, Browning, Baretta Neos, Smith & Wesson 22a, and High Standard .22 Caliber Magazines. One simple tool loads them all. Looking for something easy to operate this is about as simple as it gets no moving parts. Slip it over the magazine slide down the follower load up. Easy to keep track of with the included carabiner. Keep it handy clip it to your range bag or favorite belt loop. No more aching thumbs! Put one in your shopping cart NOW! We'll ship it to you today!", "text": "RUGER 22 CLIP LOADER I love this gizmo save your aching thumb with this affordable simple and easy to use clip loader for the Ruger, Browning, Baretta Neos, Smith & Wesson 22a, and High Standard .22 Caliber Magazines. One simple tool loads them all. Looking for something easy to operate this is about as simple as it gets no moving parts. Slip it over the magazine slide down the follower load up. Easy to keep track of with the included carabiner. Keep it handy clip it to your range bag or favorite belt loop. No more aching thumbs! Put one in your shopping cart NOW! We'll ship it to you today!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vKz67bBiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054SQJZS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B0054T7S8O", "title": "Cold Steel 12CT Safe Keeper III, Black Kraton Handle, Plain", "description": "The Safe Keeper III offers outstanding versatility, especially as a boot knife. Its light weight and overall length of five inches make it the perfect combination of small size and big performance. The single edged design of the Safe Keeper III means you can safely \"choke up\" on the blade for extra fine work, while the false edge provides superior point strength. With only one sharp edge, the Safe Keeper III can double as a rescue knife.", "text": "Cold Steel 12CT Safe Keeper III, Black Kraton Handle, Plain The Safe Keeper III offers outstanding versatility, especially as a boot knife. Its light weight and overall length of five inches make it the perfect combination of small size and big performance. The single edged design of the Safe Keeper III means you can safely \"choke up\" on the blade for extra fine work, while the false edge provides superior point strength. With only one sharp edge, the Safe Keeper III can double as a rescue knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B3bGWrsyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054T7S8O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 39.88}}
{"item_id": "B0054WOMRG", "title": "Gen-X Global Paintball Hauler (CLEAR) G-162", "description": "Gen X's paintball hauler makes filling Pods between games easy! The Hauler holds 1000 balls (half a full case), and the pour spout means your balls going to the pod, not in the dirt. The large handle is easy to hold.", "text": "Gen-X Global Paintball Hauler (CLEAR) G-162 Gen X's paintball hauler makes filling Pods between games easy! The Hauler holds 1000 balls (half a full case), and the pour spout means your balls going to the pod, not in the dirt. The large handle is easy to hold.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Mc7SkLqZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0054WOMRG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gen X Global", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Loaders & Accessories", "Tubes & Pods"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B00550VYMS", "title": "Zombie Killer Giant Fixed Blade Tactical Bowie Knife 21\"", "description": "This is the Zombie Killer Giant Tactical Bowie Knife With Sheath.. The knives are made with sliver finished 440 stainless steel material. The handle and blade are one piece and overall length is measured at 21\". The blade is sharpened and measures at 14\". The blade extends to the end of the handle, and two pieces of hard wood is used to secure the handle and give comfortable grip. The knife features a nylon sheath that can be used to hang on the back. Two snap safety secures the knife in the sheath.", "text": "Zombie Killer Giant Fixed Blade Tactical Bowie Knife 21\" This is the Zombie Killer Giant Tactical Bowie Knife With Sheath.. The knives are made with sliver finished 440 stainless steel material. The handle and blade are one piece and overall length is measured at 21\". The blade is sharpened and measures at 14\". The blade extends to the end of the handle, and two pieces of hard wood is used to secure the handle and give comfortable grip. The knife features a nylon sheath that can be used to hang on the back. Two snap safety secures the knife in the sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31y4Ry7GTEL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00550VYMS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 32.95}}
