{"item_id": "B00553XR0M", "title": "Portland Design Works Magic Flute Pump", "description": "When your bicycle features clean lines and eye-pleasing aesthetics, you don't want to ruin it with a drab plastic pump. The Portland Design Works Magic Flute is a mini pump/CO2 combo that's constructed from aluminum to keep weight down, and it's also polished for an attractive finish. To use a cartridge, simply thread one into the head, install the pump, and then release the flow valve to fill the tire up. The valve helps prevent lost CO2 by controlling its discharge. The Portland Design Works Magic Flute comes with an alloy mounting bracket.", "text": "Portland Design Works Magic Flute Pump When your bicycle features clean lines and eye-pleasing aesthetics, you don't want to ruin it with a drab plastic pump. The Portland Design Works Magic Flute is a mini pump/CO2 combo that's constructed from aluminum to keep weight down, and it's also polished for an attractive finish. To use a cartridge, simply thread one into the head, install the pump, and then release the flow valve to fill the tire up. The valve helps prevent lost CO2 by controlling its discharge. The Portland Design Works Magic Flute comes with an alloy mounting bracket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419bpUp2f3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00553XR0M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Portland Design Works", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]], "price": 55.0}}
{"item_id": "B00553XXG0", "title": "Avid Elixir Mountain Bicycle Disc Brake Pads - Pair", "description": "For Avid Elixir brakes. Sintered metal brake pad compound or", "text": "Avid Elixir Mountain Bicycle Disc Brake Pads - Pair For Avid Elixir brakes. Sintered metal brake pad compound or", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rOYYvy93L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00553XXG0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00553XXMY", "title": "Avid Elixir Disc Brake Organic Pads with Aluminum Back", "description": "These replacement pads for Avid's Elixir line of brakes feature a quiet organic pad and weight saving aluminum back plates.", "text": "Avid Elixir Disc Brake Organic Pads with Aluminum Back These replacement pads for Avid's Elixir line of brakes feature a quiet organic pad and weight saving aluminum back plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41k%2BjNorDeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00553XXMY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Pads", "Pads Inserts"]], "price": 22.25}}
{"item_id": "B00553YP4E", "title": "Avid BB7 Mountain Disc Brake", "description": "The Avid BB7 Mountain Disc Brake packs all the confident stopping power and simple adjustability you've ever wanted in a disc brake. From day rides to long-distance touring, the mechanically-actuated BB7 provides peace of mind, since all the adjustments can easily be done trailside with your standard toolkit.G2 Clean Sweep rotors dissipate heat and provide predictable modulation Avid's Tri-Align caliper adjustment knobs let you painlessly dial in your brakes Compatible with standard long-pull mountain leversProduct FeaturesMaterial: forged aluminumType: mechanicalMount Type:Rotor Size: 160 mm, 180 mm, 200 mmWeight:Recommended Use: XC, all-mountain, freerideManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "text": "Avid BB7 Mountain Disc Brake The Avid BB7 Mountain Disc Brake packs all the confident stopping power and simple adjustability you've ever wanted in a disc brake. From day rides to long-distance touring, the mechanically-actuated BB7 provides peace of mind, since all the adjustments can easily be done trailside with your standard toolkit.G2 Clean Sweep rotors dissipate heat and provide predictable modulation Avid's Tri-Align caliper adjustment knobs let you painlessly dial in your brakes Compatible with standard long-pull mountain leversProduct FeaturesMaterial: forged aluminumType: mechanicalMount Type:Rotor Size: 160 mm, 180 mm, 200 mmWeight:Recommended Use: XC, all-mountain, freerideManufacturer Warranty: 2 years", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BF%2B%2B1s1bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00553YP4E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brakes", "Disc Brake Sets"]]}}
