{"item_id": "B00556M7BY", "title": "Spyderco Vallotton Sub-Hilt G-10 Plain Edge Knife", "description": "Butch Vallotton is a renowned custom knife maker and innovator and the first folder maker to use a blade's thumb stud as a stop pin for the lock. The Vallotton Sub-Hilt pays tribute this innovation and is the only Spiders to feature both a thumb stud and our trademark round hole. This hand-filling design features brushed stainless bolsters and a sub-hilt meticulously mated with contoured, polished G-10 scales. The CPM S30V blade combines hollow-ground primary bevels with a faceted flat-ground tip to provide a superior combination of cutting performance and point strength. A sturdy Liner Lock mechanism and versatile four-position clip complete the package and make this one of the classiest production folding knives ever made.", "text": "Spyderco Vallotton Sub-Hilt G-10 Plain Edge Knife Butch Vallotton is a renowned custom knife maker and innovator and the first folder maker to use a blade's thumb stud as a stop pin for the lock. The Vallotton Sub-Hilt pays tribute this innovation and is the only Spiders to feature both a thumb stud and our trademark round hole. This hand-filling design features brushed stainless bolsters and a sub-hilt meticulously mated with contoured, polished G-10 scales. The CPM S30V blade combines hollow-ground primary bevels with a faceted flat-ground tip to provide a superior combination of cutting performance and point strength. A sturdy Liner Lock mechanism and versatile four-position clip complete the package and make this one of the classiest production folding knives ever made.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21j0e10sDUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00556M7BY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 185.95}}
{"item_id": "B00557MLRI", "title": "Gunzilla 16Oz Turret Top", "description": "Gunzilla's revolutionary formula provides lightning fast cleaning by natural based chemicals leaving a micro-thin coating for superior corrosion protection and lubrication. Gunzilla breaks down carbon which allows for quick release of various metal and plastic deposits inside the gun. It contains a natural base which penetrates and cleans better than water based products and cleaners containing petroleum based solvents.", "text": "Gunzilla 16Oz Turret Top Gunzilla's revolutionary formula provides lightning fast cleaning by natural based chemicals leaving a micro-thin coating for superior corrosion protection and lubrication. Gunzilla breaks down carbon which allows for quick release of various metal and plastic deposits inside the gun. It contains a natural base which penetrates and cleans better than water based products and cleaners containing petroleum based solvents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51kJX9xy1UL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00557MLRI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gunzilla", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 26.94}}
{"item_id": "B0055BCGBK", "title": "Radians Clay Pro Shooting and Safety Glasses (Silver Frame)", "description": "The Radians Clay Pro shooting glasses have a 7 Base wraparound unilense. Silver metal temples, rubber nosepiece. Exceeds ANSI Z87.1+ Standards", "text": "Radians Clay Pro Shooting and Safety Glasses (Silver Frame) The Radians Clay Pro shooting glasses have a 7 Base wraparound unilense. Silver metal temples, rubber nosepiece. Exceeds ANSI Z87.1+ Standards", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319rgJBPPqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055BCGBK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 17.1}}
{"item_id": "B0055BCGLA", "title": "Radians Remington Womens Eye and Ear Protection Combo Pack", "description": "Our best-selling ladies ear and eye protection, in one easy to buy kit!", "text": "Radians Remington Womens Eye and Ear Protection Combo Pack Our best-selling ladies ear and eye protection, in one easy to buy kit!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wK6mW4QIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055BCGLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Radians", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Safety Glasses"]], "price": 22.22}}
{"item_id": "B0055BQDS2", "title": "STOTT PILATES Mini Stability Ball", "description": "Stay on top of your fitness at all times with the Stott Pilates Mini Stability Ball. Achieve a full-body workout and improve your posture at home or on the go. This lightweight and portable mini ball, provides an unstable base of support, designed to activate your deepest stabilizing muscles. Comes with a straw for easy inflation or deflation. Sold individually.HOW TO INFLATE: Remove plug from ball, Insert straw, inflate to desired firmness and replace plug. (A small pump can also be used if you have one).CARE AND CLEANING: Maintain control of the ball at all times while exercising, Do not kneel or stand on the ball, Keep sharp objects away from the Mini Stability Ball, Do not use the ball if it appears worn or damaged. Store in a dry location away from direct sunlight, Never use corrosive cleaning products on ball. If necessary, clean dirty spots with a combination of tea tree oil and water on a lightly moistened cloth. A mixture of mild soap and water can be used to remove more persistent dirt. Ensure cleaner used does not make surfaces slippery.", "text": "STOTT PILATES Mini Stability Ball Stay on top of your fitness at all times with the Stott Pilates Mini Stability Ball. Achieve a full-body workout and improve your posture at home or on the go. This lightweight and portable mini ball, provides an unstable base of support, designed to activate your deepest stabilizing muscles. Comes with a straw for easy inflation or deflation. Sold individually.HOW TO INFLATE: Remove plug from ball, Insert straw, inflate to desired firmness and replace plug. (A small pump can also be used if you have one).CARE AND CLEANING: Maintain control of the ball at all times while exercising, Do not kneel or stand on the ball, Keep sharp objects away from the Mini Stability Ball, Do not use the ball if it appears worn or damaged. Store in a dry location away from direct sunlight, Never use corrosive cleaning products on ball. If necessary, clean dirty spots with a combination of tea tree oil and water on a lightly moistened cloth. A mixture of mild soap and water can be used to remove more persistent dirt. Ensure cleaner used does not make surfaces slippery.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rSxdHUl5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055BQDS2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Balls & Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0055CQ7SC", "title": "Tenn Cycho MTB Cycling Shorts Camo Med", "description": "Our Cycho MTB Shorts are built to stand up to serious impact. We've made these from super tough industrial strength Ballistic Nylon, a fabric originally developed during the Second World War, to provide additional protection for troops serving in combat areas. This means that when it comes to scuffs and scrapes, these shorts are long lasting and very tough. This fabric is also water resistant. The Cycho's have a zipped fly with metal push stud fastener, 2 x zipped pockets at the tops of the thighs for stashing valuables. We have added 2 x essential zipped leg vents on the legs to allow a through flow of cool air while riding. To make these shorts more comfortable, we've included a full length mesh lining that fully covers the inside. Padded liner shorts are not supplied with the Cychos, but you could easily team these up with our Black Padded Boxer Shorts for the ultimate package. Available in various sizes.", "text": "Tenn Cycho MTB Cycling Shorts Camo Med Our Cycho MTB Shorts are built to stand up to serious impact. We've made these from super tough industrial strength Ballistic Nylon, a fabric originally developed during the Second World War, to provide additional protection for troops serving in combat areas. This means that when it comes to scuffs and scrapes, these shorts are long lasting and very tough. This fabric is also water resistant. The Cycho's have a zipped fly with metal push stud fastener, 2 x zipped pockets at the tops of the thighs for stashing valuables. We have added 2 x essential zipped leg vents on the legs to allow a through flow of cool air while riding. To make these shorts more comfortable, we've included a full length mesh lining that fully covers the inside. Padded liner shorts are not supplied with the Cychos, but you could easily team these up with our Black Padded Boxer Shorts for the ultimate package. Available in various sizes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WsWTTb1NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055CQ7SC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0055DL5NI", "title": "Lansky LCD02 The Tactical", "description": "The Lansky Tactical sharpening rod is tough and combines the speed of tungsten carbide with a fine diamond retractable rod. Self storing field sharpener. All metal housing.", "text": "Lansky LCD02 The Tactical The Lansky Tactical sharpening rod is tough and combines the speed of tungsten carbide with a fine diamond retractable rod. Self storing field sharpener. All metal housing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hRiHjnyKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055DL5NI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lansky", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Sharpeners"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B0055E9U2K", "title": "Skywalker Trampolines 12-Feet Round Trampoline and Enclosure with Spring Pad", "description": "Bring bouncing fun to your own backyard with Skywalker Trampolines 12 ft. round trampoline with enclosure. This trampoline is a great size for all jumpers and with innovative safety features and a heavy galvanized steel frame your family will have years of safe and fun jumping. Reinforced welded T-sockets secure the enclosure frame to the trampoline frame eliminating structural twisting. Total of 6 W-shaped legs provide added bouncing stability. The Stay-Put enclosure net design uses a button-hole feature interlocking the enclosure netting directly to the jump mat away from the springs and frame creating a gap free jumping environment with no ropes to thread. The arched enclosure frame suspends the enclosure netting away from the frame and is padded with soft foam for added protection. All materials are made with quality UV resistant materials for added durability.", "text": "Skywalker Trampolines 12-Feet Round Trampoline and Enclosure with Spring Pad Bring bouncing fun to your own backyard with Skywalker Trampolines 12 ft. round trampoline with enclosure. This trampoline is a great size for all jumpers and with innovative safety features and a heavy galvanized steel frame your family will have years of safe and fun jumping. Reinforced welded T-sockets secure the enclosure frame to the trampoline frame eliminating structural twisting. Total of 6 W-shaped legs provide added bouncing stability. The Stay-Put enclosure net design uses a button-hole feature interlocking the enclosure netting directly to the jump mat away from the springs and frame creating a gap free jumping environment with no ropes to thread. The arched enclosure frame suspends the enclosure netting away from the frame and is padded with soft foam for added protection. All materials are made with quality UV resistant materials for added durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51y-zzM60SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055E9U2K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Skywalker", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 222.26}}
{"item_id": "B0055KU3KM", "title": "TT KC68050 21-Ounce Stainless Steel Sports Bottle Canteens - 2 Pack", "description": "2 pack of stainless steel, 21 oz water bottles with an elegant design, perfect for sports", "text": "TT KC68050 21-Ounce Stainless Steel Sports Bottle Canteens - 2 Pack 2 pack of stainless steel, 21 oz water bottles with an elegant design, perfect for sports", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kybL%2BVtCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055KU3KM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0055KW62U", "title": "Real Avid Mag-Rack Portable Magnetic Gun Rack", "description": "Put a gun rack where you need a gun rack. Mag–Rack is the portable gun rack that sticks to any metal surface, anywhere you need it. Bird hunters love it because it makes a handy place for the hunting party to secure their shotguns when they get back to the truck. It’s also a great way to hold additional long guns securely outside your gun safe.", "text": "Real Avid Mag-Rack Portable Magnetic Gun Rack Put a gun rack where you need a gun rack. Mag–Rack is the portable gun rack that sticks to any metal surface, anywhere you need it. Bird hunters love it because it makes a handy place for the hunting party to secure their shotguns when they get back to the truck. It’s also a great way to hold additional long guns securely outside your gun safe.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419DV2DOppL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055KW62U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 13.13}}
{"item_id": "B0055NRJLA", "title": "Pride Professional Tee System ProLength Plus Tee, 3-1/4 inch-135 Count Bag (Blue on White)", "description": "Pride Professional Tee System (PTS) is a proprietary system of color coded golf tees that allows for easy identification of tee length and appropriateness for various golf clubs. Use the 3-1/4 inch ProLength Plus Tee drivers over 360cc.", "text": "Pride Professional Tee System ProLength Plus Tee, 3-1/4 inch-135 Count Bag (Blue on White) Pride Professional Tee System (PTS) is a proprietary system of color coded golf tees that allows for easy identification of tee length and appropriateness for various golf clubs. Use the 3-1/4 inch ProLength Plus Tee drivers over 360cc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hdLW887RL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055NRJLA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pride Professional Tee System", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]], "price": 9.25}}
{"item_id": "B0055NW8FW", "title": "Pride Golf Tee - 3-1/4 inch Deluxe Tee - 400 Count", "description": "Since 1950, Pride Golf Tee has been the No.1 manufacturer of golf tees in the world. Made of 100 Percent solid hardwoord, every Pride Golf Tee is engineered and designed to provide maximum performance and durability. Pride Golf Tees - made with Pride in the USA! All Pride Golf Tees feature non-toxic, lead-free paint - safe for the environment and safe for golfers.", "text": "Pride Golf Tee - 3-1/4 inch Deluxe Tee - 400 Count Since 1950, Pride Golf Tee has been the No.1 manufacturer of golf tees in the world. Made of 100 Percent solid hardwoord, every Pride Golf Tee is engineered and designed to provide maximum performance and durability. Pride Golf Tees - made with Pride in the USA! All Pride Golf Tees feature non-toxic, lead-free paint - safe for the environment and safe for golfers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TiidkR8wL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0055NW8FW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pride Golf Tee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Tees"]], "price": 18.99}}
