{"item_id": "B00563GN4S", "title": "MTW-800 - Black Stun Gun 6.8 Million Volts - Rechargeable with Flashlight.", "description": "Here you are looking at the perfect \"You must have\" little self-defense gadget that can stop any violent or dangerous activity. This is the strongest stun gun on the market you can find today. In most cases just pulling the trigger and fire stun gun in the air is more than enough to stop the attacker as the bright electrical light followed by the terrifying noise comes out when it fires up. Well and if it is not enough to stop the attacker than a simple touch of a powerful voltage this stun gun produces will definitely do the job. As it will create electrical shock and put your enemy down and prevent him from any further aggression giving u enough time to run away or call a police. This unit also features installed flash light, no battery's needed for stun gun to operate as it charges from any wall socket. In addition to a safety switch this stun gun features a safety pin which provides an extra safety. The safety pin needs to be inserted in the safety pin receptacle to enable stun gun to spark. If you do not need this extra safety feature you may keep the safety pin plugged in all the time. Defend yourself, defend your friends. Be safe. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA. Attention: You must be 18 years of age to order stun guns or tasers. Also it is the customer's responsibility to check with local ordinances to determine legality of stun guns in the home locality.", "text": "MTW-800 - Black Stun Gun 6.8 Million Volts - Rechargeable with Flashlight. Here you are looking at the perfect \"You must have\" little self-defense gadget that can stop any violent or dangerous activity. This is the strongest stun gun on the market you can find today. In most cases just pulling the trigger and fire stun gun in the air is more than enough to stop the attacker as the bright electrical light followed by the terrifying noise comes out when it fires up. Well and if it is not enough to stop the attacker than a simple touch of a powerful voltage this stun gun produces will definitely do the job. As it will create electrical shock and put your enemy down and prevent him from any further aggression giving u enough time to run away or call a police. This unit also features installed flash light, no battery's needed for stun gun to operate as it charges from any wall socket. In addition to a safety switch this stun gun features a safety pin which provides an extra safety. The safety pin needs to be inserted in the safety pin receptacle to enable stun gun to spark. If you do not need this extra safety feature you may keep the safety pin plugged in all the time. Defend yourself, defend your friends. Be safe. Due to restrictions in some state, county and city laws we do not ship to the following locations: Hawaii, Massachusetts, Michigan, New Jersey, Illinois, New York, Rhode Island, Wisconsin, District of Columbia, Annapolis, MD, Baltimore, MD, Chicago, IL, Philadelphia, PA, Baltimore County, MD, Crawford County, IA. Attention: You must be 18 years of age to order stun guns or tasers. Also it is the customer's responsibility to check with local ordinances to determine legality of stun guns in the home locality.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312Jxtj2L5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00563GN4S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vipertek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 9.49}}
{"item_id": "B00563ITRW", "title": "Pink 6.8 Million Volt Stun Gun", "description": "7.8 Million Volt Mini Stun Gun With LED Flashlight. Packs a powerful punch in a compact size! Slips easily into a pocket or purse. Key Features: Extremely Powerful 7.8 Million Volts 2 Prongs and 2 Spikes For Double Shocking and Penetrating Power Mini Size, Conceals Easily - Only 4-1/4\" tall, 2 1/8\" wide and 1\" thick Built in Super Bright LED Flashlight Rechargeable Battery - No expensive batteries to buy FREE Holster/Case (A $10 Value) Safety switch prevents accidental discharges", "text": "Pink 6.8 Million Volt Stun Gun 7.8 Million Volt Mini Stun Gun With LED Flashlight. Packs a powerful punch in a compact size! Slips easily into a pocket or purse. Key Features: Extremely Powerful 7.8 Million Volts 2 Prongs and 2 Spikes For Double Shocking and Penetrating Power Mini Size, Conceals Easily - Only 4-1/4\" tall, 2 1/8\" wide and 1\" thick Built in Super Bright LED Flashlight Rechargeable Battery - No expensive batteries to buy FREE Holster/Case (A $10 Value) Safety switch prevents accidental discharges", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ROvnaPlXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00563ITRW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vipertek", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 11.65}}
{"item_id": "B00563J1P6", "title": "Condor MA37 Triple MP5 MP7 MP9 Magazine Pouch", "description": "This pouch was designed for use with MP5 magazine but will fit other magazines like the MP7, MP9 and extended pistol magazines like the 48 rounds KWA M9 Series and M93R.", "text": "Condor MA37 Triple MP5 MP7 MP9 Magazine Pouch This pouch was designed for use with MP5 magazine but will fit other magazines like the MP7, MP9 and extended pistol magazines like the 48 rounds KWA M9 Series and M93R.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qpJKpHI4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00563J1P6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.93}}
