{"item_id": "B0056DFZ0Q", "title": "Night Armor Tactical Penlight with Folding Knife (Black)", "description": "Night Armors Tactical Penlight and knife combo features two of our high quality products for self defense or emergency use. The Tactical Penlight is made of durable and lightweight aircraft grade aluminum and can be used as a writing instrument, flashlight, self defense tool or a glass breaker. The LED bulb lasts a lifetime and never needs replacing. Our Tactical Knife has a handle made from 6061 anodized aluminum. the blade is 440 stainless steel with a drop point and partially serrated edge and quick one handed opening feature", "text": "Night Armor Tactical Penlight with Folding Knife (Black) Night Armors Tactical Penlight and knife combo features two of our high quality products for self defense or emergency use. The Tactical Penlight is made of durable and lightweight aircraft grade aluminum and can be used as a writing instrument, flashlight, self defense tool or a glass breaker. The LED bulb lasts a lifetime and never needs replacing. Our Tactical Knife has a handle made from 6061 anodized aluminum. the blade is 440 stainless steel with a drop point and partially serrated edge and quick one handed opening feature", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417P5JCQMzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0056DFZ0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Night Armor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 14.99}}
