{"item_id": "B0056GSCBM", "title": "Gun Storage Solutions Over Under Handgun Hanger-2 Pack", "description": "Expand the capacity of your gun safe with Over-Under Handgun Hangers. This product organizes handguns under and above the shelf. Handgun Hangers are intended for guns with an overall length of 10 inches or shorter. Over-Under Handgun Hangers have chamfered ends and are vinyl coated to ensure a safe, nonabrasive mount for your gun. They are for shelves at least 11 inches deep and 5/8 to 7/8 inch in thickness. Handgun Hangers will hold handguns 22 caliber and up. Allow room for length of gun and ensure door will shut when using this product. Like all Gun Storage Solutions products, Over-Under Handgun Hangers are MADE IN THE USA! Pack of 2 hangers and that holds 4 guns.", "text": "Gun Storage Solutions Over Under Handgun Hanger-2 Pack Expand the capacity of your gun safe with Over-Under Handgun Hangers. This product organizes handguns under and above the shelf. Handgun Hangers are intended for guns with an overall length of 10 inches or shorter. Over-Under Handgun Hangers have chamfered ends and are vinyl coated to ensure a safe, nonabrasive mount for your gun. They are for shelves at least 11 inches deep and 5/8 to 7/8 inch in thickness. Handgun Hangers will hold handguns 22 caliber and up. Allow room for length of gun and ensure door will shut when using this product. Like all Gun Storage Solutions products, Over-Under Handgun Hangers are MADE IN THE USA! Pack of 2 hangers and that holds 4 guns.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/310x1BrczuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0056GSCBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gun Storage Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 19.95}}
