{"item_id": "B0056HAKD4", "title": "Zinc-Galvanized Steel Carabiner Spring Snap Link Hook - Choose from 6 Sizes 40mm to 140mm - 1-1/2\" to 5-1/2\"\"", "description": "Working load limits - 40mm: 40 lbs/20 kg, 50mm: 80 lbs/36 kg, 60mm: 140 lbs/64 kg, 80mm: 280 lbs/128 kg, 100mm: 500 lbs/227 kg, 140mm 800 lbs/363 kg. Dimensions: 40mm x 4mm inside width 12mm tapers to 5mm at eye, maximum gate opening 4mm; 50mm x 5mm inside width 15mm/6mm 5mm gate; 60mm x 6mm inside width 18mm/8mm, 7mm gate; 80mm x 8mm inside width 23mm/10mm, gate 10mm; 100m x 10m inside width 30mm/12mm, gate 12mm, 12 x 140mm inside width 45mm/20mm, gate 24mm. (25.4mm = 1 inch)", "text": "Zinc-Galvanized Steel Carabiner Spring Snap Link Hook - Choose from 6 Sizes 40mm to 140mm - 1-1/2\" to 5-1/2\"\" Working load limits - 40mm: 40 lbs/20 kg, 50mm: 80 lbs/36 kg, 60mm: 140 lbs/64 kg, 80mm: 280 lbs/128 kg, 100mm: 500 lbs/227 kg, 140mm 800 lbs/363 kg. Dimensions: 40mm x 4mm inside width 12mm tapers to 5mm at eye, maximum gate opening 4mm; 50mm x 5mm inside width 15mm/6mm 5mm gate; 60mm x 6mm inside width 18mm/8mm, 7mm gate; 80mm x 8mm inside width 23mm/10mm, gate 10mm; 100m x 10m inside width 30mm/12mm, gate 12mm, 12 x 140mm inside width 45mm/20mm, gate 24mm. (25.4mm = 1 inch)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41agJSWkORL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0056HAKD4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Nonlocking"]]}}
