{"item_id": "B0057GTZHG", "title": "Lightspeed Quick Draw Sun Shelter", "description": "The Lightspeed Quick Draw Sun Shelter is perfect for the beach, backyard, or any other place you need get some shade from the sun or protection from the elements. With the Lightspeed integrated pole system, the poles are built in to the tent, eliminating the difficulty associated with traditional separate pole tents. The revolutionary drawstring hub system allows the user to set up the tent quickly and easily. Lightweight and compact, it's easy to take anywhere!", "text": "Lightspeed Quick Draw Sun Shelter The Lightspeed Quick Draw Sun Shelter is perfect for the beach, backyard, or any other place you need get some shade from the sun or protection from the elements. With the Lightspeed integrated pole system, the poles are built in to the tent, eliminating the difficulty associated with traditional separate pole tents. The revolutionary drawstring hub system allows the user to set up the tent quickly and easily. Lightweight and compact, it's easy to take anywhere!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IMWGCsVaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057GTZHG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Shelters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0057IL8QK", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus PT709 + PT740 Grip Extension", "description": "The PG-709 is an extension for the Taurus Slim PT709 (9mm) and the PT740 (40S&W;). This extension replaces the magazine floor plate providing extra gripping surface for better control and comfort without altering the capacity of the factory magazine.", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Taurus PT709 + PT740 Grip Extension The PG-709 is an extension for the Taurus Slim PT709 (9mm) and the PT740 (40S&W;). This extension replaces the magazine floor plate providing extra gripping surface for better control and comfort without altering the capacity of the factory magazine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ePdrqJIiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057IL8QK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.76}}
{"item_id": "B0057IL8YW", "title": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Springfield Armory XDM Compact Series Grip Extension", "description": "Replaces the magazine floor plate adding grip length. Does not alter the capacity of the magazine. Fits 9mm,and 40SW only. For use on XDM models only. Will not fit standard XD frames", "text": "Pearce Grips Gun Fits Springfield Armory XDM Compact Series Grip Extension Replaces the magazine floor plate adding grip length. Does not alter the capacity of the magazine. Fits 9mm,and 40SW only. For use on XDM models only. Will not fit standard XD frames", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IneA2spTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057IL8YW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pearce Grips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 8.21}}
