{"item_id": "B0057IO0QA", "title": "Tango Down Vickers Tactical Slide Stop For Glock", "description": "Vickers Tactical perfects the Glock yet again. Having difficulty executing fast reloads with the stock slide stop? Extended slide stops locking the slide back with rounds still in the gun due to your shooting grip? Try the VTSS and never look back. Extensive prototyping and testing created the optimum slide stop shape enabling positive slide lock and release, especially with gloves. Precision stamped and formed from 4130 chrome moly steel with durable hard coat, the VTSS will outlive your Glock. We recommend professional gunsmith installation only.", "text": "Tango Down Vickers Tactical Slide Stop For Glock Vickers Tactical perfects the Glock yet again. Having difficulty executing fast reloads with the stock slide stop? Extended slide stops locking the slide back with rounds still in the gun due to your shooting grip? Try the VTSS and never look back. Extensive prototyping and testing created the optimum slide stop shape enabling positive slide lock and release, especially with gloves. Precision stamped and formed from 4130 chrome moly steel with durable hard coat, the VTSS will outlive your Glock. We recommend professional gunsmith installation only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312vyiCTkoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057IO0QA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TangoDown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 19.94}}
{"item_id": "B0057IOBFU", "title": "DeSantis Clip Grip for S&W J-Frame", "description": "The DeSantis Clip Grip #T07 has finally arrived! The Clip Grip is designed to fit round butt “J” frame revolvers only. It’s built of a glass reinforced engineering grade polymer that’s almost as strong as aluminum. The sharply checkered panels allow for continuous gun control while shooting. The T07 allows the operator to tuck the revolver inside a boot or waistband when it’s not feasible to use a holster. The Clip Grip can still be used with most holsters.", "text": "DeSantis Clip Grip for S&W J-Frame The DeSantis Clip Grip #T07 has finally arrived! The Clip Grip is designed to fit round butt “J” frame revolvers only. It’s built of a glass reinforced engineering grade polymer that’s almost as strong as aluminum. The sharply checkered panels allow for continuous gun control while shooting. The T07 allows the operator to tuck the revolver inside a boot or waistband when it’s not feasible to use a holster. The Clip Grip can still be used with most holsters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i7V6DqMFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057IOBFU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 24.89}}
{"item_id": "B0057IP1PO", "title": "Hogue Handall Grip Sleeve Hybrid, S&W M&P9, Black", "description": "Hugs the contours of your gun better than standard tube style sleeves. Features proportioned finger grooves, cobblestone texture, non-slip surface and ambidextrous palm swells. Installs with no lubrication. Specifications: - Fits: Smith & Wesson M&P; 9mm, 357 Sig, and 40 Smith & Wesson Full Size - Color Black", "text": "Hogue Handall Grip Sleeve Hybrid, S&W M&P9, Black Hugs the contours of your gun better than standard tube style sleeves. Features proportioned finger grooves, cobblestone texture, non-slip surface and ambidextrous palm swells. Installs with no lubrication. Specifications: - Fits: Smith & Wesson M&P; 9mm, 357 Sig, and 40 Smith & Wesson Full Size - Color Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417T0PCJKHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057IP1PO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 6.99}}
