{"item_id": "B0057JAEZU", "title": "Ab Roller Evolution", "description": "Perform abdominal crunches at any level with the Ab Roller Evolution. You can flip this ab workout equipment to do a total body workout. Add weight to this total body workout machine for extra resistance. This abdominal exercise machine offers support to your neck, head, and upper body. Do all your exercises from the comfort of your home gym with this workout equipment.", "text": "Ab Roller Evolution Perform abdominal crunches at any level with the Ab Roller Evolution. You can flip this ab workout equipment to do a total body workout. Add weight to this total body workout machine for extra resistance. This abdominal exercise machine offers support to your neck, head, and upper body. Do all your exercises from the comfort of your home gym with this workout equipment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513kHQng0JL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057JAEZU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Core & Abdominal Trainers"]], "price": 34.79}}
