{"item_id": "B0057LYJ86", "title": "Elixir Golf Naska UV Protection Arm Cooler Sleeve-1 Pair", "description": "Arm Cooler is the perfect accessory for summer training, racing and recovery. Its compression fit reduces damaging muscle vibrations, minimizing muscle fatigue and soreness. It makes you feel cool in hot weather when you do summer activities. Try this when you drive, it helps to protect your skin and feel cooler than bear skin. It is a special moisture-radiating material that actually offers cooling effect. 1. Unisex and One size-Extremely Elastic Material2. Ultimate UV Protection: UV-R, UV-A, UV-B BLOCK 99.8-Percent. 3. Protect your arms from Aging, Sun-burn more than Arm-Cooling 4. High Performance Fabric: Fast Sweat Kick-away and Fast Dry. 5. Special moisture-radiating material 6. Three-Dimensional (3D) Weaving Design to make more comfortable than others 7. Design without sewing line 8. Non Slip Elastic Bands on Top and Bottom 9. for Cycling, Fishing, Golf, Drive, Jogging, Claiming and all other outside activities 10. Suitable for Indoor Activites too, even your workplaces (You arms won't sticky on your desk)", "text": "Elixir Golf Naska UV Protection Arm Cooler Sleeve-1 Pair Arm Cooler is the perfect accessory for summer training, racing and recovery. Its compression fit reduces damaging muscle vibrations, minimizing muscle fatigue and soreness. It makes you feel cool in hot weather when you do summer activities. Try this when you drive, it helps to protect your skin and feel cooler than bear skin. It is a special moisture-radiating material that actually offers cooling effect. 1. Unisex and One size-Extremely Elastic Material2. Ultimate UV Protection: UV-R, UV-A, UV-B BLOCK 99.8-Percent. 3. Protect your arms from Aging, Sun-burn more than Arm-Cooling 4. High Performance Fabric: Fast Sweat Kick-away and Fast Dry. 5. Special moisture-radiating material 6. Three-Dimensional (3D) Weaving Design to make more comfortable than others 7. Design without sewing line 8. Non Slip Elastic Bands on Top and Bottom 9. for Cycling, Fishing, Golf, Drive, Jogging, Claiming and all other outside activities 10. Suitable for Indoor Activites too, even your workplaces (You arms won't sticky on your desk)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31CTRrGJUXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057LYJ86.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Armwarmers"]], "price": 16.81}}
{"item_id": "B0057R1Y7O", "title": "SKS Rifle Original 15\" Spike Military Bayonet Including Mounting Hardware- Brand New Part", "description": "Mounting Instructions : Make sure the rifle is unloaded and the receiver is clear - Slide the bayonet handle and the bayonet spring over the tang of the spike bayonet. Push downward on the handle until the slot for attaching the bayonet screw is exposed. Hold the bayonet in this position with the muzzle ring facing the muzzle of the rifle and insert the bayonet screw pin into its proper slot in the bayonet lug. Tighten the bayonet screw pin with a flathead screwdriver", "text": "SKS Rifle Original 15\" Spike Military Bayonet Including Mounting Hardware- Brand New Part Mounting Instructions : Make sure the rifle is unloaded and the receiver is clear - Slide the bayonet handle and the bayonet spring over the tang of the spike bayonet. Push downward on the handle until the slot for attaching the bayonet screw is exposed. Hold the bayonet in this position with the muzzle ring facing the muzzle of the rifle and insert the bayonet screw pin into its proper slot in the bayonet lug. Tighten the bayonet screw pin with a flathead screwdriver", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319cmG5yNrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057R1Y7O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 14.54}}
{"item_id": "B0057R8SSM", "title": "Kershaw 1605CKTST Black Clash Folding Serrated SpeedSafe Knife", "description": "A drop-point blade with just a little recurve enables this multipurpose knife to excel at a wide variety of tasks, from slicing to rope cutting. It features a blade of 8CR13MoV stainless steel, which Kershaw heat-treats to ensure its strength, hardness, and ability to hold a keen edge. The Black Clash (#1605CKTST) is SpeedSafe equipped and priced to be an excellent value. Handsome black-oxide blade coating and lightweight, black scales make it rock extra hard. Blade is partially serrated (two step serration). Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1605CKTST Black Clash Folding Serrated SpeedSafe Knife A drop-point blade with just a little recurve enables this multipurpose knife to excel at a wide variety of tasks, from slicing to rope cutting. It features a blade of 8CR13MoV stainless steel, which Kershaw heat-treats to ensure its strength, hardness, and ability to hold a keen edge. The Black Clash (#1605CKTST) is SpeedSafe equipped and priced to be an excellent value. Handsome black-oxide blade coating and lightweight, black scales make it rock extra hard. Blade is partially serrated (two step serration). Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LF7IUJdFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057R8SSM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B0057XA2KS", "title": "Hot Shot Men's The Sentry Mittens", "description": "Wool/Acrylic, 5-Gauge rag wool fingerless glove with pop-top mitten, lined with 40 grams of 3M Thinsulate Insulation and tricot and a split leather palm patch.", "text": "Hot Shot Men's The Sentry Mittens Wool/Acrylic, 5-Gauge rag wool fingerless glove with pop-top mitten, lined with 40 grams of 3M Thinsulate Insulation and tricot and a split leather palm patch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510YMgisf6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057XA2KS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hot Shot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Gloves, Mittens & Liners", "Mittens"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0057XL31A", "title": "Ontario 9468BM Ranger RD Tanto Knife (Black)", "description": "The Ontario Ranger RD Tanto is designed and manufactured to be a tough and reliable knife. You will be amazed at the outstanding durability, quality, and performance of this Ranger knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Non-reflective black coated finish. Blade is hardened to 53-55 HRC. Green Micarta handle scales. Non-slip grip that is important when cleaning game or working around camp. Includes MOLLE compatible nylon and Kydex sheath.", "text": "Ontario 9468BM Ranger RD Tanto Knife (Black) The Ontario Ranger RD Tanto is designed and manufactured to be a tough and reliable knife. You will be amazed at the outstanding durability, quality, and performance of this Ranger knife. Situated in New York State's scenic Southern Tier, Ontario Knife Company produces one of the most comprehensive, wide-ranging product lines in the cutlery industry today. While being a worldwide supplier, the Ontario Knife Company is also a major supplier to the U.S. Government and its military. Ontario has built its reputation on a heritage of uncompromising craftsmanship, quality materials and components, and a steadfast commitment to its workforce. Non-reflective black coated finish. Blade is hardened to 53-55 HRC. Green Micarta handle scales. Non-slip grip that is important when cleaning game or working around camp. Includes MOLLE compatible nylon and Kydex sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318k3LRXQ0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057XL31A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 83.94}}
{"item_id": "B0057Y7SW2", "title": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Travis Haley-Adaptive Carbine Training DVD", "description": "Whether Military, Law Enforcement, responsible armed citizen or a competitor, this Adaptive Carbine training video is the first step in increasing a shooter's survivability. The basis comes from the history and evolution of weapons manipulation in disruptive environments and the adaptation of disruptive technologies. Any person that takes their shooting lifestyle seriously has to understand these disruptions and needs to keep an open mind in order to prevent an absolute mindset and/or negative training inertias. Former Special Operations Veteran Travis Haley guides the beginner or advanced shooter on how to build a shooting platform - not only in the physical sense, but more importantly in the mental sense. Travis breaks down the basic fundamentals and incorporates mindset methodologies that allow you the opportunity to justify them for your shooting lifestyle.", "text": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Travis Haley-Adaptive Carbine Training DVD Whether Military, Law Enforcement, responsible armed citizen or a competitor, this Adaptive Carbine training video is the first step in increasing a shooter's survivability. The basis comes from the history and evolution of weapons manipulation in disruptive environments and the adaptation of disruptive technologies. Any person that takes their shooting lifestyle seriously has to understand these disruptions and needs to keep an open mind in order to prevent an absolute mindset and/or negative training inertias. Former Special Operations Veteran Travis Haley guides the beginner or advanced shooter on how to build a shooting platform - not only in the physical sense, but more importantly in the mental sense. Travis breaks down the basic fundamentals and incorporates mindset methodologies that allow you the opportunity to justify them for your shooting lifestyle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ziN9hvLOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057Y7SW2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Panteao Productions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 38.99}}
{"item_id": "B0057YK9GY", "title": "Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife - Fire Starter-Camo Coated", "description": "Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife with fire steel and sharpener! A Knife PLUS for any hunter and outdoorsman! 440 stainless steel camo-coated skinning/guthook blade; Hard nylon sheath with belt loop has an integrated fire starter and diamond honing file; Nylon-lined finger loop design for sure control; Bottle opener built in, too; 2\"l. blade, 5 1/2\"l. overall. Weighs 5 ozs.; Uniquely effective and a bargain! Order Quick! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife", "text": "Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife - Fire Starter-Camo Coated Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife with fire steel and sharpener! A Knife PLUS for any hunter and outdoorsman! 440 stainless steel camo-coated skinning/guthook blade; Hard nylon sheath with belt loop has an integrated fire starter and diamond honing file; Nylon-lined finger loop design for sure control; Bottle opener built in, too; 2\"l. blade, 5 1/2\"l. overall. Weighs 5 ozs.; Uniquely effective and a bargain! Order Quick! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Elk Ridge Infinity Field Skinner Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vpaBhknTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0057YK9GY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elk Ridge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 10.89}}
