{"item_id": "B0058DECVC", "title": "PGM3660 3' x 5' Emerald Par Golf Mat", "description": "High quality, durable nylon turf with a commercial grade with foam backing. The thicker backing helps to minimize club shock when you drive your club into the mat. This is a great golf mat for family use and can be used on any surface, including concrete patios and wood decks.", "text": "PGM3660 3' x 5' Emerald Par Golf Mat High quality, durable nylon turf with a commercial grade with foam backing. The thicker backing helps to minimize club shock when you drive your club into the mat. This is a great golf mat for family use and can be used on any surface, including concrete patios and wood decks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417DLS6U8yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DECVC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Hitting Mats"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B0058DHWQE", "title": "Stack-On PS-20-B Biometric, Large Personal Safe w/Biometric Lock, Black", "description": "", "text": "Stack-On PS-20-B Biometric, Large Personal Safe w/Biometric Lock, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Zi8GRDnmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DHWQE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 168.9}}
{"item_id": "B0058DHX5Y", "title": "Stack-On Steel Pistol Box with removable shelf, Black", "description": "Stack-On PB-1102 Steel Pistol Box with removable shelf is perfect for holding pistols, ammo, supplies and valuables. This pistol box has a locking mechanism that passes through a steel door and is secured behind the steel door frame for added security. Each PB-1102 unit is fully lockable with key coded, double – bitted lock. It has pre-drilled mounting holes allow for easy attachment to the floor, ceiling, or wall and fastening hardware is included. This cabinet has a black, epoxy paint finish with silver accents.", "text": "Stack-On Steel Pistol Box with removable shelf, Black Stack-On PB-1102 Steel Pistol Box with removable shelf is perfect for holding pistols, ammo, supplies and valuables. This pistol box has a locking mechanism that passes through a steel door and is secured behind the steel door frame for added security. Each PB-1102 unit is fully lockable with key coded, double – bitted lock. It has pre-drilled mounting holes allow for easy attachment to the floor, ceiling, or wall and fastening hardware is included. This cabinet has a black, epoxy paint finish with silver accents.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O2tOEJUfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DHX5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 46.77}}
{"item_id": "B0058DHXAO", "title": "Stack-On PC-95K Portable Case with Key Lock, Black", "description": "Stack-On PC-95K All Steel Portable Case with Key Lock is a portable safe designed to secure a wallet, credit cards, cell phone or handgun for concealed-weapon permit holders during transit. This slim-line designed steel case slips into a briefcase, under a car seat or in your luggage for added security and peace of mind. This PC-95K model meets TSA airline firearm guidelines. The foam interior protects the contents during transit. This model also includes a 1,500 pound test steel cable which keeps the case secure when the cable is looped around any fixed object and through the cable slot in the body of the case. Locking the case keeps the cable in place and the cable is included. This case is secured with a key coded locking system.", "text": "Stack-On PC-95K Portable Case with Key Lock, Black Stack-On PC-95K All Steel Portable Case with Key Lock is a portable safe designed to secure a wallet, credit cards, cell phone or handgun for concealed-weapon permit holders during transit. This slim-line designed steel case slips into a briefcase, under a car seat or in your luggage for added security and peace of mind. This PC-95K model meets TSA airline firearm guidelines. The foam interior protects the contents during transit. This model also includes a 1,500 pound test steel cable which keeps the case secure when the cable is looped around any fixed object and through the cable slot in the body of the case. Locking the case keeps the cable in place and the cable is included. This case is secured with a key coded locking system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nXEekpv6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DHXAO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 24.33}}
{"item_id": "B0058DHXBS", "title": "Stack-On Portable Case With Electronic Lock", "description": "The Stack-On® portable case with electronic lock allows you to travel with a little extra security. The electronic lock lets you program a 3- to 8-digit combination, while the case's slim design offers easy storage in a briefcase, bag or under most car/truck seats. The foam-padded bottom promises extra protection.", "text": "Stack-On Portable Case With Electronic Lock The Stack-On® portable case with electronic lock allows you to travel with a little extra security. The electronic lock lets you program a 3- to 8-digit combination, while the case's slim design offers easy storage in a briefcase, bag or under most car/truck seats. The foam-padded bottom promises extra protection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41F69Owb4AL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DHXBS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "STACK-ON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 28.79}}
{"item_id": "B0058DHZIO", "title": "Stack-On SS-22-MB-C 22 Gun Fully Convertible Security Safe with Combination Lock, Matte Black", "description": "Stack-On's Non – Fire SS-22-MB-C 22-Gun Fully Convertible Security Safe with Combination Lock is tested and listed as California Department of Justice firearms safety devices that meets the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued. This safe has 2-way locking– 1” steel live action locking bolts –up to 6 locking points and has a fully carpeted interior. This safe has large, steel locking bolts, concealed hinges and hinge side steel dead bolts that provide added security. The concealed hinges have been engineered to allow for greater access to the safe’s contents. Stack-On's safes have patented molded barrel rests that will not deteriorate or compress over time. The contour of the barrel rest will accommodate rifles as well as side-by-side shotguns. Exterior Dimensions: 55\" Height x 26-13/16\" Width x 17-5/8\" Depth", "text": "Stack-On SS-22-MB-C 22 Gun Fully Convertible Security Safe with Combination Lock, Matte Black Stack-On's Non – Fire SS-22-MB-C 22-Gun Fully Convertible Security Safe with Combination Lock is tested and listed as California Department of Justice firearms safety devices that meets the requirements of California Penal Code Section 12088 and the regulations issued. This safe has 2-way locking– 1” steel live action locking bolts –up to 6 locking points and has a fully carpeted interior. This safe has large, steel locking bolts, concealed hinges and hinge side steel dead bolts that provide added security. The concealed hinges have been engineered to allow for greater access to the safe’s contents. Stack-On's safes have patented molded barrel rests that will not deteriorate or compress over time. The contour of the barrel rest will accommodate rifles as well as side-by-side shotguns. Exterior Dimensions: 55\" Height x 26-13/16\" Width x 17-5/8\" Depth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FK17x0ZDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058DHZIO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 405.0}}
