{"item_id": "B0058EMFJW", "title": "Under Armour Men's UA Tactical Arctic Beanie", "description": "WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin!. Form-fitting ColdGear® microfleece beanie traps heat to keep you warm in the cold. Interior HeatGear® mesh lining wicks sweat away to keep your head dry and comfortable. Tonal UA embroidered cap logo adds subtle style. Polyester. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's UA Tactical Arctic Beanie WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin!. Form-fitting ColdGear® microfleece beanie traps heat to keep you warm in the cold. Interior HeatGear® mesh lining wicks sweat away to keep your head dry and comfortable. Tonal UA embroidered cap logo adds subtle style. Polyester. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412n-DjDDHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058EMFJW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B0058EO7ZC", "title": "Under Armour Men's Tactical Stealth Beanie", "description": "WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin!. ColdGear® knit hat delivers warmth and comfort so you can stay focused, even in extreme temperatures. Interior HeatGear® mesh lining wicks sweat away to keep your head dry and comfortable. Tonal UA embroidered cap logo adds subtle style. 100% Polyester. Imported.", "text": "Under Armour Men's Tactical Stealth Beanie WARNING! This product will melt when exposed to extreme heat or open flames, posing a risk of serious injury where melted product comes into contact with skin!. ColdGear® knit hat delivers warmth and comfort so you can stay focused, even in extreme temperatures. Interior HeatGear® mesh lining wicks sweat away to keep your head dry and comfortable. Tonal UA embroidered cap logo adds subtle style. 100% Polyester. Imported.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BJNK-nCXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058EO7ZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Under Armour", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B0058EOAUE", "title": "Defense Technology 56895 MK-9 Stream, 1.3% Red Band/1.3% Blue Band Pepper Spray", "description": "This MK-9, 13 ounce 1.3% \"Red Band\" Formula pistol grip stream pepper spray is nitrogen propelled and has a range of 18 - 20 feet and 14 one second bursts. 1.3% will be replacing the current 5.5% Pepper Mace formulation. 1.3% Major Capsaicinoid represents a nonflammable EDW safe formulation which is significantly more intense than previous formulations. High quality is ensured through an ISO rated manufacturing facility. Independent laboratories confirm these products are consistently made to exacting standards. Each unit has a steel \"pull-ring\" type safety pin engaging the actuator button at the top of the carry handle. The actuator button itself has a breakfree locking tab preventing accidental discharge until the first deployment. The absence of this break-free tab also indicates that the unit has been actuated at least once. This formulation has been tested and is non-flammable and Electronic Discharge Weapon (EDW) safe. Total dimensions 9.15 in H x 2.60 in Dia.With our complete line of aerosols, we are able to offer an OC level of intensity ranging from .2% Major Capsaicinoids to 1.3% MC. The variations in the MC% means that you can now select the level of intensity of OC for the environment required. We use independent laboratory testing to ensure consistent quality of each product.", "text": "Defense Technology 56895 MK-9 Stream, 1.3% Red Band/1.3% Blue Band Pepper Spray This MK-9, 13 ounce 1.3% \"Red Band\" Formula pistol grip stream pepper spray is nitrogen propelled and has a range of 18 - 20 feet and 14 one second bursts. 1.3% will be replacing the current 5.5% Pepper Mace formulation. 1.3% Major Capsaicinoid represents a nonflammable EDW safe formulation which is significantly more intense than previous formulations. High quality is ensured through an ISO rated manufacturing facility. Independent laboratories confirm these products are consistently made to exacting standards. Each unit has a steel \"pull-ring\" type safety pin engaging the actuator button at the top of the carry handle. The actuator button itself has a breakfree locking tab preventing accidental discharge until the first deployment. The absence of this break-free tab also indicates that the unit has been actuated at least once. This formulation has been tested and is non-flammable and Electronic Discharge Weapon (EDW) safe. Total dimensions 9.15 in H x 2.60 in Dia.With our complete line of aerosols, we are able to offer an OC level of intensity ranging from .2% Major Capsaicinoids to 1.3% MC. The variations in the MC% means that you can now select the level of intensity of OC for the environment required. We use independent laboratory testing to ensure consistent quality of each product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31og4begEeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058EOAUE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 49.61}}
{"item_id": "B0058IGSM8", "title": "King Arms Airsoft Green Gas Dual Pack", "description": "User Guide. Invert can and make sure charging nozzle is perpendicular to the valve stem. Press nozzle into magazine for 2-3 seconds. Repeat as necessary until magazine is full. Valve misalignment will cause gas leak when charging and result in an inadequate charge. DO NOT PUNCTURE. DO NOT LEAVE CANISTER IN TRUNK OR VEHICLE. DO NOT EXPOSE TO HEAT, SPARKS AND OPEN FLAME. DO NOT LEAVE IN DIRECT SUNLIGHT. DO NOT SOTRE AT TEMPERATURES ABOVE 120F (49C).", "text": "King Arms Airsoft Green Gas Dual Pack User Guide. Invert can and make sure charging nozzle is perpendicular to the valve stem. Press nozzle into magazine for 2-3 seconds. Repeat as necessary until magazine is full. Valve misalignment will cause gas leak when charging and result in an inadequate charge. DO NOT PUNCTURE. DO NOT LEAVE CANISTER IN TRUNK OR VEHICLE. DO NOT EXPOSE TO HEAT, SPARKS AND OPEN FLAME. DO NOT LEAVE IN DIRECT SUNLIGHT. DO NOT SOTRE AT TEMPERATURES ABOVE 120F (49C).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qko6KX3-L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058IGSM8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "King Arms", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft"]], "price": 22.49}}
