{"item_id": "B0058KDH98", "title": "OEM Black Color 12 Pack Rubber Snap On Protective Hand Guard Tactical Weaver Picatinny 7/8\" Rail Rifle Shotgun Paintball Airsoft Rail Covers", "description": "Set Of 12 Black Rubber Rail Covers - Approximately 2\" Length (each cover) Combat Quality High Tech Design For A Tactical Solution In The Toughest Environments Designed For Use With 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Rails & Handguards For Maximum Protection Of The Rails While Safeguarding Hands Perfect Tight Snap-On Fit On Your Rails To Cover Up Any Exposed Rail Area Convenient Sized Sections So You Can Cover As Little Or As Much Rail As Needed", "text": "OEM Black Color 12 Pack Rubber Snap On Protective Hand Guard Tactical Weaver Picatinny 7/8\" Rail Rifle Shotgun Paintball Airsoft Rail Covers Set Of 12 Black Rubber Rail Covers - Approximately 2\" Length (each cover) Combat Quality High Tech Design For A Tactical Solution In The Toughest Environments Designed For Use With 7/8\" Weaver-Picatinny Rails & Handguards For Maximum Protection Of The Rails While Safeguarding Hands Perfect Tight Snap-On Fit On Your Rails To Cover Up Any Exposed Rail Area Convenient Sized Sections So You Can Cover As Little Or As Much Rail As Needed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Y2CILFgPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058KDH98.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 5.47}}
{"item_id": "B0058KEY3G", "title": "Discraft Deluxe Disc Golf Set (4 Disc and Bag)", "description": "Best seller The Surge is perfect for long bombs, yet still highly controllable for virtually all skill levels. Everyone will benefit from the extra glide the Surge delivers in calm to moderate wind conditions. Distance driver of choice for 2007 World Champion Nate Doss.", "text": "Discraft Deluxe Disc Golf Set (4 Disc and Bag) Best seller The Surge is perfect for long bombs, yet still highly controllable for virtually all skill levels. Everyone will benefit from the extra glide the Surge delivers in calm to moderate wind conditions. Distance driver of choice for 2007 World Champion Nate Doss.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xsXWt9CbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058KEY3G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Discraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Discs", "Drivers"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B0058O9PHW", "title": "Waterproof Case for Phones, Digital Camera, GPS & Other Small Devices - IPX8 Certified to 100 Feet", "description": "This waterproof case is IPX8 Certified to 100 feet (30m). With 2 secure snaps at the top, your device will be secure all day whether you are swimming, relaxing on the beach, boating, or drinking near water. The case has 2 clear sides so you can still use the picture taking & video recording capabilities of your phone without worrying about potential damage. A neck lanyard is included. Sealed Retail Packaging so it's perfect for a gift! Many phones (with standard cases) will fit into the waterproof case so there is no need to be constantly removing your stylish case when using the waterproof case!", "text": "Waterproof Case for Phones, Digital Camera, GPS & Other Small Devices - IPX8 Certified to 100 Feet This waterproof case is IPX8 Certified to 100 feet (30m). With 2 secure snaps at the top, your device will be secure all day whether you are swimming, relaxing on the beach, boating, or drinking near water. The case has 2 clear sides so you can still use the picture taking & video recording capabilities of your phone without worrying about potential damage. A neck lanyard is included. Sealed Retail Packaging so it's perfect for a gift! Many phones (with standard cases) will fit into the waterproof case so there is no need to be constantly removing your stylish case when using the waterproof case!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41izi-5-Z-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058O9PHW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "General", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Dry Bags"]], "price": 2.86}}
{"item_id": "B0058P6YKC", "title": "Discraft 175 gram Super Color Ultra-Star Disc", "description": "Aggressive into the wind, Hornet's place in the hive is between Wasp and Drone. Not crazy overstable, but no sissy either. You'll be surprised by the amount of glide Hornet generates. Originally the 2010 Ace Race prototype.", "text": "Discraft 175 gram Super Color Ultra-Star Disc Aggressive into the wind, Hornet's place in the hive is between Wasp and Drone. Not crazy overstable, but no sissy either. You'll be surprised by the amount of glide Hornet generates. Originally the 2010 Ace Race prototype.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51lyoH5oKKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058P6YKC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Discraft", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Discs", "Drivers"]], "price": 12.27}}
