{"item_id": "B0058UPE44", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Rifle Gun Weapon Case 15-9648 Black (Lockable/Locking)", "description": "The Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case 15-9648 carries 2 42\" rifles, 2 pistols, 6 rifle magazines, and 8 pistol magazines! Rugged ballistic pack cloth construction, heavy duty locking zipper pulls with padlocks for security, wrap and carry handles, and closed cell foam padding. 2\" padded interior perimeter lip with padded divider to keep your weapons safe. Detachable padded, adjustable shoulder strap with outside universal attachment straps. The Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case fits any weapons not over 42\" in length. Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case 15-9648 Features: Outside pockets hold 6 rifle magazines, 8 pistol magazines and 2 pistols! Designed for carrying two 42\" rifles and two hand guns Pistol and mag pouches have locking zipper pulls Padlocks included Holds six 30 round rifle mags Holds eight pistol mags Hook-n-loop flap covers hold pistol and rifle mags securely Adjustable, removable padded shoulder strap Padded weapons pockets for protection Added outside cinch straps Universal webbing Zipper protective flap Hook-n-loop I.D. patch", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Rifle Gun Weapon Case 15-9648 Black (Lockable/Locking) The Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case 15-9648 carries 2 42\" rifles, 2 pistols, 6 rifle magazines, and 8 pistol magazines! Rugged ballistic pack cloth construction, heavy duty locking zipper pulls with padlocks for security, wrap and carry handles, and closed cell foam padding. 2\" padded interior perimeter lip with padded divider to keep your weapons safe. Detachable padded, adjustable shoulder strap with outside universal attachment straps. The Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case fits any weapons not over 42\" in length. Voodoo Tactical 42\" Deluxe Padded Weapons Case 15-9648 Features: Outside pockets hold 6 rifle magazines, 8 pistol magazines and 2 pistols! Designed for carrying two 42\" rifles and two hand guns Pistol and mag pouches have locking zipper pulls Padlocks included Holds six 30 round rifle mags Holds eight pistol mags Hook-n-loop flap covers hold pistol and rifle mags securely Adjustable, removable padded shoulder strap Padded weapons pockets for protection Added outside cinch straps Universal webbing Zipper protective flap Hook-n-loop I.D. patch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u-ygPQ9hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0058UPE44.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 124.95}}
