{"item_id": "B00598KU7Q", "title": "Rothco 3 Piece 1 Quart Canteen Kit With Cover & Aluminum Cup", "description": "Rothco's Canteen Kit includes a plastic 1 quart canteen with cover and aluminum cup with wing handle. This canteen set is ideal for any outdoor camping or survival situation.", "text": "Rothco 3 Piece 1 Quart Canteen Kit With Cover & Aluminum Cup Rothco's Canteen Kit includes a plastic 1 quart canteen with cover and aluminum cup with wing handle. This canteen set is ideal for any outdoor camping or survival situation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41np70MhN6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00598KU7Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Canteens"]], "price": 10.99}}
