{"item_id": "B005A327JE", "title": "Rack'Em 3 Pistol Holster In-Safe Handgun Rack", "description": "Pistol holder for gun cabinets and narrow door safes. Strong steel construction for years of service. Mounting screws included. Dimensions-5\"H x 5.5\"W x 5\" D", "text": "Rack'Em 3 Pistol Holster In-Safe Handgun Rack Pistol holder for gun cabinets and narrow door safes. Strong steel construction for years of service. Mounting screws included. Dimensions-5\"H x 5.5\"W x 5\" D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513SCLuO05L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005A327JE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rack&#39;em", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 38.5}}
{"item_id": "B005A32BK4", "title": "Rack'Em Mount Anywhere Pistol Rack", "description": "Rack mounts on any clean, flat surface. Has foam tape for easy mounting or can be mounted with screws. Holds pistols upright with scopes, or upside down. Holds most revolvers and semi-automatics-from small single stack pocket pistols, PPKs, 1911s, Barettas, Glocks to large frame revolvers including the 500 S&W; Magnum. Strong steel construction for years of service. Dimensions-3\"H x 4\"W x 3\" D", "text": "Rack'Em Mount Anywhere Pistol Rack Rack mounts on any clean, flat surface. Has foam tape for easy mounting or can be mounted with screws. Holds pistols upright with scopes, or upside down. Holds most revolvers and semi-automatics-from small single stack pocket pistols, PPKs, 1911s, Barettas, Glocks to large frame revolvers including the 500 S&W; Magnum. Strong steel construction for years of service. Dimensions-3\"H x 4\"W x 3\" D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J2c%2BWbbBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005A32BK4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rack&#39;em", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B005A32D70", "title": "Rack'Em 6156 Mount Anywhere Shotgun or Rifle Rack", "description": "This Rack’Em™ Mount Anywhere Vertical Rifle Rack mounts with screws to any wall, UTV, hunting blinds, etc. Strong steel wire construction has a soft, rubbery, hydrophobic coating – similar to dishwasher racks – that does not collect moisture and keeps your firearms pristine. Rack’Em™ racks are unaffected by cleaning solvents, oils or greases. Holds all rifles and shotguns. INCLUDES: Mounting screws. DIMENSIONS – 6.75”L x 3”W (Height adjustable to fit gun). ALWAYS USE A TRIGGER LOCK.", "text": "Rack'Em 6156 Mount Anywhere Shotgun or Rifle Rack This Rack’Em™ Mount Anywhere Vertical Rifle Rack mounts with screws to any wall, UTV, hunting blinds, etc. Strong steel wire construction has a soft, rubbery, hydrophobic coating – similar to dishwasher racks – that does not collect moisture and keeps your firearms pristine. Rack’Em™ racks are unaffected by cleaning solvents, oils or greases. Holds all rifles and shotguns. INCLUDES: Mounting screws. DIMENSIONS – 6.75”L x 3”W (Height adjustable to fit gun). ALWAYS USE A TRIGGER LOCK.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21UUrc2wmJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005A32D70.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rack&#39;em", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Racks"]], "price": 27.72}}
{"item_id": "B005A3FWNW", "title": "Primos Alpha Dogg Electronic Predator Call", "description": "The Primos Alpha Dogg electronic predator call leads the pack right to you with rotating directional speakers for 180-degree coverage or crisp concentrated directional calling. The ergonomic remote has a full color display, and simple to use layout. This call is equipped with 64 distinct calls-_and you can add and remove your own calls as well.Take the guesswork out of predator calling. The Alpha Dogg doesn't give you just individual sounds to choose from, it has 6 complete expert hunt sequences and 75 different sounds. These are proven hunt sets that get dogs in. The caller is powered by dual 25 watt, distortion-free speakers, allowing for crisp, clear, and loud calls. The easy-to-use remote can be operated quickly with one hand and has a range of 200 yards. Remote sound list is displayed on easy to read 2.5-inch high-resolution TFT screen and sounds are organized by species such as coyote, fox, bobcat, deer, elk, etc.Features:Rotating directional speaker system for dynamic, realistic soundsSpeakers all for 180-degree calling coverage or crisp, concentrated high volume sound in one directionErgonomic remote with full-color display and easy control layout64 digitally mastered sounds with ability to add and remove sounds180 degree cone speakersStores up to a 1000 sounds from professional sound library on 2GB of internal memoryAuxiliary jack for operating motion decoysAudio out and Audio in portsUSB cable portRugged speaker case with elevated legsTripod mounting threadsRealtree MAX-1 CamouflageUniversal tripod mounting threads2.5-inch color LCD on remoteOperates on 8 AA batteries (not included) for the base unit and 3 AA batteries (not included) for the remote", "text": "Primos Alpha Dogg Electronic Predator Call The Primos Alpha Dogg electronic predator call leads the pack right to you with rotating directional speakers for 180-degree coverage or crisp concentrated directional calling. The ergonomic remote has a full color display, and simple to use layout. This call is equipped with 64 distinct calls-_and you can add and remove your own calls as well.Take the guesswork out of predator calling. The Alpha Dogg doesn't give you just individual sounds to choose from, it has 6 complete expert hunt sequences and 75 different sounds. These are proven hunt sets that get dogs in. The caller is powered by dual 25 watt, distortion-free speakers, allowing for crisp, clear, and loud calls. The easy-to-use remote can be operated quickly with one hand and has a range of 200 yards. Remote sound list is displayed on easy to read 2.5-inch high-resolution TFT screen and sounds are organized by species such as coyote, fox, bobcat, deer, elk, etc.Features:Rotating directional speaker system for dynamic, realistic soundsSpeakers all for 180-degree calling coverage or crisp, concentrated high volume sound in one directionErgonomic remote with full-color display and easy control layout64 digitally mastered sounds with ability to add and remove sounds180 degree cone speakersStores up to a 1000 sounds from professional sound library on 2GB of internal memoryAuxiliary jack for operating motion decoysAudio out and Audio in portsUSB cable portRugged speaker case with elevated legsTripod mounting threadsRealtree MAX-1 CamouflageUniversal tripod mounting threads2.5-inch color LCD on remoteOperates on 8 AA batteries (not included) for the base unit and 3 AA batteries (not included) for the remote", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51hEdfh2vJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005A3FWNW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Predator"]], "price": 229.18}}
{"item_id": "B005A6B332", "title": "Cold Steel Pipe Hawk Sheath", "description": "Pine Hawk Cordura Sheath only. Sheath for Cold Steel Pine Hawk. Material: Cordura. Nylon tomahawk sheaths from Cold Steel are heavy duty, quality made sheaths that snap securely and protect the edge from unwanted impacts and protects you from the edge.", "text": "Cold Steel Pipe Hawk Sheath Pine Hawk Cordura Sheath only. Sheath for Cold Steel Pine Hawk. Material: Cordura. Nylon tomahawk sheaths from Cold Steel are heavy duty, quality made sheaths that snap securely and protect the edge from unwanted impacts and protects you from the edge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41oZUDZQPRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005A6B332.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cold Steel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 5.25}}
{"item_id": "B005ABEKW8", "title": "Cygolite Hotshot 2-Watt USB Rechargeable Taillight with USB Cable and Charger", "description": "Integrating Cygolite’s 20 years of tail light expertise, the HotShot 2W USB features a powerful 2 watt High-Brightness LED for max visibility, USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery, 5 flash modes, and adjustable flash speeds for additional safety. This Hotshot includes a wall charger and USB cable to charge from the wall outlet or on the USB of your computer.", "text": "Cygolite Hotshot 2-Watt USB Rechargeable Taillight with USB Cable and Charger Integrating Cygolite’s 20 years of tail light expertise, the HotShot 2W USB features a powerful 2 watt High-Brightness LED for max visibility, USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery, 5 flash modes, and adjustable flash speeds for additional safety. This Hotshot includes a wall charger and USB cable to charge from the wall outlet or on the USB of your computer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51F-y-ImL2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ABEKW8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005ABZ1V2", "title": "Targ-Dots 1-Inch Round Pasters, Black (200 Per Pack)", "description": "These pasters enable you to use a target multiple times. Just place a target paster over the bullet hole, and keep shooting. 200 Pasters per pack", "text": "Targ-Dots 1-Inch Round Pasters, Black (200 Per Pack) These pasters enable you to use a target multiple times. Just place a target paster over the bullet hole, and keep shooting. 200 Pasters per pack", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21KpU4VkVTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ABZ1V2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Targ-Dots", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery"]], "price": 7.99}}
