{"item_id": "B005ADDGGC", "title": "Mizuno Franchise Softball GFN1403 Slowpitch Fielder's Mitt (14.00-Inch, Right Handed Throw)", "description": "The Mizuno GFN1403 is a 14.00\" utility glove featuring Hi-Low Lacing to increase flexibility throughout the web. This new Slowpitch Softball specific series features Mizuno's Power Lock Closure for the quickest and most secure fit available.", "text": "Mizuno Franchise Softball GFN1403 Slowpitch Fielder's Mitt (14.00-Inch, Right Handed Throw) The Mizuno GFN1403 is a 14.00\" utility glove featuring Hi-Low Lacing to increase flexibility throughout the web. This new Slowpitch Softball specific series features Mizuno's Power Lock Closure for the quickest and most secure fit available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ygdViQboL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ADDGGC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Player Equipment", "Gloves & Mitts", "Infielder's Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005ADLWN6", "title": "Mizuno Performance Sock", "description": "The Mizuno Performance Sock G2 features a gripper top to keep your socks up. Perfect for wearing under your baseball/softball pants.The performance Sock G2 is now made from a Nylon/Acrylic/Polyester/Elastic blend and features a gripper top to keep socks up, padded footbed, Personalized Name Plate (PNP) on toe, ankle support, Y-Heel that locks the sock in place, and more arch support.", "text": "Mizuno Performance Sock The Mizuno Performance Sock G2 features a gripper top to keep your socks up. Perfect for wearing under your baseball/softball pants.The performance Sock G2 is now made from a Nylon/Acrylic/Polyester/Elastic blend and features a gripper top to keep socks up, padded footbed, Personalized Name Plate (PNP) on toe, ankle support, Y-Heel that locks the sock in place, and more arch support.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31okYY4N95L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ADLWN6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Socks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005AEQ65Y", "title": "Whetstone M-305 Airsoft Gun with 25 6mm Bbs Airsoft Starter Set", "description": "The M-305 6mm Airsoft Pistol by Whetstone™ is ideal for shooting competitions. Its 1:1 scale modeling makes it very realistic. Its plastic shell makes the M-305 very durable. This extraordinary air sport gun utilizes a spring operated firing mechanism to shoot 6 mm BBs. Its clip holds up to 8 rounds offering you plenty of fire power. Don’t be caught without a sidearm in the heat of battle!", "text": "Whetstone M-305 Airsoft Gun with 25 6mm Bbs Airsoft Starter Set The M-305 6mm Airsoft Pistol by Whetstone™ is ideal for shooting competitions. Its 1:1 scale modeling makes it very realistic. Its plastic shell makes the M-305 very durable. This extraordinary air sport gun utilizes a spring operated firing mechanism to shoot 6 mm BBs. Its clip holds up to 8 rounds offering you plenty of fire power. Don’t be caught without a sidearm in the heat of battle!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hCRnLSsEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005AEQ65Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 12.99}}
