{"item_id": "B005ALTGVS", "title": "550lb Type III 7 Strand Camouflage Paracord US Made", "description": "We get new styles and cool designs weekly!Choose from our wide selection of camo paracord colors. Our designs and colors are always updated and will keep on being updated. The great thing when you order from army universe ropes here, you are sure to get the same color shades every single time. So there won't be any difference in your various paracord crafts.Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 7 Removable NYLON Inner Strands by 2 Ply. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. Easy to clean & not as stretchy as nylon ropes. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. Made In The USA.Paracord direct from the manufacturer Army Universe. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 nylon strands can be easily removed Some uses for this cord can be: Ridge lines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & many more other Paracord Crafts!!***We offer a lifetime guarantee on these ropes and if there are any issues, contact us and we will take care of it for you!***THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "text": "550lb Type III 7 Strand Camouflage Paracord US Made We get new styles and cool designs weekly!Choose from our wide selection of camo paracord colors. Our designs and colors are always updated and will keep on being updated. The great thing when you order from army universe ropes here, you are sure to get the same color shades every single time. So there won't be any difference in your various paracord crafts.Made From 100% Heavy Duty Polyester Material. 550 Pound Tested - 7 Strand Core. 5/32\" Diameter. 7 Removable NYLON Inner Strands by 2 Ply. Quick Drying & Will Not Rot or Mildew. Easy to clean & not as stretchy as nylon ropes. 100 Feet Long. Better Than Military Specifications. Made In The USA.Paracord direct from the manufacturer Army Universe. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Paracord Ropes can be utilized in many great survival uses & the 7 nylon strands can be easily removed Some uses for this cord can be: Ridge lines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & many more other Paracord Crafts!!***We offer a lifetime guarantee on these ropes and if there are any issues, contact us and we will take care of it for you!***THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN A PLASTIC BAG WITH HANG TAG & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z0sC4uXuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ALTGVS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B005AUBHVQ", "title": "Amazon Jungle Survival Knife with Sheath", "description": "Don't brave the jungle without this knife! The Amazon Jungle Survival Knife is the ultimate in survival knives. It features a drilled guard for strapping and spear applications and heavy jagged sawback ridge design, completed with a corded handle for grip and twine that houses a mini survival kit. The survival kit includes matches, fishing line, a hook, needles and thread, a safety pin, and striking paper. The end of the knife's handle also features a compass just in case you lose your way. Measures 13\"\" overall. Includes leather sheath.", "text": "Amazon Jungle Survival Knife with Sheath Don't brave the jungle without this knife! The Amazon Jungle Survival Knife is the ultimate in survival knives. It features a drilled guard for strapping and spear applications and heavy jagged sawback ridge design, completed with a corded handle for grip and twine that houses a mini survival kit. The survival kit includes matches, fishing line, a hook, needles and thread, a safety pin, and striking paper. The end of the knife's handle also features a compass just in case you lose your way. Measures 13\"\" overall. Includes leather sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515OZOcm%2BQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005AUBHVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Amazon Jungle Survivor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 16.97}}
{"item_id": "B005AUEN9O", "title": "Meprolight Ruger Tru-Dot Night Sight for SP101 (.38 spcl. & .357 mag.) Front sight only", "description": "The ML10992 is a front sight only for use on the SP101 revolvers in .38 special and .357 magnum calibers. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "text": "Meprolight Ruger Tru-Dot Night Sight for SP101 (.38 spcl. & .357 mag.) Front sight only The ML10992 is a front sight only for use on the SP101 revolvers in .38 special and .357 magnum calibers. MEPROLIGHT sights, like our other self-illuminated products & devices take maximum advantage of tritium light sources - the fail-safe, maintenance-free light sources that don’t require any external source of energy and provides up to 15 years of usable light under all weather conditions. MEPROLIGHT continues to offer the strongest guarantee in the industry for the usable light of our TRU-DOT sights.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lcb8DTZHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005AUEN9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Meprolight", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 54.49}}
