{"item_id": "B005AXT43Q", "title": "Laserlyte Mini Bore Sight Accessory Kit", "description": "LaserLyte is proud of their MBS Six Pak accessory kit for its Mini Laser Bore Sight line. Built to give the user everything needed to sight-in, the MBS Six Pak includes a scope/gun leveler, 12-393 batteries, 12-20 shotgun adapter (works only with MBS-1), .51-.75 caliber bore adapter, extra.22-.50 caliber tool kit, daylight target and a durable polymer case to hold everything in.", "text": "Laserlyte Mini Bore Sight Accessory Kit LaserLyte is proud of their MBS Six Pak accessory kit for its Mini Laser Bore Sight line. Built to give the user everything needed to sight-in, the MBS Six Pak includes a scope/gun leveler, 12-393 batteries, 12-20 shotgun adapter (works only with MBS-1), .51-.75 caliber bore adapter, extra.22-.50 caliber tool kit, daylight target and a durable polymer case to hold everything in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LLs5XoKOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005AXT43Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 30.85}}
{"item_id": "B005AXYIPU", "title": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Upper and Lower Receiver Magazine Well-Vise Block Set, Black", "description": "3 pcs set of heavy duty blocks securely clamp all flat top and carry handle AR-15/M16 upper and lower receiver components to prevent damage or movement during repair, assembly and cleaning. Constructed of impact resistant glass filled nylon.", "text": "ProMag AR-15/M16 Upper and Lower Receiver Magazine Well-Vise Block Set, Black 3 pcs set of heavy duty blocks securely clamp all flat top and carry handle AR-15/M16 upper and lower receiver components to prevent damage or movement during repair, assembly and cleaning. Constructed of impact resistant glass filled nylon.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hITDoVavL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005AXYIPU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ProMag", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 41.02}}
