iland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.61}}
{"item_id": "B005BNYV2Y", "title": "Camco 25401 Non-Slip Grip Tape for Steps (2\" x 15', Black)", "description": "Camco's Non-Slip Black Grip Tape for RV steps helps prevent slips and falls. The self-adhesive tape is used for added safety on steps, ladders and walkways. Tape is 2\"Wide by 15' long.", "text": "Camco 25401 Non-Slip Grip Tape for Steps (2\" x 15', Black) Camco's Non-Slip Black Grip Tape for RV steps helps prevent slips and falls. The self-adhesive tape is used for added safety on steps, ladders and walkways. Tape is 2\"Wide by 15' long.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iF3nBAXyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005BNYV2Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Skateboarding", "Skateboard Parts", "Grip Tape"]], "price": 6.95}}
