{"item_id": "B005BSN4H2", "title": "Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reel", "description": "Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reels deliver blazing - fast speed and hot performance! Fire and water form a potent mix! No matter if you cast your line in saltwater or fresh, these dynamite Daiwa Sweepfire Spinners are ready to deliver big value and peak performance. No matter which one is right for you, the light touch, silk-slick action and effortless retrieve will heat up your haul. Reel yours in today! Twist Buster anti-tangle system; Dual ball-bearing roller drive; Digigear operation; Advanced locomotive level-wind; ABS aluminum spool design; State Model. Model: SW1000-2B, Gear Ratio: 4.9:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 4 lb., Line Capacity: 120 yds., Weight: 6.7 ozs., Action: Ultra - Light. Model: SW1500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 6 lb., Line Capacity: 100 yds., Weight: 9.9 ozs., Action: Ultra - Light / Light. Model: SW2000-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 8 lb., Line Capacity: 110 yds., Weight: 9.9 ozs., Action: Light / Medium - Light. Model: SW2500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 8 lb., Line Capacity: 170 yds., Weight: 10.9 ozs., Action: Medium - Light / Medium. Model: SW3000-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 10 lb., Line Capacity: 200 yds., Weight: 10.9 ozs., Action: Medium - Light / Medium. Model: SW3500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 12 lb., Line Capacity: 210 yds., Weight: 14.5 ozs., Action: Medium / Medium - Heavy. Model: SW3500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 12 lb., Line Capacity: 260 yds., Weight: 14.5 ozs., Action: Medium - Heavy / Heavy. Set your take on fire with Daiwa! Order Now! Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reel", "text": "Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reel Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reels deliver blazing - fast speed and hot performance! Fire and water form a potent mix! No matter if you cast your line in saltwater or fresh, these dynamite Daiwa Sweepfire Spinners are ready to deliver big value and peak performance. No matter which one is right for you, the light touch, silk-slick action and effortless retrieve will heat up your haul. Reel yours in today! Twist Buster anti-tangle system; Dual ball-bearing roller drive; Digigear operation; Advanced locomotive level-wind; ABS aluminum spool design; State Model. Model: SW1000-2B, Gear Ratio: 4.9:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 4 lb., Line Capacity: 120 yds., Weight: 6.7 ozs., Action: Ultra - Light. Model: SW1500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 6 lb., Line Capacity: 100 yds., Weight: 9.9 ozs., Action: Ultra - Light / Light. Model: SW2000-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 8 lb., Line Capacity: 110 yds., Weight: 9.9 ozs., Action: Light / Medium - Light. Model: SW2500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 8 lb., Line Capacity: 170 yds., Weight: 10.9 ozs., Action: Medium - Light / Medium. Model: SW3000-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 10 lb., Line Capacity: 200 yds., Weight: 10.9 ozs., Action: Medium - Light / Medium. Model: SW3500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 12 lb., Line Capacity: 210 yds., Weight: 14.5 ozs., Action: Medium / Medium - Heavy. Model: SW3500-2B, Gear Ratio: 5.3:1, Ball Bearing: 2BB, Line Weight: 12 lb., Line Capacity: 260 yds., Weight: 14.5 ozs., Action: Medium - Heavy / Heavy. Set your take on fire with Daiwa! Order Now! Daiwa Sweepfire Spinning Reel", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gWuij4z-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005BSN4H2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Spinning Reels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005BSO732", "title": "Adco Super Thumb Magazine Speed Loader", "description": "Adco Super Thumb saves your thumb when loading multiple ammunition magazines. Pushing in bullet after bullet takes it's toll during a day of shooting. Super Thumb allows you to reload without having to press your thumb down on the magazine each time.", "text": "Adco Super Thumb Magazine Speed Loader Adco Super Thumb saves your thumb when loading multiple ammunition magazines. Pushing in bullet after bullet takes it's toll during a day of shooting. Super Thumb allows you to reload without having to press your thumb down on the magazine each time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fEjyqPu9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005BSO732.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ADCO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 10.99}}
{"item_id": "B005BTT8JY", "title": "NEBO 5598 Universal Long Gun Light Mount", "description": "Universal Aluminum Mount for Long Guns adjusts, tightens, and locks with no tools needed. Long Gun mount light mount. Aircraft Grade Anodized Aluminum Construction. Fits both vented and Plain Barrels. This mount is included the NEBO Elite Laser + Flashlight Combo, also mounts on 12-20 gauge shotgun barrels.", "text": "NEBO 5598 Universal Long Gun Light Mount Universal Aluminum Mount for Long Guns adjusts, tightens, and locks with no tools needed. Long Gun mount light mount. Aircraft Grade Anodized Aluminum Construction. Fits both vented and Plain Barrels. This mount is included the NEBO Elite Laser + Flashlight Combo, also mounts on 12-20 gauge shotgun barrels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zESbl8FtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005BTT8JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nebo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 14.9}}
{"item_id": "B005BW3JRS", "title": "Outdoor Research Men's Transit Radar Cap, X-Large, Mushroom", "description": "Function lies at the heart of this street-styled, vented cap. It will shield you from the sun with UPF 50+ sun protection, keep you dry with the TransAction™headband, keep you cool with its mesh side panels, and store away in your pocket with the help of the folding bill.", "text": "Outdoor Research Men's Transit Radar Cap, X-Large, Mushroom Function lies at the heart of this street-styled, vented cap. It will shield you from the sun with UPF 50+ sun protection, keep you dry with the TransAction™headband, keep you cool with its mesh side panels, and store away in your pocket with the help of the folding bill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515%2BwthwFsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005BW3JRS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Sun Hats"]]}}
