{"item_id": "B005C4V3LY", "title": "Penn 2OZGSESD12 Reel Precision Grease Tub, 2-Ounce", "description": "This reel grease features superior lubricity, water stability, load-carrying capacity and rust protection over other conventional greases. It is formulated to perform over a wide temperature range in applications where grease is the preferred lubricant. Its advanced technology also contributes to excellent oxidation and thermal resistance. Includes 12 grease tub per shipper display. Available in 2-ounce tub.", "text": "Penn 2OZGSESD12 Reel Precision Grease Tub, 2-Ounce This reel grease features superior lubricity, water stability, load-carrying capacity and rust protection over other conventional greases. It is formulated to perform over a wide temperature range in applications where grease is the preferred lubricant. Its advanced technology also contributes to excellent oxidation and thermal resistance. Includes 12 grease tub per shipper display. Available in 2-ounce tub.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51wgrRD87uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C4V3LY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Berkley", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Fishing Tools & Maintenance Equipment", "Reel Care Accessories"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B005C6B74U", "title": "Emergency Outdoor Kit", "description": "Do you go Hiking or Camping? The Level One Outdoor Emergency Camping Kit includes one Emergency Blanket , One Emergency Tent and One Emergency Sleeping bag. All made of durable and insulating Mylar material to give you maximum protection in all weather conditions.", "text": "Emergency Outdoor Kit Do you go Hiking or Camping? The Level One Outdoor Emergency Camping Kit includes one Emergency Blanket , One Emergency Tent and One Emergency Sleeping bag. All made of durable and insulating Mylar material to give you maximum protection in all weather conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51V8xh6pyjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C6B74U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 14.99}}
