{"item_id": "B005C9BG1G", "title": "XLAB Super Wing", "description": "Lightweight: We use the latest aerospace aluminum alloy to provide the toughest alloy carrier on the market with no twisting like other hydration carriers. Without hardware the Xlab Super Wing weighs only 85 grams.", "text": "XLAB Super Wing Lightweight: We use the latest aerospace aluminum alloy to provide the toughest alloy carrier on the market with no twisting like other hydration carriers. Without hardware the Xlab Super Wing weighs only 85 grams.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BQT%2BQ0YOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C9BG1G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 94.99}}
{"item_id": "B005C9BT36", "title": "XLAB Mini Bag", "description": "Finally you can carry all your small parts on your Xlab Wing. Ideal for use with Xlab Carbon Wing and Super Wing. Drops down into rear 'luggage' compartment. Bag can carry 2 CO2 cylinders, nanoflator, pair of tire levers, patch kit, and Park mini tool kit. Could alternatively hold cell phone, cash, keys, etc., or tube, levers, and co2 cylinders. Tough Cordura 500 denier, available in black, red or pink. Specs: Length 5.5\" Volume 24 cubic inches Weight 40 grams", "text": "XLAB Mini Bag Finally you can carry all your small parts on your Xlab Wing. Ideal for use with Xlab Carbon Wing and Super Wing. Drops down into rear 'luggage' compartment. Bag can carry 2 CO2 cylinders, nanoflator, pair of tire levers, patch kit, and Park mini tool kit. Could alternatively hold cell phone, cash, keys, etc., or tube, levers, and co2 cylinders. Tough Cordura 500 denier, available in black, red or pink. Specs: Length 5.5\" Volume 24 cubic inches Weight 40 grams", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vRYih0UxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C9BT36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B005C9BZEE", "title": "XLAB 22-Cubic Inch Rocket Pocket Bag", "description": "The ideal top tube mounted bag for racing or training to carry energy food and other items. Instant access while riding. Carries all your essential needs including Gels, Energy Bars, Salt or Electrolyte Tablets, Cell Phone, Driving License, and Keys etc.", "text": "XLAB 22-Cubic Inch Rocket Pocket Bag The ideal top tube mounted bag for racing or training to carry energy food and other items. Instant access while riding. Carries all your essential needs including Gels, Energy Bars, Salt or Electrolyte Tablets, Cell Phone, Driving License, and Keys etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qwRCmvElL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C9BZEE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]], "price": 21.95}}
{"item_id": "B005C9C2VO", "title": "XLAB X-Large Rocket Pocket Bag", "description": "The ideal top tube mounted bag for racing or training to carry energy food and other items. Instant access while riding. Carries all your essential needs including Gels, Energy Bars, Salt or Electrolyte Tablets, Cell Phone, Driving License, and Keys etc.", "text": "XLAB X-Large Rocket Pocket Bag The ideal top tube mounted bag for racing or training to carry energy food and other items. Instant access while riding. Carries all your essential needs including Gels, Energy Bars, Salt or Electrolyte Tablets, Cell Phone, Driving License, and Keys etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SVMStEg-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C9C2VO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Hydration", "Hydration Packs & Bladders"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B005C9CCK0", "title": "XLAB 38-Gram Gorilla Carbon Cage", "description": "The Gorilla helps prevent bottles ejecting from cages on bumpy roads, mountain bikes and saddle-mounted water bottle carriers. The cage has over 2X the gripping force of conventional carbon cages due to the 6 high shouldered carbon gripping fingers, tall retention tab at the top and thicker carbon. The Gorilla cage will fit on any standard cage mounts.", "text": "XLAB 38-Gram Gorilla Carbon Cage The Gorilla helps prevent bottles ejecting from cages on bumpy roads, mountain bikes and saddle-mounted water bottle carriers. The cage has over 2X the gripping force of conventional carbon cages due to the 6 high shouldered carbon gripping fingers, tall retention tab at the top and thicker carbon. The Gorilla cage will fit on any standard cage mounts.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yX05%2BYcYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005C9CCK0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "XLAB", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Water Bottle Cages"]], "price": 55.95}}
