{"item_id": "B005CRPU3S", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Urban Wallet", "description": "Product Features Max Capacity: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch x 0.75-Inch thick The URBAN wallet is designed to carry the essentials, in a very compact (non-bulging) package. Inside, you'll find an ID window, a slip card compartment for a gusseted pocket which will hold up to 15 business cards, or a thick fold of bills. Will also fit certain ultra-thin cellphone like the Motorola Razor. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Urban Wallet Product Features Max Capacity: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch x 0.75-Inch thick The URBAN wallet is designed to carry the essentials, in a very compact (non-bulging) package. Inside, you'll find an ID window, a slip card compartment for a gusseted pocket which will hold up to 15 business cards, or a thick fold of bills. Will also fit certain ultra-thin cellphone like the Motorola Razor. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61o0%2B%2BR39NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005CRPU3S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005CRPU6A", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Micro Wallet", "description": "Product Features Max Capacity: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch The MICRO is truly a minimalist's wallet with an ID window, two internal card compartment, and one external slip compartment. Perfect for your drivers license, some credit cards, a few dollar20 bills, two quarters (for a phone call), and a spare key. Some call this the -Inch bikini-Inch of wallets. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Micro Wallet Product Features Max Capacity: 4.5-Inch x 3-Inch The MICRO is truly a minimalist's wallet with an ID window, two internal card compartment, and one external slip compartment. Perfect for your drivers license, some credit cards, a few dollar20 bills, two quarters (for a phone call), and a spare key. Some call this the -Inch bikini-Inch of wallets. Product Materials 1000-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Stress points double stitched, Bar tacked or -Inch Box-and-X-Inch stitched for added strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51M1L-X2WnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005CRPU6A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Bag Accessories"]]}}
