{"item_id": "B005CSYVSW", "title": "Maxpedition Micro Pocket Organizer", "description": "Maxpedition Micro Pocket Organiser - Small EDC organizer fits easily and comfortably into pants pocket. Overall dimensions: 3.5\" wide x 5.5\" high x 1\" deep (8.89cm wide x 13.97cm high x 2.54cm deep) Exterior front: Mesh slip pocket Exterior back: 3/4\" webbing grab handle, box-and-X stitched Interior left: Slip pocket with 1\" wide elastic with 3 divisions 1\" - 1\" - 1\" Interior right: Slip pocket with 1\" wide elastic with 2 divisions 1.5\" - 1.5\"& tie down loop Product Materials 800-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength", "text": "Maxpedition Micro Pocket Organizer Maxpedition Micro Pocket Organiser - Small EDC organizer fits easily and comfortably into pants pocket. Overall dimensions: 3.5\" wide x 5.5\" high x 1\" deep (8.89cm wide x 13.97cm high x 2.54cm deep) Exterior front: Mesh slip pocket Exterior back: 3/4\" webbing grab handle, box-and-X stitched Interior left: Slip pocket with 1\" wide elastic with 3 divisions 1\" - 1\" - 1\" Interior right: Slip pocket with 1\" wide elastic with 2 divisions 1.5\" - 1.5\"& tie down loop Product Materials 800-Denier water and abrasion resistant light-weight ballistic nylon fabric Teflon fabric protector for grime resistance and easy maintenance high strength zippers and zipper tracks Triple polyurethane coated for water resistance High tensile strength nylon webbing High tensile strength composite nylon thread (stronger than ordinary industry standard nylon thread) Internal seams taped and finished Paracord zipper pulls Stress points double stitched, Bartacked or \"Box-and-X\" stitched for added strength", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E-BGLcxiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005CSYVSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 14.39}}
