{"item_id": "B005CU5SXW", "title": "Bett 3.5-Feet Tyzac Nylon Cast Net (1/4 Inch Mesh)", "description": "The Bett's Tyzac cast net far exceeds the entry level net of all net makers. This net will equal other's pro series in quality. Total weight better than 3/4 pound per foot. Packed with complete \"how to\" instructions. It fully opens and is designed to sink fast.", "text": "Bett 3.5-Feet Tyzac Nylon Cast Net (1/4 Inch Mesh) The Bett's Tyzac cast net far exceeds the entry level net of all net makers. This net will equal other's pro series in quality. Total weight better than 3/4 pound per foot. Packed with complete \"how to\" instructions. It fully opens and is designed to sink fast.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qT7cUhw4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005CU5SXW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Betts", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Nets"]], "price": 28.94}}
