{"item_id": "B005CWJUJI", "title": "20 Pack - 10\" Reactive Splatter Targets - Glowshot - Multi Color - Gun and Rifle Targets - Glow Shot", "description": "GlowShot 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10\" Targets come in 20 and 50 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "20 Pack - 10\" Reactive Splatter Targets - Glowshot - Multi Color - Gun and Rifle Targets - Glow Shot GlowShot 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10\" Targets come in 20 and 50 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KMamVRZlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005CWJUJI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
