{"item_id": "B005D7FXMA", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 400 Usb Rechargeable Headlight with Quick Release Li-Ion Battery Stick and Wall Charger", "description": "State-of-the-Art Cree XPG LED technology supercharges the ExpiliOn’s brightness while the quick release internal Li-Ion battery stick gives riders the complete package: brightness for the trails, compact size for commutes, and the ability to swap batteries on-the-fly for extended run times. This handlebar mounted system features 7 lighting modes, USB charging, battery low indicator, for optimum power and convenience on every ride.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 400 Usb Rechargeable Headlight with Quick Release Li-Ion Battery Stick and Wall Charger State-of-the-Art Cree XPG LED technology supercharges the ExpiliOn’s brightness while the quick release internal Li-Ion battery stick gives riders the complete package: brightness for the trails, compact size for commutes, and the ability to swap batteries on-the-fly for extended run times. This handlebar mounted system features 7 lighting modes, USB charging, battery low indicator, for optimum power and convenience on every ride.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B65Kah-GL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005D7FXMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 113.99}}
