{"item_id": "B005DA64QG", "title": "P90X Chin-up Max - Pull-up Assist Band", "description": "The P90X Chin-Up Max is a training tool that provides assistance with pull-up and chin-up exercises. Used in conjunction with the P90X Chin-Up Bar, it helps offset your body weight so that you can work your way up to doing more unassisted reps of the exercises featured in the P90X and Asylum fitness programs. The P90X Chin-Up Max can be used with any chin-up bar. Benefits includes: Helps build a strong \"V-shaped\" back and muscular arms and offsets some of the weight your muscles must support. If you're new to chin-ups, the P90X Chin-Up Max will help you work your way up to unassisted chin-ups. If you're trying to maximize your chin-up reps, the P90X Chin-Up Max will help you complete more chin-ups after your muscles fatigue from unassisted chin-ups. Features include: Adjustable for optimal amount of resistance, two ways to adjust resistance in small increments: adjustable strap and removable band, safety hook, non-slip foot stirrup, Heavy-duty buckle for safety and support", "text": "P90X Chin-up Max - Pull-up Assist Band The P90X Chin-Up Max is a training tool that provides assistance with pull-up and chin-up exercises. Used in conjunction with the P90X Chin-Up Bar, it helps offset your body weight so that you can work your way up to doing more unassisted reps of the exercises featured in the P90X and Asylum fitness programs. The P90X Chin-Up Max can be used with any chin-up bar. Benefits includes: Helps build a strong \"V-shaped\" back and muscular arms and offsets some of the weight your muscles must support. If you're new to chin-ups, the P90X Chin-Up Max will help you work your way up to unassisted chin-ups. If you're trying to maximize your chin-up reps, the P90X Chin-Up Max will help you complete more chin-ups after your muscles fatigue from unassisted chin-ups. Features include: Adjustable for optimal amount of resistance, two ways to adjust resistance in small increments: adjustable strap and removable band, safety hook, non-slip foot stirrup, Heavy-duty buckle for safety and support", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EgW9MUKFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DA64QG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]], "price": 46.85}}
{"item_id": "B005DF9VUC", "title": "Ambient Weather WM-2 Handheld Weather Meter w/ Windspeed, Temperature, Wind Chill", "description": "", "text": "Ambient Weather WM-2 Handheld Weather Meter w/ Windspeed, Temperature, Wind Chill", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OZNfgXvrL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DF9VUC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ambient Weather", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Weather Monitors"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B005DFKGYM", "title": "DBoys Airsoft M4 & M16 Metal 500rd Extended High Capacity Magazine [Hi-Cap Mag]", "description": "For those looking for a bit of an upper hand in the field for their M4 or M16 metal gearbox AEG rifle, we've got the perfect solution. The all-new DBoys 500-round extended M4/M16 high capacity magazine comes from the factory with a 65% increase in BB capacity. Compatible with metal gearbox M4 and M16 AEGs from AGM, Classic Army, DBoys, Echo 1 and JG. OEM manufactured by JG, this metallic magazine features durable construction, and an excellent-quality finish.", "text": "DBoys Airsoft M4 & M16 Metal 500rd Extended High Capacity Magazine [Hi-Cap Mag] For those looking for a bit of an upper hand in the field for their M4 or M16 metal gearbox AEG rifle, we've got the perfect solution. The all-new DBoys 500-round extended M4/M16 high capacity magazine comes from the factory with a 65% increase in BB capacity. Compatible with metal gearbox M4 and M16 AEGs from AGM, Classic Army, DBoys, Echo 1 and JG. OEM manufactured by JG, this metallic magazine features durable construction, and an excellent-quality finish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cQ4dbOd6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DFKGYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DBoys", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 12.47}}
{"item_id": "B005DFKH0K", "title": "Osprey Packs Atmos 50 Backpack", "description": "Stow straps let you affix mountaineering tools such as ice axes or trekking poles.With the Atmos Series of packs, gear maker Osprey sought to redefine expectations about weight, ventilation, and comfort. As a result, a redesigned AirSpeed suspension system now provides a customized fit, with fully adjustable torso length, interchangeable harnesses, and adjustable hipbelt fit. Durable materials, meanwhile, include 210-denier twill nylon and 100-denier mini-ripstop nylon for long-lasting use.The Atmos 50, ideal for through-hiking and overnight or extended trips, is a great ounce-counter's trail companion. With an average weight of just over three pounds (depending on which size you select), hikers can carry essentials with ease and comfort. A traditional floating top pocket/top load design and twin front pockets with welded, water-resistant zips makes packing easy. Other features include an internal hydration sleeve, zippered mesh pockets on the adjustable hipbelt, and removable sleeping pad straps.FeaturesAdjustable harness:The torso-adjustable, interchangeable shoulder harness allows three inches of adjustment for a fine-tuned fit, while using a new pad design, spacer mesh, and ventilated foam for breathable, supportive cushioning.AirSpeed suspension:AirSpeed suspension with LightWire frame and 3D tensioned, breathable mesh back panel optimizes pack balance, ventilation, and support.Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt:The new Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt design uses dual density foam for improved support, and spacer mesh for breathability. The exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted with a six-inch total adjustment range while wearing the pack.Hydration sleeve:All Atmos Series packs are hydration compatible, with tube exit ports on both sides of the pack.Removable sleeping pad straps:Removable sleeping pad straps add a level of performance versatility.Removable top pocket:The floating top pocket with under-lid mesh pocket can be easily removed.Tool attachment:Dual ice tool loops and bungee tool tie-offs let you lash mountaineering gear to the pack's exterior.Vertical zip pocket:Dual vertical zip front pockets allow for easy gear organization.With a Fit-on-the-Fly hipbelt, and exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted while wearing the pack.SpecificationsSmall:2,868 cubic inches47 litersThree-pound, one-ounce weightMedium:3,051 cubic inches50 litersThree-pound, four-ounce weightLarge:3,234 cubic inches53 litersThree-pound, four-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyOsprey products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Osprey Packs Atmos 50 Backpack Stow straps let you affix mountaineering tools such as ice axes or trekking poles.With the Atmos Series of packs, gear maker Osprey sought to redefine expectations about weight, ventilation, and comfort. As a result, a redesigned AirSpeed suspension system now provides a customized fit, with fully adjustable torso length, interchangeable harnesses, and adjustable hipbelt fit. Durable materials, meanwhile, include 210-denier twill nylon and 100-denier mini-ripstop nylon for long-lasting use.The Atmos 50, ideal for through-hiking and overnight or extended trips, is a great ounce-counter's trail companion. With an average weight of just over three pounds (depending on which size you select), hikers can carry essentials with ease and comfort. A traditional floating top pocket/top load design and twin front pockets with welded, water-resistant zips makes packing easy. Other features include an internal hydration sleeve, zippered mesh pockets on the adjustable hipbelt, and removable sleeping pad straps.FeaturesAdjustable harness:The torso-adjustable, interchangeable shoulder harness allows three inches of adjustment for a fine-tuned fit, while using a new pad design, spacer mesh, and ventilated foam for breathable, supportive cushioning.AirSpeed suspension:AirSpeed suspension with LightWire frame and 3D tensioned, breathable mesh back panel optimizes pack balance, ventilation, and support.Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt:The new Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt design uses dual density foam for improved support, and spacer mesh for breathability. The exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted with a six-inch total adjustment range while wearing the pack.Hydration sleeve:All Atmos Series packs are hydration compatible, with tube exit ports on both sides of the pack.Removable sleeping pad straps:Removable sleeping pad straps add a level of performance versatility.Removable top pocket:The floating top pocket with under-lid mesh pocket can be easily removed.Tool attachment:Dual ice tool loops and bungee tool tie-offs let you lash mountaineering gear to the pack's exterior.Vertical zip pocket:Dual vertical zip front pockets allow for easy gear organization.With a Fit-on-the-Fly hipbelt, and exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted while wearing the pack.SpecificationsSmall:2,868 cubic inches47 litersThree-pound, one-ounce weightMedium:3,051 cubic inches50 litersThree-pound, four-ounce weightLarge:3,234 cubic inches53 litersThree-pound, four-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyOsprey products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wq57qBFXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DFKH0K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005DFL4CK", "title": "Osprey Packs Atmos 65 Backpack", "description": "Stow straps let you affix mountaineering tools such as ice axes or trekking poles.With the Atmos Series of packs, gear maker Osprey sought to redefine expectations about weight, ventilation, and comfort. As a result, a redesigned AirSpeed suspension system now provides a customized fit, with fully adjustable torso length, interchangeable harnesses, and adjustable hipbelt fit. Durable materials, meanwhile, include 210-denier twill nylon and 100-denier mini-ripstop nylon for long-lasting use.The Atmos 65, ideal for through-hiking and overnight or extended trips, is a great ounce-counter's trail companion. With an average weight of just over three pounds (depending on which size you select), hikers can carry essentials with ease and comfort. A comfortable, adjustable foam harness and hipbelt provides superb fit while the AirSpeed suspension provides great carry, even when the pack's packed full.FeaturesAdjustable harness:The torso-adjustable, interchangeable shoulder harness allows three inches of adjustment for a fine-tuned fit, while using a new pad design, spacer mesh, and ventilated foam for breathable, supportive cushioning.AirSpeed suspension:AirSpeed suspension with LightWire frame and 3D tensioned, breathable mesh back panel optimizes pack balance, ventilation, and support.Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt:The new Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt design uses dual density foam for improved support, and spacer mesh for breathability. The exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted with a six-inch total adjustment range while wearing the pack.Hydration sleeve:All Atmos Series packs are hydration compatible, with tube exit ports on both sides of the pack.Removable sleeping pad straps:Removable sleeping pad straps add a level of performance versatility.Removable top pocket:The floating top pocket with under-lid mesh pocket can be easily removed.Tool attachment:Dual ice tool loops and bungee tool tie-offs let you lash mountaineering gear to the pack's exterior.Vertical zip pocket:Dual vertical zip front pockets allow for easy gear organization.Sleeping bag compartment:A zippered sleeping bag compartment with removable divider keeps your bag protected and accessible.With a Fit-on-the-Fly hipbelt, and exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted while wearing the pack.SpecificationsSmall:3,783 cubic inches62 litersThree-pound, six-ounce weightMedium:3,967 cubic inches65 litersThree-pound, nine-ounce weightLarge:4,150 cubic inches68 litersThree-pound, ten-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyOsprey products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Osprey Packs Atmos 65 Backpack Stow straps let you affix mountaineering tools such as ice axes or trekking poles.With the Atmos Series of packs, gear maker Osprey sought to redefine expectations about weight, ventilation, and comfort. As a result, a redesigned AirSpeed suspension system now provides a customized fit, with fully adjustable torso length, interchangeable harnesses, and adjustable hipbelt fit. Durable materials, meanwhile, include 210-denier twill nylon and 100-denier mini-ripstop nylon for long-lasting use.The Atmos 65, ideal for through-hiking and overnight or extended trips, is a great ounce-counter's trail companion. With an average weight of just over three pounds (depending on which size you select), hikers can carry essentials with ease and comfort. A comfortable, adjustable foam harness and hipbelt provides superb fit while the AirSpeed suspension provides great carry, even when the pack's packed full.FeaturesAdjustable harness:The torso-adjustable, interchangeable shoulder harness allows three inches of adjustment for a fine-tuned fit, while using a new pad design, spacer mesh, and ventilated foam for breathable, supportive cushioning.AirSpeed suspension:AirSpeed suspension with LightWire frame and 3D tensioned, breathable mesh back panel optimizes pack balance, ventilation, and support.Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt:The new Fit-On-The-Fly hipbelt design uses dual density foam for improved support, and spacer mesh for breathability. The exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted with a six-inch total adjustment range while wearing the pack.Hydration sleeve:All Atmos Series packs are hydration compatible, with tube exit ports on both sides of the pack.Removable sleeping pad straps:Removable sleeping pad straps add a level of performance versatility.Removable top pocket:The floating top pocket with under-lid mesh pocket can be easily removed.Tool attachment:Dual ice tool loops and bungee tool tie-offs let you lash mountaineering gear to the pack's exterior.Vertical zip pocket:Dual vertical zip front pockets allow for easy gear organization.Sleeping bag compartment:A zippered sleeping bag compartment with removable divider keeps your bag protected and accessible.With a Fit-on-the-Fly hipbelt, and exclusive adjustment system allows the belt to be custom fitted while wearing the pack.SpecificationsSmall:3,783 cubic inches62 litersThree-pound, six-ounce weightMedium:3,967 cubic inches65 litersThree-pound, nine-ounce weightLarge:4,150 cubic inches68 litersThree-pound, ten-ounce weightLifetime WarrantyOsprey products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G2DiG-xaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DFL4CK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005DFLLXW", "title": "Airsoft Metal M4 M16 AK Double Magazine Clamp Adjustable", "description": "Our take: JG metal M4/M16/AK magazine clamp, compatible with most-all M4/M16/AK47 magazines. This magazine clamp is adjustable for fitment on the magazine you have (M4/M16/AK47) and effectively doubles your on-field ammunition capacity. Please note that the magazines in product photos is not included; It is just an example to show how the mag clamp can be used.", "text": "Airsoft Metal M4 M16 AK Double Magazine Clamp Adjustable Our take: JG metal M4/M16/AK magazine clamp, compatible with most-all M4/M16/AK47 magazines. This magazine clamp is adjustable for fitment on the magazine you have (M4/M16/AK47) and effectively doubles your on-field ammunition capacity. Please note that the magazines in product photos is not included; It is just an example to show how the mag clamp can be used.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yctvwXHmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DFLLXW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 7.0}}
{"item_id": "B005DFNJI2", "title": "CYMA Airsoft 550-Round Thermold Waffle High Capacity Magazine for AK47 / AK-47 AEGs - For CYMA, JG, Echo 1, CA, TM, ICS, G&G", "description": "This 550rd thermal molded 'waffle' hi-cap magazine from CYMA features universal fitment on all metal gearbox AK47 AEGs. Compatible with CYMA, JG, Echo 1, Classic Army, ICS, G&G; and TM AK47 AEGs. The thermal molded \"WAFFLE\" design is an especially great match for those who own black AK47 AEGs that had a waffle mag come standard with the gun, including the JG AK47 Tactical RIS series, the Echo 1 AK47 Tactical RIS series, among many others. Excellent quality and finish!", "text": "CYMA Airsoft 550-Round Thermold Waffle High Capacity Magazine for AK47 / AK-47 AEGs - For CYMA, JG, Echo 1, CA, TM, ICS, G&G This 550rd thermal molded 'waffle' hi-cap magazine from CYMA features universal fitment on all metal gearbox AK47 AEGs. Compatible with CYMA, JG, Echo 1, Classic Army, ICS, G&G; and TM AK47 AEGs. The thermal molded \"WAFFLE\" design is an especially great match for those who own black AK47 AEGs that had a waffle mag come standard with the gun, including the JG AK47 Tactical RIS series, the Echo 1 AK47 Tactical RIS series, among many others. Excellent quality and finish!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wZJZd2UCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DFNJI2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CYMA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B005DG5TZ2", "title": "Assault Systems Discreet FN Case fits FN P90/PS90", "description": "The Assualt Systems Discreet FN Case fits the FN P90 & PS90. It is constructed in the USA of 1000 denier nylon with 3/8\" closed cell foam padding. The case has wrap-around handles and heavy-duty hardware with #10 heavy-duty zippers. The main compartment has plenty of room for the weapon with scope attached. It has tie-down straps for the weapon, plus a tie-down for an FN cleaning kit and a velcro patch for removable accessory pouch. (included) The outside pocket is fully padded and has pouches for 4 magazines. Dim: 28\" x 13\" x 2.5\"", "text": "Assault Systems Discreet FN Case fits FN P90/PS90 The Assualt Systems Discreet FN Case fits the FN P90 & PS90. It is constructed in the USA of 1000 denier nylon with 3/8\" closed cell foam padding. The case has wrap-around handles and heavy-duty hardware with #10 heavy-duty zippers. The main compartment has plenty of room for the weapon with scope attached. It has tie-down straps for the weapon, plus a tie-down for an FN cleaning kit and a velcro patch for removable accessory pouch. (included) The outside pocket is fully padded and has pouches for 4 magazines. Dim: 28\" x 13\" x 2.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-UaPhIJlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DG5TZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite Survival Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 95.96}}
{"item_id": "B005DG5UHO", "title": "Assault Systems Discreet FN Case fits FN FS2000", "description": "This Assualt Systems Discreet Case fits the FN FS-2000. It is constructed in the USA of 1000 denier nylon with 3/8\" closed cell foam padding. The case has wrap-around handles and heavy-duty hardware with #10 heavy-duty zippers. The main compartment has room for the weapon with scope attached. Inside are dual tie-downs to secure the weapon in place, plus 4 magazine pouches. The outside has a fully-padded accessory pocket. Dim: 30\" x 13.5\" x 3\"", "text": "Assault Systems Discreet FN Case fits FN FS2000 This Assualt Systems Discreet Case fits the FN FS-2000. It is constructed in the USA of 1000 denier nylon with 3/8\" closed cell foam padding. The case has wrap-around handles and heavy-duty hardware with #10 heavy-duty zippers. The main compartment has room for the weapon with scope attached. Inside are dual tie-downs to secure the weapon in place, plus 4 magazine pouches. The outside has a fully-padded accessory pocket. Dim: 30\" x 13.5\" x 3\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411vmqnMWDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DG5UHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite Survival Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 95.96}}
{"item_id": "B005DH2I7S", "title": "Pocket Mag Pouch", "description": "The Elite Pocket Mag Pouch provides quick access to your spare magazine. It is constructed of a padded non-slip material with a soft nylon inner lining. The pouch is black in color and fits right or left hand users.", "text": "Pocket Mag Pouch The Elite Pocket Mag Pouch provides quick access to your spare magazine. It is constructed of a padded non-slip material with a soft nylon inner lining. The pouch is black in color and fits right or left hand users.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41COiS5HfHL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DH2I7S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B005DH9W8G", "title": "Dillon Precision RL550B 4 Stage Progressive Reloading Machine 14261", "description": "This is the RL550B without a caliber conversion kit or dies 4 station progressive loader Station 1) resize/deprime/prime Station 2) powder drop/flare Station 3) seat Station 4) crimp The RL550B is able to load rifle as well as pistol cartridges The RL550B uses standard 7/8 by 14 thread per inch dies, as long as they deprime in the size die Manually indexed shellplate Manually fed cases and bullets Capable of loading 400 to 600 rounds per hour. Lifetime \"No-B.S.\" Warranty No dies are included with the RL550B. Machine pictured shows available options. These are not included with the base machine. The basic 550 includes: Powder measure with standard large and small powder bars (small installed), Small bar throws from 2.1 to 15 grains of powder Large bar throws up to 55 to 60 grains of powder. One RL550B Progressive Reloading Machine. One prime system with large and small priming parts. One large and one small pick up tube One toolhead One powder die One loaded cartridge catch bin One written instruction manual One set of standard Allen wrenches ***NO CALIBER CONVERSION KIT OR DIES ARE INCLUDED WITH THE MACHINE*** You will need a caliber conversion kit and a set of dies to load on the RL 550B.", "text": "Dillon Precision RL550B 4 Stage Progressive Reloading Machine 14261 This is the RL550B without a caliber conversion kit or dies 4 station progressive loader Station 1) resize/deprime/prime Station 2) powder drop/flare Station 3) seat Station 4) crimp The RL550B is able to load rifle as well as pistol cartridges The RL550B uses standard 7/8 by 14 thread per inch dies, as long as they deprime in the size die Manually indexed shellplate Manually fed cases and bullets Capable of loading 400 to 600 rounds per hour. Lifetime \"No-B.S.\" Warranty No dies are included with the RL550B. Machine pictured shows available options. These are not included with the base machine. The basic 550 includes: Powder measure with standard large and small powder bars (small installed), Small bar throws from 2.1 to 15 grains of powder Large bar throws up to 55 to 60 grains of powder. One RL550B Progressive Reloading Machine. One prime system with large and small priming parts. One large and one small pick up tube One toolhead One powder die One loaded cartridge catch bin One written instruction manual One set of standard Allen wrenches ***NO CALIBER CONVERSION KIT OR DIES ARE INCLUDED WITH THE MACHINE*** You will need a caliber conversion kit and a set of dies to load on the RL 550B.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IJJwQl9DL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DH9W8G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 449.99}}
{"item_id": "B005DHKJJ2", "title": "Lock Jaw Olympic Collars Red", "description": "Innovative design superior durability and exceptional performance certify that the Lock-Jaw Barbell Collars are the finest in their class. Fully captured pressure pads and quick-action cams guarantee these collars wont damage plates or bars yet ensure theyll stay firmly in place. Solid frame construction for superior durability. Unconditionally guaranteed against breakage or failure Lock-Jaw collars will withstand even the toughest environments! Lightweight only 12oz per set. Designed to fit 2 inch Olympic bars.Sold in Pairs/2 collars per package.Color-Red", "text": "Lock Jaw Olympic Collars Red Innovative design superior durability and exceptional performance certify that the Lock-Jaw Barbell Collars are the finest in their class. Fully captured pressure pads and quick-action cams guarantee these collars wont damage plates or bars yet ensure theyll stay firmly in place. Solid frame construction for superior durability. Unconditionally guaranteed against breakage or failure Lock-Jaw collars will withstand even the toughest environments! Lightweight only 12oz per set. Designed to fit 2 inch Olympic bars.Sold in Pairs/2 collars per package.Color-Red", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OSu4rHhWL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DHKJJ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Avus Design", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B005DKMHCQ", "title": "GL-Shock-CP - FAB Shock Absorbing Butt Stock w/Cheek Piece", "description": "Revolutionary patented recoil-reducing mechanism built hidden inside the stock with a premium silicon chrome alloy spring Unique patented \"anti-rattle\" mechanism.Slick new design with no protruding parts, will not hang up on gear and webbing.Unique new slick and quick operated inversed positioning lever, integral ribbed rubber butpad with a no slipdesign, integrated \"QD\" sling swivel connectors on both sides.Watertight battery storage for two CR123A 3V Lithium Batteries / AA 1.5v Fit perfectly on both tubes - MIL-SPEC and commercial Aftermarket!Made from mill-spec reinforced composite Polymer", "text": "GL-Shock-CP - FAB Shock Absorbing Butt Stock w/Cheek Piece Revolutionary patented recoil-reducing mechanism built hidden inside the stock with a premium silicon chrome alloy spring Unique patented \"anti-rattle\" mechanism.Slick new design with no protruding parts, will not hang up on gear and webbing.Unique new slick and quick operated inversed positioning lever, integral ribbed rubber butpad with a no slipdesign, integrated \"QD\" sling swivel connectors on both sides.Watertight battery storage for two CR123A 3V Lithium Batteries / AA 1.5v Fit perfectly on both tubes - MIL-SPEC and commercial Aftermarket!Made from mill-spec reinforced composite Polymer", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/71Csa5s8cHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DKMHCQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fab-Defense", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 92.4}}
{"item_id": "B005DLB5KU", "title": "Accu-Riser Molded Cheek Rest Camo Interchangable Rise", "description": "ACCU-RISER CAMO MOLDED CHEEK REST MADE IN USA WE HAVE PUT THIS CAMO ON MANY OF WELL NAMED CAMO'S AND IT BLENDS WITH 99% Ambidextrous cheek rest incorporates two interchangeable rubber cheek pads, one 5/8\" and 1\" which can be switched to better fit your line of sight. A proper cheek weld reduces felt recoil and aligns your optic sight. This will greatly improve comfort and accuracy on your rifle or shotgun. The hard nylon base can be mounted temporarily with supplied 3M double sided tape and held fast with or without a supplied Velcro cinch strap, or unit can be permanently mounted with two screws which are then covered with the pad for a clean secure mount. Fits most rifles and shotguns with classic style stock without cheek pads. Underside of base can be easily widened to fit wider stocks with a file or dremel tool. Please keep in mind the bolt travel and removal of bolt action rifles when mounting a cheek pad. In this model, cheek pad may be removed from base for bolt removal. No need to remove entire unit. MOUNTING INSTRUCTIONS: ~ Position the ACCUR-RISER cheek rest on your weapon. ~ Bolt action, check that the bolt can be cycled and removed for cleaning before mounting to stock. ~ Check fit to stock (underside of base can be trimmed for wider stocks). ~ If mounting temporarily, cut a 1\" length of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ If mounting permanent, use the 3\" of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ Permanent without strap, drill two 5/64\" holes and fasten with two #6 screws provided with kit. ~ 5/8\" or 1\" cheek pads press onto base easily by pressing down from front to back. ~ Remove pads from base by prying with a dull kitchen knife. ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST Comes with: Two interchangeable pads 5/8\" & 1\" 3\" of double sided 3M tape 2- #6 screws to mount permanently Mounting instructions MADE IN USA", "text": "Accu-Riser Molded Cheek Rest Camo Interchangable Rise ACCU-RISER CAMO MOLDED CHEEK REST MADE IN USA WE HAVE PUT THIS CAMO ON MANY OF WELL NAMED CAMO'S AND IT BLENDS WITH 99% Ambidextrous cheek rest incorporates two interchangeable rubber cheek pads, one 5/8\" and 1\" which can be switched to better fit your line of sight. A proper cheek weld reduces felt recoil and aligns your optic sight. This will greatly improve comfort and accuracy on your rifle or shotgun. The hard nylon base can be mounted temporarily with supplied 3M double sided tape and held fast with or without a supplied Velcro cinch strap, or unit can be permanently mounted with two screws which are then covered with the pad for a clean secure mount. Fits most rifles and shotguns with classic style stock without cheek pads. Underside of base can be easily widened to fit wider stocks with a file or dremel tool. Please keep in mind the bolt travel and removal of bolt action rifles when mounting a cheek pad. In this model, cheek pad may be removed from base for bolt removal. No need to remove entire unit. MOUNTING INSTRUCTIONS: ~ Position the ACCUR-RISER cheek rest on your weapon. ~ Bolt action, check that the bolt can be cycled and removed for cleaning before mounting to stock. ~ Check fit to stock (underside of base can be trimmed for wider stocks). ~ If mounting temporarily, cut a 1\" length of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ If mounting permanent, use the 3\" of 3M tape and use the velcro cinch strap. ~ Permanent without strap, drill two 5/64\" holes and fasten with two #6 screws provided with kit. ~ 5/8\" or 1\" cheek pads press onto base easily by pressing down from front to back. ~ Remove pads from base by prying with a dull kitchen knife. ACCU-RISER MOLDED CHEEK REST Comes with: Two interchangeable pads 5/8\" & 1\" 3\" of double sided 3M tape 2- #6 screws to mount permanently Mounting instructions MADE IN USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tMnvCjA4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DLB5KU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 41.99}}
{"item_id": "B005DLZ7K4", "title": "Accu-riser Sporting Neoprene Cheek Rest Pad Right Hand Brown Trim", "description": "ACCU-RISER SPORTING NEOPRENE CHEEK REST PAD RIGHT HAND CP-5000S sporting cheek pad provides 1/4\" of soft neoprene cushion between the stock and your cheek. Correct the rise and fit of your shotgun stock! Neoprene rubber on back keeps pad from moving. Brushed black nylon surface has soft durable finish. Edges are bound with walnut colored vinyl. Cheek pad was designed for the shotgun shooter. Used to correct too low of drop in the comb and is also great for smaller or younger shooters starting out having difficulty getting correct sight alignment. Height can be increased by adding material under the pad. Pad is held on stock with a 3\" elastic strap with velcro hook so there will be no damage to your stock. Pad can easily be switched from gun to gun.", "text": "Accu-riser Sporting Neoprene Cheek Rest Pad Right Hand Brown Trim ACCU-RISER SPORTING NEOPRENE CHEEK REST PAD RIGHT HAND CP-5000S sporting cheek pad provides 1/4\" of soft neoprene cushion between the stock and your cheek. Correct the rise and fit of your shotgun stock! Neoprene rubber on back keeps pad from moving. Brushed black nylon surface has soft durable finish. Edges are bound with walnut colored vinyl. Cheek pad was designed for the shotgun shooter. Used to correct too low of drop in the comb and is also great for smaller or younger shooters starting out having difficulty getting correct sight alignment. Height can be increased by adding material under the pad. Pad is held on stock with a 3\" elastic strap with velcro hook so there will be no damage to your stock. Pad can easily be switched from gun to gun.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JifEmALwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DLZ7K4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 24.99}}
