{"item_id": "B005DN52GQ", "title": "Amphipod Hydraform Handheld Thermal-Lite", "description": "All the benefits of the classic Hydraform™ Handheld with added low profile storage and insulation sleeve! Ergonomic design allows hand to relax. Breathable AirFlow™ mesh and ultra soft inner. Easily adjusts to fit any hand size. Includes 20oz. bottle. All Amphipod bottles are recycling symbol #4 LDPE and are BPA-free.Expandable zipper pouch pocket for iPod, phone, nutrition, keys and more.Sizes: S: 12 oz. L: 20 oz..Weight: 4.3 oz..", "text": "Amphipod Hydraform Handheld Thermal-Lite All the benefits of the classic Hydraform™ Handheld with added low profile storage and insulation sleeve! Ergonomic design allows hand to relax. Breathable AirFlow™ mesh and ultra soft inner. Easily adjusts to fit any hand size. Includes 20oz. bottle. All Amphipod bottles are recycling symbol #4 LDPE and are BPA-free.Expandable zipper pouch pocket for iPod, phone, nutrition, keys and more.Sizes: S: 12 oz. L: 20 oz..Weight: 4.3 oz..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UkFxfMBXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DN52GQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Amphipod", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B005DN87HC", "title": "JG Airsoft M4 S-System Full Metal Gearbox Desert Tan AEG Rifle w/ Integrated RIS and High Performance Tight Bore Barrel - Newest Enhanced Model", "description": "The JG M4 S-System is one of the highest-rated AEGs we've EVER carried here at LA Wings Inc, and for good reason. It is the quintessential \"Player's AEG\" - it comes with everything you need and nothing you don't. For the all-new enhanced production run model, JG has done the impossible. They've re-worked and improved what MANY players thought was already a PERFECT AEG. So this new model, available EXCLUSIVELY at Airsoft Megastore, comes to you straight from the manufacturer having been re-designed from the ground up to be even more powerful, more accurate, more versatile, more reliable, and yet STILL be one of the most affordable high performance AEGs on the planet. The JG M4 S-System comes equipped with a full metal integrated RIS system has a top sight rail extending all the way back to the rear sight, making it one of the most versatile AEGs that JG manufactures. Topping the chronograph at over 450 FPS, the M4 S-System has a muzzle velocity that overpowers the likes of $300-$450 Tokyo Marui and Classic Army AEGs. Its JG enhanced full metal gearbox & super high-torque motor set-up has been thoroughly designed to ensure that no matter WHERE you play, IF you play with the JG M4 S-System, it will dominate the Airsoft field or arena. Also, the JG M4 S-System features adjustable hop up, adjustable rear sights, and a rear-retractable 4-point stock for extra comfort. With full Tokyo Marui parts compatibility and many other aftermarket upgrade parts compatibility, this AEG can be easily customized and upgraded. The rail system further adds onto the upgrade potential of this gun, since you can add an almost endless amount of tactical accessories to it, including flashlights, scopes, lasers, and grenade launchers.", "text": "JG Airsoft M4 S-System Full Metal Gearbox Desert Tan AEG Rifle w/ Integrated RIS and High Performance Tight Bore Barrel - Newest Enhanced Model The JG M4 S-System is one of the highest-rated AEGs we've EVER carried here at LA Wings Inc, and for good reason. It is the quintessential \"Player's AEG\" - it comes with everything you need and nothing you don't. For the all-new enhanced production run model, JG has done the impossible. They've re-worked and improved what MANY players thought was already a PERFECT AEG. So this new model, available EXCLUSIVELY at Airsoft Megastore, comes to you straight from the manufacturer having been re-designed from the ground up to be even more powerful, more accurate, more versatile, more reliable, and yet STILL be one of the most affordable high performance AEGs on the planet. The JG M4 S-System comes equipped with a full metal integrated RIS system has a top sight rail extending all the way back to the rear sight, making it one of the most versatile AEGs that JG manufactures. Topping the chronograph at over 450 FPS, the M4 S-System has a muzzle velocity that overpowers the likes of $300-$450 Tokyo Marui and Classic Army AEGs. Its JG enhanced full metal gearbox & super high-torque motor set-up has been thoroughly designed to ensure that no matter WHERE you play, IF you play with the JG M4 S-System, it will dominate the Airsoft field or arena. Also, the JG M4 S-System features adjustable hop up, adjustable rear sights, and a rear-retractable 4-point stock for extra comfort. With full Tokyo Marui parts compatibility and many other aftermarket upgrade parts compatibility, this AEG can be easily customized and upgraded. The rail system further adds onto the upgrade potential of this gun, since you can add an almost endless amount of tactical accessories to it, including flashlights, scopes, lasers, and grenade launchers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51X-1ZRnLFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DN87HC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Rifles"]], "price": 179.95}}
