{"item_id": "B005DQG6Y0", "title": "Vanguard Equalizer 1QS Prone Pivot Pod (Black)", "description": "An upgrade on Vanguard's popular Equalizer 1 pivoting bipod, Equalizer 1QS has a picatinny rail system that allows shooters to attach and detach firearms faster than ever. Equalizer 1QS is designed for prone position shooting.Built for SpeedUnless you're at the range, your target is most likely on the move, which is why Equalizer 1QS gets you into position swiftly and safely. Hunters especially appreciate its quick leg deployment; Its Pull-and-Position leg adjustment system lets you quickly reposition with one simple motion. And Equalizer 1QS comes with a bonus picatinny rail quick shoe for quick attachment to other firearms.Flexible Under FireEqualizer 1QS is all about versatility and comfort while shooting. It has a pivot tilt of 0 to 5 degrees and a -30 to +30-degree swing angle. It also takes on an array of terrains with feet that convert from metal spikes, for digging into the dirt, to rubber for rocky surfaces. A buffer spring reduces shock and vibration while providing a solid shooting base.", "text": "Vanguard Equalizer 1QS Prone Pivot Pod (Black) An upgrade on Vanguard's popular Equalizer 1 pivoting bipod, Equalizer 1QS has a picatinny rail system that allows shooters to attach and detach firearms faster than ever. Equalizer 1QS is designed for prone position shooting.Built for SpeedUnless you're at the range, your target is most likely on the move, which is why Equalizer 1QS gets you into position swiftly and safely. Hunters especially appreciate its quick leg deployment; Its Pull-and-Position leg adjustment system lets you quickly reposition with one simple motion. And Equalizer 1QS comes with a bonus picatinny rail quick shoe for quick attachment to other firearms.Flexible Under FireEqualizer 1QS is all about versatility and comfort while shooting. It has a pivot tilt of 0 to 5 degrees and a -30 to +30-degree swing angle. It also takes on an array of terrains with feet that convert from metal spikes, for digging into the dirt, to rubber for rocky surfaces. A buffer spring reduces shock and vibration while providing a solid shooting base.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-PtP3hPVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DQG6Y0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Vanguard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 80.05}}
{"item_id": "B005DREFOM", "title": "Walkstool Steady - Walkstool Supplemental Stabilizer with Case", "description": "Walkstool Steady is made with three kinds of users in mind: People using Walkstool outdoors with the risk of having the rubber feet sinking into the ground €\" typically hunters. Professional users working on slippery surfaces with the need of making Walkstool even more sturdy and reliable. Those in need of a heavy duty portable seat that will hold their weight for years to come. Walkstool Steady can be used with all Walkstool Comfort models and is normally being delivered pre-set for being used with Walkstool Comfort 55cm/22in. This setting can easily be changed by the user according to the Walkstool model.", "text": "Walkstool Steady - Walkstool Supplemental Stabilizer with Case Walkstool Steady is made with three kinds of users in mind: People using Walkstool outdoors with the risk of having the rubber feet sinking into the ground €\" typically hunters. Professional users working on slippery surfaces with the need of making Walkstool even more sturdy and reliable. Those in need of a heavy duty portable seat that will hold their weight for years to come. Walkstool Steady can be used with all Walkstool Comfort models and is normally being delivered pre-set for being used with Walkstool Comfort 55cm/22in. This setting can easily be changed by the user according to the Walkstool model.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41dQDXwFz0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DREFOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walkstool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Stools"]], "price": 23.95}}
