{"item_id": "B005DS7DPO", "title": "Hunting Deer & Game Hauler Cart 500 lb. Capacity", "description": "Hunting hauler cart for transporting game weighing up to 500 lbs. Includes 2 buckle straps to secure game. Saves the pain and strain of trying to drag trophy game out of the woods. Made with a heavy duty 3/4\" steel axle, 18.5\" solid rubber tires, steel rims, steel spokes, and a steel tube frame. Quick wire-spring assembly does not require tools. Folds compact for storage between uses. Includes (2) buckle straps. Finished in a durable dark hunter brown .Game Cart by Discount Ramps specifications - 26\" Axle width (24\" wheel to wheel). Tapered game hauling platform base measures 27\"L x 19.75\"W. Upright platform measures 27\"L x 18\"W, and the top handle measures 17\"L x 15.75\"W with rounded push/pull grip end. The length from handle edge to base platform edge measures 65\" diagonal. Folds compact with wheels removed to 27\"L x 26\"W x 8.5\"H for storage.", "text": "Hunting Deer & Game Hauler Cart 500 lb. Capacity Hunting hauler cart for transporting game weighing up to 500 lbs. Includes 2 buckle straps to secure game. Saves the pain and strain of trying to drag trophy game out of the woods. Made with a heavy duty 3/4\" steel axle, 18.5\" solid rubber tires, steel rims, steel spokes, and a steel tube frame. Quick wire-spring assembly does not require tools. Folds compact for storage between uses. Includes (2) buckle straps. Finished in a durable dark hunter brown .Game Cart by Discount Ramps specifications - 26\" Axle width (24\" wheel to wheel). Tapered game hauling platform base measures 27\"L x 19.75\"W. Upright platform measures 27\"L x 18\"W, and the top handle measures 17\"L x 15.75\"W with rounded push/pull grip end. The length from handle edge to base platform edge measures 65\" diagonal. Folds compact with wheels removed to 27\"L x 26\"W x 8.5\"H for storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YiIe5GgnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DS7DPO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rage Powersports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Carts"]], "price": 89.98}}
{"item_id": "B005DTEM2U", "title": "Camp Chef Sherpa Table", "description": "Keep your camp super organized with Camp Chef's Sherpa Table! A rollout aluminum tabletop attaches to the top of the frame, stows away in a side pouch when not in use and telescoping legs extend for easy set up. Four padded, removable bags keep your gear in order and stow away inside. One is lined and can be used as a cooler, to keep your food warm or even as a sink. The storage bags remove and the divider unzips so that you can customize your storage options. Unzip the bottom divider and you can store a stove inside( any Camp Chef Mountain Series stove or Ranger will fit) It's safe to say that the Sherpa Camp Table has everything, including the kitchen sink.Unzip the lower divider to store your stove.Material: 600 denier fabric.Size: 15 3/4\" x 27\" x 18 1/4\" (with legs collapsed).Table height with legs extended - 28\".Table top dimensions: 27\" x 17\".Individual organizer bag dimensions: 12\" x 11\" x 6 1/2\".", "text": "Camp Chef Sherpa Table Keep your camp super organized with Camp Chef's Sherpa Table! A rollout aluminum tabletop attaches to the top of the frame, stows away in a side pouch when not in use and telescoping legs extend for easy set up. Four padded, removable bags keep your gear in order and stow away inside. One is lined and can be used as a cooler, to keep your food warm or even as a sink. The storage bags remove and the divider unzips so that you can customize your storage options. Unzip the bottom divider and you can store a stove inside( any Camp Chef Mountain Series stove or Ranger will fit) It's safe to say that the Sherpa Camp Table has everything, including the kitchen sink.Unzip the lower divider to store your stove.Material: 600 denier fabric.Size: 15 3/4\" x 27\" x 18 1/4\" (with legs collapsed).Table height with legs extended - 28\".Table top dimensions: 27\" x 17\".Individual organizer bag dimensions: 12\" x 11\" x 6 1/2\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415V2NToKxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DTEM2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camp Chef", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Tables"]], "price": 86.99}}
