{"item_id": "B005DVA592", "title": "Cygolite Expilion 170 USB Rechargeable Headlight", "description": "The ExpiliOn 170 outshines non rechargeable commuter lights by using a powerful Cree LED to fire 170 lumens on any commute. With a cost saving USB rechargeable Li-IOn battery stick that can be swapped-on-the-fly for longer run times, this 4 mode handlebar mounted commuter light brings high powered rechargeable illumination to savvy commuters that need to see and be seen.", "text": "Cygolite Expilion 170 USB Rechargeable Headlight The ExpiliOn 170 outshines non rechargeable commuter lights by using a powerful Cree LED to fire 170 lumens on any commute. With a cost saving USB rechargeable Li-IOn battery stick that can be swapped-on-the-fly for longer run times, this 4 mode handlebar mounted commuter light brings high powered rechargeable illumination to savvy commuters that need to see and be seen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419iv4RhPxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DVA592.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005DVDR88", "title": "Shimano 2013 Ultegra SPD-SL Carbon Road Bike Pedals - PD-6700", "description": "Lightweight Carbon composite pedal body for lower weight. SPD-SL features designs proven in Pro Tour racing. Extra-wide platforms, wide bearing placements, quick entry bindings and low profile designs transfer your power directly to the pedals. Current SPD-SL design with a wider, more stable platform without affecting cornering clearance. Wide placement bearing system and stainless steel body cover / cleat glide-plate. Single-sided binding engagement with adjustable cleat tension. Low profile, sole axle distance: 14.5mm.", "text": "Shimano 2013 Ultegra SPD-SL Carbon Road Bike Pedals - PD-6700 Lightweight Carbon composite pedal body for lower weight. SPD-SL features designs proven in Pro Tour racing. Extra-wide platforms, wide bearing placements, quick entry bindings and low profile designs transfer your power directly to the pedals. Current SPD-SL design with a wider, more stable platform without affecting cornering clearance. Wide placement bearing system and stainless steel body cover / cleat glide-plate. Single-sided binding engagement with adjustable cleat tension. Low profile, sole axle distance: 14.5mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415HuHDq8hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DVDR88.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]]}}
