{"item_id": "B005DZNCGG", "title": "Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals", "description": "To cut down on cost, the Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals use a bushing in place of needles for the inner bearing. You'll also mind that there's less machining to the aluminum body then with the 3 Pedal. And while this translates into a 20g penalty and slightly more friction, you're still going to enjoy the same venerable platform shape, 10mm adjustable traction pins, and forged spindle. Also, like the 3 pedal, an outer cartridge bearing rides on the scm435 chromoly spindle for excellent strength when riding either DH or freeride. The durable and stiff aluminum plates are replaceable if they get banged up, or if pins are ripped out after one too many altercations with rocks. The Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals are available in the color Black with Silver plates.", "text": "Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals To cut down on cost, the Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals use a bushing in place of needles for the inner bearing. You'll also mind that there's less machining to the aluminum body then with the 3 Pedal. And while this translates into a 20g penalty and slightly more friction, you're still going to enjoy the same venerable platform shape, 10mm adjustable traction pins, and forged spindle. Also, like the 3 pedal, an outer cartridge bearing rides on the scm435 chromoly spindle for excellent strength when riding either DH or freeride. The durable and stiff aluminum plates are replaceable if they get banged up, or if pins are ripped out after one too many altercations with rocks. The Crank Brothers 5050 2 Pedals are available in the color Black with Silver plates.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pcGXlLrwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005DZNCGG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crank Brothers", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 63.0}}
{"item_id": "B005E0U9YS", "title": "Plastic Water Can - 5 Gallon, Desert Sand", "description": "The world-renowned heavy-duty plastic, tan, desert tan 5 gallon can for water provides optimal storage for your water. Designed to meet military specifications, the water can is for personal and professional use. Rather in the field or at home let these water cans provide you with the confidence and reliability you deserve.. Sold as 1 .", "text": "Plastic Water Can - 5 Gallon, Desert Sand The world-renowned heavy-duty plastic, tan, desert tan 5 gallon can for water provides optimal storage for your water. Designed to meet military specifications, the water can is for personal and professional use. Rather in the field or at home let these water cans provide you with the confidence and reliability you deserve.. Sold as 1 .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MbF8yJzEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005E0U9YS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LC Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 39.95}}
