{"item_id": "B005E0YS5E", "title": "Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup, Emergency Zone Brand", "description": "Perfect for camping, hiking or just carrying in your purse. The cup collapses and a tight cover to keep clean and dry. When you need a cup, simply take off the cover and expand it out to full size. Holds 4 oz. Food grade stainless steel.", "text": "Stainless Steel Collapsible Cup, Emergency Zone Brand Perfect for camping, hiking or just carrying in your purse. The cup collapses and a tight cover to keep clean and dry. When you need a cup, simply take off the cover and expand it out to full size. Holds 4 oz. Food grade stainless steel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CR%2BmIzMnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005E0YS5E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 4.54}}
