{"item_id": "B005E8JQKI", "title": "Duck Commander Men's Duck Commander Triple Threat Duck Call", "description": "The patented triple-reed system on this call replicates the mallard hen's quack, feed and hail calls to perfection. It's easy to clean, tune and operate. Its unique triple-reed design excels even when wet. Body made from tough polycarbonate. USA.", "text": "Duck Commander Men's Duck Commander Triple Threat Duck Call The patented triple-reed system on this call replicates the mallard hen's quack, feed and hail calls to perfection. It's easy to clean, tune and operate. Its unique triple-reed design excels even when wet. Body made from tough polycarbonate. USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31FGI-eluWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005E8JQKI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Duck Commander", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Duck"]], "price": 32.57}}
{"item_id": "B005E8RQLE", "title": "Israeli Adult Gas Mask with Nato Filter and Hydration Canteen New", "description": "Complete hydration and gas mask system. This is the gas mask system issued to all Israeli citizens by the Israeli army for the threat of nuclear, biological and/or chemical attacks. Mask comes equipped with large eye-openings, water intake port, tube and canteen. The system allows the user liquids without having to remove the mask and risk exposure while hydrating.", "text": "Israeli Adult Gas Mask with Nato Filter and Hydration Canteen New Complete hydration and gas mask system. This is the gas mask system issued to all Israeli citizens by the Israeli army for the threat of nuclear, biological and/or chemical attacks. Mask comes equipped with large eye-openings, water intake port, tube and canteen. The system allows the user liquids without having to remove the mask and risk exposure while hydrating.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ZIUkNcdL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005E8RQLE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "IDF", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 45.0}}
