{"item_id": "B005EADU8K", "title": "First Aid IFAK Folding Utility Survival Knife (5-Pack) - Black", "description": "It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches Currently used by: The United States Military, Survival Kit Manufactures, Bread Manufacturing for top slitting, (recommended by Health Inspectors) Electricians, Painters/ Detailers, Sewing Industry, There are so may uses for it, and more and more become evident everyday.", "text": "First Aid IFAK Folding Utility Survival Knife (5-Pack) - Black It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches Currently used by: The United States Military, Survival Kit Manufactures, Bread Manufacturing for top slitting, (recommended by Health Inspectors) Electricians, Painters/ Detailers, Sewing Industry, There are so may uses for it, and more and more become evident everyday.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pq6O3baAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EADU8K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dermasafe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 10.0}}
{"item_id": "B005EAGCN0", "title": "First Aid IFAK Folding Utility SWISS Steel Survival SERE Saw (2-Pack)", "description": "This Folding Utility Saw uses a High Speed Steel saw blade that folds into a compact handle. It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches. Uses include a pocket size tree pruner, hobby saw, carving instrument, handymans' helper, sheet rock saw and an escape artist tool. This saw is great for the outdoorsman and perfect for survival kits.", "text": "First Aid IFAK Folding Utility SWISS Steel Survival SERE Saw (2-Pack) This Folding Utility Saw uses a High Speed Steel saw blade that folds into a compact handle. It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches. Uses include a pocket size tree pruner, hobby saw, carving instrument, handymans' helper, sheet rock saw and an escape artist tool. This saw is great for the outdoorsman and perfect for survival kits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pQIXtzgAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EAGCN0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Dermasafe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 7.99}}
{"item_id": "B005ED102U", "title": "Para Cord Brands SBDEM Survival Bracelet Desert Camo Size Medium with Hand Tied Military Para-Cord Construction", "description": "Para Cord Survival Bracelet. Desert camo. Size: Medium-8\" diameter.Hand tied military Para-Cord construction. Enables you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. One inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord. 5/8\" curved side release buckles for maximum comfort, convenience and strength. Packaged in zippered plastic bag. Made in USA.", "text": "Para Cord Brands SBDEM Survival Bracelet Desert Camo Size Medium with Hand Tied Military Para-Cord Construction Para Cord Survival Bracelet. Desert camo. Size: Medium-8\" diameter.Hand tied military Para-Cord construction. Enables you to carry several feet of Para-Cord that can be used in an emergency for countless survival applications. One inch of your wrist diameter equals approximately one foot of Para-Cord. 5/8\" curved side release buckles for maximum comfort, convenience and strength. Packaged in zippered plastic bag. Made in USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51B9LOfor5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ED102U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LUOS CULTURAL GOODS (USA SELLER)", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 4.5}}
