{"item_id": "B005EFLBUY", "title": "Monogrip Rubber Grips Taurus Tracker", "description": "Description:Monogrip Revolver Rubber GripsOne-piece rubber grips for revolvers. Grips slide on the frame from the bottom, a special steel stirrup device clips over stockpin or bottom strap, grip screws to stirrup. Orthopedic handshape, ambidextrous palm swells and a generous recoil shoulder. Relieved for speed loaders. Black color with cobblestone texture.Additional Information:", "text": "Monogrip Rubber Grips Taurus Tracker Description:Monogrip Revolver Rubber GripsOne-piece rubber grips for revolvers. Grips slide on the frame from the bottom, a special steel stirrup device clips over stockpin or bottom strap, grip screws to stirrup. Orthopedic handshape, ambidextrous palm swells and a generous recoil shoulder. Relieved for speed loaders. Black color with cobblestone texture.Additional Information:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tyKvgBMBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EFLBUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hogue", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 20.59}}
{"item_id": "B005EFUNA8", "title": "BudK Russian WWII M52 Steel Helmet", "description": "One of our most popular items. An army helmet that's great for kids of any ages. These helmets were once worn by real soldiers. Includes steel pot, helmet liner with suspension and chin strap.", "text": "BudK Russian WWII M52 Steel Helmet One of our most popular items. An army helmet that's great for kids of any ages. These helmets were once worn by real soldiers. Includes steel pot, helmet liner with suspension and chin strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qTXb3CEYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EFUNA8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.95}}
