{"item_id": "B005EHPVQW", "title": "Sawyer Products PointOne Squeeze Water Filtration System", "description": "The new Sawyer PointOne squeeze water filter is one of the lightest and most versatile filtration systems available. With a total field weight of only 3-ounces this compact filter rolls up to take minimal space in your pack. Simply fill up the included 1-liter pouch at a lake, stream or river, screw the filter directly onto the pouch and either squeeze the bag and filter water into your water bottle. The push-pull cap built into the water filter lets you conveniently drink directly from the filter to keep things simple. For greater versatility you can attach the filter directly onto a standard threaded water bottle, including most 2-liter bottles. The Squeeze Filter is perfect for traveling abroad where the water source, including tap and bottled water, is compromised or questionable.", "text": "Sawyer Products PointOne Squeeze Water Filtration System The new Sawyer PointOne squeeze water filter is one of the lightest and most versatile filtration systems available. With a total field weight of only 3-ounces this compact filter rolls up to take minimal space in your pack. Simply fill up the included 1-liter pouch at a lake, stream or river, screw the filter directly onto the pouch and either squeeze the bag and filter water into your water bottle. The push-pull cap built into the water filter lets you conveniently drink directly from the filter to keep things simple. For greater versatility you can attach the filter directly onto a standard threaded water bottle, including most 2-liter bottles. The Squeeze Filter is perfect for traveling abroad where the water source, including tap and bottled water, is compromised or questionable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SJ5lM%2BhyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EHPVQW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Water Filters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EHQLUC", "title": "Round Welded Type 316 Stainless Steel Rings - Select from 12 Sizes - 5/8\" to 2-3/4\"", "description": "Available in these sizes (link diameter x inside diameter x outside diameter): 1/8 x 5/8 x 15/16\", 1/8 x 3/4 x 1-3/32\", 1/8 x 1 x 1-1/4\", 3/16 x 1 x 1-3/8\", 1/4 x 1 x 1-1/2\", 3/16 x 1-1/2 x 1-7/8\", 3/16 x 2 x 2-3/8\", 1/4 x 1-1/2 x 2\", 1/4 x 2 x 2-1/2\", 5/16 x 1-1/2 x 2-1/8\", 5/16 x 2 x 2-5/8\", 3/8 x 2-1/2 x 3-1/4\".", "text": "Round Welded Type 316 Stainless Steel Rings - Select from 12 Sizes - 5/8\" to 2-3/4\" Available in these sizes (link diameter x inside diameter x outside diameter): 1/8 x 5/8 x 15/16\", 1/8 x 3/4 x 1-3/32\", 1/8 x 1 x 1-1/4\", 3/16 x 1 x 1-3/8\", 1/4 x 1 x 1-1/2\", 3/16 x 1-1/2 x 1-7/8\", 3/16 x 2 x 2-3/8\", 1/4 x 1-1/2 x 2\", 1/4 x 2 x 2-1/2\", 5/16 x 1-1/2 x 2-1/8\", 5/16 x 2 x 2-5/8\", 3/8 x 2-1/2 x 3-1/4\".", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FuzUi2AjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EHQLUC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Hardware"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EIMD7G", "title": "2 pcs Strike Industries Cobra Series Trigger Guards (2 pcs: Ambi+Left) for AR15 AR 15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle *** FREE shipping when checkout ***", "description": "----------IMPORTANT------------This product is available in Black, Flat Dark Earth, and Olive Drab COBRA Ambidextrous / Left (2 pcs) Polymer Trigger Guard Combo - 2 Pack - Model - COBRA-01-ALCobra series trigger guards are designed as direct replacements to the standard AR trigger guard. Our trigger guards feature a deeper angle rather than a straight linear line. This gives the operator more room when wearing gloves and for cold weather environments. Also eliminates the dreaded gap between the pistol grip and trigger guard.There are four models available, classic, ambidextrous, left only, and right only. Sold in packages of two, package 01 includes both ambidextrous and left only trigger guards. Package 02 includes both straight and right only trigger guards. Our ambidextrous, right only, and left only trigger guards feature our unique finger rests.Note that the Cobra series trigger guards are non-folding. All mounting hardware included.", "text": "2 pcs Strike Industries Cobra Series Trigger Guards (2 pcs: Ambi+Left) for AR15 AR 15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle *** FREE shipping when checkout *** ----------IMPORTANT------------This product is available in Black, Flat Dark Earth, and Olive Drab COBRA Ambidextrous / Left (2 pcs) Polymer Trigger Guard Combo - 2 Pack - Model - COBRA-01-ALCobra series trigger guards are designed as direct replacements to the standard AR trigger guard. Our trigger guards feature a deeper angle rather than a straight linear line. This gives the operator more room when wearing gloves and for cold weather environments. Also eliminates the dreaded gap between the pistol grip and trigger guard.There are four models available, classic, ambidextrous, left only, and right only. Sold in packages of two, package 01 includes both ambidextrous and left only trigger guards. Package 02 includes both straight and right only trigger guards. Our ambidextrous, right only, and left only trigger guards feature our unique finger rests.Note that the Cobra series trigger guards are non-folding. All mounting hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51qBwRwWZsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EIMD7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Protective Gear", "Catcher's Leg Guards"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B005EMBEI6", "title": "ASR Outdoor Heavy Duty Titanium Ice Pick", "description": "Titanium Ice Pick by ASR Outdoor is a useful tool made of solid 6AL4V titanium.It is tough, lightweight, and will never rust. This rod has a textured handle and tapers down to a very sharp point.This tool may just save your life, so make sure to bring one with you on your cold outdoor expeditions.", "text": "ASR Outdoor Heavy Duty Titanium Ice Pick Titanium Ice Pick by ASR Outdoor is a useful tool made of solid 6AL4V titanium.It is tough, lightweight, and will never rust. This rod has a textured handle and tapers down to a very sharp point.This tool may just save your life, so make sure to bring one with you on your cold outdoor expeditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qGwV9FngL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EMBEI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ASR Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Snow & Ice Equipment", "Ice Tools"]], "price": 44.97}}
{"item_id": "B005EMILVO", "title": "WatchFire Camper's Hatchet", "description": "The WatchFirCamper's Hatchet is 10\" in overall length. The stainless steel blade has a black finish. It has a skid proof black handle. This knife comes with a sheath.", "text": "WatchFire Camper's Hatchet The WatchFirCamper's Hatchet is 10\" in overall length. The stainless steel blade has a black finish. It has a skid proof black handle. This knife comes with a sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TfCpEFaYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EMILVO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "WatchFire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 13.32}}
{"item_id": "B005EMYUNC", "title": "Fyxation Gates BMX Platform Pedal", "description": "The Fyxation Gates pedal is a classic BMX style platform pedal made out of high impact nylon and built to take abuse. These pedals work great with most foot retention systems/pedal straps (FRS) on the market.", "text": "Fyxation Gates BMX Platform Pedal The Fyxation Gates pedal is a classic BMX style platform pedal made out of high impact nylon and built to take abuse. These pedals work great with most foot retention systems/pedal straps (FRS) on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nvUNAF6hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EMYUNC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fyxation", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B005EOD6JE", "title": "Guard Dog Security Diablo 160 Lumen Tactical Flashlight with Stun Gun", "description": "A particularly handy device for military and law enforcement professionals, as well as security-minded homeowners, the Guard Dog Diablo is a first of its kind, combining the hard-case durability of a tactical field light with the added security of a stun gun. The light shines at an impressive 160 lumens, while the concealed stun gun offers 4,500,000 volts of power, capable of fending off any assailant. With patented inner-stun technology, the powered probes are completely embedded within the outer layer of the flashlight. A Type III aircraft grade aluminum alloy body with anti-roll design is remarkably durable, as is the 100,000-hour bulb.Note:The flashlight must be fully charged for 8 hours prior to use.Once the Charging Cord is successfully inserted, the Charging Indicator will turn redThe light should remain red during the charging period.A one-sided spark when test firing is normal. Both probes will spark upon contact. To test, carefully place a piece of paper across both probes and activate the stun gun to see both jumping simultaneouslyFeatures160-lumen tactical flashlightConcealed 4,500,000-volt stun gunHidden inner probesType III aircraft grade aluminum alloy bodyShock-proof case with anti-roll designEnhanced reflector system for optimum brightnessAccidental discharge security switchSwift, one-hand operation of all functionsRigid handle gripIncludes nylon carry case and fully rechargeable battery6.75-inch lengthPatented designAbout Guard DogHeadquartered in Winter Springs, Florida. Guard Dog Security produces security and protection devices for everyday use, making home and personal security convenient and affordable for everyone.", "text": "Guard Dog Security Diablo 160 Lumen Tactical Flashlight with Stun Gun A particularly handy device for military and law enforcement professionals, as well as security-minded homeowners, the Guard Dog Diablo is a first of its kind, combining the hard-case durability of a tactical field light with the added security of a stun gun. The light shines at an impressive 160 lumens, while the concealed stun gun offers 4,500,000 volts of power, capable of fending off any assailant. With patented inner-stun technology, the powered probes are completely embedded within the outer layer of the flashlight. A Type III aircraft grade aluminum alloy body with anti-roll design is remarkably durable, as is the 100,000-hour bulb.Note:The flashlight must be fully charged for 8 hours prior to use.Once the Charging Cord is successfully inserted, the Charging Indicator will turn redThe light should remain red during the charging period.A one-sided spark when test firing is normal. Both probes will spark upon contact. To test, carefully place a piece of paper across both probes and activate the stun gun to see both jumping simultaneouslyFeatures160-lumen tactical flashlightConcealed 4,500,000-volt stun gunHidden inner probesType III aircraft grade aluminum alloy bodyShock-proof case with anti-roll designEnhanced reflector system for optimum brightnessAccidental discharge security switchSwift, one-hand operation of all functionsRigid handle gripIncludes nylon carry case and fully rechargeable battery6.75-inch lengthPatented designAbout Guard DogHeadquartered in Winter Springs, Florida. Guard Dog Security produces security and protection devices for everyday use, making home and personal security convenient and affordable for everyone.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413jAumNiOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EOD6JE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Guard Dog Security", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Stun Guns"]], "price": 29.99}}
