{"item_id": "B005EOV1QE", "title": "UTG 4x32 Compact CQB Scope with Large Field of View and Bright Vision and Quick Detach", "description": "This compact scope from UTG is optimized for CQB (close quarters combat) and versatility in all light conditions with dual red/green illumination. With a 32-millimeter objective lens, 4X magnification, and accommodating eye relief, the CQB Scope offers detail without sacrificing the overview. The scope comes equipped with a mil-dot range finding reticle to optimize your shooting performance and the emerald coated lens offers up a crystal clear view. Adjustments are precise and consistent thanks to premium zero lockable and zero resettable target turrets with 1/4 MOA per click adjustment. Built on the True Strength Platform with a one-inch tube, this scope is sealed and nitrogen filled for a shockproof, fogproof, and rainproof performance. The scope comes equipped with a built-in angled sunshade, high-quality flip-open lens caps, and quick-detachable rings. The UTG 4X32 CQB scope carries a lifetime warranty.Finger adjustable windage and elevations knobs.Low profile lever lock with maximum strength QD rings (patent pending)Side wheel red/green illumination--flexible multi-level side wheel red/green illumination adjustment for most versatile weather/lighting conditions.Features:Large Field of view for optimum critical CQB missionQuick detach ringsTrue Strength Platform: sealed and nitrogen filled, shockproof, fogproof and rainproofOne-inch tubeEmerald coated lensPremium zero lockable and zero resettable target turretsConsistent and precise 1/4 MOA per click adjustmentRange estimating mil-dot reticleRed/green dual illuminationBuilt-in angled sunshadeHigh quality flip-open lens capsQuick-detachable ringsLifetime warrantySpecificationsMagnification: 4XTube Diameter: 1 inchObjective Diameter: 32 millimetersField of View @ 100 yards: 27 feetEye Relief: 3.8 inchesExit Pupil: 8 millimetersClick Value @100 yards: 1/4 inchLength: 206 millimetersWeight: 11.6 ouncesParallax Setting: 100 yardsBatteries: CR1620 3VSmart Spherical Structure(SSS)Simplified and strengthened inner/outer tube interaction for the most effective telescopic functions. SSS with height synchronized joint motion achieves the most responsive, precise, and reliable W/E adjustment.", "text": "UTG 4x32 Compact CQB Scope with Large Field of View and Bright Vision and Quick Detach This compact scope from UTG is optimized for CQB (close quarters combat) and versatility in all light conditions with dual red/green illumination. With a 32-millimeter objective lens, 4X magnification, and accommodating eye relief, the CQB Scope offers detail without sacrificing the overview. The scope comes equipped with a mil-dot range finding reticle to optimize your shooting performance and the emerald coated lens offers up a crystal clear view. Adjustments are precise and consistent thanks to premium zero lockable and zero resettable target turrets with 1/4 MOA per click adjustment. Built on the True Strength Platform with a one-inch tube, this scope is sealed and nitrogen filled for a shockproof, fogproof, and rainproof performance. The scope comes equipped with a built-in angled sunshade, high-quality flip-open lens caps, and quick-detachable rings. The UTG 4X32 CQB scope carries a lifetime warranty.Finger adjustable windage and elevations knobs.Low profile lever lock with maximum strength QD rings (patent pending)Side wheel red/green illumination--flexible multi-level side wheel red/green illumination adjustment for most versatile weather/lighting conditions.Features:Large Field of view for optimum critical CQB missionQuick detach ringsTrue Strength Platform: sealed and nitrogen filled, shockproof, fogproof and rainproofOne-inch tubeEmerald coated lensPremium zero lockable and zero resettable target turretsConsistent and precise 1/4 MOA per click adjustmentRange estimating mil-dot reticleRed/green dual illuminationBuilt-in angled sunshadeHigh quality flip-open lens capsQuick-detachable ringsLifetime warrantySpecificationsMagnification: 4XTube Diameter: 1 inchObjective Diameter: 32 millimetersField of View @ 100 yards: 27 feetEye Relief: 3.8 inchesExit Pupil: 8 millimetersClick Value @100 yards: 1/4 inchLength: 206 millimetersWeight: 11.6 ouncesParallax Setting: 100 yardsBatteries: CR1620 3VSmart Spherical Structure(SSS)Simplified and strengthened inner/outer tube interaction for the most effective telescopic functions. SSS with height synchronized joint motion achieves the most responsive, precise, and reliable W/E adjustment.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41e9Xg%2BD9%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EOV1QE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.97}}
{"item_id": "B005EOV204", "title": "UTG 3X Magnifier with Max Strength QD Picatinny Mount and High Profile Riser Adaptor", "description": "2nd Gen UTG 3X Magnifier with Max Strength Lever Lock Quick Detach Picatinny Mount and Innovative Multi-position Riser Adaptor for Demanding Quick Aiming CQB Applications with Adjustable Height and Eye Relief", "text": "UTG 3X Magnifier with Max Strength QD Picatinny Mount and High Profile Riser Adaptor 2nd Gen UTG 3X Magnifier with Max Strength Lever Lock Quick Detach Picatinny Mount and Innovative Multi-position Riser Adaptor for Demanding Quick Aiming CQB Applications with Adjustable Height and Eye Relief", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419viuwHlzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EOV204.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EOV2A4", "title": "UTG 0.21 x 15-Inch Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock", "description": "UTG Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock Φ5.3MM(0.21\")X15\"- Certified by California Department of Justice, Heavy Duty Hardened Steel Alloy Construction for Max. Strength & Security, Universal Design Compatible w/Most Long Rifles and Pistols, Easy Installation", "text": "UTG 0.21 x 15-Inch Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock UTG Ultra Strong Firearm Cable Lock Φ5.3MM(0.21\")X15\"- Certified by California Department of Justice, Heavy Duty Hardened Steel Alloy Construction for Max. Strength & Security, Universal Design Compatible w/Most Long Rifles and Pistols, Easy Installation", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qlW2QJXmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EOV2A4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 4.9}}
{"item_id": "B005EP95ZC", "title": "Topeak 2011 Update Universal Chain Tool", "description": "The Universal Chain Tool includes a chain hook to make chain repair easier, is compatible with all single speed and most multi-speed chains, including 10 speed hollow pin chain. (Not compatible with 11 speed chains.)", "text": "Topeak 2011 Update Universal Chain Tool The Universal Chain Tool includes a chain hook to make chain repair easier, is compatible with all single speed and most multi-speed chains, including 10 speed hollow pin chain. (Not compatible with 11 speed chains.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nfn3uzsSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EP95ZC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B005EP9AQQ", "title": "Topeak MondoPack Clip-On Quick Release Seat Mount Side-Opening Bike Bag", "description": "The MondoPack series is designed for adventures when you still need an aerodynamic bag. Two side opening panels provide easy access to all your gear and feature inner mesh pockets to keep items like keys and small tools in place while riding. An excellent bag for suspension bikes, folding bikes, endurance racers, randonnee, century and charity events, day touring or for cyclists who like to carry extra gear.The QuickClick system is built into every bag they make.It's the ultimate in convenience and security. QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories.A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure, the QuickClick system is the ultimate in convenience.QuickClick with Seatpost Strap (F25)See also the MondoPack Hydro if you need carry a bottleAdded features: 3M reflective strip and safety light clipFits 25.4-34.9 mm seatpostsLarge, dual side access main compartment for lightweight jacket, inner tubes, tools, etc1200 Denier nylon material is highly wear resistant", "text": "Topeak MondoPack Clip-On Quick Release Seat Mount Side-Opening Bike Bag The MondoPack series is designed for adventures when you still need an aerodynamic bag. Two side opening panels provide easy access to all your gear and feature inner mesh pockets to keep items like keys and small tools in place while riding. An excellent bag for suspension bikes, folding bikes, endurance racers, randonnee, century and charity events, day touring or for cyclists who like to carry extra gear.The QuickClick system is built into every bag they make.It's the ultimate in convenience and security. QuickClick is Topeak's proprietary quick release mounting system that allows fast and easy tool-free mounting and removal of QuickClick equipped bags, tools, lights and accessories.A simple slide and click and the bag is secure. To remove, a simple push of a button unlocks the system for easy removal. Fast, easy and secure, the QuickClick system is the ultimate in convenience.QuickClick with Seatpost Strap (F25)See also the MondoPack Hydro if you need carry a bottleAdded features: 3M reflective strip and safety light clipFits 25.4-34.9 mm seatpostsLarge, dual side access main compartment for lightweight jacket, inner tubes, tools, etc1200 Denier nylon material is highly wear resistant", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KAHcFajxL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EP9AQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs", "Wedges"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EPRM4I", "title": "TETON Sports Celsius Regular -18 Degree C / 0 Degree F Flannel Lined Sleeping Bag (80\"x 33\")", "description": "The Celsius Regular bag has higher quality materials and construction than most bags in its price category. Filled with SuperLoft Elite 4-channel hollow fiber insulation to keep out cold, the Celsius bag comes with all the bells and whistles usually found on more expensive bags: shoulder and zipper baffles, adjustable mummy hood, interior storage pocket, and an oxford nylon compression sack to pack it away when not in use. The internal storage pocket is sized for keys, wallet, watch and other valuables. Two Celsius Regular bags zip together with left and right side zippers.The bag is temperature rated to -18°C / 0°F which means it will be warm for all but extreme-winter camping.", "text": "TETON Sports Celsius Regular -18 Degree C / 0 Degree F Flannel Lined Sleeping Bag (80\"x 33\") The Celsius Regular bag has higher quality materials and construction than most bags in its price category. Filled with SuperLoft Elite 4-channel hollow fiber insulation to keep out cold, the Celsius bag comes with all the bells and whistles usually found on more expensive bags: shoulder and zipper baffles, adjustable mummy hood, interior storage pocket, and an oxford nylon compression sack to pack it away when not in use. The internal storage pocket is sized for keys, wallet, watch and other valuables. Two Celsius Regular bags zip together with left and right side zippers.The bag is temperature rated to -18°C / 0°F which means it will be warm for all but extreme-winter camping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tQI3eLzhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EPRM4I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 64.21}}
{"item_id": "B005EPRN9M", "title": "TETON Sports Sleeping Bag Liner (Mammoth, 91\"x 58\", 1.5 lbs)", "description": "This sleeping bag liner feels like a luxury sheet, is easy to insert in your bag, and quickly comes out for machine wash. Protect your bag from dirty feet and campfire smoke smells, while improving your comfort. Liners extend the life of your sleeping bag, and they are a must-have for multi-day trips or when parents and kids all pile into the huge Mammoth sleeping bag. Liners make cleanup after camp much easier, and this is one of the best liners out there for the price. This liner will improve the temperature rating of your sleeping bag by about ten Degrees.", "text": "TETON Sports Sleeping Bag Liner (Mammoth, 91\"x 58\", 1.5 lbs) This sleeping bag liner feels like a luxury sheet, is easy to insert in your bag, and quickly comes out for machine wash. Protect your bag from dirty feet and campfire smoke smells, while improving your comfort. Liners extend the life of your sleeping bag, and they are a must-have for multi-day trips or when parents and kids all pile into the huge Mammoth sleeping bag. Liners make cleanup after camp much easier, and this is one of the best liners out there for the price. This liner will improve the temperature rating of your sleeping bag by about ten Degrees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BJrwhVMmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EPRN9M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Bag Accessories", "Liners"]], "price": 31.99}}
{"item_id": "B005EPRNSI", "title": "TETON Sports Cot Organizer (39\"x 12\")", "description": "No matter the size of your tent, keeping your space organized, and keeping essential items within easy reach, makes for a more enjoyable camping trip. TETON Sports' cot organizer helps you do just that, hanging from the side of nearly any standard cot and storing keys, wallet, toothbrush, flashlight, books, phone, a beverage, TP, and other key items safely out of the way. It more or less becomes your own little camping bedside table, and is made of rugged 600-denier poly-canvas material for years of study use.Simple Velcro straps affix the organizer to your cot, and an elastic system keeps it taut.DetailsEasily attaches to most standard size cots measures 32 by 82 inches (W x D) and and largerFits side-by-side with TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Gun SleeveFleece-lined glasses pocket means you'll never step on your specs againDrink compartment with rigid base for stability and drain hole for condensation or spillsSturdy cord with quick-release clip keeps a toilet paper roll within easy reachDual bungee tensioners keep organizer taut no matter what you storeSwivel key tether prevents lost keys when it's time to strike campRugged 600-denier polyester canvas materialMeasures 39 by 12 inches (W x H)Lifetime WarrantyTETON Sports products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About TETON SportsTETON Sports was established in Utah, in 2005, with a goal of making a few crucial outdoor items, but making them very well. The company distributes through a handful of retailers, and maintains low overheard in order to keep its price points affordable, and has developed a small, but steadily growing, following of loyal repeat customers who appreciate its rugged, long-lasting camping and outdoor adventure gear.", "text": "TETON Sports Cot Organizer (39\"x 12\") No matter the size of your tent, keeping your space organized, and keeping essential items within easy reach, makes for a more enjoyable camping trip. TETON Sports' cot organizer helps you do just that, hanging from the side of nearly any standard cot and storing keys, wallet, toothbrush, flashlight, books, phone, a beverage, TP, and other key items safely out of the way. It more or less becomes your own little camping bedside table, and is made of rugged 600-denier poly-canvas material for years of study use.Simple Velcro straps affix the organizer to your cot, and an elastic system keeps it taut.DetailsEasily attaches to most standard size cots measures 32 by 82 inches (W x D) and and largerFits side-by-side with TETON Sports Outfitter XXL Gun SleeveFleece-lined glasses pocket means you'll never step on your specs againDrink compartment with rigid base for stability and drain hole for condensation or spillsSturdy cord with quick-release clip keeps a toilet paper roll within easy reachDual bungee tensioners keep organizer taut no matter what you storeSwivel key tether prevents lost keys when it's time to strike campRugged 600-denier polyester canvas materialMeasures 39 by 12 inches (W x H)Lifetime WarrantyTETON Sports products include a limited lifetime manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.About TETON SportsTETON Sports was established in Utah, in 2005, with a goal of making a few crucial outdoor items, but making them very well. The company distributes through a handful of retailers, and maintains low overheard in order to keep its price points affordable, and has developed a small, but steadily growing, following of loyal repeat customers who appreciate its rugged, long-lasting camping and outdoor adventure gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31j-yQ3kGTL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EPRNSI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B005ERO7QM", "title": "Pelican Products 1075 HardBack Case with Foam (1070-000-110)", "description": "Produced from a design partnership with BMW DesignWorks, the HardBack series cases are built with all the legendary features of a Pelican case - crush resistant, watertight to 3 feet and an automatic pressure equalization valve that prevents vacuum lock to make it easier to open at any altitude. In addition, all cases in the series offer anti-scratch foam inserts to add another layer of protection for delicate electronics. To ensure that they stay shut in tough conditions, they also sport stainless steel hardware and easy-snap latches. The Pelican 1075 HardBack Case is designed for netbooks and 10.1 inch tablets.", "text": "Pelican Products 1075 HardBack Case with Foam (1070-000-110) Produced from a design partnership with BMW DesignWorks, the HardBack series cases are built with all the legendary features of a Pelican case - crush resistant, watertight to 3 feet and an automatic pressure equalization valve that prevents vacuum lock to make it easier to open at any altitude. In addition, all cases in the series offer anti-scratch foam inserts to add another layer of protection for delicate electronics. To ensure that they stay shut in tough conditions, they also sport stainless steel hardware and easy-snap latches. The Pelican 1075 HardBack Case is designed for netbooks and 10.1 inch tablets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xlMDi1j-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ERO7QM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Pelican", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Dry Boxes"]], "price": 45.99}}
{"item_id": "B005ET5FJ8", "title": "Big Agnes Insulated Q-Core Sleeping Pad", "description": "The Insulated Q-Core's are light and compact three season pads with 3.5\"/9cm of thickness for extra comfort. Alternating I-Beam construction creates a smoother, more comfortable feel. Each pad individually inflated and tested. Add a closed cell foam pad in colder temperatures for extra insulation.", "text": "Big Agnes Insulated Q-Core Sleeping Pad The Insulated Q-Core's are light and compact three season pads with 3.5\"/9cm of thickness for extra comfort. Alternating I-Beam construction creates a smoother, more comfortable feel. Each pad individually inflated and tested. Add a closed cell foam pad in colder temperatures for extra insulation.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Ve5%2BTxyRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ET5FJ8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EU4ZKW", "title": "Condor Black 25 Round Shotgun Shotshell Reload Pouch MOLLE", "description": "The Condor Shotgun reload pouch can accommodate up to 25 shotgun shells. The pouch is an excellent fit to our shotgun scabbard.", "text": "Condor Black 25 Round Shotgun Shotshell Reload Pouch MOLLE The Condor Shotgun reload pouch can accommodate up to 25 shotgun shells. The pouch is an excellent fit to our shotgun scabbard.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418Z9D3vlXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EU4ZKW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 13.95}}
