{"item_id": "B005EWTLHW", "title": "Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster Black", "description": "Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster / Mag Pouch. Ready to travel. Ready to rock! Marry-up this fancy carrier to tote your Mk123 firearm with dignity. Tough nylon; Adjustable web strap with snap release secures gun on the go; Front mounted mag pouch; 2 inch belt slide Holster; Fits up to a 1 1/2\"w. belt; Fits Ruger Mk 1, 2, 3 with 6\" barrel; Embroidered Ruger logo. Order now! Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster, Black", "text": "Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster Black Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster / Mag Pouch. Ready to travel. Ready to rock! Marry-up this fancy carrier to tote your Mk123 firearm with dignity. Tough nylon; Adjustable web strap with snap release secures gun on the go; Front mounted mag pouch; 2 inch belt slide Holster; Fits up to a 1 1/2\"w. belt; Fits Ruger Mk 1, 2, 3 with 6\" barrel; Embroidered Ruger logo. Order now! Ruger Nylon Mk123 Holster, Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uq%2BQY-dQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EWTLHW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005EWULGM", "title": "SmartReloader #50 Ammo Box", "description": "The SmartReloader modular ammo box No.50 is the exact same size as the .50BMG military ammo can but it is made of heavy duty plastic which improves the storage of your ammunition You can even store the ammunition loose in the box or in loaded magazines. The hard plastic walls will resist everything and the box will carry over 70lbs. The whole structure of the can is made of Heavy Duty High-Density Polyethylene which is resistant to solvents and chemicals. What makes our No.50 Ammo Can modular? Simply because we include for FREE three modular trays which will make your life much easier when you need to store anything in your No.50 Ammo Can. The inner walls of the trays can be removed according to your needs to make smaller or larger storage compartments, and you will be able to do it on 3 different levels inside the Ammo Can No.50 The Ammo Can No.50 is a 100-Percent dry box and can be locked on two sides to transport by air or simply if you want to privately store valuable items or documents at home. Ammo Can No.50 Technical Features:-Matches the inner sizes of the original M2A1 Military .50 Cal. Ammo Can, Waterproof Dry Box, Holds up to 70lbs, Comes with 3 Modular Organizer Trays included, Can be locked for Privacy or Shipping Ammo for Hunting Trips. Made of Strong and Heavy Duty High-Density Polyethylene. Includes SmartReloaders 3 year warranty", "text": "SmartReloader #50 Ammo Box The SmartReloader modular ammo box No.50 is the exact same size as the .50BMG military ammo can but it is made of heavy duty plastic which improves the storage of your ammunition You can even store the ammunition loose in the box or in loaded magazines. The hard plastic walls will resist everything and the box will carry over 70lbs. The whole structure of the can is made of Heavy Duty High-Density Polyethylene which is resistant to solvents and chemicals. What makes our No.50 Ammo Can modular? Simply because we include for FREE three modular trays which will make your life much easier when you need to store anything in your No.50 Ammo Can. The inner walls of the trays can be removed according to your needs to make smaller or larger storage compartments, and you will be able to do it on 3 different levels inside the Ammo Can No.50 The Ammo Can No.50 is a 100-Percent dry box and can be locked on two sides to transport by air or simply if you want to privately store valuable items or documents at home. Ammo Can No.50 Technical Features:-Matches the inner sizes of the original M2A1 Military .50 Cal. Ammo Can, Waterproof Dry Box, Holds up to 70lbs, Comes with 3 Modular Organizer Trays included, Can be locked for Privacy or Shipping Ammo for Hunting Trips. Made of Strong and Heavy Duty High-Density Polyethylene. Includes SmartReloaders 3 year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Jxl3zjJtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EWULGM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SmartReloader", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 38.08}}
{"item_id": "B005EZGLJU", "title": "KWA M4 Magazine Style Airsoft BB Speed loader 460 round", "description": "KWA BB Speed Loader 460 round M4 Style 197-91100This BB Speed Loader holds and impressive 460 rounds, and resembles an M4 Magazine for easy mag pouch storage. Simply fill with BBs and inject them into your spring load and gas magazines. Includes a Gas mag Adapter, which stores conveniently in the loader. Hinged cover protects the feed nozzle when not in use. Impact Resistant ABS Construction, 460 round capacity. 6mm BBs only.", "text": "KWA M4 Magazine Style Airsoft BB Speed loader 460 round KWA BB Speed Loader 460 round M4 Style 197-91100This BB Speed Loader holds and impressive 460 rounds, and resembles an M4 Magazine for easy mag pouch storage. Simply fill with BBs and inject them into your spring load and gas magazines. Includes a Gas mag Adapter, which stores conveniently in the loader. Hinged cover protects the feed nozzle when not in use. Impact Resistant ABS Construction, 460 round capacity. 6mm BBs only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41x0JbtQekL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005EZGLJU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KWA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 18.49}}
