{"item_id": "B005F0S29G", "title": "V-Yoke Attachment with Camera thread for Monopod shooting stick", "description": "This V yoke can be used as a monopod accessory when you carry a heavy SLR camera with long zoom lens. The yoke can be mounted on top of the monopod and you may just rest the camera lens on the yoke as a quick support. It is also a good choice to convert a regular lightweight monopod into a shooting stick. Here are some of the features of the V yoke:3inch openning at the topBrass insert at the bottom with 1/4\" thread that fits all standard monopods.Rounded rubber strip inlaid on top of the V to provide a soft resting surface.", "text": "V-Yoke Attachment with Camera thread for Monopod shooting stick This V yoke can be used as a monopod accessory when you carry a heavy SLR camera with long zoom lens. The yoke can be mounted on top of the monopod and you may just rest the camera lens on the yoke as a quick support. It is also a good choice to convert a regular lightweight monopod into a shooting stick. Here are some of the features of the V yoke:3inch openning at the topBrass insert at the bottom with 1/4\" thread that fits all standard monopods.Rounded rubber strip inlaid on top of the V to provide a soft resting surface.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419BJgVak5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005F0S29G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 4.8}}
