{"item_id": "B005FKPV0O", "title": "Rubena Bicycle V66 Flash 86 PSI Tire (26x1.5)", "description": "From epic cross-country tours to the daily grind of commuting to work, the Rubena V66 Flash does the job right. If your bike sees a lot of miles, it deserves a tire like the Flash.", "text": "Rubena Bicycle V66 Flash 86 PSI Tire (26x1.5) From epic cross-country tours to the daily grind of commuting to work, the Rubena V66 Flash does the job right. If your bike sees a lot of miles, it deserves a tire like the Flash.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TpgQlM9ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005FKPV0O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
