{"item_id": "B005G00M5C", "title": "Burris 200437 MTAC 1-4 x 24 Illuminated Scope (Black)", "description": "The Burris MTAC line offers precision, performance, and versatility. The MTAC is the perfect match for AR platforms. You can quickly engage close targets or take precise aim out for 600 yards. This scope is ideal for big game hunting. It delivers optical performance that is virtually identical to ultra-premium scopes. The lenses are precision ground optical glass that is index matched, multi-coated with HiLume for clear, sharp, high resolution images.", "text": "Burris 200437 MTAC 1-4 x 24 Illuminated Scope (Black) The Burris MTAC line offers precision, performance, and versatility. The MTAC is the perfect match for AR platforms. You can quickly engage close targets or take precise aim out for 600 yards. This scope is ideal for big game hunting. It delivers optical performance that is virtually identical to ultra-premium scopes. The lenses are precision ground optical glass that is index matched, multi-coated with HiLume for clear, sharp, high resolution images.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pKOIs%2BKcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G00M5C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Burris", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 359.9}}
