{"item_id": "B005G45QQ8", "title": "Camo Form Protective Camouflage Fabric Wrap (RealTree Max 4 Camo)", "description": "Provides heavy duty protection for your firearms and gear. Unlike tape Camo Form clings to itself and leaves no sticky residue. Washable and reusable. Conceals and eliminates glare. Improves grip - wet or dry. Insulates and quiets loose items and gun parts. 2 in. x 144 in.", "text": "Camo Form Protective Camouflage Fabric Wrap (RealTree Max 4 Camo) Provides heavy duty protection for your firearms and gear. Unlike tape Camo Form clings to itself and leaves no sticky residue. Washable and reusable. Conceals and eliminates glare. Improves grip - wet or dry. Insulates and quiets loose items and gun parts. 2 in. x 144 in.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MJwr8QqRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G45QQ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Camo Form", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 13.05}}
