{"item_id": "B005G50S0Q", "title": "Agloves ® Sport Touchscreen Gloves, iPhone Gloves, Texting Gloves", "description": "Agloves Sport are soft, warm, stretchy and slightly fuzzy knitted gloves made a bit thicker than the original Agloves for added warmth. Agloves are the top-rated touchscreen glove for precision and accuracy. These gloves look great on. No funky fingertip designs. A snug-fitted cuff seals the wind out, while the silver nylon traps heat in. Agloves Sport are available in two unisex sizes S/M or M/L. Agloves are made with REAL silver, the most conductive element in the Periodic Table of Elements. Color is black with silver flecks to produce a charcoal grey coloring. Hand washable in cool water. Made primarily with acrylic, these gloves are breathable and help draw moisture away from the body. Agloves Sport are compatible with all capacitive touch screen devices including (but not limited to!) phones, cameras, multimedia devices, game systems, depth finders, bike computers like: iPhone, Droid X, Samsung, Tom-Tom GPS system, Nook, ATM, iPad, iPod Touch, MP3 player, Palm Pre, Blackberry Storm, Zune HD, Flip HD and other cameras, and many more.Made in China with: 68% Acrylic, 15% silver yarn, 12% spandex, 5% rubber thread", "text": "Agloves ® Sport Touchscreen Gloves, iPhone Gloves, Texting Gloves Agloves Sport are soft, warm, stretchy and slightly fuzzy knitted gloves made a bit thicker than the original Agloves for added warmth. Agloves are the top-rated touchscreen glove for precision and accuracy. These gloves look great on. No funky fingertip designs. A snug-fitted cuff seals the wind out, while the silver nylon traps heat in. Agloves Sport are available in two unisex sizes S/M or M/L. Agloves are made with REAL silver, the most conductive element in the Periodic Table of Elements. Color is black with silver flecks to produce a charcoal grey coloring. Hand washable in cool water. Made primarily with acrylic, these gloves are breathable and help draw moisture away from the body. Agloves Sport are compatible with all capacitive touch screen devices including (but not limited to!) phones, cameras, multimedia devices, game systems, depth finders, bike computers like: iPhone, Droid X, Samsung, Tom-Tom GPS system, Nook, ATM, iPad, iPod Touch, MP3 player, Palm Pre, Blackberry Storm, Zune HD, Flip HD and other cameras, and many more.Made in China with: 68% Acrylic, 15% silver yarn, 12% spandex, 5% rubber thread", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I0f8jEo2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G50S0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005G5YRYY", "title": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Wide Mouth Water Bottle and Beer Growler, 64-Ounce", "description": "Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "text": "Hydro Flask Insulated Stainless Steel Wide Mouth Water Bottle and Beer Growler, 64-Ounce Hydro Flask's insulated water bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel. The bottles have no liner (like most aluminum bottles) and are BPA free. Unlike plastic water bottles or single wall stainless bottles, Hydro Flask will keep your beverage of choice at your preferred temperature for hours, whether you choose hot, cold or room temperature liquids. All Hydro Flask products feature a lifetime warranty and are double wall vacuum insulated. They are designed to be lightweight, making them great for long hikes, days on the beach, hot yoga classes, golf, long road trips or everyday office use. Even when filled with ice, the exterior of your Hydro Flask will never leave a puddle on your desk, drip on your shirt, or sweat in your bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/313kVTSQBfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G5YRYY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hydro Flask", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 44.94}}
{"item_id": "B005G66BJC", "title": "LVXING TR90 Frame + 5 Lens Outdoor Sports Polarized Sunglasses Cycling Glasses", "description": "Features:The glasses are designed for driving cycling etc. all outdoor activitiesLens made of shatterproof unbreakable PC material are durable enough for long time using and also have the protective function like eye against BB airsoft game bulletHigh strength, the Lens Can bear that a heavy hammer blows on it and Lens has no brokenOnly The main black lens is UV400 Polarized lenses against strong sunlight, the other 5 lens are colored sunglasses for different environmental conditionWith spare rimmed soft rubber pad, frames tail inside nasal with pads, long wear more comfortableNice, trendy and cool to wearCome with hard protection box, special design for this fashion glasses kit, lined with spongeSpecification:Lens Material: The polycarbonate (PC)Frames Material: PC composite engineering resinApplicable people: UnisexUV Protection Index: UV400Lens: Brunet polarized lenses, Blue lens, Transparent dazzle colour lens, Tawny Dazzle Color Lens, Yellow brighten lens and REVO Multi-layer coating film 7 colour lensPackage include:1 x Sport Glasses Frame1 x Myopia Frame6 x Lenses1 x Hard Protection Box1 x Movement Head Harness1 x Lenses Pouch & Cleaning Cloth", "text": "LVXING TR90 Frame + 5 Lens Outdoor Sports Polarized Sunglasses Cycling Glasses Features:The glasses are designed for driving cycling etc. all outdoor activitiesLens made of shatterproof unbreakable PC material are durable enough for long time using and also have the protective function like eye against BB airsoft game bulletHigh strength, the Lens Can bear that a heavy hammer blows on it and Lens has no brokenOnly The main black lens is UV400 Polarized lenses against strong sunlight, the other 5 lens are colored sunglasses for different environmental conditionWith spare rimmed soft rubber pad, frames tail inside nasal with pads, long wear more comfortableNice, trendy and cool to wearCome with hard protection box, special design for this fashion glasses kit, lined with spongeSpecification:Lens Material: The polycarbonate (PC)Frames Material: PC composite engineering resinApplicable people: UnisexUV Protection Index: UV400Lens: Brunet polarized lenses, Blue lens, Transparent dazzle colour lens, Tawny Dazzle Color Lens, Yellow brighten lens and REVO Multi-layer coating film 7 colour lensPackage include:1 x Sport Glasses Frame1 x Myopia Frame6 x Lenses1 x Hard Protection Box1 x Movement Head Harness1 x Lenses Pouch & Cleaning Cloth", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31AEM2GqpLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G66BJC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LVXING", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Sunglasses"]], "price": 34.96}}
{"item_id": "B005G66V5G", "title": "UTG 4-Inch Compact ITA Red/Green Circle Dot Sight with Integral QD Picatinny Mount", "description": "The UTG new generation Instant Target Aiming (ITA) compact tactical sight features a red/green 4MOA target dot and 65MOA circle reticle with a 38-millimeter diameter objective lens. The sight comes complete with integral quick detachable Picatinny mounts with a fully adjustable cam lever lock system, and flip-open lens cover. The sight is designed for instant aiming and locking on target, with five brightness settings that function in diverse settings. The sight offers optimal height design to co-witness with iron sights on AR models.Key Features:Red/Green 4MOA Target Dot and 65MOA CircleFive brightness settings for diverse environmental backgroundInstant aiming and locking on targetNon-reflection high tech emerald coatingsOptimal height design to co-witness with iron sights on AR modelsMost Versatile Dot Sight for Wide Range of Pistols, Shotguns & RiflesSpecifications:Magnification: 1XTube Diameter: 38 millimetersObjective Diameter: 30 millimetersField of View at 100 yards: 16.5 feetEye Relief: FlexibleExit Pupil: 25 millimetersClick Value at 100 yards: 1/2 inchLength: 95 millimetersWeight: 7.4 ouncesBatteries: CR2032 3VIncludes Integral Quick Detach Mounting Deck and Flip-open Lens CapsTwo year warranty", "text": "UTG 4-Inch Compact ITA Red/Green Circle Dot Sight with Integral QD Picatinny Mount The UTG new generation Instant Target Aiming (ITA) compact tactical sight features a red/green 4MOA target dot and 65MOA circle reticle with a 38-millimeter diameter objective lens. The sight comes complete with integral quick detachable Picatinny mounts with a fully adjustable cam lever lock system, and flip-open lens cover. The sight is designed for instant aiming and locking on target, with five brightness settings that function in diverse settings. The sight offers optimal height design to co-witness with iron sights on AR models.Key Features:Red/Green 4MOA Target Dot and 65MOA CircleFive brightness settings for diverse environmental backgroundInstant aiming and locking on targetNon-reflection high tech emerald coatingsOptimal height design to co-witness with iron sights on AR modelsMost Versatile Dot Sight for Wide Range of Pistols, Shotguns & RiflesSpecifications:Magnification: 1XTube Diameter: 38 millimetersObjective Diameter: 30 millimetersField of View at 100 yards: 16.5 feetEye Relief: FlexibleExit Pupil: 25 millimetersClick Value at 100 yards: 1/2 inchLength: 95 millimetersWeight: 7.4 ouncesBatteries: CR2032 3VIncludes Integral Quick Detach Mounting Deck and Flip-open Lens CapsTwo year warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rrugaynuL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G66V5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 41.21}}
{"item_id": "B005G8BRRG", "title": "Bicycle seatpost-mounted Commuter Rack & Quick-release Commuter Bag", "description": "The quick-release commuter trunk bag clips on and releases within 3 seconds - no straps required!An integrated hand carrying strap and detachable padded shoulder strap are included for off-road use. The shoulder strap stores easily in a mesh pocket beneath the bag cover.The main compartment offers storage space for books, small laptops, cycling gear or tools, with reinforced and padded sides for shock protection. Side and rear pockets, zippered pouch, and external bungee cords offer additional storage for small items. A durable ABS base allows the bag to be set down on wet surfaces, protecting the cargo within.Highly reflective strips and taillight hanger add to nighttime safety.The lightweight aluminum rack easily mounts to bicycle seat posts and is length adjustable, carrying up to 22 lbs (10 kg). Includes rubber sizing shims and is reflector attachable.Ibera's PakRak Quick-release bag is compatible with Ibera Racks (IB-RA1, IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, IB-RA11, IB-RA15).Ibera commuter bags can be simultaneously mounted with Ibera panniers (IB-BA4, IB-BA7, IB-BA9)(All Weather Rain Cover (IB-BA1-RC) available separately)SpecificationsMaterial:1680D Nylon, ABS baseCapacity:17 LBag dimensions:15\" x 8.7\" x 11.4\"Bag weight:2.3 lbsRack dimensions:21\" x 5.5\" x 3\"Rack weight:1.5 lbs", "text": "Bicycle seatpost-mounted Commuter Rack & Quick-release Commuter Bag The quick-release commuter trunk bag clips on and releases within 3 seconds - no straps required!An integrated hand carrying strap and detachable padded shoulder strap are included for off-road use. The shoulder strap stores easily in a mesh pocket beneath the bag cover.The main compartment offers storage space for books, small laptops, cycling gear or tools, with reinforced and padded sides for shock protection. Side and rear pockets, zippered pouch, and external bungee cords offer additional storage for small items. A durable ABS base allows the bag to be set down on wet surfaces, protecting the cargo within.Highly reflective strips and taillight hanger add to nighttime safety.The lightweight aluminum rack easily mounts to bicycle seat posts and is length adjustable, carrying up to 22 lbs (10 kg). Includes rubber sizing shims and is reflector attachable.Ibera's PakRak Quick-release bag is compatible with Ibera Racks (IB-RA1, IB-RA2, IB-RA3, IB-RA4, IB-RA5, IB-RA11, IB-RA15).Ibera commuter bags can be simultaneously mounted with Ibera panniers (IB-BA4, IB-BA7, IB-BA9)(All Weather Rain Cover (IB-BA1-RC) available separately)SpecificationsMaterial:1680D Nylon, ABS baseCapacity:17 LBag dimensions:15\" x 8.7\" x 11.4\"Bag weight:2.3 lbsRack dimensions:21\" x 5.5\" x 3\"Rack weight:1.5 lbs", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OoVpcmSdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005G8BRRG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 99.98}}
