{"item_id": "B005GJ4KTC", "title": "Aimpoint Outer Cover, Dark Earth Brown", "description": "Outer Rubber Cover. Superior durability and fast target acquisition capabilities, it's easy to see why Aimpoint is so often the reflex sight of choice for military, police, hunters and shooting enthusiasts around the world.- Dark Earth, Brown- Fits: M3/ML3.", "text": "Aimpoint Outer Cover, Dark Earth Brown Outer Rubber Cover. Superior durability and fast target acquisition capabilities, it's easy to see why Aimpoint is so often the reflex sight of choice for military, police, hunters and shooting enthusiasts around the world.- Dark Earth, Brown- Fits: M3/ML3.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417ff11TyzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GJ4KTC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimPoint", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]], "price": 34.9}}
{"item_id": "B005GKX2DG", "title": "Kenda Happy Medium Cyclocross Tire (Black)", "description": "Designed to be fast and agile. The Happy Medium's knob heights and profiles allow for a seamless transition from the tire center to the edge knobs. A universal design that is applicable to all types of riding and racing; fast rolling center with aggressive outside edge for cornering assurance. Cross-country versions feature light-weight single-ply casings and DTC rubber. Front and Rear application.", "text": "Kenda Happy Medium Cyclocross Tire (Black) Designed to be fast and agile. The Happy Medium's knob heights and profiles allow for a seamless transition from the tire center to the edge knobs. A universal design that is applicable to all types of riding and racing; fast rolling center with aggressive outside edge for cornering assurance. Cross-country versions feature light-weight single-ply casings and DTC rubber. Front and Rear application.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jKOaUdI7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GKX2DG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005GLHJU2", "title": "Giordana 2013/14 Brooklyn Team Cycling Cap - World Stripes - gi-s2-coca-brok", "description": "Brooklyn Team Cotton Cycling Cap. Giordana(R) Body Parts encompass a complete range of cycling accessory items to accommodate all riders in every season. The Giordana(R) name guarantees quality craftsmanship and the highest standards in the industry.", "text": "Giordana 2013/14 Brooklyn Team Cycling Cap - World Stripes - gi-s2-coca-brok Brooklyn Team Cotton Cycling Cap. Giordana(R) Body Parts encompass a complete range of cycling accessory items to accommodate all riders in every season. The Giordana(R) name guarantees quality craftsmanship and the highest standards in the industry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OpUArT%2BbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GLHJU2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Caps"]], "price": 9.95}}
