{"item_id": "B005GOU5SW", "title": "Abu Garcia Pro Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel", "description": "The Pro MaxTM has now been updated with a more compact design and smoother feel thanks to advances in technology. The top of line Abu Garcia Max series reel features seven smooth bearings plus a corrosion resistant instant anti-reverse bearing. Its graphite side plates and frame create a truly lightweight reel weighing in at a mere 7.9 ounces. The 7.1:1 high speed gear ratio is the fastest in the Max family picking up 31 inches per turn", "text": "Abu Garcia Pro Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel The Pro MaxTM has now been updated with a more compact design and smoother feel thanks to advances in technology. The top of line Abu Garcia Max series reel features seven smooth bearings plus a corrosion resistant instant anti-reverse bearing. Its graphite side plates and frame create a truly lightweight reel weighing in at a mere 7.9 ounces. The 7.1:1 high speed gear ratio is the fastest in the Max family picking up 31 inches per turn", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qSE5tLdFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GOU5SW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Abu Garcia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Trolling Reels"]], "price": 64.91}}
{"item_id": "B005GOU6V8", "title": "Abu Garcia Silver Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel - SMAX2 / SMAX2-L", "description": "The new more compact and ergonomic 2012 Silver Max places performance at your finger tips with a five bearing system and an additional instant anti-reverse bearing to ensure smooth retrieves. The upgraded design includes a light weight graphite frame and side plate in addition to the signature MagTrax brake system that provides precise cast control. Performance and toughness are hallmarks of the Max family, and the flipping switch included on this reel provides a swift means for casting jigs and plastics with just a touch of the thumb.", "text": "Abu Garcia Silver Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel - SMAX2 / SMAX2-L The new more compact and ergonomic 2012 Silver Max places performance at your finger tips with a five bearing system and an additional instant anti-reverse bearing to ensure smooth retrieves. The upgraded design includes a light weight graphite frame and side plate in addition to the signature MagTrax brake system that provides precise cast control. Performance and toughness are hallmarks of the Max family, and the flipping switch included on this reel provides a swift means for casting jigs and plastics with just a touch of the thumb.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sqa3n6MtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GOU6V8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Abu Garcia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Baitcasting Reels"]], "price": 39.7}}
{"item_id": "B005GQO1WG", "title": "Airsoft M4 & M16 Metal 300rd High Capacity Magazine [Hi-Cap Mag] - JG OEM Manufactured For JG & Echo 1 AEGs", "description": "Compatibility: - Tokyo Marui, ICS, Classic Army, UTG, WELL, GB, JG, Echo1 - M4, M16, SCAR, SPR, HK416, and more! - Made in China", "text": "Airsoft M4 & M16 Metal 300rd High Capacity Magazine [Hi-Cap Mag] - JG OEM Manufactured For JG & Echo 1 AEGs Compatibility: - Tokyo Marui, ICS, Classic Army, UTG, WELL, GB, JG, Echo1 - M4, M16, SCAR, SPR, HK416, and more! - Made in China", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nDtyeCpJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GQO1WG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Magazines"]], "price": 6.75}}
{"item_id": "B005GR1CSQ", "title": "Smith & Wesson 22a Speed Beez Clip Loader", "description": "How to load a Smith & Wesson 22A mag in as little a 3 seconds....The nearly famous \"Ultimate Clip Loader\" Has been CNC modified to Easily load your favorite Smith & Wesson 22A magazine in seconds and saving your thumbs and fingers from abuse. This Ultimate Clip Loader holds 50 rounds of .22 ammo and speed loads .22 auto Smith & Wesson 22A pistol magazines. Simply pour lose rounds into the Smith & Wesson 22A Ultimate Clip Loader, shake loader to align cartridges, press the empty magazine into loader pump the magazine in and out slightly and extract. Wow, now you know how to load a Smith & Wesson 22A mag in 3 seconds! Made in the USA from virtually indestructible polycarbonate. A shooters favorite discover the secret for yourself! Get one now before we sell out! This one Fits the Smith & Wesson 22A Only. We buy the blue Ultimate Clips Loaders in bulk form McFadden then CNC modify them to accept and work with the 22a. If you buy a blue one from some place else it won't work with the 22a. Other seller other than Speed Beez have listed Blue Ultimate Clip Loaders along side ours that have not been modified to work with the 22a. The blue coloring is not what makes it work with the 22a. Be sure to buy it from Speed Beez if you want it to work with your 22a.", "text": "Smith & Wesson 22a Speed Beez Clip Loader How to load a Smith & Wesson 22A mag in as little a 3 seconds....The nearly famous \"Ultimate Clip Loader\" Has been CNC modified to Easily load your favorite Smith & Wesson 22A magazine in seconds and saving your thumbs and fingers from abuse. This Ultimate Clip Loader holds 50 rounds of .22 ammo and speed loads .22 auto Smith & Wesson 22A pistol magazines. Simply pour lose rounds into the Smith & Wesson 22A Ultimate Clip Loader, shake loader to align cartridges, press the empty magazine into loader pump the magazine in and out slightly and extract. Wow, now you know how to load a Smith & Wesson 22A mag in 3 seconds! Made in the USA from virtually indestructible polycarbonate. A shooters favorite discover the secret for yourself! Get one now before we sell out! This one Fits the Smith & Wesson 22A Only. We buy the blue Ultimate Clips Loaders in bulk form McFadden then CNC modify them to accept and work with the 22a. If you buy a blue one from some place else it won't work with the 22a. Other seller other than Speed Beez have listed Blue Ultimate Clip Loaders along side ours that have not been modified to work with the 22a. The blue coloring is not what makes it work with the 22a. Be sure to buy it from Speed Beez if you want it to work with your 22a.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rJ4d-dDBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GR1CSQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B005GREUD0", "title": "Ka-Bar Leather Sheath, 7-Inch, Brown", "description": "KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "text": "Ka-Bar Leather Sheath, 7-Inch, Brown KA-BAR Knives, Inc., a subsidiary of Alcas Corporation, manufactures high quality military, hunting, sporting, and all-purpose utility knives. KA-BAR Knives are a favorite of adventurers, survivalists, outdoor sportsmen and, of course, knife collectors who know that their knife deserves a place in their collection. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EfEZ3giiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GREUD0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ka-Bar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 9.19}}
