{"item_id": "B005GWYT8Q", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Mossberg 500 590 835 Persuader Maverick 88 Shotgun Weaver Picatinny Base Rail Scope Sight Mount", "description": "Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Length: 5.5\" (140mm). Easy installation- Attaches to existing holes on your shotgun with included screws. Provides a 5.5 inch long Weaver/picatinny style tactical rail with 13 cross slots. This allows some adjustment for eye relief and also accepts a wider variety of scopes, reflex sights, red dot scopes and tactical accessories. Compatible with most Weaver/Picatinny style scope rings and similar accessories. Compatible with Mossberg 500, 590, 835 Persuader and Maverick 88 shotguns. On older versions that are not drilled you would have to tap and drill new ones.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Mossberg 500 590 835 Persuader Maverick 88 Shotgun Weaver Picatinny Base Rail Scope Sight Mount Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Length: 5.5\" (140mm). Easy installation- Attaches to existing holes on your shotgun with included screws. Provides a 5.5 inch long Weaver/picatinny style tactical rail with 13 cross slots. This allows some adjustment for eye relief and also accepts a wider variety of scopes, reflex sights, red dot scopes and tactical accessories. Compatible with most Weaver/Picatinny style scope rings and similar accessories. Compatible with Mossberg 500, 590, 835 Persuader and Maverick 88 shotguns. On older versions that are not drilled you would have to tap and drill new ones.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31F4c3XATeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GWYT8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 4.99}}
{"item_id": "B005GXOG10", "title": "Ruger LCP Sneaky Pete Holster (Belt Loop)", "description": "The Ruger LCP Sneaky Pete Holster has a sewn belt loop which can accommodate a belt up to 1.75\" inches wide. The holster is made of high quality soft leather, and when worn on the belt resembles a cell phone case. The advantage of this design is that it allows you to carry your LCP concealed, but with full and easy access. Now it's possible to wear whatever you want, whenever you want to. Don't dress around your gun anymore. The holster is made inside and out of glove-quality leather, and uses two magnets to stay closed. Each holster is designed for your specific firearm, and the opening is made in such a way that you cannot accidentally place your finger on the trigger during draw. The Kydex insert ensures that a smooth, silent draw occurs every time. The use of double stitching and steel rivets guarantees that this holster will last for years to come. All available options are listed above, and the holster can be ordered either with the belt loop, or optional belt clip. We design every holster to be as small as possible and still fit your pistol. The size of this holster before options is: 94mm x 142mm x 32mm.", "text": "Ruger LCP Sneaky Pete Holster (Belt Loop) The Ruger LCP Sneaky Pete Holster has a sewn belt loop which can accommodate a belt up to 1.75\" inches wide. The holster is made of high quality soft leather, and when worn on the belt resembles a cell phone case. The advantage of this design is that it allows you to carry your LCP concealed, but with full and easy access. Now it's possible to wear whatever you want, whenever you want to. Don't dress around your gun anymore. The holster is made inside and out of glove-quality leather, and uses two magnets to stay closed. Each holster is designed for your specific firearm, and the opening is made in such a way that you cannot accidentally place your finger on the trigger during draw. The Kydex insert ensures that a smooth, silent draw occurs every time. The use of double stitching and steel rivets guarantees that this holster will last for years to come. All available options are listed above, and the holster can be ordered either with the belt loop, or optional belt clip. We design every holster to be as small as possible and still fit your pistol. The size of this holster before options is: 94mm x 142mm x 32mm.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jBxNcDcDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GXOG10.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B005GXQR9O", "title": "MetalTac 0.2g BB 5000 Round Bag Airsoft 6mm BB Perfect Grade", "description": "MetalTac 0.2g BB 6mm Airsoft 5000 Bag. Heavy Weight, perfect for high quality AEG, perfectly balanced BB, extreme accuracy. High Precision, ultra smooth and perfectly balanced BB. Precisely made with minimal variation (+-0.01mm), weight precisely at 0.2g (+-0.01g) The Metal precision rating level has exceeded most the brand out there available on the Market, running head to head to the best Japanese brand BBs'. 5000 Round The most valued package 0.2g BB available.", "text": "MetalTac 0.2g BB 5000 Round Bag Airsoft 6mm BB Perfect Grade MetalTac 0.2g BB 6mm Airsoft 5000 Bag. Heavy Weight, perfect for high quality AEG, perfectly balanced BB, extreme accuracy. High Precision, ultra smooth and perfectly balanced BB. Precisely made with minimal variation (+-0.01mm), weight precisely at 0.2g (+-0.01g) The Metal precision rating level has exceeded most the brand out there available on the Market, running head to head to the best Japanese brand BBs'. 5000 Round The most valued package 0.2g BB available.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41uyotjjRAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005GXQR9O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "BBs"]], "price": 11.99}}
