{"item_id": "B005H7730Q", "title": "15 Pack of 16 Gram Threaded CO2 Cartridges", "description": "NEW (15) Threaded 16 gram CO2 Food grade and suitable for Mosquito Magnet, as well as bicycle, lawnmower, off-road, auto and atv tire inflators. Sorry, no International shipping of these cartridges! New cartridges pulled from new boxes to fit small USPS flat rate box.", "text": "15 Pack of 16 Gram Threaded CO2 Cartridges NEW (15) Threaded 16 gram CO2 Food grade and suitable for Mosquito Magnet, as well as bicycle, lawnmower, off-road, auto and atv tire inflators. Sorry, no International shipping of these cartridges! New cartridges pulled from new boxes to fit small USPS flat rate box.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21LJxhrJSsL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005H7730Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mosa", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "CO2 Pumps"]], "price": 16.8}}
