{"item_id": "B005HFIOKQ", "title": "U.S. Military First Aid Kit Container (empty)", "description": "These boxes do come straight from mfg cases. However due to a mfg defect some of the latches do not close snuggly. That being said while all have 4 latches the airtight seal cannot be guaranteed. Still these make great storage boxes and we are gonna sell them at half the price of the other guys!", "text": "U.S. Military First Aid Kit Container (empty) These boxes do come straight from mfg cases. However due to a mfg defect some of the latches do not close snuggly. That being said while all have 4 latches the airtight seal cannot be guaranteed. Still these make great storage boxes and we are gonna sell them at half the price of the other guys!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qUSPKtRhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HFIOKQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B005HGAZCU", "title": "U.S. Marine Corps Airsoft Spring Pistol", "description": "A medium-sized, single-shot pistol with a 12-shot clip. It features a comfort grip and quick-release, easy load magazine. With velocities of up to 325 fps, this is an ideal sidearm for close quarter skirmishes.", "text": "U.S. Marine Corps Airsoft Spring Pistol A medium-sized, single-shot pistol with a 12-shot clip. It features a comfort grip and quick-release, easy load magazine. With velocities of up to 325 fps, this is an ideal sidearm for close quarter skirmishes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MFZwM54BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HGAZCU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "U.S. Marine Corps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 15.87}}
