{"item_id": "B005HN1X9W", "title": "OKO H2O Level-2 Advanced Filtration Water Bottle, 550ml, Air", "description": "OKO's advanced filtration water bottles are made from a customized blend of plastics that have passed stringent SGS testing for FDA food contact safety. The bottle cap is made of Tritan, a BPA-free clear hard plastic renowned for its durability and clarity that allows the user to see water filtration in action as you drink. The bottle's body is made of an ultra-light polypropylene material used popularly in food storage containers worldwide. Our semi-soft nozzle and washer create functional accents and the contoured shape makes the bottle easy to grip. The O-ring carabineer is used to carry or hook the bottle onto a bag. OKO Level-2 filtration, originally developed through a NASA grant for space stations, is now available for consumer use. Simply put, it is the state-of-the-art in water filtration technology. The filter produces superiorly-efficient filtration with a powerful flow. Our patent-pending Upstream Valve returns any backwashed fluid into the \"unfiltered\" water area for re-filtration and to ensure that every sip is pure, fresh and clean. OKO bottles are dishwasher safe and easy to clean. See manual for care instructions.", "text": "OKO H2O Level-2 Advanced Filtration Water Bottle, 550ml, Air OKO's advanced filtration water bottles are made from a customized blend of plastics that have passed stringent SGS testing for FDA food contact safety. The bottle cap is made of Tritan, a BPA-free clear hard plastic renowned for its durability and clarity that allows the user to see water filtration in action as you drink. The bottle's body is made of an ultra-light polypropylene material used popularly in food storage containers worldwide. Our semi-soft nozzle and washer create functional accents and the contoured shape makes the bottle easy to grip. The O-ring carabineer is used to carry or hook the bottle onto a bag. OKO Level-2 filtration, originally developed through a NASA grant for space stations, is now available for consumer use. Simply put, it is the state-of-the-art in water filtration technology. The filter produces superiorly-efficient filtration with a powerful flow. Our patent-pending Upstream Valve returns any backwashed fluid into the \"unfiltered\" water area for re-filtration and to ensure that every sip is pure, fresh and clean. OKO bottles are dishwasher safe and easy to clean. See manual for care instructions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vnCj4pmhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HN1X9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OKO H2O", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 17.78}}
{"item_id": "B005HPRUV0", "title": "Bushwhacker Tahoe Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Crossbar Top Tube Stem Bag - w/ Reflective Trim", "description": "The Tahoe attaches to your frame with a 4-point mounting system. One long zippered compartment is trimmed with Scotchlite to increase visibility. Volume: 156 cubic inches. Color: Black.", "text": "Bushwhacker Tahoe Black - Bicycle Frame Bag Cycling Triangle Pack Bike Crossbar Top Tube Stem Bag - w/ Reflective Trim The Tahoe attaches to your frame with a 4-point mounting system. One long zippered compartment is trimmed with Scotchlite to increase visibility. Volume: 156 cubic inches. Color: Black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41f6y4LuaSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HPRUV0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Panniers & Rack Trunks"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B005HPUA5S", "title": "Paracord 100' 7 strand, type III nylon by TACTICAL INTENT", "description": "May be used for many applications requiring strength and durability: camping, boating, indoor and outdoor clothesline, halyard lines, garden lines, and various survival applications. Actual length may vary slightly from the stated 100 Ft, plus or minus.", "text": "Paracord 100' 7 strand, type III nylon by TACTICAL INTENT May be used for many applications requiring strength and durability: camping, boating, indoor and outdoor clothesline, halyard lines, garden lines, and various survival applications. Actual length may vary slightly from the stated 100 Ft, plus or minus.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nwF6PBLIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HPUA5S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tactical Intent", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B005HQ1EWU", "title": "Guppy Neck Knife", "description": "Meyerco Knives - Guppy Neck Fixed Blade Knife with One Piece 440 Stainless Construction. Model: MC4663. 4 1/4\" overall. 2\" blade. Finger hole. Integrated guthook and pry bar tip. Molded black glass filled nylon sheath with beaded neck chain. Designed by Blackie Collins. Hang packaged.\"", "text": "Guppy Neck Knife Meyerco Knives - Guppy Neck Fixed Blade Knife with One Piece 440 Stainless Construction. Model: MC4663. 4 1/4\" overall. 2\" blade. Finger hole. Integrated guthook and pry bar tip. Molded black glass filled nylon sheath with beaded neck chain. Designed by Blackie Collins. Hang packaged.\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KluMELTaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HQ1EWU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005HQ2JC4", "title": "Serfas True 500 Usb Headlight (Black, One)", "description": "Serfas' True 500 Light is what you need to see the road or trail at night. Lightweight, compact, and super bright - the TSL-500 will deliver when you need it most. It comes with a rechargeable Li-Ion Battery, USB Charger cable, USB Wall Adapter, Handlebar and Helmet Mounting systems, and a limited lifetime warranty. Serfas is setting the benchmark in high-powered LED lighting technology by testing it lights in house using a 20\" N.I.S.T. Traceable Standard Intergrating Sphere. Hence the name \"True\" lights, when you buy a Serfas light - you are guaranteed to get what you paid for. Additional Li-Ion batteries available for purchase, charge up 2 batteries and ride all night!", "text": "Serfas True 500 Usb Headlight (Black, One) Serfas' True 500 Light is what you need to see the road or trail at night. Lightweight, compact, and super bright - the TSL-500 will deliver when you need it most. It comes with a rechargeable Li-Ion Battery, USB Charger cable, USB Wall Adapter, Handlebar and Helmet Mounting systems, and a limited lifetime warranty. Serfas is setting the benchmark in high-powered LED lighting technology by testing it lights in house using a 20\" N.I.S.T. Traceable Standard Intergrating Sphere. Hence the name \"True\" lights, when you buy a Serfas light - you are guaranteed to get what you paid for. Additional Li-Ion batteries available for purchase, charge up 2 batteries and ride all night!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QZ0JiPXmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HQ2JC4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 149.99}}
{"item_id": "B005HQ7QKE", "title": "SportLite Towels - 100% Microfiber Sport Towels sold separately in three sizes: Hand + Face, Sport + Bath, and Beach + Pool. SportLite Towels by YogaRat are the Official Towel of the Los Angeles County Lifeguard Association.", "description": "Just named The Official Towel of the Los Angeles County Lifeguard Association, YogaRat's SportLite Towels are not only great for yoga practice but also for home, gym, beach, outdoors, and travel. Highly absorbent and ultra-fast-drying, these lint-free towels are available in three sizes: Hand+Face towels come 2 IN A PACK (2 for the price of one!), and are the perfect small-sized towel to keep next to your yoga mat, in your golf bag, in your kitchen, or any place a larger towel is unnecessary. Medium-sized Sport+Bath towels are the size of standard bath towels and are a great way to dry off after a morning surf session, a hard workout at the gym, or after a shower. Large-sized Beach+Pool towels will barely take up a corner of your backpack or carry bag, won't trap sand, and dry so fast it's like having a fresh towel every time you need to dry off. All SportLite Towels are great for hiking and travel, as they take up much less space than terry towels when packed. They are made of super-absorbent microfiber that's incredibly soft to the touch, machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors, no bleach or fabric softener; tumble dry low) and extremely durable. And since they take up a fraction of the volume of their terry counterparts, they save space, water, and energy when it's laundry time. Each towel includes a perfectly placed sewn-in hang loop that makes it a breeze to hang from a hook, for even faster drying. SportLite Towels: towels with a whole new Rattitude! We recommend washing SportLite Towels separately before use.Also check out ourSportLite Beach Blanketand the entireYogaRat product lineup.", "text": "SportLite Towels - 100% Microfiber Sport Towels sold separately in three sizes: Hand + Face, Sport + Bath, and Beach + Pool. SportLite Towels by YogaRat are the Official Towel of the Los Angeles County Lifeguard Association. Just named The Official Towel of the Los Angeles County Lifeguard Association, YogaRat's SportLite Towels are not only great for yoga practice but also for home, gym, beach, outdoors, and travel. Highly absorbent and ultra-fast-drying, these lint-free towels are available in three sizes: Hand+Face towels come 2 IN A PACK (2 for the price of one!), and are the perfect small-sized towel to keep next to your yoga mat, in your golf bag, in your kitchen, or any place a larger towel is unnecessary. Medium-sized Sport+Bath towels are the size of standard bath towels and are a great way to dry off after a morning surf session, a hard workout at the gym, or after a shower. Large-sized Beach+Pool towels will barely take up a corner of your backpack or carry bag, won't trap sand, and dry so fast it's like having a fresh towel every time you need to dry off. All SportLite Towels are great for hiking and travel, as they take up much less space than terry towels when packed. They are made of super-absorbent microfiber that's incredibly soft to the touch, machine washable/dryable (wash cold with like colors, no bleach or fabric softener; tumble dry low) and extremely durable. And since they take up a fraction of the volume of their terry counterparts, they save space, water, and energy when it's laundry time. Each towel includes a perfectly placed sewn-in hang loop that makes it a breeze to hang from a hook, for even faster drying. SportLite Towels: towels with a whole new Rattitude! We recommend washing SportLite Towels separately before use.Also check out ourSportLite Beach Blanketand the entireYogaRat product lineup.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gQtATyYpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HQ7QKE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
