{"item_id": "B005HRP7YU", "title": "ALPS OutdoorZ Ranger Day Pack (Realtree Xtra Camo Fabric)", "description": "ALPS OutdoorZ Ranger Day Pack is a great entry-level pack for smaller excursions. With 1450 cubic inches of space, there's plenty of room to pack the essential gear for the day. The front pocket helps keep your supplies separate and the daisy chain on the front provides a place to tie on a few bigger items that you don't want taking up space in your pack.", "text": "ALPS OutdoorZ Ranger Day Pack (Realtree Xtra Camo Fabric) ALPS OutdoorZ Ranger Day Pack is a great entry-level pack for smaller excursions. With 1450 cubic inches of space, there's plenty of room to pack the essential gear for the day. The front pocket helps keep your supplies separate and the daisy chain on the front provides a place to tie on a few bigger items that you don't want taking up space in your pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JcLDx-6AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HRP7YU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS OutdoorZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B005HRP86C", "title": "ALPS OutdoorZ Dark Timber Day Pack (Realtree Xtra HD)", "description": "ALPS OutdoorZ Dark Timber Day Pack is a great choice for trips when comfort and durability are a must. There is a padded waist belt and shoulder straps. With three separate pockets to keep your gear organized, plus water bottle pockets on each side, there's enough room to bring along the essentials, and then some! The pack is hydration compatible and has lashing straps to tie down even more gear.", "text": "ALPS OutdoorZ Dark Timber Day Pack (Realtree Xtra HD) ALPS OutdoorZ Dark Timber Day Pack is a great choice for trips when comfort and durability are a must. There is a padded waist belt and shoulder straps. With three separate pockets to keep your gear organized, plus water bottle pockets on each side, there's enough room to bring along the essentials, and then some! The pack is hydration compatible and has lashing straps to tie down even more gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51sSiJdl5YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HRP86C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS OutdoorZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags"]], "price": 43.99}}
{"item_id": "B005HRY7UA", "title": "Gladding 550-7 Paracord Mil-C-Type III Camo Green 100 Feet", "description": "Gladding 550-7 Paracord, Mil-C-5040 Type III, 100 Feet, One Spool, camo green", "text": "Gladding 550-7 Paracord Mil-C-Type III Camo Green 100 Feet Gladding 550-7 Paracord, Mil-C-5040 Type III, 100 Feet, One Spool, camo green", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41smBYFVpYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HRY7UA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gladding Braid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B005HSLRZ2", "title": "Emergency Thermal Blanket 52\" x 84\" (4 Pack)", "description": "Our emergency thermal blanket provides warmth and deflects heat in hot climate, providing compact emergency protection in all weather conditions. Reusable, waterproof and windproof. This compact emergency blanket can be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag. Made of durable insulating mylar material designed by NASA for space exploration. Blanket size is standard 63\" x 83\" (160 x 210 CM). Retains/reflects back 90% of body heat. Thickness: 12.5 um. Pack of 4 blankets.", "text": "Emergency Thermal Blanket 52\" x 84\" (4 Pack) Our emergency thermal blanket provides warmth and deflects heat in hot climate, providing compact emergency protection in all weather conditions. Reusable, waterproof and windproof. This compact emergency blanket can be used as emergency shelter. Also great for camping, hiking, and surviving the cold outdoors. Excellent as liner of sleeping bag. Made of durable insulating mylar material designed by NASA for space exploration. Blanket size is standard 63\" x 83\" (160 x 210 CM). Retains/reflects back 90% of body heat. Thickness: 12.5 um. Pack of 4 blankets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514rtEGztRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HSLRZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mylar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Emergency Blankets"]], "price": 4.21}}
