{"item_id": "B005HXDKH0", "title": "Speedo Biofuse Swim Training Fins", "description": "Fin offers a perfect blend of hard and soft silicone to enhance performance and provide unparalleled comfort - Stiff blade for maximum power and strength building - 100% silicone and latex free Note: Fin sizes are in men's sizes and they tend to run small!", "text": "Speedo Biofuse Swim Training Fins Fin offers a perfect blend of hard and soft silicone to enhance performance and provide unparalleled comfort - Stiff blade for maximum power and strength building - 100% silicone and latex free Note: Fin sizes are in men's sizes and they tend to run small!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l7j0%2BKjfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005HXDKH0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Training Fins"]]}}
