{"item_id": "B005I0IVUI", "title": "Lyman Reloading 380 Auto Pistol Max Cartridge Gauge", "description": "Lyman maximum cartridge gauges check all critical dimensions of pistol ammunition to insure proper functioning. These precision made gauges allow the reloader to check the case length, diameter and overall cartridge length of pistol ammunition. This inspection is considered mandatory by top competitive shooters who demand 100% reliability for their competition ammo.", "text": "Lyman Reloading 380 Auto Pistol Max Cartridge Gauge Lyman maximum cartridge gauges check all critical dimensions of pistol ammunition to insure proper functioning. These precision made gauges allow the reloader to check the case length, diameter and overall cartridge length of pistol ammunition. This inspection is considered mandatory by top competitive shooters who demand 100% reliability for their competition ammo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B3IQiqq9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I0IVUI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 15.79}}
{"item_id": "B005I0K5CA", "title": "Lyman Turbo Brass/Media Separator", "description": "Lyman's new Rotary Case/Media Separator makes separating cases and media quick and easy. Polished cases and media are emptied into the open separator basket, the unit is then closed and the handle turned for a few rotations. The media and fine dust fall to the bottom of the unit, leaving cases clean and ready to use.", "text": "Lyman Turbo Brass/Media Separator Lyman's new Rotary Case/Media Separator makes separating cases and media quick and easy. Polished cases and media are emptied into the open separator basket, the unit is then closed and the handle turned for a few rotations. The media and fine dust fall to the bottom of the unit, leaving cases clean and ready to use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eik1wfzcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I0K5CA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 29.89}}
{"item_id": "B005I0LAHO", "title": "Lyman T-Mag Extra Turret", "description": "With an extra detachable T-Mag Turret, reloaders can maintain precise set-up while changing calibers. (Will fit old T-Mag. Turret handle not included", "text": "Lyman T-Mag Extra Turret With an extra detachable T-Mag Turret, reloaders can maintain precise set-up while changing calibers. (Will fit old T-Mag. Turret handle not included", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yp8iyiT6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I0LAHO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 45.99}}
