{"item_id": "B005I5ML0O", "title": "MREs (Meals Ready-to-Eat) Box A, Genuine U.S. Military Surplus, Menus 1-12", "description": "These MREs are genuine U.S. military issue. Each contains a full 12 meals, and every meal includes a flameless ration heater--all you need is water and a few minutes to have a hot meal. Each comes sealed in a waterproof airtight polymer bag, and includes an entree, side dish, crackers/bread, spread, dessert/candy, and a cold beverage base. They also feature amenities like utensils, napkins, matches, creamer, sugar, salt, and gum. Some have hot beverages or hot sauce, depending on the meal. Each meal provides around 1200 calories for an active person on the move, and is tailored to provide a good mix of protein, fat, and carbs (13/36/51&#37;) for optimum nutrition.Whether camping, hiking, hunting, traveling, or simply staying prepared for emergencies, MREs offer a simple, easy-to-store, easy-to-transport package that can mean a hot, nutritional, and filling meal whenever or wherever you need.", "text": "MREs (Meals Ready-to-Eat) Box A, Genuine U.S. Military Surplus, Menus 1-12 These MREs are genuine U.S. military issue. Each contains a full 12 meals, and every meal includes a flameless ration heater--all you need is water and a few minutes to have a hot meal. Each comes sealed in a waterproof airtight polymer bag, and includes an entree, side dish, crackers/bread, spread, dessert/candy, and a cold beverage base. They also feature amenities like utensils, napkins, matches, creamer, sugar, salt, and gum. Some have hot beverages or hot sauce, depending on the meal. Each meal provides around 1200 calories for an active person on the move, and is tailored to provide a good mix of protein, fat, and carbs (13/36/51&#37;) for optimum nutrition.Whether camping, hiking, hunting, traveling, or simply staying prepared for emergencies, MREs offer a simple, easy-to-store, easy-to-transport package that can mean a hot, nutritional, and filling meal whenever or wherever you need.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51VmzjJzXfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I5ML0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B005I6O8VS", "title": "Nike Dri-Fit UV Solar Golf & Basketball Sleeves (1 Pair) - Select Size/Color", "description": "", "text": "Nike Dri-Fit UV Solar Golf & Basketball Sleeves (1 Pair) - Select Size/Color", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21eLRA4l8dL._SY445_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6O8VS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nike", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Shirts & Tees"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Big & Tall"]], "price": 24.46}}
{"item_id": "B005I6OA3Y", "title": "Giros Savant Road Bike Helmet", "description": "The Savant is an amazing fit for riders who enjoy great routes as much as a swift pace. The slim shape combines impressive ventilation thanks to 25 wind tunnel vents and the comfortable convenience of the adjustable Roc Loc 5 fit and stability system. And with the lightweight and durability of in-mold construction, it won't weigh you down.", "text": "Giros Savant Road Bike Helmet The Savant is an amazing fit for riders who enjoy great routes as much as a swift pace. The slim shape combines impressive ventilation thanks to 25 wind tunnel vents and the comfortable convenience of the adjustable Roc Loc 5 fit and stability system. And with the lightweight and durability of in-mold construction, it won't weigh you down.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SSOUHmEbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6OA3Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6OAZC", "title": "Giro Reverb Bike Helmet", "description": "The Reverb's compact, classic lines are a perfect match to the clean new style that is driving urban cycling. The light-yet-tough In-mold shell wraps around to the inside of the helmet to resist dents and dings from life on the streets, and a self-adjusting fit system eliminates the need to dial-in the fit when wearing a cycling or winter caps. The finishing touch is a simple, removable cycling cap-style visor that adds a touch of style without compromising cooling ventilation in changing weather.", "text": "Giro Reverb Bike Helmet The Reverb's compact, classic lines are a perfect match to the clean new style that is driving urban cycling. The light-yet-tough In-mold shell wraps around to the inside of the helmet to resist dents and dings from life on the streets, and a self-adjusting fit system eliminates the need to dial-in the fit when wearing a cycling or winter caps. The finishing touch is a simple, removable cycling cap-style visor that adds a touch of style without compromising cooling ventilation in changing weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rnwX6G7%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6OAZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6ONKE", "title": "Packtowl Personal Ultra-Soft Towel", "description": "Exceptionally soft and smooth, this towel is the ideal choice for next-to-skin comfort. It’s available in sizes large enough for any activity, but is light and compact enough to follow you everywhere.", "text": "Packtowl Personal Ultra-Soft Towel Exceptionally soft and smooth, this towel is the ideal choice for next-to-skin comfort. It’s available in sizes large enough for any activity, but is light and compact enough to follow you everywhere.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nf9E85eVL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6ONKE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6OT1W", "title": "Packtowl Ultralite Soft Texture Towel", "description": "Soft, absorbent and easy to pack, the UltraLite towel is perfect for fun on the fly. It’s available in bath towel sizes, and makes a great choice for anyone who wants to play in the water without lugging a wet cotton towel around.", "text": "Packtowl Ultralite Soft Texture Towel Soft, absorbent and easy to pack, the UltraLite towel is perfect for fun on the fly. It’s available in bath towel sizes, and makes a great choice for anyone who wants to play in the water without lugging a wet cotton towel around.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-yHBSZgrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6OT1W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6OTBC", "title": "MSR MicroRocket Stove", "description": "A trip into the unknown shouldn't make you give up certain luxuries... and by luxuries, we mean coffee. The MSR Pocket Rocket packs easily for long treks and boils water in save-your-life quick time. Its easy assembly and simple operation mean you don't have to prime or pressurize the stove to get a flame going, and its brilliant simplicity means maintenance is small to non-existent.", "text": "MSR MicroRocket Stove A trip into the unknown shouldn't make you give up certain luxuries... and by luxuries, we mean coffee. The MSR Pocket Rocket packs easily for long treks and boils water in save-your-life quick time. Its easy assembly and simple operation mean you don't have to prime or pressurize the stove to get a flame going, and its brilliant simplicity means maintenance is small to non-existent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aKA2IkNyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6OTBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B005I6OZHU", "title": "Giro Feature Mountain Bike Helmet", "description": "As trail riding progresses, helmets have to evolve. The Feature starts with a new shape that combines a little more coverage than traditional trail helmets, with vents that radiate heat up and out of the helmet; perfect for climbing at lower speeds. And when the trail drops, our rugged In-Form fit system offers one-handed fit and stability adjustment, so you can dial-in the perfect feel and stay focused on the trail ahead.", "text": "Giro Feature Mountain Bike Helmet As trail riding progresses, helmets have to evolve. The Feature starts with a new shape that combines a little more coverage than traditional trail helmets, with vents that radiate heat up and out of the helmet; perfect for climbing at lower speeds. And when the trail drops, our rugged In-Form fit system offers one-handed fit and stability adjustment, so you can dial-in the perfect feel and stay focused on the trail ahead.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31coyar9l2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6OZHU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6P2VS", "title": "MSR WhisperLite Universal Stove", "description": "Rather than juggling two stoves, overpacking, and stressing the heck out, the WhisperLite Universal allows you to burn both liquid fuel and gas, with the ability to invert gas canisters for cold weather use.", "text": "MSR WhisperLite Universal Stove Rather than juggling two stoves, overpacking, and stressing the heck out, the WhisperLite Universal allows you to burn both liquid fuel and gas, with the ability to invert gas canisters for cold weather use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411Gz4sTerL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6P2VS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MSR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 139.95}}
{"item_id": "B005I6PCKY", "title": "Packtowl Original Superabsorbent Towel", "description": "The original superabsorbent towel comes in a variety of sizes to meet any fun or utility need. It’s made from a natural, fiber-based fabric that softens with every wash, so it only gets better with age.", "text": "Packtowl Original Superabsorbent Towel The original superabsorbent towel comes in a variety of sizes to meet any fun or utility need. It’s made from a natural, fiber-based fabric that softens with every wash, so it only gets better with age.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/312rqpa9FrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6PCKY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6QZE6", "title": "Therm-a-Rest ProLite Sleeping Pad", "description": "", "text": "Therm-a-Rest ProLite Sleeping Pad", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jutIcT9NL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6QZE6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Self-Inflating Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6R0WC", "title": "Thermarest Z-Lite SOL Sleeping Pad", "description": "Our lightest, most compact closed-cell mattress is now warmer than ever: a new, aluminized surface reflects heat, increasing overall warmth by nearly 20%. The proprietary foams are softer on top for extra comfort and denser on the bottom for extra durability. Wherever you’re headed, the Z Lite Sol mattress is the right choice for ultralight, warmth, durability and comfort.", "text": "Thermarest Z-Lite SOL Sleeping Pad Our lightest, most compact closed-cell mattress is now warmer than ever: a new, aluminized surface reflects heat, increasing overall warmth by nearly 20%. The proprietary foams are softer on top for extra comfort and denser on the bottom for extra durability. Wherever you’re headed, the Z Lite Sol mattress is the right choice for ultralight, warmth, durability and comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QW3S3yz6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6R0WC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads", "Foam Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6RBOO", "title": "Thermarest NeoAir Xlite Sleeping Pad", "description": "NeoAir technology changed what people expect from a backcountry mattress. Warm, comfortable and extremely lightweight, our next-generation NeoAir mattress delivers even greater performance than the original. The streamlined shape makes the XLite mattress ultra light and highly packable, while continuing to provide the comfort you need in the backcountry. Stuff sack and repair kit included.", "text": "Thermarest NeoAir Xlite Sleeping Pad NeoAir technology changed what people expect from a backcountry mattress. Warm, comfortable and extremely lightweight, our next-generation NeoAir mattress delivers even greater performance than the original. The streamlined shape makes the XLite mattress ultra light and highly packable, while continuing to provide the comfort you need in the backcountry. Stuff sack and repair kit included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4152vSZA6EL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6RBOO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Sleeping Pads"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005I6SGI4", "title": "Packtowl Nano Light Towel", "description": "Our lightest, most compact towel, the Nano is the ideal choice for those who pack light. The smooth texture is perfect for drying skin around faces and hands.", "text": "Packtowl Nano Light Towel Our lightest, most compact towel, the Nano is the ideal choice for those who pack light. The smooth texture is perfect for drying skin around faces and hands.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WyfeypcQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005I6SGI4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]]}}
