{"item_id": "B005IABM0O", "title": "Maxpedition Three Mag Holder (Hook & Loop Modular 3-Clip Holder)", "description": "Three Mag Holder (Hook & Loop Modular 3-Clip Holder) attaches with hook side velcro to loop velcro sewn in various Maxpedition packs. It holds your magazine clips, multi-tools, or flashlights. Dimensions: 2\" x 6.5\". Color Options: Black Only.", "text": "Maxpedition Three Mag Holder (Hook & Loop Modular 3-Clip Holder) Three Mag Holder (Hook & Loop Modular 3-Clip Holder) attaches with hook side velcro to loop velcro sewn in various Maxpedition packs. It holds your magazine clips, multi-tools, or flashlights. Dimensions: 2\" x 6.5\". Color Options: Black Only.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OCC24VdAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IABM0O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 11.75}}
{"item_id": "B005IABNFS", "title": "Maxpedition Gear Tactical Travel Tray", "description": "Product Details Ever been unable to find your car keys or cellphone right as you were heading out the door to that important meeting? We've all been there. Our Tactical Travel Tray keeps all your essentials and valuables in one place. Inside of tray dims: 8.5-Inch x 5.5-Inch x 2-Inch Tray flattened dims: 12.5-Inch x 11-Inch x 0.25-Inch Folding tray-style organizer for valuables Keep key, phone, EDC essentials in centralized location Keep glasses, watch, jewelry on bedside table Keep gun parts from getting lost during cleaning Lays flat when not in use; very easy to pack.", "text": "Maxpedition Gear Tactical Travel Tray Product Details Ever been unable to find your car keys or cellphone right as you were heading out the door to that important meeting? We've all been there. Our Tactical Travel Tray keeps all your essentials and valuables in one place. Inside of tray dims: 8.5-Inch x 5.5-Inch x 2-Inch Tray flattened dims: 12.5-Inch x 11-Inch x 0.25-Inch Folding tray-style organizer for valuables Keep key, phone, EDC essentials in centralized location Keep glasses, watch, jewelry on bedside table Keep gun parts from getting lost during cleaning Lays flat when not in use; very easy to pack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41H4k6kDfIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IABNFS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Maxpedition Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 19.79}}
{"item_id": "B005ICG6IK", "title": "4-16x50mm Scope W front AO adjustment. Red/green Illumination mil-dot reticle. Comes with extended sunshade and Heavy Duty Ring Mount", "description": "Objective: 50mm Magnification: 4x-16x Tube Diameter: 1\" Parallax Setting: 10 to Infinity Reticle Type: Mil-Dot Field of View (ft @ 100 yds): 22.0 - 6.0 Eye Relief (in): 3.3 Exit Pupil (mm): 10.0 - 3.1 Weight (oz): 25.7 Length (in): 15.2 Battery: CR2032 3V W/E Click Value @ 100 yds 1/4\" Overview Superior multi-coated optics sets the sniper line of scopes apart from the competition without costing you an arm and a leg. Comparable if not the same as the manufacturing process to that of the Japanese and German optics. A hint of yellowish tint can be found on most Chinese optics offered by companies such as NcStar, Aimsports, Leapers, and Barska. Sniper line of scope is crystal clear and full of useful features such as quick windage/elevation locking adjustment plate. Sniper offers not a limited lifetime warranty (as stated, you are limited to conditions in fine prints) but a 100% satisfaction guaranty on the workmanship and against any manufacturer's defect. Rule the game with your new sniper scope.", "text": "4-16x50mm Scope W front AO adjustment. Red/green Illumination mil-dot reticle. Comes with extended sunshade and Heavy Duty Ring Mount Objective: 50mm Magnification: 4x-16x Tube Diameter: 1\" Parallax Setting: 10 to Infinity Reticle Type: Mil-Dot Field of View (ft @ 100 yds): 22.0 - 6.0 Eye Relief (in): 3.3 Exit Pupil (mm): 10.0 - 3.1 Weight (oz): 25.7 Length (in): 15.2 Battery: CR2032 3V W/E Click Value @ 100 yds 1/4\" Overview Superior multi-coated optics sets the sniper line of scopes apart from the competition without costing you an arm and a leg. Comparable if not the same as the manufacturing process to that of the Japanese and German optics. A hint of yellowish tint can be found on most Chinese optics offered by companies such as NcStar, Aimsports, Leapers, and Barska. Sniper line of scope is crystal clear and full of useful features such as quick windage/elevation locking adjustment plate. Sniper offers not a limited lifetime warranty (as stated, you are limited to conditions in fine prints) but a 100% satisfaction guaranty on the workmanship and against any manufacturer's defect. Rule the game with your new sniper scope.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RVukjqBpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ICG6IK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sniper", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 93.0}}
{"item_id": "B005ID0KI6", "title": "ExOfficio Accessories Sol Cool Bandana,Sage,One", "description": "", "text": "ExOfficio Accessories Sol Cool Bandana,Sage,One", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41w6v2FQpLL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ID0KI6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Headbands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005IGOTE4", "title": "550LB Military 7 Strand Nylon Paracord Rope Tube - 300 Feet", "description": "Military 550 Genuine GI Type III 100% Nylon Parchute Cord Paracord Rope 300 Feet Tube - Made From 100% Nylon. Made By a Certified U.S. Government Contractor. 550 lbs. Test. 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part of any Survival Kit. Type III Paracord. Enhanced Para Cord is Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail.Our nylon paracord is made in the U.S. by a government contractor. It is certified 550 lbs. test cord with seven internal strands and a colored woven exterior. It is GSA compliant and meets Mil-Spec. You will find it to be durable, water-resistant, rot-resistant, and surprisingly strong. Paracord is the ultimate utility cord and proves itself useful whenever you need something stronger than string or twine but lighter and less bulky than a rope.Use the tubes for all your projects. The 300 feet length is perfect size for all your needs. It doesn't take up much space and these paracord tubes are really great for any paracord user. Mix and match our paracord colors from our wide selection and great low prices!Paracord direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts.THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN SHRINK WRAP & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "text": "550LB Military 7 Strand Nylon Paracord Rope Tube - 300 Feet Military 550 Genuine GI Type III 100% Nylon Parchute Cord Paracord Rope 300 Feet Tube - Made From 100% Nylon. Made By a Certified U.S. Government Contractor. 550 lbs. Test. 7 Strand Core. Made In The USA. 5/32\" Diameter. Important Part of any Survival Kit. Type III Paracord. Enhanced Para Cord is Better Than Military Specifications. Top Quality Craftsmanship, Detailed Construction, Improving Every Last Detail.Our nylon paracord is made in the U.S. by a government contractor. It is certified 550 lbs. test cord with seven internal strands and a colored woven exterior. It is GSA compliant and meets Mil-Spec. You will find it to be durable, water-resistant, rot-resistant, and surprisingly strong. Paracord is the ultimate utility cord and proves itself useful whenever you need something stronger than string or twine but lighter and less bulky than a rope.Use the tubes for all your projects. The 300 feet length is perfect size for all your needs. It doesn't take up much space and these paracord tubes are really great for any paracord user. Mix and match our paracord colors from our wide selection and great low prices!Paracord direct from the manufacturer. Commercial Grade Paracord not Mil-Spec. When reliability is a must, this is what you want. This is the real thing, not a cheap imitation. Some uses for this cord can be: Ridgelines for Tarps Securing Equipment Shoelaces, Hanging Food from Bears, Vehicle Tie Downs, Sewing Fabric, Repairing Equipment, Making a Fire Bow, Fishing Line, Paracord String for a Bow, Making a Shelter, Fish Gill Nets, Fishing Line, Animal Snares Clothes Lines, Paracord Lanyards, Anchor Line, Binding, Twine, Animal Restraints, Tooth Floss, Splints, Tourniquet, Paracord Braiding, Bracelets, Paracord Bracelets & Other Paracord Crafts.THESE PARACORDS ARE MADE SPECIFICALLY BY ARMYUNIVERSE & NOT ANY OTHER BRAND. THEY COME SEALED IN SHRINK WRAP & OFFICIAL ARMYUNIVERSE LOGO & PACKAGING.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517r3%2B9PDGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IGOTE4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B005IHT32Q", "title": "Classic SafariTM Aluminum Framed Gun Case", "description": "Features aluminum-framed exterior, 2 combination locks and foam inserts to protect guns from damage. Measures 18-1/2\" x 3-1/4\" x 9-3/4\". Not childproof. Gift boxed.Gun not included.", "text": "Classic SafariTM Aluminum Framed Gun Case Features aluminum-framed exterior, 2 combination locks and foam inserts to protect guns from damage. Measures 18-1/2\" x 3-1/4\" x 9-3/4\". Not childproof. Gift boxed.Gun not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51W02I0-poL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IHT32Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Pistol Cases"]], "price": 20.44}}
{"item_id": "B005IISMAY", "title": "Tac Force Speedster EMT Assisted Open Pocket Knife Rescue Tool w/ Glass Breaker and Seatbelt Cutter", "description": "Misc Speed Assisted Rescue Linerlock - EMT. 4 1/2\" closed. 3 1/2\" black finish partially serrated assisted opening stainless blade with thumb stud, Emergency Medical Team blade etching and extended tang. Orange finish aluminum handles with machined hole cutouts and EMT shield. Integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "text": "Tac Force Speedster EMT Assisted Open Pocket Knife Rescue Tool w/ Glass Breaker and Seatbelt Cutter Misc Speed Assisted Rescue Linerlock - EMT. 4 1/2\" closed. 3 1/2\" black finish partially serrated assisted opening stainless blade with thumb stud, Emergency Medical Team blade etching and extended tang. Orange finish aluminum handles with machined hole cutouts and EMT shield. Integrated seat belt cutter and glass breaker. Black finish stainless pocket clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41l4SzahwGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IISMAY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Miscellaneous", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 7.5}}
