{"item_id": "B005IZDRWK", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS Rifle Receiver Cover Top Pin Replacement Part", "description": "Brand New. SKS Replacement receiver pin for the top cover. If it is ever lost or worn out, this critical part would do the job just as well if not better than the original. A must have for any SKS owner's kit.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical SKS Rifle Receiver Cover Top Pin Replacement Part Brand New. SKS Replacement receiver pin for the top cover. If it is ever lost or worn out, this critical part would do the job just as well if not better than the original. A must have for any SKS owner's kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zNFHGI5SL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005IZDRWK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B005J13VCO", "title": "Squirrel Daddy Ar15 / M16 Lower Receiver Magazine Vise Block Made In Usa", "description": "Robust designs and high performance is what to expect from Squirrel Daddy products. Our lower vise block will work with an AR-15 lower receiver that is stripped or a fully assembled. You may work on the top side or bottom side of the receiver without removing the block from the vise. With our design only the bottom part of the block will get marked up from the vise jaws, leaving the precision machined upper part undamaged so you will have a perfect fit every time.", "text": "Squirrel Daddy Ar15 / M16 Lower Receiver Magazine Vise Block Made In Usa Robust designs and high performance is what to expect from Squirrel Daddy products. Our lower vise block will work with an AR-15 lower receiver that is stripped or a fully assembled. You may work on the top side or bottom side of the receiver without removing the block from the vise. With our design only the bottom part of the block will get marked up from the vise jaws, leaving the precision machined upper part undamaged so you will have a perfect fit every time.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31gwKoD%2BYdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005J13VCO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.78}}
{"item_id": "B005J1QMWA", "title": "Military Outdoor Clothing U.S. Military Jumbo Bail-Out Bag", "description": "M.O.C. Jumbo Bail-Out Bags have 12 exterior pockets, 7 interior pockets and 2 exterior hidden Velcro closure pockets (good for weapons). Polyester lining to protect your delicate items from scratching. Plastic coat-treated metal zippers with leash. Wide and comfortable removable shoulder strap. Inner AR15 30 round. Side pockets designed for water bottles or drinks. Velcro attachment points for ID or moral patches. Outside measures 20 x 11 x 15 Inch. Main compartment measures 16 x 7 x 14 Inch.", "text": "Military Outdoor Clothing U.S. Military Jumbo Bail-Out Bag M.O.C. Jumbo Bail-Out Bags have 12 exterior pockets, 7 interior pockets and 2 exterior hidden Velcro closure pockets (good for weapons). Polyester lining to protect your delicate items from scratching. Plastic coat-treated metal zippers with leash. Wide and comfortable removable shoulder strap. Inner AR15 30 round. Side pockets designed for water bottles or drinks. Velcro attachment points for ID or moral patches. Outside measures 20 x 11 x 15 Inch. Main compartment measures 16 x 7 x 14 Inch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NtmAqtUDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005J1QMWA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Explorer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 30.5}}
