{"item_id": "B005J6ZABO", "title": "Halo Headbands Super Wide II Cycling Headband", "description": "All Halo Products offer Sweat Block technology and fits great under helmets. Every Halo Headband included our soft and comfortable Sweat Block water-tight seal that redirects sweat away from your face. All Halo Products are made with High Performance DRYLINE Visa Endurance Fabric. The Dry line Fabric absorbs, evaporates and wicks sweat away quickly while channeling the sweat away from your eyes.", "text": "Halo Headbands Super Wide II Cycling Headband All Halo Products offer Sweat Block technology and fits great under helmets. Every Halo Headband included our soft and comfortable Sweat Block water-tight seal that redirects sweat away from your face. All Halo Products are made with High Performance DRYLINE Visa Endurance Fabric. The Dry line Fabric absorbs, evaporates and wicks sweat away quickly while channeling the sweat away from your eyes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417z2hcWX8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005J6ZABO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Halo Headbands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 12.27}}
{"item_id": "B005J76ETA", "title": "UKARMS 1911 Spring Plastic Pistol Airsoft Gun 217AF w/ Laser, Light FPS-160", "description": "You really can't beat the 217AF by UKARMS when it comes to options and a great price. The M1851F comes with a LED tactical light and a laser sight. The gun fires straight and accurate and is very easy to load. Features:Spring Powered /Plastic Construction /Light Weight /Easy to Load /Hop-Up Fixed /Laser and Flashlight /Use 6mm Plastic BBs Includes:Spring 1911 Pistol Airsoft Gun 217AF /A Bag of BBs /Laser and Light Part Specifications:FPS: 160~180 w/6mm .12g BB /Magazine Capacity: 9 /Size:7\"", "text": "UKARMS 1911 Spring Plastic Pistol Airsoft Gun 217AF w/ Laser, Light FPS-160 You really can't beat the 217AF by UKARMS when it comes to options and a great price. The M1851F comes with a LED tactical light and a laser sight. The gun fires straight and accurate and is very easy to load. Features:Spring Powered /Plastic Construction /Light Weight /Easy to Load /Hop-Up Fixed /Laser and Flashlight /Use 6mm Plastic BBs Includes:Spring 1911 Pistol Airsoft Gun 217AF /A Bag of BBs /Laser and Light Part Specifications:FPS: 160~180 w/6mm .12g BB /Magazine Capacity: 9 /Size:7\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J6Oa5v-ML._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005J76ETA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UKARMS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 17.49}}
{"item_id": "B005J7CUTS", "title": "Speedo I.M. Tech Paddles", "description": "Tired of swimming with multiple paddle sizes for specific stroke techniques and benefits? Now you can maximize all your training needs with swimming's first multi stroke paddle. The I.M. Tech Paddle is specifically designed to improve your technique for butterfly, backstroke, breastroke, or freestyle swimming - all with one training tool. With multiple water channel holes to retain the feel of the water and other great features, this is a must for every serious swimmer wanting to improve strength, endurance, or technique and take seconds off the stopwatch. Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions and the world's #1 swim brand!", "text": "Speedo I.M. Tech Paddles Tired of swimming with multiple paddle sizes for specific stroke techniques and benefits? Now you can maximize all your training needs with swimming's first multi stroke paddle. The I.M. Tech Paddle is specifically designed to improve your technique for butterfly, backstroke, breastroke, or freestyle swimming - all with one training tool. With multiple water channel holes to retain the feel of the water and other great features, this is a must for every serious swimmer wanting to improve strength, endurance, or technique and take seconds off the stopwatch. Look and feel your best as you play, train, or win in Speedo, the choice of champions and the world's #1 swim brand!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MgX41OdBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005J7CUTS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Training Equipment", "Hand Paddles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005JAF44S", "title": "Tech-SIGHT'S TSM200 Adjustable Aperture Sight for THE MARLIN 60, 795, 70P and 70PSS Rifles", "description": "Rear sight Windage & Elevation adjustable with detent locking. Increases sight radius by 6\". Now made with steel parts. Compatible with TS211 Sight adjusting tool (ASIN: B0086T8IVU) and IRAS aperture inserts(ASIN: B00ANWVAAY). (not included but also available on Amazon)", "text": "Tech-SIGHT'S TSM200 Adjustable Aperture Sight for THE MARLIN 60, 795, 70P and 70PSS Rifles Rear sight Windage & Elevation adjustable with detent locking. Increases sight radius by 6\". Now made with steel parts. Compatible with TS211 Sight adjusting tool (ASIN: B0086T8IVU) and IRAS aperture inserts(ASIN: B00ANWVAAY). (not included but also available on Amazon)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vg79ky3HL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JAF44S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.99}}
{"item_id": "B005JCL05I", "title": "100 BCW 9-Pocket Plastic Sheets", "description": "The BCW Pro 9-Pocket page is an acid free archival quality product that is designed to protect, store and display your trading cards. This product features high clarity and top loading pockets with strong welds. BCW 9-Pocket pFor Ages fit all standard 3-ring binders and albums. 100 9-pocket sheets.", "text": "100 BCW 9-Pocket Plastic Sheets The BCW Pro 9-Pocket page is an acid free archival quality product that is designed to protect, store and display your trading cards. This product features high clarity and top loading pockets with strong welds. BCW 9-Pocket pFor Ages fit all standard 3-ring binders and albums. 100 9-pocket sheets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CgV34hPJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JCL05I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "BCW", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Memorabilia Display & Storage", "Card Sleeves"]], "price": 14.59}}
{"item_id": "B005JCZI5G", "title": "ECR4Kids Lock and Roll Portable Under-Bed Personal Safe", "description": "This low profile, locking mobile storage container from ECR4Kids is perfect for protecting your valuables with ease and efficiency. It's great for college students that need to lock up their lap top computer, passport, wallet, and any other valuables. Also ideal for vacation homes, boats, or RV's. Just place valuables in the container, lock lid and roll it under any standard bed frame. Includes a wire-braided security cable to secure it to the bed frame or other fixed post. Cart capacity is 50 lbs/23 kgs.", "text": "ECR4Kids Lock and Roll Portable Under-Bed Personal Safe This low profile, locking mobile storage container from ECR4Kids is perfect for protecting your valuables with ease and efficiency. It's great for college students that need to lock up their lap top computer, passport, wallet, and any other valuables. Also ideal for vacation homes, boats, or RV's. Just place valuables in the container, lock lid and roll it under any standard bed frame. Includes a wire-braided security cable to secure it to the bed frame or other fixed post. Cart capacity is 50 lbs/23 kgs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Og3WEv%2BCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JCZI5G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ECR4Kids", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 64.22}}
{"item_id": "B005JEI932", "title": "Aqua-Quest \"The Guide\" Waterproof & Ultra Lightweight Silicone Sil Tarp - 13 x 10 Large Green Model", "description": "The Ultralight Large Sil Tarp, made by Aqua Quest, has a Proven Record of Being One of The Best Sil Tarps Available Anywhere on Earth. With a Hydrostatic Resistance rating of 20,000 mm, You Can be Confident that You Will Remain Dry, Even in Extreme Weather. Gear Out Here is Proud to Present AquaQuest Products - Tested by Over 40,000 of Our Happy Customers in the Wildest Conditions on Earth, from Africa to Antarctica. We Know You Will Be as Satisfied as They Are.", "text": "Aqua-Quest \"The Guide\" Waterproof & Ultra Lightweight Silicone Sil Tarp - 13 x 10 Large Green Model The Ultralight Large Sil Tarp, made by Aqua Quest, has a Proven Record of Being One of The Best Sil Tarps Available Anywhere on Earth. With a Hydrostatic Resistance rating of 20,000 mm, You Can be Confident that You Will Remain Dry, Even in Extreme Weather. Gear Out Here is Proud to Present AquaQuest Products - Tested by Over 40,000 of Our Happy Customers in the Wildest Conditions on Earth, from Africa to Antarctica. We Know You Will Be as Satisfied as They Are.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31HlIwDN1QL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JEI932.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Tent Tarps"]], "price": 99.0}}
