{"item_id": "B005JLYV6Y", "title": "Scuba Max Regulator Bag - Heavy Duty Padded Cover - Dive Bag", "description": "This is a great, simple reg bag! Dimensions are 13\"x13\"x4\"Fully padded Adjustable and removable padded shoulder strap Holds even the largest reg setups.Made with high quality materials.", "text": "Scuba Max Regulator Bag - Heavy Duty Padded Cover - Dive Bag This is a great, simple reg bag! Dimensions are 13\"x13\"x4\"Fully padded Adjustable and removable padded shoulder strap Holds even the largest reg setups.Made with high quality materials.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412x1cT40KL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JLYV6Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scuba Max", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Regulator Accessories"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B005JSARJM", "title": "United Cutlery UC2814 Elite for CES Military Paracord Survival Bracelet, OD Green", "description": "This military paracord survival bracelet is hand woven from military spec, 300-lb. paracord. Each bracelet offers strong ABS side-release buckles and fits wrists up to 7 to 9\" in circumference. The bracelet can be unwound in survival situations to produce more than 9 feet of usable survival cord. It could be used for shelter building, splint building, spear lashing, building animal snares and many other tasks.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2814 Elite for CES Military Paracord Survival Bracelet, OD Green This military paracord survival bracelet is hand woven from military spec, 300-lb. paracord. Each bracelet offers strong ABS side-release buckles and fits wrists up to 7 to 9\" in circumference. The bracelet can be unwound in survival situations to produce more than 9 feet of usable survival cord. It could be used for shelter building, splint building, spear lashing, building animal snares and many other tasks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tGiomnwRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JSARJM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 5.25}}
{"item_id": "B005JSG6NI", "title": "HDE® Mini Pocket Fishing Rod / Reel", "description": "Now you can fish anytime and anywhere (as long as there is water) with this high quality fishing pen! Fish when you have the time, but especially when the fish are bitin`! This FishPen comes equipped with a casting reel and is designed for both fishermen and fisherwomen to use anytime! The rod extends from the size of a pen to over 3.5 feet in length and definitely provides you with all the necessities of a standard fishing rod. The rod is small, compact, and perfectly designed to be put in your pocket, in your glove box, or in a backpack! Get yours today and save!", "text": "HDE® Mini Pocket Fishing Rod / Reel Now you can fish anytime and anywhere (as long as there is water) with this high quality fishing pen! Fish when you have the time, but especially when the fish are bitin`! This FishPen comes equipped with a casting reel and is designed for both fishermen and fisherwomen to use anytime! The rod extends from the size of a pen to over 3.5 feet in length and definitely provides you with all the necessities of a standard fishing rod. The rod is small, compact, and perfectly designed to be put in your pocket, in your glove box, or in a backpack! Get yours today and save!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RXTr9HrML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JSG6NI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Rod & Reel Combos", "Baitcasting Combos"]], "price": 10.99}}
