{"item_id": "B005JVUWJ4", "title": "1911 Pistol Recoil Buffer Pack of 10 Also work for Ruger Mini 14 (see picture)", "description": "This recoil buffer reduces metal to metal impact of slide to frame, reduces internal wear. You will feel the difference the first time you cycle the slide. You actually get ten (10) buffers in each package because the mfgr. knows what a bear the M1911A1 .45 is, making the average life of these buffers about 800-1600 shots instead of the 3000-7000 life of rifle buffers.", "text": "1911 Pistol Recoil Buffer Pack of 10 Also work for Ruger Mini 14 (see picture) This recoil buffer reduces metal to metal impact of slide to frame, reduces internal wear. You will feel the difference the first time you cycle the slide. You actually get ten (10) buffers in each package because the mfgr. knows what a bear the M1911A1 .45 is, making the average life of these buffers about 800-1600 shots instead of the 3000-7000 life of rifle buffers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31WzDOBGx1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JVUWJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GRG MFG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 6.09}}
{"item_id": "B005JWGJI6", "title": "Tactical Pistol Red Laser Sight w/Rail", "description": "Raser Range: 300 mm Length:1.2\" Weight: 1 oz Operated by 3x AG5 Battery(Included)", "text": "Tactical Pistol Red Laser Sight w/Rail Raser Range: 300 mm Length:1.2\" Weight: 1 oz Operated by 3x AG5 Battery(Included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z5XSqNHdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JWGJI6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Sights"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B005JWQY40", "title": "EZ Towel with New Durable Tube and Packaging, 50 Pieces", "description": "This NEW AND Improved EZ Towel features more compression (it takes less water to activate), a stronger, more durable and moisture-resistant plastic carry tube that will hold up to 10 EZ Towels (included in package for free). This EZ Towel package also comes with a re-designed moisture-resistant zip-lock to insure that your EZ Towels stay dry when you are not using them and a step-by-step guide on the package to show you how to use. EZ Towels are made out of a completely 100% Rayon material that is bio-degradable and septic-safe. The EZ Towel comes packaged in a convenient, re-sealable pouch that holds 50 towels. All you need to do is simply add water, watch it grow, unfold and use. When the EZ Towel is unfolded, it is about 8 1/2 inches by 9 1/2 inches and it is durable, soft and absorbable. Plus, this package of EZ Towels includes a convenient plastic carry case that will hold up to 10 EZ Towels. You can put this in your pocket, purse, or diaper bag and carry it with you on the go. Forget paper towels! The EZ Towel does more work than 10 paper towels combined!", "text": "EZ Towel with New Durable Tube and Packaging, 50 Pieces This NEW AND Improved EZ Towel features more compression (it takes less water to activate), a stronger, more durable and moisture-resistant plastic carry tube that will hold up to 10 EZ Towels (included in package for free). This EZ Towel package also comes with a re-designed moisture-resistant zip-lock to insure that your EZ Towels stay dry when you are not using them and a step-by-step guide on the package to show you how to use. EZ Towels are made out of a completely 100% Rayon material that is bio-degradable and septic-safe. The EZ Towel comes packaged in a convenient, re-sealable pouch that holds 50 towels. All you need to do is simply add water, watch it grow, unfold and use. When the EZ Towel is unfolded, it is about 8 1/2 inches by 9 1/2 inches and it is durable, soft and absorbable. Plus, this package of EZ Towels includes a convenient plastic carry case that will hold up to 10 EZ Towels. You can put this in your pocket, purse, or diaper bag and carry it with you on the go. Forget paper towels! The EZ Towel does more work than 10 paper towels combined!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51PKQ3PG6IL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JWQY40.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EZ-Towel", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Towels"]], "price": 7.65}}
{"item_id": "B005JZGM0I", "title": "Survivor Fire Starters Magnesium Firesteel Orange, Flint and Steel", "description": "Provides 20,000 strikes. Includes plastic handle with nylon strap, striker, compass and thermometer. Ships in retail clamshell packaging and instruction card.", "text": "Survivor Fire Starters Magnesium Firesteel Orange, Flint and Steel Provides 20,000 strikes. Includes plastic handle with nylon strap, striker, compass and thermometer. Ships in retail clamshell packaging and instruction card.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ysjPadkeL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005JZGM0I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Survivor Firestarters", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 24.89}}
{"item_id": "B005K031OC", "title": "DeSantis Pocket Shot LCP/P3AT/TCP Black", "description": "The Pocket Shot is our latest way to conceal and rapidly access your small auto. The #110 disguises itself as a wallet but can be brought into action instantly without removing the gun. It's made of black leather, is ambidextrous, and will carry several different 380 and 32 autos.", "text": "DeSantis Pocket Shot LCP/P3AT/TCP Black The Pocket Shot is our latest way to conceal and rapidly access your small auto. The #110 disguises itself as a wallet but can be brought into action instantly without removing the gun. It's made of black leather, is ambidextrous, and will carry several different 380 and 32 autos.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BbsFFvvqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005K031OC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 31.08}}
{"item_id": "B005K4TWVY", "title": "", "description": "Revolutionary FPS controller for the Playstation 3 with PC style control layout for FPS players of all levels. The mouse allows for precision aiming and quick response with an adjustable mouse sensitivity switch. This controller will allow you to experience FPS games at a whole new level. Keyboard and mouse buttons are remappable with LED backlight display installed for players to recognize which button is remapped. This product also includes a HORI mouse pad.", "text": "Revolutionary FPS controller for the Playstation 3 with PC style control layout for FPS players of all levels. The mouse allows for precision aiming and quick response with an adjustable mouse sensitivity switch. This controller will allow you to experience FPS games at a whole new level. Keyboard and mouse buttons are remappable with LED backlight display installed for players to recognize which button is remapped. This product also includes a HORI mouse pad.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51U7MTCpT5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005K4TWVY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Tactical Vests"]], "price": 85.52}}
{"item_id": "B005K7ZG0W", "title": "Tac Sol Rug Mk Series Hlstr High Blk", "description": "American - made, secure and quick! Black Dog Mag Ruger MK Series Holster. A new Holster designed to fit the Ruger Mark Series (MK-I, MK-II, MK-III and 22/45) .22LR pistols with or without optics. It has adjustable retention for the perfect fit and draw for the various versions. Made of near-indestructible Kydex thermomolded plastic. Reversible design for left and right handers. Fits up to a 2\" belt. The smooth ride your gun needs... get it now! Black Dog Mag Ruger MK Series Holster", "text": "Tac Sol Rug Mk Series Hlstr High Blk American - made, secure and quick! Black Dog Mag Ruger MK Series Holster. A new Holster designed to fit the Ruger Mark Series (MK-I, MK-II, MK-III and 22/45) .22LR pistols with or without optics. It has adjustable retention for the perfect fit and draw for the various versions. Made of near-indestructible Kydex thermomolded plastic. Reversible design for left and right handers. Fits up to a 2\" belt. The smooth ride your gun needs... get it now! Black Dog Mag Ruger MK Series Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xO%2B3q23YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005K7ZG0W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tactical Solutions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 30.59}}
{"item_id": "B005K994QM", "title": "Mora Stainless Steel Camo Knife", "description": "", "text": "Mora Stainless Steel Camo Knife", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41BIzn54G4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005K994QM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 11.0}}
{"item_id": "B005KAKA2S", "title": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck Ruger LC9 Right Hand Tan", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck Ruger LC9 Right Hand Tan Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31V8nwVW5cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KAKA2S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.58}}
{"item_id": "B005KDBHWM", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Black", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip. The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps. The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking. * Capacity: 36L * 2 separate compartments * 2 front pockets * All pockets with a 2-way zipper * Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack * Adjustable padded shoulder straps * Padded back * Adjustable hip belt * Lateral compression straps * Various MOLLE attachment points * Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps * Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated * Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm * Weight: 1400g * Water-resistant * Manufacturer: Mil-Tec * The best in fashion and comfort * Finished to high standard * Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition! * Extremely Durable army product * Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L Black This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip. The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps. The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking. * Capacity: 36L * 2 separate compartments * 2 front pockets * All pockets with a 2-way zipper * Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack * Adjustable padded shoulder straps * Padded back * Adjustable hip belt * Lateral compression straps * Various MOLLE attachment points * Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps * Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated * Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm * Weight: 1400g * Water-resistant * Manufacturer: Mil-Tec * The best in fashion and comfort * Finished to high standard * Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition! * Extremely Durable army product * Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X8v2LM4GL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KDBHWM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005KGC6OC", "title": "Shimano SM-BB4600 Tiagra Hollowtech II Bottom Bracket (68-mm BSA)", "description": "The Shimano 4600 Tiagra bottom bracket includes the cups and bearings needed to install a Hollowtech 2 road crankset such as the FC-4600. Available in standard BSA threading (68mm BB shell).", "text": "Shimano SM-BB4600 Tiagra Hollowtech II Bottom Bracket (68-mm BSA) The Shimano 4600 Tiagra bottom bracket includes the cups and bearings needed to install a Hollowtech 2 road crankset such as the FC-4600. Available in standard BSA threading (68mm BB shell).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KUsiedpvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KGC6OC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shimano", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components"]], "price": 17.99}}
{"item_id": "B005KH8FHI", "title": "AR15 Match Grade Flat Top Carry Handle - Adj Rear Sight", "description": "Precision/Tolerances to Fit All Model 4/15 Variants Superior Quality Locking Plate Excellent Quality Thumb Nuts with Retention Design Precision Windage/Elevation Adjustments", "text": "AR15 Match Grade Flat Top Carry Handle - Adj Rear Sight Precision/Tolerances to Fit All Model 4/15 Variants Superior Quality Locking Plate Excellent Quality Thumb Nuts with Retention Design Precision Windage/Elevation Adjustments", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lxJwvU9yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KH8FHI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 12.66}}
{"item_id": "B005KLBJHM", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Release 2.5-10x40 Dual Red and Green P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle Hunting AR15 AR-15 M4 M-4 Rifle Scope W/ .223 Bullet Drop Compensator And Red Dot Laser Sight - Includes QD Weaver-Picatinny Base, Lithium Battery,lens cleaning kit", "description": "Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 2.5-10x40 Dual Red & Green Illuminated P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle scope with red dot aiming sight. This package includes the scope, removable red dot laser, a \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Base, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery as well as a lens cleaning kit. For super fast target acquisition, the removable and fully adjustable for windage and elevation red dot aiming sight provides a great tactical advantage and also makes sighting in the scope a breeze. The scope weighs 23.5 oz,is constructed primarily of fully coated premium aircraft grade anodized aluminum , it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 8.25\" on top and 7.5\" on bottom because of the built in sunshade. This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement, and it is built to last and absorb heavy duty rifle recoil - 100% Shock and recoil resistant. This scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and will provide a sharp, bright field of view- 27.3 Feet @ 100 yards , an eye relief of 2.9\", an exit pupil of 8mm. 100-500 yard .223 bullet drop compensation. The windage and elevation adjustments are 1/2 MOA Adjustments.The scope's illuminated P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 11 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 5 illumated red settings, or 5 illuminated green settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical \"QD\" Quick Release 2.5-10x40 Dual Red and Green P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle Hunting AR15 AR-15 M4 M-4 Rifle Scope W/ .223 Bullet Drop Compensator And Red Dot Laser Sight - Includes QD Weaver-Picatinny Base, Lithium Battery,lens cleaning kit Official Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation 2.5-10x40 Dual Red & Green Illuminated P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder Reticle scope with red dot aiming sight. This package includes the scope, removable red dot laser, a \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Base, a lithium CR-2032 3V battery as well as a lens cleaning kit. For super fast target acquisition, the removable and fully adjustable for windage and elevation red dot aiming sight provides a great tactical advantage and also makes sighting in the scope a breeze. The scope weighs 23.5 oz,is constructed primarily of fully coated premium aircraft grade anodized aluminum , it has a Black Matte finish color, and a length of approximately 8.25\" on top and 7.5\" on bottom because of the built in sunshade. This scope is built for hunters, military, law enforcement, and it is built to last and absorb heavy duty rifle recoil - 100% Shock and recoil resistant. This scope is nitrogen filled, fully coated, shockproof, fogproof, and water resistant. The lenses are multi coated and will provide a sharp, bright field of view- 27.3 Feet @ 100 yards , an eye relief of 2.9\", an exit pupil of 8mm. 100-500 yard .223 bullet drop compensation. The windage and elevation adjustments are 1/2 MOA Adjustments.The scope's illuminated P4 Mil Dot Rangefinder reticle allows the shooter to estimate the range of the target, and is able to be viewed with 11 different settings -either black(when illumination is turned off), or 5 illumated red settings, or 5 illuminated green settings to allow the shooter the best tactical advantage in any setting.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31iP7a1PxEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KLBJHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.95}}
{"item_id": "B005KLXGJQ", "title": "SE 10 pc Rifle/Gun Cleaning Kit", "description": "10 pc Rifle/Gun Cleaning Kit. Kit Includes: 1pc .22 cal Brass Brush, 1pc .22 cal Chamber Brush, 1pc Double Ended Mini Nylon Brush, 1pc Plastic Oil Bottle, 2pc Patch Holder, 4pc Rifle Rods, Comes with Canvas Pouch.", "text": "SE 10 pc Rifle/Gun Cleaning Kit 10 pc Rifle/Gun Cleaning Kit. Kit Includes: 1pc .22 cal Brass Brush, 1pc .22 cal Chamber Brush, 1pc Double Ended Mini Nylon Brush, 1pc Plastic Oil Bottle, 2pc Patch Holder, 4pc Rifle Rods, Comes with Canvas Pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jeCIfeBtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KLXGJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 9.27}}
{"item_id": "B005KMFPSA", "title": "Original Gas Mask Nbc Filter - Canister Type 80 Israeli Imported", "description": "Weight: 228 g (w/o caps) Diameter: 106 mm Height: 75 mm Air flow resistance: 14 mm water gauge at a flow of 30 lpm Aerosol penetration: <0.01% CK gas life: 100 minutes (at a flow of 30 lpm and inlet concentration of 2.4 mg/lt) DMMP gas life: 250 minutes (at a flow of 30 lpm and inlet concentration of 3.0 mg/lt) Charcoal: ASC 12x30 complying with Mil-C-13724D Filter medium: Glass fibre HEPA media complying with ASME AG-1 Section FC-1 Quotation/Info. NBC FILTER CANISTER TYPE 80 Description The Type 80 filter canister was developed for the Israel Defense Force (IDF) to provide protection against all known NBC agents in the form of vapours and aerosols. It is supplied as an integral part of all Shalon's personal respiratory protection systems. The Type 80 is a robust durable canister intended for military and civil defense use. It is specially designed for comfort and extended use at a minimal physiological load, having low breathing resistance and low weight. Its design assures optimal performance complying with all IDF specifications as well as the performance requirements of the American Army C2 filter canister. The filter is supplied with a standard Nato thread (40 mm x 1/7\") and is thus compatible with almost all military and industrial respirators. The Type 80 filters are supplied sealed with leak-proof plastic caps, assuring a shelf life exceeding 15 years.", "text": "Original Gas Mask Nbc Filter - Canister Type 80 Israeli Imported Weight: 228 g (w/o caps) Diameter: 106 mm Height: 75 mm Air flow resistance: 14 mm water gauge at a flow of 30 lpm Aerosol penetration: <0.01% CK gas life: 100 minutes (at a flow of 30 lpm and inlet concentration of 2.4 mg/lt) DMMP gas life: 250 minutes (at a flow of 30 lpm and inlet concentration of 3.0 mg/lt) Charcoal: ASC 12x30 complying with Mil-C-13724D Filter medium: Glass fibre HEPA media complying with ASME AG-1 Section FC-1 Quotation/Info. NBC FILTER CANISTER TYPE 80 Description The Type 80 filter canister was developed for the Israel Defense Force (IDF) to provide protection against all known NBC agents in the form of vapours and aerosols. It is supplied as an integral part of all Shalon's personal respiratory protection systems. The Type 80 is a robust durable canister intended for military and civil defense use. It is specially designed for comfort and extended use at a minimal physiological load, having low breathing resistance and low weight. Its design assures optimal performance complying with all IDF specifications as well as the performance requirements of the American Army C2 filter canister. The filter is supplied with a standard Nato thread (40 mm x 1/7\") and is thus compatible with almost all military and industrial respirators. The Type 80 filters are supplied sealed with leak-proof plastic caps, assuring a shelf life exceeding 15 years.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Z4qDx10DL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KMFPSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shalon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 12.9}}
{"item_id": "B005KN6DIA", "title": "Blade-Tech Tek-Lok with Hardware", "description": "Introducing Blade-Tech's newly remodeled Universal Belt Clip Tek-Lok: a secure, innovative and versatile latching attachment system. The engineers and product developers at Blade-Tech took the original Tek-Lok and reworked its functional ability to add more utility and ease of use. The Tek-Lok has also been contoured to fit the profile of the body better and to eliminate hot spots. The new Tek-Lok is held in place by two robust retaining tabs. A user friendly, integrated secondary locking system was also built into the redesigned Tek-Lok. With the simple motion of a thumb or finger, the redundant lock rotates out of the way to allow the user to pinch the retaining tabs and conveniently remove the Tek-Lok from the belt. It is readily adjustable to accommodate belts from 2.25\" down to 1.25\". Hardware included in this set are as follows; (3) 3/16\" posts, (3) screws and (3) 1/8\" Spacers. Enjoy!", "text": "Blade-Tech Tek-Lok with Hardware Introducing Blade-Tech's newly remodeled Universal Belt Clip Tek-Lok: a secure, innovative and versatile latching attachment system. The engineers and product developers at Blade-Tech took the original Tek-Lok and reworked its functional ability to add more utility and ease of use. The Tek-Lok has also been contoured to fit the profile of the body better and to eliminate hot spots. The new Tek-Lok is held in place by two robust retaining tabs. A user friendly, integrated secondary locking system was also built into the redesigned Tek-Lok. With the simple motion of a thumb or finger, the redundant lock rotates out of the way to allow the user to pinch the retaining tabs and conveniently remove the Tek-Lok from the belt. It is readily adjustable to accommodate belts from 2.25\" down to 1.25\". Hardware included in this set are as follows; (3) 3/16\" posts, (3) screws and (3) 1/8\" Spacers. Enjoy!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rh9zl6ruL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KN6DIA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tek-Lok Bladetech", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boat Trailer Accessories", "Tie-Downs"]], "price": 6.4}}
{"item_id": "B005KNNQMG", "title": "AR15/.223 Armorer's Combo Wrench Tool All IN ONE 2nd Generation", "description": "ALL IN ONE TOOL-Combines many of the functions necessary for the Armorer.Helps to install and uninstall most of the accesories on .223 rifles.", "text": "AR15/.223 Armorer's Combo Wrench Tool All IN ONE 2nd Generation ALL IN ONE TOOL-Combines many of the functions necessary for the Armorer.Helps to install and uninstall most of the accesories on .223 rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31eh1C63I8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KNNQMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.9}}
{"item_id": "B005KOKFR4", "title": "Aluminum Cycle Pro Mechanic Bicycle Repair Stand Rack Bike", "description": "Body: Full Alloy AluminumHeight: Quick Release Adjustable (1.5m or 59\" Fully extended)Head Rotated:360 DegreeTool Plate: Magnetic Tool Plate IncludedColour:SilverLimited weight of bike:25kg (55.1 lbs)Weight:5kg/set (11 lbs)Place of Made: TaiwanWarranty: 1 Year", "text": "Aluminum Cycle Pro Mechanic Bicycle Repair Stand Rack Bike Body: Full Alloy AluminumHeight: Quick Release Adjustable (1.5m or 59\" Fully extended)Head Rotated:360 DegreeTool Plate: Magnetic Tool Plate IncludedColour:SilverLimited weight of bike:25kg (55.1 lbs)Weight:5kg/set (11 lbs)Place of Made: TaiwanWarranty: 1 Year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OobdgJgWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KOKFR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 99.99}}
{"item_id": "B005KOKFUQ", "title": "CYCLE PRO MECHANIC BICYCLE REPAIR STAND/RACK BIKE", "description": "Body: Powder coated AluminiumColour: BlackLimited weight of bike: 100 lbsWeight: 16 lbsMade in Taiwan", "text": "CYCLE PRO MECHANIC BICYCLE REPAIR STAND/RACK BIKE Body: Powder coated AluminiumColour: BlackLimited weight of bike: 100 lbsWeight: 16 lbsMade in Taiwan", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tX2pEDn2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KOKFUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005KP2LZW", "title": "Gerber 31-001054 Gator Combo Axe", "description": "Axes have been around for ages. And even our award-winning axes are hardly new. But the Gator Axe is a wood-busting' breakthrough. Because we applied our proprietary Gator textured rubber to the grip for an unprecedented level of comfort and control. Beneath that tactile rubber surface is a virtually indestructible glass-filled nylon handle. And inside that handle is a hollow area containing a magnet that can hold a knife. The axe head is engineered from forged steel, which does an outstanding job of keeping its edge.", "text": "Gerber 31-001054 Gator Combo Axe Axes have been around for ages. And even our award-winning axes are hardly new. But the Gator Axe is a wood-busting' breakthrough. Because we applied our proprietary Gator textured rubber to the grip for an unprecedented level of comfort and control. Beneath that tactile rubber surface is a virtually indestructible glass-filled nylon handle. And inside that handle is a hollow area containing a magnet that can hold a knife. The axe head is engineered from forged steel, which does an outstanding job of keeping its edge.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qaob0HTcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KP2LZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives"]], "price": 38.81}}
{"item_id": "B005KSWIBQ", "title": "Leatherman Rebar Multi Tool", "description": "Leatherman's Rebar Multi Tool is a serious tool for on the job as well as for at home-projects. The iconic box-like body and sloped-neck design is similar to Leatherman's Super Tool 300 and Micra but the Rebar is lighter in weight and balances that with size and durability. The Rebar pliers have been optimized for strength and feature replaceable wire/hard-wire cutters, a first for a four-inch tool from Leatherman. Its selection of most popular tools, sleek look and slim profile will make it your choice for everyday carry. Comes with a nylon belt pouch.Electrical Crimper.420HC Knife.420HC Serrated Knife.Wood/Metal File.Saw.Small Screwdriver.Large Screwdriver.Phillips Screwdriver.Awl w/Thread Loop.Ruler (8 inches/20 cm).Bottle Opener.Can Opener.Wire Stripper.Lanyard Ring.Stainless Steel Body.Stainless Steel Handles.Size: 4 in. | 10.16 cm (Closed).Blade Length: 2.9 in | 7.36 cm.Weight: 6.7 oz | 189.94 g.", "text": "Leatherman Rebar Multi Tool Leatherman's Rebar Multi Tool is a serious tool for on the job as well as for at home-projects. The iconic box-like body and sloped-neck design is similar to Leatherman's Super Tool 300 and Micra but the Rebar is lighter in weight and balances that with size and durability. The Rebar pliers have been optimized for strength and feature replaceable wire/hard-wire cutters, a first for a four-inch tool from Leatherman. Its selection of most popular tools, sleek look and slim profile will make it your choice for everyday carry. Comes with a nylon belt pouch.Electrical Crimper.420HC Knife.420HC Serrated Knife.Wood/Metal File.Saw.Small Screwdriver.Large Screwdriver.Phillips Screwdriver.Awl w/Thread Loop.Ruler (8 inches/20 cm).Bottle Opener.Can Opener.Wire Stripper.Lanyard Ring.Stainless Steel Body.Stainless Steel Handles.Size: 4 in. | 10.16 cm (Closed).Blade Length: 2.9 in | 7.36 cm.Weight: 6.7 oz | 189.94 g.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mW3W4%2B4AL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KSWIBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leatherman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 45.69}}
