{"item_id": "B005KVH8U4", "title": "Tony Horton's PowerStands", "description": "Achieve the perfect push-up every time! The most ergonomic, heavy-duty push-up gear we've ever made! The ultimate fitness equipment designed to help you achieve the perfect push-up every time! It enhances your push-up workouts without straining your wrists or forearms. The ergonomic design with nonskid bases and foam-grip padding ensures muscle engagement and maximum comfort during prolonged use. Tony Horton's PowerStands are the perfect addition to your home gym for strengthening and sculpting your arms, shoulders, chest, and back! Special features include: • Works for any fitness level-from beginner through professional athlete • Premium grade, heavy duty • Nonskid circular bases are ultra-stable • Angled to eliminate wrist strain • Foam grips eliminate hand strain • Designed and used by celebrity trainer Tony Horton", "text": "Tony Horton's PowerStands Achieve the perfect push-up every time! The most ergonomic, heavy-duty push-up gear we've ever made! The ultimate fitness equipment designed to help you achieve the perfect push-up every time! It enhances your push-up workouts without straining your wrists or forearms. The ergonomic design with nonskid bases and foam-grip padding ensures muscle engagement and maximum comfort during prolonged use. Tony Horton's PowerStands are the perfect addition to your home gym for strengthening and sculpting your arms, shoulders, chest, and back! Special features include: • Works for any fitness level-from beginner through professional athlete • Premium grade, heavy duty • Nonskid circular bases are ultra-stable • Angled to eliminate wrist strain • Foam grips eliminate hand strain • Designed and used by celebrity trainer Tony Horton", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zm5Sg5I7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KVH8U4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pushup Stands"]], "price": 52.85}}
{"item_id": "B005KW3RZS", "title": "SigTac CPL-RM Classic Pistol Laser with Rail Mount", "description": "The CPL-1 Classic Laser, is a lightweight solution for fast target acquisition. This rugged and reliable red laser provides assured accuracy from a long range. It features a rugged black polymer housing with an aluminum rail clamp to ensure optimal performance in the most extreme conditions and an Illuminated red laser with easy-to-reach ambidextrous controls. Adjustable for windage and elevation. Features:- Ambidextrous on/off switches- Fits most pistols with a picatinny rail- Easy-to-reach ambidextrous controls. Windage & elevation adjustments- Comes complete with Allen Wench Specifications:- Dimensions: 2.0\" L X 1.1\" W X 0.9\"H- Weight with Batteries: 1.1 oz./31g- Visible Laser: Hi Visibility (635nm)- Laser Switching: Steady on/off- Battery: CR1/3N Lithium or equivalent- Power Management: Digital integrated circuit- Laser Type: Class IIIa visible laser diode- Peak Power: 3mW- Wavelength: 635nm- Beam Color: Red.", "text": "SigTac CPL-RM Classic Pistol Laser with Rail Mount The CPL-1 Classic Laser, is a lightweight solution for fast target acquisition. This rugged and reliable red laser provides assured accuracy from a long range. It features a rugged black polymer housing with an aluminum rail clamp to ensure optimal performance in the most extreme conditions and an Illuminated red laser with easy-to-reach ambidextrous controls. Adjustable for windage and elevation. Features:- Ambidextrous on/off switches- Fits most pistols with a picatinny rail- Easy-to-reach ambidextrous controls. Windage & elevation adjustments- Comes complete with Allen Wench Specifications:- Dimensions: 2.0\" L X 1.1\" W X 0.9\"H- Weight with Batteries: 1.1 oz./31g- Visible Laser: Hi Visibility (635nm)- Laser Switching: Steady on/off- Battery: CR1/3N Lithium or equivalent- Power Management: Digital integrated circuit- Laser Type: Class IIIa visible laser diode- Peak Power: 3mW- Wavelength: 635nm- Beam Color: Red.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TntUOafJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KW3RZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Laser Sights"]], "price": 79.88}}
{"item_id": "B005KW3WXA", "title": "NcStar Vism Micro Green Dot Sight with Integrated Red Laser, Black", "description": "The VISM Green Dot Micro Laser Rifle Sight w/Red Laser VDGRLB is the ideal weapon accessory for those who are professionals in the law enforcement or military capacities. This Green Dot Laser Sight manufactured by VISM is image essentially two sighting systems in one convenient package. The VISM Micro Laser Sight has an incredibly bright green dot and an integrated red dot that can be operated with extreme ease because of the Multi-Function Rheostat Control System. This VISM Laser Scope has a slim contour Weaver Style Mount to create an inconceivably stable surface that eliminates bulk. The Micro Green Dot Laser Sight by VISM is made with some of the most advanced in laser technology available, so you can track your target under any circumstance.", "text": "NcStar Vism Micro Green Dot Sight with Integrated Red Laser, Black The VISM Green Dot Micro Laser Rifle Sight w/Red Laser VDGRLB is the ideal weapon accessory for those who are professionals in the law enforcement or military capacities. This Green Dot Laser Sight manufactured by VISM is image essentially two sighting systems in one convenient package. The VISM Micro Laser Sight has an incredibly bright green dot and an integrated red dot that can be operated with extreme ease because of the Multi-Function Rheostat Control System. This VISM Laser Scope has a slim contour Weaver Style Mount to create an inconceivably stable surface that eliminates bulk. The Micro Green Dot Laser Sight by VISM is made with some of the most advanced in laser technology available, so you can track your target under any circumstance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Et6c1fnkL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KW3WXA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NcStar", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B005KW5F3K", "title": "Lee Precision Bugle Buster", "description": "Lee Bulge Buster Kit and appropriate Lee Factory Crimp assures your mixed brass is bulge free. This push through die adapter will quickly remove the annoying bulge rings that shell holder constrained dies simply can't reach. The Bulge Buster Kit includes: extension sleeve, push through punch, catch container and complete instructions. Works with these rimless cases: 380 ACP, 10mm, 40 S&W;, 41 AE, 45 ACP, 45 GAP, and 45 Win Mag. NOTE: 9mm cases are not able to be used in the Bulge Buster because it has a slightly tapered case and the rim is not completely flush with the case. Glock Cases: We do not recommend \"fixing\" cases fired in pistols with unsupported chambers, because there is no way to make them safe once they have bulged. The case wall is thinned where it bulges, and resizing the outside of the case back down to the correct diameter does not restore the case back to its original thickness. If this case is fired in a pistol with an unsupported chamber again, and this thinned section of brass happens to line up with the unsupported part of the chamber, there is a high probability that the case will rupture.", "text": "Lee Precision Bugle Buster Lee Bulge Buster Kit and appropriate Lee Factory Crimp assures your mixed brass is bulge free. This push through die adapter will quickly remove the annoying bulge rings that shell holder constrained dies simply can't reach. The Bulge Buster Kit includes: extension sleeve, push through punch, catch container and complete instructions. Works with these rimless cases: 380 ACP, 10mm, 40 S&W;, 41 AE, 45 ACP, 45 GAP, and 45 Win Mag. NOTE: 9mm cases are not able to be used in the Bulge Buster because it has a slightly tapered case and the rim is not completely flush with the case. Glock Cases: We do not recommend \"fixing\" cases fired in pistols with unsupported chambers, because there is no way to make them safe once they have bulged. The case wall is thinned where it bulges, and resizing the outside of the case back down to the correct diameter does not restore the case back to its original thickness. If this case is fired in a pistol with an unsupported chamber again, and this thinned section of brass happens to line up with the unsupported part of the chamber, there is a high probability that the case will rupture.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xuKL21V0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KW5F3K.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 16.19}}
{"item_id": "B005KW6OJY", "title": "Ruger Pepper Spray Ultra System", "description": "Ruger branded pepper spray products are powered by Tornado-a leader and innovator in the pepper spray personal defense product industry. with a wide selection of carry and deployment options, the Ruger branded pepper spray line allows for a form, fit and function that meets a variety of protection needs-from on-the-go to at home, from your car to your camper. These products are a great addition to your overall personal safety plan.", "text": "Ruger Pepper Spray Ultra System Ruger branded pepper spray products are powered by Tornado-a leader and innovator in the pepper spray personal defense product industry. with a wide selection of carry and deployment options, the Ruger branded pepper spray line allows for a form, fit and function that meets a variety of protection needs-from on-the-go to at home, from your car to your camper. These products are a great addition to your overall personal safety plan.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qpiKildqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KW6OJY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruger Pepper Spray", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment", "Pepper Spray"]], "price": 22.92}}
{"item_id": "B005KW6YB2", "title": "SigTac Roto Retention Paddle Holster for SIG P250 Compac", "description": "Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Holster has the rail for the attachment of our single \"slide on\" mag pouch. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at “The Ready” - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Protective sight channel - Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer P250 Models", "text": "SigTac Roto Retention Paddle Holster for SIG P250 Compac Made of durable, high-tech, black polymer, these right-handed holsters use a unique patented retention system with a zero time to disengage feature. Simply depressing the lever allows for instant removal of the firearm. Holster has the rail for the attachment of our single \"slide on\" mag pouch. Features: - Comfortable, contoured fit holster is positioned to where your trigger finger normally rests at “The Ready” - Fully adjustable for cant - Rotates 360 degrees for every application (small of back, cross draw, etc.) - Adjusts with simple Allen key - Protective sight channel - Right hand models only Fits: - Sig Sauer P250 Models", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3189rmuXWJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005KW6YB2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SigTac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 21.95}}
