{"item_id": "B005L8R19O", "title": "GRIP POWER PADS® - Alternative To Gym Gloves | Lifting Grips | Workout Gloves | Men Workout Gloves |Women Workout Gloves", "description": "1) Grip Power Pads PRO - these pads are constructed of soft 0.2″ thick Spongy RUBBER, with Velcro straps and a stainless steel metal ring to adjust to any hand size. They are very comfortable lifting pads, the best non-slip grip you can get during your workout. They are ideal for heavy lifting. They are also the most popular Grip Pads among our customers. Grip Power Pads Lifting Grips to Enhance Your Workout 2) Grip Power Pads NEO- these grip pads are constructed of black NEOPRENE, are 0.2″ thick, and feature Velcro straps and a stainless steel metal ring that adjust to any hand size. These lifting pads are recommended for both men or women for every day use. 3) Grip Power Pads FIT - These grip pads are constructed of NEOPRENE RUBBER and are approximately 0.12″ thick. These pads are a thinner and smaller neoprene version of the NEO pad and are recommended for women for every day use. Grip Power Pads Lifting Grips to Enhance Your Workout 4) Grip Power Pads Soft - These are our simple rubber grip pads, These pads are constructed of soft rubber and are approximately 0.2″ thick. They are a simple lifting grips that don't feature straps. They are the most economical product in our lineup. 5) Grip Power Pads Firm - These are our simple rubber pads. These pads are constructed of firmer rubber and are approximately 0.12″ thick. These workout pads provide minimum palm coverage, ideal to keep your hands safe from sharp metal points and bars. They'll provide you maximum support and grip while isolating any metal from your skin. Firm is comprised of formed rubber which imitates the shape of the coated metal bars. 6) Grip Power Pads Foam - These are our simple foam pads, These pads are constructed of a mix of synthetic foam and rubber and are 0.25″ thick. There pads are recommended for more advanced weight lifters, who require more hand protection for their grip.", "text": "GRIP POWER PADS® - Alternative To Gym Gloves | Lifting Grips | Workout Gloves | Men Workout Gloves |Women Workout Gloves 1) Grip Power Pads PRO - these pads are constructed of soft 0.2″ thick Spongy RUBBER, with Velcro straps and a stainless steel metal ring to adjust to any hand size. They are very comfortable lifting pads, the best non-slip grip you can get during your workout. They are ideal for heavy lifting. They are also the most popular Grip Pads among our customers. Grip Power Pads Lifting Grips to Enhance Your Workout 2) Grip Power Pads NEO- these grip pads are constructed of black NEOPRENE, are 0.2″ thick, and feature Velcro straps and a stainless steel metal ring that adjust to any hand size. These lifting pads are recommended for both men or women for every day use. 3) Grip Power Pads FIT - These grip pads are constructed of NEOPRENE RUBBER and are approximately 0.12″ thick. These pads are a thinner and smaller neoprene version of the NEO pad and are recommended for women for every day use. Grip Power Pads Lifting Grips to Enhance Your Workout 4) Grip Power Pads Soft - These are our simple rubber grip pads, These pads are constructed of soft rubber and are approximately 0.2″ thick. They are a simple lifting grips that don't feature straps. They are the most economical product in our lineup. 5) Grip Power Pads Firm - These are our simple rubber pads. These pads are constructed of firmer rubber and are approximately 0.12″ thick. These workout pads provide minimum palm coverage, ideal to keep your hands safe from sharp metal points and bars. They'll provide you maximum support and grip while isolating any metal from your skin. Firm is comprised of formed rubber which imitates the shape of the coated metal bars. 6) Grip Power Pads Foam - These are our simple foam pads, These pads are constructed of a mix of synthetic foam and rubber and are 0.25″ thick. There pads are recommended for more advanced weight lifters, who require more hand protection for their grip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61ESqAwaE4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005L8R19O.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]], "price": 6.99}}
