{"item_id": "B005LB7UGA", "title": "Wondershade II Portable Umbrella (Royal Blue)", "description": "Tired of being held captive in the sun when you are trying to enjoy your child's soccer game or other event? Let Wondershade help you tame the sun by blocking 98% of harmful UV rays. Wondershade II is the solution portable, lightweight sun shade. Easy and quick to set-up, Wondershade II adjusts in height from 3' to 8'. The 60\" umbrella to also tilts to better block the sun and has gust-proof vents which allow for air to pass through. Includes patent pending accessory collars for attaching (2) cup holders and (2) utility hooks for hanging towels, jackets, back packs or anything else that you want to keep off the ground and out of the dirt. Great for all outdoor events: Tailgating, baseball, soccer, poolside, fishing, parades, the beach, and your backyard patio.", "text": "Wondershade II Portable Umbrella (Royal Blue) Tired of being held captive in the sun when you are trying to enjoy your child's soccer game or other event? Let Wondershade help you tame the sun by blocking 98% of harmful UV rays. Wondershade II is the solution portable, lightweight sun shade. Easy and quick to set-up, Wondershade II adjusts in height from 3' to 8'. The 60\" umbrella to also tilts to better block the sun and has gust-proof vents which allow for air to pass through. Includes patent pending accessory collars for attaching (2) cup holders and (2) utility hooks for hanging towels, jackets, back packs or anything else that you want to keep off the ground and out of the dirt. Great for all outdoor events: Tailgating, baseball, soccer, poolside, fishing, parades, the beach, and your backyard patio.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413rMyooYEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LB7UGA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]]}}
