{"item_id": "B005LD2K36", "title": "Tenn Sprint Long Sleeve Cycle Cycling Jersey Shirt", "description": "Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our Long sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from an amazingly effective genuine high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. The fabric in this jersey has been manufactured using recycled polyester. It also has excellent odour control properties and offers the wearer added UV-Protection. Incorporating a non-slip zip and exceptional silicone waist grippers with extended rear drop. Three elasticated rear pockets and a front mobile phone holder zipped pocket, provide the wearer with ample storage options.With safety in mind these jerseys include reflective print on the front and rear logo's and a reflective trim on the bottom of the rear pockets.These are not 'second skin' jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and colours.", "text": "Tenn Sprint Long Sleeve Cycle Cycling Jersey Shirt Another outstanding value product manufactured by Tenn Outdoors. Our Long sleeved cycle jerseys have been produced with the serious cyclist in mind. Manufactured from an amazingly effective genuine high-wicking and technically advanced fabric to take moisture from the body and out through the fabric, whilst keeping the wearer both dry and warm. The fabric in this jersey has been manufactured using recycled polyester. It also has excellent odour control properties and offers the wearer added UV-Protection. Incorporating a non-slip zip and exceptional silicone waist grippers with extended rear drop. Three elasticated rear pockets and a front mobile phone holder zipped pocket, provide the wearer with ample storage options.With safety in mind these jerseys include reflective print on the front and rear logo's and a reflective trim on the bottom of the rear pockets.These are not 'second skin' jerseys and provide a slightly looser, more comfortable fit.These jerseys are available in other sizes and colours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lWkecq1FL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LD2K36.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jerseys"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005LEPMSA", "title": "G.I. Military MOLLE II Sustainment Pouch - ACU Camouflage", "description": "Part of the Modular Lightweight Load-bearing System, the Sustainment Pouch attaches to either side of the issue ruck or large ruck packs. Holds (2) MRE's or other gear. Drawstring with barrel lock top closure and Fastex buckle cinch strap on lid cover. Can also be attached to other MOLLE gear, or carried with a sling (not included) using the D-rings on each side of the bag.", "text": "G.I. Military MOLLE II Sustainment Pouch - ACU Camouflage Part of the Modular Lightweight Load-bearing System, the Sustainment Pouch attaches to either side of the issue ruck or large ruck packs. Holds (2) MRE's or other gear. Drawstring with barrel lock top closure and Fastex buckle cinch strap on lid cover. Can also be attached to other MOLLE gear, or carried with a sling (not included) using the D-rings on each side of the bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gha50LXGL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LEPMSA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specialty Defense Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 25.49}}
