{"item_id": "B005LJRMHO", "title": "G.I. Military MOLLE II Six Magazine Bandolier - Woodland Camouflage", "description": "Three individual pockets each hold two magazines. Flap covers with snaps secure 2 magazines per pocket. Has an adjustable shoulder strap for external carry, and fits in the external pocket of the Military's MOLLE Rucksack.", "text": "G.I. Military MOLLE II Six Magazine Bandolier - Woodland Camouflage Three individual pockets each hold two magazines. Flap covers with snaps secure 2 magazines per pocket. Has an adjustable shoulder strap for external carry, and fits in the external pocket of the Military's MOLLE Rucksack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413KaErwJiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LJRMHO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Specialty Defense Systems", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 15.89}}
