{"item_id": "B005LMZ066", "title": "Micro Fishing Survival Kit (Lot of 2)", "description": "Micro Fishing Survival Kit BE PREPARED! You get two (2) of these kits, keep one for yourself and a spare (or give to a friend)! Each kit comes with the following: 4 Hooks 2 Split shot 10# Mono Fishing Line 1 Fishing Fly Marabou Jig Plastic Bait Foam (tie on for strike indicator (bobber) 2 - Metallic flash (fold over line just above bait for \"flash\" Mini Instruction sheet All come in waterproof floating tube. Includes all items for basic fishing needs. PLEASE NOTE: THIS IS NOT A COMPLETE SURVIVAL KIT, BUT RATHER AN IMPORTANT ITEM TO ADD TO A FULL SURVIVAL KIT TO PROVIDE A MEANS OF OBTAINING FOOD IN A SURVIVAL SITUATION. SUGGESTED IS A FULL SURVIVAL KIT AND A GOOD MANUAL ON SURVIVAL AND KNOWLEDGE OF THE BOOK AND KITS CONTENTS.", "text": "Micro Fishing Survival Kit (Lot of 2) Micro Fishing Survival Kit BE PREPARED! You get two (2) of these kits, keep one for yourself and a spare (or give to a friend)! Each kit comes with the following: 4 Hooks 2 Split shot 10# Mono Fishing Line 1 Fishing Fly Marabou Jig Plastic Bait Foam (tie on for strike indicator (bobber) 2 - Metallic flash (fold over line just above bait for \"flash\" Mini Instruction sheet All come in waterproof floating tube. Includes all items for basic fishing needs. PLEASE NOTE: THIS IS NOT A COMPLETE SURVIVAL KIT, BUT RATHER AN IMPORTANT ITEM TO ADD TO A FULL SURVIVAL KIT TO PROVIDE A MEANS OF OBTAINING FOOD IN A SURVIVAL SITUATION. SUGGESTED IS A FULL SURVIVAL KIT AND A GOOD MANUAL ON SURVIVAL AND KNOWLEDGE OF THE BOOK AND KITS CONTENTS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51THofRrczL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LMZ066.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 6.97}}
{"item_id": "B005LPMDWC", "title": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck S&W Shield Right Hand Tan", "description": "Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "text": "DeSantis Sof-Tuck S&W Shield Right Hand Tan Sof-Tuck #106 is a new IWB/Tuck-able holster with adjustable cant. It can be worn strong side, cross draw or on the small of the back. It is built from soft, no-slip suede and reinforced at the top with premium saddle leather to aid in re-holstering. The #106 is available for most concealable hand guns in right and left hand.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31lT6V1cpWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LPMDWC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 23.48}}
{"item_id": "B005LRYS64", "title": "Victorinox Swiss Classic 22-Piece Cutlery Block Set", "description": "22-piece set includes: 2-1/2-inch shaping knife, 3-1/4-inch straight paring knife, 3 1/4-inch serrated paring knife, 4 1/2-inch serrated utility knife, eight 4 1/2-inch serrated steak knives with spear tip, 5-inch chef's utility knife, 6-inch utility knife, 6-inch boning knife, 7-inch granton edge santoku knife, 8-inch carving knife, 8-inch chef's knife, 8-inch bread knife, 10 1/4-inch slicer, kitchen shears and slant hardwood block.", "text": "Victorinox Swiss Classic 22-Piece Cutlery Block Set 22-piece set includes: 2-1/2-inch shaping knife, 3-1/4-inch straight paring knife, 3 1/4-inch serrated paring knife, 4 1/2-inch serrated utility knife, eight 4 1/2-inch serrated steak knives with spear tip, 5-inch chef's utility knife, 6-inch utility knife, 6-inch boning knife, 7-inch granton edge santoku knife, 8-inch carving knife, 8-inch chef's knife, 8-inch bread knife, 10 1/4-inch slicer, kitchen shears and slant hardwood block.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5114KomnyIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LRYS64.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Victorinox", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 296.95}}
{"item_id": "B005LS4B6U", "title": "Columbia River Knife & Tool 2010K C/K Dragon Fixed Blade Knife with Textured Glass Filled Nylon Handles", "description": "CRKT C/K Dragon. 9 1/4\" overall. 4 1/2\" black finish 9Cr18 stainless wharncliff blade. Full tang. Textured black G-10 handles. Lanyard hole. Molded multi-position carry Kydex sheath. Designed by Bob Kasper and Pat Crawford.BRK Exclusive!", "text": "Columbia River Knife & Tool 2010K C/K Dragon Fixed Blade Knife with Textured Glass Filled Nylon Handles CRKT C/K Dragon. 9 1/4\" overall. 4 1/2\" black finish 9Cr18 stainless wharncliff blade. Full tang. Textured black G-10 handles. Lanyard hole. Molded multi-position carry Kydex sheath. Designed by Bob Kasper and Pat Crawford.BRK Exclusive!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21q%2BmN1WCaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LS4B6U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.45}}
