{"item_id": "B005LUTJHE", "title": "Mountainsmith Lumbar-Recycled Series Day TLS R Backpack", "description": "For hiking, urban touring or school, the day is the lumbar pack that started it all and it's still a perennial favorite. This classic, sizable lumbar pack delivers all of the features and functionality you've come to expect", "text": "Mountainsmith Lumbar-Recycled Series Day TLS R Backpack For hiking, urban touring or school, the day is the lumbar pack that started it all and it's still a perennial favorite. This classic, sizable lumbar pack delivers all of the features and functionality you've come to expect", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513Psz8584L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LUTJHE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mountainsmith", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Waist Packs"]], "price": 84.94}}
