{"item_id": "B005LW3KJA", "title": "Aurorae \"Synergy\" Yoga Mat/Towel for Hot Yoga/Moist hands and feet that causes Slipping (5 mm) US Patent Protected", "description": "Aurorae \"Synergy\" Yoga Mat-Towel is the latest new development by Aurorae and US PATENT PROTECTED.This unique super deluxe slip free Mat-Towel combination, bonds our eco-safe/friendly 5mm per yoga mat with our lush, ultra absorbent slip free microfiber towel.You will experience no more slipping and no more need for a bunched-up Towel moving around on the floor.Synergy's 5mm thickness and 72\" length is ideal for your safety and comfort. Easy to care for and machine washable with no odor.You will have the best of both worlds all wrapped up into one product. Synergy is the most innovative one of a kind yoga product in the market.\"Be One with your Mat\"*No More Slipping on your Yoga mat and Great for Hot/Active Yoga where you sweat a lot*Aurorae's lush slip free microfiber towel is the top surface with our 5mm per yoga mat as bottom surface*No bunching or movement of your yoga towel while you practice*For best results lightly spray the top of your mat, where your hands and feet go for down dog, with water before use*Ultra Thick 5mm for comfort and stability to protect your joints. 72\" long. *Eco Friendly and safe. SGS tested and approved. Free from Latex, Silcone and Phthalates*No Odor, Light Weight, Durable and easy to care for.*Aurorae's Golden Sun Focal Icon to help with concentrationWashing Instructions:* Machine Wash alone with detergent on gentle, warm water, extra rinse cycle. If you have a top loading machine with an agitator wash by hand with a brush or coarse sponge.* After rinsing your mat, wrap your mat in a bath towel and squeeze excess water out.* Hang dry. DO NOT PUT IN DRYER.*Aurorae stands for Quality and Great Personal Service. All products guaranteed.", "text": "Aurorae \"Synergy\" Yoga Mat/Towel for Hot Yoga/Moist hands and feet that causes Slipping (5 mm) US Patent Protected Aurorae \"Synergy\" Yoga Mat-Towel is the latest new development by Aurorae and US PATENT PROTECTED.This unique super deluxe slip free Mat-Towel combination, bonds our eco-safe/friendly 5mm per yoga mat with our lush, ultra absorbent slip free microfiber towel.You will experience no more slipping and no more need for a bunched-up Towel moving around on the floor.Synergy's 5mm thickness and 72\" length is ideal for your safety and comfort. Easy to care for and machine washable with no odor.You will have the best of both worlds all wrapped up into one product. Synergy is the most innovative one of a kind yoga product in the market.\"Be One with your Mat\"*No More Slipping on your Yoga mat and Great for Hot/Active Yoga where you sweat a lot*Aurorae's lush slip free microfiber towel is the top surface with our 5mm per yoga mat as bottom surface*No bunching or movement of your yoga towel while you practice*For best results lightly spray the top of your mat, where your hands and feet go for down dog, with water before use*Ultra Thick 5mm for comfort and stability to protect your joints. 72\" long. *Eco Friendly and safe. SGS tested and approved. Free from Latex, Silcone and Phthalates*No Odor, Light Weight, Durable and easy to care for.*Aurorae's Golden Sun Focal Icon to help with concentrationWashing Instructions:* Machine Wash alone with detergent on gentle, warm water, extra rinse cycle. If you have a top loading machine with an agitator wash by hand with a brush or coarse sponge.* After rinsing your mat, wrap your mat in a bath towel and squeeze excess water out.* Hang dry. DO NOT PUT IN DRYER.*Aurorae stands for Quality and Great Personal Service. All products guaranteed.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IQXRj9dRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LW3KJA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B005LW4J04", "title": "Ontario 7500 Blackbird SK-5 Wilderness Survival Knife (Brown)", "description": "The Ontario SK-5 Blackbird was designed by Paul Sheiter. In describing the knife he states, \"I believe the more complicated a product becomes, the more likely it is to fail when your life depends on it. For this reason I designed The Blackbird SK-5 Knife to achieve maximum function delivered through pure simplicity. The blade is made from American made 154CM steel, known for its superior toughness, edge-retaining ability, sharpness and corrosion resistance. The SK-5's blade is 0.13 inch thick and features a full-taper grind. The perimeter of the Micarta handle is rounded to provide a comfortable grip. The handle is secured to the knife tang with stainless steel Allen screws. The Blackbird SK-5 comes with a MOLLE compatible sheath with belt loop that features a rigid protective insert.", "text": "Ontario 7500 Blackbird SK-5 Wilderness Survival Knife (Brown) The Ontario SK-5 Blackbird was designed by Paul Sheiter. In describing the knife he states, \"I believe the more complicated a product becomes, the more likely it is to fail when your life depends on it. For this reason I designed The Blackbird SK-5 Knife to achieve maximum function delivered through pure simplicity. The blade is made from American made 154CM steel, known for its superior toughness, edge-retaining ability, sharpness and corrosion resistance. The SK-5's blade is 0.13 inch thick and features a full-taper grind. The perimeter of the Micarta handle is rounded to provide a comfortable grip. The handle is secured to the knife tang with stainless steel Allen screws. The Blackbird SK-5 comes with a MOLLE compatible sheath with belt loop that features a rigid protective insert.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DHgWVgPdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LW4J04.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ontario Knife", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 102.97}}
{"item_id": "B005LXKKW4", "title": "Gas Mask Family Kit Two Adult + Two Children Israeli Gas Mask w/ Original Nato Filter w/ tablets - 14 Tablets of 130 Mg Potassium Iodine", "description": "The perfect family protective kit. You are receiving 2 adult size Israeli gas masks, 2 children size Israeli gas masks with their original 40mm NBC sealed filters. Total of 4 masks and 4 filters. To complete the family protection we are adding a 14 Potassium Iodide tablets. The Israeli civilian mask is one of the best available in the market. This price won't last for long...", "text": "Gas Mask Family Kit Two Adult + Two Children Israeli Gas Mask w/ Original Nato Filter w/ tablets - 14 Tablets of 130 Mg Potassium Iodine The perfect family protective kit. You are receiving 2 adult size Israeli gas masks, 2 children size Israeli gas masks with their original 40mm NBC sealed filters. Total of 4 masks and 4 filters. To complete the family protection we are adding a 14 Potassium Iodide tablets. The Israeli civilian mask is one of the best available in the market. This price won't last for long...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41a3jcb690L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LXKKW4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 134.9}}
{"item_id": "B005LYUQ5E", "title": "Instapark® GLS-3 Pistol / Rifle Compact Mounted Green Laser Sight with Picatinny Rail", "description": "Made of impact resistant T6 aluminum, the Instapark GLS-3 laser sight is designed and built to withstand the extremely high-impact shock generated by large caliber rifles and handguns. The GLS-3 laser sight features a built-in standard weaver mount with a stabilizing cross bar insert for added support on even the shortest rails. And the integrated military standard Picatinny rail provides a strong, stable platform to mount accessories.Designed for convenience & easy operation in the field, the GLS-3 is equipped with an on/off slide switch ideal for hand guns and the slide switch can also be bypassed by adding the included cable pressure switch securely screwed to the back of the laser. Standard windage and elevation adjustments are handily accessible with the included Allen wrench.Powered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium battery, the GLS-3 can constantly emit intense laser beam for accurate targeting. One-year manufacturer's warranty included.What's in the Box?Green laser sight with built-in mount and railMounting hardwareCable pressure switchCR-123A lithium batteryUser manual", "text": "Instapark® GLS-3 Pistol / Rifle Compact Mounted Green Laser Sight with Picatinny Rail Made of impact resistant T6 aluminum, the Instapark GLS-3 laser sight is designed and built to withstand the extremely high-impact shock generated by large caliber rifles and handguns. The GLS-3 laser sight features a built-in standard weaver mount with a stabilizing cross bar insert for added support on even the shortest rails. And the integrated military standard Picatinny rail provides a strong, stable platform to mount accessories.Designed for convenience & easy operation in the field, the GLS-3 is equipped with an on/off slide switch ideal for hand guns and the slide switch can also be bypassed by adding the included cable pressure switch securely screwed to the back of the laser. Standard windage and elevation adjustments are handily accessible with the included Allen wrench.Powered by a high capacity CR-123A lithium battery, the GLS-3 can constantly emit intense laser beam for accurate targeting. One-year manufacturer's warranty included.What's in the Box?Green laser sight with built-in mount and railMounting hardwareCable pressure switchCR-123A lithium batteryUser manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41X5lO%2BEknL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005LYUQ5E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005M0313Q", "title": "12 Gauge Aluminum Shotgun Cartridge Laser Boresighter Red", "description": "No more wasting ammo and money sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes. A common misconception that the rifle is sighted from the factory. Dead accurate sighting and zeroing your scope at 100 yards.", "text": "12 Gauge Aluminum Shotgun Cartridge Laser Boresighter Red No more wasting ammo and money sighting or zeroing in your iron sights, red dots, or scopes. A common misconception that the rifle is sighted from the factory. Dead accurate sighting and zeroing your scope at 100 yards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318pzUiqNjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M0313Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Field Sport Inc", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 11.7}}
