{"item_id": "B005M21DPC", "title": "Browning 800 Express air pistol", "description": "Browning 800 Express air pistol Breakbarrel Single-shot Anti-recoil power system Magnum velocity Fiber optic sights (adj. rear) Ergonomic & ambidextrous Textured synthetic grip with finger grooves Automatic safety Grooved receiver Includes cocking aid In the Airgun Reporter video for the Browning 800 Mag pistol - the version prior to the Browning 800 Express release, Paul Capello shows a dot sight on the gun. That sight comes with a Weaver mount. This pistol does not have a Weaver base...it has an 11mm base. To mount that sight or any Weaver accessory, mount an 11mm-to-Weaver adapter on this gun's 11mm scope grooves. We have 2 listed on the ACCESSORIES link on this page. Then, you can select Weaver-based dot sights, which are also shown on the ACCESSORIES link.... ...", "text": "Browning 800 Express air pistol Browning 800 Express air pistol Breakbarrel Single-shot Anti-recoil power system Magnum velocity Fiber optic sights (adj. rear) Ergonomic & ambidextrous Textured synthetic grip with finger grooves Automatic safety Grooved receiver Includes cocking aid In the Airgun Reporter video for the Browning 800 Mag pistol - the version prior to the Browning 800 Express release, Paul Capello shows a dot sight on the gun. That sight comes with a Weaver mount. This pistol does not have a Weaver base...it has an 11mm base. To mount that sight or any Weaver accessory, mount an 11mm-to-Weaver adapter on this gun's 11mm scope grooves. We have 2 listed on the ACCESSORIES link on this page. Then, you can select Weaver-based dot sights, which are also shown on the ACCESSORIES link.... ...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PhY8X6BQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M21DPC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005M28P6C", "title": "Black Powder Outlaw Revolver Replica with Stand", "description": "This offering is for a replica of the original Colt 1851Navy Revolver and display stand (new). The gun has realistic features but cannot be modified to fire actual bullets (please note orange plug on barrel end). Although the revolver replica being sold is not a licensed Colt product, it follows the detail of the Colt manufactured .36 caliber revolvers that were common during and following the Civil War. The bronze tone metal is ornately etched in keeping with the period and the cylinder is stamped \"US .36\". Handles are plastic with wood grain finish. According to Wikipedia, the name of \"Colt 1851 Navy\" was coined by collectors. The more common name of \"Navy Revolver\" evolved from its early designation of the \"Colt Revolving Belt Pistol of Naval Caliber\". Despite the \"Navy\" designation, which came to be because the original pistols had a naval scene etched on the cylinder, the revolver was chiefly purchased by civilians and military land forces. Famous individuals who carried the Navy revolver include Wild Bill Hickok, John Henry \"Doc\" Holliday, Ned Kelly, Robert E. Lee and Quantrill's Raiders. The guns were so popular and reliable they continued to be used long after more modern cartridge revolvers were introduced in 1873.", "text": "Black Powder Outlaw Revolver Replica with Stand This offering is for a replica of the original Colt 1851Navy Revolver and display stand (new). The gun has realistic features but cannot be modified to fire actual bullets (please note orange plug on barrel end). Although the revolver replica being sold is not a licensed Colt product, it follows the detail of the Colt manufactured .36 caliber revolvers that were common during and following the Civil War. The bronze tone metal is ornately etched in keeping with the period and the cylinder is stamped \"US .36\". Handles are plastic with wood grain finish. According to Wikipedia, the name of \"Colt 1851 Navy\" was coined by collectors. The more common name of \"Navy Revolver\" evolved from its early designation of the \"Colt Revolving Belt Pistol of Naval Caliber\". Despite the \"Navy\" designation, which came to be because the original pistols had a naval scene etched on the cylinder, the revolver was chiefly purchased by civilians and military land forces. Famous individuals who carried the Navy revolver include Wild Bill Hickok, John Henry \"Doc\" Holliday, Ned Kelly, Robert E. Lee and Quantrill's Raiders. The guns were so popular and reliable they continued to be used long after more modern cartridge revolvers were introduced in 1873.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HgmWocsRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M28P6C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Replicas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B005M2EDG8", "title": "Serfas Super Bright 60 \"The Shield\"", "description": "The more you ride at dawn or dusk, the more you realize just how important it is to be seen. The Serfas Super Bright 60, also known as \"The Shield\", is one of the brightest taillights made by Serfas and it's USB rechargeable so that you'll be seen going to, and coming from work. Serfas' Shield features LED bulbs that produce up to 60 lumens of brightness, and at full power, you'll be visible for up to a full mile. It features four modes: high, low, high flash, and low flash. If you're worried it might burn out mid-ride, the battery lasts for up to 14 hours in low flash mode, but also for 2. 4 in high mode, plenty of time to get where you are going or head out for an evening training session. Charge indicator lights let you know when the battery is running low and a built-in smart charge prevents you from overcharging. The Serfas Bright 60 \"The Shield\" is rack compatible and comes with a clip for your backpack.", "text": "Serfas Super Bright 60 \"The Shield\" The more you ride at dawn or dusk, the more you realize just how important it is to be seen. The Serfas Super Bright 60, also known as \"The Shield\", is one of the brightest taillights made by Serfas and it's USB rechargeable so that you'll be seen going to, and coming from work. Serfas' Shield features LED bulbs that produce up to 60 lumens of brightness, and at full power, you'll be visible for up to a full mile. It features four modes: high, low, high flash, and low flash. If you're worried it might burn out mid-ride, the battery lasts for up to 14 hours in low flash mode, but also for 2. 4 in high mode, plenty of time to get where you are going or head out for an evening training session. Charge indicator lights let you know when the battery is running low and a built-in smart charge prevents you from overcharging. The Serfas Bright 60 \"The Shield\" is rack compatible and comes with a clip for your backpack.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51RQNmdd-hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M2EDG8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Serfas", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 54.4}}
{"item_id": "B005M3T37Q", "title": "Voodoo Tactical 15-9961 Tactical Sling Pack with MOLLE Webbing", "description": "This Tactical Sling Bag from Voodoo Tactical provides an over the shoulder carry bag that is adaptable for right to left handed wearers with the click of a buckle. The padded waist strap provides added support and prevents the pack from bouncing while you are moving.The single padded shoulder strap has 2 accessory pouches for cell phones, GPS, or other electronics and 1 zippered utility pocket. The outside of the pack is also loaded with pockets: 1 large central pocket and 6 zippered pouches along the side. Four external \"D\" rings offer additional attachment points and the bag accepts MOLLE compatible pouches. It also has Velcro to attach your name tape, unit designation or other patches.Use the wrapped carry handle when not using it as a sling bag. A great bag in or out of the field.Measures: 18\" across x 6\" deep x 16\" tall", "text": "Voodoo Tactical 15-9961 Tactical Sling Pack with MOLLE Webbing This Tactical Sling Bag from Voodoo Tactical provides an over the shoulder carry bag that is adaptable for right to left handed wearers with the click of a buckle. The padded waist strap provides added support and prevents the pack from bouncing while you are moving.The single padded shoulder strap has 2 accessory pouches for cell phones, GPS, or other electronics and 1 zippered utility pocket. The outside of the pack is also loaded with pockets: 1 large central pocket and 6 zippered pouches along the side. Four external \"D\" rings offer additional attachment points and the bag accepts MOLLE compatible pouches. It also has Velcro to attach your name tape, unit designation or other patches.Use the wrapped carry handle when not using it as a sling bag. A great bag in or out of the field.Measures: 18\" across x 6\" deep x 16\" tall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ZyXwWJr%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M3T37Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Game Belts & Bags"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B005M91MWY", "title": "Safariland 6006-1 ALS guard for 6377, 6378, 6379 Holsters", "description": "The Safariland model 6006ALS Guard provides additional security from attempted weapon takeaways by covering the ALS Levr on Safariland ALS holsters. It can be retrofitted to existing ALS concealment holsters.", "text": "Safariland 6006-1 ALS guard for 6377, 6378, 6379 Holsters The Safariland model 6006ALS Guard provides additional security from attempted weapon takeaways by covering the ALS Levr on Safariland ALS holsters. It can be retrofitted to existing ALS concealment holsters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414sgFNa95L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005M91MWY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Safariland", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.09}}
{"item_id": "B005MAGUPM", "title": "Bravo Sports Quik Bronze Series Chair", "description": "Our Bravo Sports Quik Chair Bronze Series Chair features sturdy steel construction, durable polyester fabric and a cup holder. This chair opens and folds closed in seconds! Includes carry bag with shoulder strap. Only 36\" tall when folded closed. 225 lb. load capacity. Perfect for the backyard, park or sporting events.", "text": "Bravo Sports Quik Bronze Series Chair Our Bravo Sports Quik Chair Bronze Series Chair features sturdy steel construction, durable polyester fabric and a cup holder. This chair opens and folds closed in seconds! Includes carry bag with shoulder strap. Only 36\" tall when folded closed. 225 lb. load capacity. Perfect for the backyard, park or sporting events.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Z2iHzU%2BoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MAGUPM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Quik Shade", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 19.97}}
{"item_id": "B005MCLPJQ", "title": "Desantis Superfly For Glock 26 W/CT Ambidextrous Black", "description": "When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "text": "Desantis Superfly For Glock 26 W/CT Ambidextrous Black When DeSantis designed the original Nemesis, they thought that it would remain the best pocket holster forever! Well, it just got even better! The Super Fly has outdone even the best! Super Fly's new exclusive sticky rubberized fabric is even more viscous than the Nemesis. They have also added a removable, reversible outer flap to even further disguise the firearm. This pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your pocket. The inside is made of slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and is reinforced with added polymer in the right places. Back or front pocket design. Available in black.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31IRkOsXPoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MCLPJQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis Gunhide", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 30.23}}
{"item_id": "B005MCNBB6", "title": "Desantis Mini Scabbard Holster for LC9 with Crimson Trace LG-412 Laser Gaurd, Right Hand, Black", "description": "This unique holster has been reduced to the barest of essentials, yet offers a secure grip on the handgun thanks to exact molding and adjustable tension device. The Mini Scabbard will accommodate belts up to 1 1/2\" wide.", "text": "Desantis Mini Scabbard Holster for LC9 with Crimson Trace LG-412 Laser Gaurd, Right Hand, Black This unique holster has been reduced to the barest of essentials, yet offers a secure grip on the handgun thanks to exact molding and adjustable tension device. The Mini Scabbard will accommodate belts up to 1 1/2\" wide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dx8QEekyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MCNBB6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B005MG7PD2", "title": "Huntington MG2 Black Military Bearing / Lensatic Compass, Professionally Liquid-Dampened, Full Metal Body with Bearing Prism / Lens System (K4580 BL US)", "description": "Don't take this one on your next Easter egg hunt. Instead, consider this compass for a voyage through the wilds. Or a trek in the mountains. That's all you need.", "text": "Huntington MG2 Black Military Bearing / Lensatic Compass, Professionally Liquid-Dampened, Full Metal Body with Bearing Prism / Lens System (K4580 BL US) Don't take this one on your next Easter egg hunt. Instead, consider this compass for a voyage through the wilds. Or a trek in the mountains. That's all you need.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2B6bwbXzuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MG7PD2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Compasses"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B005MH67D0", "title": "Brown Bear Full Animal Hood Hoodie Hat Faux Fur 3 in 1 Function", "description": "Our full Brown Bear hood / hat is a 3 in 1 function, a combination of a hat, scarf and gloves and small zipper pocket to keep your cell phone. The coolest way to keep warm during the cold, they make great gifts and a great way to be uniquely different! Please note no animals are hurt in making this hood / hat 100% Faux fur.", "text": "Brown Bear Full Animal Hood Hoodie Hat Faux Fur 3 in 1 Function Our full Brown Bear hood / hat is a 3 in 1 function, a combination of a hat, scarf and gloves and small zipper pocket to keep your cell phone. The coolest way to keep warm during the cold, they make great gifts and a great way to be uniquely different! Please note no animals are hurt in making this hood / hat 100% Faux fur.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41O2gXLbgoL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MH67D0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Clothing", "Women", "Hats"]]}}
