{"item_id": "B005MZU7DS", "title": "Don't Tread On Me Slide Cover Plate for Glock", "description": "Don't Tread on Me DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all Glock models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.", "text": "Don't Tread On Me Slide Cover Plate for Glock Don't Tread on Me DesignFixxxer slide back plates are made of T6 aluminum, hard coat anodized. Great replacement for a plastic factory part. All designs are laser engraved.Black anodized and permanent laser engraved slide cover plates are made from durable aluminum. Slide cover plates fit all Glock models and are easily installed.You will love the quality of FIXXXER products.Fits all Generation Glocks 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 30, 31, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39Fixxxer LLCis proud to be an American Company. We stand behind our products, period.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21jC%2Bb1T8CL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005MZU7DS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fixxxer LLC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 12.5}}
