{"item_id": "B005N035WM", "title": "Lone Wolf Plug for Glock G26,27,33,39", "description": "The Lone Wolf plug is designed to close the open cavity at the bottom of the Glock grip. This will prevent debris from entering and reaching the trigger assembly and firing pin. Also eliminates possible snagging from open cavity. Used worldwide. Fits 2nd and 3rd Generation Sub-Compact Glock pistols: •9mm model 26. •40 S&W; model 27. •357 Sig model 33. •45 GAP model 39. * Fit may vary between Glock models. ** Will NOT fit SF models or Gen4 pistols. Please note: Olive Drab framed Glocks have a slight chance of being damaged when using this plug, therefore Lone Wolf does not warranty the use of this plug used in an Olive Drab frame.", "text": "Lone Wolf Plug for Glock G26,27,33,39 The Lone Wolf plug is designed to close the open cavity at the bottom of the Glock grip. This will prevent debris from entering and reaching the trigger assembly and firing pin. Also eliminates possible snagging from open cavity. Used worldwide. Fits 2nd and 3rd Generation Sub-Compact Glock pistols: •9mm model 26. •40 S&W; model 27. •357 Sig model 33. •45 GAP model 39. * Fit may vary between Glock models. ** Will NOT fit SF models or Gen4 pistols. Please note: Olive Drab framed Glocks have a slight chance of being damaged when using this plug, therefore Lone Wolf does not warranty the use of this plug used in an Olive Drab frame.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418QiVORG7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005N035WM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lone Wolf Distributors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.49}}
