{"item_id": "B005NIAJCS", "title": "Mountain Trails Base Camp Cot", "description": "When you need a lightweight and compact cot for guests or for emergency purposes, look no further than the Mountain Trails Base Camp Cot. Weighing in at 9 pounds, 13 ounces, the Base Camp Cot is easy to transport and store with included carry bag. Measuring 74.8 x 30.3 x 6.7 inches, the Base Camp Cot is comfortable for any adult to sleep on.", "text": "Mountain Trails Base Camp Cot When you need a lightweight and compact cot for guests or for emergency purposes, look no further than the Mountain Trails Base Camp Cot. Weighing in at 9 pounds, 13 ounces, the Base Camp Cot is easy to transport and store with included carry bag. Measuring 74.8 x 30.3 x 6.7 inches, the Base Camp Cot is comfortable for any adult to sleep on.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/316PVHk%2BK0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NIAJCS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 30.9}}
