{"item_id": "B005NKDCUM", "title": "Military MOLLE II 9MM Magazine Pouch (Single) ACU", "description": "MOLLE II 9mm Magazine Pouch holds a 9mm Magazine (and others of similar size) and has MOLLE straps on the back for attaching to vests, packs etc. These are made by the same US Government Subcontractor that makes the ones sold to the US Military, and are made from the same grade of materials, to the same specifications.", "text": "Military MOLLE II 9MM Magazine Pouch (Single) ACU MOLLE II 9mm Magazine Pouch holds a 9mm Magazine (and others of similar size) and has MOLLE straps on the back for attaching to vests, packs etc. These are made by the same US Government Subcontractor that makes the ones sold to the US Military, and are made from the same grade of materials, to the same specifications.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513lMjUgprL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NKDCUM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GOVERNMENT CONTRACTOR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 4.98}}
{"item_id": "B005NL1RRQ", "title": "Speedo Speed Socket Mirrored Swim Goggle", "description": "- Excellent competition goggle. - Low profile competition goggle offers enhanced vision, reduced drag and ultimate performance- 3 interchangeable nose pieces for custom fit- UV Protection and Anti-Fog- 100% PVC free", "text": "Speedo Speed Socket Mirrored Swim Goggle - Excellent competition goggle. - Low profile competition goggle offers enhanced vision, reduced drag and ultimate performance- 3 interchangeable nose pieces for custom fit- UV Protection and Anti-Fog- 100% PVC free", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xgbe-OiwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NL1RRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B005NL791O", "title": "Grip Force Gen 1, 2 & 3 Glock Beavertail Grip Adapter", "description": "GRIP FORCE ADAPTERS Grip Force Gen 123 The GRIP FORCE GEN 123 ADAPTER was developed specifically for GLOCK's GEN 1, GEN 2, and GEN 3 series of pistols. It eliminates the drawbacks associated with permanent modifications to your factory pistol. The GRIP FORCE GEN 123 ADAPTER mates completely to the back strap of the GLOCK frame, permitting the shooter's hand to conform to the frame in a more secure manner. This offers more control and allows the shooter to index the pistol on target more efficiently. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: GFA123B Category: GRIPS/RECOIL PADS Type :Grip Adapter Model :Glock Gen 1,2, & 3 Finish :Black Material :Polymer Color :Black Length : Medallion :", "text": "Grip Force Gen 1, 2 & 3 Glock Beavertail Grip Adapter GRIP FORCE ADAPTERS Grip Force Gen 123 The GRIP FORCE GEN 123 ADAPTER was developed specifically for GLOCK's GEN 1, GEN 2, and GEN 3 series of pistols. It eliminates the drawbacks associated with permanent modifications to your factory pistol. The GRIP FORCE GEN 123 ADAPTER mates completely to the back strap of the GLOCK frame, permitting the shooter's hand to conform to the frame in a more secure manner. This offers more control and allows the shooter to index the pistol on target more efficiently. SPECIFICATIONS: Mfg Item Num: GFA123B Category: GRIPS/RECOIL PADS Type :Grip Adapter Model :Glock Gen 1,2, & 3 Finish :Black Material :Polymer Color :Black Length : Medallion :", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41mbwXfXWYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NL791O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Grip Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B005NXM7Y6", "title": "Diamondback 2012 Overdrive 29'er Mountain Bike (Black, 16-Inch/ Small)", "description": "Tree roots, rocks, bumps - whatever is ahead in the trail, the big wheels of the Diamondback Overdrive will keep on rolling. The 29'er butted aluminum frame is paired with an SR Suntour XCT 100mm travel fork . 24 gears controlled by SRAM X-4 shifters and rear derailleur allow you a multitude of gears to choose from and the double wall rims will be sure to keep you going down the trail. When it is time to stop rely on the Tektro Novela mechanical disc brakes. Granted, the Overdrive will not do all the work for you, but it will sure make your job easier.", "text": "Diamondback 2012 Overdrive 29'er Mountain Bike (Black, 16-Inch/ Small) Tree roots, rocks, bumps - whatever is ahead in the trail, the big wheels of the Diamondback Overdrive will keep on rolling. The 29'er butted aluminum frame is paired with an SR Suntour XCT 100mm travel fork . 24 gears controlled by SRAM X-4 shifters and rear derailleur allow you a multitude of gears to choose from and the double wall rims will be sure to keep you going down the trail. When it is time to stop rely on the Tektro Novela mechanical disc brakes. Granted, the Overdrive will not do all the work for you, but it will sure make your job easier.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41NpY7Jbi5L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NXM7Y6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bikes", "Mountain Bikes", "Hardtail Mountain Bikes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005NZIYMI", "title": "Survivor HK-7521 Outdoor Fixed Blade Knife 7-Inch Overall", "description": "7in Overall, 3.5in Blade.Black stainless steel double edge blade.Handle wrap with thick army green nylon strap.Include army green nylon sheath.", "text": "Survivor HK-7521 Outdoor Fixed Blade Knife 7-Inch Overall 7in Overall, 3.5in Blade.Black stainless steel double edge blade.Handle wrap with thick army green nylon strap.Include army green nylon sheath.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TrF6zSRZL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005NZIYMI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Survivor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 5.96}}
{"item_id": "B005O0ROSW", "title": "Nite Ize See 'Em LED - Amber, 2-Pack", "description": "Nite Ize See'Ems turn bicycle wheels from \"hard to spot\" to \"impossible to miss.\" Easy to attach and reposition and molded of tough, durable plastic, they're backed with stainless steel clips specially designed to snap securely onto oval, round, and bladed (flat) bicycle spokes. A bright, long-lasting LED (powered by a replaceable lithium battery) is activated by a simple twist, and can be seen in even the darkest night to keep you seen and safe while riding your bike", "text": "Nite Ize See 'Em LED - Amber, 2-Pack Nite Ize See'Ems turn bicycle wheels from \"hard to spot\" to \"impossible to miss.\" Easy to attach and reposition and molded of tough, durable plastic, they're backed with stainless steel clips specially designed to snap securely onto oval, round, and bladed (flat) bicycle spokes. A bright, long-lasting LED (powered by a replaceable lithium battery) is activated by a simple twist, and can be seen in even the darkest night to keep you seen and safe while riding your bike", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PKUz5ujSL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005O0ROSW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 6.69}}
{"item_id": "B005O9GSXU", "title": "Moultrie Mini-Cam Security Box", "description": "Protect your Moultrie Mini-Cams with the only Camera Security Box specifically designed for them! Protect your Moultrie Mini-Cams from theft and damage 18-gauge, powder-coated steel security box Helps deter game camera theft and creates protective housing from curious animals Custom designed to fit Moultrie's Mini-Cams Perfect-Fit design keeps Mini-Cams snug, no slippage Unique design allows you to easily strap back plate to tree or other permanent structure & secure with included lag bolts Dual security: - Padlock in front of case to secure camera inside security box (padlock not included) - Security cable, such as Python™ cable, easily slides through holein back of security box to secure to tree Design allows easy installation of optional Moultrie PowerPanel Hardware included for easy set up", "text": "Moultrie Mini-Cam Security Box Protect your Moultrie Mini-Cams with the only Camera Security Box specifically designed for them! Protect your Moultrie Mini-Cams from theft and damage 18-gauge, powder-coated steel security box Helps deter game camera theft and creates protective housing from curious animals Custom designed to fit Moultrie's Mini-Cams Perfect-Fit design keeps Mini-Cams snug, no slippage Unique design allows you to easily strap back plate to tree or other permanent structure & secure with included lag bolts Dual security: - Padlock in front of case to secure camera inside security box (padlock not included) - Security cable, such as Python™ cable, easily slides through holein back of security box to secure to tree Design allows easy installation of optional Moultrie PowerPanel Hardware included for easy set up", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Huc1Fv9hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005O9GSXU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005O9U59I", "title": "United Cutlery UC2804 S.O.A. Titanium Assault Knife with Micarta Handle and Kydex Sheath", "description": "This S.O.A. Assault knife features a contoured premium Micarta handle which not only gives this knife a tactical appearance, but is also slip resistant and extremely easy to grip even while wet. The 4 3/4-Inch full-tang blade has been titanium-coated to reduce glare and prevent corrosion and then etched with the S.O.A. emblem and “Death Waits In The Dark.-Inch The extended tang of the blade can be used as a pry bar in emergency situations. Each knife includes a custom-molded Kydex sheath with a high-pressure metal clip that has been laser-etched with the S.O.A. emblem and also offers pre-drilled lanyard holes. Because the sheath is custom-molded, it prevents the knife from falling from the sheath, even while clipped upside down on a shoulder strap or rifle sling.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2804 S.O.A. Titanium Assault Knife with Micarta Handle and Kydex Sheath This S.O.A. Assault knife features a contoured premium Micarta handle which not only gives this knife a tactical appearance, but is also slip resistant and extremely easy to grip even while wet. The 4 3/4-Inch full-tang blade has been titanium-coated to reduce glare and prevent corrosion and then etched with the S.O.A. emblem and “Death Waits In The Dark.-Inch The extended tang of the blade can be used as a pry bar in emergency situations. Each knife includes a custom-molded Kydex sheath with a high-pressure metal clip that has been laser-etched with the S.O.A. emblem and also offers pre-drilled lanyard holes. Because the sheath is custom-molded, it prevents the knife from falling from the sheath, even while clipped upside down on a shoulder strap or rifle sling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31w%2BQKNAmbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005O9U59I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 33.17}}
