{"item_id": "B005OU18XE", "title": "Abu Garcia Black Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel (12-Pound/145-Yard)", "description": "A value-priced Abu Garcia reel, the new, compact Black Max features a smooth-retrieve, 4+1 bearing system with enough built-in durability to withstand the rigors of hardcore fishing. A lightweight graphite frame and body weigh out at a mere 7.9 ounces, while the compact bent handle and star provide an ergonomic feel during retrieves.The handle, which features the renowned Abu Garcia seal, has a compact bent handle and star to provide an ergonomic design.FeaturesFour stainless steel ball bearings plus one roller bearing provide smooth operationMachined aluminum spool provides strength without adding excess weightPower Disk drag system gives smooth drag performanceDuragear brass gear for extended gear lifeMagTrax brake system gives consistent brake pressure throughout the castCompact bent handle and star provide a more ergonomic designRecessed reel foot allows for a more ergonomic reel designLightweight one piece graphite frame and graphite sideplatesWarrantyAbu Garcia products include limited manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship of one year on reels and three years on roods.About Abu GarciaSerious anglers have counted on Abu Garcia to withstand their toughest tests for generations, thanks in part to the company's reputation for building solid products the first they're released, and continuing to improve and fine-tune them over time. The Swedish company's trademark dedication to designing and building superior fishing products has earned it the honor of being chosen \"Purveyor to the Royal Swedish Court,\" a distinction bestowed upon a select group of manufacturers for consistently exceeding its highest standards of quality and craftsmanship.", "text": "Abu Garcia Black Max Low Profile Baitcast Reel (12-Pound/145-Yard) A value-priced Abu Garcia reel, the new, compact Black Max features a smooth-retrieve, 4+1 bearing system with enough built-in durability to withstand the rigors of hardcore fishing. A lightweight graphite frame and body weigh out at a mere 7.9 ounces, while the compact bent handle and star provide an ergonomic feel during retrieves.The handle, which features the renowned Abu Garcia seal, has a compact bent handle and star to provide an ergonomic design.FeaturesFour stainless steel ball bearings plus one roller bearing provide smooth operationMachined aluminum spool provides strength without adding excess weightPower Disk drag system gives smooth drag performanceDuragear brass gear for extended gear lifeMagTrax brake system gives consistent brake pressure throughout the castCompact bent handle and star provide a more ergonomic designRecessed reel foot allows for a more ergonomic reel designLightweight one piece graphite frame and graphite sideplatesWarrantyAbu Garcia products include limited manufacturer's warranties against defects in materials and workmanship of one year on reels and three years on roods.About Abu GarciaSerious anglers have counted on Abu Garcia to withstand their toughest tests for generations, thanks in part to the company's reputation for building solid products the first they're released, and continuing to improve and fine-tune them over time. The Swedish company's trademark dedication to designing and building superior fishing products has earned it the honor of being chosen \"Purveyor to the Royal Swedish Court,\" a distinction bestowed upon a select group of manufacturers for consistently exceeding its highest standards of quality and craftsmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lxwWmCdKL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OU18XE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Abu Garcia", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Reels", "Trolling Reels"]], "price": 48.0}}
{"item_id": "B005OU4E1M", "title": "Exerpeutic 900XL Extended Capacity Recumbent Bike with Pulse", "description": "Ideal for achieving a challenging cardiovascular workout while minimizing stress on your joints, the EXERPEUTIC 900XL offers an impressive 300-pound maximum user weight, a wide padded seat for improved comfort, smooth magnetic resistance, and handlebar-embedded pulse monitoring sensors to help keep you in your target heart rate zone.FeaturesRecumbent Design:The step-through style bike ensures easy on-and-off, as well as a comfortable workout that won't unnecessarily stress your back and kneesLeg Stabilizers:Extended leg stabilizers provide a rock-solid platform during even the most strenuous of workoutsTransportation Wheels:Easily move the unit from one location to anotherTension Resistance:Eight-level Magnetic Tension Control System allows you to customize your ride and challenge yourself over timeOnboard Computer:Large, easy-to-read LCD display indicates distance, calories burned, time, speed, and heart rate informationHeart Rate Sensors:Built-in hand pulse monitor helps you maintain your desired target heart rateCrank System:\"Smooth torque\" cranking system with precision-balanced flywheel and V-belt drive provides smooth, consistent, quiet pedalingAdjustable Seat:Fits users from five feet, six inches to six feet, three inches tallSafety:Larger pedals with safety straps prevent foot slippageComfort:A padded, oversized seat cushion and back rest ensure as comfortable a workout as possibleSpecificationsMeasures 22 by 34 by 54 inches (W x H x D)63-pound weightWarrantyThe Exerpeutic 900XL includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "text": "Exerpeutic 900XL Extended Capacity Recumbent Bike with Pulse Ideal for achieving a challenging cardiovascular workout while minimizing stress on your joints, the EXERPEUTIC 900XL offers an impressive 300-pound maximum user weight, a wide padded seat for improved comfort, smooth magnetic resistance, and handlebar-embedded pulse monitoring sensors to help keep you in your target heart rate zone.FeaturesRecumbent Design:The step-through style bike ensures easy on-and-off, as well as a comfortable workout that won't unnecessarily stress your back and kneesLeg Stabilizers:Extended leg stabilizers provide a rock-solid platform during even the most strenuous of workoutsTransportation Wheels:Easily move the unit from one location to anotherTension Resistance:Eight-level Magnetic Tension Control System allows you to customize your ride and challenge yourself over timeOnboard Computer:Large, easy-to-read LCD display indicates distance, calories burned, time, speed, and heart rate informationHeart Rate Sensors:Built-in hand pulse monitor helps you maintain your desired target heart rateCrank System:\"Smooth torque\" cranking system with precision-balanced flywheel and V-belt drive provides smooth, consistent, quiet pedalingAdjustable Seat:Fits users from five feet, six inches to six feet, three inches tallSafety:Larger pedals with safety straps prevent foot slippageComfort:A padded, oversized seat cushion and back rest ensure as comfortable a workout as possibleSpecificationsMeasures 22 by 34 by 54 inches (W x H x D)63-pound weightWarrantyThe Exerpeutic 900XL includes a limited three-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41%2BemPwIB5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OU4E1M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Exerpeutic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Exercise Bikes"]], "price": 169.0}}
