{"item_id": "B005OVCF8U", "title": "Casio Men's PRW2500-1 Pro-Trek Tough Solar Digital Sport Watch", "description": "", "text": "Casio Men's PRW2500-1 Pro-Trek Tough Solar Digital Sport Watch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513yUju23uL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OVCF8U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Casio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "New Arrivals"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Sport Watches"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Watches", "Wrist Watches"]], "price": 179.1}}
{"item_id": "B005OY350E", "title": "United Cutlery GH5025 Gil Hibben Assault Tactical Knife with Sheath", "description": "This new Hibben Assault knife combines a unique trigger-grip handle and a powerful fulltang blade to make one functional, tactical knife. It offers a 7 1/2-Inch razor-sharp, 7CR17 stainless steel, clip-point blade and a handle constructed of premium Micarta, nickel silver pins and a nickel-silver lanyard hole. The guard, pommel and fittings are cast of stainless steel with a satin finish. This is a unique collectible that should be passed down for many future generations to enjoy. Includes a custom leather belt sheath with the Hibben Custom Design logo stamped right into the leather and a certificate of authenticity.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5025 Gil Hibben Assault Tactical Knife with Sheath This new Hibben Assault knife combines a unique trigger-grip handle and a powerful fulltang blade to make one functional, tactical knife. It offers a 7 1/2-Inch razor-sharp, 7CR17 stainless steel, clip-point blade and a handle constructed of premium Micarta, nickel silver pins and a nickel-silver lanyard hole. The guard, pommel and fittings are cast of stainless steel with a satin finish. This is a unique collectible that should be passed down for many future generations to enjoy. Includes a custom leather belt sheath with the Hibben Custom Design logo stamped right into the leather and a certificate of authenticity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41vuBTu3DIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OY350E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 49.72}}
{"item_id": "B005OYF58E", "title": "Bell Javelin Time Trial/Triathlon Helmet", "description": "The latest installment in Bell's speed series is a new TT helmet called Javelin. It features a wind-tunnel and real world-proven aerodynamic fuselage, the Javelin is designed to be both fast and ventilated. Bell's super adjustable Twin Axis gear (TAG) fit system makes fitting easy while the exclusive SeamFlex ear flaps make getting the Javelin on and off both quick and pain free- a big plus particularly if \"transition area\" is part of your venacular.", "text": "Bell Javelin Time Trial/Triathlon Helmet The latest installment in Bell's speed series is a new TT helmet called Javelin. It features a wind-tunnel and real world-proven aerodynamic fuselage, the Javelin is designed to be both fast and ventilated. Bell's super adjustable Twin Axis gear (TAG) fit system makes fitting easy while the exclusive SeamFlex ear flaps make getting the Javelin on and off both quick and pain free- a big plus particularly if \"transition area\" is part of your venacular.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nV6CTZsBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OYF58E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005OZBMJ4", "title": "Aimshot .22LR Bore Sight with External Battery Box", "description": "AimSHOT Universal Laser Bore sight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately bore sight your weapon. Just slide the AimSHOT Laser Bore sight cartridge into the image caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot I.", "text": "Aimshot .22LR Bore Sight with External Battery Box AimSHOT Universal Laser Bore sight is the most complete, accurate, easy and inexpensive way to accurately bore sight your weapon. Just slide the AimSHOT Laser Bore sight cartridge into the image caliber-specific sleeve in your rifle chamber and a laser dot I.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31KgRqZQGFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005OZBMJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AimShot", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Boresighters"]], "price": 37.56}}
