{"item_id": "B005P12C5A", "title": "SentrySafe SFW123GDC 1.23 Cubic Feet Electronic Fire-Safe, Gun Metal Grey", "description": "Protect your documents, digital media, and other valuables from fire, water, and theft with the SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe. The safe sports four 1-inch steel bolts that are 60 percent bigger than bolts found on traditional safes. Other security features including a pry-resistant hinge and a dual electronic lock and key offer peace of mind and make it harder than ever for burglars to access your important possessions. An interior locking drawer and a key rack, tray, and pocket on the door make it easy to organize your things. This safe has been verified to provide one-hour fire protection.SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-SafeAt a Glance:Four 1-inch live-locking steel boltsDual electronic lock and keyCertified to provide one-hour fire protectionBacked by a one-year limited warrantyThe SFW123GDC has bolts that are 60 percent bigger than those found in traditional safes (click to enlarge).The safe features a dual electronic lock and key for increased security (click to enlarge).Solid Construction to Keep Your Valuables SecureDesigned to provide years of protection and dependable service, the SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe features a solid steel exterior along with four 1-inch live-locking steel bolts that are 60 percent bigger than those on traditional safes. A pry-resistant hinge bar provides additional protection from forced entry, while a dual electronic lock and key deliver increased security. Included with the safe is a bolt-down kit that enables you to easily bolt the safe to the floor.Fire and Water ProtectionThe SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe has been certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) and Edison Testing Laboratories (ETL) to provide one-hour fire protection. The safe can also sit in up to 8 inches of water for up to 24 hours without sustaining water damage. In addition, the SFW123GDC has been subjected to 15-foot drop tests, whereupon the contents remain intact and the safe remains locked.Smart Features for Greater ConvenienceThe SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe has several features to help keep your irreplaceable valuables organized. For quick access, the interior of the door has a key rack, a tray, and a pocket for small items like CDs and DVDs. An interior locking drawer provides additional privacy, while a bright interior LED light makes it easier to see your things. Other nice touches include a backlit keypad--handy when you need to access the safe in the dark--and a quick-access battery pack that makes it simple to replace batteries.The safe measures 17.8 by 16.3 by 19.3 inches on the outside (H x W x D) and 13.8 by 12.6 by 11.9 on the inside and weighs 101 pounds.About SentrySafeSentrySafe has been a global leader in the safe industry for over 80 years, producing more fire-safe security containers than any other company in the world. With its primary manufacturing facility located in Rochester, New York, SentrySafe makes most of its products in the United States. SentrySafe is dedicated to providing quality, affordable, innovative products that meet rigorous UL and ETL testing standards to protect your important and irreplaceable valuables from theft, fire, and water.What's in the BoxSentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe, bolt-down hardware, owner's instruction manual, and warranty information.To keep your valuables organized, the SFW123GDC offers an interior locking drawer, a key rack, a tray, and a pocket for small items (click to enlarge).", "text": "SentrySafe SFW123GDC 1.23 Cubic Feet Electronic Fire-Safe, Gun Metal Grey Protect your documents, digital media, and other valuables from fire, water, and theft with the SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe. The safe sports four 1-inch steel bolts that are 60 percent bigger than bolts found on traditional safes. Other security features including a pry-resistant hinge and a dual electronic lock and key offer peace of mind and make it harder than ever for burglars to access your important possessions. An interior locking drawer and a key rack, tray, and pocket on the door make it easy to organize your things. This safe has been verified to provide one-hour fire protection.SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-SafeAt a Glance:Four 1-inch live-locking steel boltsDual electronic lock and keyCertified to provide one-hour fire protectionBacked by a one-year limited warrantyThe SFW123GDC has bolts that are 60 percent bigger than those found in traditional safes (click to enlarge).The safe features a dual electronic lock and key for increased security (click to enlarge).Solid Construction to Keep Your Valuables SecureDesigned to provide years of protection and dependable service, the SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe features a solid steel exterior along with four 1-inch live-locking steel bolts that are 60 percent bigger than those on traditional safes. A pry-resistant hinge bar provides additional protection from forced entry, while a dual electronic lock and key deliver increased security. Included with the safe is a bolt-down kit that enables you to easily bolt the safe to the floor.Fire and Water ProtectionThe SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe has been certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) and Edison Testing Laboratories (ETL) to provide one-hour fire protection. The safe can also sit in up to 8 inches of water for up to 24 hours without sustaining water damage. In addition, the SFW123GDC has been subjected to 15-foot drop tests, whereupon the contents remain intact and the safe remains locked.Smart Features for Greater ConvenienceThe SentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe has several features to help keep your irreplaceable valuables organized. For quick access, the interior of the door has a key rack, a tray, and a pocket for small items like CDs and DVDs. An interior locking drawer provides additional privacy, while a bright interior LED light makes it easier to see your things. Other nice touches include a backlit keypad--handy when you need to access the safe in the dark--and a quick-access battery pack that makes it simple to replace batteries.The safe measures 17.8 by 16.3 by 19.3 inches on the outside (H x W x D) and 13.8 by 12.6 by 11.9 on the inside and weighs 101 pounds.About SentrySafeSentrySafe has been a global leader in the safe industry for over 80 years, producing more fire-safe security containers than any other company in the world. With its primary manufacturing facility located in Rochester, New York, SentrySafe makes most of its products in the United States. SentrySafe is dedicated to providing quality, affordable, innovative products that meet rigorous UL and ETL testing standards to protect your important and irreplaceable valuables from theft, fire, and water.What's in the BoxSentrySafe SFW123GDC Electronic Fire-Safe, bolt-down hardware, owner's instruction manual, and warranty information.To keep your valuables organized, the SFW123GDC offers an interior locking drawer, a key rack, a tray, and a pocket for small items (click to enlarge).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41meyNKzpmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005P12C5A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SentrySafe", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Gun Safes & Cabinets"]], "price": 201.26}}
