{"item_id": "B005Q12CVI", "title": "Safe Alert! Mini Keychain Safety Emergency Survival Whistle", "description": "The SafeAlert! Mini keychain safety whistle is small enough to carry in your pocket with your keys, while loud enough to attract or detract attention when you need. The high pitched tone created when blown is well suited for both outdoor and urban use.", "text": "Safe Alert! Mini Keychain Safety Emergency Survival Whistle The SafeAlert! Mini keychain safety whistle is small enough to carry in your pocket with your keys, while loud enough to attract or detract attention when you need. The high pitched tone created when blown is well suited for both outdoor and urban use.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419njPKWoTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Q12CVI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Whistles"]], "price": 4.98}}
