{"item_id": "B005Q2SVDU", "title": "Sure-Pak MRE Full Meal Kit with Heater-Single Meal", "description": "Sopakco Sure-Pak Genuine GI Military MRE Meals - Ready To Eat. Direct From US Government Contractor. 1 Delicious Ready To Eat Meal Included Per Sample picked randomly from the Various & Assorted Menu Types. Possible Main Entrees include: Beef ravioli, Beef Taco, Apple Maple Oatmeal, Pot Roast, Garlic Chicken and Chicken Fajitas. Each MRE Includes a Main Entree, Side Dish, Dessert, May include Crackers, Spread, Coffee, Beverage Mix and Accessory Pack. Dimensions: 8.5\" x 3.5\" x 5.5\". Ideal For Emergency Situations & Disaster Preparedness. Nutritious Great-Tasting Meals Ideal For Emergency Situations. Sopakco has been the top supplier of MRE's to the US Military for more than 30 years. This pack includes the flameless Heater. Sure-Pak Meals contain between 900 to 1,250 calories per meal, depending on the entree and individual components. A minimum of two meals per person per day is recommended for a 72-hour period.", "text": "Sure-Pak MRE Full Meal Kit with Heater-Single Meal Sopakco Sure-Pak Genuine GI Military MRE Meals - Ready To Eat. Direct From US Government Contractor. 1 Delicious Ready To Eat Meal Included Per Sample picked randomly from the Various & Assorted Menu Types. Possible Main Entrees include: Beef ravioli, Beef Taco, Apple Maple Oatmeal, Pot Roast, Garlic Chicken and Chicken Fajitas. Each MRE Includes a Main Entree, Side Dish, Dessert, May include Crackers, Spread, Coffee, Beverage Mix and Accessory Pack. Dimensions: 8.5\" x 3.5\" x 5.5\". Ideal For Emergency Situations & Disaster Preparedness. Nutritious Great-Tasting Meals Ideal For Emergency Situations. Sopakco has been the top supplier of MRE's to the US Military for more than 30 years. This pack includes the flameless Heater. Sure-Pak Meals contain between 900 to 1,250 calories per meal, depending on the entree and individual components. A minimum of two meals per person per day is recommended for a 72-hour period.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51O1pGUP9mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Q2SVDU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sure Pak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 4.99}}
