{"item_id": "B005Q6WN9Y", "title": "Mio Pacer PC Ultra Slim Pedometer Watch", "description": "The MIO Pacer PC+ is a sleek, credit card sized (only 5mm thick!) Activity Monitor. Upload your progress to Facebook and Twitter to track and share your progress. It uses advanced 3D Accelerometer Technology to accurately count and record daily steps, distance, speed, and even calories burned. The MIO Pacer PC+ and its supporting software can actually determine if you’re walking or running, ensuring accuracy The MIO Pacer PC+ uses your personal stats to provide you with the instant data you need to achieve your health and fitness goals.", "text": "Mio Pacer PC Ultra Slim Pedometer Watch The MIO Pacer PC+ is a sleek, credit card sized (only 5mm thick!) Activity Monitor. Upload your progress to Facebook and Twitter to track and share your progress. It uses advanced 3D Accelerometer Technology to accurately count and record daily steps, distance, speed, and even calories burned. The MIO Pacer PC+ and its supporting software can actually determine if you’re walking or running, ensuring accuracy The MIO Pacer PC+ uses your personal stats to provide you with the instant data you need to achieve your health and fitness goals.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xKTLgoLnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Q6WN9Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Pedometers"]], "price": 7.99}}
