{"item_id": "B005QHN3QK", "title": "Light My Fire Spork XM BPA-Free Tritan Spork with Full-Sized Spoon, Fork and Serrated Knife Edge", "description": "The Spork XM is a larger version of the spoon-fork-knife combo.", "text": "Light My Fire Spork XM BPA-Free Tritan Spork with Full-Sized Spoon, Fork and Serrated Knife Edge The Spork XM is a larger version of the spoon-fork-knife combo.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vCoN7qKxL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QHN3QK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Light my Fire", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 5.79}}
{"item_id": "B005QI8IOQ", "title": "Source Outdoor Tactical Gear WXP Hydration System, 3-Liter", "description": "Source WXP 3L Hydration Reservoir System- Liquid Capacity 100 oz. (3L). 17”L X 8.3”W x 1.2”D. Empty weight: .53 lbs. High performance 3L hydration drinking system. Beefy 3 layer coextruded Polyethylene construction for durability. Exclusive taste-free Glass-like liner with FDA approved Grunge- Guard drastically reduces cleaning and field maintenance. Patented leakproof \"slider\" wide opening for easy cleaning, draining, ice insertion. Easy opening NC filler port mates with most pump-style water filters.. Self sealing QMT tube with 2 \"quick disconnects\" for instant installation of filters, tube refill adaptors, accessory drinking valves and more. Patented push/pull Storm Valve requires no biting, delivers 25% higher flow than standard bite designs. Integrated valve shut-off. Protective Dirt Shield valve cover. UV bLock weave covered tube.", "text": "Source Outdoor Tactical Gear WXP Hydration System, 3-Liter Source WXP 3L Hydration Reservoir System- Liquid Capacity 100 oz. (3L). 17”L X 8.3”W x 1.2”D. Empty weight: .53 lbs. High performance 3L hydration drinking system. Beefy 3 layer coextruded Polyethylene construction for durability. Exclusive taste-free Glass-like liner with FDA approved Grunge- Guard drastically reduces cleaning and field maintenance. Patented leakproof \"slider\" wide opening for easy cleaning, draining, ice insertion. Easy opening NC filler port mates with most pump-style water filters.. Self sealing QMT tube with 2 \"quick disconnects\" for instant installation of filters, tube refill adaptors, accessory drinking valves and more. Patented push/pull Storm Valve requires no biting, delivers 25% higher flow than standard bite designs. Integrated valve shut-off. Protective Dirt Shield valve cover. UV bLock weave covered tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MBvmpg0yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QI8IOQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Source Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B005QI8JVS", "title": "Source Outdoors WXP SQC QMT Storm Valve-IRR Cover (Foliage, 3-Litres )", "description": "Source WXP 3L Hydration Reservoir System- Liquid Capacity 100 oz. (3L). 17”L X 8.3”W x 1.2”D. Empty weight: .53 lbs. High performance 3L hydration drinking system. Beefy 3 layer coextruded Polyethylene construction for durability. Exclusive taste-free Glass-like liner with FDA approved Grunge- Guard drastically reduces cleaning and field maintenance. Patented leakproof \"slider\" wide opening for easy cleaning, draining, ice insertion. Easy opening NC filler port mates with most pump-style water filters.. Self sealing QMT tube with 2 \"quick disconnects\" for instant installation of filters, tube refill adaptors, accessory drinking valves and more. Patented push/pull Storm Valve requires no biting, delivers 25% higher flow than standard bite designs. Integrated valve shut-off. Protective Dirt Shield valve cover. UV bLock weave covered tube.", "text": "Source Outdoors WXP SQC QMT Storm Valve-IRR Cover (Foliage, 3-Litres ) Source WXP 3L Hydration Reservoir System- Liquid Capacity 100 oz. (3L). 17”L X 8.3”W x 1.2”D. Empty weight: .53 lbs. High performance 3L hydration drinking system. Beefy 3 layer coextruded Polyethylene construction for durability. Exclusive taste-free Glass-like liner with FDA approved Grunge- Guard drastically reduces cleaning and field maintenance. Patented leakproof \"slider\" wide opening for easy cleaning, draining, ice insertion. Easy opening NC filler port mates with most pump-style water filters.. Self sealing QMT tube with 2 \"quick disconnects\" for instant installation of filters, tube refill adaptors, accessory drinking valves and more. Patented push/pull Storm Valve requires no biting, delivers 25% higher flow than standard bite designs. Integrated valve shut-off. Protective Dirt Shield valve cover. UV bLock weave covered tube.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41MBvmpg0yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QI8JVS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Source Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 32.99}}
{"item_id": "B005QI8M5Q", "title": "Source Outdoors Military Universal Tube Refill Adaptor (Coyote)", "description": "UTA (Universal Tube Refill Adaptor) – 1.8”L x 1” W x 1”D Unpackaged .Weight: .03 lbs. UTA provides on the move hydration system refills right through the drinking tube. Fit the most widely used water bottle and spigot sizes as well as Water Buffalo field units. Mates with Source’s QMT “quick-connect” system for instant, “click in, click out” operation. Fast fill-ups even with unpressurized water sources. Visual fill indicator. Optional accessory MOLLE storage pouch is available separately. COMPATIBLE ONLY WITH SOURCE HYDRATION QMT SYSTEMS.", "text": "Source Outdoors Military Universal Tube Refill Adaptor (Coyote) UTA (Universal Tube Refill Adaptor) – 1.8”L x 1” W x 1”D Unpackaged .Weight: .03 lbs. UTA provides on the move hydration system refills right through the drinking tube. Fit the most widely used water bottle and spigot sizes as well as Water Buffalo field units. Mates with Source’s QMT “quick-connect” system for instant, “click in, click out” operation. Fast fill-ups even with unpressurized water sources. Visual fill indicator. Optional accessory MOLLE storage pouch is available separately. COMPATIBLE ONLY WITH SOURCE HYDRATION QMT SYSTEMS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319TAVeZsAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QI8M5Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 10.53}}
{"item_id": "B005QI8S46", "title": "Source Outdoors Helix QMT Valve Kit (Coyote)", "description": "Source Helix Valve Kit QMT . 2”L x 1.2”W x 1.2”D Unpackaged. Packaged weight: .04 lbs. Fits all QMT hydration tubes. Exclusive Helix design delivers high flow with minimal bite pressure. Omni directional operation. Integrated twist shut-off. Long wearing design.", "text": "Source Outdoors Helix QMT Valve Kit (Coyote) Source Helix Valve Kit QMT . 2”L x 1.2”W x 1.2”D Unpackaged. Packaged weight: .04 lbs. Fits all QMT hydration tubes. Exclusive Helix design delivers high flow with minimal bite pressure. Omni directional operation. Integrated twist shut-off. Long wearing design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qDPA4TFAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QI8S46.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 9.13}}
