{"item_id": "B005QPBR9W", "title": "Compact Pistol Flash Light 150 LUMEN", "description": "SUPER BRIGHT COMPACT PISTOL FLASHLIGHT 150 LUMEN LED LED CREE T5 BULB THIS IS THE BRIGHTEST AND SMALLEST ONE BATTERY WEAPON LIGHT MADE !!! 150 Lumen TRUE Output LED WEAPON LIGHT USED BY SEVERAL POLICE DEPARTMENTS HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION SUPER TOUGH!! MADE OF 6061 AIRCRAFT GRADE ALUMINUM PUSH BUTTON ON SWITCH • Quick Detach System Easy to take On And Off The Gun But Holds Secure • Fits Weaver / Picatinny Rails • Length: 2.5 Inches • Width: 1 Inche • Height: 1.6 Inches Fits All Pistols With Weaver or Picatinny Rails Beretta px4 Compact Smith & Wesson M&P; Compact Ruger SR9c Compact Xd Subcompact XDm 3.8 Compact All Rifles and Shotgun's too !! • Can Be Mounted On Shotguns/Rifles mount may be needed • Operating Voltage: 3V DC • Operation Current: <300mA • One year Warranty • Battery type - 1 CR2 Lithium SUPER FAST SHIPPING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "text": "Compact Pistol Flash Light 150 LUMEN SUPER BRIGHT COMPACT PISTOL FLASHLIGHT 150 LUMEN LED LED CREE T5 BULB THIS IS THE BRIGHTEST AND SMALLEST ONE BATTERY WEAPON LIGHT MADE !!! 150 Lumen TRUE Output LED WEAPON LIGHT USED BY SEVERAL POLICE DEPARTMENTS HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION SUPER TOUGH!! MADE OF 6061 AIRCRAFT GRADE ALUMINUM PUSH BUTTON ON SWITCH • Quick Detach System Easy to take On And Off The Gun But Holds Secure • Fits Weaver / Picatinny Rails • Length: 2.5 Inches • Width: 1 Inche • Height: 1.6 Inches Fits All Pistols With Weaver or Picatinny Rails Beretta px4 Compact Smith & Wesson M&P; Compact Ruger SR9c Compact Xd Subcompact XDm 3.8 Compact All Rifles and Shotgun's too !! • Can Be Mounted On Shotguns/Rifles mount may be needed • Operating Voltage: 3V DC • Operation Current: <300mA • One year Warranty • Battery type - 1 CR2 Lithium SUPER FAST SHIPPING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RlbfA-7fL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QPBR9W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B005QRYQ0C", "title": "Lightweight Compact Folding Camp Stove Windscreen", "description": "This folding windscreen is a great addition to outdoor cooking with a camp stove. Block the wind for for faster cooking and heat retention. You can also use this to help you start a fire in windy conditions. Each panel measures 5.25\" inches high by 3\" wide. There are 9 panels total. folded the stack measures 1/2\" thick. With the storage bag total weight is only 4.4 ounces! This windscreen is intended for use with stoves that do not mount to the top of a tank. The stove would be too high for the windscreen to be effective. Use this with stoves like the MSR Whisperlite or similar as shown, stove not included.", "text": "Lightweight Compact Folding Camp Stove Windscreen This folding windscreen is a great addition to outdoor cooking with a camp stove. Block the wind for for faster cooking and heat retention. You can also use this to help you start a fire in windy conditions. Each panel measures 5.25\" inches high by 3\" wide. There are 9 panels total. folded the stack measures 1/2\" thick. With the storage bag total weight is only 4.4 ounces! This windscreen is intended for use with stoves that do not mount to the top of a tank. The stove would be too high for the windscreen to be effective. Use this with stoves like the MSR Whisperlite or similar as shown, stove not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKlyAIliL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QRYQ0C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 2.01}}
{"item_id": "B005QSE69M", "title": "Ruffwear K-9 Overcoat Utility Jacket", "description": "The K-9 Overcoat Dog Jacket from Ruffwear is durable, abrasion-resistant and keeps your dog warm in cold, inclement weather.", "text": "Ruffwear K-9 Overcoat Utility Jacket The K-9 Overcoat Dog Jacket from Ruffwear is durable, abrasion-resistant and keeps your dog warm in cold, inclement weather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tPGDzJTzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QSE69M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ruffwear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Dog Packs"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B005QTVTJ6", "title": "Igloo Stainless Steel Cooler Latch", "description": "Although made Igloo-tough, accidents can happen. Get your replacement latches here to make your Igloo cooler like new again. This Stainless Steel latch is 100 percent steel for longer life and a secure closure. Made to fit Glide Elite and all current and old style Igloo coolers equipped with latches. 1 unit.", "text": "Igloo Stainless Steel Cooler Latch Although made Igloo-tough, accidents can happen. Get your replacement latches here to make your Igloo cooler like new again. This Stainless Steel latch is 100 percent steel for longer life and a secure closure. Made to fit Glide Elite and all current and old style Igloo coolers equipped with latches. 1 unit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41m1GDiPLlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QTVTJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Igloo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 12.75}}
{"item_id": "B005QYHG7K", "title": "Lezyne Alloy Drive Hand Pump", "description": "A compact HV hand pump made entirely of custom CNC-machined aluminum for precise and lightweight construction. The HV design allows this pump to inflate tires to riding pressure with 30% fewer strokes compared to conventional hand pumps. The overlapping handle and barrel with oversized piston and shaft are integrated into a compact design. Comes equipped with the ABS Flex Hose and a Composite Matrix frame pump mount.", "text": "Lezyne Alloy Drive Hand Pump A compact HV hand pump made entirely of custom CNC-machined aluminum for precise and lightweight construction. The HV design allows this pump to inflate tires to riding pressure with 30% fewer strokes compared to conventional hand pumps. The overlapping handle and barrel with oversized piston and shaft are integrated into a compact design. Comes equipped with the ABS Flex Hose and a Composite Matrix frame pump mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ijmR9cxaL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QYHG7K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005QZWG06", "title": "Maxpedition 32-Ounce Military Water Bottle (Desert Tan)", "description": "MAXPEDITION 32oz Water Bottle \"MILITARY\" (Desert)", "text": "Maxpedition 32-Ounce Military Water Bottle (Desert Tan) MAXPEDITION 32oz Water Bottle \"MILITARY\" (Desert)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zJBg2B5hL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005QZWG06.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005R0K2OM", "title": "Nite Ize SlapLit LED Bracelet - Wavy Grid", "description": "The Nite Ize SlapLit features that same \"slap it to snap it\" technology as those bracelets from yesteryear with an added dimension of LED illuminating functionality. Made of durable nylon patterned with a reflective spider web design the SlapLit is powered by a bright easy-to-activate LED that lights up the entire wrap. Turn it on slap it on your wrist upper arm or ankle (or any tubular-shaped object for that matter) and you've got instant nighttime visibility.", "text": "Nite Ize SlapLit LED Bracelet - Wavy Grid The Nite Ize SlapLit features that same \"slap it to snap it\" technology as those bracelets from yesteryear with an added dimension of LED illuminating functionality. Made of durable nylon patterned with a reflective spider web design the SlapLit is powered by a bright easy-to-activate LED that lights up the entire wrap. Turn it on slap it on your wrist upper arm or ankle (or any tubular-shaped object for that matter) and you've got instant nighttime visibility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sop9tLOcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005R0K2OM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nite Ize", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 9.25}}
{"item_id": "B005R44H4Y", "title": "Meyerco Thumb Drive II Utility Neck Knife Stainless Steel Handle Measures 4 Inch Overall", "description": "Meyerco Pinkerton Thumb Drive II. One piece black finish AUS-6 stainless construction. 4\" overall. 1 1/4\" double edge blade. Molded black glass filled nylon sheath with beaded neck chain. Hang packaged. Designed by Dirk Pinkerton.", "text": "Meyerco Thumb Drive II Utility Neck Knife Stainless Steel Handle Measures 4 Inch Overall Meyerco Pinkerton Thumb Drive II. One piece black finish AUS-6 stainless construction. 4\" overall. 1 1/4\" double edge blade. Molded black glass filled nylon sheath with beaded neck chain. Hang packaged. Designed by Dirk Pinkerton.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21V-sRIZFnL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005R44H4Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005R4Y2NA", "title": "Provident Pantry® MyChoiceTM Butter Powder 9oz.", "description": "For baking needs, or simply for spreading on a fresh slice of bread, Butter Powder offers flavor and convenience to your food storage. Made from real sweet cream butter, this dehydrated baking essential rehydrates and spreads on smooth. Add a small amount of vegetable oil for an even smoother texture and to enhance flavor. When used in baking, it is not necessary to reconstitute: Simply add it to your dry ingredients and increase the liquid. Butter Powder also works great to make your own honey butter and herb-flavored butters.", "text": "Provident Pantry® MyChoiceTM Butter Powder 9oz. For baking needs, or simply for spreading on a fresh slice of bread, Butter Powder offers flavor and convenience to your food storage. Made from real sweet cream butter, this dehydrated baking essential rehydrates and spreads on smooth. Add a small amount of vegetable oil for an even smoother texture and to enhance flavor. When used in baking, it is not necessary to reconstitute: Simply add it to your dry ingredients and increase the liquid. Butter Powder also works great to make your own honey butter and herb-flavored butters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-62WmD0bL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005R4Y2NA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 5.95}}
{"item_id": "B005RBVE84", "title": "Manual Card Shuffler", "description": "Enjoy this Deck Manual Card Shuffler for Poker and Bridge size cards. A great aid for people requiring help with shuffling playing cards. The manual hand crank makes it easy to use. Shuffles one to two decks at once.", "text": "Manual Card Shuffler Enjoy this Deck Manual Card Shuffler for Poker and Bridge size cards. A great aid for people requiring help with shuffling playing cards. The manual hand crank makes it easy to use. Shuffles one to two decks at once.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FwoVh6zbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RBVE84.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Classic Game Collection", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Casino Equipment", "Cards & Equipment", "Card Shufflers"]], "price": 15.98}}
{"item_id": "B005RDCJF4", "title": "adidas Men's Techfit Fitted Short Sleeve Top, Prime Blue, XX-Large", "description": "", "text": "adidas Men's Techfit Fitted Short Sleeve Top, Prime Blue, XX-Large", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zpcuUOBUL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RDCJF4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "adidas"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Men", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Shirts & Tees"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005RJBZBM", "title": "Exotac nanoSTRIKER Refill Kit", "description": "To replace an old rod, simply unscrew the rod and screw in the new rod. Ensure the rod is a snug fit into the rod holder. An optional drop of blue or purple Loctite will help retain the rod if it becomes loose. The Exotac fire starting tools utilize a proprietary alloy of rare earth metals called ferrocerium. Some of these metals include Iron, Cerium and Magnesium. When a ferrocerium rod is rapidly scraped, the friction created ignites the shavings of ferrocerium producing molten globular of burning metal. It is these long-burning molten globular of metal that make a ferrocerium fire starter so effective at catching other materials afire.", "text": "Exotac nanoSTRIKER Refill Kit To replace an old rod, simply unscrew the rod and screw in the new rod. Ensure the rod is a snug fit into the rod holder. An optional drop of blue or purple Loctite will help retain the rod if it becomes loose. The Exotac fire starting tools utilize a proprietary alloy of rare earth metals called ferrocerium. Some of these metals include Iron, Cerium and Magnesium. When a ferrocerium rod is rapidly scraped, the friction created ignites the shavings of ferrocerium producing molten globular of burning metal. It is these long-burning molten globular of metal that make a ferrocerium fire starter so effective at catching other materials afire.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GDEqSepCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RJBZBM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Exotac", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B005ROCZZC", "title": "GG&G Benelli M4 Charging Handle", "description": "Retracting bolt handle issued with the popular Benelli M1 Super 90, M2, M3 M4 and Model 121 fighting shotguns is difficult to grasp during the high anxiety associated with a gunfight. Oversized, knurled, rotating Benelli tactical charging handle for the Benelli law enforcement series shotguns. Tactical accessories are made from 4140 ordnance steel, heat-treated to Rockwell 45 C hardness and feature a matte black, mil-spec manganese phosphate finish.Description:Benelli Tactical Charging HandleAdditional Information:", "text": "GG&G Benelli M4 Charging Handle Retracting bolt handle issued with the popular Benelli M1 Super 90, M2, M3 M4 and Model 121 fighting shotguns is difficult to grasp during the high anxiety associated with a gunfight. Oversized, knurled, rotating Benelli tactical charging handle for the Benelli law enforcement series shotguns. Tactical accessories are made from 4140 ordnance steel, heat-treated to Rockwell 45 C hardness and feature a matte black, mil-spec manganese phosphate finish.Description:Benelli Tactical Charging HandleAdditional Information:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-Um46t9sL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ROCZZC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Rings & Covers", "Optic Covers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005RTPMBQ", "title": "GG&G Quick Detach Harris Bipod Adapter GGG-1406", "description": "GG&G; Quick Detach Harris Bipod Adapter GGG-1406", "text": "GG&G Quick Detach Harris Bipod Adapter GGG-1406 GG&G; Quick Detach Harris Bipod Adapter GGG-1406", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21QjkiKzHSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RTPMBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GG&amp;G", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Monopods & Bipods"]], "price": 78.2}}
{"item_id": "B005RURGYQ", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Weather Resistant iPhone 4, iPhone 5, Smartphone Case", "description": "Ibera's PB7 is weather resistant and fits the iPhone 4 and most smartphones. There are 2 velcro flaps, doubly securing the phone from the rain. The inside bag folds down several times to ensure that it stays sealed and the rain stays out. The clear window is made of clear polyurethane and allows for easy access to touch pad controls.The phone bag can be clipped onto a stem mount and bar clamp mount in both portrait and landscape modes. This is great for keeping an iPhone handy for communication or for using a GPS function on longer rides. Available in black and white.3 Mounting options:(Q1) Handlebar mount with bottle cage mount (attach a bottle cage,water bottle and bottle cage not included)(Q2) Handlebar mount with mini handlebar (attach a light, bell, or cycling computer)(Q4) Angle adjustable stem mount (for customized viewing angles and reducing glare)Specifications:Material:Nylon with clear windowMax. Device Size:4.5\" x 2.4\" 0.5\"Screen size:4\"Weight:1.76 ozNote:Measure cell phone device before ordering to ensure compatibility with handheld case. Some cases/shells may need to be removed before using the weather resistant phone mount.Warning:Not for use off road or rough riding", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Weather Resistant iPhone 4, iPhone 5, Smartphone Case Ibera's PB7 is weather resistant and fits the iPhone 4 and most smartphones. There are 2 velcro flaps, doubly securing the phone from the rain. The inside bag folds down several times to ensure that it stays sealed and the rain stays out. The clear window is made of clear polyurethane and allows for easy access to touch pad controls.The phone bag can be clipped onto a stem mount and bar clamp mount in both portrait and landscape modes. This is great for keeping an iPhone handy for communication or for using a GPS function on longer rides. Available in black and white.3 Mounting options:(Q1) Handlebar mount with bottle cage mount (attach a bottle cage,water bottle and bottle cage not included)(Q2) Handlebar mount with mini handlebar (attach a light, bell, or cycling computer)(Q4) Angle adjustable stem mount (for customized viewing angles and reducing glare)Specifications:Material:Nylon with clear windowMax. Device Size:4.5\" x 2.4\" 0.5\"Screen size:4\"Weight:1.76 ozNote:Measure cell phone device before ordering to ensure compatibility with handheld case. Some cases/shells may need to be removed before using the weather resistant phone mount.Warning:Not for use off road or rough riding", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/410LHGnj4ZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RURGYQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Handlebar Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005RY3N0I", "title": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Dry Day Pack (22-Liter)", "description": "Made from siliconized CORDURA® fabric, this ultra-lightweight and compact day pack resists water and packs into its own tiny stuff sack complete with a Hypalon® key ring attachment. The seams are double stitched and sealed with high density PU seam tape. The unique double Hypalon® roll top is non-wicking and helps create a good seal. The compression lacing system provides secure storage.", "text": "Sea to Summit Ultra-Sil Dry Day Pack (22-Liter) Made from siliconized CORDURA® fabric, this ultra-lightweight and compact day pack resists water and packs into its own tiny stuff sack complete with a Hypalon® key ring attachment. The seams are double stitched and sealed with high density PU seam tape. The unique double Hypalon® roll top is non-wicking and helps create a good seal. The compression lacing system provides secure storage.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KMNsSafEL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005RY3N0I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sea to Summit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]], "price": 54.95}}
{"item_id": "B005S0IAMM", "title": "Spyderco Delica4 Lightweight FRN Flat Ground Plain Edge Knife, Orange", "description": "If you already own a Delica or Endura, you have one of the best selling knives Spyderco makes. The knife you have just acquired is a bit different from the normal C10 Endura4 and C11 Delica4 Lightweights. They are now available in a range of new handle colors with full-flat ground blades. Their FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handles come in new vibrant tones including blue, green, brown, gray, orange and purple. Molded onto the handle's surface is Bi-Directional Texturing for slip-free tactile traction. Inside the handle are dual skeletonized stainless steel liners which strengthen the knife without additional weight and double as an anchor for external and internal components to attach through generating more sturdiness and rigidity. The blades are full flat-ground VG-10 with a thinner highly refined cutting edge and a larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade’s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left-or right-handed clip.", "text": "Spyderco Delica4 Lightweight FRN Flat Ground Plain Edge Knife, Orange If you already own a Delica or Endura, you have one of the best selling knives Spyderco makes. The knife you have just acquired is a bit different from the normal C10 Endura4 and C11 Delica4 Lightweights. They are now available in a range of new handle colors with full-flat ground blades. Their FRN (fiberglass reinforced nylon) handles come in new vibrant tones including blue, green, brown, gray, orange and purple. Molded onto the handle's surface is Bi-Directional Texturing for slip-free tactile traction. Inside the handle are dual skeletonized stainless steel liners which strengthen the knife without additional weight and double as an anchor for external and internal components to attach through generating more sturdiness and rigidity. The blades are full flat-ground VG-10 with a thinner highly refined cutting edge and a larger 13mm opening hole. Added to the blade’s spine is slip resistant jimping. Phosphor bronze washers smooth out the open/close action and the clip is upgraded to a four-way tip-up, tip-down, left-or right-handed clip.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zdpsjT42L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005S0IAMM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Spyderco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 61.1}}
{"item_id": "B005S43C7G", "title": "DeMarini Vendetta Bag", "description": "Whether playing on the road or at home, Wilson and DeMarini bags are designed to give players at every level the superior equipment they demand to get them through the season.", "text": "DeMarini Vendetta Bag Whether playing on the road or at home, Wilson and DeMarini bags are designed to give players at every level the superior equipment they demand to get them through the season.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41d01gQHa1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005S43C7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeMarini", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Baseball", "Accessories", "Equipment Bags", "Gear Bags"]], "price": 29.95}}
{"item_id": "B005S6GY74", "title": "Intex Excursion 4 Boat Set - 2013 Model", "description": "Inflatable 4 person boat, with oars and pump included. Has 3 air chambers for fast fill and quick deflate. US Coast Guard approved vessel.", "text": "Intex Excursion 4 Boat Set - 2013 Model Inflatable 4 person boat, with oars and pump included. Has 3 air chambers for fast fill and quick deflate. US Coast Guard approved vessel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VR0ir-93L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005S6GY74.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boats", "Inflatable Rafts"]], "price": 149.99}}
{"item_id": "B005SBN0GC", "title": "Springfield XD Sub Compact Hybrid IWB Holster, SHTF Gear ACE-1", "description": "SHTF Gear ACE-1This holster is made specifically for the Springfield XD Sub CompactOur line of ACE holsters (Always Combat Effective) provides the perfect combination of comfort and rapid deployment that are a must for every day concealed carry. Our holsters are designed to allow the shooter to get a full shooting grip on the gun while it is holstered, ensuring that the second the gun is out it's ready for action. Our first and most successful product sets a new standard for comfort and concealment. The ACE line of holsters are an IWB (inside the waistband) holster built on premium laser cut leather paired with custom molded Kydex to create the perfect draw and allow for easy reholstering. Both of these components are held together with a combination of rivets and hand-sewn Kevlar thread ensure long lasting durability and strength that simply can't be matched by our competitors.All holsters come with a Lifetime Warranty, a 30 day money back guarantee, and a free replacement clips for life!Specify barrel length for revolvers and 1911 holsters.All orders will be filled with a right handed holster. If you need a left handed please specify by sending a message via AmazonYou are buying direct from the maker, each holster is hand made and fitted (some wear marks may result) and does not come in retail packaging.", "text": "Springfield XD Sub Compact Hybrid IWB Holster, SHTF Gear ACE-1 SHTF Gear ACE-1This holster is made specifically for the Springfield XD Sub CompactOur line of ACE holsters (Always Combat Effective) provides the perfect combination of comfort and rapid deployment that are a must for every day concealed carry. Our holsters are designed to allow the shooter to get a full shooting grip on the gun while it is holstered, ensuring that the second the gun is out it's ready for action. Our first and most successful product sets a new standard for comfort and concealment. The ACE line of holsters are an IWB (inside the waistband) holster built on premium laser cut leather paired with custom molded Kydex to create the perfect draw and allow for easy reholstering. Both of these components are held together with a combination of rivets and hand-sewn Kevlar thread ensure long lasting durability and strength that simply can't be matched by our competitors.All holsters come with a Lifetime Warranty, a 30 day money back guarantee, and a free replacement clips for life!Specify barrel length for revolvers and 1911 holsters.All orders will be filled with a right handed holster. If you need a left handed please specify by sending a message via AmazonYou are buying direct from the maker, each holster is hand made and fitted (some wear marks may result) and does not come in retail packaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41g7tjx3jqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SBN0GC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B005SH1TEQ", "title": "Super High Quality Green Laser Sight & Pressure Switch", "description": "Tactical Ultra Bright Green Laser Sight is Far Superior to Red Lasers Used during Daylight Operations because the green beam produced is the most sensitive to the human eye allowing true daylight visibility at more than 100 yards in bright daylight. The 532nm wavelength laser and exceptional glass optics produce a beam visible 10,000 yards at night more than 100 yards during true daylight viewing. This Green Laser is 40 times brighter than red laser gun sights and produces a target dot smaller than 1.78\" at 100 yards for precise accuracy. The laser delivers unmatched target acquisition anytime, all the time -day or night! With our new filter technology. We use a 5mw output laser to meet legal limits while providing a green laser that is as bright as a 20mw laser just by cutting out all non-visible laser light. We only use the best components made for this green laser. Constructed by high grade Aluminum Alloy and Waterproofing seals to keep out the elements, this ULTRA Powerful green laser sight is visible in strong sunlight and with its Weaver/PICATINNY Rail Mount and barrel mount it makes it perfect for any Rifle. The laser can be installed on Rifle in seconds with no gunsmith or permanent modification. 1 Allen Wrench allows you to adjust the laser sight to align with your gun scope or sights Charged by 1 x CR123 3V Lithium Battery (Included) Includes high quality pressure switch Packaged with nice box and dense foam. This is one of the brightest legal lasers on the market.", "text": "Super High Quality Green Laser Sight & Pressure Switch Tactical Ultra Bright Green Laser Sight is Far Superior to Red Lasers Used during Daylight Operations because the green beam produced is the most sensitive to the human eye allowing true daylight visibility at more than 100 yards in bright daylight. The 532nm wavelength laser and exceptional glass optics produce a beam visible 10,000 yards at night more than 100 yards during true daylight viewing. This Green Laser is 40 times brighter than red laser gun sights and produces a target dot smaller than 1.78\" at 100 yards for precise accuracy. The laser delivers unmatched target acquisition anytime, all the time -day or night! With our new filter technology. We use a 5mw output laser to meet legal limits while providing a green laser that is as bright as a 20mw laser just by cutting out all non-visible laser light. We only use the best components made for this green laser. Constructed by high grade Aluminum Alloy and Waterproofing seals to keep out the elements, this ULTRA Powerful green laser sight is visible in strong sunlight and with its Weaver/PICATINNY Rail Mount and barrel mount it makes it perfect for any Rifle. The laser can be installed on Rifle in seconds with no gunsmith or permanent modification. 1 Allen Wrench allows you to adjust the laser sight to align with your gun scope or sights Charged by 1 x CR123 3V Lithium Battery (Included) Includes high quality pressure switch Packaged with nice box and dense foam. This is one of the brightest legal lasers on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Qrl3RxacL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SH1TEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Omega", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights"]], "price": 74.99}}
