{"item_id": "B005SO8RQM", "title": "Sawyer Products Squeezable Pouches", "description": "The Sawyer Squeezable Pouch for the Sawyer Point One Water Filter (Campmor Item No. 84704) comes in three sizes for convenience. These are replacement pouches for the ones that come with the filter to start.", "text": "Sawyer Products Squeezable Pouches The Sawyer Squeezable Pouch for the Sawyer Point One Water Filter (Campmor Item No. 84704) comes in three sizes for convenience. These are replacement pouches for the ones that come with the filter to start.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41xSt-T1PFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SO8RQM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005SO8VAE", "title": "Sawyer Personal Water Bottle Filter", "description": "The Sawyer Personal Water Bottle Filter offers the highest level of filtration available, and the quality and assurance you can expect from Sawyer. The Hollow Fiber Membrane filter effectively removes bacteria such as Salmonella, Cholera and E Coli, as well as protozoa such as Giardia and Cryptosporidium, without adding harmful chemicals to the water.Weight 7.5 oz..Size: 11\" x 3\"..", "text": "Sawyer Personal Water Bottle Filter The Sawyer Personal Water Bottle Filter offers the highest level of filtration available, and the quality and assurance you can expect from Sawyer. The Hollow Fiber Membrane filter effectively removes bacteria such as Salmonella, Cholera and E Coli, as well as protozoa such as Giardia and Cryptosporidium, without adding harmful chemicals to the water.Weight 7.5 oz..Size: 11\" x 3\"..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41J4mROLGOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SO8VAE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sawyer Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 34.93}}
{"item_id": "B005SQNAMG", "title": "Speedo Adult Pull Buoy", "description": "This is a great training tool to build strength and endurance during your lap work outs. Our Pull Buoy is one of Speedo's best selling items. Train on and train strong with Speedo, the water experts and most popular swim brand in the world!", "text": "Speedo Adult Pull Buoy This is a great training tool to build strength and endurance during your lap work outs. Our Pull Buoy is one of Speedo's best selling items. Train on and train strong with Speedo, the water experts and most popular swim brand in the world!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416Yjv5lstL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SQNAMG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Speedo", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Aquatic Fitness Equipment"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B005SRBEWS", "title": "M1 Garand Butt Stock Cleaning Kit", "description": "Keep your rifle cleaning tools and chemicals right in the buttstock and never be without them. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance of your gun between competitive matches or other uses. Mil-Spec tools provide a very close substitute to the original military buttstock cleaning kits.Keep your service rifle cleaning tools right in the buttstock and never be without. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance between competitive matches or trips to field: Kit includes: * 4 piece steel cleaning rod * Patch loop tip * .30 cal. bronze bore brush * WWII type dual reservoir oiler * M1 combo tool * Pouch \"", "text": "M1 Garand Butt Stock Cleaning Kit Keep your rifle cleaning tools and chemicals right in the buttstock and never be without them. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance of your gun between competitive matches or other uses. Mil-Spec tools provide a very close substitute to the original military buttstock cleaning kits.Keep your service rifle cleaning tools right in the buttstock and never be without. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance between competitive matches or trips to field: Kit includes: * 4 piece steel cleaning rod * Patch loop tip * .30 cal. bronze bore brush * WWII type dual reservoir oiler * M1 combo tool * Pouch \"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51iNGAAGjKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SRBEWS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MILITARIA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 21.79}}
{"item_id": "B005SRVAS6", "title": "Freshette by Freshette", "description": "395061 Features: Anatomically design contours the female body, making it easy to use in all conditions Small, compact design is lightweight for easy transport Complete with a convenient travel pouch that fits neatly into your pack or pocket, so you can carry it everywhere you go Specifications:", "text": "Freshette by Freshette 395061 Features: Anatomically design contours the female body, making it easy to use in all conditions Small, compact design is lightweight for easy transport Complete with a convenient travel pouch that fits neatly into your pack or pocket, so you can carry it everywhere you go Specifications:", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416IZ%2BXLtvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SRVAS6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Freshette", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Hygiene & Sanitation"]], "price": 19.99}}
