{"item_id": "B005STMIQW", "title": "Chinese Military Genuine Surplus SKS Rifle 7.62x39 Original Butt Stock Buttstock Cleaning Kit", "description": "Official Product of Ultimate Arms Gear Surplus.This is a Original kit. Ready to go into service for you, cleaned of cosmoline and oiled lightly, ready to use from the time you open the package. No greasy mess to deal with. Limited Supply - Genuine Surplus -Some Signs Of Cosmetic Wear But Overall Excellent, Fully Operational And Functional ConditionContains: 1-Rod Handle, 1-7.62x39mm Bore Brush, 1-Takedown Tool, 1- Metal Cleaning Kit Tube.Tube Style Cleaning Kit Fits In Original SKS Rifle Butstocks That Have A \"Trap Door\".2 Piece Storage Tube Also Is Used As Handle For Cleaning Rod.A Must Have Accessory.", "text": "Chinese Military Genuine Surplus SKS Rifle 7.62x39 Original Butt Stock Buttstock Cleaning Kit Official Product of Ultimate Arms Gear Surplus.This is a Original kit. Ready to go into service for you, cleaned of cosmoline and oiled lightly, ready to use from the time you open the package. No greasy mess to deal with. Limited Supply - Genuine Surplus -Some Signs Of Cosmetic Wear But Overall Excellent, Fully Operational And Functional ConditionContains: 1-Rod Handle, 1-7.62x39mm Bore Brush, 1-Takedown Tool, 1- Metal Cleaning Kit Tube.Tube Style Cleaning Kit Fits In Original SKS Rifle Butstocks That Have A \"Trap Door\".2 Piece Storage Tube Also Is Used As Handle For Cleaning Rod.A Must Have Accessory.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41soqTrMl-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005STMIQW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 14.48}}
{"item_id": "B005SUEVHU", "title": "Boost Oxygen Natural Energy in a Can, 22 Ounce", "description": "90% of the body's energy comes from oxygen. Only 10% from food and water. The chemical basis of energy production in the body is a chemical called adenosine triphosphate (atp). If something goes wrong with the production of atp, the result is lowered vitality. Oxygen is the most critical for the production of atp. Oxygen is the most important factor in the body's metabolism. When we eat a poor diet with foods that are high in fat, carbohydrates, sugar, and alcohol, our bodies have to use more oxygen to digest, assimilate, decompose and eventually expel them. A common outward symptom is the food coma, the feeling of mid-afternoon lethargy. The brain is deprived of its normal ration of oxygen, and fatigue sets in. We yawn to get more oxygen to the brain. Boost oxygen contains no caffeine, no sugar or any other unnatural stimulants. It does not provide a superficial jolt to the central nervous system like energy drinks. It give you a healthy energy boost to help return your body and mind to equilibrium. For 22oz cans, remove tamper evident plastic, insert mouth into the mask, press trigger and inhale deeply. Hold oxygen in lungs temporarily before exhaling for best results. Repeat as desired. It is recommended to repeat this procedure 3-5 times to feel the effects of the oxygen.", "text": "Boost Oxygen Natural Energy in a Can, 22 Ounce 90% of the body's energy comes from oxygen. Only 10% from food and water. The chemical basis of energy production in the body is a chemical called adenosine triphosphate (atp). If something goes wrong with the production of atp, the result is lowered vitality. Oxygen is the most critical for the production of atp. Oxygen is the most important factor in the body's metabolism. When we eat a poor diet with foods that are high in fat, carbohydrates, sugar, and alcohol, our bodies have to use more oxygen to digest, assimilate, decompose and eventually expel them. A common outward symptom is the food coma, the feeling of mid-afternoon lethargy. The brain is deprived of its normal ration of oxygen, and fatigue sets in. We yawn to get more oxygen to the brain. Boost oxygen contains no caffeine, no sugar or any other unnatural stimulants. It does not provide a superficial jolt to the central nervous system like energy drinks. It give you a healthy energy boost to help return your body and mind to equilibrium. For 22oz cans, remove tamper evident plastic, insert mouth into the mask, press trigger and inhale deeply. Hold oxygen in lungs temporarily before exhaling for best results. Repeat as desired. It is recommended to repeat this procedure 3-5 times to feel the effects of the oxygen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q-F6hi1oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SUEVHU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Boost", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Medicine", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 6.19}}
{"item_id": "B005SWETD4", "title": "Matrix Iron Face Carbon Steel \"Striker\" Gen2 Metal Mesh Lower Half Mask - Black", "description": "This mask is amazing. Achieve full air ventilation while offering maximum protection for your lower face. Obtain a good goggle and you have a full face protection without loosing your ability to aim! The Gen2 offers ear protection compare to the gen1, a bit bigger, but preferred for CQB situations over the Gen1. Both the Gen1 and Gen2 of the striker mask features \"Maximum comfort!\". Applications: Achieve full face protection with most Full Seal Goggles and other similar size eye goggles. Provides Cheek, ear, nose and mouth lower face protection. Adjustable.", "text": "Matrix Iron Face Carbon Steel \"Striker\" Gen2 Metal Mesh Lower Half Mask - Black This mask is amazing. Achieve full air ventilation while offering maximum protection for your lower face. Obtain a good goggle and you have a full face protection without loosing your ability to aim! The Gen2 offers ear protection compare to the gen1, a bit bigger, but preferred for CQB situations over the Gen1. Both the Gen1 and Gen2 of the striker mask features \"Maximum comfort!\". Applications: Achieve full face protection with most Full Seal Goggles and other similar size eye goggles. Provides Cheek, ear, nose and mouth lower face protection. Adjustable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51LNJfKgftL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005SWETD4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 16.18}}
{"item_id": "B005T0L1EU", "title": "Standard Scopecoat Eotech 512/552 2mm Thick Black Neoprene Laminated Nylon Draws Moisture", "description": "Standard Scopecoat: EoTech 512/552 - 2mm thick - Black - Constructed of the highest quality neoprene laminated with nylon - Draws moisture & condensation away from your scope & helps protect it from the elements - Safeguards against dings & scratches", "text": "Standard Scopecoat Eotech 512/552 2mm Thick Black Neoprene Laminated Nylon Draws Moisture Standard Scopecoat: EoTech 512/552 - 2mm thick - Black - Constructed of the highest quality neoprene laminated with nylon - Draws moisture & condensation away from your scope & helps protect it from the elements - Safeguards against dings & scratches", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412yGqzl88L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T0L1EU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Scopecoat", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 19.98}}
{"item_id": "B005T2W750", "title": "Gear Up Hang-2 Deluxe Kayak Storage Strap, Black", "description": "The Gear Up Hang-2 kayak storage strap system is a simple and easy way to store your kayaks up off the ground and out of the way. The storage straps are adjustable and also include quick-release buckles as well for easy loading and unloading. Use indoors or outdoors. Stainless steel heavy-duty eye bolts are included for you to mount into the ceiling or wall. 150 lb weight capacity.", "text": "Gear Up Hang-2 Deluxe Kayak Storage Strap, Black The Gear Up Hang-2 kayak storage strap system is a simple and easy way to store your kayaks up off the ground and out of the way. The storage straps are adjustable and also include quick-release buckles as well for easy loading and unloading. Use indoors or outdoors. Stainless steel heavy-duty eye bolts are included for you to mount into the ceiling or wall. 150 lb weight capacity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51xDeMWtJtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T2W750.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Indoor Kayak Storage"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B005T3F8NM", "title": "AK-47/SKS Field Cleaning Kit With Pouch OD", "description": "Keep your gun clean anywhere with this SKS Field Cleaning Kit With Pouch! Kit includes cleaning brushes, cleaning cloths, oil bottle, and cleaning rod. Includes OD storage pouch.", "text": "AK-47/SKS Field Cleaning Kit With Pouch OD Keep your gun clean anywhere with this SKS Field Cleaning Kit With Pouch! Kit includes cleaning brushes, cleaning cloths, oil bottle, and cleaning rod. Includes OD storage pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414VgqyUTZL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T3F8NM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MILITARIA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 13.3}}
{"item_id": "B005T3F8YG", "title": "M14 Cleaning Kit With Chamber Brush", "description": "Keep your rifle cleaning tools and chemicals right in the buttstock and never be without them. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance of your gun between competitive matches or other uses. Mil-Spec tools provide a very close substitute to the original military buttstock cleaning kits. This M1 cleaning kit includes a four-piece steel cleaning rod, patch loop tip, a bronze bore brush, M14 combo tool, and O.D. green rod pouch.", "text": "M14 Cleaning Kit With Chamber Brush Keep your rifle cleaning tools and chemicals right in the buttstock and never be without them. Perfect for cleaning and maintenance of your gun between competitive matches or other uses. Mil-Spec tools provide a very close substitute to the original military buttstock cleaning kits. This M1 cleaning kit includes a four-piece steel cleaning rod, patch loop tip, a bronze bore brush, M14 combo tool, and O.D. green rod pouch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ufooC%2BTjL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T3F8YG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MILITARIA", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 19.06}}
{"item_id": "B005T82MZO", "title": "SunGuard UPF 50+ Performance Headband Face Mask Tube Head Neck Gator UV Sun Protection Aqua Design Multifunctional Camo Headwear", "description": "New for 2012. Vibrant water camo SunGuard Tube collection.Aqua Design has re-invented the typical multi-headband-neck-face protector by offering three sizes in a four-way stretch fabric. Our research team discovered that \"one size does not fit all\" when wearing sun protective tubes. There's probably as many head sizes as shoe sizes. The solution is a forgiving, four-way stretch fabric in three tube sizes - M (7 - 7 1/8 hat), L (7 1/4 - 7 3/8 hat) or XL (7 1/2 - 7 3/4 hat).If you do not know your hat size, you can measure your head with a string or flexible tape measure, just above the ears where you would normally wear a hat.M = 21 1/2\" - 22 1/4\"L = 22 3/8\" - 23\"XL = 23 1/8\" - 24\"Save on the cost of sunscreen lotion and protect neck, ears, face and head with UPF 50+ SunGuard Tubes. UPF 50+ blocks harmful UV rays 97% - 99%. Skyward camouflage print and natural colors More size options in M, L, XL Comfortable flat lock seam and soft four-way stretch fabric Breathable microfiber fabric wicks moisture Designed for use in our out of the water Cap and shirt not included.", "text": "SunGuard UPF 50+ Performance Headband Face Mask Tube Head Neck Gator UV Sun Protection Aqua Design Multifunctional Camo Headwear New for 2012. Vibrant water camo SunGuard Tube collection.Aqua Design has re-invented the typical multi-headband-neck-face protector by offering three sizes in a four-way stretch fabric. Our research team discovered that \"one size does not fit all\" when wearing sun protective tubes. There's probably as many head sizes as shoe sizes. The solution is a forgiving, four-way stretch fabric in three tube sizes - M (7 - 7 1/8 hat), L (7 1/4 - 7 3/8 hat) or XL (7 1/2 - 7 3/4 hat).If you do not know your hat size, you can measure your head with a string or flexible tape measure, just above the ears where you would normally wear a hat.M = 21 1/2\" - 22 1/4\"L = 22 3/8\" - 23\"XL = 23 1/8\" - 24\"Save on the cost of sunscreen lotion and protect neck, ears, face and head with UPF 50+ SunGuard Tubes. UPF 50+ blocks harmful UV rays 97% - 99%. Skyward camouflage print and natural colors More size options in M, L, XL Comfortable flat lock seam and soft four-way stretch fabric Breathable microfiber fabric wicks moisture Designed for use in our out of the water Cap and shirt not included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51JVNNHcP8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T82MZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B005T8ARKG", "title": "Sunny Health & Fitness Climbing Stepper", "description": "Lets burn some calories! The Sunny Health & Fitness Climbing Stepper is a low-impact workout that's easy on your knees but hard on your calories. This indoor mountain climbing trainer tones your calves, glutes, thighs, and hips while melting away pounds via a serious cardiovascular workout. The climber itself is made of heavy-duty steel and plastic so it can hang tough with even the most demanding regimen. A convenient display shows the amount of calories burned, a scan mode, timer, and step count to keep you informed about your progress. The Climbing Stepper folds for easy storage. About Sunny Health & Fitness Sunny Health & Fitness has been importing and distributing high-quality health and fitness products for over ten years. From their headquarters in Los Angeles, California, they import equipment from direct sources in Taiwan and China to provide more competitive pricing than the average health and fitness equipment distributor. Because they are committed to excellence and stand behind the quality of every one of their products, Sunny Health & Fitness has become one of the fastest-growing companies in the market. Train for indoor mountain climbing. Heavy-duty steel and plastic construction. 2 adjustable resistance cylinders. Shows calories burned, scan mode, timer, climb count. Folds away for easy storage. Dimensions: 27L x 17W x 54H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included.", "text": "Sunny Health & Fitness Climbing Stepper Lets burn some calories! The Sunny Health & Fitness Climbing Stepper is a low-impact workout that's easy on your knees but hard on your calories. This indoor mountain climbing trainer tones your calves, glutes, thighs, and hips while melting away pounds via a serious cardiovascular workout. The climber itself is made of heavy-duty steel and plastic so it can hang tough with even the most demanding regimen. A convenient display shows the amount of calories burned, a scan mode, timer, and step count to keep you informed about your progress. The Climbing Stepper folds for easy storage. About Sunny Health & Fitness Sunny Health & Fitness has been importing and distributing high-quality health and fitness products for over ten years. From their headquarters in Los Angeles, California, they import equipment from direct sources in Taiwan and China to provide more competitive pricing than the average health and fitness equipment distributor. Because they are committed to excellence and stand behind the quality of every one of their products, Sunny Health & Fitness has become one of the fastest-growing companies in the market. Train for indoor mountain climbing. Heavy-duty steel and plastic construction. 2 adjustable resistance cylinders. Shows calories burned, scan mode, timer, climb count. Folds away for easy storage. Dimensions: 27L x 17W x 54H inches. Manufacturer's warranty included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41G07NUll3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005T8ARKG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sunny Health &amp; Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Cardio Training", "Step Machines"]], "price": 121.44}}
{"item_id": "B005TEXO7I", "title": "Innova Champion Material Disc Golf, Set of 3 (Colors may vary)", "description": "For the player that gets hooked quickly and wants the best stuff, we have developed the Champion Material Disc Golf Set.", "text": "Innova Champion Material Disc Golf, Set of 3 (Colors may vary) For the player that gets hooked quickly and wants the best stuff, we have developed the Champion Material Disc Golf Set.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51adnVI5siL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005TEXO7I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Innova - Champion Discs", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Discs", "Putters"]], "price": 36.95}}
{"item_id": "B005THTIES", "title": "Callaway Tri-Ball Hitting Net", "description": "Step by stepset up manual.Our Callaway Tri-Ball Hitting Nets are available in 3 sizes and are made with the strongest netting in golf. It's unique shape supports practice for all clubs in your bag - from driver through wedge. Easy to set up and take down. Perfect for indoor or outdoor use. Includes nylon carry bag for easy transport and storage.Note: Product has been improved and the metal grommet referenced in the video has been replaced by a nylon 'sleeve' to improve the integrity of the material.", "text": "Callaway Tri-Ball Hitting Net Step by stepset up manual.Our Callaway Tri-Ball Hitting Nets are available in 3 sizes and are made with the strongest netting in golf. It's unique shape supports practice for all clubs in your bag - from driver through wedge. Easy to set up and take down. Perfect for indoor or outdoor use. Includes nylon carry bag for easy transport and storage.Note: Product has been improved and the metal grommet referenced in the video has been replaced by a nylon 'sleeve' to improve the integrity of the material.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51BVuH8rYiL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005THTIES.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Hitting Nets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005TPTCW8", "title": "Coleman Outdoor Clear Lantern Globe214,285,28 R214D046C", "description": "Coleman Outdoor Clear Lantern Globe214,285,28 R214D046C", "text": "Coleman Outdoor Clear Lantern Globe214,285,28 R214D046C Coleman Outdoor Clear Lantern Globe214,285,28 R214D046C", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y1YKxeusL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005TPTCW8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Lights & Lanterns", "Lantern Accessories"]], "price": 13.35}}
{"item_id": "B005TYMLF4", "title": "Fade Lite Disc Golf Bag", "description": "The FADE Lite is a GREAT starter bag. If you're on a light budget or if you just know someone who wants to play occasionally, this is the bag. We call it FADE Lite because is weighs just 11 ounces but is built tough. It is also low on calories. The FADE Lite has the basic set of features; 2-putter pocket, beverage pocket, pencil and scorecard pockets. One big feature is a comfortable shoulder strap. You can load this bag up with as much weight as other everyday bags so it might as well be comfortable. The main compartment is divided into two sections and will hold 10-12 discs, PLUS . . . you can store two putters in this puppy. The FADE Lite is made from durable 600-D Polyester canvas. We double-stitch the seams and cover them with tape to prevent unraveling. Stress points are reinforced. All Fade Gear bags include a 1 Year, no fault warranty.", "text": "Fade Lite Disc Golf Bag The FADE Lite is a GREAT starter bag. If you're on a light budget or if you just know someone who wants to play occasionally, this is the bag. We call it FADE Lite because is weighs just 11 ounces but is built tough. It is also low on calories. The FADE Lite has the basic set of features; 2-putter pocket, beverage pocket, pencil and scorecard pockets. One big feature is a comfortable shoulder strap. You can load this bag up with as much weight as other everyday bags so it might as well be comfortable. The main compartment is divided into two sections and will hold 10-12 discs, PLUS . . . you can store two putters in this puppy. The FADE Lite is made from durable 600-D Polyester canvas. We double-stitch the seams and cover them with tape to prevent unraveling. Stress points are reinforced. All Fade Gear bags include a 1 Year, no fault warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mzcv-6rRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005TYMLF4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fade Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Bags & Accessories"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B005U3BGD2", "title": "United Cutlery GH5026 Gil Hibben Extreme Survival Bowie with Sheath", "description": "With styling reminiscent of early Hibben bowies, this Hibben Survivor Bowie knife is the ultimate jungle warrior. This massive knife offers a 10-Inch razor-sharp stainless steel blade with powerful sawback teeth. The micarta handle offers a solid, ergonomic grip as the polished hand guard protects your hand from slipping to the blade. Lashing holes are pre-drilled in the guard and pommel to allow for spear making by lashing the knife to a long, wooden handle. Includes a custom leather belt sheath with the Hibben Custom Design logo stamped right into the leather and a certificate of authenticity.", "text": "United Cutlery GH5026 Gil Hibben Extreme Survival Bowie with Sheath With styling reminiscent of early Hibben bowies, this Hibben Survivor Bowie knife is the ultimate jungle warrior. This massive knife offers a 10-Inch razor-sharp stainless steel blade with powerful sawback teeth. The micarta handle offers a solid, ergonomic grip as the polished hand guard protects your hand from slipping to the blade. Lashing holes are pre-drilled in the guard and pommel to allow for spear making by lashing the knife to a long, wooden handle. Includes a custom leather belt sheath with the Hibben Custom Design logo stamped right into the leather and a certificate of authenticity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21a7%2Bpv%2Bi4L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005U3BGD2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Knives"]], "price": 76.58}}
{"item_id": "B005U4A9KW", "title": "Silver Cup Shaker Bottle Premium Talc Powder, 13-Ounce", "description": "Silver Cup Chalk is acclaimed by both professional and amateur players alike and is the exclusive chalk used in many of the most prestigious and lucrative tournaments televised around the world. Silver Cup Chalk, Inc. was founded in 1990 with the goal of producing a professional grade billiard chalk unsurpassed by any others. Silver Cup and National Tournament Chalk are made from the finest quality sand mined only in the United States. Just the right amount of moisture and additives produce the highest quality billiard chalk to be found and made only in our plant in Macon, GA USA.", "text": "Silver Cup Shaker Bottle Premium Talc Powder, 13-Ounce Silver Cup Chalk is acclaimed by both professional and amateur players alike and is the exclusive chalk used in many of the most prestigious and lucrative tournaments televised around the world. Silver Cup Chalk, Inc. was founded in 1990 with the goal of producing a professional grade billiard chalk unsurpassed by any others. Silver Cup and National Tournament Chalk are made from the finest quality sand mined only in the United States. Just the right amount of moisture and additives produce the highest quality billiard chalk to be found and made only in our plant in Macon, GA USA.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AYK3nN4PL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005U4A9KW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Silver Cup", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Billiards & Pool", "Cue Chalk"]], "price": 11.94}}
{"item_id": "B005U5J1GY", "title": "Coleman Quickbed with Pump Combo", "description": "The Coleman Quickbed and Pump Combo combines comfort, reliability and versatility in one great airbed. This twin-sized airbed measures 74\" x 39\" x 5\" high when inflated, and fits standard-sized sheets. The Quickbed is constructed of high-grade, puncture-resistant PVC, with a Comfort Coil system inside for great support, and a soft plush top for luxurious comfort. The conveniently included pump operates on 4D batteries (sold separately); it inflates and deflates the bed quickly, thanks to Coleman's Double-Lock valve. Like all Coleman inflatable products, this Quickbed features Coleman's Airtight System, so your bed stays inflated while you sleep. The attached Coleman Wrap 'N' Roll System makes packing, storing and transporting a breeze.", "text": "Coleman Quickbed with Pump Combo The Coleman Quickbed and Pump Combo combines comfort, reliability and versatility in one great airbed. This twin-sized airbed measures 74\" x 39\" x 5\" high when inflated, and fits standard-sized sheets. The Quickbed is constructed of high-grade, puncture-resistant PVC, with a Comfort Coil system inside for great support, and a soft plush top for luxurious comfort. The conveniently included pump operates on 4D batteries (sold separately); it inflates and deflates the bed quickly, thanks to Coleman's Double-Lock valve. Like all Coleman inflatable products, this Quickbed features Coleman's Airtight System, so your bed stays inflated while you sleep. The attached Coleman Wrap 'N' Roll System makes packing, storing and transporting a breeze.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AQMM0qtcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005U5J1GY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005U5ZUE6", "title": "Adamo Saddle ISM Ergo Prologue Bicycle Saddle", "description": "It may look funny, but the ISM Adamo Prologue saddle is all about performance. The unique design alleviates pressure on the perineal artery, so you can ride faster, stronger and harder without any of the numbness or pain that can be caused by traditional saddles. The saddle has been made longer and narrower to accommodate improved movement while pedaling. This saddle is ideal for riders who are all over the saddle while riding, shifting back and forth between multiple positions. It's ideal for triathletes and long distance cycling. The patented ISM design that eliminates the \"nose\" part of the traditional saddle Longer cutout on the front arms provide better circulation Measures 270mm long and 135mm wide for a more anatomical fit Integrated tri-hook under the rear of the saddle allows for quick placement and removal of bike in transition area 100mm of fore-aft rail adjustment Chromoly rails are durable and stiff.", "text": "Adamo Saddle ISM Ergo Prologue Bicycle Saddle It may look funny, but the ISM Adamo Prologue saddle is all about performance. The unique design alleviates pressure on the perineal artery, so you can ride faster, stronger and harder without any of the numbness or pain that can be caused by traditional saddles. The saddle has been made longer and narrower to accommodate improved movement while pedaling. This saddle is ideal for riders who are all over the saddle while riding, shifting back and forth between multiple positions. It's ideal for triathletes and long distance cycling. The patented ISM design that eliminates the \"nose\" part of the traditional saddle Longer cutout on the front arms provide better circulation Measures 270mm long and 135mm wide for a more anatomical fit Integrated tri-hook under the rear of the saddle allows for quick placement and removal of bike in transition area 100mm of fore-aft rail adjustment Chromoly rails are durable and stiff.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41skwCwGDVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005U5ZUE6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ISM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 165.01}}
{"item_id": "B005UAFH3A", "title": "XMark Fitness XMat Ultra Thick Gym Flooring", "description": "\"XMark X-Mat Ultra Thick Flooring ModelThe XMark X-Mat is a necessity for any home gym. This heavy-duty rugged mat is half an inch thick, has a non-slip textured surface and will protect your floor as well as your equipment.Specifications for XM-1998 1/2 inch Ultra Thick Mat:- Width - 4 ft.- Length - 6 ft.- Thickness - .5 in.- Weight - 75 lbs.- Textured non-slip surface- Available in black- Box Dimensions - 49\" x 12\" x 12\"Specifications for XM-1992 3/8 inch Ultra Thick Mat:- Width - 4 ft.- Length - 6 ft.- Thickness - 3/8 in.- Weight - 58 lbs.- Textured non-slip surface- Available in black- Box Dimensions - 49\" x 12\" x 12\"", "text": "XMark Fitness XMat Ultra Thick Gym Flooring \"XMark X-Mat Ultra Thick Flooring ModelThe XMark X-Mat is a necessity for any home gym. This heavy-duty rugged mat is half an inch thick, has a non-slip textured surface and will protect your floor as well as your equipment.Specifications for XM-1998 1/2 inch Ultra Thick Mat:- Width - 4 ft.- Length - 6 ft.- Thickness - .5 in.- Weight - 75 lbs.- Textured non-slip surface- Available in black- Box Dimensions - 49\" x 12\" x 12\"Specifications for XM-1992 3/8 inch Ultra Thick Mat:- Width - 4 ft.- Length - 6 ft.- Thickness - 3/8 in.- Weight - 58 lbs.- Textured non-slip surface- Available in black- Box Dimensions - 49\" x 12\" x 12\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41S5SMJ31JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UAFH3A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Protective Flooring"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD5X8Q", "title": "Ultega Upper Body Workout Bar", "description": "The Ultega Upper Body Workout Bar provides a versatile platform for working your entire upper body from your abdomen to your arms, back, and shoulders. Used on the floor, the Workout Bar provides a perfect base for push-ups and dips. The Workout Bar can be braced in a doorway to provide a foot hold for a variety of sit-ups and crunches. Finally, the Workout Bar mounts easily into any standard doorway of 24 to 32 inches wide--without tools--providing a platform for pull-ups, chin-ups, and any other bar based exercises. Built for versatility in any application, the Workout Bar provides multiple padded grips for its entire range of exercises.", "text": "Ultega Upper Body Workout Bar The Ultega Upper Body Workout Bar provides a versatile platform for working your entire upper body from your abdomen to your arms, back, and shoulders. Used on the floor, the Workout Bar provides a perfect base for push-ups and dips. The Workout Bar can be braced in a doorway to provide a foot hold for a variety of sit-ups and crunches. Finally, the Workout Bar mounts easily into any standard doorway of 24 to 32 inches wide--without tools--providing a platform for pull-ups, chin-ups, and any other bar based exercises. Built for versatility in any application, the Workout Bar provides multiple padded grips for its entire range of exercises.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Ako9Pi3hL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD5X8Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Pull-Up Bars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD64AM", "title": "Ultega 2-in-1 Ski Boot Bag with Carrying Handle and Backpack", "description": "With the Ultega 2-in-1 ski boot bag with carrying handle and backpack you have everything under control. The 2-in-1 function makes this bag convenient and useful in any environment. The main pocket is ideal for ski or snowboard boots with its wide opening and zipper. The bag can also be used as a multi-functional backpack by fastening the attached shoulder straps. The straps are adjustable and can be taken off completely. Two side pockets provide additional space for all kinds of utensils as such as glasses, gloves and other things. The bag has dimensions of 15 x 12 x 15.5 inches and can be easily transported by using the handle. High-quality materials provide the necessary robustness and longevity.", "text": "Ultega 2-in-1 Ski Boot Bag with Carrying Handle and Backpack With the Ultega 2-in-1 ski boot bag with carrying handle and backpack you have everything under control. The 2-in-1 function makes this bag convenient and useful in any environment. The main pocket is ideal for ski or snowboard boots with its wide opening and zipper. The bag can also be used as a multi-functional backpack by fastening the attached shoulder straps. The straps are adjustable and can be taken off completely. Two side pockets provide additional space for all kinds of utensils as such as glasses, gloves and other things. The bag has dimensions of 15 x 12 x 15.5 inches and can be easily transported by using the handle. High-quality materials provide the necessary robustness and longevity.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NrLKrdcQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD64AM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Boot Bags"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD79Q0", "title": "Ultega Wireless All-Round Bike Computer", "description": "The Ultega Wireless All-Round Bike Computer provides multi-function usability without reliance on complicated wires. Unlike typical, wire-based bicycle computers, the All-Round Bike Computer uses a wireless transmitter to report speed and distance information to the handle-bar mounted computer. This makes it easy to view multiple speed and distance measurements while you are riding. In addition to speed and distance, the All-Round Computer offers a user-selectable 12/24 hour clock and a temperature thermometer. The user interface is effortless thanks to auto on/off and scan mode that allows you to cycle through the readout information without pressing buttons. Designed for flexibility, the All-Round Computer is water-resistant enabling it to be used in light rain showers. Readouts are available using both the metric and imperial systems.Functions and Features:Auto on/offScan ModeSpeed:AverageRelativeMaximumDistanceIndividualTotalRiding time24/12 hour clockTemperature thermometerODOMetric systemImperial systemWheel circumferenceWater-resistant--can be used in light rain showers.What's in the Box?Bicycle computer, Transmitter, Magnet, Bracket, Bracket seat, Square rubber slip, Rectangle rubber slip, Nylon cords, manual", "text": "Ultega Wireless All-Round Bike Computer The Ultega Wireless All-Round Bike Computer provides multi-function usability without reliance on complicated wires. Unlike typical, wire-based bicycle computers, the All-Round Bike Computer uses a wireless transmitter to report speed and distance information to the handle-bar mounted computer. This makes it easy to view multiple speed and distance measurements while you are riding. In addition to speed and distance, the All-Round Computer offers a user-selectable 12/24 hour clock and a temperature thermometer. The user interface is effortless thanks to auto on/off and scan mode that allows you to cycle through the readout information without pressing buttons. Designed for flexibility, the All-Round Computer is water-resistant enabling it to be used in light rain showers. Readouts are available using both the metric and imperial systems.Functions and Features:Auto on/offScan ModeSpeed:AverageRelativeMaximumDistanceIndividualTotalRiding time24/12 hour clockTemperature thermometerODOMetric systemImperial systemWheel circumferenceWater-resistant--can be used in light rain showers.What's in the Box?Bicycle computer, Transmitter, Magnet, Bracket, Bracket seat, Square rubber slip, Rectangle rubber slip, Nylon cords, manual", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ddIWCt-yL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD79Q0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Electronics & Gadgets", "Cycling Computers"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD79XS", "title": "Ultega 3-Piece Folding Shovel with Travel Pouch", "description": "Durable, portable, 3-piece folding shovel with travel pouch included. Extends to 23 and ½ inches.", "text": "Ultega 3-Piece Folding Shovel with Travel Pouch Durable, portable, 3-piece folding shovel with travel pouch included. Extends to 23 and ½ inches.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31PzAmE8fHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD79XS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Shovels"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD7A8W", "title": "Ultega Steel Floor Pump", "description": "The pump is equipped with a special universal pump head system. Use one side to easily inflate Dunlop (DV) and Presta/Sclaverand (SV) valves. If the Schrader/auto (AV) valve is required, it can be attached within seconds. To secure the pump, simply place both feet on the ground plate. This provides the floor pump with the necessary stability required for easy and efficient inflation. A concise pressure gauge allows easy and precise reading of the values during use. The analog gauge can display a maximum pressure of up to 11 bar / 160 PSI. The red indicator on the bezel of the pressure gauge can be used to indicate a maximum value. For inflating balls, for example, the floor pump is equipped with a ball pin. The set furthermore includes an adapter that can be used for inflating air mattresses or other toys. Valve types compatible with pump: Dunlop (DV) Valve types compatible with pump: Presta/Sclaverand Ventil (SV) Valve types compatible with pump: auto valve (AV)", "text": "Ultega Steel Floor Pump The pump is equipped with a special universal pump head system. Use one side to easily inflate Dunlop (DV) and Presta/Sclaverand (SV) valves. If the Schrader/auto (AV) valve is required, it can be attached within seconds. To secure the pump, simply place both feet on the ground plate. This provides the floor pump with the necessary stability required for easy and efficient inflation. A concise pressure gauge allows easy and precise reading of the values during use. The analog gauge can display a maximum pressure of up to 11 bar / 160 PSI. The red indicator on the bezel of the pressure gauge can be used to indicate a maximum value. For inflating balls, for example, the floor pump is equipped with a ball pin. The set furthermore includes an adapter that can be used for inflating air mattresses or other toys. Valve types compatible with pump: Dunlop (DV) Valve types compatible with pump: Presta/Sclaverand Ventil (SV) Valve types compatible with pump: auto valve (AV)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31dwogjYojL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD7A8W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UD7C7G", "title": "Ultega 5-LED Rear Bicycle Light", "description": "5-LED rear bicycle light with wide viewing angle. Useful at night to make oneself visible to cars and pedestrians. Comes with an optional belt attachment bracket and also with bike installation kit.", "text": "Ultega 5-LED Rear Bicycle Light 5-LED rear bicycle light with wide viewing angle. Useful at night to make oneself visible to cars and pedestrians. Comes with an optional belt attachment bracket and also with bike installation kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PHcdWPV7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UD7C7G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Lighting Parts & Accessories"]], "price": 11.66}}
{"item_id": "B005UDAD5Y", "title": "Ultega Jumper Trampoline with Safety Net", "description": "The trampoline features 4 galvanized steel legs. This greatly reduces the risk of it tipping over and ensures that it stands securely. The rods of the net frame are padded across their entire length to ensure even greater safety. High-quality net surrounds the entire trampoline enabling you to use the entire 10-Feet mat. Durable, fine outer net prevents things getting trapped or caught.Quality UV-resistant mat gives the trampoline an extremely long life.General information on trampolines: In addition to being a fun activity for children and adults, trampolines are also good for your health. Using a mini trampoline provides an efficient cardiovascular workout similar to jogging for an extended period of time which in turn increases lung capacities and red blood cell counts and lowers blood pressure.", "text": "Ultega Jumper Trampoline with Safety Net The trampoline features 4 galvanized steel legs. This greatly reduces the risk of it tipping over and ensures that it stands securely. The rods of the net frame are padded across their entire length to ensure even greater safety. High-quality net surrounds the entire trampoline enabling you to use the entire 10-Feet mat. Durable, fine outer net prevents things getting trapped or caught.Quality UV-resistant mat gives the trampoline an extremely long life.General information on trampolines: In addition to being a fun activity for children and adults, trampolines are also good for your health. Using a mini trampoline provides an efficient cardiovascular workout similar to jogging for an extended period of time which in turn increases lung capacities and red blood cell counts and lowers blood pressure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5129NlXBgUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UDAD5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultega", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Trampolines & Accessories", "Trampolines"]], "price": 266.75}}
{"item_id": "B005UDM848", "title": "NXe 2-pod Harness-SP Series (Black)", "description": "Our SP Series Harnesses are a great choice for casual players and field owners. The 2-pod harnesses feature an adjustable belt system for optimal performance and comfort.", "text": "NXe 2-pod Harness-SP Series (Black) Our SP Series Harnesses are a great choice for casual players and field owners. The 2-pod harnesses feature an adjustable belt system for optimal performance and comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pgZwnIQ1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UDM848.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tippmann", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Paintball", "Harnesses"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B005UE6BNG", "title": "Kershaw 1970 Burst Folding SpeedSafe Knife", "description": "The aggressive, spiked look of the Kershaw Burst (#1970) is sure to draw the eye and plenty of positive comment. You’ll appreciate its SpeedSafe® assisted opening, which is easily accessed with a convenient flipper. Oh yes; and do notice that flipper. We’ve directed the blade grind all the way down the flipper for a sweeping line. The handle is injection-molded, glass-filled nylon; a stout locking liner secures the blade during use. The Burst also includes a reversible pocketclip. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1970 Burst Folding SpeedSafe Knife The aggressive, spiked look of the Kershaw Burst (#1970) is sure to draw the eye and plenty of positive comment. You’ll appreciate its SpeedSafe® assisted opening, which is easily accessed with a convenient flipper. Oh yes; and do notice that flipper. We’ve directed the blade grind all the way down the flipper for a sweeping line. The handle is injection-molded, glass-filled nylon; a stout locking liner secures the blade during use. The Burst also includes a reversible pocketclip. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-leCrWw0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UE6BNG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 17.0}}
{"item_id": "B005UE6CHG", "title": "Kershaw Serrated Burst Speedsafe Knife", "description": "The aggressive, spiked look of the Serrated Kershaw Burst (#1970ST) is sure to draw the eye and plenty of positive comment. You’ll appreciate its SpeedSafe® assisted opening, which is easily accessed with a convenient flipper. Oh yes; and do notice that flipper. We’ve directed the blade grind all the way down the flipper for a sweeping line. The handle is injection-molded, glass-filled nylon; a stout locking liner secures the blade during use. The Burst also includes a reversible pocketclip. A partially serrated blade provides additional cutting power for tough jobs. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw Serrated Burst Speedsafe Knife The aggressive, spiked look of the Serrated Kershaw Burst