{"item_id": "B005UGIMNQ", "title": "UTG 3-9x32 Compact CQB Bug Buster AO RGB Scope with Med. Picatinny Rings, 2\" Sunshade", "description": "DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3-9X32 Compact CQB Bug Buster AO RGB ScopeUTG 3-9X32 1\" BugBuster Scope, AO, RGB Mil-dot, QD RingsSCP-M392AOLWQThe UTG 3-9x32 Bug Buster scope is completely sealed and 100% nitrogen filled. It is shock, fog, and rain proof for maximum reliability when mounted on your firearm or airgun application. Dual red and green illumination and an accommodating eye relief makes this scope a no brainer for all shooters who find themselves in the most diverse of environments and weather conditions. Standard for the SCP-M392AOLWQ is the included 2” sunshade, quality flip-open lens caps, and quick detachable rings. This 3-9X32 Bug Buster is ready to meet your shooting needs right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevation adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Premium Lockable and Resettable TurretsWell-designed and constructed target turrets allow for crisp, consistent and precise windage and elevation adjustments. Its locking and re-setting features protect and complement one of the most critical parts in the optic for proper zeroing.Parallax Free View from 3 Yards to InfinityUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series achieves an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from as close in as 3 yards out to infinity using its adjustable wide angle front objective.RGB Side Wheel IlluminationLeapers/UTG pioneered red AND green reticle illumination in this industry in 2004, allowing for even more effective scope use under diverse environments and lighting conditions. The innovative side wheel control was then introduced for the RGB illumination, getting away from the traditional bulky rheostat on the eye piece and giving users quick and easy access for reticle light.Range Estimating Mil-dot ReticleLeapers/UTG started introducing mil-dot reticle optics from as early as 2003, pioneering the Range Estimating concept as a useful tool for hunters and shooters around the world. Today, the mil-dot reticle is widely accepted and used in this industry. Leveraging our years of experience in this area, UTG developed and refined the unique Tactical Range Estimating(TRE) mil-dot reticle and offers this feature in almost all of our optics. With some patient learning and practice using our TRE, shooters can enhance accuracy and performance in ways not imagined before. Regular mil-dot reticles found on the market usually have 4 dots in each direction of the cross hair, giving you 9 different aiming points for either windage or elevation. If you count the 2 inner tips of the opposite duplex cross hairs, you get 11 aiming points. In contrast, Leapers/UTG 36 Mil-Dot Tactical Range Estimating Reticle (TRE) has 9 dots on each direction of the cross hair, giving you 19 aiming points or 21 including the inner tips of the duplex cross hairs.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories. In addition to the flip-open lens caps, a 2” sunshade and a pair of medium profile Max Strength heavy duty rings are included. The rings, with a saddle height of 15mm, fit on Picatinny/Weaver rails and are secured with patented, fully adjustable quick detach lever locks.", "text": "UTG 3-9x32 Compact CQB Bug Buster AO RGB Scope with Med. Picatinny Rings, 2\" Sunshade DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3-9X32 Compact CQB Bug Buster AO RGB ScopeUTG 3-9X32 1\" BugBuster Scope, AO, RGB Mil-dot, QD RingsSCP-M392AOLWQThe UTG 3-9x32 Bug Buster scope is completely sealed and 100% nitrogen filled. It is shock, fog, and rain proof for maximum reliability when mounted on your firearm or airgun application. Dual red and green illumination and an accommodating eye relief makes this scope a no brainer for all shooters who find themselves in the most diverse of environments and weather conditions. Standard for the SCP-M392AOLWQ is the included 2” sunshade, quality flip-open lens caps, and quick detachable rings. This 3-9X32 Bug Buster is ready to meet your shooting needs right out of the box.True Strength PlatformThe innovative True Strength(TS) Platform is a signature scope construction platform. Most significantly, it includes a Smart Spherical Structure(SSS) controlling the joint-like interaction between a scope’s inner and outer tubes. The design provides long lasting reliability in these interactions to guarantee precise and responsive windage/elevation adjustment over time. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Most Demanding TestsWe perform our testing based on actual users' input. We gather usage intelligence from all deployment aspects, carefully analyze their impacts and develop appropriate test parameters to ensure optimal performance under all conditions. TS has been at the heart of every genuine Leapers scope for more than a decade and has been fully tested on scope-killer airguns and elephant rifles with extreme recoil.Premium Lockable and Resettable TurretsWell-designed and constructed target turrets allow for crisp, consistent and precise windage and elevation adjustments. Its locking and re-setting features protect and complement one of the most critical parts in the optic for proper zeroing.Parallax Free View from 3 Yards to InfinityUncommon throughout the market, this particular scope series achieves an impressive and unparalleled parallax free view from as close in as 3 yards out to infinity using its adjustable wide angle front objective.RGB Side Wheel IlluminationLeapers/UTG pioneered red AND green reticle illumination in this industry in 2004, allowing for even more effective scope use under diverse environments and lighting conditions. The innovative side wheel control was then introduced for the RGB illumination, getting away from the traditional bulky rheostat on the eye piece and giving users quick and easy access for reticle light.Range Estimating Mil-dot ReticleLeapers/UTG started introducing mil-dot reticle optics from as early as 2003, pioneering the Range Estimating concept as a useful tool for hunters and shooters around the world. Today, the mil-dot reticle is widely accepted and used in this industry. Leveraging our years of experience in this area, UTG developed and refined the unique Tactical Range Estimating(TRE) mil-dot reticle and offers this feature in almost all of our optics. With some patient learning and practice using our TRE, shooters can enhance accuracy and performance in ways not imagined before. Regular mil-dot reticles found on the market usually have 4 dots in each direction of the cross hair, giving you 9 different aiming points for either windage or elevation. If you count the 2 inner tips of the opposite duplex cross hairs, you get 11 aiming points. In contrast, Leapers/UTG 36 Mil-Dot Tactical Range Estimating Reticle (TRE) has 9 dots on each direction of the cross hair, giving you 19 aiming points or 21 including the inner tips of the duplex cross hairs.AccessoriesUTG aims to provide application and solution oriented products, including useful and most commonly sough-after accessories. In addition to the flip-open lens caps, a 2” sunshade and a pair of medium profile Max Strength heavy duty rings are included. The rings, with a saddle height of 15mm, fit on Picatinny/Weaver rails and are secured with patented, fully adjustable quick detach lever locks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415TUy7w-kL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UGIMNQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 89.85}}
{"item_id": "B005UGINUS", "title": "UTG 3X Magnifier with Innovative Flip-to-side Quick Detach Picatinny Mount", "description": "DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3X Magnifier with Flip-to-side QD Picatinny MountUTG 3X Magnifier with Flip-to-side QD Picatinny MountSCP-MF3WQSSimilar to the American sport of baseball, shooters and sports enthusiasts alike try their best to cover all bases, specifically when choosing what type of magnification they desire out of their dedicated optic. Ideally, having both an optic that can take care of close up distances and one for further out distances would be great. All bases covered. However, two optics would be cumbersome on one rifle! Or would it? Enter the Leapers UTG 3X Flip-To-Side Magnifier, a supplemental optic to a 1X red dot.What Makes Our Magnifier Unique?The sturdy construction with consistent and positive tension control means that you will never need to worry about loss of ideal optical positioning. The extremely wide field of view is another technological breakthrough, beating other comparable models on the market. The height is carefully designed to allow for easy achievement of co-witnessing with popular dot sights. Obviously, our standard UTG optics characteristics are also present, precision machining, excellent finish against wear, superb lens coating and light transmission – just to name a few. Smart consumers, make your quick transitions and cover all bases with the Leapers UTG SCP-MF3WQS 3X magnifier.Quick Transition Flip-To-Side MechanismThe patented flip-to-side mechanism positions the magnifier up and ready or stowed and off to the side bridging the gap between shorter and longer ranges at the flip of the wrist.Broadband Multi-Coated LensUTG Signature high-tech Emerald lens coating provides crystal clear 3X image clarity.Wide Field of View30% larger FOV in comparison to other similar models currently in the market provides faster target acquisition and situational awareness.", "text": "UTG 3X Magnifier with Innovative Flip-to-side Quick Detach Picatinny Mount DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\".item_title { font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 2; padding: 1px; border: 1px solid #D4D0C8; background-color: #1754a5; } .item_image { text-align: center; } .item_desc { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal; color: #000; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; } .item_number { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #000; line-height: 18px; } .item_topbar { text-align: center; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #FFF; text-transform: none; line-height: normal; }UTG 3X Magnifier with Flip-to-side QD Picatinny MountUTG 3X Magnifier with Flip-to-side QD Picatinny MountSCP-MF3WQSSimilar to the American sport of baseball, shooters and sports enthusiasts alike try their best to cover all bases, specifically when choosing what type of magnification they desire out of their dedicated optic. Ideally, having both an optic that can take care of close up distances and one for further out distances would be great. All bases covered. However, two optics would be cumbersome on one rifle! Or would it? Enter the Leapers UTG 3X Flip-To-Side Magnifier, a supplemental optic to a 1X red dot.What Makes Our Magnifier Unique?The sturdy construction with consistent and positive tension control means that you will never need to worry about loss of ideal optical positioning. The extremely wide field of view is another technological breakthrough, beating other comparable models on the market. The height is carefully designed to allow for easy achievement of co-witnessing with popular dot sights. Obviously, our standard UTG optics characteristics are also present, precision machining, excellent finish against wear, superb lens coating and light transmission – just to name a few. Smart consumers, make your quick transitions and cover all bases with the Leapers UTG SCP-MF3WQS 3X magnifier.Quick Transition Flip-To-Side MechanismThe patented flip-to-side mechanism positions the magnifier up and ready or stowed and off to the side bridging the gap between shorter and longer ranges at the flip of the wrist.Broadband Multi-Coated LensUTG Signature high-tech Emerald lens coating provides crystal clear 3X image clarity.Wide Field of View30% larger FOV in comparison to other similar models currently in the market provides faster target acquisition and situational awareness.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41wIOw%2Bg5YL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UGINUS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 79.49}}
{"item_id": "B005UGIPUQ", "title": "UTG New Gen 4-Inch Red/Green Dot Sight with Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck - (SCP-RD40RGW-A)", "description": "UTG New Gen 4” Tactical Red/Green Dot Sight, 38mm Tube, 4MOA Target Dot, Complete with Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck with Double Locking Nuts and Flip-open Lens Caps. Leapers/UTG’s dot sight is designed to offer a crisp dot for professional precision shooting. By design, a reflex sight will more or less have coma effect due to the spray rays and minor ghost image caused by reflection. In general, due to the contrast, the brighter the target background, the crisper the dot appears and the least amount of ghost image will show. In addition, lowering the illuminiation intensity setting will lessen any ghost or spray imaging.", "text": "UTG New Gen 4-Inch Red/Green Dot Sight with Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck - (SCP-RD40RGW-A) UTG New Gen 4” Tactical Red/Green Dot Sight, 38mm Tube, 4MOA Target Dot, Complete with Integral Picatinny Mounting Deck with Double Locking Nuts and Flip-open Lens Caps. Leapers/UTG’s dot sight is designed to offer a crisp dot for professional precision shooting. By design, a reflex sight will more or less have coma effect due to the spray rays and minor ghost image caused by reflection. In general, due to the contrast, the brighter the target background, the crisper the dot appears and the least amount of ghost image will show. In addition, lowering the illuminiation intensity setting will lessen any ghost or spray imaging.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41lwQpLA92L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UGIPUQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Iron Sights"]], "price": 34.97}}
{"item_id": "B005UGIR36", "title": "UTG 4x32 TS Full Size Mil-dot Scope with Airgun/.22 Rings, Pre-adj @ 35 Yds", "description": "UTG New Gen 4X32 TS Full Size with Mil-Dot Reticle, Sapphire Coating, Angled Integral Sunshade, Flip-open Lens Cover, and Low Profile .22/Airgun Rings. Parallax Adjusted @ 35 Yards", "text": "UTG 4x32 TS Full Size Mil-dot Scope with Airgun/.22 Rings, Pre-adj @ 35 Yds UTG New Gen 4X32 TS Full Size with Mil-Dot Reticle, Sapphire Coating, Angled Integral Sunshade, Flip-open Lens Cover, and Low Profile .22/Airgun Rings. Parallax Adjusted @ 35 Yards", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Bcej3rZYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UGIR36.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "UTG", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Night Vision"]], "price": 40.68}}
{"item_id": "B005UND3CY", "title": "Lezyne Steel Floor Drive Pump", "description": "A precision high-pressure floor pump made with a steel barrel and piston, varnished wood handle, aluminum base, and Composite Matrix connectors. ABS Flip-Thread Chuck and 43\" | 130cm rubber hose easily reach both Presta and Schrader valves. Included Speed Chuck makes pump compatible with disc wheels. The 2.5\" oversized gauge is precise and easy to read. The steel barrel is painted keeping this pump stylish.", "text": "Lezyne Steel Floor Drive Pump A precision high-pressure floor pump made with a steel barrel and piston, varnished wood handle, aluminum base, and Composite Matrix connectors. ABS Flip-Thread Chuck and 43\" | 130cm rubber hose easily reach both Presta and Schrader valves. Included Speed Chuck makes pump compatible with disc wheels. The 2.5\" oversized gauge is precise and easy to read. The steel barrel is painted keeping this pump stylish.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XwVVnJyfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UND3CY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lezyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B005UOHQ8A", "title": "Head Jaguar LiquidSkin Swim Goggle", "description": "The HEAD Swimming Jaguar LSR+ Swim Mask is a comfortable swim mask designed with comfort and ease of use in mind. The Head Jaguar LSR+ Swim Goggles are an extremely comfortable super-soft Hypoallergenic Liquid Injection Silicone Skirt Swim Mask. Goggles have Hard High Grade Polycarbonate Shatterproof Lenses; give 100% UV Protection against the sun's harmful Ultra Violet Rays and is Anti-Fog Polymer Treated to prevent Fogging for great vision, while you workout. Head's Jaguar LSR+ Adult Swim Goggles are a Hydrodynamic Swimming Mask, granting total safety even in rough waters. With Liquid Bi-Silicone Technology, Rapid Adjustment System and Optimum Peripheral Vision these are the swimmers choice.", "text": "Head Jaguar LiquidSkin Swim Goggle The HEAD Swimming Jaguar LSR+ Swim Mask is a comfortable swim mask designed with comfort and ease of use in mind. The Head Jaguar LSR+ Swim Goggles are an extremely comfortable super-soft Hypoallergenic Liquid Injection Silicone Skirt Swim Mask. Goggles have Hard High Grade Polycarbonate Shatterproof Lenses; give 100% UV Protection against the sun's harmful Ultra Violet Rays and is Anti-Fog Polymer Treated to prevent Fogging for great vision, while you workout. Head's Jaguar LSR+ Adult Swim Goggles are a Hydrodynamic Swimming Mask, granting total safety even in rough waters. With Liquid Bi-Silicone Technology, Rapid Adjustment System and Optimum Peripheral Vision these are the swimmers choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ECHryRfgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UOHQ8A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Swimming", "Goggles"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B005UP22QK", "title": "IFAK - Individual First Aid Kit - USAF Issue - Black", "description": "The IFAK or individual first aid kit, is the very same as what is issued to the USAF in Iraq but in a tan zippered pouch. This is a very popular and useful kit, currently being used by several state and federal government agencies. The bag is durable cordura NYLON with three MOLLE straps. Included is the new ACS 1st Response Quik-Clot and all the items necessary for wound management. Contains the following items:1 Israeli Bandage 4\" 1 Lip Balm1 Set of Blue Nitrile Gloves 1 Quik-Clot2 H&H; Compress Gauze 4.5\"x4.1yds. 1 Tan Self Adhesive Bandage 3\"1 Tourniquet non pneumatic 1 Tape 1\"x10yds.1 Set of EMT Shears 7.5\" 1 Triangular Bandage 46\"x46\"x52\"", "text": "IFAK - Individual First Aid Kit - USAF Issue - Black The IFAK or individual first aid kit, is the very same as what is issued to the USAF in Iraq but in a tan zippered pouch. This is a very popular and useful kit, currently being used by several state and federal government agencies. The bag is durable cordura NYLON with three MOLLE straps. Included is the new ACS 1st Response Quik-Clot and all the items necessary for wound management. Contains the following items:1 Israeli Bandage 4\" 1 Lip Balm1 Set of Blue Nitrile Gloves 1 Quik-Clot2 H&H; Compress Gauze 4.5\"x4.1yds. 1 Tan Self Adhesive Bandage 3\"1 Tourniquet non pneumatic 1 Tape 1\"x10yds.1 Set of EMT Shears 7.5\" 1 Triangular Bandage 46\"x46\"x52\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515dcvdjk1L._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UP22QK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Elite First Aid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 51.0}}
{"item_id": "B005UQECP8", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear M1 M-1 M1A M14 Rifle Steel Castle Nut Remove Muzzle Brake Flash Hider Suppressor Installation & Removal Tool Pliers", "description": "", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear M1 M-1 M1A M14 Rifle Steel Castle Nut Remove Muzzle Brake Flash Hider Suppressor Installation & Removal Tool Pliers", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31w3WEkxHXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UQECP8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005URBNXG", "title": "Hip Holster for Taurus Judge Public Defender - 2 1/2\" - 3\"", "description": "This is a brand new holster that will fit the Taurus Judge Public Defender. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "text": "Hip Holster for Taurus Judge Public Defender - 2 1/2\" - 3\" This is a brand new holster that will fit the Taurus Judge Public Defender. It combines the ruggedness and stability of a belt holster with the convenience of a clip-on. It's multi-layer nylon cushion fit design molds itself to the shape of the gun. This holster is ambidextrous and includes both 2\" wide belt loops and a sturdy, high carbon, black metal clip. The holster may be worn either left or right handed; it includes belt loops on both sides and the metal clip can be moved from side to side. The polyslide sight channel, soft nylon lining and reinforced thumb break insure a quick release and a smooth draw. The thumbreak is positioned across the hammer instead of the grip for a natural feel and a positive draw. The holster is constructed using only top grade, new materials, and no surplus automotive foams, fillers or liners. The nylon exterior provides resistance to scuffs, abrasions and moisture. The interior features a smooth nylon lining and a closed cell foam moisture barrier. It is sewn using nylon thread and edgebound with nylon binding tape using double needle stitching to provide about 14 stitches per inch reinforcement. The combination of materials and hand finishing provides a strong, good looking, long wearing holster.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413BrM%2Bg8gL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005URBNXG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 18.9}}
{"item_id": "B005UTLXXE", "title": "SKLZ SIMSTIX - True Feel Club for Golf Gaming", "description": "Simstix", "text": "SKLZ SIMSTIX - True Feel Club for Golf Gaming Simstix", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tjrg%2BxUyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UTLXXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SKLZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Training Equipment", "Swing Trainers"]], "price": 24.05}}
{"item_id": "B005UYTVZG", "title": "Lezyne Alloy Floor Drive Pump", "description": "A precision high-pressure floor pump featuring a CNC-machined aluminum barrel and base, a steel piston, and a varnished wood handle. ABS Flip-Thread Chuck and 43\" | 130cm extra long rubber hose easily reach both Presta and Schrader valves. The included Speed Chuck makes the pump compatible with disc wheels. The 2.5\" oversized gauge is precise and easy to read. An anodized high-polish finish makes this pump stylish and durable.", "text": "Lezyne Alloy Floor Drive Pump A precision high-pressure floor pump featuring a CNC-machined aluminum barrel and base, a steel piston, and a varnished wood handle. ABS Flip-Thread Chuck and 43\" | 130cm extra long rubber hose easily reach both Presta and Schrader valves. The included Speed Chuck makes the pump compatible with disc wheels. The 2.5\" oversized gauge is precise and easy to read. An anodized high-polish finish makes this pump stylish and durable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/314TxJCphVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UYTVZG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lezyne", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 61.18}}
{"item_id": "B005UZNT08", "title": "Lezyne Micro Drive HP Pump", "description": "Some would have you believe that chaos is the natural current of the universe; we see the logic. Chaos expands the boundaries of space. Chaos created the necessity for agriculture. And chaos gives you flat tires when you're trying to get from A to B. The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive HP Pump doesn't care if these events are interwoven effects of a butterfly flapping its wings in Paraguay or not. Its very existence is predicated upon rounding out the cosmic playing field, and restoring balance to a universe of annoying variables. By reinvigorating the power within us to be the master of our own destinies, the Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is a shield in the battle of mankind against roadside nails and thorns. You'll never be stranded again; that is, unless you forgot a tube.At only 260mm, the Micro Floor Drive is a travel pump that delivers the ease-of-use, and the maximum PSI, of a floor pump. The Micro Floor Drive is capable of an impressive maximum pressure of 160psi. It also features a stainless steel folding foot peg that sticks out around 35mm from the base when unfolded. For durability and weight reduction, the base, shaft, barrel, and 40mm-wide handle are all constructed of CNC-machined aluminum.The Micro Floor Drive uses a 60cm long rubber hose that comes equipped with the Lezyne Flip Thread chuck for both Presta/Schrader valve interactions. The chuck also has the Lezyne Air Bleed System for micro-adjustments to pressure, or to back out the pump without air loss. The Micro Floor Drive works so well as a floor pump, it also includes the 90 degree bend Lezyne Speed Chuck for slip-fitting and precariously positioned valves.The Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is being offered in two versions; HP and HPG. The HP is the standard version of the pump, and the HPG includes an in-line pressure gauge.The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is available in one size, and has a maximum pressure of 160psi. A Composite Matrix mount is also included.", "text": "Lezyne Micro Drive HP Pump Some would have you believe that chaos is the natural current of the universe; we see the logic. Chaos expands the boundaries of space. Chaos created the necessity for agriculture. And chaos gives you flat tires when you're trying to get from A to B. The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive HP Pump doesn't care if these events are interwoven effects of a butterfly flapping its wings in Paraguay or not. Its very existence is predicated upon rounding out the cosmic playing field, and restoring balance to a universe of annoying variables. By reinvigorating the power within us to be the master of our own destinies, the Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is a shield in the battle of mankind against roadside nails and thorns. You'll never be stranded again; that is, unless you forgot a tube.At only 260mm, the Micro Floor Drive is a travel pump that delivers the ease-of-use, and the maximum PSI, of a floor pump. The Micro Floor Drive is capable of an impressive maximum pressure of 160psi. It also features a stainless steel folding foot peg that sticks out around 35mm from the base when unfolded. For durability and weight reduction, the base, shaft, barrel, and 40mm-wide handle are all constructed of CNC-machined aluminum.The Micro Floor Drive uses a 60cm long rubber hose that comes equipped with the Lezyne Flip Thread chuck for both Presta/Schrader valve interactions. The chuck also has the Lezyne Air Bleed System for micro-adjustments to pressure, or to back out the pump without air loss. The Micro Floor Drive works so well as a floor pump, it also includes the 90 degree bend Lezyne Speed Chuck for slip-fitting and precariously positioned valves.The Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is being offered in two versions; HP and HPG. The HP is the standard version of the pump, and the HPG includes an in-line pressure gauge.The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive HP Pump is available in one size, and has a maximum pressure of 160psi. A Composite Matrix mount is also included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hrOis8xIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UZNT08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UZOJZ2", "title": "Lezyne Micro Floor Drive High Volume Pump", "description": "For shop convenience gone mobile, you can't beat the Lezyne Micro Floor Drive Pump. The guys at Lazyne may not have succeeded in making it fun to get flat tires, but they did manage to take a lot of the pain out of the inevitable flat with this innovative portable high-volume pump.The Micro Floor Drive incorporates a fold-out stainless steel foot peg to give you the convenience of a floor pump on the trail or side of the road. The comfortable CNC-machined T-handle is a world away from those uncomfortable shaft-handles on most micro pumps. The 24in hose makes it easy to get to valve stems, either Presta or Shrader, and a Speed Chuck is included.The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive Pump is available in a standard (HV) version or a version with an in-line pressure gauge (HVG). Both versions include a Composite Matrix frame pump mount.", "text": "Lezyne Micro Floor Drive High Volume Pump For shop convenience gone mobile, you can't beat the Lezyne Micro Floor Drive Pump. The guys at Lazyne may not have succeeded in making it fun to get flat tires, but they did manage to take a lot of the pain out of the inevitable flat with this innovative portable high-volume pump.The Micro Floor Drive incorporates a fold-out stainless steel foot peg to give you the convenience of a floor pump on the trail or side of the road. The comfortable CNC-machined T-handle is a world away from those uncomfortable shaft-handles on most micro pumps. The 24in hose makes it easy to get to valve stems, either Presta or Shrader, and a Speed Chuck is included.The Lezyne Micro Floor Drive Pump is available in a standard (HV) version or a version with an in-line pressure gauge (HVG). Both versions include a Composite Matrix frame pump mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aHFDov0TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UZOJZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005UZPML2", "title": "Lezyne Pressure Drive Hand Pump", "description": "A compact HP hand pump made of 100% custom CNC-machined aluminum for precise and lightweight construction. The HP design allows this pump to reach riding pressure with 30% fewer strokes compared to conventional pumps. The overlapping handle and barrel are integrated into a compact design. Equipped with the ABS Flex Hose and a Composite Matrix frame mount.", "text": "Lezyne Pressure Drive Hand Pump A compact HP hand pump made of 100% custom CNC-machined aluminum for precise and lightweight construction. The HP design allows this pump to reach riding pressure with 30% fewer strokes compared to conventional pumps. The overlapping handle and barrel are integrated into a compact design. Equipped with the ABS Flex Hose and a Composite Matrix frame mount.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31zSaANvylL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005UZPML2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Frame-Mounted Pumps"]]}}
