{"item_id": "B005V0V74M", "title": "Polarlens PG20 German Engineered Goggles, Snowboard Goggles, Ski Goggles with EXCHANGEABLE LENSES", "description": "Ski and snowboard goggles *** Frame Color: Glossy Black twin panels *** FLASH MIRROR ***Super ANTI-FOG ability *** sun filters: CAT 3 *** UV400, 100% UV protection *** Disc Color: Black and Mirrored Contrast-orange as Exchangeable lens *** Quality ventilation system at the top and bottom *** 40mm wide***adjustable strap that is helmet compatible *** Delivery: goggles, exchangeable lens in Contrast-orange, micro-fiber cleaning pouch This is a German Engineered product. Polarlens is always striving to provide its followers with affordable, high quality and innovative products. And Campbell International, its US distributor, prides itself in bringing quality products to its customers here in the US. We work hard so that our customers are getting the best quality for the price here in the states. Please let us know how we are doing and can better serve you! We strive for 5 Stars on our Amazon Feedback!", "text": "Polarlens PG20 German Engineered Goggles, Snowboard Goggles, Ski Goggles with EXCHANGEABLE LENSES Ski and snowboard goggles *** Frame Color: Glossy Black twin panels *** FLASH MIRROR ***Super ANTI-FOG ability *** sun filters: CAT 3 *** UV400, 100% UV protection *** Disc Color: Black and Mirrored Contrast-orange as Exchangeable lens *** Quality ventilation system at the top and bottom *** 40mm wide***adjustable strap that is helmet compatible *** Delivery: goggles, exchangeable lens in Contrast-orange, micro-fiber cleaning pouch This is a German Engineered product. Polarlens is always striving to provide its followers with affordable, high quality and innovative products. And Campbell International, its US distributor, prides itself in bringing quality products to its customers here in the US. We work hard so that our customers are getting the best quality for the price here in the states. Please let us know how we are doing and can better serve you! We strive for 5 Stars on our Amazon Feedback!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41t5rugb%2BcL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V0V74M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing", "Goggles"]], "price": 59.9}}
{"item_id": "B005V1KQRA", "title": "20 pack - 16\" x 10\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Gun and Rifle Targets", "description": "GlowShot 16 x 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "20 pack - 16\" x 10\" Reactive Splatter Targets - GlowShot - Gun and Rifle Targets GlowShot 16 x 10\" Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 7\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AxIRRlBlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V1KQRA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B005V1L2VE", "title": "Filzer Fork Adapter - 15mm (FA-15)", "description": "The Filzer 15mmx100mm Fork Adapter is a quick and easy way to convert standard fork-mount bicycle racks to fit 15mm Thru-Axle forks. It is easy to install and compatible with most racks.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- Fits most 15mm x 100 mm Forks- Easy to install- Secure- Powder coat finishABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.Filzer: it fills a gap in the market between big marketing budgets with over-hyped products and cheap, poorly made disposable knock-offs. With Filzer, the goods are great and the value is the bottom line. It's that simple.", "text": "Filzer Fork Adapter - 15mm (FA-15) The Filzer 15mmx100mm Fork Adapter is a quick and easy way to convert standard fork-mount bicycle racks to fit 15mm Thru-Axle forks. It is easy to install and compatible with most racks.FUNCTIONS & FEATURES- Fits most 15mm x 100 mm Forks- Easy to install- Secure- Powder coat finishABOUT FILZERFilzer. It's more than a brand.Filzer is a lifestyle. Filzer is a solution. Filzer is value.That's a pretty big line to talk, but Filzer has been delivering the goods on its ever-growing range of products since 2002. What began as a philosophy (make useful, high-quality products at an affordable price), has evolved into an entire product line of inventive solutions for daily living.Cycling computers, bicycle tools, pumps, lights, stainless steel water bottles, and more... wherever you go in the Filzer product line, you can count on two things: quality and value.Whatever life you lead, value counts. Filzer keeps the cost factor down and the quality consistently high. How? By going directly to factories to cut out all the middle men and counting on your satisfaction and word of mouth.We like to think about business a bit differently. When you buy Filzer, you aren't paying for the brand. You're enjoying it.Filzer: it fills a gap in the market between big marketing budgets with over-hyped products and cheap, poorly made disposable knock-offs. With Filzer, the goods are great and the value is the bottom line. It's that simple.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZL4V6jSuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V1L2VE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 2.99}}
{"item_id": "B005V1RUFQ", "title": "Matrix Iron Face Carbon Steel \"Striker\" Metal Mesh Lower Half Mask (Black)", "description": "There are many similar products in the market and we have carried the highest quality version at factory direct pricing just for you! Applications: Achieve full face protection with most Full Seal Goggles and other similar size eye goggles. Provides Cheek, nose and mouth lower face protection. Adjustable.", "text": "Matrix Iron Face Carbon Steel \"Striker\" Metal Mesh Lower Half Mask (Black) There are many similar products in the market and we have carried the highest quality version at factory direct pricing just for you! Applications: Achieve full face protection with most Full Seal Goggles and other similar size eye goggles. Provides Cheek, nose and mouth lower face protection. Adjustable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zKJnlEPsL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V1RUFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 10.02}}
{"item_id": "B005V1T798", "title": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly Glock 17,17l,22,24,31,34,35,37 GEN 1,2,3", "description": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly is a complete drop in unit. Special features include a solid one piece stainless steel guide rod precision CNC machined to accept a removable 3/32 Allen head tip. The ISMI recoil spring is manufactured of certified materials, heat treated for longer life, shot peened for stress relief and finally calibrated to Glock factory specifications (17lbs). The Spring includes a full 1 year replacement warranty that extends beyond just materials and workmanship. We even cover failure due to wear. These combined features make the Guide Rod Assembly the most durable, longest lasting system available today. Fits G17,17L,22,24,31,34,35,37 GEN 1,2,3 Pistols. Experienced shooters realize plastic guide rods can chip, crack or break resulting in feeding or ejection failures and guide rod flex can contribute to accuracy problems. The Guide Rod Assembly addresses all of these issues and will provide you a life time of reliable service.", "text": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly Glock 17,17l,22,24,31,34,35,37 GEN 1,2,3 Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly is a complete drop in unit. Special features include a solid one piece stainless steel guide rod precision CNC machined to accept a removable 3/32 Allen head tip. The ISMI recoil spring is manufactured of certified materials, heat treated for longer life, shot peened for stress relief and finally calibrated to Glock factory specifications (17lbs). The Spring includes a full 1 year replacement warranty that extends beyond just materials and workmanship. We even cover failure due to wear. These combined features make the Guide Rod Assembly the most durable, longest lasting system available today. Fits G17,17L,22,24,31,34,35,37 GEN 1,2,3 Pistols. Experienced shooters realize plastic guide rods can chip, crack or break resulting in feeding or ejection failures and guide rod flex can contribute to accuracy problems. The Guide Rod Assembly addresses all of these issues and will provide you a life time of reliable service.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31nyqJWE7sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V1T798.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "NDZ Performance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.48}}
{"item_id": "B005V1UWMO", "title": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly Glock G19,23,32,38 GEN 1,2,3", "description": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly 18lb ISMI Spring Fits Glock models: 19,23,32,38 Generations 1,2,and 3 The ilovemyglock Stainless Steel Recoil Guide Rod Assembly's are a complete drop in unit. Special features include: Solid one piece stainless steel guide rod Precision CNC machined.The ISMI recoil spring is manufactured of certified materials, heat treated for longer life, shot peened for stress relief and finally calibrated to Glock factory specifications (18lbs)..Made in the USA with a lifetime warranty on the rod.", "text": "Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly Glock G19,23,32,38 GEN 1,2,3 Stainless Steel Guide Rod Assembly 18lb ISMI Spring Fits Glock models: 19,23,32,38 Generations 1,2,and 3 The ilovemyglock Stainless Steel Recoil Guide Rod Assembly's are a complete drop in unit. Special features include: Solid one piece stainless steel guide rod Precision CNC machined.The ISMI recoil spring is manufactured of certified materials, heat treated for longer life, shot peened for stress relief and finally calibrated to Glock factory specifications (18lbs)..Made in the USA with a lifetime warranty on the rod.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yypnIF7sL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005V1UWMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 19.49}}
