{"item_id": "B005VCD1VM", "title": "Camelbak Octane XCT Hydration Pack (100-Ounce/200 Cubic-Inch, Black/Lemon Chrome)", "description": "Perfect for minimalist trail running or trail riding.", "text": "Camelbak Octane XCT Hydration Pack (100-Ounce/200 Cubic-Inch, Black/Lemon Chrome) Perfect for minimalist trail running or trail riding.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519hIRshoOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VCD1VM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005VDS9RC", "title": "Trek Light Gear Double Hammock", "description": "The Trek Light Double Hammock represents the perfect blend of comfort and function in an extremely lightweight and portable design. The Double Hammock isn't just about fitting two people (though you can certainly do that too). If you're planning to sleep in your hammock on a camp trip, napping in the yard or even as a full time bed at home, the Double is designed to be the best hammock for a full night's sleep. The key to sleeping in a hammock comfortably is to lay at an angle across it so you're able to lie flat - the Double gives you all the room you need to lie flat and comfortable for a healthy hammock experience. If you do like to share your hammock with a friend the Double won't let you down. Even better, the hammock conforms to your body so you won't be swallowed up if you're using it alone, but there's always plenty of room for two. The Double hammock holds up to 400lbs and only weighs slightly over a pound (20oz) in the pouch. When packed, it's scarcely bigger or heavier than the Trek Light Gear Single Hammock and provides you with the best possible hammock experience at home or on the trail.", "text": "Trek Light Gear Double Hammock The Trek Light Double Hammock represents the perfect blend of comfort and function in an extremely lightweight and portable design. The Double Hammock isn't just about fitting two people (though you can certainly do that too). If you're planning to sleep in your hammock on a camp trip, napping in the yard or even as a full time bed at home, the Double is designed to be the best hammock for a full night's sleep. The key to sleeping in a hammock comfortably is to lay at an angle across it so you're able to lie flat - the Double gives you all the room you need to lie flat and comfortable for a healthy hammock experience. If you do like to share your hammock with a friend the Double won't let you down. Even better, the hammock conforms to your body so you won't be swallowed up if you're using it alone, but there's always plenty of room for two. The Double hammock holds up to 400lbs and only weighs slightly over a pound (20oz) in the pouch. When packed, it's scarcely bigger or heavier than the Trek Light Gear Single Hammock and provides you with the best possible hammock experience at home or on the trail.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V3GQgNsBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VDS9RC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Cots & Hammocks"]], "price": 73.57}}
{"item_id": "B005VMO49U", "title": "Abus Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 Foldable Lock - 85cm", "description": "Very good protection at high theft risk. Recommended for securing high quality bicycles. Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 .. Bordo family: Ideal combination of resistibility, flexibility, weight and transport size. 5.5 mm steel bars with extra soft 2-components coating to prevent damage to the bicycle's paintworkColour-matching silicone cover for the lock body with \"soft touch\" properties. Link construction offers compact foldingABUS Link-Protection-Shield offers high saw protection of the links. The bars, the links, the case as well as supporting elements of the locking system are made of special hardened steel. ABUS X-Plus cylinder for extremely high protection against manipulation, e.g. picking. Two keys are supplied with the lock, one LED-lighted. ABUS Code Card for additional or replacement key.", "text": "Abus Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 Foldable Lock - 85cm Very good protection at high theft risk. Recommended for securing high quality bicycles. Bordo Granit X-Plus 6500 .. Bordo family: Ideal combination of resistibility, flexibility, weight and transport size. 5.5 mm steel bars with extra soft 2-components coating to prevent damage to the bicycle's paintworkColour-matching silicone cover for the lock body with \"soft touch\" properties. Link construction offers compact foldingABUS Link-Protection-Shield offers high saw protection of the links. The bars, the links, the case as well as supporting elements of the locking system are made of special hardened steel. ABUS X-Plus cylinder for extremely high protection against manipulation, e.g. picking. Two keys are supplied with the lock, one LED-lighted. ABUS Code Card for additional or replacement key.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31ZAj35z7xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VMO49U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Abus", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Fan Shop", "Sports Souvenirs", "Trading Cards"]], "price": 169.99}}
{"item_id": "B005VQ4KTK", "title": "RITE EDGE - Assisted Open EMS FOLDING KNIFE W/ CLIP, Seatbelt Cutter and Glass Breaker", "description": "Assisted Open 4.5in. overall EMS FOLDING KNIFE W/ CLIP. black blade, seatbelt cutter, and glass breaker.", "text": "RITE EDGE - Assisted Open EMS FOLDING KNIFE W/ CLIP, Seatbelt Cutter and Glass Breaker Assisted Open 4.5in. overall EMS FOLDING KNIFE W/ CLIP. black blade, seatbelt cutter, and glass breaker.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Elh%2BjduFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VQ4KTK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rite Edge", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 7.69}}
{"item_id": "B005VQLAP2", "title": "Packin' Tee Black Holster Model# 1982", "description": "Feel free to exercise your Second Amendment rights! Now you can conceal and carry your trusty handgun without the restricting discomfort of a typical holster. This holster attaches to the Packin' Tee (required; sold separately) using a heavy-duty hook-and-loop system to secure the pistol at your side. Order holster by the hand that you draw with (using cross draw method).", "text": "Packin' Tee Black Holster Model# 1982 Feel free to exercise your Second Amendment rights! Now you can conceal and carry your trusty handgun without the restricting discomfort of a typical holster. This holster attaches to the Packin' Tee (required; sold separately) using a heavy-duty hook-and-loop system to secure the pistol at your side. Order holster by the hand that you draw with (using cross draw method).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tfLgqHwIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VQLAP2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005VREWO2", "title": "Condor Outdoor Tactical EMT First Aid Pouch, MOLLE Compatible- Coyote Tan", "description": "A heavy-duty 900 denier polyester zipper pouch designed for first aid, in MOLLE-compatible format for easy attachment. Features inside pocket, inside elastic, exterior ladder system and more. Closed dimensions 7\" X 8\" X 3\"", "text": "Condor Outdoor Tactical EMT First Aid Pouch, MOLLE Compatible- Coyote Tan A heavy-duty 900 denier polyester zipper pouch designed for first aid, in MOLLE-compatible format for easy attachment. Features inside pocket, inside elastic, exterior ladder system and more. Closed dimensions 7\" X 8\" X 3\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/519nv42Q15L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VREWO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 16.0}}
