{"item_id": "B005VV4YLE", "title": "Ukarms Air Soft Gun-m757", "description": "The UK Arms M-757 is a great spring powered pistol with a very affordable price range. Whether you are getting it for backyard skirmish, as a movie prop, gift or as a collectors item, this should be your top choice. Great look, feel and durability. It is not a $300 electric rifle for serious simulations however this is ideal as movie props, costume accessories and display items.", "text": "Ukarms Air Soft Gun-m757 The UK Arms M-757 is a great spring powered pistol with a very affordable price range. Whether you are getting it for backyard skirmish, as a movie prop, gift or as a collectors item, this should be your top choice. Great look, feel and durability. It is not a $300 electric rifle for serious simulations however this is ideal as movie props, costume accessories and display items.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xa9IpMVbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VV4YLE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 5.3}}
{"item_id": "B005VY3T6M", "title": "Revgear Glove Dog Deodorizer", "description": "The Glove Dog Dryer and Deodorizer absorbs all around moisture while deodorizing. It gives longer glove life, leaves fresh cedar odor, conforms to inner shape of your glove. Breathable cotton flannel shells filled with refined, long lasting cedar chips.", "text": "Revgear Glove Dog Deodorizer The Glove Dog Dryer and Deodorizer absorbs all around moisture while deodorizing. It gives longer glove life, leaves fresh cedar odor, conforms to inner shape of your glove. Breathable cotton flannel shells filled with refined, long lasting cedar chips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TMPpacgmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005VY3T6M.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Revgear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves"]], "price": 13.49}}
{"item_id": "B005W0PUK8", "title": "Precor 9.23 Treadmill with Ground Effects Technology", "description": "Are you ready to get moving with a cardio or weight loss program? The 9.23 treadmill can help you get there. Whether you walk or run, our patented shock absorption, a smaller size, and just the right combination of features will help you achieve your fitness goals. Short length handlebars provide plenty of room. Patented Ground Effects Impact Control Technology reduces joint stress, minimizes fatigue and helps prevent injuries. Shock absorbers at the front of the deck offer extra cushioning to absorb impact, while a pivot point in the back supports a full range-of-motion and provides a solid surface, but with some give, for an easy push off. Stride Support technology senses the changes in your stride velocity and adjusts the belt speed up to 57 times a second at 12 mph. Touch heart rate monitoring with SmartRate® helps to keep you in your in your fat burn, cardio or peak target zone. 6 preset programs include Fun Run, Hill Climb, Interval, Manual, Walk and Weight Loss. Speed levels of 0.5 to 12 mph, with 0% to 15% incline. The easy-to-use console includes readouts for calories, distance, heart rate, incline, pace, program profile, SmartRate and time. Quiet, responsive 3.0 HP continuous duty motor. Maintenance-free 20” W x 57” L belt is the same size used on our commercial treadmills. Fully welded, powder coated steel frame, 1-inch deck, multi-ply belt has a PVC non-slip surface. Integrated reading rack, accessories holder and 2 water bottle holders. Magnetic safety clip immediately turns off power with a gentle stop. Warm brown color palette complements your décor. Warranty: Lifetime frame and welds; 5 years parts and wear items; 1 year labor. Power 120 VAC 50/60 Hz Equipment dimensions 81” L x 31” W x 54” H, 227 lbs. Shipping box dimensions 85” L x 33” W x 18” H, 290 lbs. Assembly required.Compare These Precor TreadmillsModel9.239.279.319.339.35ASIN to LinkB00