{"item_id": "B005WIA0EQ", "title": "Tanfoglio Witness 1911 CO2 BB Pistol, Brown Grips air pistol", "description": "Tanfoglio Witness 1911 pistol Uses 12-gram CO2 cartridges Semiauto 18rd removable BB magazine (also holds the CO2 cartridge) Fixed front and rear sights Blowback Single-action Metal construction Checkered grips Single-action only The box states that this gun comes with Hop-Up (spin), but it does not. The owner's manual states that this gun is double-action and single-action. That is incorrect. It is single-action only.... Tanfoglio 1911...realistic!...", "text": "Tanfoglio Witness 1911 CO2 BB Pistol, Brown Grips air pistol Tanfoglio Witness 1911 pistol Uses 12-gram CO2 cartridges Semiauto 18rd removable BB magazine (also holds the CO2 cartridge) Fixed front and rear sights Blowback Single-action Metal construction Checkered grips Single-action only The box states that this gun comes with Hop-Up (spin), but it does not. The owner's manual states that this gun is double-action and single-action. That is incorrect. It is single-action only.... Tanfoglio 1911...realistic!...", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41cGy3NOFOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WIA0EQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tanfoglio", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 119.99}}
{"item_id": "B005WIAUUU", "title": "Crosman CPA416AORG2 Centerpoint 4-16x40mm Riflescope", "description": "Adventure Class scopes come standard with adjustable objectives, delivering a parallax-free image, without moving the point of impact. This means, if your target moves, your scope can adjust quickly and accurately at any distance. And their dual illuminated reticles offer a bright, sharp image for those fast-moving, close-in shots. Whether you're shooting at dusk or at dawn, in heavy brush or open field, the Adventure Class will deliver a quick, bright image. Includes weaver-style/picatinny mounting rings and flip-open lens caps.", "text": "Crosman CPA416AORG2 Centerpoint 4-16x40mm Riflescope Adventure Class scopes come standard with adjustable objectives, delivering a parallax-free image, without moving the point of impact. This means, if your target moves, your scope can adjust quickly and accurately at any distance. And their dual illuminated reticles offer a bright, sharp image for those fast-moving, close-in shots. Whether you're shooting at dusk or at dawn, in heavy brush or open field, the Adventure Class will deliver a quick, bright image. Includes weaver-style/picatinny mounting rings and flip-open lens caps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31pONarQ-yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WIAUUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B005WOB3FK", "title": "Rem Flex Rods with Fast Snap T-Handles", "description": "A clean firearm simply performs better, and there's no better way to keep your guns in pristine condition than with Remington cleaning accessories. These collapsible, coated, stainless lightweight cleaning cables feature slotted brass tips with industry standard 8/32 universal threads that can easily interchange with our Squeeg-Es, bronze bore brushes, cotton mops, and patch pullers. The Rem Flex Rod provides a sturdy, strong option that won't mar or scratch your barrel and patented Fast Snap T-Handle provides for quick adaptability.12 inch ideal for handguns; 26 inch ideal for shotguns/ARs; 32 inch ideal for shotguns/rifles; 39 inch ideal for rifles.", "text": "Rem Flex Rods with Fast Snap T-Handles A clean firearm simply performs better, and there's no better way to keep your guns in pristine condition than with Remington cleaning accessories. These collapsible, coated, stainless lightweight cleaning cables feature slotted brass tips with industry standard 8/32 universal threads that can easily interchange with our Squeeg-Es, bronze bore brushes, cotton mops, and patch pullers. The Rem Flex Rod provides a sturdy, strong option that won't mar or scratch your barrel and patented Fast Snap T-Handle provides for quick adaptability.12 inch ideal for handguns; 26 inch ideal for shotguns/ARs; 32 inch ideal for shotguns/rifles; 39 inch ideal for rifles.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qaYEp4GEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WOB3FK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Snakes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005WPFVPC", "title": "Masione Waterproof CREE T6 LED 4-Mode 1000-Lumen White LED Bike Light Headlamp with Battery Pack Set", "description": "Features:Can be used as Headlamp or Bicycie LightModel of LED: CREE T6 LEDOutput bright can come to max 1000 lumens [lm]Internal wiring applies the high efficient booster circuit, working voltage is wide and can utilize the batteries in the largest extent.Waterproofing designAluminum alloy casingAluminum alloy reflector4 switch Mode: Strong Brightness / Medium Brightness / Low Brightness / FlashingDischarge Time: 180 mins (max brightness)Model of Battery required: 8.4V - 12V 4400mAh Battery Pack50000 Hours LifePackage Contains:1 x CREE T6 Bulb LED Light unit ( Can be used as Headlamp or Bicycie Light )1 x Adjustable headband2 x Rubber ring for installation1 x Battery Pack1 x Charger (100v-240v)1 x Waterproof Bag", "text": "Masione Waterproof CREE T6 LED 4-Mode 1000-Lumen White LED Bike Light Headlamp with Battery Pack Set Features:Can be used as Headlamp or Bicycie LightModel of LED: CREE T6 LEDOutput bright can come to max 1000 lumens [lm]Internal wiring applies the high efficient booster circuit, working voltage is wide and can utilize the batteries in the largest extent.Waterproofing designAluminum alloy casingAluminum alloy reflector4 switch Mode: Strong Brightness / Medium Brightness / Low Brightness / FlashingDischarge Time: 180 mins (max brightness)Model of Battery required: 8.4V - 12V 4400mAh Battery Pack50000 Hours LifePackage Contains:1 x CREE T6 Bulb LED Light unit ( Can be used as Headlamp or Bicycie Light )1 x Adjustable headband2 x Rubber ring for installation1 x Battery Pack1 x Charger (100v-240v)1 x Waterproof Bag", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51OXXqbBzJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WPFVPC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Masione", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 20.3}}
