{"item_id": "B005WT01NA", "title": "Glider Gloves - Winter Style Touch Screen Gloves (Black), Warm Touchscreen Compatiable Texting Gloves for Iphone and Android", "description": "Use your touchsrceen device with gloves on. Glider Gloves are the warmest touch screen compatible gloves for men and women. Made with a blend of conductive materials, now you can enjoy amazing touch response along your entire hand and all 10 fingers. With best in-class accuracy and precision, your frozen fingers will warm up to the idea of touch, tap, text, pinch, and glide! Regular gloves simply do not work on touch screens - Glider Gloves do! We are a Canadian company - Trust us, we know cold! Established 2010 Designed in Canada. Made in Sri Lanka ISO 9001:2000 Certified. UKAS Certified.", "text": "Glider Gloves - Winter Style Touch Screen Gloves (Black), Warm Touchscreen Compatiable Texting Gloves for Iphone and Android Use your touchsrceen device with gloves on. Glider Gloves are the warmest touch screen compatible gloves for men and women. Made with a blend of conductive materials, now you can enjoy amazing touch response along your entire hand and all 10 fingers. With best in-class accuracy and precision, your frozen fingers will warm up to the idea of touch, tap, text, pinch, and glide! Regular gloves simply do not work on touch screens - Glider Gloves do! We are a Canadian company - Trust us, we know cold! Established 2010 Designed in Canada. Made in Sri Lanka ISO 9001:2000 Certified. UKAS Certified.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bJjnk9RpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WT01NA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Gloves"]]}}
