{"item_id": "B005WUDS2A", "title": "Condor Drop Leg Dump Pouch - Black", "description": "The Condor Drop Leg Dump Pouch could be used as a dump pouch or as extra storage. The rigid insert keeps the pouch in form for easy dumping or retrieving of M4 mags, pistol mags, 40mm...etc.", "text": "Condor Drop Leg Dump Pouch - Black The Condor Drop Leg Dump Pouch could be used as a dump pouch or as extra storage. The rigid insert keeps the pouch in form for easy dumping or retrieving of M4 mags, pistol mags, 40mm...etc.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41781NS5gDL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005WUDS2A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Pouches"]], "price": 24.95}}
