{"item_id": "B005XN5EJ6", "title": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Survival Medic", "description": "AMK's Survival Medic contains top notch survival tools and first aid essentials in an ultralight waterproof pouch that is small enough to fit just about anywhere. It includes first aid supplies for shelter, fire and signaling.Button Compass 1 ea.Duct Tape 2\" x 26' 1 ea.SOL™ Survival Instructions 1 ea.Medical Supplies.Antiseptic Towelette 2 ea.Ibuprofen (200 mg) Pkg 2.Triple Antibiotic Ointment (0.5g) 1 ea.Bandage, Adhesive Fabric, Knuckle 1 ea.Bandage, Adhesive Fabric 1\" x 3\" 2 ea.Satety Pin 1 ea.", "text": "Adventure Medical Kits SOL Survival Medic AMK's Survival Medic contains top notch survival tools and first aid essentials in an ultralight waterproof pouch that is small enough to fit just about anywhere. It includes first aid supplies for shelter, fire and signaling.Button Compass 1 ea.Duct Tape 2\" x 26' 1 ea.SOL™ Survival Instructions 1 ea.Medical Supplies.Antiseptic Towelette 2 ea.Ibuprofen (200 mg) Pkg 2.Triple Antibiotic Ointment (0.5g) 1 ea.Bandage, Adhesive Fabric, Knuckle 1 ea.Bandage, Adhesive Fabric 1\" x 3\" 2 ea.Satety Pin 1 ea.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51-RvTW6DyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005XN5EJ6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Adventure Medical Kits", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "First Aid Kits"]], "price": 12.73}}
{"item_id": "B005XO84XI", "title": "Condor MOLLE 25 Round Shotgun Reload Tactical Pouch - Multicam", "description": "Size: 8\"H x 4\"W x 1 1/2\"D Color: Multicam Manufacture: Condor.", "text": "Condor MOLLE 25 Round Shotgun Reload Tactical Pouch - Multicam Size: 8\"H x 4\"W x 1 1/2\"D Color: Multicam Manufacture: Condor.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Pv7CMm1FL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005XO84XI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B005XOZXG4", "title": "Cressi Supernova Dry Snorkel", "description": "The Dry snorkel has a unique splash guard at the end which greatly reduces the entrance of water during use on the surface. The end part has a corrugated piece that is smooth on the inner side and keeps the snorkel away from the mouth during use when scuba diving. A special water collection well, with a large elliptic valve, allows quick and easy expulsion of water.", "text": "Cressi Supernova Dry Snorkel The Dry snorkel has a unique splash guard at the end which greatly reduces the entrance of water during use on the surface. The end part has a corrugated piece that is smooth on the inner side and keeps the snorkel away from the mouth during use when scuba diving. A special water collection well, with a large elliptic valve, allows quick and easy expulsion of water.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/213UrojCymL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005XOZXG4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cressi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkels"]], "price": 22.16}}
{"item_id": "B005XQA8KI", "title": "Tek Lok Small Belt Clip", "description": "The Tek-Lok is a great belt loop system that works on KYDEX and Concealex belt sheaths or gun sheaths. This locking system allows the knife or gun to be carried in the Vertical or Horizontal position on your belt or web gear. The Tek-Lok works like a door swinging closed and snapping into place for a secured carry. The Tek-Lok can be unlocked and removed via a specially designed molded pair of friction-grip press handles from its sides. The hole spacing set up for the Tek-Lok is 1 inch on its centers. Includes hardware, 1.5 x 1.5 Inside Dimensions : Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Great for small field accessories and electronics.", "text": "Tek Lok Small Belt Clip The Tek-Lok is a great belt loop system that works on KYDEX and Concealex belt sheaths or gun sheaths. This locking system allows the knife or gun to be carried in the Vertical or Horizontal position on your belt or web gear. The Tek-Lok works like a door swinging closed and snapping into place for a secured carry. The Tek-Lok can be unlocked and removed via a specially designed molded pair of friction-grip press handles from its sides. The hole spacing set up for the Tek-Lok is 1 inch on its centers. Includes hardware, 1.5 x 1.5 Inside Dimensions : Fits 1.5 belts and smaller. Great for small field accessories and electronics.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31RanEkcZzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005XQA8KI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tek Lok", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.95}}
