{"item_id": "B005XZQH9U", "title": "Lockstraps 801 Locking Carabiner", "description": "Heavy duty, heat treated steel combination locking carabiner. Perfect for many applications. Up to 600 pounds of strength.", "text": "Lockstraps 801 Locking Carabiner Heavy duty, heat treated steel combination locking carabiner. Perfect for many applications. Up to 600 pounds of strength.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Xngq4OH6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005XZQH9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lockstraps", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Carabiners", "Locking"]], "price": 12.11}}
{"item_id": "B005Y1TC22", "title": "Condor MOLLE Triple Kangaroo M4 & Pistol Mag Pouch - Tan", "description": "This design will save precious real estate on molly plate carriers and/or chest rigs. The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the .223 or 5.56mm Magazine and Pistol Magazine with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style magazine pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel.", "text": "Condor MOLLE Triple Kangaroo M4 & Pistol Mag Pouch - Tan This design will save precious real estate on molly plate carriers and/or chest rigs. The Condor Kangaroo Pouch is design to hold both the .223 or 5.56mm Magazine and Pistol Magazine with one single pouch. This is was a aftermath of our popular open-top style magazine pouches, and few suggestion from LE/MIL personnel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NqiHFsHJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Y1TC22.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 20.95}}
{"item_id": "B005Y2539C", "title": "Emergency Zone Multilayer Reflective Sleeping Bag/Bivy Sack with HeatStore", "description": "Why purchase a HeatStore sleeping bag over a standard reflective sleeping bag? Here are three big reasons. (1) Durability. If even a small tear occurred with a standard reflective material, there is little resistance to the propagation of the tear across the entire length of the sleeping bag. A sleeping bag with a big tear does not do much to retain heat. Our NEW sleeping bag uses a layer of aluminumized PVC bonded to a layer of thin non woven nylon fibers. The sleeping bag remains very thin and lightweight, but more resistant to punctures and more importantly, the propagation of tears. The seams are reinforced with the same multilayer material for added strength. Standard reflective sleeping bags use only tape on the seams. (2) Heat Absorption. Standard reflective sleeping bags are reflective on both sides. While the standard reflective bag reflects heat from the body back towards the body, the outside is also reflective and reflects heat from the sun away from the body too. Our multilayer sleeping bag will absorb more heat from the environment rather than reflecting it away. (3) Visibility. The orange outer layer is visible from long distances and contracts with snow and trees.", "text": "Emergency Zone Multilayer Reflective Sleeping Bag/Bivy Sack with HeatStore Why purchase a HeatStore sleeping bag over a standard reflective sleeping bag? Here are three big reasons. (1) Durability. If even a small tear occurred with a standard reflective material, there is little resistance to the propagation of the tear across the entire length of the sleeping bag. A sleeping bag with a big tear does not do much to retain heat. Our NEW sleeping bag uses a layer of aluminumized PVC bonded to a layer of thin non woven nylon fibers. The sleeping bag remains very thin and lightweight, but more resistant to punctures and more importantly, the propagation of tears. The seams are reinforced with the same multilayer material for added strength. Standard reflective sleeping bags use only tape on the seams. (2) Heat Absorption. Standard reflective sleeping bags are reflective on both sides. While the standard reflective bag reflects heat from the body back towards the body, the outside is also reflective and reflects heat from the sun away from the body too. Our multilayer sleeping bag will absorb more heat from the environment rather than reflecting it away. (3) Visibility. The orange outer layer is visible from long distances and contracts with snow and trees.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51zrdEnc1HL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Y2539C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Emergency Zone", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Bivy Sacks"]], "price": 15.99}}
{"item_id": "B005Y2J05A", "title": "Diamond Strike Anywhere \"Greenlight\" Matches 300 Ct", "description": "Made in USA", "text": "Diamond Strike Anywhere \"Greenlight\" Matches 300 Ct Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51r%2Br%2BPwOgL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Y2J05A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hearthmark, LLC dba Jarden Home Brands", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 6.5}}
{"item_id": "B005Y4C992", "title": "Aim Sports Flashlight 150-Lumen Compact Flashlight with Quick Release Mount Color Filtered Lens, Black", "description": "One piece aircraft grade aluminum body, Compact size 150 lumens USA made Cree led flashlight comes with 3 color filtered lens (red, blue, yellow).", "text": "Aim Sports Flashlight 150-Lumen Compact Flashlight with Quick Release Mount Color Filtered Lens, Black One piece aircraft grade aluminum body, Compact size 150 lumens USA made Cree led flashlight comes with 3 color filtered lens (red, blue, yellow).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41qYttFtAPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Y4C992.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "AIM Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Personal Defense Equipment"]], "price": 29.32}}
{"item_id": "B005Y83SJI", "title": "ZoN Hand Grips", "description": "Strengthen your hands, fingers and forearms while testing your resolve with this challenging exercise. ZoN Resistance Hand Grips hand grips build finger, hand, and forearm strength. They are ideal for developing strength and stamina safely, efficiently and effectively while reducing stress at the same time. And you can use them practically anywhere. Great for strength training, sports training and rehab. Package includes two hand grips.", "text": "ZoN Hand Grips Strengthen your hands, fingers and forearms while testing your resolve with this challenging exercise. ZoN Resistance Hand Grips hand grips build finger, hand, and forearm strength. They are ideal for developing strength and stamina safely, efficiently and effectively while reducing stress at the same time. And you can use them practically anywhere. Great for strength training, sports training and rehab. Package includes two hand grips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41s63EJp7TL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Y83SJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ZON", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Hand Strengtheners"]], "price": 7.25}}
{"item_id": "B005YNC8PI", "title": "Laserlyte Rear Sight Laser For All Glock", "description": "LaserLyte returns to basics with the patented RTB-GL rear sight laser that fits all GLOCK firearms. The high performance laser built into a rear sight specifically designed for all GLOCK pistols features a simple, ambidextrous “press and go” activation. The laser is easily programmable to either constant on or pulse mode. Another great feature is the “auto-off” feature that displays a unique flash after 5-minutes of operation and automatically turns the unit off after 6-minutes.", "text": "Laserlyte Rear Sight Laser For All Glock LaserLyte returns to basics with the patented RTB-GL rear sight laser that fits all GLOCK firearms. The high performance laser built into a rear sight specifically designed for all GLOCK pistols features a simple, ambidextrous “press and go” activation. The laser is easily programmable to either constant on or pulse mode. Another great feature is the “auto-off” feature that displays a unique flash after 5-minutes of operation and automatically turns the unit off after 6-minutes.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mm35CWPDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YNC8PI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 87.5}}
{"item_id": "B005YPK7V8", "title": "Kryptonite Keeper 785 Integrated Chain Lock", "description": "To lock your bike and quick-release wheels, or to lock up yours and a friend's bikes during a coffee run, the Kryptonite 785 Integrated Chain Lock is the ideal accessory. This chain lock features a patent-pending end-link design that secures the links to the hardened deadbolt, which helps to eliminate critical vulnerability. In other words, there are no weld seams in the links that are able to be pried open. Additionally, the disc-style lock cylinder is pick and drill resistant. The chain is 33. 5in long, which makes it easy to secure to a bike rack, tree, or other immovable object. It is sheathed in a weather-resistant nylon sleeve to prevent scratches on your bike. To ensure that you never have to bring in a specialist to remove the lock due to lost keys, Kryptonite's Key Safe program is available -- just register your key and you're able to get a replacement when necessary.", "text": "Kryptonite Keeper 785 Integrated Chain Lock To lock your bike and quick-release wheels, or to lock up yours and a friend's bikes during a coffee run, the Kryptonite 785 Integrated Chain Lock is the ideal accessory. This chain lock features a patent-pending end-link design that secures the links to the hardened deadbolt, which helps to eliminate critical vulnerability. In other words, there are no weld seams in the links that are able to be pried open. Additionally, the disc-style lock cylinder is pick and drill resistant. The chain is 33. 5in long, which makes it easy to secure to a bike rack, tree, or other immovable object. It is sheathed in a weather-resistant nylon sleeve to prevent scratches on your bike. To ensure that you never have to bring in a specialist to remove the lock due to lost keys, Kryptonite's Key Safe program is available -- just register your key and you're able to get a replacement when necessary.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CFQ%2BdLb-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPK7V8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "Chain Locks"]], "price": 30.95}}
{"item_id": "B005YPK8B2", "title": "Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 Integrated Chain Bicycle Lock", "description": "The Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 Integrated Chain includes 9mm four-sided chain links made from 3t manganese steel and secures with a new patent-pending KryptoLok Series 2 Lock Head with talon deadbolt.In the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include powersports, hardware and snowsports security.", "text": "Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 Integrated Chain Bicycle Lock The Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 Integrated Chain includes 9mm four-sided chain links made from 3t manganese steel and secures with a new patent-pending KryptoLok Series 2 Lock Head with talon deadbolt.In the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include powersports, hardware and snowsports security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416TczpifqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPK8B2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005YPK8G2", "title": "Kryptonite Kryptolok Series 2 Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Transit FlexFrame Bracket (4-inch x 9-inch) with 4-Foot Flex Cable", "description": "The next generation in standard bicycle security with a $1500 USD anti-theft protection with a security rating of 8 of out 12 and includes a KryptoFlex Looped Cable 4' long for complete protection.Kryptonite U-locks represent extreme security while maintaining a realistic size/weight. U-locks represent the most popular lock for enthusiasts.In the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include powersports, hardware and snowsports security.", "text": "Kryptonite Kryptolok Series 2 Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Transit FlexFrame Bracket (4-inch x 9-inch) with 4-Foot Flex Cable The next generation in standard bicycle security with a $1500 USD anti-theft protection with a security rating of 8 of out 12 and includes a KryptoFlex Looped Cable 4' long for complete protection.Kryptonite U-locks represent extreme security while maintaining a realistic size/weight. U-locks represent the most popular lock for enthusiasts.In the early 1970s, Michael Zane was a free-spirited, bearded kid with a VW van and a big idea for a new kind of lock. He traveled thousands of miles showing the unique U-shaped locking device and spreading his passion for bicycle security to bike dealers all around the country and forged lifetime relationships. The company soon expanded its product line to include powersports, hardware and snowsports security.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416efSoWkhL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPK8G2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 42.95}}
{"item_id": "B005YPK8NU", "title": "Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock", "description": "FEATURES of the Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock 13mm hardened Performance steel shackle resists cutting and leverage attacks Reinforced hardened cross bar design provides increased protection High security, disc-style cylinder Anti-rattle bumpers reduce noise during transport Rotating dustcover protects cylinder Includes, patented EZ Mount transportation system which allows for versatile carrying Protective vinyl coating 2 stainless steel keys Key Safe Program SPECIFICATIONS of the Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock Weight: 3.20 lbs / 1.45 kg Dimension: 4 x 11.5\" / 10.2 x 29.2 cm", "text": "Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock FEATURES of the Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock 13mm hardened Performance steel shackle resists cutting and leverage attacks Reinforced hardened cross bar design provides increased protection High security, disc-style cylinder Anti-rattle bumpers reduce noise during transport Rotating dustcover protects cylinder Includes, patented EZ Mount transportation system which allows for versatile carrying Protective vinyl coating 2 stainless steel keys Key Safe Program SPECIFICATIONS of the Kryptonite KryptoLok Series 2 LS U-Lock Weight: 3.20 lbs / 1.45 kg Dimension: 4 x 11.5\" / 10.2 x 29.2 cm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sIsp9yi2L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPK8NU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 39.95}}
