{"item_id": "B005YPK99I", "title": "Kryptonite Evolution Series 4 Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Transit FlexFrame Bracket (4-Inch x 9-Inch)", "description": "Bicycle security for moderate to high crime areas with a 2250 USD anti-theft protection with a security rating of 9 of out 12.", "text": "Kryptonite Evolution Series 4 Standard Bicycle U-Lock with Transit FlexFrame Bracket (4-Inch x 9-Inch) Bicycle security for moderate to high crime areas with a 2250 USD anti-theft protection with a security rating of 9 of out 12.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419Yf7vmg-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPK99I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 66.95}}
