{"item_id": "B005YPKC5O", "title": "OnGuard Bulldog DT U-Lock with 4-Inch Cinch Loop Cable (Black, 4.53 x 9.06-Inch)", "description": "NEW extra thick molded end caps protect against bumps and hits. 10mm fully coated braided steel cable allows for extra locking versatility.", "text": "OnGuard Bulldog DT U-Lock with 4-Inch Cinch Loop Cable (Black, 4.53 x 9.06-Inch) NEW extra thick molded end caps protect against bumps and hits. 10mm fully coated braided steel cable allows for extra locking versatility.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418mnkteQiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPKC5O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OnGuard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 34.92}}
{"item_id": "B005YPKL5U", "title": "OnGuard Bulldog Mini U-Lock (Black, 3.55 x 5.52-Inch)", "description": "BullDog level protection in a compact design. for those who travel light and fast but need the extra security of a X2P Double Bolt lock. Shackle Dimensions 90mm x 140mm W x H x Diam 3.55'' x 5.52'' x 13mm 0.51'' D", "text": "OnGuard Bulldog Mini U-Lock (Black, 3.55 x 5.52-Inch) BullDog level protection in a compact design. for those who travel light and fast but need the extra security of a X2P Double Bolt lock. Shackle Dimensions 90mm x 140mm W x H x Diam 3.55'' x 5.52'' x 13mm 0.51'' D", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31e1H7tnfjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPKL5U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OnGuard", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 26.35}}
{"item_id": "B005YPKLLE", "title": "Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket", "description": "FEATURES of the Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket Mounts quickly and easy Supports the transportation of the most common size u-locks Compatible with 13mm and 16mm round shaped shackles 360 degree rotation allows for the ability to micro-adjust Heavy-duty soft strap system contours to bike frame SPECIFICATIONS of the Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket Weight: 0.40 lb / 0.18 kg Fits Bicycle Frame: 25mm to 80mm", "text": "Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket FEATURES of the Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket Mounts quickly and easy Supports the transportation of the most common size u-locks Compatible with 13mm and 16mm round shaped shackles 360 degree rotation allows for the ability to micro-adjust Heavy-duty soft strap system contours to bike frame SPECIFICATIONS of the Kryptonite Transfit FlexFrame-U Bracket Weight: 0.40 lb / 0.18 kg Fits Bicycle Frame: 25mm to 80mm", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Nnu996jSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPKLLE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kryptonite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Locks", "U-Locks"]], "price": 14.0}}
