{"item_id": "B005YPRCMA", "title": "Topeak Explorer 29Er Tubular Rack with Disc Mount (Black, 16.5x6.7x16.3-Inch)", "description": "The perfect rack for classic loaded touring, commuting or just running errands. QuickTrack compatible for use with any MTX TrunkBag and rear basket.", "text": "Topeak Explorer 29Er Tubular Rack with Disc Mount (Black, 16.5x6.7x16.3-Inch) The perfect rack for classic loaded touring, commuting or just running errands. QuickTrack compatible for use with any MTX TrunkBag and rear basket.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Sc0VBOGvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005YPRCMA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Cargo Racks"]], "price": 41.14}}
