{"item_id": "B005Z2CYX4", "title": "Zero Tolerance ZT0550 Hinderer Design Folding Knife", "description": "The Zero Tolerance 0550 features a bullet-tough blade of Crucible's S35VN stainless steel with stonewashed finish. The steel is designed to offer increased toughness over S30V, yet be easier to machine and polish. It offers high wear resistance and resists edge chipping. It's chemistry includes niobium, vanadium and chromium carbides and offers an exceptionally uniform distribution of those carbides, too. In other words, this high-performance knife can take whatever you can dish out. Designed by Rick Hinderer.", "text": "Zero Tolerance ZT0550 Hinderer Design Folding Knife The Zero Tolerance 0550 features a bullet-tough blade of Crucible's S35VN stainless steel with stonewashed finish. The steel is designed to offer increased toughness over S30V, yet be easier to machine and polish. It offers high wear resistance and resists edge chipping. It's chemistry includes niobium, vanadium and chromium carbides and offers an exceptionally uniform distribution of those carbides, too. In other words, this high-performance knife can take whatever you can dish out. Designed by Rick Hinderer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EsHtNBC8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z2CYX4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Zero Tolerance", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 160.0}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4BAAK", "title": "Park Tool Supergrip Carbon and Alloy Assembly Compound - 4 oz. tube", "description": "Park Tool Supergrip Carbon and Alloy Assembly Compound creates a better grip between slippery surfaces, so you don't have to deal with slippery seatposts, stems, or handlebars anymore. Note: Not for threaded surfaces. Do not use for bearing lubrication", "text": "Park Tool Supergrip Carbon and Alloy Assembly Compound - 4 oz. tube Park Tool Supergrip Carbon and Alloy Assembly Compound creates a better grip between slippery surfaces, so you don't have to deal with slippery seatposts, stems, or handlebars anymore. Note: Not for threaded surfaces. Do not use for bearing lubrication", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318Ke0gO81L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4BAAK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Cleaners"]], "price": 10.49}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4CDCY", "title": "Race Face Ride Mountain Bike Seat Post", "description": "The Ride seatpost features a user friendly, adjustable design with Race Face engineering and quality at a value price point.", "text": "Race Face Ride Mountain Bike Seat Post The Ride seatpost features a user friendly, adjustable design with Race Face engineering and quality at a value price point.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31tu88ewy6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4CDCY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Seat Posts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4KTJS", "title": "Topeak Ratchet Rocket Lite Tool (Black, 4.6x2.2x0.8-Inch)", "description": "The Ratchet Rocket Lite features a fine tooth ratchet mechanism with reverse lever and thumb wheel for quick rotation and control in tight spots and includes hardened steel tools in 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6 and 8mm hex, T10, T25 Torx and No.2 Phillips bits.", "text": "Topeak Ratchet Rocket Lite Tool (Black, 4.6x2.2x0.8-Inch) The Ratchet Rocket Lite features a fine tooth ratchet mechanism with reverse lever and thumb wheel for quick rotation and control in tight spots and includes hardened steel tools in 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6 and 8mm hex, T10, T25 Torx and No.2 Phillips bits.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AHWX-Kh6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4KTJS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Topeak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Tool Kits"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4LKCI", "title": "Park Tool Tl-6 Steel Core Tire Levers", "description": "The TL-6 is a composite covered, steel core lever that provides smooth, scratch-free operation and superior strength to help remove even the tightest tires. Slightly longer (5.5\"/14cm) than our other take-along levers. The TL-6 is perfect for use as a take-along or as an everyday bench lever. Set of two.", "text": "Park Tool Tl-6 Steel Core Tire Levers The TL-6 is a composite covered, steel core lever that provides smooth, scratch-free operation and superior strength to help remove even the tightest tires. Slightly longer (5.5\"/14cm) than our other take-along levers. The TL-6 is perfect for use as a take-along or as an everyday bench lever. Set of two.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31vbFDWc66L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4LKCI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance"]], "price": 15.26}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4LVG8", "title": "Park Tool Valve Core Remover", "description": "A small, handy tool designed to remove and install Schrader and Presta valve cores and to remove and install Presta valve extenders with 5mm wrench flats.", "text": "Park Tool Valve Core Remover A small, handy tool designed to remove and install Schrader and Presta valve cores and to remove and install Presta valve extenders with 5mm wrench flats.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31qFKxsZ3mL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4LVG8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Park Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Derailleurs & Shifters", "Derailleurs"]], "price": 9.86}}
{"item_id": "B005Z4NGDE", "title": "Michelin Pro4 Endurance Tire", "description": "This tire was designed to meet the needs of riders who place the emphasis on endurance. Thanks to its reinforced protection against punctures and cuts, the Michelin Pro4 Endurance combines high performance with outstanding durability.", "text": "Michelin Pro4 Endurance Tire This tire was designed to meet the needs of riders who place the emphasis on endurance. Thanks to its reinforced protection against punctures and cuts, the Michelin Pro4 Endurance combines high performance with outstanding durability.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31JGuPHRTOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z4NGDE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tires"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005Z7SJUG", "title": "Rage Cage Broadhead Case (Holds-6), Red", "description": "Keep your RAGE Broadheads handy and protected in a RAGE Cage! The RAGE Cage is a handy carrying case made specifically to hold your RAGE broadheads. The RAGE Cage is constructed of a heavy duty plastic and is designed to hold up to six 2 blade or 3 blade RAGE broadheads. Keeping your RAGE broadheads in a RAGE Cage eliminates unnecessary wear and tear on both blades and O-rings. The foam insert on the inside of the RAGE Cage holds the heads in place and is blade friendly. Each RAGE Cage comes with a plastic vial that will hold spare O-rings, replacement blades, Allen wrenches, etc. The RAGE Cage is \"RAGE red\", so it's easy to find. And, it's compact so it easily fits in a fanny pack or pocket!", "text": "Rage Cage Broadhead Case (Holds-6), Red Keep your RAGE Broadheads handy and protected in a RAGE Cage! The RAGE Cage is a handy carrying case made specifically to hold your RAGE broadheads. The RAGE Cage is constructed of a heavy duty plastic and is designed to hold up to six 2 blade or 3 blade RAGE broadheads. Keeping your RAGE broadheads in a RAGE Cage eliminates unnecessary wear and tear on both blades and O-rings. The foam insert on the inside of the RAGE Cage holds the heads in place and is blade friendly. Each RAGE Cage comes with a plastic vial that will hold spare O-rings, replacement blades, Allen wrenches, etc. The RAGE Cage is \"RAGE red\", so it's easy to find. And, it's compact so it easily fits in a fanny pack or pocket!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/513T3Z359mL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z7SJUG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rage Broadheads", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 8.88}}
{"item_id": "B005Z7SVWW", "title": "RCBS Powder Trickler", "description": "RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "text": "RCBS Powder Trickler RCBS specializes in offering a complete line of reloading supplies for the home hand loader. RCBS Reloader Supplies set the standard for high-quality reloading equipment - just as they've done for over 60 years. With six decades of experience under their belt, RCBS knows all the ins and outs of the gear used by the home ammunition reloader. The brass case is the most expensive part of a loaded round of ammo. Reloading brass (by replacing the primer, powder and bullet inside the used brass casing) offers savings of about 60% over factory-loaded ammunition. RCBS handloading supplies provide shooters with everything needed to re-use expensive brass cartridge cases by reloading them with new primer, powder and bullets.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31x5Vgu0arL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z7SVWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RCBS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 27.54}}
{"item_id": "B005Z8A0ZW", "title": "Tipton 777890 Patch Trap", "description": "Cleaning the barrel on your rifle, shotgun or muzzleloader can be a messy choir. Solvent splatter, drips and dirty patches always seem to end up where you don't want them. Strong solvents and powder residue can stain clothes and work surfaces. The Tipton Patch Trap puts an end to the mess.", "text": "Tipton 777890 Patch Trap Cleaning the barrel on your rifle, shotgun or muzzleloader can be a messy choir. Solvent splatter, drips and dirty patches always seem to end up where you don't want them. Strong solvents and powder residue can stain clothes and work surfaces. The Tipton Patch Trap puts an end to the mess.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21yuc-dwDBL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005Z8A0ZW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tipton", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cage Traps"]], "price": 11.59}}
{"item_id": "B005ZBZN38", "title": "Mission Captive Brake Lever", "description": "The Mission Captive Lever will compliment any brake, and while it is half the price of most, you will not sacrifice any stopping power! Comes in Midnight Black, Rick Ross Gold, and Pearl White.", "text": "Mission Captive Brake Lever The Mission Captive Lever will compliment any brake, and while it is half the price of most, you will not sacrifice any stopping power! Comes in Midnight Black, Rick Ross Gold, and Pearl White.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yaXJZnNEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ZBZN38.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Bike Brakes & Parts", "Brake Parts", "Brake Levers"]]}}
