{"item_id": "B005ZGQCO2", "title": "Blackburn Air Tower 1 Floor Bicycle Pump", "description": "New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new Any Valve Head automatically detects between Presto and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-1 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when knocked down and still extremely accurate. AT-1 base - Designed in our state-of-the-art floorpump test lab, the AT-1s glass-reinforced nylon fiber base is actually stiffer than many metal bases. And due to its large footprint, it's incredibly stable.", "text": "Blackburn Air Tower 1 Floor Bicycle Pump New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new Any Valve Head automatically detects between Presto and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-1 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when knocked down and still extremely accurate. AT-1 base - Designed in our state-of-the-art floorpump test lab, the AT-1s glass-reinforced nylon fiber base is actually stiffer than many metal bases. And due to its large footprint, it's incredibly stable.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jkcC-EBKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ZGQCO2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blackburn", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]], "price": 25.99}}
{"item_id": "B005ZGQDB4", "title": "Blackburn Air Tower 2 Floor Bicycle Pump (Orange)", "description": "New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip, and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-2 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when kicked down and still extremely accurate. AT-2 base - The base is formed out of stamped steel, which is welded to the barrel, Wider and longer, it provides a wobble-free platform for pumping.", "text": "Blackburn Air Tower 2 Floor Bicycle Pump (Orange) New oversized T-handle provides a comfortable grip, and features storage drawers at both ends for patch kits, tire levers and included ball needle adapters. All-new AnyValve Head automatically detects between Presta and Schrader valves and features Standard and Overdrive lock modes. AT-2 gauge - New diaphragm style gauge is stronger and more resistant to damage when kicked down and still extremely accurate. AT-2 base - The base is formed out of stamped steel, which is welded to the barrel, Wider and longer, it provides a wobble-free platform for pumping.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31n7L0EINiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ZGQDB4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Pumps", "Floor Pumps"]]}}
{"item_id": "B005ZGSQPK", "title": "Tactical First Aid Pouch, MOLLE Compatible - Multicam Multi cam Medic EMT Pouch", "description": "A heavy-duty 900 denier polyester zipper pouch designed for first aid, in MOLLE-compatible format for easy attachment. Features inside pocket, inside elastic, exterior ladder system and more. Closed dimensions 7\" X 8\" X 3\"", "text": "Tactical First Aid Pouch, MOLLE Compatible - Multicam Multi cam Medic EMT Pouch A heavy-duty 900 denier polyester zipper pouch designed for first aid, in MOLLE-compatible format for easy attachment. Features inside pocket, inside elastic, exterior ladder system and more. Closed dimensions 7\" X 8\" X 3\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31DSOvrMOpL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ZGSQPK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor Outdoor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty"]], "price": 19.99}}
{"item_id": "B005ZIBKK6", "title": "HemingWeigh Acupressure Mat", "description": "The HemingWeigh Acupressure Matis an effective wellness tool for relieving back pain and muscle tension while promoting stress-relief and relaxation. The mat is believed to increase circulation and blood oxygenation and is suitable for people with low levels of energy, high levels of stress, insomnia, backache and depression. By releasing this inner tension, we release a lot of the problems from depression to tense neck / shoulders and poor digestion. Regular use of the mat will help with this.With its Indian origin dating back thousands of years, the bed of nails is a well tested tool for healing the body. It has been used by Indian Yogis (yoga practitioners) throughout time to attain perfection of body and mind, and to reach deep inner peace. The original bed of nails was constructed of wood and metal nails.It helps to promote the release of the body's own pain-relieving and happiness hormones - endorphins and oxytocin- which help to release tension, create relaxation and promote a sense well-being.Acupressure mats were recently featured on the Dr. Oz Show where Dr. Oz showed some of the amazing benefits of using an acupressure mat! Basic positions target the back, stomach and hips.In a research study done by Dr. Zilberter,98% of the participants reported pain relief,96% reported relaxation, 94% improved sleep,81% reported an increase in energy levels after using acupressure mats.These acupressure mats are made from high quality materials, made without any glue, and feature 8820 contact points to help relax your back, neck, shoulders, and legs.The HemingWeigh Acupressure Matsare 29 x 17 x 1 inches in size.Warnings:Do not use an acupressure mat, or consult with your health care practitioner before using an acupressure mat, if you: Are pregnant, Have a blood disorder or are using anticoagulants, Suffer from epilepsy, or have sun burn, or open wounds.", "text": "HemingWeigh Acupressure Mat The HemingWeigh Acupressure Matis an effective wellness tool for relieving back pain and muscle tension while promoting stress-relief and relaxation. The mat is believed to increase circulation and blood oxygenation and is suitable for people with low levels of energy, high levels of stress, insomnia, backache and depression. By releasing this inner tension, we release a lot of the problems from depression to tense neck / shoulders and poor digestion. Regular use of the mat will help with this.With its Indian origin dating back thousands of years, the bed of nails is a well tested tool for healing the body. It has been used by Indian Yogis (yoga practitioners) throughout time to attain perfection of body and mind, and to reach deep inner peace. The original bed of nails was constructed of wood and metal nails.It helps to promote the release of the body's own pain-relieving and happiness hormones - endorphins and oxytocin- which help to release tension, create relaxation and promote a sense well-being.Acupressure mats were recently featured on the Dr. Oz Show where Dr. Oz showed some of the amazing benefits of using an acupressure mat! Basic positions target the back, stomach and hips.In a research study done by Dr. Zilberter,98% of the participants reported pain relief,96% reported relaxation, 94% improved sleep,81% reported an increase in energy levels after using acupressure mats.These acupressure mats are made from high quality materials, made without any glue, and feature 8820 contact points to help relax your back, neck, shoulders, and legs.The HemingWeigh Acupressure Matsare 29 x 17 x 1 inches in size.Warnings:Do not use an acupressure mat, or consult with your health care practitioner before using an acupressure mat, if you: Are pregnant, Have a blood disorder or are using anticoagulants, Suffer from epilepsy, or have sun burn, or open wounds.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51WTLvD30rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B005ZIBKK6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "HemingWeigh&reg;", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Yoga", "Mats"]], "price": 41.41}}
