{"item_id": "B0060B0ZGM", "title": "Ruger SP101 Speed Loader 8 Shot", "description": "Speed Loading is a Snap! Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? The Ruger SP101 8 Shot Speed Loader is fast and easy to use! Now your New Ruger SP101 8 shot 22lr revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and have more shooting satisfaction. When used with the optional speed blocks a simple push down on the speed loader clicks in 8 rounds.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click all your 8 empty chambers are full. These little honeys are made right here in the USA. Tough and durable ready to survive a fun day at the range. Load up the Ruger SP101 8 shot 22lr Speed Loader and head to the range and have loads of Fun!", "text": "Ruger SP101 Speed Loader 8 Shot Speed Loading is a Snap! Why load your revolver one cartridge at a time? The Ruger SP101 8 Shot Speed Loader is fast and easy to use! Now your New Ruger SP101 8 shot 22lr revolver can be as much fun to load as it is to shoot. Give a Speed Beez Speedloader a try and have more shooting satisfaction. When used with the optional speed blocks a simple push down on the speed loader clicks in 8 rounds.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click all your 8 empty chambers are full. These little honeys are made right here in the USA. Tough and durable ready to survive a fun day at the range. Load up the Ruger SP101 8 shot 22lr Speed Loader and head to the range and have loads of Fun!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41gbXVTXh9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0060B0ZGM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Magazine Loaders"]], "price": 29.99}}
