{"item_id": "B0060E7I78", "title": "TENRYU MAZ-021 Hand Forged Samurai Sword 41-Inch Overall", "description": "41\" Captain Nathan Algren Samurai Sword. Based on the sword used by the fictional American samurai! A.K.A. \"the last samurai\". Algren is a fictional U.S. Army captain who becomes engrossed in the culture of his samurai capturers. This 41\" Samurai Sword pays tribute to the story and makes an awesome showpiece for your collection. More: 41\" overall; 28\"-long hand-forged Captain Nathan Algren Tachi high-carbon steel blade, 7.5mm-thick; 11\" Japanese silk-wrapped tsuba with real ray skin; Zinc alloy tsunami tsuba; Black lacquer finish scabbard; Also includes cotton sword bag. Order yours today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. MAZ-021 Samurai Sword, 41\" Overall", "text": "TENRYU MAZ-021 Hand Forged Samurai Sword 41-Inch Overall 41\" Captain Nathan Algren Samurai Sword. Based on the sword used by the fictional American samurai! A.K.A. \"the last samurai\". Algren is a fictional U.S. Army captain who becomes engrossed in the culture of his samurai capturers. This 41\" Samurai Sword pays tribute to the story and makes an awesome showpiece for your collection. More: 41\" overall; 28\"-long hand-forged Captain Nathan Algren Tachi high-carbon steel blade, 7.5mm-thick; 11\" Japanese silk-wrapped tsuba with real ray skin; Zinc alloy tsunami tsuba; Black lacquer finish scabbard; Also includes cotton sword bag. Order yours today! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. MAZ-021 Samurai Sword, 41\" Overall", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31NebxaRhJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0060E7I78.jpg", "metadata": 