{"item_id": "B0060ZB8AA", "title": "RavX Fatty X Black Bar Ends", "description": "When riding a bicycle with a straight handle bar you have only one hand position. Within the first 5 miles of riding you start to suffer hand numbness and the discomfort increases with each passing mile. You try to hold the bar differently but you have no options. BAR ENDS offer hand relief! They give you an alternative hand position to relieve the pressure on your hands. They also allow you to get out of the saddle and over the bars, to stand on the pedals to push up a climb. RavX offers BAR ENDS in a wide range of shapes and sizes to suit different hand sizes and riding preferences. Short to long, round to teardrop and even oversized. Our BAR ENDS also come in different materials from cold forged one piece alloy, lightweight CNC 7050 alloy, or covered with Kraton rubber. It all comes down to your personal comfort and choice.", "text": "RavX Fatty X Black Bar Ends When riding a bicycle with a straight handle bar you have only one hand position. Within the first 5 miles of riding you start to suffer hand numbness and the discomfort increases with each passing mile. You try to hold the bar differently but you have no options. BAR ENDS offer hand relief! They give you an alternative hand position to relieve the pressure on your hands. They also allow you to get out of the saddle and over the bars, to stand on the pedals to push up a climb. RavX offers BAR ENDS in a wide range of shapes and sizes to suit different hand sizes and riding preferences. Short to long, round to teardrop and even oversized. Our BAR ENDS also come in different materials from cold forged one piece alloy, lightweight CNC 7050 alloy, or covered with Kraton rubber. It all comes down to your personal comfort and choice.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fWjW7UbUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0060ZB8AA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]], "price": 19.1}}
