{"item_id": "B00611XYXM", "title": "Innova DX Beast Golf Disc (Colors may vary)", "description": "The Beast is a long distance driver with a gliding, predictable finish. The Beast was an instant classic when it was released in 2002; giving players more distance using less power. The Beast’s high glide, high speed and high speed turn all combine to give big distance.", "text": "Innova DX Beast Golf Disc (Colors may vary) The Beast is a long distance driver with a gliding, predictable finish. The Beast was an instant classic when it was released in 2002; giving players more distance using less power. The Beast’s high glide, high speed and high speed turn all combine to give big distance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vLJnT47XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00611XYXM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00611Y8BE", "title": "Innova DX Valkyrie Golf Disc (Colors may vary)", "description": "The Valkyrie currently holds the World Distance Record at 820'. In lighter weights gives new players extra distance. Lighter weights also give players extreme range when thrown downwind, while maximum weights can give excellent upwind distance. The Valkyrie’s high speed turn and flight characteristics make it great choice for long range turnover shots and rollers.", "text": "Innova DX Valkyrie Golf Disc (Colors may vary) The Valkyrie currently holds the World Distance Record at 820'. In lighter weights gives new players extra distance. Lighter weights also give players extreme range when thrown downwind, while maximum weights can give excellent upwind distance. The Valkyrie’s high speed turn and flight characteristics make it great choice for long range turnover shots and rollers.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DmF-4oipL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00611Y8BE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Leisure Sports & Game Room", "Outdoor Games & Activities", "Disc Sports", "Disc Golf", "Discs", "Drivers"]]}}
