{"item_id": "B0061G5AW0", "title": "Condor Multi Wrap", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor Multi Wrap Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31d9zXHlmUL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061G5AW0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Accessories", "Hats & Caps", "Skull Caps"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B0061G5BRY", "title": "United Cutlery UC2836 M48 Ranger Hawk Axe with Compass", "description": "This M48 Ranger Hawk is the ultimate tactical tool. It is lightweight to be carried all day without added muscle fatigue and the blade of the M48 Ranger Hawk offers a wide, upswept axe blade for mammoth chopping, slashing and cutting potential. The axe head is constructed of precision cast 2Cr13 stainless steel. When combined with the backside of the head, the spike and axe head make for an efficient personal defense and breaching tool as well as a great camping tool with an extremely fast chopping edge. The blade is securely attached to the sturdy nylon reinforced handle with 30-Percent fiberglass, with three separate bolts and black nylon cord wrapping. It comes complete with a nylon snap button sheath that also houses the included directional compass.", "text": "United Cutlery UC2836 M48 Ranger Hawk Axe with Compass This M48 Ranger Hawk is the ultimate tactical tool. It is lightweight to be carried all day without added muscle fatigue and the blade of the M48 Ranger Hawk offers a wide, upswept axe blade for mammoth chopping, slashing and cutting potential. The axe head is constructed of precision cast 2Cr13 stainless steel. When combined with the backside of the head, the spike and axe head make for an efficient personal defense and breaching tool as well as a great camping tool with an extremely fast chopping edge. The blade is securely attached to the sturdy nylon reinforced handle with 30-Percent fiberglass, with three separate bolts and black nylon cord wrapping. It comes complete with a nylon snap button sheath that also houses the included directional compass.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416MLOLSlDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061G5BRY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "United Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Axes"]], "price": 42.7}}
{"item_id": "B0061G5I9U", "title": "Condor Edc Bag", "description": "Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "text": "Condor Edc Bag Condor Outdoor Products, Inc specialize in tactical vest, plate carrier, modular pouches, packs...etc. With over 20 years of experience in the tactical/outdoor gear industry, Condor offers all the essential gear for any mission while saving you money.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LD88phUTL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061G5I9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Bow Maintenance Accessories"]], "price": 39.02}}
{"item_id": "B0061LS2SY", "title": "Japanese Sword Choji Oil", "description": "For many centuries, the Japanese Samurai have used fine grade Choji Oil just like this to protect their priceless swords from rusting, corroding and pitting for centuries. It can be used to protect all of your fine steel tools from rusting and pitting, especially those with a sharp cutting edge, such as Gardening Tools & Wood Working Tools.", "text": "Japanese Sword Choji Oil For many centuries, the Japanese Samurai have used fine grade Choji Oil just like this to protect their priceless swords from rusting, corroding and pitting for centuries. It can be used to protect all of your fine steel tools from rusting and pitting, especially those with a sharp cutting edge, such as Gardening Tools & Wood Working Tools.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41HySuMhSgL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061LS2SY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons", "Practice Swords"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B0061LW0PK", "title": "Kershaw RJII Serrated Speedsafe Knife", "description": "The Kershaw Serrated RJ II (#1980ST) is a slightly smaller version of the RJI. It has all the features of its bigger brother, including SpeedSafe® assisted opening, but with a shorter blade length. It’s more compact, just as cool. Partial blade serration adds versatility. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw RJII Serrated Speedsafe Knife The Kershaw Serrated RJ II (#1980ST) is a slightly smaller version of the RJI. It has all the features of its bigger brother, including SpeedSafe® assisted opening, but with a shorter blade length. It’s more compact, just as cool. Partial blade serration adds versatility. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/3151RgtrWoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061LW0PK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 23.76}}
{"item_id": "B0061NB31K", "title": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L MARPAT Digital Woodland Camo", "description": "This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "text": "Mil-Tec Military Army Patrol Molle Assault Pack Tactical Combat Rucksack Backpack Bag 36L MARPAT Digital Woodland Camo This heavy duty and water-resistant 36 liters assault pack features 2 large compartments with various zip and mesh inner pockets and 2 small front pockets (one with organizer), as well as a built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack. All compartments are closed with sturdy 2-way zippers. Ergonomically designed shoulder straps are padded, about 5cm wide and adjustable in length. Moreover the pack goes with a padded back and an adjustable waist strap opened with a clip.The pack allows for volume control and baggage fixation thanks to a number of a lateral compression straps and gives a possibility to attached additional equipment through a number of robust nylon MOLLE straps all-round, and loops and D-rings on shoulder straps.The pack offers a great amount of carrying space and is perfect for military as well as camping and hiking.* Capacity: 36L* 2 separate compartments* 2 front pockets* All pockets with a 2-way zipper* Built-in Velcro pocket for a hydro pack* Adjustable padded shoulder straps* Padded back* Adjustable hip belt* Lateral compression straps* Various MOLLE attachment points* Loops and D-rings on shoulder straps* Material: 600D polyester, PVC coated* Dimensions: approx. 51x29x28cm* Weight: 1400g* Water-resistant* Manufacturer: Mil-Tec* The best in fashion and comfort* Finished to high standard* Brand new, never worn, high quality product in Mint Condition!* Extremely Durable army product* Retail Price $79.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51aY55hO7eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061NB31K.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs", "Tactical Backpacks"]], "price": 59.95}}
{"item_id": "B0061NZJOM", "title": "Browning 124 BL Pandemonium Folding Knife", "description": "Pandemonium folder. Blade steel 440. Black oxide Blade finish. 3 1/2\". Blade length. 7 3/4\" Over all length. Handle made of G-10. 4 way adjusted Sheath/pocket clip. Liner lock", "text": "Browning 124 BL Pandemonium Folding Knife Pandemonium folder. Blade steel 440. Black oxide Blade finish. 3 1/2\". Blade length. 7 3/4\" Over all length. Handle made of G-10. 4 way adjusted Sheath/pocket clip. Liner lock", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31s75Kq3DRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061NZJOM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Browning", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 22.05}}
{"item_id": "B0061PWBLY", "title": "223 5.56 Aluminum Upper and Lower Vise Block Combo set", "description": "Best design available because the magazine lock is on both side of the block. It will lock going into the top or through the bottom. It also has a rigid stop so a \"bare\" receiver can be held in a vise without sliding down and hitting the metal vise jaws. Our lower block will also clear the bolt so the complete rifle can be held in the vise.", "text": "223 5.56 Aluminum Upper and Lower Vise Block Combo set Best design available because the magazine lock is on both side of the block. It will lock going into the top or through the bottom. It also has a rigid stop so a \"bare\" receiver can be held in a vise without sliding down and hitting the metal vise jaws. Our lower block will also clear the bolt so the complete rifle can be held in the vise.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BGJc4ppQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061PWBLY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.94}}
{"item_id": "B0061WI5GM", "title": "Condor Crye Precision Licensed MOLLE Triple Stacker (6 Mag) M4 Mag Pouch (Multicam Pattern)", "description": "Your most essential M4 mag pouch now comes in open top and in triple stacker! Holds up to 6 M4 / M16 standard magazines.", "text": "Condor Crye Precision Licensed MOLLE Triple Stacker (6 Mag) M4 Mag Pouch (Multicam Pattern) Your most essential M4 mag pouch now comes in open top and in triple stacker! Holds up to 6 M4 / M16 standard magazines.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2Bdq3Edn9L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0061WI5GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Perfect Home Station", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 36.15}}
