{"item_id": "B00620Z8M2", "title": "Philips BF48L20BBLX1 SafeRide Black LED Battery Driven BikeLight", "description": "The Philips SafeRide LED Bike Light is powered by 2 high-power Philips Luxeon LEDs housed in an optimized reflector design, providing you with beam distances of 200 feet. It is equipped with long lasting LED technology and two modes; city-eco mode lasting up to 8 hours, and a high-power mode that lasts up to 2 hours. The robust waterproof aluminum housing ensures optimal operation during all weather conditions. This product is backed by a one-year Philips warranty.", "text": "Philips BF48L20BBLX1 SafeRide Black LED Battery Driven BikeLight The Philips SafeRide LED Bike Light is powered by 2 high-power Philips Luxeon LEDs housed in an optimized reflector design, providing you with beam distances of 200 feet. It is equipped with long lasting LED technology and two modes; city-eco mode lasting up to 8 hours, and a high-power mode that lasts up to 2 hours. The robust waterproof aluminum housing ensures optimal operation during all weather conditions. This product is backed by a one-year Philips warranty.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41u9hYsHWwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00620Z8M2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Philips", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 93.8}}
