{"item_id": "B0062CB360", "title": "GEN 4 Slug Plug Glock 17 19 22 23 31 34 35 *Fits only Generation 4*", "description": "This grip plug is for full size & compact Gen 4 GLOCKS secures in the frame utilizing the lanyard hole. It will keep dirt and debris out of the trigger area as well as help lead the magazine into the mag well. The Gen4 grip plug works on the following Gen4 GLOCKS: 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 35, and 37. PLEASE NOTE: This grip plug will NOT install on a Gen 4 that is using any of the additional backstraps.", "text": "GEN 4 Slug Plug Glock 17 19 22 23 31 34 35 *Fits only Generation 4* This grip plug is for full size & compact Gen 4 GLOCKS secures in the frame utilizing the lanyard hole. It will keep dirt and debris out of the trigger area as well as help lead the magazine into the mag well. The Gen4 grip plug works on the following Gen4 GLOCKS: 17, 19, 22, 23, 31, 35, and 37. PLEASE NOTE: This grip plug will NOT install on a Gen 4 that is using any of the additional backstraps.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41XvJchoWcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0062CB360.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Sure Plug", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 8.75}}
