{"item_id": "B0062O7B4Q", "title": "Rail Kit for Elzetta ZSM Flashlight mount", "description": "Aluminum Mil-Std 1913 Picatinny Rail Accessory Kit for ZSM/ZSM-T Mounts RAIL KIT ONLY, Mount not included. Requires mounting kit ZSM or ZSM-T, sold separately.", "text": "Rail Kit for Elzetta ZSM Flashlight mount Aluminum Mil-Std 1913 Picatinny Rail Accessory Kit for ZSM/ZSM-T Mounts RAIL KIT ONLY, Mount not included. Requires mounting kit ZSM or ZSM-T, sold separately.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EjcSNrJYL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0062O7B4Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 17.95}}
{"item_id": "B0062ORZSS", "title": "Cap Barbell Fitness Vinyl Kettlebell (Black)", "description": "Kettlebell training develops strength, power, endurance and balance. Working out with kettlebells will sculpt and tone the entire body because lifting and controlling a kettlebell forces the entire body, and specifically the core, to contract as a group, building both strength and stability at the same time. They are a great option for getting a whole body workout in a short time. Made with a protective vinyl shell to prevent wear and tear. These kettlebells are cement filled and vinyl coated, providing a more economical choice over the tradtional cast iron made kettlebells.", "text": "Cap Barbell Fitness Vinyl Kettlebell (Black) Kettlebell training develops strength, power, endurance and balance. Working out with kettlebells will sculpt and tone the entire body because lifting and controlling a kettlebell forces the entire body, and specifically the core, to contract as a group, building both strength and stability at the same time. They are a great option for getting a whole body workout in a short time. Made with a protective vinyl shell to prevent wear and tear. These kettlebells are cement filled and vinyl coated, providing a more economical choice over the tradtional cast iron made kettlebells.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eiY96zj3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0062ORZSS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Kettlebells"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0062Q46SS", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Original Army Surplus USGI US Military Issued Woodland Camo Camouflage Enhanced Load Bearing Tactical Vest", "description": "This is a Current U.S. Government issue Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest. It has two main pouches on each side that will hold two M16 magazines each, below that is a pouch designed to hold one grenade. The padded shoulder straps are adjustable and there are two adjustable buckles on the front. The webbing on each side is also adjustable. At the bottom there are loops to secure this to your belt. These have been stored for a while but do not appear to have been issued to troops, so they are in great shape.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Original Army Surplus USGI US Military Issued Woodland Camo Camouflage Enhanced Load Bearing Tactical Vest This is a Current U.S. Government issue Enhanced Tactical Load Bearing Vest. It has two main pouches on each side that will hold two M16 magazines each, below that is a pouch designed to hold one grenade. The padded shoulder straps are adjustable and there are two adjustable buckles on the front. The webbing on each side is also adjustable. At the bottom there are loops to secure this to your belt. These have been stored for a while but do not appear to have been issued to troops, so they are in great shape.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jWY-XlW0L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0062Q46SS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]], "price": 49.98}}
