{"item_id": "B0063GT330", "title": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media Bag, 15-Pound", "description": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "text": "Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media Bag, 15-Pound Frankford Arsenal Corn Cob Brass Cleaning Media has been designed to quickly and efficiently remove dirt, grit and powder residue from brass cases before reloading to keep reloading dies in top working condition. Media can be used repeatedly, but should be replaced periodically for optimum performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bg-Zok3XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0063GT330.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frankford Arsenal", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 19.89}}
