{"item_id": "B0063KUEHU", "title": "Ruger SP101 4 Banger Loading Block", "description": "With a Loading Block for the New Ruger SP101 8 Shot Speedloader you can pre-stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 8 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 8 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Four Banger speed block holds 32 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 8 rounds in your Speedloader and 32 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 40 rounds ready to snap into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it. Loads of fun!", "text": "Ruger SP101 4 Banger Loading Block With a Loading Block for the New Ruger SP101 8 Shot Speedloader you can pre-stage your rounds for some fast and fun shooting. A simple push down on the Speedloader clicks in 8 rounds in less than 1 second.... transfer them to the cylinder.... push again and click your 8 empty chambers are full. The average person with a little practice can be reloading their revolver in less than 5 seconds. The Four Banger speed block holds 32 rounds of 22 Long Rifle. If you load 8 rounds in your Speedloader and 32 rounds in the loading block you'll have a total of 40 rounds ready to snap into your revolver. Buy one today and see how fast you can empty it. Loads of fun!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41EqsBJadbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0063KUEHU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B0063NDCGW", "title": "Molten FLISTATEC® Volleyball - Official NCAA Men's Volleyball, Red/White/Blue", "description": "The Molten NCAA FLISTATEC Volleyball is the official volleyball of the NCAA Men's Volleyball Championships and is the volleyball of choice for numerous collegiate conferences and programs across the nation. Expect exceptional, top of the line performance including increased visibility, enhanced flight stability and more accurate overhand passing and sets. By optimizing the air-current around the ball in flight and enhancing grip, Molten's FLISTATEC Flight Stability Technology delivers athletes the control and consistency that they demand with every contact.", "text": "Molten FLISTATEC® Volleyball - Official NCAA Men's Volleyball, Red/White/Blue The Molten NCAA FLISTATEC Volleyball is the official volleyball of the NCAA Men's Volleyball Championships and is the volleyball of choice for numerous collegiate conferences and programs across the nation. Expect exceptional, top of the line performance including increased visibility, enhanced flight stability and more accurate overhand passing and sets. By optimizing the air-current around the ball in flight and enhancing grip, Molten's FLISTATEC Flight Stability Technology delivers athletes the control and consistency that they demand with every contact.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DTwyJXiZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0063NDCGW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Molten", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Team Sports", "Volleyball", "Volleyballs", "Indoor Volleyballs"]], "price": 48.5}}
{"item_id": "B0063W6ZM6", "title": "Carlisle Value Kayak Paddle, 240-cm, (2 piece paddle)", "description": "The Carlisle Value paddle is a great paddle for beginners or for use as a backup. The Value kayak paddle has symmetric polyethylene blades and a durable aluminum shaft. Ergonomic foam grips are included. The push-button take down allows blades to be feathered at 60-degrees or inline, for right- and left-hand control.", "text": "Carlisle Value Kayak Paddle, 240-cm, (2 piece paddle) The Carlisle Value paddle is a great paddle for beginners or for use as a backup. The Value kayak paddle has symmetric polyethylene blades and a durable aluminum shaft. Ergonomic foam grips are included. The push-button take down allows blades to be feathered at 60-degrees or inline, for right- and left-hand control.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21r0SOZh1pL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0063W6ZM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Carlisle", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns"]], "price": 34.2}}
{"item_id": "B0064C878A", "title": "Mil-Comm Three-Step Gun Care Kit - NRA® Licensed Gun Care System", "description": "NRA TW25B light synthetic grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide because it performs so well under so many conditions. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies as well as many leading firearms manufacturers, weapons professionals and gun enthusiasts throughout the world. 0.75 ounce bottle", "text": "Mil-Comm Three-Step Gun Care Kit - NRA® Licensed Gun Care System NRA TW25B light synthetic grease is Mil-Comm Products' original formula and a top selling firearms lubricant worldwide because it performs so well under so many conditions. Its exceptional performance in adverse conditions has made this weapons lubricant the choice of the U.S. Military and its Allies as well as many leading firearms manufacturers, weapons professionals and gun enthusiasts throughout the world. 0.75 ounce bottle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Mx249uvwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064C878A.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mil-Comm", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 16.99}}
{"item_id": "B0064DPLMY", "title": "Serious Steel 41\" Pull-Up Band | CrossFit Band | Power-Lifting, Stretch & Resistance Band | Great for Assisted Pull-ups & Resistance Training! (Single Band)", "description": "SALE IS FOR A SINGLE BAND AND NOT A SET. THE BAND BEING PURCHASED IS REFERENCED IN THE IMAGE. Increase the weight you lift by using weight lifting and powerlifting bands. These bands are an excellent addition to your workouts. Steel Bands are not just for powerlifting, these are great for all sports related weight lifting training and workouts to include fitness and every day working out. Steel Bands come in SIX different resistance levels for any type of user and activity.Great for all pulling and pushing movements when you lift. Overload your squats or use these for assisted chin-ups. These bands can stretch up to 2.5 times it's original length! These bands are made using a continuous 15-layer strip of rubber latex! Don't be fooled by the cheap Chinese bands that snap and break easily. These bands are guaranteed from snapping/breaking for 90 days! There are countless exercises for these bands. Regardless of your fitness level, these things are guaranteed to help you reach your exercise and fitness goals. *Shades and colors may vary based on inventory and customer recommendations*", "text": "Serious Steel 41\" Pull-Up Band | CrossFit Band | Power-Lifting, Stretch & Resistance Band | Great for Assisted Pull-ups & Resistance Training! (Single Band) SALE IS FOR A SINGLE BAND AND NOT A SET. THE BAND BEING PURCHASED IS REFERENCED IN THE IMAGE. Increase the weight you lift by using weight lifting and powerlifting bands. These bands are an excellent addition to your workouts. Steel Bands are not just for powerlifting, these are great for all sports related weight lifting training and workouts to include fitness and every day working out. Steel Bands come in SIX different resistance levels for any type of user and activity.Great for all pulling and pushing movements when you lift. Overload your squats or use these for assisted chin-ups. These bands can stretch up to 2.5 times it's original length! These bands are made using a continuous 15-layer strip of rubber latex! Don't be fooled by the cheap Chinese bands that snap and break easily. These bands are guaranteed from snapping/breaking for 90 days! There are countless exercises for these bands. Regardless of your fitness level, these things are guaranteed to help you reach your exercise and fitness goals. *Shades and colors may vary based on inventory and customer recommendations*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31grpk8HrrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064DPLMY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 11.99}}
{"item_id": "B0064E1JR4", "title": "#3 Pull-Up / CrossFit Size: 1.125\" x 4.5mm Resistance: 20-80lbs", "description": "Increase the weight you lift by using weight lifting and powerlifting bands. These bands are an excellent addition to your workouts. Steel Bands are not just for powerlifting, these are great for all sports related weight lifting training and workouts to include fitness and every day working out. Steel Bands come in SIX different resistance levels for any type of user and activity.Great for all pulling and pushing movements when you lift. Overload your squats or use these for assisted chin-ups. These bands can stretch up to 2.5 times it's original length! These bands are made using a continuous 15-layer strip of rubber latex! Don't be fooled by the cheap chinease bands that snap and break easily. These bands are guarnteed from snapping/breaking ofr 90 days! *This sale is for a single band based on the option/color selected above*", "text": "#3 Pull-Up / CrossFit Size: 1.125\" x 4.5mm Resistance: 20-80lbs Increase the weight you lift by using weight lifting and powerlifting bands. These bands are an excellent addition to your workouts. Steel Bands are not just for powerlifting, these are great for all sports related weight lifting training and workouts to include fitness and every day working out. Steel Bands come in SIX different resistance levels for any type of user and activity.Great for all pulling and pushing movements when you lift. Overload your squats or use these for assisted chin-ups. These bands can stretch up to 2.5 times it's original length! These bands are made using a continuous 15-layer strip of rubber latex! Don't be fooled by the cheap chinease bands that snap and break easily. These bands are guarnteed from snapping/breaking ofr 90 days! *This sale is for a single band based on the option/color selected above*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bzOFKfjpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064E1JR4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0064FH4D6", "title": "Black Crystal Hiking Ski Snow Gaiters Waterproof Breathable Nylon Men's Black Size Large", "description": "These hiking gaiters are essential for hiking, walking, backpacking, and skiing. They are made with durable waterproof materials to sustain harsh weather and to keep rocks, dirt and snow from getting into your footwear. Size: Large (Fit US shoe size 10.5-12/EUR 44-46). Front length: 15.5 inch. Top circumference: 18 inch. Calf circumference: 17.7 inch. Weight: 8-9 oz/pair. Check our other listings for small, medium and extra large size.", "text": "Black Crystal Hiking Ski Snow Gaiters Waterproof Breathable Nylon Men's Black Size Large These hiking gaiters are essential for hiking, walking, backpacking, and skiing. They are made with durable waterproof materials to sustain harsh weather and to keep rocks, dirt and snow from getting into your footwear. Size: Large (Fit US shoe size 10.5-12/EUR 44-46). Front length: 15.5 inch. Top circumference: 18 inch. Calf circumference: 17.7 inch. Weight: 8-9 oz/pair. Check our other listings for small, medium and extra large size.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SKSNMusJL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064FH4D6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Black Crystal Outdoor Equipment", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing"]], "price": 26.99}}
{"item_id": "B0064N57DW", "title": "BudK High Tech Survivor 3 Piece Neck Knife Set", "description": "This set of three neck knives features full tang construction of black anodized AUS-6 stainless steel with razor sharp 3 1/8 inch blades and ABS handles. The impact resistant sheaths each hold the knife firmly in place and includes nylon neck cords for lightweight transport. 6 7/8 inch each ov.", "text": "BudK High Tech Survivor 3 Piece Neck Knife Set This set of three neck knives features full tang construction of black anodized AUS-6 stainless steel with razor sharp 3 1/8 inch blades and ABS handles. The impact resistant sheaths each hold the knife firmly in place and includes nylon neck cords for lightweight transport. 6 7/8 inch each ov.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yossxUQhL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064N57DW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Bud K", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 13.95}}
{"item_id": "B0064OAIDA", "title": "40 Pack - 10x16\" Reactive Splatter Target 5 Bulls-eyes Per Target - Multicolor - Total of 200 Targets on All 40 Sheets", "description": "GlowShot 10x16 Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10x16 Targets come in 20 and 40 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "40 Pack - 10x16\" Reactive Splatter Target 5 Bulls-eyes Per Target - Multicolor - Total of 200 Targets on All 40 Sheets GlowShot 10x16 Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10x16 Targets come in 20 and 40 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511HIdvSh6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064OAIDA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 25.0}}
{"item_id": "B0064OCEUU", "title": "20 Pack - 10x16\" Reactive Splatter Target 5 Bulls-eyes Per Target - Multicolor - Total of 100 Targets on All 20 Sheets", "description": "GlowShot 10x16 Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10x16 Targets come in 20 and 40 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "text": "20 Pack - 10x16\" Reactive Splatter Target 5 Bulls-eyes Per Target - Multicolor - Total of 100 Targets on All 20 Sheets GlowShot 10x16 Multi Color Reactive Targets. You will \"See Your Hits Instantly.\" These targets use GlowShot Technology to produce a colored ring around your hits. No more walking down range or picking a spotting scope to see your hits. Each colored ring represents 1 inch from the center. These targets are made of a heavy duty reinforced tag board to withstand dozens of shots. Attach the target to any surface. When you are done shooting, you can remove the target and take it home for analysis or bragging rights. 10x16 Targets come in 20 and 40 Packs. - Search GlowShot for all our 6\", 8\", 10\" and 10\"x16\" Target Sizes and Packs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511HIdvSh6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064OCEUU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GlowShot Targets", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 19.69}}
{"item_id": "B0064OOS86", "title": "GoFit Gravity Straps Suspended Body Weight Training System with Carry Bag and Bob Harper Training DVD", "description": "The Bob Harper Gravity Straps harness your body weight, making it all the resistance you need for a variety of total-body exercises. This ideal fitness tool installs into your doorway in seconds with no hardware, offering a super-effective workout that's ultra convenient to use at home and when traveling. Join Bob Harper in his included DVD, as he instructs, coaches and motivates you to build strength, increase your balance and gain core stability for a better lifestyle.", "text": "GoFit Gravity Straps Suspended Body Weight Training System with Carry Bag and Bob Harper Training DVD The Bob Harper Gravity Straps harness your body weight, making it all the resistance you need for a variety of total-body exercises. This ideal fitness tool installs into your doorway in seconds with no hardware, offering a super-effective workout that's ultra convenient to use at home and when traveling. Join Bob Harper in his included DVD, as he instructs, coaches and motivates you to build strength, increase your balance and gain core stability for a better lifestyle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JKYcEhh2L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064OOS86.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0064OQNKM", "title": "OEM Matte Black Steel SKS Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With 1\" Rings", "description": "No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "text": "OEM Matte Black Steel SKS Rifle See Through Receiver Cover Replacement High Profile Tactical Scope Weaver Picatinny Rail Mount Complete With 1\" Rings No Drilling Tapping Or Alteration To The Rifle Required Whatsoever - Simply Replaces The Existing Receiver Cover. Most users will be able to install this mount in under a minute without any modification. Due to the many variants on some SKS rifles, the front prongs on this mount may need to be slightly filed in order to achieve a perfect secure fit on your SKS rifle. Those prongs are intentionally made to be slightly longer in order to accommodate all the SKS variants. DO NOT OVER FILE, only a minimal amount of filing would be required. File just a bit, check the fit, repeat if necessary but only 1-2 filing strokes. File at the same angle of the mount prongs to maintain their angle and shape and this mount will work great and fit properly on your SKS.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418F3XkHDRL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064OQNKM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "OEM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 23.95}}
{"item_id": "B0064Q0H2U", "title": "Recoil Buffer", "description": "Recoil Buffer for the pistol eliminates the metal slide from impacting the polymer frame. This repeated impact batters the frame where the two parts come into contact. Stopping this battering is accomplished by inserting the buffer between the recoil spring and the slide. Each time the action is worked or the weapon is fired the buffer comes into contact with the frame, not the metal slide. Installation of the Recoil Buffer will result in reduced felt recoil, enhanced muzzle control and a longer service life. The Recoil Buffer will fit models 17, 17L, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24C, 31, 32, and 37. What Is A Recoil Buffer?? What Can It Do For Your Gun? A Recoil Buffer is designed to cushion the trauma your bolt and receiver experience during normal cartridge discharge. Each carefully designed buffer is made from a polyurethane with specific shock-absorbing properties. When it is placed between the bolt and what it slams against at the extreme range of its travel, the buffer acts as a gentle cushion. Without the buffer, the bolt is driven backwards to make direct violent contact with another piece of steel. In time, this pounding takes its toll. The gun becomes less accurate and the action becomes dangerously loose.", "text": "Recoil Buffer Recoil Buffer for the pistol eliminates the metal slide from impacting the polymer frame. This repeated impact batters the frame where the two parts come into contact. Stopping this battering is accomplished by inserting the buffer between the recoil spring and the slide. Each time the action is worked or the weapon is fired the buffer comes into contact with the frame, not the metal slide. Installation of the Recoil Buffer will result in reduced felt recoil, enhanced muzzle control and a longer service life. The Recoil Buffer will fit models 17, 17L, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24C, 31, 32, and 37. What Is A Recoil Buffer?? What Can It Do For Your Gun? A Recoil Buffer is designed to cushion the trauma your bolt and receiver experience during normal cartridge discharge. Each carefully designed buffer is made from a polyurethane with specific shock-absorbing properties. When it is placed between the bolt and what it slams against at the extreme range of its travel, the buffer acts as a gentle cushion. Without the buffer, the bolt is driven backwards to make direct violent contact with another piece of steel. In time, this pounding takes its toll. The gun becomes less accurate and the action becomes dangerously loose.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TIhW5DxuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064Q0H2U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Generic", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Recoil Pads"]], "price": 7.98}}
{"item_id": "B0064QDMJ0", "title": "Esee Knives Izula II DT Desert Tan Blade Light Green Handles", "description": "Esee Knives Izula II DT 6 3/4\" overall. 3\" Desert Tan powder coated 1095 high carbon steel blade. Full tang. Desert tan canvas micarta handles. Oversized lanyard hole. Black injection molded sheath with lashing holes. Includes survival information card.", "text": "Esee Knives Izula II DT Desert Tan Blade Light Green Handles Esee Knives Izula II DT 6 3/4\" overall. 3\" Desert Tan powder coated 1095 high carbon steel blade. Full tang. Desert tan canvas micarta handles. Oversized lanyard hole. Black injection molded sheath with lashing holes. Includes survival information card.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Tw%2B56vb3L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064QDMJ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ESEE", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 69.99}}
{"item_id": "B0064SR6SG", "title": "Kershaw 1985ST RJI Serrated Folding SpeedSafe Knife", "description": "Designed by RJ Martin, the RJ I’s blade design and grind provides a moderately curved belly with plenty of slicing power, plus a flat-ground tanto tip that’s significantly thicker than comparable tantos. The result is an über-strong tip that takes on the toughest piercing tasks with no fear. The RJ I (#1985ST) features 3-D machined G-10 handles with a stainless-steel liner lock on the back only, making it a lightweight carry. It opens easily with SpeedSafe® assisted opening with a handy flipper or thumbstud and carries tip-up or tip-down for right-handers and tip-up for lefties. Partial blade serration adds cutting power for tough jobs. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "text": "Kershaw 1985ST RJI Serrated Folding SpeedSafe Knife Designed by RJ Martin, the RJ I’s blade design and grind provides a moderately curved belly with plenty of slicing power, plus a flat-ground tanto tip that’s significantly thicker than comparable tantos. The result is an über-strong tip that takes on the toughest piercing tasks with no fear. The RJ I (#1985ST) features 3-D machined G-10 handles with a stainless-steel liner lock on the back only, making it a lightweight carry. It opens easily with SpeedSafe® assisted opening with a handy flipper or thumbstud and carries tip-up or tip-down for right-handers and tip-up for lefties. Partial blade serration adds cutting power for tough jobs. Since the company's founding in 1974, Kershaw Knives has been dedicated to quality. This has led to a worldwide reputation for performance and innovation in tools and knives. From state-of-the-art manufacturing to advanced materials, customers rely on Kershaw for products that provide \"technology with an edge\". Today, Kershaw is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Kai Corporation, which has been in business for more than 90 years. Kai Corporation is Japan's premier blade producer. Their innovative approach to product development has resulted in more than 10,000 superior products. Kershaw products are guaranteed for the lifetime of the original owner to be free of defects when received from the factory. Any product we find to be defective in its original material, construction, or workmanship will be repaired or replaced with the same item or one of equal value at no charge. Normal wear, abuse, or neglect are excluded from this non-transferable warranty. For warranty service, please return product via UPS or insured mail. Include your name, address, telephone number, proof of purchase (sales slip) and a short explanation of the warranty service requested to Kai USA Ltd. 18600 SW Teton Avenue, Tualatin, OR 97062.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aAg5ZoblL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064SR6SG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Kershaw", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 29.94}}
{"item_id": "B0064UYCE0", "title": "Slip2000 Gun Lubricant Trigger Spray, 16-Ounce", "description": "Slip 2000 Gun Lubricant was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and repetitive shooting firearms, black powder guns, shotguns, riffles, pistols and airsoft guns. Slip 2000 Gun Lubricant contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. It penetrates the micro-pores of the metal surfaces bonding itself to the metal allowing lubrication from within the metal itself.", "text": "Slip2000 Gun Lubricant Trigger Spray, 16-Ounce Slip 2000 Gun Lubricant was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and repetitive shooting firearms, black powder guns, shotguns, riffles, pistols and airsoft guns. Slip 2000 Gun Lubricant contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. It penetrates the micro-pores of the metal surfaces bonding itself to the metal allowing lubrication from within the metal itself.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TUKrTc6JL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064UYCE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 25.75}}
{"item_id": "B0064V8J8E", "title": "Slip2000 EWL30 Twist Top, 4-Ounce", "description": "EWL-30 has the same properties as our original EWL but with an additional carrying agent that makes a thicker, heavier weight (30) lubricant. Slip 2000 EWL-30 was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWL-30 contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. It penetrates the micro-pores of the metal surfaces bonding itself to the metal allowing lubrication from within the metal itself.", "text": "Slip2000 EWL30 Twist Top, 4-Ounce EWL-30 has the same properties as our original EWL but with an additional carrying agent that makes a thicker, heavier weight (30) lubricant. Slip 2000 EWL-30 was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWL-30 contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. It penetrates the micro-pores of the metal surfaces bonding itself to the metal allowing lubrication from within the metal itself.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31wUCANwEmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064V8J8E.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 17.2}}
{"item_id": "B0064VEUNM", "title": "Slip2000 EWG Syringe Applicator", "description": "Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "text": "Slip2000 EWG Syringe Applicator Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B%2BQoLEJ5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VEUNM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 10.85}}
{"item_id": "B0064VFTV4", "title": "Slip2000 EWG Lube, 1.5-Ounce", "description": "Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "text": "Slip2000 EWG Lube, 1.5-Ounce Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XjZgFhAQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VFTV4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B0064VHKTI", "title": "Slip2000 EWG Lube, 4-Ounce", "description": "Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "text": "Slip2000 EWG Lube, 4-Ounce Slip 2000 Extreme Weapons Grease (EWG) was formulated especially for use on automatic rapid-fire and machine gun, riffles and pistols. Slip 2000 EWG contains an exclusive metal treatment designed to control friction, which reduces heat and eliminates excessive wear. Same properties as our EWL but in a thicker non-migrating grease formula.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oU-H7QJzL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VHKTI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Lubrication"]], "price": 16.25}}
{"item_id": "B0064VN61Y", "title": "Slip2000 Carbon Killer Bore Cleaner Twist Top, 4-Ounce", "description": "Carbon Killer removes carbon on contact. Use in chambers and barrels as a bore cleaner. Apply to cylinder faces, bolt faces and any other hard to clean areas and allow to soak for 2 to 10 minutes. Carbon, lead, copper, plastic and burnt powder will wipe clean with a nylon brush. Next cleaning will be much easier if used with a Slip 2000 Lubricant. Users will actually be able to wipe carbon and plastic wad fouling away.", "text": "Slip2000 Carbon Killer Bore Cleaner Twist Top, 4-Ounce Carbon Killer removes carbon on contact. Use in chambers and barrels as a bore cleaner. Apply to cylinder faces, bolt faces and any other hard to clean areas and allow to soak for 2 to 10 minutes. Carbon, lead, copper, plastic and burnt powder will wipe clean with a nylon brush. Next cleaning will be much easier if used with a Slip 2000 Lubricant. Users will actually be able to wipe carbon and plastic wad fouling away.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41RfdzyrPyL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VN61Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 10.75}}
{"item_id": "B0064VQ0TO", "title": "Slip2000 725 Gun Cleaner Pump Spray, 4-Ounce", "description": "725 Gun Cleaner should truly be called \"Super Degreaser\" judging from the way it out-performs competitive products. This cleaner will cut through the toughest cosmoline, carbon, grease and grime. Its super strength allows it to degum and degunk the dirtiest of gun parts when sprayed on or used in parts washers or solvent tanks.", "text": "Slip2000 725 Gun Cleaner Pump Spray, 4-Ounce 725 Gun Cleaner should truly be called \"Super Degreaser\" judging from the way it out-performs competitive products. This cleaner will cut through the toughest cosmoline, carbon, grease and grime. Its super strength allows it to degum and degunk the dirtiest of gun parts when sprayed on or used in parts washers or solvent tanks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MQFld0AfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VQ0TO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 9.65}}
{"item_id": "B0064VRRAU", "title": "Slip2000 725 Gun Cleaner Trigger Spray, 16-Ounce", "description": "725 Gun Cleaner should truly be called \"Super Degreaser\" judging from the way it out-performs competitive products. This cleaner will cut through the toughest cosmoline, carbon, grease and grime. Its super strength allows it to degum and degunk the dirtiest of gun parts when sprayed on or used in parts washers or solvent tanks.", "text": "Slip2000 725 Gun Cleaner Trigger Spray, 16-Ounce 725 Gun Cleaner should truly be called \"Super Degreaser\" judging from the way it out-performs competitive products. This cleaner will cut through the toughest cosmoline, carbon, grease and grime. Its super strength allows it to degum and degunk the dirtiest of gun parts when sprayed on or used in parts washers or solvent tanks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41D3SFU8EqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064VRRAU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Slip2000", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Solvents"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B0064Y3ORC", "title": "Danskin Women's Seven Inch Bike Short", "description": "", "text": "Danskin Women's Seven Inch Bike Short", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aDYoHXCHL._SX342_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0064Y3ORC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Women", "Shorts"], ["Clothing, Shoes & Jewelry", "Women", "Clothing", "Active", "Active Shorts"]]}}
