{"item_id": "B00655B91S", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Sportac Goggles", "description": "These Sportac Goggles by Voodoo Tactical are high performance eyewear used by military personnel and civilians alike. Features include a padded foam seal, adjustable strap, UV 400 protection and shatter & scratch resistant polycarbonate lenses. Made for the avid outdoorsman. Measures 2\" x 6.4\" x 0.5\"", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Sportac Goggles These Sportac Goggles by Voodoo Tactical are high performance eyewear used by military personnel and civilians alike. Features include a padded foam seal, adjustable strap, UV 400 protection and shatter & scratch resistant polycarbonate lenses. Made for the avid outdoorsman. Measures 2\" x 6.4\" x 0.5\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KXC5dUofL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00655B91S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Goggles"]], "price": 11.95}}
{"item_id": "B00655CM14", "title": "Blood Type Tags by Voodoo Tactical", "description": "Popularized by our troops so the medics and docs know their blood type, these are a good idea for anyone going into harms way. Why waste precious time after a traumatic injury?Includes a hook-n-loop strap and quick release snap hook, these blood type tags can go anywhere you do. Clip them to your pack, vest, jacket or pants. Carry them on or off duty, they just might save you life! These blood type tags come in 4 colors and 8 blood type options. Measuring 4.5\" overall.", "text": "Blood Type Tags by Voodoo Tactical Popularized by our troops so the medics and docs know their blood type, these are a good idea for anyone going into harms way. Why waste precious time after a traumatic injury?Includes a hook-n-loop strap and quick release snap hook, these blood type tags can go anywhere you do. Clip them to your pack, vest, jacket or pants. Carry them on or off duty, they just might save you life! These blood type tags come in 4 colors and 8 blood type options. Measuring 4.5\" overall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41evMXo-7pL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00655CM14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00655DEXE", "title": "Voodoo Tactical Adjustable Cheek Rest with Ammo Carrier", "description": "The Adjustable Rifle Stock Cheek Rest With Ammo Carrier is a great accessory for the competitive long-range shooter or hunter who wants easy access to extra rifle rounds or other gear. The Stock Pack also provides a padded cheek weld that adds comfort and lessens recoil. Features include:Triple strap adjustment.Ambidextrous design.Removable center pad to lower eye relief.Removable covered 7 round ammo carrier for .308 or 300 winmag.*Removable ammo pouch with hook-n-loop backing can be attached to either side of stock*", "text": "Voodoo Tactical Adjustable Cheek Rest with Ammo Carrier The Adjustable Rifle Stock Cheek Rest With Ammo Carrier is a great accessory for the competitive long-range shooter or hunter who wants easy access to extra rifle rounds or other gear. The Stock Pack also provides a padded cheek weld that adds comfort and lessens recoil. Features include:Triple strap adjustment.Ambidextrous design.Removable center pad to lower eye relief.Removable covered 7 round ammo carrier for .308 or 300 winmag.*Removable ammo pouch with hook-n-loop backing can be attached to either side of stock*", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Q-HKXlHtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00655DEXE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "VooDoo Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 19.95}}
