{"item_id": "B0065NYXWW", "title": "Cressi Scuba Diving Frameless Mask", "description": "Cressi Frameless Mask Frameless Masks are loved by many divers for their Low-Profile and ability to Fold-Flat for easy carrying, even in a BCD Pocket. Cressi's Frameless Mask Design Bonds a High-Grade Silicone Double Feathered Edge Skirt directly to a Single Tempered Glass Lens for the Ultimate in Simplicity. FEATURES The Low Internal Volume allows for effortless clearing Quick-Adjust Strap Buckles are molded directly into the Skirt for a Flexible Fit and Reduced Drag The Easy Access Nose Pocket can be used with one hand for proper Ear Equalization Single Lens Design affords a Wide Field of Vision The Cressi Frameless Mask has a Wide Split Mask Strap Design for Comfort and to give Even Tension on the Skirt for a Proper Seal Please Allow An Extra Five Shipping Days For Cressi Items As They Are Very Popular", "text": "Cressi Scuba Diving Frameless Mask Cressi Frameless Mask Frameless Masks are loved by many divers for their Low-Profile and ability to Fold-Flat for easy carrying, even in a BCD Pocket. Cressi's Frameless Mask Design Bonds a High-Grade Silicone Double Feathered Edge Skirt directly to a Single Tempered Glass Lens for the Ultimate in Simplicity. FEATURES The Low Internal Volume allows for effortless clearing Quick-Adjust Strap Buckles are molded directly into the Skirt for a Flexible Fit and Reduced Drag The Easy Access Nose Pocket can be used with one hand for proper Ear Equalization Single Lens Design affords a Wide Field of Vision The Cressi Frameless Mask has a Wide Split Mask Strap Design for Comfort and to give Even Tension on the Skirt for a Proper Seal Please Allow An Extra Five Shipping Days For Cressi Items As They Are Very Popular", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41htH8CpLlL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0065NYXWW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cressi", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Diving Masks"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B0065PHDZE", "title": "RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Adjustable Repair Stand", "description": "Introducing the all new, RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Repair Stand. This is the one everyone is talking about, but you can only get it here. The Rad Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Stand holds up to 66 pounds (30kg) effortlessly in its heavy duty \"Work Horse\" clamps that are engineered not to harm your bike's finish. The \"Work Horse\" clamps are designed to rotate 360 degrees on two axes, and fits nearly every standard tube frame from 1\" to 1.5\". Included is a tool tray with a magnetic strip to help keep those nuts and bolts where you can find them when it comes time to put them back on. The feet are even pre-drill just in case you want to mount your RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Stand to the floor or work bench permanently, or semi-permanently.", "text": "RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Adjustable Repair Stand Introducing the all new, RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Repair Stand. This is the one everyone is talking about, but you can only get it here. The Rad Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Stand holds up to 66 pounds (30kg) effortlessly in its heavy duty \"Work Horse\" clamps that are engineered not to harm your bike's finish. The \"Work Horse\" clamps are designed to rotate 360 degrees on two axes, and fits nearly every standard tube frame from 1\" to 1.5\". Included is a tool tray with a magnetic strip to help keep those nuts and bolts where you can find them when it comes time to put them back on. The feet are even pre-drill just in case you want to mount your RAD Cycle Products Pro Bicycle Stand to the floor or work bench permanently, or semi-permanently.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415ZvwhyPYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0065PHDZE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RAD Cycle Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Workstands"]], "price": 39.0}}
{"item_id": "B0065PK1GM", "title": "5.11 Covrt", "description": "Created to help covert teams maintain their cover while transporting rifles, the COVRTM4 is made from 500D and 420D nylon with a smooth 600D lining with YKKzippers and fits an M4 with a collapsed stock. Its ambidextrous cross-body shoulder strap with QuickTactaccessory strap ads functionality and features. The COVRT M4 features 5.11’s new R.A.C.(Roll-down Assault Compartment) with a web platform and loop-sided ID panel holder. Two carry handles; Internal barrel catch/muzzle trap. Main Compartment 32H x 12L x 2.5D (960 cu in) (15.73 liters); Front Compartment 19.77H x 10L x 3.6D (712 cu in) (11.67 liters)", "text": "5.11 Covrt Created to help covert teams maintain their cover while transporting rifles, the COVRTM4 is made from 500D and 420D nylon with a smooth 600D lining with YKKzippers and fits an M4 with a collapsed stock. Its ambidextrous cross-body shoulder strap with QuickTactaccessory strap ads functionality and features. The COVRT M4 features 5.11’s new R.A.C.(Roll-down Assault Compartment) with a web platform and loop-sided ID panel holder. Two carry handles; Internal barrel catch/muzzle trap. Main Compartment 32H x 12L x 2.5D (960 cu in) (15.73 liters); Front Compartment 19.77H x 10L x 3.6D (712 cu in) (11.67 liters)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41CTIXYRCAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0065PK1GM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "5.11", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Rifle Cases"]], "price": 128.21}}
{"item_id": "B0065PM9H6", "title": "Laserlyte Side Mount Laser for Smith and Wesson and Taurus", "description": "The side mounted laser fits on all of the Smith & Wesson J-frame revolvers ever made and all Taurus revolvers. And now, the Taurus Judges including the Public Defender finally has a laser system to call its own with the CK-SWAT laser.", "text": "Laserlyte Side Mount Laser for Smith and Wesson and Taurus The side mounted laser fits on all of the Smith & Wesson J-frame revolvers ever made and all Taurus revolvers. And now, the Taurus Judges including the Public Defender finally has a laser system to call its own with the CK-SWAT laser.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41fZuMiEHqL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0065PM9H6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 99.99}}
