{"item_id": "B00669R8I6", "title": "Fashion German Army Military Hooded Field Jacket Parka Coat Flecktarn Camo", "description": "* Extremely durable, and comfortable military jacket* 2 large breast pockets* 2 slash side pockets* Inner pocket* Large drawstring hood* A zip closure with a stud zipper storm flap* Drawstring at waist and the bottom hem* Velcro strip for name tape* Elastic cuffs with Velcro adjustable strap* Ventilation zips under the arms* Large drawstring hood* Two Stud Epaulets* Modern German Army (Bundeswehr) camo pattern* Brand new, never worn, high quality jacket!* Manufacturer - STURM-Mil-Tec, Germany* Material & Lining -80% Cotton, 20% Polyester* Available sizes: S, M, L, XL, 2XL* Retail Price $78.00", "text": "Fashion German Army Military Hooded Field Jacket Parka Coat Flecktarn Camo * Extremely durable, and comfortable military jacket* 2 large breast pockets* 2 slash side pockets* Inner pocket* Large drawstring hood* A zip closure with a stud zipper storm flap* Drawstring at waist and the bottom hem* Velcro strip for name tape* Elastic cuffs with Velcro adjustable strap* Ventilation zips under the arms* Large drawstring hood* Two Stud Epaulets* Modern German Army (Bundeswehr) camo pattern* Brand new, never worn, high quality jacket!* Manufacturer - STURM-Mil-Tec, Germany* Material & Lining -80% Cotton, 20% Polyester* Available sizes: S, M, L, XL, 2XL* Retail Price $78.00", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51dzDG8qruL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00669R8I6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Clothing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0066DD4XK", "title": "RhinoDillos Tire Liners - Different Sizes Available", "description": "Install a pair of Rhinodillos between your tire and tube to prevent flat tires! Each roll of 26x2\" liners weigh 95g. That's 10% lighter than a regular brown Mr. Tuffy. The most important: New formula to create a super tough silver layer that is up to 2 times more thorn resistant than material used by previous liners! Has been independent lab tested against competitors - see additional images. 9 sizes to fit: Mountain Bikes, Road Bikes, Cross Bikes, Commuters, BMX, Cruisers, & 29r's.", "text": "RhinoDillos Tire Liners - Different Sizes Available Install a pair of Rhinodillos between your tire and tube to prevent flat tires! Each roll of 26x2\" liners weigh 95g. That's 10% lighter than a regular brown Mr. Tuffy. The most important: New formula to create a super tough silver layer that is up to 2 times more thorn resistant than material used by previous liners! Has been independent lab tested against competitors - see additional images. 9 sizes to fit: Mountain Bikes, Road Bikes, Cross Bikes, Commuters, BMX, Cruisers, & 29r's.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/512eycq4pVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0066DD4XK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
