{"item_id": "B0067BGZBE", "title": "Cressi Scuba Diving Snorkeling Freediving Mask Snorkel Set", "description": "Cressi Frameless Mask Sleek 100% liquid silicone skirt attached directly to the tempered glass lens. No mask frame means the frameless mask offers an incredible field of vision and packs flat. | Cressi Desert Dry Snorkel is the first submersible dry top snorkel of the Cressi line. Great for kids to adults, anyone who wants to feel that much safer when they are snorkeling.", "text": "Cressi Scuba Diving Snorkeling Freediving Mask Snorkel Set Cressi Frameless Mask Sleek 100% liquid silicone skirt attached directly to the tempered glass lens. No mask frame means the frameless mask offers an incredible field of vision and packs flat. | Cressi Desert Dry Snorkel is the first submersible dry top snorkel of the Cressi line. Great for kids to adults, anyone who wants to feel that much safer when they are snorkeling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414ciCvE8YL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067BGZBE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Diving & Snorkeling", "Snorkeling Packages"]], "price": 44.95}}
{"item_id": "B0067BH0HC", "title": "Fits Desert Eagle - Baby Desert Eagle: 9mm, .40 S&W, .45 ACP with 4\" - 5 1/4\" BARREL", "description": "Nylon, Black, Fully Lined Holster Ambidextrous Belt and Clip Combination Thumb break is adjustable with a steel shank for quick access Magazine pouch holds double stacked or two single stacked magazines Belt loops on both sides of holster 2\" metal clip can be moved to either side For security, these holsters are designed to wear with the clip on the pants and the belt through the loop to insure a more stable fit.", "text": "Fits Desert Eagle - Baby Desert Eagle: 9mm, .40 S&W, .45 ACP with 4\" - 5 1/4\" BARREL Nylon, Black, Fully Lined Holster Ambidextrous Belt and Clip Combination Thumb break is adjustable with a steel shank for quick access Magazine pouch holds double stacked or two single stacked magazines Belt loops on both sides of holster 2\" metal clip can be moved to either side For security, these holsters are designed to wear with the clip on the pants and the belt through the loop to insure a more stable fit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LlZ1j%2B4rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067BH0HC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 19.75}}
{"item_id": "B0067EMCVI", "title": "Derma-safe Folding Utility Survival Knife (5-pack) Orange", "description": "It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches Currently used by: The United States Military, Survival Kit Manufactures, Bread Manufacturing for top slitting, (recommended by Health Inspectors) Electricians, Painters/ Detailers, Sewing Industry, There are so may uses for it, and more and more become evident everyday.", "text": "Derma-safe Folding Utility Survival Knife (5-pack) Orange It weighs less than 8 grams with a closed length of less then 3 inches Currently used by: The United States Military, Survival Kit Manufactures, Bread Manufacturing for top slitting, (recommended by Health Inspectors) Electricians, Painters/ Detailers, Sewing Industry, There are so may uses for it, and more and more become evident everyday.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WItKL99CL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067EMCVI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 9.5}}
{"item_id": "B0067MV3XI", "title": ".750 5.56/.223 Low Profile Slant Nose Picatiiny Rail Top and Bottom Gas Block", "description": "Low profile luminum .750 low profile gas block, with 1913/picatinny-style rail, permits mounting iron sights, flashlights or laser aiming devices. Fit on .750\" barrels. .", "text": ".750 5.56/.223 Low Profile Slant Nose Picatiiny Rail Top and Bottom Gas Block Low profile luminum .750 low profile gas block, with 1913/picatinny-style rail, permits mounting iron sights, flashlights or laser aiming devices. Fit on .750\" barrels. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31aNDEvvHQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067MV3XI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "CoiTAC", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 24.45}}
{"item_id": "B0067PFYAI", "title": "550 Paracord 100Ft", "description": "The550CordShop only sells MADE IN THE USA Parachute cordWhat is 550 cord? Parachute cord is the lightweight nylon cord used in the suspension lines of US parachutes during World War II. Soldiers found this cord very useful for many things. Now it is used as a general purpose utility cord by both the military and civilians. The braided sheath has a high number of interwoven strands giving it a smooth texture. The all-nylon construction makes parachute cord weather and fade resistant. While the military has no overall diameter requirements most cord typically measures about 4mm in diameter.Would I ever need 550 cord? We certainly hope you don't but life can be unpredictable.\"Good Luck happens when preparedness meets opportunity.\"-Unknown\"I will prepare and someday my chance will come.\" -- Abraham Lincoln\"No rope! And only last night you said to yourself: \"Sam, what about a bit of rope? You'll want it if you haven't got it\". Well, I want it and I can't get it now.\"-- Samwise Gamgee from \"The Lord of the Rings\"Why would I want to carry parachute cord?In an emergency you could use the parachute cord for many life saving applications. You could build a shelter or raft. Fashion a bow string or bola or another primitive weapon. You could shred the fibers with a knife and use it as tinder. Make a fire bow/drill. Improvise a gun sling, pants belt or Shoelaces. Make a tourniquet. The inner strand can be stripped out and used as a fishing line! Rope is just a practical thing to have during an emergency, and it hardly gets more versatile than Military Spec MIL-C-5040 Type III 550 Parachute Cord!How can I easily carry parachute cord? There are many ways to keep parachute cord handy. The most popular is in the form of a survival bracelet or belt. There are a wide variety of colors, so you can make your bracelet or belt to match your clothes, your team, YOUR STYLE", "text": "550 Paracord 100Ft The550CordShop only sells MADE IN THE USA Parachute cordWhat is 550 cord? Parachute cord is the lightweight nylon cord used in the suspension lines of US parachutes during World War II. Soldiers found this cord very useful for many things. Now it is used as a general purpose utility cord by both the military and civilians. The braided sheath has a high number of interwoven strands giving it a smooth texture. The all-nylon construction makes parachute cord weather and fade resistant. While the military has no overall diameter requirements most cord typically measures about 4mm in diameter.Would I ever need 550 cord? We certainly hope you don't but life can be unpredictable.\"Good Luck happens when preparedness meets opportunity.\"-Unknown\"I will prepare and someday my chance will come.\" -- Abraham Lincoln\"No rope! And only last night you said to yourself: \"Sam, what about a bit of rope? You'll want it if you haven't got it\". Well, I want it and I can't get it now.\"-- Samwise Gamgee from \"The Lord of the Rings\"Why would I want to carry parachute cord?In an emergency you could use the parachute cord for many life saving applications. You could build a shelter or raft. Fashion a bow string or bola or another primitive weapon. You could shred the fibers with a knife and use it as tinder. Make a fire bow/drill. Improvise a gun sling, pants belt or Shoelaces. Make a tourniquet. The inner strand can be stripped out and used as a fishing line! Rope is just a practical thing to have during an emergency, and it hardly gets more versatile than Military Spec MIL-C-5040 Type III 550 Parachute Cord!How can I easily carry parachute cord? There are many ways to keep parachute cord handy. The most popular is in the form of a survival bracelet or belt. There are a wide variety of colors, so you can make your bracelet or belt to match your clothes, your team, YOUR STYLE", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61gvSpq-BPL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067PFYAI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "The550CordShop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 6.26}}
{"item_id": "B0067SVIAK", "title": "Magpul PTS Airsoft Steel \"RSA\" Rail Sling Attachment", "description": "The Magpul Rail Sling Attachment, or \"RSA\", provides a forward sling attachment point for any clip on style sling. The RSA will easily fit any 20mm or Mil-Spec sized rail. The RSA has also been proven to withstand stress tests of over 300 pounds yet weighs a mere 1.26 ounces.", "text": "Magpul PTS Airsoft Steel \"RSA\" Rail Sling Attachment The Magpul Rail Sling Attachment, or \"RSA\", provides a forward sling attachment point for any clip on style sling. The RSA will easily fit any 20mm or Mil-Spec sized rail. The RSA has also been proven to withstand stress tests of over 300 pounds yet weighs a mere 1.26 ounces.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eKsstQJiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0067SVIAK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B00683OLRQ", "title": "Froglube CLP Cleaning 2-Pk, 8oz Paste & 4oz Liquid", "description": "You get 1 each of 8oz Paste and 1 each of 4oz Liquid. Froglube is Non-Toxic, Premium version, excellent for all your guns, knives, tools and more. CLP cleans, lubricates and protects your items from rust, water, fouling, carbon and more.", "text": "Froglube CLP Cleaning 2-Pk, 8oz Paste & 4oz Liquid You get 1 each of 8oz Paste and 1 each of 4oz Liquid. Froglube is Non-Toxic, Premium version, excellent for all your guns, knives, tools and more. CLP cleans, lubricates and protects your items from rust, water, fouling, carbon and more.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51GBoC1tH1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00683OLRQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Frog Lube", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]], "price": 37.99}}
{"item_id": "B00684WPRS", "title": "4 PIECE US MILITARY SLEEP SYSTEM WITH GORE-TEX COVER", "description": "This is a BRAND NEW genuine U.S. Army Modular Sleeping system which is one of the best found anywhere in the world and it's rated to up to -50 degrees!! This Genuine U.S. Army Modular Sleeping System is constructed to insulate the user in environments ranging from mild weather to extremely cold weather. It includes 4 brand new items, a green patrol bag, the black intermediate cold weather bag, a woodland camo bivy cover, and a stuff sack. These two mummy style sleeping bags can be used independently or together in colder environments. The patrol bag is rated at +30 degrees, the black intermediate cold weather bag is rated to -10 degrees and both bags can be used with the vapor permeable bivy cover. When all three components are used together (patrol bag, cold weather bag and bivy cover,) it is rated at -10 degrees and if combined with various insulating layers of the extended cold weather clothing system, it is rated to -50 degrees. Each bag is constructed of water resistant rip-stop nylon and is machine washable and non-flammable. The Woodland Camo Bivy Cover is made of durably waterproof and windproof 3-layer GORE-TEX fabric and includes snap fastener and slide fastener. This modular sleep system features an anatomically designed foot box contains twice the insulation as the bag Sewn-in, quilted chest collar prevents air drafts up and down through the hood. It has a reversible double-pull (opens end to end) slider allows top or bottom ventilation Non-locking slide fastener self repairs if jammed or snagged. It is free from cold spots and the snaps prevent the insulation from migrating in the bag. The draft flap prevents heat loss and the hood adjusts for heat retention (includes a nylon draw cord and barrel lock.)", "text": "4 PIECE US MILITARY SLEEP SYSTEM WITH GORE-TEX COVER This is a BRAND NEW genuine U.S. Army Modular Sleeping system which is one of the best found anywhere in the world and it's rated to up to -50 degrees!! This Genuine U.S. Army Modular Sleeping System is constructed to insulate the user in environments ranging from mild weather to extremely cold weather. It includes 4 brand new items, a green patrol bag, the black intermediate cold weather bag, a woodland camo bivy cover, and a stuff sack. These two mummy style sleeping bags can be used independently or together in colder environments. The patrol bag is rated at +30 degrees, the black intermediate cold weather bag is rated to -10 degrees and both bags can be used with the vapor permeable bivy cover. When all three components are used together (patrol bag, cold weather bag and bivy cover,) it is rated at -10 degrees and if combined with various insulating layers of the extended cold weather clothing system, it is rated to -50 degrees. Each bag is constructed of water resistant rip-stop nylon and is machine washable and non-flammable. The Woodland Camo Bivy Cover is made of durably waterproof and windproof 3-layer GORE-TEX fabric and includes snap fastener and slide fastener. This modular sleep system features an anatomically designed foot box contains twice the insulation as the bag Sewn-in, quilted chest collar prevents air drafts up and down through the hood. It has a reversible double-pull (opens end to end) slider allows top or bottom ventilation Non-locking slide fastener self repairs if jammed or snagged. It is free from cold spots and the snaps prevent the insulation from migrating in the bag. The draft flap prevents heat loss and the hood adjusts for heat retention (includes a nylon draw cord and barrel lock.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CAnxJK3oL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00684WPRS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]]}}
