{"item_id": "B0068AGQ4A", "title": "BERN Watts EPS 2-Tone Summer Matte Helmet", "description": "The Watts is a bike helmet inspired by skate style. Developed in 2007, the Watts is the successor of Bern’s signature model the Baker (patent #US D572, 865 S). You asked for the Baker with vents and you got it. Today the Watts is one of Bern’s most valued all-around lids.", "text": "BERN Watts EPS 2-Tone Summer Matte Helmet The Watts is a bike helmet inspired by skate style. Developed in 2007, the Watts is the successor of Bern’s signature model the Baker (patent #US D572, 865 S). You asked for the Baker with vents and you got it. Today the Watts is one of Bern’s most valued all-around lids.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tGwzg4nAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068AGQ4A.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Helmets", "Adult Helmets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0068APV14", "title": "GDT 3x Magnifier for Red Dot Fts (Flip To Side) Mount", "description": "Vastly improved accuracy at medium range distances. Increased target recognition and identification at greater distances. Achieves extremely rapid transition from Close Quarters Battle to medium range targeting - and back again. Zero is maintained in the HWS Red Dot Scope and not in the magnifier - you never lose zero, no matter if you are targeting through the magnifier or only through the HWS Riflesight. Magnifier mount provides elevation and azimuth adjustment to allow the reticle to be centered in the FOV of the magnifier. Ambidextrous mount allows left or right flip. Body and mount are made of anodized aluminum and steel. Very strong built, shockproof, waterproof, fogproof.", "text": "GDT 3x Magnifier for Red Dot Fts (Flip To Side) Mount Vastly improved accuracy at medium range distances. Increased target recognition and identification at greater distances. Achieves extremely rapid transition from Close Quarters Battle to medium range targeting - and back again. Zero is maintained in the HWS Red Dot Scope and not in the magnifier - you never lose zero, no matter if you are targeting through the magnifier or only through the HWS Riflesight. Magnifier mount provides elevation and azimuth adjustment to allow the reticle to be centered in the FOV of the magnifier. Ambidextrous mount allows left or right flip. Body and mount are made of anodized aluminum and steel. Very strong built, shockproof, waterproof, fogproof.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41z8SIR81NL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068APV14.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Sights", "Red Dot Sights"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0068CL0VW", "title": "METAL Spring Powered Full Scale High Power 1:1 Silver Metal Airsoft Pistol 320-Fps Airsoft Gun Shoots EXTREMELY HARD AND ACCURATE", "description": "Metal Airsoft Pistol.Shoots at 320 FPS with .12g BB's. Full 1:1 scale handgun is weighted for more realistic feel. Push button clip release holds 15 BB's. Includes small starter pack of 20-pc. 6mm BB's. Gun Length: 9\"", "text": "METAL Spring Powered Full Scale High Power 1:1 Silver Metal Airsoft Pistol 320-Fps Airsoft Gun Shoots EXTREMELY HARD AND ACCURATE Metal Airsoft Pistol.Shoots at 320 FPS with .12g BB's. Full 1:1 scale handgun is weighted for more realistic feel. Push button clip release holds 15 BB's. Includes small starter pack of 20-pc. 6mm BB's. Gun Length: 9\"", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tyjI6wt6L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068CL0VW.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Guns & Rifles", "Pistols"]], "price": 20.0}}
{"item_id": "B0068FAQIM", "title": "Continental 42mm Presta Valve Tube", "description": "Continental bicycle tubes are constructed of durable, seamless butyl rubber and are 100% inspected to ensure high quality and reliability. Seamless, and vulcanized to ensure uniform roundness and improved reliability at the valve stem Every tube passes a stringent 100% quality control inspection For 29\" mtb rims, 29 x 1.75-2.5\" Presta valve with removable core", "text": "Continental 42mm Presta Valve Tube Continental bicycle tubes are constructed of durable, seamless butyl rubber and are 100% inspected to ensure high quality and reliability. Seamless, and vulcanized to ensure uniform roundness and improved reliability at the valve stem Every tube passes a stringent 100% quality control inspection For 29\" mtb rims, 29 x 1.75-2.5\" Presta valve with removable core", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51KoEpmU7CL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068FAQIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B0068FART0", "title": "Continental 60mm Presta Valve Tube", "description": "The advantages of the Continental Unitube system. Multi-size tubes allow greater compatibility with more tire sizes, and fewer tubes. Unitubes are available in both Schrader and Presta valve tubes. Presta valves are available in a variety of lengths. All tubes are seamless and mold-cured (vulcanized) to ensure uniform roundness and improved reliability at the valve stem.Each and every tube passes a stringent 100% quality control inspection.", "text": "Continental 60mm Presta Valve Tube The advantages of the Continental Unitube system. Multi-size tubes allow greater compatibility with more tire sizes, and fewer tubes. Unitubes are available in both Schrader and Presta valve tubes. Presta valves are available in a variety of lengths. All tubes are seamless and mold-cured (vulcanized) to ensure uniform roundness and improved reliability at the valve stem.Each and every tube passes a stringent 100% quality control inspection.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HhHAqpgXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068FART0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Tires & Tubes", "Tubes"]]}}
