{"item_id": "B0068X982Y", "title": "Dovetail to Weaver Base Mount 3/8\" to 7/8\" Converter", "description": "With this mount, you can use your weaver based scopes, lasers, flashlights and other accessories on your dovetail based weapons.", "text": "Dovetail to Weaver Base Mount 3/8\" to 7/8\" Converter With this mount, you can use your weaver based scopes, lasers, flashlights and other accessories on your dovetail based weapons.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sNtNB51XL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068X982Y.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TR", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 13.33}}
{"item_id": "B0068XS7Q2", "title": "Mosin Nagant M44 M91/30 M39 M38 Rifle Scope Mount Short NEW", "description": "Works on models M91/30, M44, M91/59, M38, M39 Chinese Type 53 with both the 2 3/8\" 1000m rear site and the 3 3/8\" 2000m rear site, 1891&1938 Carbine & Finish Variants. This \"Short Mount\" best one on the market. Not need to cut or change bolt.", "text": "Mosin Nagant M44 M91/30 M39 M38 Rifle Scope Mount Short NEW Works on models M91/30, M44, M91/59, M38, M39 Chinese Type 53 with both the 2 3/8\" 1000m rear site and the 3 3/8\" 2000m rear site, 1891&1938 Carbine & Finish Variants. This \"Short Mount\" best one on the market. Not need to cut or change bolt.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Gh1tyzpNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0068XS7Q2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 6.31}}
