{"item_id": "B0069630N8", "title": "Pearl Izumi Select Glove - Women's", "description": "For riders who put in a lot of saddle time, nothing beats our Women's SELECT Glove with updated Comfort Bridge Gel padding and anatomic palm patterning. Comfort Bridge GelFoam padding relieves pressure on Ulnar and Median nerves for riding comfort. Synthetic leather palm is soft and durable. Soft, lowprofile wiping surface on thumb. Hook and loop closure", "text": "Pearl Izumi Select Glove - Women's For riders who put in a lot of saddle time, nothing beats our Women's SELECT Glove with updated Comfort Bridge Gel padding and anatomic palm patterning. Comfort Bridge GelFoam padding relieves pressure on Ulnar and Median nerves for riding comfort. Synthetic leather palm is soft and durable. Soft, lowprofile wiping surface on thumb. Hook and loop closure", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Z8pM0wq-L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0069630N8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Women", "Gloves"]]}}
