{"item_id": "B00696K4E6", "title": "Ibera Bicycle Triangle Frame Bag", "description": "Carry gear in an easy-to-reach place that minimizes wind-resistance and won't get in the way of knees, feet, or other gear. Great for tools, snacks, wallet, keys and other small items.2 top zippers for the main compartment and slim outside pocket. 1 internal pocket. Compatible with most bikes.Note:Please measure bike frames to ensure compatibility.(Also available in Medium (IB-FB1-M). Check store for availability)..", "text": "Ibera Bicycle Triangle Frame Bag Carry gear in an easy-to-reach place that minimizes wind-resistance and won't get in the way of knees, feet, or other gear. Great for tools, snacks, wallet, keys and other small items.2 top zippers for the main compartment and slim outside pocket. 1 internal pocket. Compatible with most bikes.Note:Please measure bike frames to ensure compatibility.(Also available in Medium (IB-FB1-M). Check store for availability)..", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Gjh9LzauL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B00696K4E6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Racks & Bags", "Seat Packs"]]}}
