{"item_id": "B0069CJXWE", "title": "Tactical Magazine Mag Pouch With Adaptor For Rifle Buttstocks Fits Ruger Mini14, Mini30, AR15, M16, Howa 1500, Remington 700, AK47, MAK90, Saiga, SKS", "description": "Material: Heavy duty PVC, Fits one magazine in .223 or 7.62x39 caliber. Does not fit 7.62x54r or .308 magazines. Length: 7.5\", Width: 3.75\", Height: 1.5\", Weight: 5.2 ounces, Color: Black. Attaches directly to most any conventional type rifle stock. Will not work with collapsible, retractable or folding stocks. Adjustable bungee style retention straps make access to your magazine quick and easy and allows for adjustment to accommodate different magazines lengths. Military style PALS/MOLLE Straps attach the mag pouch to butt stock adapter. Pouch can also be used by itself with most other PAL/MOLLE equipment. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "text": "Tactical Magazine Mag Pouch With Adaptor For Rifle Buttstocks Fits Ruger Mini14, Mini30, AR15, M16, Howa 1500, Remington 700, AK47, MAK90, Saiga, SKS Material: Heavy duty PVC, Fits one magazine in .223 or 7.62x39 caliber. Does not fit 7.62x54r or .308 magazines. Length: 7.5\", Width: 3.75\", Height: 1.5\", Weight: 5.2 ounces, Color: Black. Attaches directly to most any conventional type rifle stock. Will not work with collapsible, retractable or folding stocks. Adjustable bungee style retention straps make access to your magazine quick and easy and allows for adjustment to accommodate different magazines lengths. Military style PALS/MOLLE Straps attach the mag pouch to butt stock adapter. Pouch can also be used by itself with most other PAL/MOLLE equipment. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51a0OHRX4gL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0069CJXWE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 16.25}}
{"item_id": "B0069D0BLA", "title": "Tactical Barrel Mount Rail Adaptor For 12 Gauge SHotguns And Magazine Tubes Fits Remington 870 1100 Mossberg 500 590 835 Maverick 88 Benelli NOVA Supernova Winchetser 1300", "description": "Made by AIM, Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Will fit most 12 gauge shotgun magazine tube extensions and also directly to long scope tubes with a 1\" tube diameter. Will not fit on 12 gauge barrels unless they have a true 1\" overall external diameter. Includes 2 rails for attaching your tactical accessories and a barrel mount adapter. One rail is 1-3/4\" long and the second rail is 2-3/16\" long. The rails bolt on directly to the barrel mount. Note that you can only mount one single rail at a time. The rails will accept Picatinny and 7/8\" Weaver style accessories. Easy bolt-on installation requires no gunsmithing. Due to the heavy recoil of 12 gauge shotguns, you must use a quality thread locking compound on all the screws or they will come loose from the heavy recoil. Thread lock is not included. Manufacture warranty against defects. Will not fit shotgun with vent rib barrels. Note that on some shotguns you may need to remove the magazine tube in order to have full access to the barrel so you may properly install this mount. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "text": "Tactical Barrel Mount Rail Adaptor For 12 Gauge SHotguns And Magazine Tubes Fits Remington 870 1100 Mossberg 500 590 835 Maverick 88 Benelli NOVA Supernova Winchetser 1300 Made by AIM, Material: Aluminum, Color: Matte black, Will fit most 12 gauge shotgun magazine tube extensions and also directly to long scope tubes with a 1\" tube diameter. Will not fit on 12 gauge barrels unless they have a true 1\" overall external diameter. Includes 2 rails for attaching your tactical accessories and a barrel mount adapter. One rail is 1-3/4\" long and the second rail is 2-3/16\" long. The rails bolt on directly to the barrel mount. Note that you can only mount one single rail at a time. The rails will accept Picatinny and 7/8\" Weaver style accessories. Easy bolt-on installation requires no gunsmithing. Due to the heavy recoil of 12 gauge shotguns, you must use a quality thread locking compound on all the screws or they will come loose from the heavy recoil. Thread lock is not included. Manufacture warranty against defects. Will not fit shotgun with vent rib barrels. Note that on some shotguns you may need to remove the magazine tube in order to have full access to the barrel so you may properly install this mount. Manufacture warranty against defects. Brand New", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Abgd-sn3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0069D0BLA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 20.95}}
