{"item_id": "B0069RZBVQ", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Micro Compact Red Dot Open Reflex Sight With Pistol Rifle Shotgun Integral Weaver Picatinny Mount Base", "description": "Length 1.7\", Weight: 57 grams, Magnification 1x With 25mm Ruby coated anti glare reflective lenses . 2 MOA Red Dot reticle powers On/Off via easy access rear sliding switch . Full Windage & Elevation adjustments, And securely attaches to a Weaver Picatinny 7/8\" base mount with a \"QD\" quick-detach thumbnut. Excellent combination of quality and value, great for hunters, military, and law enforcement. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Ultimate Arms Gear Brand - Leaders in tactical gear & optics . Included Lifetime Warranty", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Tactical Micro Compact Red Dot Open Reflex Sight With Pistol Rifle Shotgun Integral Weaver Picatinny Mount Base Length 1.7\", Weight: 57 grams, Magnification 1x With 25mm Ruby coated anti glare reflective lenses . 2 MOA Red Dot reticle powers On/Off via easy access rear sliding switch . Full Windage & Elevation adjustments, And securely attaches to a Weaver Picatinny 7/8\" base mount with a \"QD\" quick-detach thumbnut. Excellent combination of quality and value, great for hunters, military, and law enforcement. Official Ultimate Arms Gear Ultimate Arms Gear Brand - Leaders in tactical gear & optics . Included Lifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41VaUNLB7%2BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0069RZBVQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 39.95}}
{"item_id": "B0069T38N2", "title": "NEW Hand Held Hunting Archery 50LB PISTOL CROSSBOW Gun", "description": "Brand New 50lb Crossbow (Cross bow)! Length: 12.5 String Length: 17.5 Axle to Axle: 17.5 Draw Weight: 45-50 pounds Limb: Metal Comes with 3 Arrows Includes practice target Note: Must be 18 years of age to purchase. Buyer should follow all local laws associated with purchasing this product.", "text": "NEW Hand Held Hunting Archery 50LB PISTOL CROSSBOW Gun Brand New 50lb Crossbow (Cross bow)! Length: 12.5 String Length: 17.5 Axle to Axle: 17.5 Draw Weight: 45-50 pounds Limb: Metal Comes with 3 Arrows Includes practice target Note: Must be 18 years of age to purchase. Buyer should follow all local laws associated with purchasing this product.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tv6hA2qpL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B0069T38N2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Shelter", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B006A9YLIM", "title": "Retrospec Bicycles Super Deep-V Wheels with CST Tires (700C x 23)", "description": "Retrospec All-Star wheel sets have been custom-designed to ensure optimal speed, dexterity, and control on the road. 41-millimeter, deep-V rims strike an ideal balance between being lightweight and having responsive performance capacity and durability. Rims are double-walled, with black spokes that show off color better than traditional wheels. The wheels are designed to work with Retrospec and other bikes, and are ideal for a road conversion.Premium Retrospec wheels come in many different colors.SpecificationsAlloy 41-millimeter, double-walled 700 x 23c rimsKT Quando flip-flop hubs (F 100mm, R 110mm)16T fixed-gear and freewheel cogsCST 700 x 23c tubes with presta valvesCST high performance tiresAbout Retrospec BicyclesRetrospec was founded in 2009 in downtown Los Angeles, in order to fulfill the need for a fixed-gear urban bicycle with transportation and style in mind. All of the company's frames are tig-welded and outfitted with top quality components such as double-walled super deep V wheels, three-piece cranks, CST high performance tires, Kraton rubber grips, riser-style handlebars, and KMC chains.The company's primary mission is to offer a healthy and sustainable form of transportation to all mankind, and promote it as a preferred lifestyle choice. Retrospec seeks to provide customers with a fixed-gear cycling device with a powerful, fluid riding experience. To achieve this goal, steel frames have a flawless design, and are hand-welded by skillful professionals, to ensure that they ride comfortably and last for years to come. In addition, Retrospec uses post-consumer grade recycled cardboard for packaging, and is actively involved in maintaining a fair and safe work environment for workers in its factories.", "text": "Retrospec Bicycles Super Deep-V Wheels with CST Tires (700C x 23) Retrospec All-Star wheel sets have been custom-designed to ensure optimal speed, dexterity, and control on the road. 41-millimeter, deep-V rims strike an ideal balance between being lightweight and having responsive performance capacity and durability. Rims are double-walled, with black spokes that show off color better than traditional wheels. The wheels are designed to work with Retrospec and other bikes, and are ideal for a road conversion.Premium Retrospec wheels come in many different colors.SpecificationsAlloy 41-millimeter, double-walled 700 x 23c rimsKT Quando flip-flop hubs (F 100mm, R 110mm)16T fixed-gear and freewheel cogsCST 700 x 23c tubes with presta valvesCST high performance tiresAbout Retrospec BicyclesRetrospec was founded in 2009 in downtown Los Angeles, in order to fulfill the need for a fixed-gear urban bicycle with transportation and style in mind. All of the company's frames are tig-welded and outfitted with top quality components such as double-walled super deep V wheels, three-piece cranks, CST high performance tires, Kraton rubber grips, riser-style handlebars, and KMC chains.The company's primary mission is to offer a healthy and sustainable form of transportation to all mankind, and promote it as a preferred lifestyle choice. Retrospec seeks to provide customers with a fixed-gear cycling device with a powerful, fluid riding experience. To achieve this goal, steel frames have a flawless design, and are hand-welded by skillful professionals, to ensure that they ride comfortably and last for years to come. In addition, Retrospec uses post-consumer grade recycled cardboard for packaging, and is actively involved in maintaining a fair and safe work environment for workers in its factories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419V07B6eoL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006A9YLIM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Wheels & Accessories", "Wheels"]], "price": 135.03}}
{"item_id": "B006A9YU0Q", "title": "Retrospec Bicycles Urban/Fixed Gear Grips", "description": "Retrospec Grips are perfect for your road bike, fixed-gear, single-speed, urban commuter, mountain or really any type of bike. They're available in Black, Clear, Dark Green, Electric Blue, Lime Green, Mint Green orange, Pink, Purple, Red, White or Yellow. It features a triangular pattern with just enough cushion for supreme comfort, yet stable to maximize performance.", "text": "Retrospec Bicycles Urban/Fixed Gear Grips Retrospec Grips are perfect for your road bike, fixed-gear, single-speed, urban commuter, mountain or really any type of bike. They're available in Black, Clear, Dark Green, Electric Blue, Lime Green, Mint Green orange, Pink, Purple, Red, White or Yellow. It features a triangular pattern with just enough cushion for supreme comfort, yet stable to maximize performance.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31R5kQG0TSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006A9YU0Q.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 7.91}}
{"item_id": "B006ADN24M", "title": "Chalk Bag with Waist Belt and Zippered Pocket - two Ogres", "description": "High quality, durable and functional chalk bag from Two Ogres. Front zippered pocket is ideal to keep your money, ID, cards, etc. with you at all times while climbing. Tight closure prevents chalk from spilling. Has a brush holder on the side. The bag is 6 inches tall.", "text": "Chalk Bag with Waist Belt and Zippered Pocket - two Ogres High quality, durable and functional chalk bag from Two Ogres. Front zippered pocket is ideal to keep your money, ID, cards, etc. with you at all times while climbing. Tight closure prevents chalk from spilling. Has a brush holder on the side. The bag is 6 inches tall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319m188P%2BfL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ADN24M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Climbing", "Chalk Bags"]], "price": 15.95}}
{"item_id": "B006BBW15O", "title": "Blizzard Survival Sleeping Bag (Bivvy) - Tactical / Reversible", "description": "The Blizzard Survival Bag is a Full-Sized Sleeping Bag (Bivvy) in a pack about the size of a video cassette, providing total warmth and shelter - anywhere, at any time. Made with Reflexcell, it is the new standard in thermal performance.Reflexcell material blocks heat loss more effectively than any other emergency product. The bag is elasticized to hug the body to ensure positive warmth retention.SPECIFICATIONSSize (vacuum packed): 8.5 in. X 4 in. X 1.75 in.Volume: 0.9 litres.Weight: 13.3 ounces.Size (unpacked): 2.1 metersColor: Tactical Olive Drab - Reversible to Civilian Silver for High Visibility and Signaling.FEATURESTop may be closed to form hood.Drawcord with spring toggle.Fits fully clothed large adult.Reusable.PERFORMANCEWarmth: 8 Togs - equal to a medium weight regular sleeping bag.Weather protection: fully waterproof and windproof.Storage: indefinite: not affected by temperature or moisture, either during storage or in use.Re-usability: bags can be re-used many times without loss of performance.APPLICATIONSThe chosen standard equipment by the military, emergency services, civil emergency planners, medical authorities and rescue teams.Survival and Emergency PreparednessThe Blizzard Survival Bag is a revolution in thermal protection for any situation in which people need to be kept warm, or treated immediately for chilling and hypothermia. Applications include everything from military, medical, marine and mountain rescue, outdoor sports, and hunting, to civil evacuations and disasters.MilitaryThe standard issue to Special Operations military personnel worldwide.", "text": "Blizzard Survival Sleeping Bag (Bivvy) - Tactical / Reversible The Blizzard Survival Bag is a Full-Sized Sleeping Bag (Bivvy) in a pack about the size of a video cassette, providing total warmth and shelter - anywhere, at any time. Made with Reflexcell, it is the new standard in thermal performance.Reflexcell material blocks heat loss more effectively than any other emergency product. The bag is elasticized to hug the body to ensure positive warmth retention.SPECIFICATIONSSize (vacuum packed): 8.5 in. X 4 in. X 1.75 in.Volume: 0.9 litres.Weight: 13.3 ounces.Size (unpacked): 2.1 metersColor: Tactical Olive Drab - Reversible to Civilian Silver for High Visibility and Signaling.FEATURESTop may be closed to form hood.Drawcord with spring toggle.Fits fully clothed large adult.Reusable.PERFORMANCEWarmth: 8 Togs - equal to a medium weight regular sleeping bag.Weather protection: fully waterproof and windproof.Storage: indefinite: not affected by temperature or moisture, either during storage or in use.Re-usability: bags can be re-used many times without loss of performance.APPLICATIONSThe chosen standard equipment by the military, emergency services, civil emergency planners, medical authorities and rescue teams.Survival and Emergency PreparednessThe Blizzard Survival Bag is a revolution in thermal protection for any situation in which people need to be kept warm, or treated immediately for chilling and hypothermia. Applications include everything from military, medical, marine and mountain rescue, outdoor sports, and hunting, to civil evacuations and disasters.MilitaryThe standard issue to Special Operations military personnel worldwide.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Se2X2vklL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006BBW15O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Blizzard Survival", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 38.05}}
