{"item_id": "B006CBOR00", "title": "Low profile 3 slot picatinny 1/2\" riser", "description": "This riser mount has a 1.6-inch Picatinny rail with three slots, a low profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .50 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing. Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 1.6 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 1 Dimensions: 1.6 by 1.6 by 0.7 inches (L x W x H)", "text": "Low profile 3 slot picatinny 1/2\" riser This riser mount has a 1.6-inch Picatinny rail with three slots, a low profile, and is see-through to allow for use with the original iron sights. It features a .50 of an inch saddle height, a side plat with spring tension for quick and easy installation, and is precision machined from aircraft-grade aluminum with matte black anodizing. Specifications: Material: Aluminum Weight: 1.6 ounces Pieces: 1 Rail Type: Picatinny/Weaver No. of Rails: 1 Dimensions: 1.6 by 1.6 by 0.7 inches (L x W x H)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rujbkCQuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CBOR00.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 8.55}}
