{"item_id": "B006CFDOEQ", "title": "Pure Fix Cycles Untaped Bull Horn Handlebars", "description": "Timeless drop type handle bars curve forward into a downward arc, customized to Pure Fix Cycles's specifications. These high grade alloy drop handle bars look good and work well for long distance and endurance riding, offering comfort and aerodynamic arm positioning. Will fit bikes with stem dimensions of (1 1/8\", 26mm/90mm ext).", "text": "Pure Fix Cycles Untaped Bull Horn Handlebars Timeless drop type handle bars curve forward into a downward arc, customized to Pure Fix Cycles's specifications. These high grade alloy drop handle bars look good and work well for long distance and endurance riding, offering comfort and aerodynamic arm positioning. Will fit bikes with stem dimensions of (1 1/8\", 26mm/90mm ext).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41GFJ0GiDlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CFDOEQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebar Tape"]], "price": 22.0}}
{"item_id": "B006CM95OC", "title": "Phoenix Technology Mossberg 500 and Maverick 88 Rear Pistol Grip", "description": "Rugged, one piece grip with textured finish and comfortable ergonomic design for optimal comfort and performance. Includes, optional 'end cap' cover plate and sling swivel stud. Injection molded in USA of premium grade glass filled nylon. All assembly hardware included.", "text": "Phoenix Technology Mossberg 500 and Maverick 88 Rear Pistol Grip Rugged, one piece grip with textured finish and comfortable ergonomic design for optimal comfort and performance. Includes, optional 'end cap' cover plate and sling swivel stud. Injection molded in USA of premium grade glass filled nylon. All assembly hardware included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31yA8tmrjiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CM95OC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Phoenix Technology LTD.", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 13.7}}
