{"item_id": "B006CU9P1C", "title": "EZ Drinker Beer and Soda Can Holster Belt, Pack of 6", "description": "Beer & Beverage Belt by EZ Drinker. This beer belt holds up to 6 beverages and has an adjustable strap to comfortably fit any waist. The belt features a black design.Our beer belt is the perfect accessory for camping trips, tailgating, parties, the beach, and any event where you are drinking on the go!Manufactured by EZ Drinker, and features a 1 year warranty for any damage or defects.", "text": "EZ Drinker Beer and Soda Can Holster Belt, Pack of 6 Beer & Beverage Belt by EZ Drinker. This beer belt holds up to 6 beverages and has an adjustable strap to comfortably fit any waist. The belt features a black design.Our beer belt is the perfect accessory for camping trips, tailgating, parties, the beach, and any event where you are drinking on the go!Manufactured by EZ Drinker, and features a 1 year warranty for any damage or defects.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51SLEInXB7L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CU9P1C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "EZ DRINKER", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Camouflage Accessories"]], "price": 6.49}}
{"item_id": "B006CV7NSS", "title": "Combat Sports MMA Sparring Gloves", "description": "As a result of raw material surplus, the top selling Combat Sports gloves are offered in snythetic for a huge savings. Design that allows grappling and striking in the same training session without changing gloves Four layers of foam that offer the same shock dispersing capabilities as 16-ounce boxing gloves Synthetic leather construction that is resilient for continual use Three size options, including Regular (6 oz.), Large (6.5 oz.) and XL (7 oz.)", "text": "Combat Sports MMA Sparring Gloves As a result of raw material surplus, the top selling Combat Sports gloves are offered in snythetic for a huge savings. Design that allows grappling and striking in the same training session without changing gloves Four layers of foam that offer the same shock dispersing capabilities as 16-ounce boxing gloves Synthetic leather construction that is resilient for continual use Three size options, including Regular (6 oz.), Large (6.5 oz.) and XL (7 oz.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gEPeTL0kL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CV7NSS.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Training Equipment", "Training Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006CV85K8", "title": "Ringside Gel Shock Boxing Super Bag Gloves", "description": "Incorporating the latest safety inducing technology, the 12 ounce Gel Super Bag Gloves combine foam with strategically positioned gel across the knuckles to produce an impact-absorbing training tool. Includes elastic wristwrap hook & loop closures. Leather.", "text": "Ringside Gel Shock Boxing Super Bag Gloves Incorporating the latest safety inducing technology, the 12 ounce Gel Super Bag Gloves combine foam with strategically positioned gel across the knuckles to produce an impact-absorbing training tool. Includes elastic wristwrap hook & loop closures. Leather.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51jyVSKBcpL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CV85K8.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Gloves", "Bag Gloves"]], "price": 61.98}}
{"item_id": "B006CV8J18", "title": "Contender Fight Sports MMA Grappling Shin Guards (Black)", "description": "The most secure fitting guards available. A neoprene wrap holds the guards firmly in place. Strategically placed shock absorbing foam covered with a synthetic leather striking surface. Designed specifically for the grappler", "text": "Contender Fight Sports MMA Grappling Shin Guards (Black) The most secure fitting guards available. A neoprene wrap holds the guards firmly in place. Strategically placed shock absorbing foam covered with a synthetic leather striking surface. Designed specifically for the grappler", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SCC5sPYNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CV8J18.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Shin Guards"]], "price": 29.99}}
{"item_id": "B006CV991W", "title": "Contender Fight Sports MMA Pro-Style Shin Guards", "description": "Pro Shin Guards from Contender Fight Sports boast a double layer of protection to optimize MMA training sessions. Extra level of thick foam padding runs down the length of the shin for safety of the legs and the training partner Two hook & loop straps on the backside ensure the guard does not slip Elastic strap on the instep secures the foot padding Neoprene at the ankle allows full range of movement without leaving it unprotected Synthetic leather construction allows high impact training without sacrificing long lasting performance Regular (lighter than 165 lbs.), Large (165 lbs. to 200 lbs.) or XL (heavier than 200 lbs.)", "text": "Contender Fight Sports MMA Pro-Style Shin Guards Pro Shin Guards from Contender Fight Sports boast a double layer of protection to optimize MMA training sessions. Extra level of thick foam padding runs down the length of the shin for safety of the legs and the training partner Two hook & loop straps on the backside ensure the guard does not slip Elastic strap on the instep secures the foot padding Neoprene at the ankle allows full range of movement without leaving it unprotected Synthetic leather construction allows high impact training without sacrificing long lasting performance Regular (lighter than 165 lbs.), Large (165 lbs. to 200 lbs.) or XL (heavier than 200 lbs.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41aCE93GuYL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CV991W.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Protective Gear", "Shin Guards"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006CW02ZS", "title": "Valor Fitness BD-9 Power Squat Stand", "description": "BD-9 Features: Built with the serious weight lifter in mind. We added both safety bar catches as well as expandable base and adjustable bar supports. Some users may want to use the racks for bench press. Adjust the bar supports to your desired level and then adjust the safety bar catches in case you need safety support. At the bottom you will find plate storage pegs. These play a dual roll in the stands. One is for plate storage but the more important role is to ground the unit with added weight during squat or military functions. We also added more height to the unit. Max height will reach 6' 5-Inch. That means a user in the 7' height range will be able to use the units. The weight bar is so high you can even do pull ups from the bar by tucking your legs underneath you. Solid Expandable Base with each base covering 400 square Inch of surface. For added safety, do not practice squats alone. Always have a spotter.", "text": "Valor Fitness BD-9 Power Squat Stand BD-9 Features: Built with the serious weight lifter in mind. We added both safety bar catches as well as expandable base and adjustable bar supports. Some users may want to use the racks for bench press. Adjust the bar supports to your desired level and then adjust the safety bar catches in case you need safety support. At the bottom you will find plate storage pegs. These play a dual roll in the stands. One is for plate storage but the more important role is to ground the unit with added weight during squat or military functions. We also added more height to the unit. Max height will reach 6' 5-Inch. That means a user in the 7' height range will be able to use the units. The weight bar is so high you can even do pull ups from the bar by tucking your legs underneath you. Solid Expandable Base with each base covering 400 square Inch of surface. For added safety, do not practice squats alone. Always have a spotter.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41OI%2BmARc7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006CW02ZS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Valor Fitness", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 189.99}}
