{"item_id": "B006DWT4L0", "title": "Bushnell Trophy 3 MOA Red Dot Sight Riflescope (Predator Camo, 1x25mm)", "description": "1 x 25 a reliable, 3 M.O.A. red-dot sight with unlimited eye relief for handguns and shotguns (Rings Included). Built in mount for Weaver-style rail. Engineered with Amber-Bright optics that quickly help you distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter, the Trophy riflescopes have been heralded by hunters as the ideal scope for the autumn deer woods. With multi-coated optics for increased brightness in low-light conditions, the avid inner hunter in you will be most satisfied. No question about it, they're designed to excel during the day's most important times.", "text": "Bushnell Trophy 3 MOA Red Dot Sight Riflescope (Predator Camo, 1x25mm) 1 x 25 a reliable, 3 M.O.A. red-dot sight with unlimited eye relief for handguns and shotguns (Rings Included). Built in mount for Weaver-style rail. Engineered with Amber-Bright optics that quickly help you distinguish between a brown tree and a brown critter, the Trophy riflescopes have been heralded by hunters as the ideal scope for the autumn deer woods. With multi-coated optics for increased brightness in low-light conditions, the avid inner hunter in you will be most satisfied. No question about it, they're designed to excel during the day's most important times.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51Ml828qzqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006DWT4L0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B006EE695Q", "title": "Apex Tactical M&P Trigger Kit with FSS Polymer Replacement Trigger for 9mm, .357 Sig, .40 S&W, and .45 ACP Models", "description": "This is the best drop in trigger system available for the M&P; 9mm, .40, and .357 Sig. This kit includes the action enhancement parts of Duty/Carry Enhancement Kit and Competition Enhancement Kit and adds a robust trigger that reduces pre-travel by 20%. It includes trigger springs for both a 4-4.5 pound and 5-5.5 pound trigger, giving you the flexibility to decide between competition or duty/carry applications.The Apex Polymer Action Enhancement Trigger Kit directly replaces the factory hinged trigger with a solid body polymer trigger with a center mounted pivoting safety. The rounded face of the trigger provides a smooth comfortable surface for the shooter's finger while firing.Apex Tactical Specialties S&W; M&P; Trigger Forward Set Sear & Trigger Kit FSS.Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "text": "Apex Tactical M&P Trigger Kit with FSS Polymer Replacement Trigger for 9mm, .357 Sig, .40 S&W, and .45 ACP Models This is the best drop in trigger system available for the M&P; 9mm, .40, and .357 Sig. This kit includes the action enhancement parts of Duty/Carry Enhancement Kit and Competition Enhancement Kit and adds a robust trigger that reduces pre-travel by 20%. It includes trigger springs for both a 4-4.5 pound and 5-5.5 pound trigger, giving you the flexibility to decide between competition or duty/carry applications.The Apex Polymer Action Enhancement Trigger Kit directly replaces the factory hinged trigger with a solid body polymer trigger with a center mounted pivoting safety. The rounded face of the trigger provides a smooth comfortable surface for the shooter's finger while firing.Apex Tactical Specialties S&W; M&P; Trigger Forward Set Sear & Trigger Kit FSS.Please Note: Please check your state regulations, hunting regulations, etc before placing an order with this supplier. Your order may be canceled if the item is not able to be shipped to your state due to their regulations.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tHH1V-vqL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006EE695Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Accessories", "Kisser Buttons"]], "price": 129.95}}
{"item_id": "B006EE6F3W", "title": "Magpul Speedplate Black - Glock 9mm/.40S&W 3 Pack Speed Plate MP MAG230-BLK", "description": "Similar in concept to the Magpul Ranger Plate, the Speedplate allows for rapid magazine extraction and positive handling. Protects the base of magazine from impact. The Speedplate replaces factory floorplates on GLOCK 9mm and .40S&W; pistol magazines.Made in U.S.A.", "text": "Magpul Speedplate Black - Glock 9mm/.40S&W 3 Pack Speed Plate MP MAG230-BLK Similar in concept to the Magpul Ranger Plate, the Speedplate allows for rapid magazine extraction and positive handling. Protects the base of magazine from impact. The Speedplate replaces factory floorplates on GLOCK 9mm and .40S&W; pistol magazines.Made in U.S.A.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BCTxyotIL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006EE6F3W.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Magpul", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 13.4}}
