{"item_id": "B006EHACXS", "title": "Coghlans Collapsible Water Container", "description": "The 5 Gallon Collapsible Water Container provides a convenient way to transport and use water wherever you need it. The convenient on/off spigot is removable, so it’s easy to fill. The Carrier’s molded handles make for easy carrying. When empty, the Carrier folds flat for easy transport and storage. Made of a food approved plastic and is BPA free.", "text": "Coghlans Collapsible Water Container The 5 Gallon Collapsible Water Container provides a convenient way to transport and use water wherever you need it. The convenient on/off spigot is removable, so it’s easy to fill. The Carrier’s molded handles make for easy carrying. When empty, the Carrier folds flat for easy transport and storage. Made of a food approved plastic and is BPA free.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51XRqinXgAL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006EHACXS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coghlans", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 9.99}}
{"item_id": "B006ERS99C", "title": "GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist Outdoor Cook Set", "description": "GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist is an ultra light. The nFORM Ultralight line has taken the unique needs of fast and light backpacking and built a system of solutions that defy the notion that ultra light means making sacrifices. Time, comfort, efficiency, performance and ultra-light weight in a system built for one or two.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist Outdoor Cook Set GSI Outdoors Pinnacle Soloist is an ultra light. The nFORM Ultralight line has taken the unique needs of fast and light backpacking and built a system of solutions that defy the notion that ultra light means making sacrifices. Time, comfort, efficiency, performance and ultra-light weight in a system built for one or two.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31UJJeKuWnL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ERS99C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Pots & Pans", "Pots & Pans"]], "price": 44.5}}
{"item_id": "B006ERSWLM", "title": "Nalgene Grip-N-Gulp Water Bottle", "description": "Side indents are easy for tiny hands to grasp. Soft touch lid makes drinking comfortable. Superior threading on cup and lid is engineered to prevent spills. Cup, lid, and removable sipper valve are all top rack dishwasher safe. Lid loop can be clipped to backpack, diaper bag or stroller. Cup is compatible with OTG, ATB and wide-mouth closures. Indestructible, translucent, odor, stain and residue resistant. 12 oz.", "text": "Nalgene Grip-N-Gulp Water Bottle Side indents are easy for tiny hands to grasp. Soft touch lid makes drinking comfortable. Superior threading on cup and lid is engineered to prevent spills. Cup, lid, and removable sipper valve are all top rack dishwasher safe. Lid loop can be clipped to backpack, diaper bag or stroller. Cup is compatible with OTG, ATB and wide-mouth closures. Indestructible, translucent, odor, stain and residue resistant. 12 oz.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41QvrGBCoDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ERSWLM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nalgene", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Accessories", "Sports Water Bottles"]], "price": 7.95}}
{"item_id": "B006ERT8WO", "title": "GSI Outdoors Halulite MicroDualist Cookware Set", "description": "Diminuitive, integrated cooking and eating solution.", "text": "GSI Outdoors Halulite MicroDualist Cookware Set Diminuitive, integrated cooking and eating solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BIerA4QQL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ERT8WO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GSI", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Campfire Cookware"]], "price": 49.95}}
{"item_id": "B006ESIUHM", "title": "Birchwood Casey Battle Target 8 Pack", "description": "Fun for all ages. Improve your shooting skills with these colorful Dirty Bird style targets. Each shot will “halo” white so you instantly know where your shot has hit. Use them while shooting alone or appeal to your competitive side and try to beat your shooting partner. With Battle at Sea, try to sink all of your opponents’ ships before they get yours.", "text": "Birchwood Casey Battle Target 8 Pack Fun for all ages. Improve your shooting skills with these colorful Dirty Bird style targets. Each shot will “halo” white so you instantly know where your shot has hit. Use them while shooting alone or appeal to your competitive side and try to beat your shooting partner. With Battle at Sea, try to sink all of your opponents’ ships before they get yours.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51gDqvEcWCL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ESIUHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Birchwood Casey", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Targets & Accessories"]], "price": 12.31}}
{"item_id": "B006ESJEE0", "title": "KNS AR15 Hooded-Duplex Front SightBlack", "description": "Sight Body Style - Hooded .240 aperture. Crosshair Type - Duplex. Crosshair Size - .010 / .020 Diameter. Crosshair Material - Heat treated. Installation - Replaces mil-spec front sight post sight w/o modifications to the weapon. Does not require a special tool. Using a ball point pin to depress the front sight detent, the installer can simply rotate the hooded sight with the finger tips.", "text": "KNS AR15 Hooded-Duplex Front SightBlack Sight Body Style - Hooded .240 aperture. Crosshair Type - Duplex. Crosshair Size - .010 / .020 Diameter. Crosshair Material - Heat treated. Installation - Replaces mil-spec front sight post sight w/o modifications to the weapon. Does not require a special tool. Using a ball point pin to depress the front sight detent, the installer can simply rotate the hooded sight with the finger tips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31-6IPts2cL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ESJEE0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "KNS Precision", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 28.45}}
{"item_id": "B006ESJJUY", "title": "Midwest Industries AK Railed Scope Mount with American Defense Throw Lever, Black", "description": "This AK railed scope mount features a 6.75\" long rail for mounting a variety of optics to your rifle. This is designed to attach to rifles with built-in AK receiver rail interfaces using the ADM auto lock system.", "text": "Midwest Industries AK Railed Scope Mount with American Defense Throw Lever, Black This AK railed scope mount features a 6.75\" long rail for mounting a variety of optics to your rifle. This is designed to attach to rifles with built-in AK receiver rail interfaces using the ADM auto lock system.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41SLzsvuw6L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ESJJUY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Midwest Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Optics Mounts & Bases"]], "price": 114.93}}
