{"item_id": "B006FFSJ7U", "title": "niceeshop(TM) Innovative Black Waterproof Silicone Wrap-around Rear Bicycle Light/Flashlight with 2 LED", "description": "Adorable frog shape with LED light, offer you a safety and bright riding environment.Front & rear design, cold- and heat-resistant, well stretchy and use in handlebar, saddle pipe support, backpacks, shelves, helmets, etc.Install or remove without any toolsA good helper for riding, camping and hikingButton cell includedColor: show as pictures.Notice: Color of pictures may varies by different monitor setting. All pictures are real stock photos.Package include:1 x bicycle lightPlease note:1> niceeshop(TM) is a registered trademark and the only authorized seller of niceeshop branded products.2> niceeshop provide you various kinds of great products at the lowest possible prices, welcome to our store and get what you want !!!3> niceeshop highly appriciate all customers' opinions to improve the selling ,also if anything you unsatisfied, pls contact our customer service department for probable best solution.", "text": "niceeshop(TM) Innovative Black Waterproof Silicone Wrap-around Rear Bicycle Light/Flashlight with 2 LED Adorable frog shape with LED light, offer you a safety and bright riding environment.Front & rear design, cold- and heat-resistant, well stretchy and use in handlebar, saddle pipe support, backpacks, shelves, helmets, etc.Install or remove without any toolsA good helper for riding, camping and hikingButton cell includedColor: show as pictures.Notice: Color of pictures may varies by different monitor setting. All pictures are real stock photos.Package include:1 x bicycle lightPlease note:1> niceeshop(TM) is a registered trademark and the only authorized seller of niceeshop branded products.2> niceeshop provide you various kinds of great products at the lowest possible prices, welcome to our store and get what you want !!!3> niceeshop highly appriciate all customers' opinions to improve the selling ,also if anything you unsatisfied, pls contact our customer service department for probable best solution.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4196m5yUiRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006FFSJ7U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "niceEshop", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Taillights"]], "price": 2.29}}
{"item_id": "B006FLDWT4", "title": "Magpul Airsoft PTS MS2 Multi-Mission Sling System BLACK", "description": "Driven by the operational experience of Magpul Dynamics instructors and specifically made for the airsoft community, the Magpul PTS MS2 Multi-Mission Sling System is made nearly identical in every way like its Magpul USA counterpart and was designed to give a versatile weapon-retention solution for a multitude of tactical environments and missions. As a standalone product, the rapidly-convertible MS2 allows an operator to leverage the maneuverability of Single-Point attachment for direct-action, or two-point attachment for stability. Single-hand adjustments, quick-detach lanyard and positive-locking metal hardware provide flexibility and durability in a truly adaptable sling system. Used in conjunction with the Magpul ASAP plate (sold separately), the MS2 enables seamless transitions into an array of shooting positions without getting bound or fouled. The MS2 concept allows switching from Weapon Shoulder to Reaction Shoulder for shooting around corners, under vehicles, or to minimize exposure.", "text": "Magpul Airsoft PTS MS2 Multi-Mission Sling System BLACK Driven by the operational experience of Magpul Dynamics instructors and specifically made for the airsoft community, the Magpul PTS MS2 Multi-Mission Sling System is made nearly identical in every way like its Magpul USA counterpart and was designed to give a versatile weapon-retention solution for a multitude of tactical environments and missions. As a standalone product, the rapidly-convertible MS2 allows an operator to leverage the maneuverability of Single-Point attachment for direct-action, or two-point attachment for stability. Single-hand adjustments, quick-detach lanyard and positive-locking metal hardware provide flexibility and durability in a truly adaptable sling system. Used in conjunction with the Magpul ASAP plate (sold separately), the MS2 enables seamless transitions into an array of shooting positions without getting bound or fouled. The MS2 concept allows switching from Weapon Shoulder to Reaction Shoulder for shooting around corners, under vehicles, or to minimize exposure.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/510xtVwZaPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006FLDWT4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MAGPUL PTS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Slings"]], "price": 42.0}}
{"item_id": "B006FMAO08", "title": "Standing Room 100 hanging Family/Cabin Camping Tent", "description": "MUST HAVE CANOPY FRAME! FRAME NOT INCLUDED The Fast Up \"Standing Room\" tent is an excellent shelter with vertical walls that most people can stand straight up in. If you are tall and want a tent with headroom, this tent has over 8 feet of height at the center, and the vertical walls allow use of the full floor space The tent and the gazebo come separately and nearly any 10'x10' (straight leg) canopy or gazebo can be used as a cover and the support for this tent. The tent by itself comes with a solid waterproof top that is covered and sheltered from rain and sun by the gazebo or 10'x10' canopy tent roof insuring a weather proof environment . Other features include two Power Cord outlets that velcro shut as well as four storage pouches located conveniently around the walls of the tent. Two doors allow easy access to and from and allow two or more tents to be \"stacked\" together. The doors and windows all zip shut to keep rain and bugs out, and the tent has a tub style floor, so it is completely enclosed. The tent itself hangs from the canopy by hooks at the four corners. It is a great family tent with room in the 10' X 10' model for two queen sized air mattresses or air beds and 5 sleepers. Another nice feature is the simplicity and ease of setting it up, so that even the youngest campers can jump in and help and be effective. Easily set up in under 10 minutes.MUST HAVE CANOPY FRAME! FRAME NOT INCLUDED", "text": "Standing Room 100 hanging Family/Cabin Camping Tent MUST HAVE CANOPY FRAME! FRAME NOT INCLUDED The Fast Up \"Standing Room\" tent is an excellent shelter with vertical walls that most people can stand straight up in. If you are tall and want a tent with headroom, this tent has over 8 feet of height at the center, and the vertical walls allow use of the full floor space The tent and the gazebo come separately and nearly any 10'x10' (straight leg) canopy or gazebo can be used as a cover and the support for this tent. The tent by itself comes with a solid waterproof top that is covered and sheltered from rain and sun by the gazebo or 10'x10' canopy tent roof insuring a weather proof environment . Other features include two Power Cord outlets that velcro shut as well as four storage pouches located conveniently around the walls of the tent. Two doors allow easy access to and from and allow two or more tents to be \"stacked\" together. The doors and windows all zip shut to keep rain and bugs out, and the tent has a tub style floor, so it is completely enclosed. The tent itself hangs from the canopy by hooks at the four corners. It is a great family tent with room in the 10' X 10' model for two queen sized air mattresses or air beds and 5 sleepers. Another nice feature is the simplicity and ease of setting it up, so that even the youngest campers can jump in and help and be effective. Easily set up in under 10 minutes.MUST HAVE CANOPY FRAME! FRAME NOT INCLUDED", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51pVJgt-lDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006FMAO08.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 139.0}}
{"item_id": "B006FOGIRO", "title": "Condor Recon Chest Rig (Multicam)", "description": "- Genuine Crye Precision Multicam material, sewn in foreign country. -chest rig comes with three BUILT IN stackerKangaroo type mag pouch, will hold six M4 mag and six pistol mag. -Swivel Lockster - Swivel Push-Button release buckle. -Padded cross-back shoulder strap with webbing and D-ring. -Additional mesh pocket on the back. -Two open-top mag pouch. (one on each side) - One size fits most", "text": "Condor Recon Chest Rig (Multicam) - Genuine Crye Precision Multicam material, sewn in foreign country. -chest rig comes with three BUILT IN stackerKangaroo type mag pouch, will hold six M4 mag and six pistol mag. -Swivel Lockster - Swivel Push-Button release buckle. -Padded cross-back shoulder strap with webbing and D-ring. -Additional mesh pocket on the back. -Two open-top mag pouch. (one on each side) - One size fits most", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51vpK-WGFiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006FOGIRO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Condor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Hydration", "Flasks"]], "price": 51.81}}
