{"item_id": "B006GGC898", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle Lower Receiver Mag Magazine Red Injected Polymer Gunsmith Vise Block", "description": "Constructed of red injection molded polymer.Easy to use, the block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 Rifle Lower Receiver Mag Magazine Red Injected Polymer Gunsmith Vise Block Constructed of red injection molded polymer.Easy to use, the block allows the user to work on and install parts to AR-15 / M16 lower receivers. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. The block slips into the rifle's magazine well and is held in place by the rifle's magazine catch.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P9JPzrWDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GGC898.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Storage & Safes", "Ammunition & Magazine Pouches"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B006GGC8QQ", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear 2 Piece .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 A1 A2 Rifle Upper Receiver Mag Magazine Polymer Gunsmith Action Vise Block", "description": "Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Fits both carry handles & flattop uppers. Easy to use, the block lets you tightly clamp a carry handle receiver or flattop receiver in a large bench vise. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. Holds the rifle firm so you can work on your rifle securely without scratching or damaging the finish for effective cleaning, assembly, and repair. Made In the USA", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear 2 Piece .223 5.56 AR15 AR-15 M4 M16 A1 A2 Rifle Upper Receiver Mag Magazine Polymer Gunsmith Action Vise Block Constructed of black injection molded polymer.Fits both carry handles & flattop uppers. Easy to use, the block lets you tightly clamp a carry handle receiver or flattop receiver in a large bench vise. The vise block is locked into the users table/workbench vise. Holds the rifle firm so you can work on your rifle securely without scratching or damaging the finish for effective cleaning, assembly, and repair. Made In the USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41LvCnXSQ8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GGC8QQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 24.95}}
{"item_id": "B006GHDE68", "title": "Fyxation Bar End Plugs", "description": "The Fyxation Bar End Cap is the ultimate accessory to finish off your ride or to plug an open ended handlebar.", "text": "Fyxation Bar End Plugs The Fyxation Bar End Cap is the ultimate accessory to finish off your ride or to plug an open ended handlebar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41A1NE72ZcL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GHDE68.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fyxation", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Grips"]], "price": 11.66}}
{"item_id": "B006GHDH5G", "title": "Fyxation Rodeo Pursuit Bullhorn Handle Bar", "description": "The Fyxation Rodeo Pursuit Bullhorn bar provides a wide range of hand positions and a subtle 40mm drop for a comfortable and quick forward position. Whether riding the center for comfortable spinning or forward for sprints, the Rodeo Bullhorn bar is the ideal city bar.", "text": "Fyxation Rodeo Pursuit Bullhorn Handle Bar The Fyxation Rodeo Pursuit Bullhorn bar provides a wide range of hand positions and a subtle 40mm drop for a comfortable and quick forward position. Whether riding the center for comfortable spinning or forward for sprints, the Rodeo Bullhorn bar is the ideal city bar.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31oo5eMWhzL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GHDH5G.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Handlebars"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006GHE1XS", "title": "Ultimate Arms Gear Dark Earth 5X \"CQB\" Tactical Magnifier for Red Dot Scope-Sight : Includes \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Ring", "description": "Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation \"CQB\" 5X Scope/Sight Magnifier :Package Includes Matching Dark Earth 30mm Quick Detach Weaver 7/8\" Mounting Ring. Superior Quality 3x Fixed Magnification, Multi Coated 30mm diameter lens allows in maximum light. With a weight of 6 oz and a length of 4.5\", this Magnifier has the ability to switch in a split second from CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to longer range for a great tactical advantage. Field Of View : 6 Degrees , and 1.65\" Eye relief. Sealed Fog-Proof Internal optics, waterproof, shockproof. Finish/Color is a non reflective Dark Earth with a hard coat finish. Works with Eotech & Aimpoint Compact Sights and similar Sights/Scopes . A favorite with Military - Law Enforcement - Hunters.", "text": "Ultimate Arms Gear Dark Earth 5X \"CQB\" Tactical Magnifier for Red Dot Scope-Sight : Includes \"QD\" Quick Detach Weaver-Picatinny Mounting Ring Ultimate Arms Gear New Generation \"CQB\" 5X Scope/Sight Magnifier :Package Includes Matching Dark Earth 30mm Quick Detach Weaver 7/8\" Mounting Ring. Superior Quality 3x Fixed Magnification, Multi Coated 30mm diameter lens allows in maximum light. With a weight of 6 oz and a length of 4.5\", this Magnifier has the ability to switch in a split second from CQB (Close Quarters Battle) to longer range for a great tactical advantage. Field Of View : 6 Degrees , and 1.65\" Eye relief. Sealed Fog-Proof Internal optics, waterproof, shockproof. Finish/Color is a non reflective Dark Earth with a hard coat finish. Works with Eotech & Aimpoint Compact Sights and similar Sights/Scopes . A favorite with Military - Law Enforcement - Hunters.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/319bEeGFGnL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GHE1XS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ultimate Arms Gear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 64.95}}
{"item_id": "B006GJ8NX0", "title": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 4-Person Instant Tent", "description": "Add this Rainfly to your Coleman 4-Person Instant Tent, and you can comfortably open the tent windows while still keeping your tent dry in the rain. The Rainfly also instantly creates a spacious vestibule outside -- perfect for stowing shoes and other gear. The Rainfly fits the 8'x7' four-person Instant Tent.", "text": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 4-Person Instant Tent Add this Rainfly to your Coleman 4-Person Instant Tent, and you can comfortably open the tent windows while still keeping your tent dry in the rain. The Rainfly also instantly creates a spacious vestibule outside -- perfect for stowing shoes and other gear. The Rainfly fits the 8'x7' four-person Instant Tent.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GjImRoX7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GJ8NX0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 29.83}}
{"item_id": "B006GJ8PFG", "title": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 6-Person Instant Tent", "description": "Get better airflow when camping in your Coleman Instant six-person tent with this Instant tent rainfly. Coleman tents are well sealed and protected from the rain, so campers sometime lose airflow when it starts to pour. Designed for Coleman's 10-by-9-foot Instant tents, the rainfly not only provides added protection from the weather, but it also allows you to crack your windows during a storm and still stay dry. Plus, the rainfly creates a spacious vestibule outside--perfect for stowing shoes and other gear.", "text": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 6-Person Instant Tent Get better airflow when camping in your Coleman Instant six-person tent with this Instant tent rainfly. Coleman tents are well sealed and protected from the rain, so campers sometime lose airflow when it starts to pour. Designed for Coleman's 10-by-9-foot Instant tents, the rainfly not only provides added protection from the weather, but it also allows you to crack your windows during a storm and still stay dry. Plus, the rainfly creates a spacious vestibule outside--perfect for stowing shoes and other gear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31B5MESZj1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GJ8PFG.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents"]], "price": 34.99}}
{"item_id": "B006GJ8Q7S", "title": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 8-Person Instant Tent", "description": "", "text": "Coleman Rainfly for Coleman 8-Person Instant Tent", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41UI7QV7GNL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GJ8Q7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tents", "Family Camping Tents"]], "price": 39.99}}
{"item_id": "B006GOK5FE", "title": "Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant/SVT-40 Scope", "description": "One of the most recognizable pieces of rifle equipment is reborn! The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant scope is a replication of the Russian PU Scope, originally noted for its precision and distinguished as one of the most consistently used rifle pieces throughout the Soviet Union during World War II. In capable hands, a Mosin-Nagant sniper rifle fitted with the PU Scope was a formidable weapon and now Firefield users can achieve that same intensity. The Firefield PU scope's metal body, thick lenses, tough mechanism and firm mount allowed the PU scope to withstand uncommonly rough conditions and its design is timeless, having been tried and tested throughout the decades. The Firefield recreation of the PU scope merges a well known, classic design with the latest in optic technology and stays true to the original three post design, and multicoated, specially shaped lenses that greatly improve both clarity and accuracy. The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant/SVT-40 Scope is available in the standard black matte finish and comes with a cast iron scope mount, mounting screws and cast iron mount receiver. With a 3.5 times magnification, the user can see up to 200 yards and wind age and elevation knobs provide maximum customization. The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant is the “must have” item for any collector, enthusiast or Mosin-Nagant rifle owner and is protected by the Firefield three year warranty. Firefield-Victory justifies Everything!", "text": "Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant/SVT-40 Scope One of the most recognizable pieces of rifle equipment is reborn! The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant scope is a replication of the Russian PU Scope, originally noted for its precision and distinguished as one of the most consistently used rifle pieces throughout the Soviet Union during World War II. In capable hands, a Mosin-Nagant sniper rifle fitted with the PU Scope was a formidable weapon and now Firefield users can achieve that same intensity. The Firefield PU scope's metal body, thick lenses, tough mechanism and firm mount allowed the PU scope to withstand uncommonly rough conditions and its design is timeless, having been tried and tested throughout the decades. The Firefield recreation of the PU scope merges a well known, classic design with the latest in optic technology and stays true to the original three post design, and multicoated, specially shaped lenses that greatly improve both clarity and accuracy. The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant/SVT-40 Scope is available in the standard black matte finish and comes with a cast iron scope mount, mounting screws and cast iron mount receiver. With a 3.5 times magnification, the user can see up to 200 yards and wind age and elevation knobs provide maximum customization. The Firefield PU Mosin-Nagant is the “must have” item for any collector, enthusiast or Mosin-Nagant rifle owner and is protected by the Firefield three year warranty. Firefield-Victory justifies Everything!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/418-v1tD-QL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GOK5FE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Firefield", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 128.0}}
{"item_id": "B006GT50EA", "title": "Ultralight Backpacking Canister Rocket Camp Stove 3.9oz", "description": "Ultralight backpacking camp stove, weighs only 3.9oz packed in the bag! Uses Iso-butane/propane canisters. One is pictured as an example but is not included.This is a great stove at a UNBELIEVABLE price. You get a durable, ultralight canister stove, and weighs only 3.9oz. This stove is built very well, do not let the price fool you! Quality construction and materials are at work in this stove. I guarantee you will be happy! These stoves wok with any screw top iso butane / propane canisters, available just about anywhere, MSR, coleman, camping gaz, etc.This stove will also simmer. It has a fully adjustable flame! This really is an impressive stove. When I got these in i was expecting something much cheaper, I am totally impressed with this little guy.These would make great primary stoves, back up stoves, emergency, spares, Boy Scout troops etc etc endless possibilities, and the price is right!", "text": "Ultralight Backpacking Canister Rocket Camp Stove 3.9oz Ultralight backpacking camp stove, weighs only 3.9oz packed in the bag! Uses Iso-butane/propane canisters. One is pictured as an example but is not included.This is a great stove at a UNBELIEVABLE price. You get a durable, ultralight canister stove, and weighs only 3.9oz. This stove is built very well, do not let the price fool you! Quality construction and materials are at work in this stove. I guarantee you will be happy! These stoves wok with any screw top iso butane / propane canisters, available just about anywhere, MSR, coleman, camping gaz, etc.This stove will also simmer. It has a fully adjustable flame! This really is an impressive stove. When I got these in i was expecting something much cheaper, I am totally impressed with this little guy.These would make great primary stoves, back up stoves, emergency, spares, Boy Scout troops etc etc endless possibilities, and the price is right!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QQNSxGirL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006GT50EA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "GO Outdoors", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Camp Stoves"]], "price": 4.65}}
{"item_id": "B006H0QD7G", "title": "Rifle Barrel Clamp Accessory Weaver Mount Rail", "description": "Barrel Clamped Weaver Rail. Great for mounting flashlight, laser sight, bipod etc. right to your barrel.", "text": "Rifle Barrel Clamp Accessory Weaver Mount Rail Barrel Clamped Weaver Rail. Great for mounting flashlight, laser sight, bipod etc. right to your barrel.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-nAr9UOML._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006H0QD7G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DYZ", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 5.18}}
{"item_id": "B006H1ZDBC", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Rendezvous Chair", "description": "Standing around a campfire is great, but why stand when you can lounge like a medieval lord' The ALPS Mountaineering Rendezvous Chair instantly transforms camp into a luxurious, velour-ensconced palace of delights. OK, that's a bit of an exaggeration, but it's definitely more comfortable than sitting on the ground.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Rendezvous Chair Standing around a campfire is great, but why stand when you can lounge like a medieval lord' The ALPS Mountaineering Rendezvous Chair instantly transforms camp into a luxurious, velour-ensconced palace of delights. OK, that's a bit of an exaggeration, but it's definitely more comfortable than sitting on the ground.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411pDLMKHdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006H1ZDBC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camping Furniture", "Chairs"]], "price": 42.19}}
{"item_id": "B006H1ZWR2", "title": "ALPS Mountaineering Chaos 3 Tent Floor Saver", "description": "Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "text": "ALPS Mountaineering Chaos 3 Tent Floor Saver Our floor savers are a great addition to any tent purchase. They are cut a little smaller than the dimension of the tent floor and have a webbing loop on the corners, which makes it easy to pull and stake out with the tent stakes. Simple, fast and all at a great price.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jjla8GzQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006H1ZWR2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "ALPS Mountaineering", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Tent Accessories", "Footprints"]], "price": 33.69}}
{"item_id": "B006H7YEPC", "title": "Magpul MBUS Sight Set (Front & Rear) - GEN 2, Black w/ Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth", "description": "The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The dual aperture MBUS Rear Sight is adjustable for windage and fits all MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny rail equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform.The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The MBUS Front Sight is adjustable for elevation and fits most Picatinny-railed hand guard equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform.SureFire EP3 Sonic DefendersEP3 Sonic Defenders protect your hearing without interfering with your ability to hear routine sounds or conversations. Their double-flange stem design fits most people and provides a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 24dB. Sounds, at safe levels, are allowed to pass through into the ear canal, while potentially harmful noises (above 85dB) are reduced via a proprietary design that incorporates the patented Hocks Noise Braker filter. EP3s include attached stopper plugs, which can be inserted for further protection, and they also block out lower-level noise like that heard on a plane. They can be used in situations where hearing ambient sounds or conversations isn't critical. The right/left color-coded Sonic Defenders are made from a soft but durable, hypoallergenic polymer and are ergonomically shaped, with an adjustable-stem design, providing a secure fit, all-day comfort, and extended product life (3 to 6+ months, depending on usage and care). And their low-profile design means they can be worn while wearing a helmet or mask, or while using a phone or headset. Each set is packaged in a convenient carry case.", "text": "Magpul MBUS Sight Set (Front & Rear) - GEN 2, Black w/ Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The dual aperture MBUS Rear Sight is adjustable for windage and fits all MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny rail equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform.The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The MBUS Front Sight is adjustable for elevation and fits most Picatinny-railed hand guard equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform.SureFire EP3 Sonic DefendersEP3 Sonic Defenders protect your hearing without interfering with your ability to hear routine sounds or conversations. Their double-flange stem design fits most people and provides a Noise Reduction Rating (NRR) of 24dB. Sounds, at safe levels, are allowed to pass through into the ear canal, while potentially harmful noises (above 85dB) are reduced via a proprietary design that incorporates the patented Hocks Noise Braker filter. EP3s include attached stopper plugs, which can be inserted for further protection, and they also block out lower-level noise like that heard on a plane. They can be used in situations where hearing ambient sounds or conversations isn't critical. The right/left color-coded Sonic Defenders are made from a soft but durable, hypoallergenic polymer and are ergonomically shaped, with an adjustable-stem design, providing a secure fit, all-day comfort, and extended product life (3 to 6+ months, depending on usage and care). And their low-profile design means they can be worn while wearing a helmet or mask, or while using a phone or headset. Each set is packaged in a convenient carry case.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31voGOlO4BL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006H7YEPC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earplugs"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B006H7YVT6", "title": "Magpul MBUS Sight Set (Front & Rear) - GEN 2, Dark Earth w/ Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth", "description": "The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The dual aperture MBUS Rear Sight is adjustable for windage and fits all MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny rail equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform. The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The MBUS Front Sight is adjustable for elevation and fits most Picatinny-railed hand guard equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform. Free MSP Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth Cloth May be use over and over again untill it wears out, Dot not wash this cloth. Sise: 14\" x 15\" Use on: Guns Gun Sights Fishing Reels Fishing Tactle", "text": "Magpul MBUS Sight Set (Front & Rear) - GEN 2, Dark Earth w/ Free MSP Silicone Gun Cloth The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The dual aperture MBUS Rear Sight is adjustable for windage and fits all MIL-STD-1913 Picatinny rail equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform. The new MBUS (Magpul Back-Up Sight) GEN 2 is a low-cost, color injection molded, folding back-up sight. The MBUS Front Sight is adjustable for elevation and fits most Picatinny-railed hand guard equipped weapons, but is specifically tailored to the AR15/M16/M4 platform. Free MSP Silicone Gun & Reel Cloth Cloth May be use over and over again untill it wears out, Dot not wash this cloth. Sise: 14\" x 15\" Use on: Guns Gun Sights Fishing Reels Fishing Tactle", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31%2BE3hasqsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006H7YVT6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Gun Stock Accessories"]], "price": 89.95}}
{"item_id": "B006HFA1YC", "title": "Coleman 9-Can Soft Cooler With Hard Liner", "description": "The Coleman 9-Can Soft Cooler goes with you to work, to sporting events and tailgates, picnics, and beyond. It holds 9 cans inside, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, back mesh pocket, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! Sporting an adjustable shoulder strap, the cooler is soft on the outside for comfortable carrying, and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect your sandwich and other food from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides protection to resist odors, mold and mildew.", "text": "Coleman 9-Can Soft Cooler With Hard Liner The Coleman 9-Can Soft Cooler goes with you to work, to sporting events and tailgates, picnics, and beyond. It holds 9 cans inside, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, back mesh pocket, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! Sporting an adjustable shoulder strap, the cooler is soft on the outside for comfortable carrying, and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect your sandwich and other food from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides protection to resist odors, mold and mildew.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HtwYk4S9L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HFA1YC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 13.99}}
{"item_id": "B006HFB5S8", "title": "Coleman 42-Can Wheeled Soft Cooler With Hard Liner", "description": "The Coleman 42-Can Wheeled Soft Cooler goes with you to the campsite, the BBQ, sporting events, tailgates and beyond. It features durable wheels and a retractable handle, so it's easy and comfortable to transport to wherever the party is. The cooler is big enough to hold 42 cans, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, side mesh pockets, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! The cooler is soft on the outside and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect the contents from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides to resist odors, mold, and mildew.", "text": "Coleman 42-Can Wheeled Soft Cooler With Hard Liner The Coleman 42-Can Wheeled Soft Cooler goes with you to the campsite, the BBQ, sporting events, tailgates and beyond. It features durable wheels and a retractable handle, so it's easy and comfortable to transport to wherever the party is. The cooler is big enough to hold 42 cans, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, side mesh pockets, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! The cooler is soft on the outside and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect the contents from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides to resist odors, mold, and mildew.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41sBi0QM%2BBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HFB5S8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 49.76}}
{"item_id": "B006HFBF7E", "title": "Coleman 30-Can Soft Cooler With Hard Liner", "description": "The Coleman 30-Can Soft Cooler goes with you to picnics, BBQs, camping, sporting events, tailgates and beyond. It holds 30 cans inside, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, side mesh pockets, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! Sporting an adjustable shoulder strap, the cooler is soft on the outside for comfortable carrying, and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect your food from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides antimicrobial protection, to resist odors, mold, and mildew.", "text": "Coleman 30-Can Soft Cooler With Hard Liner The Coleman 30-Can Soft Cooler goes with you to picnics, BBQs, camping, sporting events, tailgates and beyond. It holds 30 cans inside, and features plenty of extra storage space in its front zippered pocket, side mesh pockets, and mesh pocket in the lid. There are even bungees on the lid for stowing more extras! Sporting an adjustable shoulder strap, the cooler is soft on the outside for comfortable carrying, and has a hard plastic liner inside to protect your food from being crushed. The liner material is FDA approved for food contact, and is removable for easy cleaning. The Soft Cooler provides antimicrobial protection, to resist odors, mold, and mildew.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51tf74NUZCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HFBF7E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Coolers"]], "price": 23.78}}
