{"item_id": "B006HJC8Q2", "title": "Ocean Kayak Scupper Valves M - 2-Pack", "description": "Pop the medium Scupper Valve into your Ocean Kayak's hull and put an end to the soggy rear. Pull em out when it's time to port-out and those scupper holes can do their duty of draining any water that decided to stow away in your boat.", "text": "Ocean Kayak Scupper Valves M - 2-Pack Pop the medium Scupper Valve into your Ocean Kayak's hull and put an end to the soggy rear. Pull em out when it's time to port-out and those scupper holes can do their duty of draining any water that decided to stow away in your boat.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41zEB%2ByotiL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HJC8Q2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ocean Kayak", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayak Hardware"]], "price": 9.95}}
{"item_id": "B006HLYPQQ", "title": "Olicamp Space Saver Aluminum Mug", "description": "An aluminum version of Olicamp's best selling Space Saver Cup. The Space Saver Mug fits snuggly over the bottom of a 1 quart, round Nalgene bottle saving valuable space in your pack. Innovative handle design feels more like your favorite mug at home while still folding compactly.", "text": "Olicamp Space Saver Aluminum Mug An aluminum version of Olicamp's best selling Space Saver Cup. The Space Saver Mug fits snuggly over the bottom of a 1 quart, round Nalgene bottle saving valuable space in your pack. Innovative handle design feels more like your favorite mug at home while still folding compactly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41bGr8hAuKL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HLYPQQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Olicamp", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 9.59}}
{"item_id": "B006HMDN6S", "title": "Pair of Pace Maker Extended Life Vulcanized Rubber Replacement Tips/asphalt Paws Ferrules (Fits Almost All Brands of Poles)", "description": "Ideal for Nordic Walking on pavement and other hard surfaces. Unlike cheap rubber feet, these are guaranteed to keep you walking and walking. Made of the finest quality of vulcanized rubber, these paws compare with the finest shoes available on the market. These are guaranteed to stand the test of time. These tips will fit over almost all pole tips.", "text": "Pair of Pace Maker Extended Life Vulcanized Rubber Replacement Tips/asphalt Paws Ferrules (Fits Almost All Brands of Poles) Ideal for Nordic Walking on pavement and other hard surfaces. Unlike cheap rubber feet, these are guaranteed to keep you walking and walking. Made of the finest quality of vulcanized rubber, these paws compare with the finest shoes available on the market. These are guaranteed to stand the test of time. These tips will fit over almost all pole tips.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21YWocLLr3L.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HMDN6S.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 7.95}}
