{"item_id": "B006HWTZYM", "title": "Fury Tactical Kuba-Kickz Self Defense Control Device", "description": "Kuba-Kickz from Fury Products is the only non-lethal self defense tool available for your shoes. It fits above the tongue and between the laces of your shoe to provide a simple, lightweight, yet devastatingly effective non-lethal self defense tool. Anyone can use the Kuba-Kickz regardless of their level of self defense training. Quick kicks to an attacker's arms and legs can help you escape a dangerous assault; even a simple kick to the shins will have your assailant re-thinking the wisdom of choosing you for a target. Great for anyone who needs a light weight, unobtrusive and covert defense tool. Available in a number of coordinating colors. Buy two for added protection. 1\" wide x 2.5\" long x 1.25\" tall.", "text": "Fury Tactical Kuba-Kickz Self Defense Control Device Kuba-Kickz from Fury Products is the only non-lethal self defense tool available for your shoes. It fits above the tongue and between the laces of your shoe to provide a simple, lightweight, yet devastatingly effective non-lethal self defense tool. Anyone can use the Kuba-Kickz regardless of their level of self defense training. Quick kicks to an attacker's arms and legs can help you escape a dangerous assault; even a simple kick to the shins will have your assailant re-thinking the wisdom of choosing you for a target. Great for anyone who needs a light weight, unobtrusive and covert defense tool. Available in a number of coordinating colors. Buy two for added protection. 1\" wide x 2.5\" long x 1.25\" tall.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51u2p2wI13L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HWTZYM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Fury Tactical", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Weapons"]], "price": 8.59}}
{"item_id": "B006HYVR7S", "title": "Walker's Alpha Series Power Muffs", "description": "Walkers Alpha Muffs SSL (Super Slim Lite) provides unsurpassed sound quality. &nbsp;Featuring two wind resistant, high frequency stereo microphones for precise sound directionality, they offer up to 5x hearing enhancement and a noise reduction rating of 24db. Take these Walkers ear muffs on your next trip to the shooting range or hunting. The highly advanced technology incorporated in the Walkers Hearing Protection allows excellent speech clarity, superior hearing protection and sound enhancement. Guard your valuable hearing with an additional layer of protection given by the electronic sound activated compression circuitry, which reduces loud sounds such as muzzle blasts to levels safe for your ears. Walkers Alpha Power Muffs also provide the ability of amplifying sound up to 5x your normal hearing with the two microphones on each cup. Walkers Alpha Muffs SSL (Super Slim Lite) Features: 5x Enhancement Power of 50dB Two wind resistant, high frequency, stereo microphones for precise sound directionality 5x Hearing Enhancement/lo&gt; Two independent volume controls Sound activated compression Anti-Bacterial agent to prevent growth of mold Noise reducing rating, NRR 24dB Ultimate acoustic seal ear pads Available in D-Max Green Gray Carbon Finish Slim profile ideal for smaller heads, women and youth Power source 2 Energizer &lsquo;AAA&rsquo; batteries (included)", "text": "Walker's Alpha Series Power Muffs Walkers Alpha Muffs SSL (Super Slim Lite) provides unsurpassed sound quality. &nbsp;Featuring two wind resistant, high frequency stereo microphones for precise sound directionality, they offer up to 5x hearing enhancement and a noise reduction rating of 24db. Take these Walkers ear muffs on your next trip to the shooting range or hunting. The highly advanced technology incorporated in the Walkers Hearing Protection allows excellent speech clarity, superior hearing protection and sound enhancement. Guard your valuable hearing with an additional layer of protection given by the electronic sound activated compression circuitry, which reduces loud sounds such as muzzle blasts to levels safe for your ears. Walkers Alpha Power Muffs also provide the ability of amplifying sound up to 5x your normal hearing with the two microphones on each cup. Walkers Alpha Muffs SSL (Super Slim Lite) Features: 5x Enhancement Power of 50dB Two wind resistant, high frequency, stereo microphones for precise sound directionality 5x Hearing Enhancement/lo&gt; Two independent volume controls Sound activated compression Anti-Bacterial agent to prevent growth of mold Noise reducing rating, NRR 24dB Ultimate acoustic seal ear pads Available in D-Max Green Gray Carbon Finish Slim profile ideal for smaller heads, women and youth Power source 2 Energizer &lsquo;AAA&rsquo; batteries (included)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4128Jc47T-L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006HYVR7S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Walker&#39;s Game Ear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Eyewear & Hearing Protection", "Earmuffs"]], "price": 55.12}}
{"item_id": "B006IGMGRA", "title": "AR15 Cleaning Kit Refill, Pipe Cleaners and Swabs for AR15 M16 M4 AK47", "description": "Stop using your wife's q-tips and craft grade pipe cleaners that just leave fuzz in your firearms. Kit includes: 100 six inch wood cotton swabs 44 six inch coarse pipe cleaners 4 nylon cleaning picks 2 nylon cleaning brushes 1 empty oil bottle Not just for AR15's. Great for general use on all firearms.", "text": "AR15 Cleaning Kit Refill, Pipe Cleaners and Swabs for AR15 M16 M4 AK47 Stop using your wife's q-tips and craft grade pipe cleaners that just leave fuzz in your firearms. Kit includes: 100 six inch wood cotton swabs 44 six inch coarse pipe cleaners 4 nylon cleaning picks 2 nylon cleaning brushes 1 empty oil bottle Not just for AR15's. Great for general use on all firearms.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/419rYEdrGaL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006IGMGRA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gun Cleaning Kits"]]}}
