{"item_id": "B006IVWXFA", "title": "Atwood Rope 550-Pound Type III 7 Strand Core Paracord", "description": "Don't be fooled by cheap paracord. Atwood Rope makes the original 550 Type III paracord right here in the USA. Unlike inferior parachute cord, all Atwood paracord consists of a seven strand core made with three separate strands. This stuff is tough! Paracord is a must for camping, hiking, survival and millions of other uses including securing equipment, shoelaces, vehicle tie downs, sewing, repairing equipment, making a bow, making a shelter, fish gill nets, fishing line, animal snares, clothes lines, lanyards, anchor line, binding, adult recreation, restraints, tooth floss, splints, tourniquet, braiding, bracelets and other crafts. This 100' bundle is great addition to your survival kit or pack. Get the color you want; everything from our traditional and camouflage series to our Zombie apocalypse line. You will love it. Genuine Atwood Paracord has the Atwood Rope Mfg. Co. label; accept no substitutes!", "text": "Atwood Rope 550-Pound Type III 7 Strand Core Paracord Don't be fooled by cheap paracord. Atwood Rope makes the original 550 Type III paracord right here in the USA. Unlike inferior parachute cord, all Atwood paracord consists of a seven strand core made with three separate strands. This stuff is tough! Paracord is a must for camping, hiking, survival and millions of other uses including securing equipment, shoelaces, vehicle tie downs, sewing, repairing equipment, making a bow, making a shelter, fish gill nets, fishing line, animal snares, clothes lines, lanyards, anchor line, binding, adult recreation, restraints, tooth floss, splints, tourniquet, braiding, bracelets and other crafts. This 100' bundle is great addition to your survival kit or pack. Get the color you want; everything from our traditional and camouflage series to our Zombie apocalypse line. You will love it. Genuine Atwood Paracord has the Atwood Rope Mfg. Co. label; accept no substitutes!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31EJAgOwHlL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006IVWXFA.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Atwood Rope Mfg. Co", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 8.0}}
{"item_id": "B006IXB73C", "title": "Intex Seahawk 2 Boat Set", "description": "Get ready for your next great adventure in the Seahawk series of boats. If you looking for a day at the lake with the family or fishing with friends the Seahawk series has something to fit your needs. Upgraded features and rugged vinyl construction make this a great boat for anyone. Set includes 48\" Oars and high output pump.Need a Boat Certificate of Origin? Write down the HIN (Hull Identification Number) and go to www.intexcorp.com. On the first screen that pops up, select your location. Click on the \"Need a Boat Certificate of Origin?\" option under Consumer Information. Choose your boat model. Enter the required information and print your certificate.", "text": "Intex Seahawk 2 Boat Set Get ready for your next great adventure in the Seahawk series of boats. If you looking for a day at the lake with the family or fishing with friends the Seahawk series has something to fit your needs. Upgraded features and rugged vinyl construction make this a great boat for anyone. Set includes 48\" Oars and high output pump.Need a Boat Certificate of Origin? Write down the HIN (Hull Identification Number) and go to www.intexcorp.com. On the first screen that pops up, select your location. Click on the \"Need a Boat Certificate of Origin?\" option under Consumer Information. Choose your boat model. Enter the required information and print your certificate.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51e4%2BV%2B8R4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006IXB73C.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Intex", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Boating", "Boats", "Inflatable Rafts"]], "price": 48.74}}
{"item_id": "B006J0PHAI", "title": "Leg Shield | Superior Pant Strap for Biking | 1 unit", "description": "The Leg Shield is the perfect solution for protecting your right pant leg from hard-to-clean grease stains and preventing pants from getting jammed in the bike gears. With the existing trouser clips and straps, grease still gets on pants when rubbing against the chain, the strap/clips slip down, or come apart. Additional Uses: 1. the Neon Yellow with Reflective Leg Shield enhances visibility to traffic 2. A pair can be worn for protection against rain/dirt. The Leg Shield was built to last and comes with a solid 3-Year Guarantee; if it does not last 3 years we will replace it for free. It is made with strong zig-zag stitching. It has three premium Velcro style straps which are easy to tear off, fit securely, and can withstand heavy usage. Made with a thin layer of neoprene which is flexible, durable, and allows for a snug fit around your leg and will not fall down. Because neoprene is not as flimsy as other materials, it is easy to put on and take off. Cyclists are free from worry and concern about ruining their pants and can have a safe and enjoyable bike ride. Easy to carry or store, can be stored around the frame of the bike. Great for bike commuters and recumbent riders. Hand wash and line dry only. Product Dimensions: 11.5 inches tall & the neoprene is 2mm thick. The Leg Shield was designed to be worn on either leg. The Leg Shield can get warm, wearing it slightly loose will make it feel cooler. Use the Leg Shield and you don't need to install a bicycle chain guard. Universal size that fits most adults. Fits calf sizes between 11.5-18 inches (29-46 cm). Calf measurement is the circumference at the widest part of the calf. Each order is 1 unit, not a pair. Makes a great gift.", "text": "Leg Shield | Superior Pant Strap for Biking | 1 unit The Leg Shield is the perfect solution for protecting your right pant leg from hard-to-clean grease stains and preventing pants from getting jammed in the bike gears. With the existing trouser clips and straps, grease still gets on pants when rubbing against the chain, the strap/clips slip down, or come apart. Additional Uses: 1. the Neon Yellow with Reflective Leg Shield enhances visibility to traffic 2. A pair can be worn for protection against rain/dirt. The Leg Shield was built to last and comes with a solid 3-Year Guarantee; if it does not last 3 years we will replace it for free. It is made with strong zig-zag stitching. It has three premium Velcro style straps which are easy to tear off, fit securely, and can withstand heavy usage. Made with a thin layer of neoprene which is flexible, durable, and allows for a snug fit around your leg and will not fall down. Because neoprene is not as flimsy as other materials, it is easy to put on and take off. Cyclists are free from worry and concern about ruining their pants and can have a safe and enjoyable bike ride. Easy to carry or store, can be stored around the frame of the bike. Great for bike commuters and recumbent riders. Hand wash and line dry only. Product Dimensions: 11.5 inches tall & the neoprene is 2mm thick. The Leg Shield was designed to be worn on either leg. The Leg Shield can get warm, wearing it slightly loose will make it feel cooler. Use the Leg Shield and you don't need to install a bicycle chain guard. Universal size that fits most adults. Fits calf sizes between 11.5-18 inches (29-46 cm). Calf measurement is the circumference at the widest part of the calf. Each order is 1 unit, not a pair. Makes a great gift.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/514x%2BNOVg8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J0PHAI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Protective Gear"]], "price": 16.95}}
{"item_id": "B006J15694", "title": "Old Town Contour Carry Handle, Set of 2", "description": "Exact replacement for broken or lost Old Town kayak bow or stern carry handles. Minimal easy snap-together assembly required.", "text": "Old Town Contour Carry Handle, Set of 2 Exact replacement for broken or lost Old Town kayak bow or stern carry handles. Minimal easy snap-together assembly required.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41eNn2--ShL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J15694.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Boating & Water Sports", "Kayaking", "Kayak Hardware"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006J31OZ2", "title": "DeSantis Super Fly Pocket Holster - Ambidextrous, Black M44BJV5Z0 - Ruger LC9 & Beretta", "description": "DeSantis Super Fly Pocket Holster - Ambidextrous, Black M44BJV5Z0 - Ruger LC9 & Beretta Nano", "text": "DeSantis Super Fly Pocket Holster - Ambidextrous, Black M44BJV5Z0 - Ruger LC9 & Beretta DeSantis Super Fly Pocket Holster - Ambidextrous, Black M44BJV5Z0 - Ruger LC9 & Beretta Nano", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31fALAF1iYL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J31OZ2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 26.89}}
{"item_id": "B006J31PAQ", "title": "Desantis Nemesis Holster for LC9 Nano Gun, Black", "description": "This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. The Nemesis pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. .", "text": "Desantis Nemesis Holster for LC9 Nano Gun, Black This will revolutionize pocket holsters. Never before has there been a material this viscous. The Nemesis pocket holster will absolutely not move out of position in your front pocket. The inside is made of a slick pack cloth for a low friction draw and the core is just the right amount of foam to break up the outline of the gun. .", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31sRCEK7yjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J31PAQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "DeSantis", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 12.5}}
{"item_id": "B006J3EEHM", "title": "Coleman 1-Person Stainless Steel Mess Kit", "description": "The Coleman 1-Person Stainless Steel Mess Kit has everything you need for cooking and eating on the trail, at camp, and beyond. For cooking, you get a 6.25\" frying pan with dual-use lid (use it as a lid or as a second pan), a 2-quart cooking pot, and a pan gripper, all made of rugged #304-grade stainless steel. For eating, there's a 6\" bowl and 12-ounce mug, both made of BPA-free polypropylene and both conveniently dishwasher-safe. Everything nests together compactly, for easy packing and transport, in the included mesh carry bag.", "text": "Coleman 1-Person Stainless Steel Mess Kit The Coleman 1-Person Stainless Steel Mess Kit has everything you need for cooking and eating on the trail, at camp, and beyond. For cooking, you get a 6.25\" frying pan with dual-use lid (use it as a lid or as a second pan), a 2-quart cooking pot, and a pan gripper, all made of rugged #304-grade stainless steel. For eating, there's a 6\" bowl and 12-ounce mug, both made of BPA-free polypropylene and both conveniently dishwasher-safe. Everything nests together compactly, for easy packing and transport, in the included mesh carry bag.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41slczufAOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J3EEHM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Cooking Utensils"]], "price": 28.99}}
{"item_id": "B006J3EFM6", "title": "Coleman Trekking Pole", "description": "The Coleman Trekking Pole is lightweight, strong, and adjustable -- perfect to get you there and back. It's made of durable, lightweight aluminum, with a strong tungsten carbide tip with removable basket. The pole easily adjusts to suit your height, from 27\"-53\". A rorational friction clamp allows quick adjustment. Shock-absorbing springs stand up to rugged use, and the contoured cork handle grip is comfortable and features an adjustable nylon strap.", "text": "Coleman Trekking Pole The Coleman Trekking Pole is lightweight, strong, and adjustable -- perfect to get you there and back. It's made of durable, lightweight aluminum, with a strong tungsten carbide tip with removable basket. The pole easily adjusts to suit your height, from 27\"-53\". A rorational friction clamp allows quick adjustment. Shock-absorbing springs stand up to rugged use, and the contoured cork handle grip is comfortable and features an adjustable nylon strap.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Q-5Rs51eL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J3EFM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Coleman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Trekking Poles"]], "price": 19.9}}
{"item_id": "B006J64XBQ", "title": "Firefield MG \"Kemper XL\" Machine Gun Reflex Sight", "description": "Get ready for action with the Firefield MG \"Kemper XL\" Machine Gun reflex sight. The Kemper XL features the largest objective lens window on the market with unlimited eye relief and a large field of view. Featuring a bullet drop compensator circle-dot reticle, the Kemper XL has dual color options in red and green and five adjustable reticle brightness settings, so every marksman can customize his or her sight. Designed for use on machine guns, the Firefield Kemper XL withstands even the toughest recoil for maximum intensity and a rubber shield protects against scratching and damage, prolonging the life of the unit. Perfect for any shooter wanting the maximum in quick acquisition and a field of view so large, it can be used for skeet shooting and fast moving varmint hunting. The Kemper XL sight features a two piece weaver mount that is also compatible with bolt action rifles because it features a longer mount. Operable with just one CR2032 battery, the Firefield Kemper XL is great for quick target acquisition and will get the shooter on paper every time. Firefield-Victory Justifies Everything.", "text": "Firefield MG \"Kemper XL\" Machine Gun Reflex Sight Get ready for action with the Firefield MG \"Kemper XL\" Machine Gun reflex sight. The Kemper XL features the largest objective lens window on the market with unlimited eye relief and a large field of view. Featuring a bullet drop compensator circle-dot reticle, the Kemper XL has dual color options in red and green and five adjustable reticle brightness settings, so every marksman can customize his or her sight. Designed for use on machine guns, the Firefield Kemper XL withstands even the toughest recoil for maximum intensity and a rubber shield protects against scratching and damage, prolonging the life of the unit. Perfect for any shooter wanting the maximum in quick acquisition and a field of view so large, it can be used for skeet shooting and fast moving varmint hunting. The Kemper XL sight features a two piece weaver mount that is also compatible with bolt action rifles because it features a longer mount. Operable with just one CR2032 battery, the Firefield Kemper XL is great for quick target acquisition and will get the shooter on paper every time. Firefield-Victory Justifies Everything.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hLyFKvcZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J64XBQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 119.99}}
{"item_id": "B006J6I4RU", "title": "-10f Us Military Modular Intermediate Black Sleeping Bag", "description": "BLACK INTERMEDIATE SLEEPING BAG. THIS IS A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, INTERMEDIATE COLD WEATHER, BLACK, SLEEPING BAG. NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! THE SYSTEM, IS BRILLIANTLY, CONSTRUCTED, TO INSULATE, THE USER, FROM MILD TO COLD WEATHER!!! A BLACK INTERMEDIATE BAG, RATED TO -10 DEGREES F, IF USED ALONE AND RATED TO -30 DEGREES, WHEN USED, WITH THE PATROL BAG. WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR COLD WEATHER CLIMATES, FROM 30 DEGREES TO -10 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. ABOUT 85 INCHES LONG. AND ABOUT 35 INCHES WIDE. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "text": "-10f Us Military Modular Intermediate Black Sleeping Bag BLACK INTERMEDIATE SLEEPING BAG. THIS IS A GENUINE, AUTHENTIC, OFFICIAL, U.S. MILITARY ISSUE, INTERMEDIATE COLD WEATHER, BLACK, SLEEPING BAG. NO RIPS, NO HOLES, NO TEARS!!! THE SYSTEM, IS BRILLIANTLY, CONSTRUCTED, TO INSULATE, THE USER, FROM MILD TO COLD WEATHER!!! A BLACK INTERMEDIATE BAG, RATED TO -10 DEGREES F, IF USED ALONE AND RATED TO -30 DEGREES, WHEN USED, WITH THE PATROL BAG. WATER RESISTANT, RIP STOP NYLON. RECOMMENDED, FOR COLD WEATHER CLIMATES, FROM 30 DEGREES TO -10 DEGREES. ADJUSTABLE HOOD. ABOUT 85 INCHES LONG. AND ABOUT 35 INCHES WIDE. ALL ZIPPERS AND SNAPS WORK EXCELLENT!! A GREAT VALUE!!! AN EXCELLENT ADDITION TO YOUR OUTDOOR GEAR!!! Ideal for camping, hunting, fishing, hiking or any outdoor activities!!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41TEfuoN-bL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006J6I4RU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Tennier Industries", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Sleeping Bags"]], "price": 39.5}}
