{"item_id": "B006JUP0G4", "title": "Louis Garneau Equipe Bib Short - Men's LG Red, M", "description": "The prospect of wearing through your grundle while participating in the RAAM won\\222t help your pre-race psyche. Lucky for you Louis Garneau added the magical Crabyon fabric to their supportive chamois in the Equipe Bib Short. It not only offers support for those super-long rides like the RAAM, it may even accelerate wound healing.Product FeaturesMaterial: Lycra Power, Fit Sensor (60% nylon, 24% polyester, 16% Lycra), Power Mesh (85% polyester, 15% spandex)Fit: compressiveInseam: (Medium) 11.25 inChamois: yes, AirGelChamois Thickness:Removable Chamois:Bib: yesPockets: 1 back radioSPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: training, racingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "text": "Louis Garneau Equipe Bib Short - Men's LG Red, M The prospect of wearing through your grundle while participating in the RAAM won\\222t help your pre-race psyche. Lucky for you Louis Garneau added the magical Crabyon fabric to their supportive chamois in the Equipe Bib Short. It not only offers support for those super-long rides like the RAAM, it may even accelerate wound healing.Product FeaturesMaterial: Lycra Power, Fit Sensor (60% nylon, 24% polyester, 16% Lycra), Power Mesh (85% polyester, 15% spandex)Fit: compressiveInseam: (Medium) 11.25 inChamois: yes, AirGelChamois Thickness:Removable Chamois:Bib: yesPockets: 1 back radioSPF Rating:UPF Rating:Recommended Use: training, racingManufacturer Warranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31P81wGgcWL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JUP0G4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts", "Compression Shorts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006JV4UGE", "title": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer .380 ACP Cartridge", "description": "The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to for the popular .380ACP, the new Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.", "text": "Laserlyte Laser Trainer .380 ACP Cartridge The caliber-specific Laser Trainer Cartridge that offers a revolutionary way to train almost anywhere. The Laser Trainer Cartridge is the most realistic training option in LaserLyte's popular line of Laser Trainers with the choice to practice tap, rack, bang or malfunction drills. Designed to for the popular .380ACP, the new Laser Trainer Cartridge fits inside the pistol chamber and features a firing-pin activated switch that indicates bullet impact with a bright red laser dot. For the cost of one or two visits to a local range, shooting enthusiasts can enjoy a lifetime of free training with the Laser Trainer Cartridge at the location that works best for them.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415t7QL1INL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JV4UGE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 79.99}}
