{"item_id": "B006JWWWX6", "title": "16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack", "description": "Replace your red disposable party plastic cups with Klean Kanteen's 16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack. These re-usable, dishwasher safe pint cups are made of food-grade stainless steel that won't retain the flavors from any beverages you pour into them. They won't break like glass and are extremely portable, whether you are spending a weekend hiking and camping or just going to a friend's barbecue. PRODUCT FEATURES: 18/8, food-grade stainless steel Durable and won't break like glass Easily stackable and transportable Electropolished interior Laser-etched exterior Dishwasher safe Doesn't retain or impart flavors Pint Ring available as accessory Lifetime warranty KSSC16-4PK , Klean Kanteen 16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , clean cantean , cleen canteen , pint cup pack , klean kanteen pint cup pack , 4pk pint cups , klean kanteen 4pk , water bottles , cups , drinking , hydration , camping , hiking , backpacking , stainless steel , stainless steal , BPA free , metal cup , non-plastic cup , ss pint cup , metal pint glass", "text": "16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack Replace your red disposable party plastic cups with Klean Kanteen's 16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack. These re-usable, dishwasher safe pint cups are made of food-grade stainless steel that won't retain the flavors from any beverages you pour into them. They won't break like glass and are extremely portable, whether you are spending a weekend hiking and camping or just going to a friend's barbecue. PRODUCT FEATURES: 18/8, food-grade stainless steel Durable and won't break like glass Easily stackable and transportable Electropolished interior Laser-etched exterior Dishwasher safe Doesn't retain or impart flavors Pint Ring available as accessory Lifetime warranty KSSC16-4PK , Klean Kanteen 16oz Pint Cup 4-Pack , water bottles , kleen kanteen , klean kantean , clean canteen , clean cantean , cleen canteen , pint cup pack , klean kanteen pint cup pack , 4pk pint cups , klean kanteen 4pk , water bottles , cups , drinking , hydration , camping , hiking , backpacking , stainless steel , stainless steal , BPA free , metal cup , non-plastic cup , ss pint cup , metal pint glass", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41r0o9kEb7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JWWWX6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klean Kanteen", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Dishes & Utensils", "Cups & Mugs"]], "price": 30.0}}
{"item_id": "B006JYHFJA", "title": "TETON Sports Trailrunner 2.0 Hydration Backpack w/ Bladder (16.5\"x 10.5\"x .7\", Black)", "description": "Minimalist pack comes with 70-ounce/2 liter bladder, deep pocket for snacks and wallet, exterior bungee with barrel lock. Low-profile athletic cut rides above jersey pockets, below bike helmets. Adjustable waist/shoulder fits men and women. Wide mesh straps and chest shock absorber reduce bounce. Cushioned, ventilated back panel. FDA-compliant food grade bladder constructed with triple-heat sealed edges, 2” opening for easy fill and cleaning, heavy duty kink-free sip tube, cushioned bite valve, twist-lock to prevent leaks.", "text": "TETON Sports Trailrunner 2.0 Hydration Backpack w/ Bladder (16.5\"x 10.5\"x .7\", Black) Minimalist pack comes with 70-ounce/2 liter bladder, deep pocket for snacks and wallet, exterior bungee with barrel lock. Low-profile athletic cut rides above jersey pockets, below bike helmets. Adjustable waist/shoulder fits men and women. Wide mesh straps and chest shock absorber reduce bounce. Cushioned, ventilated back panel. FDA-compliant food grade bladder constructed with triple-heat sealed edges, 2” opening for easy fill and cleaning, heavy duty kink-free sip tube, cushioned bite valve, twist-lock to prevent leaks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51E383tgjFL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JYHFJA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 24.33}}
{"item_id": "B006JYHG3U", "title": "TETON Sports Oasis1100 Hydration Backpack with Bladder (18.5\"x 10\"x 7\", Green)", "description": "Three zipper pockets, stash space, and two mesh pouches make this 1,100 cubic inch hydration pack roomy enough for day or overnight trips. Low-profile athletic cut with full adjustment fits both men and women comfortably. Sturdy and lightweight. Wide mesh straps with ventilated foam and chest shock absorber. FDA-compliant food grade bladder with triple-heat sealed edges, 2” opening for easy fill and cleaning, kink-free sip tube, cushioned bite valve, and twist-lock to prevent leaks.", "text": "TETON Sports Oasis1100 Hydration Backpack with Bladder (18.5\"x 10\"x 7\", Green) Three zipper pockets, stash space, and two mesh pouches make this 1,100 cubic inch hydration pack roomy enough for day or overnight trips. Low-profile athletic cut with full adjustment fits both men and women comfortably. Sturdy and lightweight. Wide mesh straps with ventilated foam and chest shock absorber. FDA-compliant food grade bladder with triple-heat sealed edges, 2” opening for easy fill and cleaning, kink-free sip tube, cushioned bite valve, and twist-lock to prevent leaks.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HkYkPcVVL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JYHG3U.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hydration Packs"]], "price": 42.14}}
{"item_id": "B006JYHGM6", "title": "TETON Sports Summit1500 Ultralight Internal Frame Backpack (22.5\"x 11\"x 9\", Orange)", "description": "This hydration-ready daypack fits a 2.5-liter bladder (not included) and has left and right ports and clips for drinking tube. With six pockets, two pouches, slide storage, and gear loops, the Summit1500 stores everything you need for an overnight or full-day trip. Front map pocket has storm-proof zipper and water-resistant liner. Compression straps cover side pouches to keep water bottles or longer items in place. Adjustable comfort harness fits children or adults. Lifetime guarantee.", "text": "TETON Sports Summit1500 Ultralight Internal Frame Backpack (22.5\"x 11\"x 9\", Orange) This hydration-ready daypack fits a 2.5-liter bladder (not included) and has left and right ports and clips for drinking tube. With six pockets, two pouches, slide storage, and gear loops, the Summit1500 stores everything you need for an overnight or full-day trip. Front map pocket has storm-proof zipper and water-resistant liner. Compression straps cover side pouches to keep water bottles or longer items in place. Adjustable comfort harness fits children or adults. Lifetime guarantee.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41nQR8clxvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JYHGM6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 59.99}}
{"item_id": "B006JYHHL6", "title": "TETON Sports Hiker3700 Ultralight Internal Frame Backpack (30.5\"x 12.5\"x 12.5\", Red)", "description": "A rugged all-purpose pack large enough for three- or four-day outdoor adventures. Includes custom-fit features such as split waist wings for independent top and bottom adjustments at hips and waist, contoured harness with redesigned chest straps, sliding torso lengthener, and forward-tightening load straps. This hydration-ready pack fits a 2.5-liter bladder (not included) and comes with added lumbar support and lightweight aluminum stays to support heavy loads. With plenty of pockets, gear loops, and external compression straps, the Hiker3700 will hold everything and still be comfortable to wear.", "text": "TETON Sports Hiker3700 Ultralight Internal Frame Backpack (30.5\"x 12.5\"x 12.5\", Red) A rugged all-purpose pack large enough for three- or four-day outdoor adventures. Includes custom-fit features such as split waist wings for independent top and bottom adjustments at hips and waist, contoured harness with redesigned chest straps, sliding torso lengthener, and forward-tightening load straps. This hydration-ready pack fits a 2.5-liter bladder (not included) and comes with added lumbar support and lightweight aluminum stays to support heavy loads. With plenty of pockets, gear loops, and external compression straps, the Hiker3700 will hold everything and still be comfortable to wear.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416dELMalZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JYHHL6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 83.58}}
{"item_id": "B006JYHJ9G", "title": "TETON Sports Canyon2100 Canyoneering Internal Frame Backpack (25.5\"x 13\"x 11.5\", Orange)", "description": "Load this pack up with a change of clothes and shoes, food, sleeping bag, tent, poles, ice axe, mini cook stove, and more, yet pack still rides tight and comfortable so you can run and jump without fear of losing anything. PVC/PET dry bag fits inside or hangs from loop to protect keys and valuables in wet or muddy conditions. This low-profile pack has a comfort harness, padded shoulders and back, four adjustment points and is hydration-ready fitting up to a 2.5-liter bladder (not included).", "text": "TETON Sports Canyon2100 Canyoneering Internal Frame Backpack (25.5\"x 13\"x 11.5\", Orange) Load this pack up with a change of clothes and shoes, food, sleeping bag, tent, poles, ice axe, mini cook stove, and more, yet pack still rides tight and comfortable so you can run and jump without fear of losing anything. PVC/PET dry bag fits inside or hangs from loop to protect keys and valuables in wet or muddy conditions. This low-profile pack has a comfort harness, padded shoulders and back, four adjustment points and is hydration-ready fitting up to a 2.5-liter bladder (not included).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tJ3L5BQbL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006JYHJ9G.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Teton Sports", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Internal Frame Backpacks"]], "price": 69.33}}
{"item_id": "B006K3KXEY", "title": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Travis Haley: Adaptive Handgun", "description": "Special Operations Veteran Travis Haley delivers a modern hand gunfighting program for military, government contractors, law enforcement officers, responsible armed citizens and competitors built around mindset and skill.", "text": "Panteao Productions Make Ready with Travis Haley: Adaptive Handgun Special Operations Veteran Travis Haley delivers a modern hand gunfighting program for military, government contractors, law enforcement officers, responsible armed citizens and competitors built around mindset and skill.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51DUaR-FlDL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006K3KXEY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Panteao Productions", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 48.1}}
{"item_id": "B006K3Z7UY", "title": "Combat Sports Pro Style MMA Gloves", "description": "MMA fight gloves meet all state regulations for professional competition. 5-ounce weight as mandated my state athletic commissions Full 3/4-inch padding that allows increased safety of the hands and opponent Open palm that allows full gripping capabilities Synthetic leather construction for resiliency Three size options, including Regular (150lbs. and lighter) and Large (heavier than 150 lbs.)", "text": "Combat Sports Pro Style MMA Gloves MMA fight gloves meet all state regulations for professional competition. 5-ounce weight as mandated my state athletic commissions Full 3/4-inch padding that allows increased safety of the hands and opponent Open palm that allows full gripping capabilities Synthetic leather construction for resiliency Three size options, including Regular (150lbs. and lighter) and Large (heavier than 150 lbs.)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/515Ztgg2EsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006K3Z7UY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Martial Arts", "Training Equipment", "Training Gloves"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006K408LG", "title": "Ringside 150 -Poundheavy Duty Heavy Bag Spring", "description": "Lessens shock so bag mounts last longer. Manufactured for use with bags as heavy as 150 lbs.", "text": "Ringside 150 -Poundheavy Duty Heavy Bag Spring Lessens shock so bag mounts last longer. Manufactured for use with bags as heavy as 150 lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41PbdOD9nZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006K408LG.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Ringside", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Other Sports", "Boxing", "Boxing Pads"]], "price": 7.99}}
