{"item_id": "B006KN7ZZO", "title": "Tech Sight's MINI200 Adjustable Aperture Sight for the Ruger® Mini 14 and Ranch Rifle 5800 Series", "description": "The new MINI200 sight for the Ruger Mini 14 and Ranch Rifles. This sight upgrade for the 5800 models manufactured after 2005 and Ranch Rifles produced prior to 2005 adds a new dimension of adjustability to the venerable Mini 14 family of rifles. The new sight provides: All Steel Construction Easy Click Adjustments on Elevation Easy Click Adjustments on Windage Standard .062 Aperture Optional Aperture inserts available: .042\", .062\", and .086\". (contact us for avialablity) Easy installation Replaces the fragile Fold Down Aperture on pre 2005 Ranch Rifles Adds adjustment ease to the 5800 series produced from 2005 to present Includes parts needed for both models pre 2005 and post 2005. For pre 2005 has included Retro Mounting Kit. (not need when installing on post 2005 rifle.) fits Ruger rifle series models:5805, 5806, 5814, 5817, 5846, 5847, 5848, & 5853. Compatible with TS211 Sight adjusting tool (ASIN: B0086T8IVU) and IRAS aperture inserts(ASIN: B00ANWVAAY). (not included but also available on Amazon)", "text": "Tech Sight's MINI200 Adjustable Aperture Sight for the Ruger® Mini 14 and Ranch Rifle 5800 Series The new MINI200 sight for the Ruger Mini 14 and Ranch Rifles. This sight upgrade for the 5800 models manufactured after 2005 and Ranch Rifles produced prior to 2005 adds a new dimension of adjustability to the venerable Mini 14 family of rifles. The new sight provides: All Steel Construction Easy Click Adjustments on Elevation Easy Click Adjustments on Windage Standard .062 Aperture Optional Aperture inserts available: .042\", .062\", and .086\". (contact us for avialablity) Easy installation Replaces the fragile Fold Down Aperture on pre 2005 Ranch Rifles Adds adjustment ease to the 5800 series produced from 2005 to present Includes parts needed for both models pre 2005 and post 2005. For pre 2005 has included Retro Mounting Kit. (not need when installing on post 2005 rifle.) fits Ruger rifle series models:5805, 5806, 5814, 5817, 5846, 5847, 5848, & 5853. Compatible with TS211 Sight adjusting tool (ASIN: B0086T8IVU) and IRAS aperture inserts(ASIN: B00ANWVAAY). (not included but also available on Amazon)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/416JwgwJp1L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006KN7ZZO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 79.99}}
