{"item_id": "B006M9NJJW", "title": "Gerber 31-001078 Bear Grylls Scout Essentials Kit, Plastic Case", "description": "There are a few non-negotiable items that every outdoor adventurer must have. This is one of them. The Scout Essentials Kit has been designed by Bear Grylls and Gerber for absolute safety and survival in the wild. Every detail has been carefully considered; even the polypropylene case doubles as a water capturing device. Complete with a first aid kit, waterproof matches, L.E.D. Micro Torch light, Compact Scout knife, button compass and Bear's \"Priorities of Survival\" Guide, this is the cornerstone of packing for any trip through the backcountry.", "text": "Gerber 31-001078 Bear Grylls Scout Essentials Kit, Plastic Case There are a few non-negotiable items that every outdoor adventurer must have. This is one of them. The Scout Essentials Kit has been designed by Bear Grylls and Gerber for absolute safety and survival in the wild. Every detail has been carefully considered; even the polypropylene case doubles as a water capturing device. Complete with a first aid kit, waterproof matches, L.E.D. Micro Torch light, Compact Scout knife, button compass and Bear's \"Priorities of Survival\" Guide, this is the cornerstone of packing for any trip through the backcountry.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51HCgQM4nDL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006M9NJJW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 17.41}}
{"item_id": "B006M9NJNI", "title": "Gerber 30-000433 Remix Tactical Clip Folder, Serrated Edge", "description": "Building off the success of our popular Remix series, the Remix Tactical Clip Folder marries a broad three inch serrated tanto blade with our iconic Remix handle design. It's a tactically inspired, tip up pocket carrier with class. A newly designed thumb lift provides stability and safety while cutting. Made with a slim, lightweight handle and a blade that opens with one hand it is an ideal choice for your everyday carry knife.", "text": "Gerber 30-000433 Remix Tactical Clip Folder, Serrated Edge Building off the success of our popular Remix series, the Remix Tactical Clip Folder marries a broad three inch serrated tanto blade with our iconic Remix handle design. It's a tactically inspired, tip up pocket carrier with class. A newly designed thumb lift provides stability and safety while cutting. Made with a slim, lightweight handle and a blade that opens with one hand it is an ideal choice for your everyday carry knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31hX-z2LlrL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006M9NJNI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B006M9NK1O", "title": "Gerber 31-001066 Bear Grylls Compact Fixed Blade", "description": "Compact and indestructible, this full tang knife is designed to be a smaller, bare-bones survival knife that stays at hand. The durable rubber handle is ergonomically shaped for a better, more comfortable grip in all types of weather. It includes a lightweight plastic sheath that clips to a belt or backpack and Bear's Priorities of Survival guide. For light and fast day trips into the woods the compact fixed blade is the right knife.", "text": "Gerber 31-001066 Bear Grylls Compact Fixed Blade Compact and indestructible, this full tang knife is designed to be a smaller, bare-bones survival knife that stays at hand. The durable rubber handle is ergonomically shaped for a better, more comfortable grip in all types of weather. It includes a lightweight plastic sheath that clips to a belt or backpack and Bear's Priorities of Survival guide. For light and fast day trips into the woods the compact fixed blade is the right knife.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31i62WrZI8L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006M9NK1O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 18.55}}
{"item_id": "B006MHIBA6", "title": "CoreBody Reformer", "description": "Combining three core-focused workout types in one, the portable Bowflex CoreBody reformer keeps you fit without requiring a ton of storage space. The women's CoreBody reformer offers dozens of exercise options centered around yoga for flexibility, dance for burning calories, and Pilates for strengthening and toning your muscles. With three resistance levels--3 pounds, 6 pounds, and 9 pounds--you can start slow while your body adjusts, and then escalate your workout as you get stronger, slimmer, and toned all over.The CoreBody reformer's portable design lets you workout out wherever you want.It's easy to get up to speed on the CoreBody reformer thanks to the included workout DVD, which offers four complete workouts: Total Body One, Total Body Express, Core Essentials, and Stretch & Renew. Whether you have time for a full-body workout or just a quick energy boost, each fun, flexible routine will lead you through the exercises so you'll never get bored. The reformer also comes with Go-Anywhere fitness flip cards, which illustrate more than 32 exercises unique to the CoreBody reformer. As your strength and flexibility increases, so does the intensity of the exercises, with options for everyone--beginner to advanced. The cards include eight recommended workouts and are color coded by target area.To help with your diet, the CoreBody reformer comes with a weight loss plan that lets you customize a balanced diet of carbs and proteins to maximize energy gain and fat loss. Whether you're dining out or eating in, the weight loss plan shows you how to enjoy your favorite foods while losing weight. Other accessories include a workout poster that helps you keep track of your weekly progress, a carrying strap for easy portability, and a blue washable cover that keeps the reformer looking--and performing--its best.Best of all, the entire unit folds into a convenient tube, so you can take the CoreBody reformer pretty much anywhere--on business trips, camping excursions, family vacations, and more.SpecificationsResistance levels: Low (3 pounds), medium (6 pounds), and high (9 pounds)Tube length: 42.3 inchesCrossbar length: 37.4 inchesCapacity: 300 poundsWeight: 17 poundsWarranty: 1 year", "text": "CoreBody Reformer Combining three core-focused workout types in one, the portable Bowflex CoreBody reformer keeps you fit without requiring a ton of storage space. The women's CoreBody reformer offers dozens of exercise options centered around yoga for flexibility, dance for burning calories, and Pilates for strengthening and toning your muscles. With three resistance levels--3 pounds, 6 pounds, and 9 pounds--you can start slow while your body adjusts, and then escalate your workout as you get stronger, slimmer, and toned all over.The CoreBody reformer's portable design lets you workout out wherever you want.It's easy to get up to speed on the CoreBody reformer thanks to the included workout DVD, which offers four complete workouts: Total Body One, Total Body Express, Core Essentials, and Stretch & Renew. Whether you have time for a full-body workout or just a quick energy boost, each fun, flexible routine will lead you through the exercises so you'll never get bored. The reformer also comes with Go-Anywhere fitness flip cards, which illustrate more than 32 exercises unique to the CoreBody reformer. As your strength and flexibility increases, so does the intensity of the exercises, with options for everyone--beginner to advanced. The cards include eight recommended workouts and are color coded by target area.To help with your diet, the CoreBody reformer comes with a weight loss plan that lets you customize a balanced diet of carbs and proteins to maximize energy gain and fat loss. Whether you're dining out or eating in, the weight loss plan shows you how to enjoy your favorite foods while losing weight. Other accessories include a workout poster that helps you keep track of your weekly progress, a carrying strap for easy portability, and a blue washable cover that keeps the reformer looking--and performing--its best.Best of all, the entire unit folds into a convenient tube, so you can take the CoreBody reformer pretty much anywhere--on business trips, camping excursions, family vacations, and more.SpecificationsResistance levels: Low (3 pounds), medium (6 pounds), and high (9 pounds)Tube length: 42.3 inchesCrossbar length: 37.4 inchesCapacity: 300 poundsWeight: 17 poundsWarranty: 1 year", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5123yRLsI5L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006MHIBA6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nautilus Safety Footwear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Pilates", "Reformers"]], "price": 123.75}}
{"item_id": "B006MOBTJ4", "title": "Barnett Talon Crossbow Sling, Carbon Black", "description": "Designed specifically for Barnett crossbows and offers extreme grip and eliminates sliding or bouncing and even eliminates squeaking in -20 to 50 degree weather and even in less than perfect conditions. Adjusts from 32\" to 40\". Has quick release so the weapons are quickly and quietly released without use of tools. Comes with swivels.", "text": "Barnett Talon Crossbow Sling, Carbon Black Designed specifically for Barnett crossbows and offers extreme grip and eliminates sliding or bouncing and even eliminates squeaking in -20 to 50 degree weather and even in less than perfect conditions. Adjusts from 32\" to 40\". Has quick release so the weapons are quickly and quietly released without use of tools. Comes with swivels.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413mW0J-mOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006MOBTJ4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Barnett", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Slings"]], "price": 18.88}}
{"item_id": "B006MOCJTS", "title": "Apple 0936 Economy Bow Vise", "description": "Designed for better functionality, Plastic-coated jaws prevent damage your bow while you work, Vise allows 360 degree left-to-right rotation and front-to-back rotation, All-steel construction and a baked powder coated finish, No cast parts to break or bend.", "text": "Apple 0936 Economy Bow Vise Designed for better functionality, Plastic-coated jaws prevent damage your bow while you work, Vise allows 360 degree left-to-right rotation and front-to-back rotation, All-steel construction and a baked powder coated finish, No cast parts to break or bend.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I7IQU34yL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006MOCJTS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Apple Archery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting"]], "price": 69.37}}
{"item_id": "B006MOW0P6", "title": "Whetstone Cutlery The Brute Super Machete (Black, 22.75-Inch Long)", "description": "Whetstone Cutlery The Brute 22.75\" Super Machete our Flagship Survival Machete. At 22.75\" Overall it is a heavy duty machete that has numerous features for Survival. From the Backyard to the Wilderness and to the Jungle you'll never have trouble surviving through the brush with the Brute! Has a 1/2 Pakkawood 1/2 Cord wrapped handle for exceptional one and two-handed grip and a Black Coated Rust Resistant Stainless Steel blade. With a heavy duty sawtooth back and a cord cutter slot. And a eyelet for easy storage and a slot in handle for additional straps. Included is a Nylon Belt Sheath. The Brute is one machete that will last a lifetime a true Super Machete!", "text": "Whetstone Cutlery The Brute Super Machete (Black, 22.75-Inch Long) Whetstone Cutlery The Brute 22.75\" Super Machete our Flagship Survival Machete. At 22.75\" Overall it is a heavy duty machete that has numerous features for Survival. From the Backyard to the Wilderness and to the Jungle you'll never have trouble surviving through the brush with the Brute! Has a 1/2 Pakkawood 1/2 Cord wrapped handle for exceptional one and two-handed grip and a Black Coated Rust Resistant Stainless Steel blade. With a heavy duty sawtooth back and a cord cutter slot. And a eyelet for easy storage and a slot in handle for additional straps. Included is a Nylon Belt Sheath. The Brute is one machete that will last a lifetime a true Super Machete!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31Y0%2BhlASRL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006MOW0P6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Whetstone Cutlery", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Folding Hunting Knives"]], "price": 25.95}}
