{"item_id": "B006MYCIOE", "title": "AR15 M4 Flat Top Offset One Piece QD Scope Mount with Quick Release Cam Locks 1913 Picatinny Rails", "description": "A very solid and heavy duty offset ring mount to install magnified optics scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticlesThe QD cam locks can be finger adjusted when needed. With the cam lever at unlock position, pull up and rotate the star wheel on the opposite end of the clamping bolt to adjustRing Size: 30mm (1inch metal size inserts included)Centerline Height - 40mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two finger adjustable quick release cam locksHeight from top of rail to bottom of cradle: 1\"Overall height 2.50\"Overall length 5.30\"Inner space between the rings 64mm (2.52inch)Ring width: 16mm(0.63inch)Recoil lug: 2 cross-slot square bolt shaftsIncludes one extra ring top with accessory rail with 4 ring slots", "text": "AR15 M4 Flat Top Offset One Piece QD Scope Mount with Quick Release Cam Locks 1913 Picatinny Rails A very solid and heavy duty offset ring mount to install magnified optics scope for easier eye relief setup. Very helpful when mounting a scope with longer eyepiece tube, especially ones with illuminated reticlesThe QD cam locks can be finger adjusted when needed. With the cam lever at unlock position, pull up and rotate the star wheel on the opposite end of the clamping bolt to adjustRing Size: 30mm (1inch metal size inserts included)Centerline Height - 40mmMachined from extruded aluminum alloy 6061Anodized black matte finishClamp attachment - two finger adjustable quick release cam locksHeight from top of rail to bottom of cradle: 1\"Overall height 2.50\"Overall length 5.30\"Inner space between the rings 64mm (2.52inch)Ring width: 16mm(0.63inch)Recoil lug: 2 cross-slot square bolt shaftsIncludes one extra ring top with accessory rail with 4 ring slots", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31XGI8zF%2B8L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006MYCIOE.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Rifle Scope Accessories"]], "price": 56.0}}
