{"item_id": "B006NQGU5Y", "title": "Spring Assisted Glass Breaker Orange Folder Pocket Knife", "description": "The unique design folding knife in stainless steel. The handle's shape settles the index finger on the underside, suitable for use. Blade style is a drop point in 440 stainless steel, making it harder, higher on the Rockwell scale and in turn extending the amount of time for it to stay sharp. Right thumb study give fast opening, and the linerlock release allows easy one-hand closing.", "text": "Spring Assisted Glass Breaker Orange Folder Pocket Knife The unique design folding knife in stainless steel. The handle's shape settles the index finger on the underside, suitable for use. Blade style is a drop point in 440 stainless steel, making it harder, higher on the Rockwell scale and in turn extending the amount of time for it to stay sharp. Right thumb study give fast opening, and the linerlock release allows easy one-hand closing.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31MYx0sqdwL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006NQGU5Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006NY7PVO", "title": "Bodylastics 11 pcs Resistance Bands Set *BASIC TENSION with 4 Stackable anti-snap exercise tubes, Heavy Duty components, carrying case, and FREE 3 month access to over 2000 full length resistance bands workout videos, from Pilates to MMA", "description": "Great for: Average strength individuals (58 lbs.)The Bodylastics Basic Tension Resistance Bands Set is a great entry level resistance bands system. Use this versatile set for fitness programs, rehabilitation and general strength training. It comes complete with all of the components that you will need to do the best exercises from the gym.Bodylastics systems incorporate super heavy duty components for better workouts and greater safetyThe Bodylastics difference:**Bodylastics bands are dipped so they have more latex. The more latex, the more resistance.**Bodylastics components are super strong and super high quality. We use industrial grade materials like molded nylon for the core of the handles and door anchor**Bodylastics invented and incorporates Patented and patent pending anti-snap technology. Work out with confidence!**$18 Value! - Free 3 months access to over 2000 amazing resistance bands workouts on the LIVEEXERCISE websiteWhat's in the box:1 Dipped Anti-Snap yellow band (3 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap green band (5 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap red band (8 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap blue band (13 lbs.)2 Heavy duty foam covered handles2 Heavy duty ankle straps1 Heavy duty door anchor1 Massive 3x4 ft wall chart with over 100 exercises1 Token for the 3 month Free trial to Liveexercise (credit card verification required)1 storage/travel bagLifetime Warranty", "text": "Bodylastics 11 pcs Resistance Bands Set *BASIC TENSION with 4 Stackable anti-snap exercise tubes, Heavy Duty components, carrying case, and FREE 3 month access to over 2000 full length resistance bands workout videos, from Pilates to MMA Great for: Average strength individuals (58 lbs.)The Bodylastics Basic Tension Resistance