th access to 2000 resistance bands workout videos from Pilates to MMA Great for: Super strong individuals (262 lbs.)The Bodylastics Super Strong Man System is a great high level resistance bands system. This stackable kit provides up to 262 lbs of resistance, which will challenge individuals who need a little extra to push their muscles to the limit. It comes complete with all of the components found in the regular Super Strong Man System plus the small anywhere anchor. The small anywhere anchor will enable you to safely attach your bands to small stationary objects like flagpoles etc...Bodylastics systems incorporate super heavy duty components for better workouts and greater safetyThe Bodylastics difference:**Bodylastics bands are dipped so they have more latex. The more latex, the more resistance.**Bodylastics components are super strong and super high quality. We use industrial grade materials**Bodylastics invented and incorporates Patented and patent pending anti-snap technology. Work out with confidence!What's in the box:1 Dipped Anti-Snap yellow band (3 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap green band (5 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap red band (8 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap blue band (13 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap black band (19 lbs.)1 Dipped Anti-Snap purple band (23 lbs.)2 Dipped Anti-Snap Orange bands (30 lbs. ea.)4 Heavy duty foam covered handles4 Heavy duty ankle straps2 heavy duty door anchors1 heavy duty small anywhere anchor1 massive 3x4 ft Wall chart with over 100 exercises 1 Token for the 6 month Free trial to Liveexercise (credit card verification required)1 storage/travel bagLifetime Warranty", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51peJoyb6vL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006O0GDMO.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 79.97}}
