{"item_id": "B006O0UOJC", "title": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty anywhere anchor with super strong nylon webbing, stitching and neoprene", "description": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty anywhere anchor with super strong nylon webbing, stitching and neopreneThe Bodylastics Anywhere Anchor will enable to to safely attach your bands to almost any stationary objectYou get what you pay for - The best quality components on Amazon and the entire market - Guaranteed! DON'T BE FOOLED BY CHEAP IMITATIONS.Everyone Claims that theirs is the best but here are the facts:- Bodylastics anywhere anchors are made of super thick nylon webbing, which is actually doubled over for extra strength- Bodylastics anywhere anchors are sewn with extra lines of stitching for better reinforcement- Bodylastics anywhere anchors incorporate neoprene in the loops to prevent damage to your bandsWhat's in the box:1 Heavy Duty anywhere anchor", "text": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty anywhere anchor with super strong nylon webbing, stitching and neoprene Bodylastics Heavy Duty anywhere anchor with super strong nylon webbing, stitching and neopreneThe Bodylastics Anywhere Anchor will enable to to safely attach your bands to almost any stationary objectYou get what you pay for - The best quality components on Amazon and the entire market - Guaranteed! DON'T BE FOOLED BY CHEAP IMITATIONS.Everyone Claims that theirs is the best but here are the facts:- Bodylastics anywhere anchors are made of super thick nylon webbing, which is actually doubled over for extra strength- Bodylastics anywhere anchors are sewn with extra lines of stitching for better reinforcement- Bodylastics anywhere anchors incorporate neoprene in the loops to prevent damage to your bandsWhat's in the box:1 Heavy Duty anywhere anchor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/411MyDXQhhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006O0UOJC.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 19.95}}
{"item_id": "B006O0Y84Y", "title": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty Door Anchor Attachment with Solid Nylon core, dense foam (won't hurt your door) and super strong nylon webbing", "description": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty Door Anchor Attachment with Solid Nylon core, dense foam (won't hurt your door) and super strong nylon webbingThe Bodylastics ultra heavy duty door anchor will enable you to attach almost any resistance bands to a door (hinge side)You get what you pay for - The best quality components on Amazon and the entire market - Guaranteed! DON'T BE FOOLED BY CHEAP IMITATIONS.Everyone Claims that theirs is the best but here are the facts:- Bodylastics door anchors are made with nylon plastic, the strongest and most expensive that you can buy, high density foam, super strong nylon webbing and neoprene- Bodylastics door anchors are designed to be friendly to your door and to your bands.- Bodylastics door anchors can be placed on the hinge side of the door as well as the top and bottom of the door (as long as the door can be securely closed)What's in the box:1 Heavy Duty door anchor", "text": "Bodylastics Heavy Duty Door Anchor Attachment with Solid Nylon core, dense foam (won't hurt your door) and super strong nylon webbing Bodylastics Heavy Duty Door Anchor Attachment with Solid Nylon core, dense foam (won't hurt your door) and super strong nylon webbingThe Bodylastics ultra heavy duty door anchor will enable you to attach almost any resistance bands to a door (hinge side)You get what you pay for - The best quality components on Amazon and the entire market - Guaranteed! DON'T BE FOOLED BY CHEAP IMITATIONS.Everyone Claims that theirs is the best but here are the facts:- Bodylastics door anchors are made with nylon plastic, the strongest and most expensive that you can buy, high density foam, super strong nylon webbing and neoprene- Bodylastics door anchors are designed to be friendly to your door and to your bands.- Bodylastics door anchors can be placed on the hinge side of the door as well as the top and bottom of the door (as long as the door can be securely closed)What's in the box:1 Heavy Duty door anchor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41pAJ-omFZL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006O0Y84Y.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Accessories", "Exercise Bands"]], "price": 8.95}}
{"item_id": "B006O74XQ0", "title": "Crosman LPH .22 Caliber Hollow Point Pellets, 500-Pack", "description": "Premier Pellet dies are made from a single set of heat treated, water resistant metal tools to ensure each pellet is indistinguishable from the next. Pellet weight is 14.3 grain. Follow all manufacturers lead warnings.", "text": "Crosman LPH .22 Caliber Hollow Point Pellets, 500-Pack Premier Pellet dies are made from a single set of heat treated, water resistant metal tools to ensure each pellet is indistinguishable from the next. Pellet weight is 14.3 grain. Follow all manufacturers lead warnings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51CTSbuNPeL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006O74XQ0.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Gun Pellets"]], "price": 8.1}}
