{"item_id": "B006PP92H6", "title": "CaddyTek SuperLite Deluxe Golf Push Cart", "description": "CaddyLite 11.5 is simple 3 wheel push cart. Yet it is loaded it with all the features that normally equipped on expensive carts, such as umbrella holder, foot brake and even with front wheel alignment mechanism, etc. It is the most valuable 3 wheel golf push cart on the market.", "text": "CaddyTek SuperLite Deluxe Golf Push Cart CaddyLite 11.5 is simple 3 wheel push cart. Yet it is loaded it with all the features that normally equipped on expensive carts, such as umbrella holder, foot brake and even with front wheel alignment mechanism, etc. It is the most valuable 3 wheel golf push cart on the market.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tJGrHk%2BbL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006PP92H6.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "Golf Carts"]], "price": 79.95}}
