{"item_id": "B006QFBOG2", "title": "DPx HEST/F 2.0 Olive Drab, RH Configuration", "description": "The DPx HEST/F 2.0 is a German D2 tool steel folder mated to a U.S. made titanium alloy frame with a durable American G10 scale assembled by the crafstmen at LionSTEEL in Northern Italy. The HEST/F was developed as the direct folding version of the HEST fixed blade knife and was dubbed the 2.0 because there were a number of significant modifications made to the original design of this brutal use folder. The goal was to increase strength without adding weight and to directly address concerns about ease of opening, strength of lockup and usability. Patents Pending The knife boasts the following features: Blade is German D2 tool steel polished then milspec phosphate coated Tumble finish 6Al4V Grade 5 titanium alloy frame and spring frame lock Patented LionSTEEL RotoBlock system American-made G10 handle scale Removable stainless steel clip and glass breaker (comes with replacement smooth head screw) with integrated lanyard attachment 1/4\" hex driver Unique wire stripper, jimping and hard lashing points Thumb grip/bottle opener Dimensions: Open length: 7.63\" Closed length: 4.93\" Cutting edge: 3.10\" Titanium alloy frame thickness: 0.165\" G10 scale thickness: 0.165\" Knife includes a unique, collectible Mr. DP skull adjustment tool which is used to adjust the pivot tension and remove/replace the glass breaker screw with an included flat screw. The tool may also be used as a handy EDC by itself.", "text": "DPx HEST/F 2.0 Olive Drab, RH Configuration The DPx HEST/F 2.0 is a German D2 tool steel folder mated to a U.S. made titanium alloy frame with a durable American G10 scale assembled by the crafstmen at LionSTEEL in Northern Italy. The HEST/F was developed as the direct folding version of the HEST fixed blade knife and was dubbed the 2.0 because there were a number of significant modifications made to the original design of this brutal use folder. The goal was to increase strength without adding weight and to directly address concerns about ease of opening, strength of lockup and usability. Patents Pending The knife boasts the following features: Blade is German D2 tool steel polished then milspec phosphate coated Tumble finish 6Al4V Grade 5 titanium alloy frame and spring frame lock Patented LionSTEEL RotoBlock system American-made G10 handle scale Removable stainless steel clip and glass breaker (comes with replacement smooth head screw) with integrated lanyard attachment 1/4\" hex driver Unique wire stripper, jimping and hard lashing points Thumb grip/bottle opener Dimensions: Open length: 7.63\" Closed length: 4.93\" Cutting edge: 3.10\" Titanium alloy frame thickness: 0.165\" G10 scale thickness: 0.165\" Knife includes a unique, collectible Mr. DP skull adjustment tool which is used to adjust the pivot tension and remove/replace the glass breaker screw with an included flat screw. The tool may also be used as a handy EDC by itself.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51NlHG7F3LL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QFBOG2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 174.92}}
{"item_id": "B006QGH8CU", "title": "Razor Pro XX Scooter", "description": "Take it to the next level with the Razor Pro XX Scooter. Designed and tested by Team Razor pro riders, for maximum durability and performance in mind. The scooter offers a 100 percent aircraft-grade aluminum body, a double TIG-welded deck for superior strength, and threaded 110mm compatible fork to sustain even the roughest conditions. The scooter also features freestyle rubberized grips to protect your palms along with Razors patented rear brake system. It is equipped with 14 spoke 110mm high grade urethane wheels and RZR Pro 20 bearings for a smooth ride. Recommended for ages 8 and older and comes in your choice of silver or red, the Razor Pro XX Scooter is sure to impress!", "text": "Razor Pro XX Scooter Take it to the next level with the Razor Pro XX Scooter. Designed and tested by Team Razor pro riders, for maximum durability and performance in mind. The scooter offers a 100 percent aircraft-grade aluminum body, a double TIG-welded deck for superior strength, and threaded 110mm compatible fork to sustain even the roughest conditions. The scooter also features freestyle rubberized grips to protect your palms along with Razors patented rear brake system. It is equipped with 14 spoke 110mm high grade urethane wheels and RZR Pro 20 bearings for a smooth ride. Recommended for ages 8 and older and comes in your choice of silver or red, the Razor Pro XX Scooter is sure to impress!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31TjUzm8edL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QGH8CU.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Action Sports", "Scooters & Equipment", "Scooters", "Kick Scooters"]], "price": 45.99}}
{"item_id": "B006QGH9N8", "title": "Razor 360 Flash Rider", "description": "A comfortable, molded polycarbonate seat keeps little riders comfy.Popular scooter maker Razor has updated the classic kids' three-wheeler of the 1970s and 80s with the FlashRider 360. Based on Razor's award-winning caster tricycle, this zippy little version turns and drifts on dual inclined caster wheels, with an exciting Spark Bar feature using the same compatible spark cartridge found in the popular Spark scooters and the eSpark.Other features include a large, high-impact front wheel with flat-free tire for easy pedaling and complete control, and two dual inclined caster rear wheels allowing resistance-free drifting and spinning. The steel framed design and MX-style handlebars enhance the look and lend a stylish touch. An adjustable handbrake and rubber grips provide the necessary support and grip, ensuring your child's safety. The Razor FlashRider 360 also features a double crown fork that gives the stiffness for quality and durabilityFeaturesWelded steel frame and forkDual inclined casters for drifting and spinning actionHigh-impact front wheel with flat-free tireMX-style handlebars with rubber gripsThree-piece crankDouble crown fork designSpark Bar with replaceable Spark cartridgeDual inclined casters enable drifting and spinning action kids will love.SpecificationsMeasures 24.5 by 25.75 by 40 inches (W x H x D)Some assembly requiredReplaceable Spark cartridges also sold separately17.5-pound weight160-pound maximum rider weightRecommended for users age six and upAbout RazorFounded in June 2000, Razor USA, LLC is a privately held company based in Cerritos, California. Creators of the popular Razor kick scooter, Razor additionally offers the E100, E200, and E300 electric scooters, as well as Dirt Rocket, Pocket Mod, Pocket Rocket, and Ground Force electrically-powered ride-on toys and junior scooters. Razor has received numerous industry awards, including the Toy Industry Association’s “Toy of the Year” and “Toy of the Year” honors fromTime Magazine,Parents,Parenting,Sports Illustrated for Kids,Nick Jr., andU.S. News & World Report.", "text": "Razor 360 Flash Rider A comfortable, molded polycarbonate seat keeps little riders comfy.Popular scooter maker Razor has updated the classic kids' three-wheeler of the 1970s and 80s with the FlashRider 360. Based on Razor's award-winning caster tricycle, this zippy little version turns and drifts on dual inclined caster wheels, with an exciting Spark Bar feature using the same compatible spark cartridge found in the popular Spark scooters and the eSpark.Other features include a large, high-impact front wheel with flat-free tire for easy pedaling and complete control, and two dual inclined caster rear wheels allowing resistance-free drifting and spinning. The steel framed design and MX-style handlebars enhance the look and lend a stylish touch. An adjustable handbrake and rubber grips provide the necessary support and grip, ensuring your child's safety. The Razor FlashRider 360 also features a double crown fork that gives the stiffness for quality and durabilityFeaturesWelded steel frame and forkDual inclined casters for drifting and spinning actionHigh-impact front wheel with flat-free tireMX-style handlebars with rubber gripsThree-piece crankDouble crown fork designSpark Bar with replaceable Spark cartridgeDual inclined casters enable drifting and spinning action kids will love.SpecificationsMeasures 24.5 by 25.75 by 40 inches (W x H x D)Some assembly requiredReplaceable Spark cartridges also sold separately17.5-pound weight160-pound maximum rider weightRecommended for users age six and upAbout RazorFounded in June 2000, Razor USA, LLC is a privately held company based in Cerritos, California. Creators of the popular Razor kick scooter, Razor additionally offers the E100, E200, and E300 electric scooters, as well as Dirt Rocket, Pocket Mod, Pocket Rocket, and Ground Force electrically-powered ride-on toys and junior scooters. Razor has received numerous industry awards, including the Toy Industry Association’s “Toy of the Year” and “Toy of the Year” honors fromTime Magazine,Parents,Parenting,Sports Illustrated for Kids,Nick Jr., andU.S. News & World Report.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41h9j%2BWDmtL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QGH9N8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Razor", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling"]], "price": 98.99}}
{"item_id": "B006QIPQYA", "title": "Lyman 223 Rem Carbide Deluxe Rifle 3 Die Set (5.56-mm)", "description": "Set consists of a full length resizing die with decapping stem and neck expanding button and a bullet seating die. In addition, Lyman has included a neck sizing die with a carbide expander. This extra die enables the reloader to extend case life by reducing the amount of stretching caused by excessive sizing. These die sets are the reloader's best choice for loading jacketed bullets in bottlenecked rifle cases. Standard 7/8 x 14 thread. The best choice for loading 223 Remington (5.56mm) cartridges.", "text": "Lyman 223 Rem Carbide Deluxe Rifle 3 Die Set (5.56-mm) Set consists of a full length resizing die with decapping stem and neck expanding button and a bullet seating die. In addition, Lyman has included a neck sizing die with a carbide expander. This extra die enables the reloader to extend case life by reducing the amount of stretching caused by excessive sizing. These die sets are the reloader's best choice for loading jacketed bullets in bottlenecked rifle cases. Standard 7/8 x 14 thread. The best choice for loading 223 Remington (5.56mm) cartridges.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51FlJ-ykaPL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QIPQYA.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 62.99}}
{"item_id": "B006QMOEEY", "title": "Columbia Men's Shimmer Me Timbers II Jacket", "description": "Warmth is the name of the game with the popular Shimmer Me Timbersfamily; Omni-Heat® helps to retain your body heat while the durable nylon ripstop exterior sheds rain and stains. Large classic baffles increase the effectiveness of the insulation so you stay warm in cold conditions.", "text": "Columbia Men's Shimmer Me Timbers II Jacket Warmth is the name of the game with the popular Shimmer Me Timbersfamily; Omni-Heat® helps to retain your body heat while the durable nylon ripstop exterior sheds rain and stains. Large classic baffles increase the effectiveness of the insulation so you stay warm in cold conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511plr6KdfL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QMOEEY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Snow Sports", "Skiing"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006QNHRVK", "title": "223 5.56 Pro Aluminum Upper Lower Vise Block Combo set", "description": "Highest quality upper receiver vise block made from solid aluminum. The lower is precision machined from a high strength polymer and will securely lock in the mag well. Includes 1 Pro upper vise block, 1 lower vise block Made in USA", "text": "223 5.56 Pro Aluminum Upper Lower Vise Block Combo set Highest quality upper receiver vise block made from solid aluminum. The lower is precision machined from a high strength polymer and will securely lock in the mag well. Includes 1 Pro upper vise block, 1 lower vise block Made in USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jRO6SPw4L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QNHRVK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 25.95}}
{"item_id": "B006QP720O", "title": "Primos Hunting Turkey Hunter Starter Pack", "description": "The perfect started pack for the beginning or advanced hunter. A very loud Sonic Dome slate call for long distance, a double-sided box call for mid-range, and a diaphram mouth call for hands-free, close-range calling.", "text": "Primos Hunting Turkey Hunter Starter Pack The perfect started pack for the beginning or advanced hunter. A very loud Sonic Dome slate call for long distance, a double-sided box call for mid-range, and a diaphram mouth call for hands-free, close-range calling.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41-Z%2BFvm3xL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QP720O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Primos Hunting", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Game Calls", "Turkey"]], "price": 24.95}}
