g", "metadata": {"brand": "Neewer", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Protective Gear", "Masks"]], "price": 14.45}}
{"item_id": "B006QQX3C4", "title": "RioRand 4 Mode 1200 Lumen CREE XML T6 Bulb LED Bicycle bike HeadLight Lamp Flashlight Light Headlamp", "description": "Features:2 in 1 functions: Bicycle light+Head LightMade of CREE XM-L T6 LED, ultra brightOutput bright comes to max 1200 lumens4 switch modes: Strong Brightness, Normal Brightness, Weak Brightness and Strobe( press button for 3 second)Rechargeable 4400mA battery offers powerful power supplyAluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service lifeEquipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenientSuitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activitiesSpecification:Model: T6Casing: Smooth Light Head Shell made of Aviation Aluminum Alloy, CNC machining, anodizing surface treatmentColor BIN: WhiteTotal Emitters: 1Battery Configurations: Powered by a rechargeable 8.4V 4400mAh lithium-ion battery pack (4x 18650 Batteries; Battery overcharge protection)Voltage Input: 8.4 V maxSwitch Type: Clicky (Clickie)Switch Location: Tailcap (Tail-cap)Modes: 3Mode Arrangement: High > Mid > Weak > Fast StrobeBrightness: 1200 lumens maximum brightness (manufacturer rated)Runtime: Up to 3~4 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated)Reflector: Plating Smooth ReflectorLens: GlassWater Resistant: Yes, light and battery pack can work in rainy daysPackage include:1 x RioRand RR-XM-L-T6 LED Bicycle Light1 x Adjustable headband2 x Rubber ring for installation1 x 4400mAh Battery Pack1 x AC charger (100-240V)1 x Plug Adaptor", "text": "RioRand 4 Mode 1200 Lumen CREE XML T6 Bulb LED Bicycle bike HeadLight Lamp Flashlight Light Headlamp Features:2 in 1 functions: Bicycle light+Head LightMade of CREE XM-L T6 LED, ultra brightOutput bright comes to max 1200 lumens4 switch modes: Strong Brightness, Normal Brightness, Weak Brightness and Strobe( press button for 3 second)Rechargeable 4400mA battery offers powerful power supplyAluminum alloy casing, waterproof design, long service lifeEquipped with an elastic & adjustable headlamp band and 2 plastic rings, very convenientSuitable for cycling, climbing, fishing, hunting, camping and other outdoor activitiesSpecification:Model: T6Casing: Smooth Light Head Shell made of Aviation Aluminum Alloy, CNC machining, anodizing surface treatmentColor BIN: WhiteTotal Emitters: 1Battery Configurations: Powered by a rechargeable 8.4V 4400mAh lithium-ion battery pack (4x 18650 Batteries; Battery overcharge protection)Voltage Input: 8.4 V maxSwitch Type: Clicky (Clickie)Switch Location: Tailcap (Tail-cap)Modes: 3Mode Arrangement: High > Mid > Weak > Fast StrobeBrightness: 1200 lumens maximum brightness (manufacturer rated)Runtime: Up to 3~4 hours run-time at 100% brightness (manufacturer rated)Reflector: Plating Smooth ReflectorLens: GlassWater Resistant: Yes, light and battery pack can work in rainy daysPackage include:1 x RioRand RR-XM-L-T6 LED Bicycle Light1 x Adjustable headband2 x Rubber ring for installation1 x 4400mAh Battery Pack1 x AC charger (100-240V)1 x Plug Adaptor", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51%2BtsFc3-xL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QQX3C4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "RioRand", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 19.88}}
{"item_id": "B006QT7FFC", "title": "MagicShine 2000-Lumen LED Bike Light with Improved Battery and Charger", "description": "The MJ-880 2012 Version Features: Multiple Lighting modes; Flood, Spot, High Smooth dimming allows you to choose from 5% to 100% power output using the Command Control Buttons Lighted Command Control Button has a 4 level LED battery Power Indicator: Green = 100% charge, Blue = 75% charge, Yellow = 50% charge, Red = 25% charge The light has a highly efficient Digital constant current control circuit that uses Pulse Width Modulation to control the light output- this means the light wont dim over time, it remains the same brightness until the battery life has been exhausted 6061-T6 aircraft aluminum enclosure - type III anodized *Battery - 6 protected 18650 Li-ion cells in a highly durable water tight enclosure. in MagicShine branded neoprene battery case with an elastic Velcro attachment strap. Battery Charger Included.", "text": "MagicShine 2000-Lumen LED Bike Light with Improved Battery and Charger The MJ-880 2012 Version Features: Multiple Lighting modes; Flood, Spot, High Smooth dimming allows you to choose from 5% to 100% power output using the Command Control Buttons Lighted Command Control Button has a 4 level LED battery Power Indicator: Green = 100% charge, Blue = 75% charge, Yellow = 50% charge, Red = 25% charge The light has a highly efficient Digital constant current control circuit that uses Pulse Width Modulation to control the light output- this means the light wont dim over time, it remains the same brightness until the battery life has been exhausted 6061-T6 aircraft aluminum enclosure - type III anodized *Battery - 6 protected 18650 Li-ion cells in a highly durable water tight enclosure. in MagicShine branded neoprene battery case with an elastic Velcro attachment strap. Battery Charger Included.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/516Q2o4b6rL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QT7FFC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MagicShine", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 150.5}}
