{"item_id": "B006QYU85Q", "title": "Ortho Home Defense Max Insect Killer Rtu Wand - 0196810 - Bci (1.1 GAL)", "description": "Ortho Home Defense Max Perimeter and indoor insect killer with wand. The easy way to spray. No bending, pumping, or hand fatigue. 1-touch continuous spray. Ergonomic handle. Extended reach wand with multiple spray settings. Active ingredient: 0.050% Bifen", "text": "Ortho Home Defense Max Insect Killer Rtu Wand - 0196810 - Bci (1.1 GAL) Ortho Home Defense Max Perimeter and indoor insect killer with wand. The easy way to spray. No bending, pumping, or hand fatigue. 1-touch continuous spray. Ergonomic handle. Extended reach wand with multiple spray settings. Active ingredient: 0.050% Bifen", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51s-Pg-5x1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006QYU85Q.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Flagline", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Personal Care", "Insect Repellent"]], "price": 13.56}}
{"item_id": "B006RBKP8I", "title": "SOS Emergency Water Packets - 3 Day/72 Hour Supply (12 Packets)", "description": "S.O.S Emergency Drinking Water Packets, Pack of 12. Packets each contain 4.225 oz. /125 ml of lifesaving purified water for use in emergency and rationed survival situations. Purified and bacteria free water products. Ideal for 72 Hour Survival Kits, Emergencies, Disaster Relief, Camping, Hiking. These safe and convenient pre-measured 4.225 oz. metallized sachets are easy to dispense and easy to store. Unlike bottled water which must be rotated and replaced every 6 months, these water packets last for years! S.O.S emergency water ration pouches can withstand temperatures ranging from -40 F to 230 F. Can be frozen without any adverse effects, and it can also be used as cold compress. U. S. Coast Guard approved. . While you can probably survive for weeks without food, your body can only go for a few days without water. Water is also extremely important to insure that your mind (your greatest survival tool) continues to work well because even a small degree of dehydration adversely affects your ability to think. While the weight of water mandates that only a small amount can be carried in a personal survival kit. You can store larger quantities of these S.O.S water ration packets in your home or travel survival kits. You should always carry some water pouches with you in your car, truck, boat or RV, because you may not have time to procure it (even where it is generally available) in an emergency for medical or other uses. The advantage to pre-packaged water is that it will last for years without replacement. At times of high demand, these S.O.S water pouches may be substituted with a competitors water pouches of equal or higher value. No need for twice annual rotation Purified / filtered safe drinking water No need for concern proper containers being used Single serving eliminates loss Superior tri-laminate packaging extremely durable. May be frozen. Meets or exceeds U.S. Coast Guard standards.", "text": "SOS Emergency Water Packets - 3 Day/72 Hour Supply (12 Packets) S.O.S Emergency Drinking Water Packets, Pack of 12. Packets each contain 4.225 oz. /125 ml of lifesaving purified water for use in emergency and rationed survival situations. Purified and bacteria free water products. Ideal for 72 Hour Survival Kits, Emergencies, Disaster Relief, Camping, Hiking. These safe and convenient pre-measured 4.225 oz. metallized sachets are easy to dispense and easy to store. Unlike bottled water which must be rotated and replaced every 6 months, these water packets last for years! S.O.S emergency water ration pouches can withstand temperatures ranging from -40 F to 230 F. Can be frozen without any adverse effects, and it can also be used as cold compress. U. S. Coast Guard approved. . While you can probably survive for weeks without food, your body can only go for a few days without water. Water is also extremely important to insure that your mind (your greatest survival tool) continues to work well because even a small degree of dehydration adversely affects your ability to think. While the weight of water mandates that only a small amount can be carried in a personal survival kit. You can store larger quantities of these S.O.S water ration packets in your home or travel survival kits. You should always carry some water pouches with you in your car, truck, boat or RV, because you may not have time to procure it (even where it is generally available) in an emergency for medical or other uses. The advantage to pre-packaged water is that it will last for years without replacement. At times of high demand, these S.O.S water pouches may be substituted with a competitors water pouches of equal or higher value. No need for twice annual rotation Purified / filtered safe drinking water No need for concern proper containers being used Single serving eliminates loss Superior tri-laminate packaging extremely durable. May be frozen. Meets or exceeds U.S. Coast Guard standards.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/417U9isYYvL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006RBKP8I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "SOS", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B006RENGLS", "title": "CygoLite ExpiliOn 300 USB Li-on Rechargable Headlight", "description": "The Expilion 300 outshines non rechargeable commuter lights by using a powerful Cree LED to fire 300 lumens on any commute. With a cost saving USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery stick that can be swapped-on-the-fly for longer run times, this 4 mode handlebar mounted commuter light brings high powered rechargeable illumination to savvy commuters that need to see and be seen.", "text": "CygoLite ExpiliOn 300 USB Li-on Rechargable Headlight The Expilion 300 outshines non rechargeable commuter lights by using a powerful Cree LED to fire 300 lumens on any commute. With a cost saving USB rechargeable Li-Ion battery stick that can be swapped-on-the-fly for longer run times, this 4 mode handlebar mounted commuter light brings high powered rechargeable illumination to savvy commuters that need to see and be seen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/415Sg4G8Q%2BL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006RENGLS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Cygo Lite", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlights"]], "price": 63.0}}
{"item_id": "B006RUIVUI", "title": "Magpul Men's 10th Anniversary T-Shirt", "description": "The Magpul Foundations: Magpul was founded in 1999 with the intent of developing a simple device to aid in the manipulation of rifle magazines while reloading under stress. The company’s name comes from this original product called the Magpul. Over the last decade Magpul has continued to grow and develop using much the same mission and process with a focus on innovation, simplicity, and efficiency. To understand Magpul, one must first understand the root ideas that form the foundation of our company culture and design philosophy. These core principles have allowed us to maintain a course true to our original mission, and help explain how and why we do the things we do.", "text": "Magpul Men's 10th Anniversary T-Shirt The Magpul Foundations: Magpul was founded in 1999 with the intent of developing a simple device to aid in the manipulation of rifle magazines while reloading under stress. The company’s name comes from this original product called the Magpul. Over the last decade Magpul has continued to grow and develop using much the same mission and process with a focus on innovation, simplicity, and efficiency. To understand Magpul, one must first understand the root ideas that form the foundation of our company culture and design philosophy. These core principles have allowed us to maintain a course true to our original mission, and help explain how and why we do the things we do.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IDgzlhUsL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006RUIVUI.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Clothing", "Men", "Shirts", "T-Shirts"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006SBCQR0", "title": "Smart Air Beds Raised Ultra Tough Inflatable Mattress with Rechargeable Pump", "description": "When we set out to design this bed, we wanted to produce an air mattress that was military grade, durable, super tough material that can withstand the rigors of tough use and abuse in an outdoor environment that is still comfortable enough that you'd let your own mother sleep on it. After almost a year in engineering, development and production, Smart Air Beds is proud to introduce the Smart Air Beds Ultra Tough Twin Size Raised Air Bed. Raised 16\" off the ground, this air bed is exactly what you're looking for if you are planning a weekend tip in the mountains or a multi-month relocation due to a home remodel. The beds durability comes from a unique PVC/polyester oxford laminate blend that makes the bed less susceptible to punctures. It has a 300 lb. weight capacity, so it is certainly suitable for one adult. The entire bed has expertly electronically welded seams for long lasting quality. Its cross beam design (pockets of air run perpendicular to the users back) provides exceptional support and comfort. After charging, the included handheld rechargeable pump can have the mattress ready from box to bed in about 2 minutes. It can also be inflated with any standard A/C air bed pump (sold separately). The bed uses standard twin sheets (not included). When you're ready to pack the item up, simply open the patented 2-in-1 valves to release the air, roll and fold and store the item neatly in the included storage bag (which is the size of a gym bag).", "text": "Smart Air Beds Raised Ultra Tough Inflatable Mattress with Rechargeable Pump When we set out to design this bed, we wanted to produce an air mattress that was military grade, durable, super tough material that can withstand the rigors of tough use and abuse in an outdoor environment that is still comfortable enough that you'd let your own mother sleep on it. After almost a year in engineering, development and production, Smart Air Beds is proud to introduce the Smart Air Beds Ultra Tough Twin Size Raised Air Bed. Raised 16\" off the ground, this air bed is exactly what you're looking for if you are planning a weekend tip in the mountains or a multi-month relocation due to a home remodel. The beds durability comes from a unique PVC/polyester oxford laminate blend that makes the bed less susceptible to punctures. It has a 300 lb. weight capacity, so it is certainly suitable for one adult. The entire bed has expertly electronically welded seams for long lasting quality. Its cross beam design (pockets of air run perpendicular to the users back) provides exceptional support and comfort. After charging, the included handheld rechargeable pump can have the mattress ready from box to bed in about 2 minutes. It can also be inflated with any standard A/C air bed pump (sold separately). The bed uses standard twin sheets (not included). When you're ready to pack the item up, simply open the patented 2-in-1 valves to release the air, roll and fold and store the item neatly in the included storage bag (which is the size of a gym bag).", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31BclCymAuL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006SBCQR0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Air Mattresses"]]}}
