{"item_id": "B006SIGX9U", "title": "Tac Force TF-669 Series Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5.25-Inch Closed", "description": "", "text": "Tac Force TF-669 Series Assisted Opening Folding Knife 5.25-Inch Closed", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41rUYfuvfFL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006SIGX9U.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "TAC Force", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Knives"]], "price": 8.75}}
{"item_id": "B006SK0SP8", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2388 Folts S.P.E.W Fixed Blade Razor Edge Knife", "description": "Custom knife maker and metalworker Alan Folts really knows how to get the most into a small fixed blade knife design. The S.P.E.W. (Small Pocket Everyday Wharncliffe), is a slimmed down design for easy carry and all around blade utility. It is tough to argue against the value of having a knife along with you, especially one as versatile and comfortable as the S.P.E.W. The key to any great user knife is control. These small fixed blade designs from Alan Folts offer a few of the best that we have ever seen.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool 2388 Folts S.P.E.W Fixed Blade Razor Edge Knife Custom knife maker and metalworker Alan Folts really knows how to get the most into a small fixed blade knife design. The S.P.E.W. (Small Pocket Everyday Wharncliffe), is a slimmed down design for easy carry and all around blade utility. It is tough to argue against the value of having a knife along with you, especially one as versatile and comfortable as the S.P.E.W. The key to any great user knife is control. These small fixed blade designs from Alan Folts offer a few of the best that we have ever seen.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41WolmUuwmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006SK0SP8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives", "Fixed Blade Hunting Knives"]], "price": 24.6}}
{"item_id": "B006SK1KR8", "title": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M16-10KSF Special Forces Tanto Razor Edge Knife", "description": "The M16 –SS EDC Series - A proven knife design platform made simple, made tough, and made affordable. If you are a fan of the Kit Carson designed M16 tactical folding knives you are going to want to check out these stainless steel (SS) variations. Handles are shaped and contoured in the same confident grip M16 style, but are crafted of a retro flavored stainless steel. Handles are all finished in a classic black oxide finish. These folders are available in several blade style options including cutting edge configurations, each with their own user advantages to offer. Blades also feature the Carson Flipper for quick and convenient blade actuation-and the flipper doubles as an effective blade guard in the open position. Blade lock up is secured through the traditional frame lock mechanism. The M16-SS EDC Series is a straight up, \"no frills\" every day carry folder design that kicks butt in pure performance and value.", "text": "Columbia River Knife and Tool M16-10KSF Special Forces Tanto Razor Edge Knife The M16 –SS EDC Series - A proven knife design platform made simple, made tough, and made affordable. If you are a fan of the Kit Carson designed M16 tactical folding knives you are going to want to check out these stainless steel (SS) variations. Handles are shaped and contoured in the same confident grip M16 style, but are crafted of a retro flavored stainless steel. Handles are all finished in a classic black oxide finish. These folders are available in several blade style options including cutting edge configurations, each with their own user advantages to offer. Blades also feature the Carson Flipper for quick and convenient blade actuation-and the flipper doubles as an effective blade guard in the open position. Blade lock up is secured through the traditional frame lock mechanism. The M16-SS EDC Series is a straight up, \"no frills\" every day carry folder design that kicks butt in pure performance and value.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31VALdCUL3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006SK1KR8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Columbia River Knife &amp; Tool", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 27.95}}
