{"item_id": "B006T3JJD6", "title": "Lee Precision 300 Aac Blackout Very Limited Production 3-Die", "description": "Lee 300 AAC Blackout PaceSetter 3-Die Set. Includes Full Length Sizing Die, Easy Adjust Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "text": "Lee Precision 300 Aac Blackout Very Limited Production 3-Die Lee 300 AAC Blackout PaceSetter 3-Die Set. Includes Full Length Sizing Die, Easy Adjust Dead Length Bullet Seating Die, Factory Crimp Die, Universal Shell Holder, Powder Dipper and Instructions/Load Data.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51ep75G080L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006T3JJD6.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lee", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 31.48}}
{"item_id": "B006T5ES9O", "title": "20-1 Gallon 10-Inch by 16-Inch Mylar Bags and 300cc Oxy-Sorb Oxygen Absorbers for Long Term Food Storage Preservation", "description": "This listing is for 20 - Up to 2 Gallon (10\"x16\" 5 mil thick foil lined) Mylar Bags and 1 package of 20 - 300cc Oxygen Absorbers made by OxySorb. These bags are different than most of the gallon Mylar bags sold, since they are Foil Lined and 5 mil Thick. Comparably these bags do not need to be stored in buckets since they block light (foil lined) and are thick enough to protect against puncture. In today's world of financial instability, food shortages, possible inflation and rising commodity prices Long Term Food Storage must be considered by any prudent individual or family. Mylar bags, when combined with oxygen absorbers and buckets, are considered the best way to store large quantities of food for 20 - 30 years. These Mylar bags block sunlight and provide an additional oxygen and moisture barrier. To seal Mylar bags, simply take a hot iron and iron the opening shut. These bags are perfect for storing smaller quantities of food. Gallon sized bags are ideal for dried powered foods, spices, hard candy, salts and other baking ingredients. These bags will help protect valuables, ammo and medical supplies from general corrosion that comes with varying weather and heat conditions over time. Included with these Absorbers is an oxygen indicator pill that will turn from pink to solid dark blue in the presence of oxygen. These absorbers are rated for twice their cc ratings.", "text": "20-1 Gallon 10-Inch by 16-Inch Mylar Bags and 300cc Oxy-Sorb Oxygen Absorbers for Long Term Food Storage Preservation This listing is for 20 - Up to 2 Gallon (10\"x16\" 5 mil thick foil lined) Mylar Bags and 1 package of 20 - 300cc Oxygen Absorbers made by OxySorb. These bags are different than most of the gallon Mylar bags sold, since they are Foil Lined and 5 mil Thick. Comparably these bags do not need to be stored in buckets since they block light (foil lined) and are thick enough to protect against puncture. In today's world of financial instability, food shortages, possible inflation and rising commodity prices Long Term Food Storage must be considered by any prudent individual or family. Mylar bags, when combined with oxygen absorbers and buckets, are considered the best way to store large quantities of food for 20 - 30 years. These Mylar bags block sunlight and provide an additional oxygen and moisture barrier. To seal Mylar bags, simply take a hot iron and iron the opening shut. These bags are perfect for storing smaller quantities of food. Gallon sized bags are ideal for dried powered foods, spices, hard candy, salts and other baking ingredients. These bags will help protect valuables, ammo and medical supplies from general corrosion that comes with varying weather and heat conditions over time. Included with these Absorbers is an oxygen indicator pill that will turn from pink to solid dark blue in the presence of oxygen. These absorbers are rated for twice their cc ratings.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51oQSypVrmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006T5ES9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Oxy-Sorb", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Freeze-Dried Food"]], "price": 12.99}}
{"item_id": "B006TDEV20", "title": "Hornit dB140 Cycle Horn with Remote Trigger", "description": "The Hornit dB140 is the loudest cycle horn on the market. It emits a piercing 140 decibel sound which is enough to alert trucks, vans, buses, cars and even 'in a world of their own' pedestrians. Compatible with all styles of bikes, including road bikes, it gives cyclists a way of letting all other road users know where they are and makes cycling much safer.", "text": "Hornit dB140 Cycle Horn with Remote Trigger The Hornit dB140 is the loudest cycle horn on the market. It emits a piercing 140 decibel sound which is enough to alert trucks, vans, buses, cars and even 'in a world of their own' pedestrians. Compatible with all styles of bikes, including road bikes, it gives cyclists a way of letting all other road users know where they are and makes cycling much safer.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/311zfRcXSjL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006TDEV20.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hornit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Accessories", "Bike Horns"]], "price": 41.49}}
{"item_id": "B006THJJXM", "title": "CARBON FIBER BIKJRFOTO Bicycle HEADSET SPACERS 1 1/8\" SET STEM Set 5-10-15-20mm 4 pcs By JRFOTO CC01", "description": "One way to lighten up your bike and get that technical carbon look is to replace your metal spacers with these super light 100% carbon fiber spacers. You will get the 1 1/8\" tube size 5,10,15,20mm thicknesses in one package. Contains: 5 mm thick x1 10 mm thick x1 15 mm thick x1 20 mm thick x1 Specification: Material:Full Carbon Fiber Diameter: 28.6mm( 1 1/8\") Net Weight: 26g (4PCS)", "text": "CARBON FIBER BIKJRFOTO Bicycle HEADSET SPACERS 1 1/8\" SET STEM Set 5-10-15-20mm 4 pcs By JRFOTO CC01 One way to lighten up your bike and get that technical carbon look is to replace your metal spacers with these super light 100% carbon fiber spacers. You will get the 1 1/8\" tube size 5,10,15,20mm thicknesses in one package. Contains: 5 mm thick x1 10 mm thick x1 15 mm thick x1 20 mm thick x1 Specification: Material:Full Carbon Fiber Diameter: 28.6mm( 1 1/8\") Net Weight: 26g (4PCS)", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31GGIaDeSyL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006THJJXM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "JRFOTO", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Handlebars, Headsets & Stems", "Headset Spacers"]], "price": 8.99}}
{"item_id": "B006THNYOC", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol Bore Cleaner, 24000 Volt, .22 Cal", "description": "With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol Bore Cleaner, 24000 Volt, .22 Cal With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AXgsYZj7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006THNYOC.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 18.99}}
{"item_id": "B006THNYVK", "title": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol Bore Cleaner, 24003 Volt, .40, .41 Cal", "description": "With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "text": "Hoppe's BoreSnake Viper Pistol Bore Cleaner, 24003 Volt, .40, .41 Cal With the BoreSnake Viper it features 50% more scouring power, a coneshaped bore guide for quicker, easier alignment and a designated lubrication zone on the handle. One pass with the BoreSnake Viper loosens large particles, scrubs out residue, and swabs your bore spotless. Just add some Hoppe's Elite Gun Cleaner of your choice for a one-step triple-action bore shine.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41AXgsYZj7L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006THNYVK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Hoppe&#39;s", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 18.99}}
