{"item_id": "B006U0Z1JY", "title": "Simmons Simmons LRF 600 Tilt Intelligence laser Rangefinder", "description": "The LRF 600 is hairsplitting accuracy made simple. An in-view LCD display provides the actual distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards with the tap of a single button, while the 4x magnification and bright, crystal-clear optics bring you nose to nose with your next trophy. Tilt Intelligence calculates and displays True Horizontal Distance below the line of sight distance. Its efficient, compact, vertical design and weather-resistant housing provide an unparalleled advantage that's easy to carry -- just be prepared to carry something much heavier on the hike back.", "text": "Simmons Simmons LRF 600 Tilt Intelligence laser Rangefinder The LRF 600 is hairsplitting accuracy made simple. An in-view LCD display provides the actual distance to your target from 10 to 600 yards with the tap of a single button, while the 4x magnification and bright, crystal-clear optics bring you nose to nose with your next trophy. Tilt Intelligence calculates and displays True Horizontal Distance below the line of sight distance. Its efficient, compact, vertical design and weather-resistant housing provide an unparalleled advantage that's easy to carry -- just be prepared to carry something much heavier on the hike back.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41KHtQrqLdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006U0Z1JY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Simmons", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Laser Rangefinders"]], "price": 124.9}}
{"item_id": "B006U0Z3BK", "title": "Bushnell 8MP Trophy Cam HD Trail Camera with Night Vision", "description": "The Bushnell Trophy Cam offers 8 MP high-quality full color resolution and now features 720p HD video with audio record for the most vivid viewing experience possible. New Field Scan 2x gives you two windows of image capture to capitalize on dusk and dawn movement. Its 32 LEDs can capture images in total darkness with a range of 60 feet and Hyper Night Vision feature gives you the brightest possible after-dark images. The time stamps are more detailed than ever, and now include date, time, moon, temp and name, plus the addition of GPS Geotag to automatically embed each image with GPS coordinates for optimum tracking. To maximize consistency in all conditions, new Auto PIR setting automatically regulates sensitivity based on temperature. All this and built on a foundation of a category leading 1-year battery life and the lightning quick 0.6-second trigger speed that’s made it a nationwide favorite.", "text": "Bushnell 8MP Trophy Cam HD Trail Camera with Night Vision The Bushnell Trophy Cam offers 8 MP high-quality full color resolution and now features 720p HD video with audio record for the most vivid viewing experience possible. New Field Scan 2x gives you two windows of image capture to capitalize on dusk and dawn movement. Its 32 LEDs can capture images in total darkness with a range of 60 feet and Hyper Night Vision feature gives you the brightest possible after-dark images. The time stamps are more detailed than ever, and now include date, time, moon, temp and name, plus the addition of GPS Geotag to automatically embed each image with GPS coordinates for optimum tracking. To maximize consistency in all conditions, new Auto PIR setting automatically regulates sensitivity based on temperature. All this and built on a foundation of a category leading 1-year battery life and the lightning quick 0.6-second trigger speed that’s made it a nationwide favorite.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZPpT6ayOL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006U0Z3BK.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Game & Trail Cameras"]], "price": 175.54}}
{"item_id": "B006U0Z400", "title": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Side-Armor Deluxe Range Bag, Black", "description": "Uncle Mike’s Side-Armor bags were built and constructed with one goal in mind, to offer exceptional quality, function and value. Side-Armor fabric is comprised of durable 1680D X 1680D polyester fabric treated with a polyurethane backing for water resistance. Paying attention to the details that matter most, with added piping on the seams for added structural strength at critical stress points and ergonomically designed pull tabs for easy operation on every zipper. You can trust a Side- Armor bag to go the distance. Uncle Mike's Side-Armor Range Bag is designed for a day at the range with over 1,200 cubic inches of storage and packed with features. Made from durable fabric with a removable handgun pouch, this bag will make any day a range day.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Side-Armor Deluxe Range Bag, Black Uncle Mike’s Side-Armor bags were built and constructed with one goal in mind, to offer exceptional quality, function and value. Side-Armor fabric is comprised of durable 1680D X 1680D polyester fabric treated with a polyurethane backing for water resistance. Paying attention to the details that matter most, with added piping on the seams for added structural strength at critical stress points and ergonomically designed pull tabs for easy operation on every zipper. You can trust a Side- Armor bag to go the distance. Uncle Mike's Side-Armor Range Bag is designed for a day at the range with over 1,200 cubic inches of storage and packed with features. Made from durable fabric with a removable handgun pouch, this bag will make any day a range day.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51bJdwMiRFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006U0Z400.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s Law Enforcement", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 40.99}}
{"item_id": "B006U0Z482", "title": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Side-Armor Standard Car Seat Organizer, Black", "description": "Uncle Mike’s Side-Armor bags were built and constructed with one goal in mind, to offer exceptional quality, function and value. Side-Armor fabric is comprised of durable 1680D X 1680D polyester fabric treated with a polyurethane backing for water resistance. Paying attention to the details that matter most, with added piping on the seams for added structural strength at critical stress points and ergonomically designed pull tabs for easy operation on every zipper. You can trust a Side- Armor bag to go the distance. Uncle Mike's Side-Armor Car Seat Organizer is the perfect way to transport your gear from one vehicle to another or back to your command post with ease. Made from durable 1680D fabric and packed with features, this organizer is ready to ride along.", "text": "Uncle Mike's Law Enforcement Side-Armor Standard Car Seat Organizer, Black Uncle Mike’s Side-Armor bags were built and constructed with one goal in mind, to offer exceptional quality, function and value. Side-Armor fabric is comprised of durable 1680D X 1680D polyester fabric treated with a polyurethane backing for water resistance. Paying attention to the details that matter most, with added piping on the seams for added structural strength at critical stress points and ergonomically designed pull tabs for easy operation on every zipper. You can trust a Side- Armor bag to go the distance. Uncle Mike's Side-Armor Car Seat Organizer is the perfect way to transport your gear from one vehicle to another or back to your command post with ease. Made from durable 1680D fabric and packed with features, this organizer is ready to ride along.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51AmlEz%2BkIL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006U0Z482.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Uncle Mike&#39;s Law Enforcement", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Tactical Bags & Packs"]], "price": 37.01}}
