{"item_id": "B006UMFUES", "title": "Bike Bicycle Cycle Crank Puller Bike Tool", "description": "-Tool needs either a 5/8 or 16mm spanner or just an adjustable spanner. -This tool is incredibly simple to use and requires no rocket science. -1 Remove the bolt in the crank arm -2 Screw the lower black part of the tool into the crank till tight (ish) -3 Screw in and continue to tighten the silver piece of the tool until the crank starts to move Package included: -1 BIKE CRANK EXTRACTOR REMOVER PULLER TOOL", "text": "Bike Bicycle Cycle Crank Puller Bike Tool -Tool needs either a 5/8 or 16mm spanner or just an adjustable spanner. -This tool is incredibly simple to use and requires no rocket science. -1 Remove the bolt in the crank arm -2 Screw the lower black part of the tool into the crank till tight (ish) -3 Screw in and continue to tighten the silver piece of the tool until the crank starts to move Package included: -1 BIKE CRANK EXTRACTOR REMOVER PULLER TOOL", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41JJ%2BqgVwtL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006UMFUES.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "World Pride", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Bike Tools & Maintenance", "Shop Tools"]], "price": 3.77}}
{"item_id": "B006URBKEM", "title": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Phantom 2.0 Soft Shell Jacket", "description": "This versatile, durable garment from GORE BIKE WEAR is a combination cycling jacket, short-sleeved jersey, and vest designed to move with you as you ride. Made of soft WINDSTOPPER soft shell material that seals out the wind-driven chill while still letting perspiration escape, the Phantom 2.0 combines the comfort of a soft mid-layer with the water resistance of a shell. It's ideal for passionate cyclists who need to get their miles in, regardless of weather conditions.360-degree zips around each shoulder can quickly turn the jacket into a short-sleeved jersey or vest.FeaturesThree-compartment patch pockets on backReflective print on back and sleevesStretch inserts for optimum freedom of movementWear-resistant elastic binding on sleeve-hem and on hemZip-underflapAdditional short sleevesDetachable raglan sleevesReflective logo on front and backSlightly slanted back pocket at side for better accessAbout GORE BIKE WEARFor more than 50 years, the GORE line has stood for durable high-tech function and premium quality, and its line of bicycling products are designed and fine-tuned to meet the needs of devout cyclists. Hundreds of industry awards have been bestowed upon GORE BIKE WEAR products for their quality, performance, and design, and well-known materials such as GORE-TEX, WINDSTOPPER, and other carefully selected technical fabrics are the key components of GORE BIKE WEAR products. All have been developed and rigorously tested to keep out the elements while maximizing comfort.", "text": "Gore Bike Wear Men's Phantom 2.0 Soft Shell Jacket This versatile, durable garment from GORE BIKE WEAR is a combination cycling jacket, short-sleeved jersey, and vest designed to move with you as you ride. Made of soft WINDSTOPPER soft shell material that seals out the wind-driven chill while still letting perspiration escape, the Phantom 2.0 combines the comfort of a soft mid-layer with the water resistance of a shell. It's ideal for passionate cyclists who need to get their miles in, regardless of weather conditions.360-degree zips around each shoulder can quickly turn the jacket into a short-sleeved jersey or vest.FeaturesThree-compartment patch pockets on backReflective print on back and sleevesStretch inserts for optimum freedom of movementWear-resistant elastic binding on sleeve-hem and on hemZip-underflapAdditional short sleevesDetachable raglan sleevesReflective logo on front and backSlightly slanted back pocket at side for better accessAbout GORE BIKE WEARFor more than 50 years, the GORE line has stood for durable high-tech function and premium quality, and its line of bicycling products are designed and fine-tuned to meet the needs of devout cyclists. Hundreds of industry awards have been bestowed upon GORE BIKE WEAR products for their quality, performance, and design, and well-known materials such as GORE-TEX, WINDSTOPPER, and other carefully selected technical fabrics are the key components of GORE BIKE WEAR products. All have been developed and rigorously tested to keep out the elements while maximizing comfort.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/4154yX1BScL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006URBKEM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Clothing", "Men", "Jackets"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006V2ARCM", "title": "Laserlyte Side Mount Laser for Ruger LC9", "description": "LaserLyte answers the growing demand for lasers specific to the increasingly popular conceal carry market with the Ruger LC9 Side Mount Laser (CK-AMF9). At half the cost of a leading competitor, the CK-AMF9 fits on the side of the Ruger LC9 and the Kel-Tec PF9. Easy to mount on the gun by simply pushing out and replacing the stock pins with the new screws (included). Then push the ergonomic activation button with the index finger and the laser is on target. The CK-AMF9 design works also as a finger guide that allows for safe trigger control without blocking the laser beam. The LaserLyte Ruger LC9 Side Mount Laser is compact and light, and foremost - deadly.", "text": "Laserlyte Side Mount Laser for Ruger LC9 LaserLyte answers the growing demand for lasers specific to the increasingly popular conceal carry market with the Ruger LC9 Side Mount Laser (CK-AMF9). At half the cost of a leading competitor, the CK-AMF9 fits on the side of the Ruger LC9 and the Kel-Tec PF9. Easy to mount on the gun by simply pushing out and replacing the stock pins with the new screws (included). Then push the ergonomic activation button with the index finger and the laser is on target. The CK-AMF9 design works also as a finger guide that allows for safe trigger control without blocking the laser beam. The LaserLyte Ruger LC9 Side Mount Laser is compact and light, and foremost - deadly.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41kRoDSdHwL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006V2ARCM.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "LaserLyte", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Lasers"]], "price": 80.23}}
{"item_id": "B006V6D6I0", "title": "WOSS Military Strap Trainer, Brown, Made in USA", "description": "Build body strength with your own weight. Very portable and easy to use and very adjustable. Perfect for beginners to expert.", "text": "WOSS Military Strap Trainer, Brown, Made in USA Build body strength with your own weight. Very portable and easy to use and very adjustable. Perfect for beginners to expert.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/61Fb2pqQiAL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006V6D6I0.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Strength Training Equipment", "Home Gyms"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B006VEEKCI", "title": "Gerber De Facto Fixed Blade Knife 30-000528", "description": "In close quarters combat, speed of deployment is key. If your primary weapon system is compromised, you need an immediate, easily accessible solution to defend against physical threat. Developed with veteran Special Forces Soldiers, our knife has a four-inch spear-point blade, dual serrations, rubberized grip and spike pommel that quickly transforms an empty hand into a lethal defense weapon. What sets this knife apart is its innovative sheath locking system ' a 'weapons hot' friction lock for fast, unrestrained deployment in danger close situations and a secondary retention lock to ensure that the knife isn't lost during high-speed insertion.", "text": "Gerber De Facto Fixed Blade Knife 30-000528 In close quarters combat, speed of deployment is key. If your primary weapon system is compromised, you need an immediate, easily accessible solution to defend against physical threat. Developed with veteran Special Forces Soldiers, our knife has a four-inch spear-point blade, dual serrations, rubberized grip and spike pommel that quickly transforms an empty hand into a lethal defense weapon. What sets this knife apart is its innovative sheath locking system ' a 'weapons hot' friction lock for fast, unrestrained deployment in danger close situations and a secondary retention lock to ensure that the knife isn't lost during high-speed insertion.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31rhcsfoeCL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VEEKCI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Fixed-Blade Knives"]], "price": 93.99}}
{"item_id": "B006VEEM9O", "title": "Gerber 31-001031 Bear Grylls Survival Torch", "description": "", "text": "Gerber 31-001031 Bear Grylls Survival Torch", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/318FD1TjNXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VEEM9O.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Kitchen", "Stove Accessories", "Fire Starters"]], "price": 22.95}}
{"item_id": "B006VEEQ6S", "title": "Gerber 31-001270 Bear Grylls Field Sharpener", "description": "Encased in a smooth, hard plastic cover and fitting easily in your pocket, the Bear Grylls knife sharpener (model 31-001270) features a handle made of grippy rubber for secure holding in wet or cold conditions. Two rod shaped diamond-coated sharpeners allow you to sharpen the serrated sections of your knife. Coarse carbide and fine ceramic inserts will get your fine edge blade in shape.", "text": "Gerber 31-001270 Bear Grylls Field Sharpener Encased in a smooth, hard plastic cover and fitting easily in your pocket, the Bear Grylls knife sharpener (model 31-001270) features a handle made of grippy rubber for secure holding in wet or cold conditions. Two rod shaped diamond-coated sharpeners allow you to sharpen the serrated sections of your knife. Coarse carbide and fine ceramic inserts will get your fine edge blade in shape.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/413sCekLanL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VEEQ6S.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Knives & Tools", "Folding Knives"]], "price": 16.52}}
{"item_id": "B006VGZTVW", "title": "Rothco GI Type Coyote Plastic Machete Sheath - 18\"", "description": "This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "text": "Rothco GI Type Coyote Plastic Machete Sheath - 18\" This item comes with well known brand name of Rothco. Rothco is the World's Foremost Supplier of Military and Outdoor Clothing and Accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21edrXFzxXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VGZTVW.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Rothco", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Fishing", "Accessories", "Safety Gear"]], "price": 13.32}}
{"item_id": "B006VK5WFQ", "title": "Pepper Gun W/Holster Combo - Camo 28G", "description": "Mace Brand Pepper Gun w/ Cartridges- Warrior Model w/ Holster The Mace Warrior OC Gun is one of the most accurate non-lethal self defense sprays available. With its advanced delivery system - utilizing bag-in-a-can technology - the Mace Warrior OC Gun delivers a targeted stream of OC pepper spray up to 20 feet, and fires from any angle. Features: The Mace Warrior OC Gun features high impact ABS construction and a popular outdoor camouflage pattern. A safe and fire mechanism prevents accidental discharge The Warrior OC Gun comes loaded with a water practice cartridge and includes a 28 gram cartridge of OC Pepper Spray and a custom-fit matching camouflage holster. Includes: 1 x Warrior OC Gun 1 x Water cartridge 1 x OC Pepper Spray Cartridge (28 g) 1 x Camoflage Holster", "text": "Pepper Gun W/Holster Combo - Camo 28G Mace Brand Pepper Gun w/ Cartridges- Warrior Model w/ Holster The Mace Warrior OC Gun is one of the most accurate non-lethal self defense sprays available. With its advanced delivery system - utilizing bag-in-a-can technology - the Mace Warrior OC Gun delivers a targeted stream of OC pepper spray up to 20 feet, and fires from any angle. Features: The Mace Warrior OC Gun features high impact ABS construction and a popular outdoor camouflage pattern. A safe and fire mechanism prevents accidental discharge The Warrior OC Gun comes loaded with a water practice cartridge and includes a 28 gram cartridge of OC Pepper Spray and a custom-fit matching camouflage holster. Includes: 1 x Warrior OC Gun 1 x Water cartridge 1 x OC Pepper Spray Cartridge (28 g) 1 x Camoflage Holster", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41DQkSDq5EL.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VK5WFQ.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 38.89}}
{"item_id": "B006VK6Y5I", "title": "Mace Pepper Gun - Mat Blk W/Strobe Led", "description": "Mace Brand Pepper Gun w/ Cartridges- Black Color MACE PEPPER GUN uses an advanced delivery system utilizing patented Bag-in-a-Can Technology. This new system allows the pepper spray to spray like an aerosol in a continuous fashion from any angle, even when Pepper Gun is held upside down. Sprays 7 blasts up to 25 feet. Trigger Activated LED Light: Allows for better aim Temporarily disorients intruder Mace Pepper Gun includes: Pepper Gun dispenser One 28 gram 10% OC cartridge", "text": "Mace Pepper Gun - Mat Blk W/Strobe Led Mace Brand Pepper Gun w/ Cartridges- Black Color MACE PEPPER GUN uses an advanced delivery system utilizing patented Bag-in-a-Can Technology. This new system allows the pepper spray to spray like an aerosol in a continuous fashion from any angle, even when Pepper Gun is held upside down. Sprays 7 blasts up to 25 feet. Trigger Activated LED Light: Allows for better aim Temporarily disorients intruder Mace Pepper Gun includes: Pepper Gun dispenser One 28 gram 10% OC cartridge", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41jX-ltZUOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VK6Y5I.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mace", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Safety & Survival", "Bear Protection"]], "price": 39.96}}
