{"item_id": "B006VYBAZ8", "title": "MIC Holster Black 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35", "description": "Since 1997 the one and only design of the original MIC (Minimal Inside Carry) holster for Glock Safe Action Pistols. The holster is made from hi retention Kydex which is a perfect combination of flexibility for comfort and durability for many years of daily concealed carry use. What you see here is the first, and the original MIC holster. Fits Glock Models 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35 Made in The USA", "text": "MIC Holster Black 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35 Since 1997 the one and only design of the original MIC (Minimal Inside Carry) holster for Glock Safe Action Pistols. The holster is made from hi retention Kydex which is a perfect combination of flexibility for comfort and durability for many years of daily concealed carry use. What you see here is the first, and the original MIC holster. Fits Glock Models 17,18,19,22,23,24,26,27,31,32,34,35 Made in The USA", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41ZSjn5ngXL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VYBAZ8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.98}}
{"item_id": "B006VYBXUK", "title": "Tech MIC Holster Black 20,21,30,36,37,38,39", "description": "Since 1997 the one and only design of the original MIC (Minimal Inside Carry) holster for Safe Action Pistols has been a staple in the library of products. You will see imitations of this holster on the internet, you tube and many other places. What you see here is the first, and the original MIC holster. Fits Models G20,21,30,36,37,38,39", "text": "Tech MIC Holster Black 20,21,30,36,37,38,39 Since 1997 the one and only design of the original MIC (Minimal Inside Carry) holster for Safe Action Pistols has been a staple in the library of products. You will see imitations of this holster on the internet, you tube and many other places. What you see here is the first, and the original MIC holster. Fits Models G20,21,30,36,37,38,39", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41IMy4JP%2BBL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006VYBXUK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Unknown", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Holsters, Cases & Bags", "Gun Holsters"]], "price": 22.99}}
