{"item_id": "B006WIW6H4", "title": "Gerber Model 30-000137 Covert Knife", "description": "The Applegate-Fairbairn designed Gerber Covert has all the features you want in a tactical knife. It has an over-sized release button to assure quick deployment even with gloves. The front mounted slide safety engages in both the open and closed positions. The spear-point black coated S30V blade is partially serrated and well suited to most applications. The Covert handle is black anodized aluminum with grip grooves and stainless liners assure the rigidity of the handle. A removable deep carry pocket clip (tip-down) allows convenient and discreet carry. Comfortable, practical and reasonably prices, the Covert makes an excellent tactical knife choice.Specifications:Overall Length: 8.70\"Blade Length: 3.78\"Blade Thickness: 0.125\"Blade Material: S30V Stainless SteelHandle Material: Type III Anodized 6061 AluminumClosed Length: 4.92\"Handle Thickness: 0.48\"Weight: 3.8 oz.Somerled Tactical Beanie- Machine washable- One size fits all design- High quality embroidered logo", "text": "Gerber Model 30-000137 Covert Knife The Applegate-Fairbairn designed Gerber Covert has all the features you want in a tactical knife. It has an over-sized release button to assure quick deployment even with gloves. The front mounted slide safety engages in both the open and closed positions. The spear-point black coated S30V blade is partially serrated and well suited to most applications. The Covert handle is black anodized aluminum with grip grooves and stainless liners assure the rigidity of the handle. A removable deep carry pocket clip (tip-down) allows convenient and discreet carry. Comfortable, practical and reasonably prices, the Covert makes an excellent tactical knife choice.Specifications:Overall Length: 8.70\"Blade Length: 3.78\"Blade Thickness: 0.125\"Blade Material: S30V Stainless SteelHandle Material: Type III Anodized 6061 AluminumClosed Length: 4.92\"Handle Thickness: 0.48\"Weight: 3.8 oz.Somerled Tactical Beanie- Machine washable- One size fits all design- High quality embroidered logo", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41peUO8wcdL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006WIW6H4.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Gerber", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting & Tactical Knives", "Hunting Knives"]], "price": 139.0}}
