{"item_id": "B006WPSCOI", "title": "Mueller Speed Shot Rifle Scope, Black, 1-4 x 24mm", "description": "The Speed Shot 1-4×24 features include a 30 millimeter tube, larger target style capped turrets with 1/2 moa click adjustments, 3.5 of eye relief, fast-focus eye-piece, wide-angle field-of-view and illuminated 4moa dot reticle with 11 brightness settings. The new Speed Shot utilizes a illumination system that allows the illumination to be seen during normal daylight conditions, without causing any excessive tube glow. This new illumination system, combined with the dot reticle is ideal for many different applications that may require speed shots, including but not limited to CQB, hog hunting and bear hunting. We also feel it would be ideal for turkey hunting, closer range varmint hunting such as squirrel hunting. All of these features at a price that cant be matched.", "text": "Mueller Speed Shot Rifle Scope, Black, 1-4 x 24mm The Speed Shot 1-4×24 features include a 30 millimeter tube, larger target style capped turrets with 1/2 moa click adjustments, 3.5 of eye relief, fast-focus eye-piece, wide-angle field-of-view and illuminated 4moa dot reticle with 11 brightness settings. The new Speed Shot utilizes a illumination system that allows the illumination to be seen during normal daylight conditions, without causing any excessive tube glow. This new illumination system, combined with the dot reticle is ideal for many different applications that may require speed shots, including but not limited to CQB, hog hunting and bear hunting. We also feel it would be ideal for turkey hunting, closer range varmint hunting such as squirrel hunting. All of these features at a price that cant be matched.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41iY3z%2BltvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006WPSCOI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Mueller", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 229.95}}
