{"item_id": "B006WS5WXO", "title": "Klymit - Cush Inflatable Pillow / Seat", "description": "The Klymit Cush - Inflatable Pillow / Seat is an amazingly versatile thing. It is a seat cushion for one or two people. Or it can be your personal camp or travel pillow. Because it is 29 inches long 2 people can sit on it or if you are solo you can fold it over and sit with double or triple cushioning. Or put it in your sleeping bag for the most comfy pillow ever. Inflates with 3-4 breaths and is easy to deflate. Packs very small and is very light to carry. And because it is easy to adjust the inflation level it is can always be set to your custom comfort level.Durable Polyester material.Inflates quickly (3-4 breaths).Sturdy easy to use push/pull-inflate/deflate valve.Color - Black/Blue.Weight - 3 oz.Dimensions - Inflated = 29\"x 9\" x 1.5\" - Packed = 4\" x 2.5\" x 2.5\".Materials -75D Polyester.UPC: 846447002454.Manufacturer part number: 12CUBG01.", "text": "Klymit - Cush Inflatable Pillow / Seat The Klymit Cush - Inflatable Pillow / Seat is an amazingly versatile thing. It is a seat cushion for one or two people. Or it can be your personal camp or travel pillow. Because it is 29 inches long 2 people can sit on it or if you are solo you can fold it over and sit with double or triple cushioning. Or put it in your sleeping bag for the most comfy pillow ever. Inflates with 3-4 breaths and is easy to deflate. Packs very small and is very light to carry. And because it is easy to adjust the inflation level it is can always be set to your custom comfort level.Durable Polyester material.Inflates quickly (3-4 breaths).Sturdy easy to use push/pull-inflate/deflate valve.Color - Black/Blue.Weight - 3 oz.Dimensions - Inflated = 29\"x 9\" x 1.5\" - Packed = 4\" x 2.5\" x 2.5\".Materials -75D Polyester.UPC: 846447002454.Manufacturer part number: 12CUBG01.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mXV4fPKEL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006WS5WXO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Klymit", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Camp Bedding", "Camping Pillows"]], "price": 13.75}}
{"item_id": "B006X38ISY", "title": "Glock Original 3.5lb Minus Connector", "description": "The Glock 'minus' connector known as the 3.5lb connector. With the stock firing pin spring will reduce the pull to approximately 4.5lbs.", "text": "Glock Original 3.5lb Minus Connector The Glock 'minus' connector known as the 3.5lb connector. With the stock firing pin spring will reduce the pull to approximately 4.5lbs.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31C7O-CZdXL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006X38ISY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Glock", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B006X41PRY", "title": "\"The Executive\" Comfortable Bicycle Seat", "description": "Most bicycle seats can cause you to cut short or eliminate your bicycle ride due to skinny, uncomfortable, or poorly designed seats that cut off your blood flow, leading to numbness and discomfort. \"The Executive\" Bicycle Saddle by Yosemite Bicycles replaces your uncomfortable bicycle seat with gel foam cushioning, an extra wide saddle, two oversized chrome suspension springs and an anatomic relief design, made with durable weatherproof Lycra. 10.5\"x10.5\", 3 lbs. Universal mount system fits most cruiser, exercise, mountain and road bike seat posts. MOUNT INSTRUCTIONS: Saddle comes mounted with a standard seat post clamp for use with most cruisers and exercise bicycles. For use with most mountain and road bicycles, simply remove the seat post clamp and bolt seat post directly to seat. For more information on us and the seat check out facebook.com/yosemitebicycles", "text": "\"The Executive\" Comfortable Bicycle Seat Most bicycle seats can cause you to cut short or eliminate your bicycle ride due to skinny, uncomfortable, or poorly designed seats that cut off your blood flow, leading to numbness and discomfort. \"The Executive\" Bicycle Saddle by Yosemite Bicycles replaces your uncomfortable bicycle seat with gel foam cushioning, an extra wide saddle, two oversized chrome suspension springs and an anatomic relief design, made with durable weatherproof Lycra. 10.5\"x10.5\", 3 lbs. Universal mount system fits most cruiser, exercise, mountain and road bike seat posts. MOUNT INSTRUCTIONS: Saddle comes mounted with a standard seat post clamp for use with most cruisers and exercise bicycles. For use with most mountain and road bicycles, simply remove the seat post clamp and bolt seat post directly to seat. For more information on us and the seat check out facebook.com/yosemitebicycles", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41hfVpELs1L._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006X41PRY.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Parts & Components", "Saddles & Accessories", "Saddles"]], "price": 24.99}}
{"item_id": "B006X4STB4", "title": "100 FT Military 550 Paracord from Our School Spirit - Made in the USA", "description": "NOTE:All paracord from Our School Spirit is manufactured in the USA and is packaged with theOur School Spiritbrand.Great for paracord bracelets, pet collars, camping equipment. Check out our 3/8\" buckles in a variety of colors.Our School Spirit is owned and operated by a combat disabled veteran.", "text": "100 FT Military 550 Paracord from Our School Spirit - Made in the USA NOTE:All paracord from Our School Spirit is manufactured in the USA and is packaged with theOur School Spiritbrand.Great for paracord bracelets, pet collars, camping equipment. Check out our 3/8\" buckles in a variety of colors.Our School Spirit is owned and operated by a combat disabled veteran.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51EEdYWTOmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006X4STB4.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Tactical & Duty", "Paracords"]], "price": 7.99}}
