{"item_id": "B006YQCTL2", "title": "Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella", "description": "Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella Perfect For Sunny Days or Torrential Downpours Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella features: Oversized 68\" single-canopy umbrella provides maximum protection Constructed of waterproof, UV-coated nylon for lasting durability Custom molded handle for comfortable carry Fits all models of Clicgear Carts, as well as other brands of umbrella holders Clicgear brandname on alternating panels Includes carry bag Clicgear...The Next Generation of Golf Pushcart Accessories", "text": "Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella Perfect For Sunny Days or Torrential Downpours Clicgear Single Canopy Umbrella features: Oversized 68\" single-canopy umbrella provides maximum protection Constructed of waterproof, UV-coated nylon for lasting durability Custom molded handle for comfortable carry Fits all models of Clicgear Carts, as well as other brands of umbrella holders Clicgear brandname on alternating panels Includes carry bag Clicgear...The Next Generation of Golf Pushcart Accessories", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41I4uXuYMSL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YQCTL2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Clicgear", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Golf", "On-Course Accessories", "Umbrellas"]], "price": 38.24}}
{"item_id": "B006YSR3K2", "title": "Crosman M4-177 Multi-Pump BB and Pellet Air Rifle", "description": "The next great variable pump rifle is here! This kit has everything you need: rifle, ammunition, targets and shooting glasses. If you enjoy the adaptability of the AR platform then you're going to love the M4-177. The airgun features a rifled steel barrel and shoots both pellets and BBs. The rifle's variable pump action is easy to use for right or left-handed shooters. Expect velocities up to 660 fps with BBs and 625 fps with 7.9gr, .177 caliber pellets. There's plenty of picatinny rails for mounting your favorite accessories, plus the front and rear sights and stock are removable for the ultimate in upgrade possibilities.", "text": "Crosman M4-177 Multi-Pump BB and Pellet Air Rifle The next great variable pump rifle is here! This kit has everything you need: rifle, ammunition, targets and shooting glasses. If you enjoy the adaptability of the AR platform then you're going to love the M4-177. The airgun features a rifled steel barrel and shoots both pellets and BBs. The rifle's variable pump action is easy to use for right or left-handed shooters. Expect velocities up to 660 fps with BBs and 625 fps with 7.9gr, .177 caliber pellets. There's plenty of picatinny rails for mounting your favorite accessories, plus the front and rear sights and stock are removable for the ultimate in upgrade possibilities.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31LP7q90P0L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YSR3K2.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Crosman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Airsoft, Air Guns & Slingshots", "Air Guns", "Air Rifles"]], "price": 73.63}}
{"item_id": "B006YU66XK", "title": "Weaver Base System Savage Axis", "description": "Since the Savage Axis bolt-action rifle arrives pre-drilled and tapped for scope mounts, we decided to make it easy. Weaver’s new Savage Axis Multi-Slot Base not only affixes directly to the receiver, it also features the legendary Weaver cross-lock design and several slots to choose from so you get optimum eye relief and scope ring location. Constructed from 6061-T6 aluminium and made in the USA, this new multi-slot base is the second order you need to place…right after ordering your new Savage Axis rifle.", "text": "Weaver Base System Savage Axis Since the Savage Axis bolt-action rifle arrives pre-drilled and tapped for scope mounts, we decided to make it easy. Weaver’s new Savage Axis Multi-Slot Base not only affixes directly to the receiver, it also features the legendary Weaver cross-lock design and several slots to choose from so you get optimum eye relief and scope ring location. Constructed from 6061-T6 aluminium and made in the USA, this new multi-slot base is the second order you need to place…right after ordering your new Savage Axis rifle.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/21LBdcvlQFL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YU66XK.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors"]], "price": 16.33}}
{"item_id": "B006YU67JS", "title": "Weaver Base Top Mount H and R Pardner Pump", "description": "Want your H&R; Pardner Pump to be a deer-dropping slug gun? Then top it with a Weaver scope and lock that scope down with Weaver’s new base designed specifically for the H&R; Pardner Pump. Proudly made in the USA and crafted from 6061-T6 aluminium, this new base is not only lightweight it also offers the rock solid hold of Weaver’s famous cross-lock design.", "text": "Weaver Base Top Mount H and R Pardner Pump Want your H&R; Pardner Pump to be a deer-dropping slug gun? Then top it with a Weaver scope and lock that scope down with Weaver’s new base designed specifically for the H&R; Pardner Pump. Proudly made in the USA and crafted from 6061-T6 aluminium, this new base is not only lightweight it also offers the rock solid hold of Weaver’s famous cross-lock design.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31jJKdomhjL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YU67JS.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Weaver", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Paintball & Airsoft", "Airsoft", "Gun Scope Mounts"]], "price": 7.45}}
{"item_id": "B006YU7RMO", "title": "Leupold 114933 VX-HOG Rifle Scope", "description": "Leupold VX-HOG 1-4x20mm Rifle Scope, Matte Black, Pig Plex Reticle 114933", "text": "Leupold 114933 VX-HOG Rifle Scope Leupold VX-HOG 1-4x20mm Rifle Scope, Matte Black, Pig Plex Reticle 114933", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/412Ezu5-FQL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YU7RMO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Leupold", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 229.99}}
{"item_id": "B006YU9JNO", "title": "MTM Limited Edition Zombie Ammo Can (Black and Green)", "description": "The AC50Z Limited Edition Zombie Ammo Can is a 50-Caliber Ammo Storage Can from MTM that is durable and sturdy. Molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic in Zombie Black and Green color, the can has a reinforced bottom with a thick sidewall design to stand up to heavy loads and rough treatment. The 50-Caliber can is designed to hold up to thirty pounds of ammo, and keep it dry, thanks to its water-resistant O-ring seals. The can is equipped with a fluorescent green, comfortable handle, a heavy-duty, dual latching system in fluorescent green, double padlock tabs, and molded-in stacking ridges. A great option for secure storage in basements, garages, or storage sheds. Specially designed for your Zombie Ammo and accessories.", "text": "MTM Limited Edition Zombie Ammo Can (Black and Green) The AC50Z Limited Edition Zombie Ammo Can is a 50-Caliber Ammo Storage Can from MTM that is durable and sturdy. Molded out of rugged polypropylene plastic in Zombie Black and Green color, the can has a reinforced bottom with a thick sidewall design to stand up to heavy loads and rough treatment. The 50-Caliber can is designed to hold up to thirty pounds of ammo, and keep it dry, thanks to its water-resistant O-ring seals. The can is equipped with a fluorescent green, comfortable handle, a heavy-duty, dual latching system in fluorescent green, double padlock tabs, and molded-in stacking ridges. A great option for secure storage in basements, garages, or storage sheds. Specially designed for your Zombie Ammo and accessories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51IvHSCenOL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YU9JNO.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "MTM", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Archery", "Bow Cases"]], "price": 13.39}}
{"item_id": "B006YUAIJI", "title": "Lyman Turbo Sonic Case Concentrated Cleaning Solution, 32 Fluid Ounce", "description": "Cleaning with ultrasonics requires the correct solution for the correct cleaning application. Lyman has partnered with a renowned chemical research team to develop the right solutions for use with today's new Ultrasonic Cleaners. Our Turbo Sonic case cleaning solution was formulated to deliver premium results in cleaning cases inside and out.", "text": "Lyman Turbo Sonic Case Concentrated Cleaning Solution, 32 Fluid Ounce Cleaning with ultrasonics requires the correct solution for the correct cleaning application. Lyman has partnered with a renowned chemical research team to develop the right solutions for use with today's new Ultrasonic Cleaners. Our Turbo Sonic case cleaning solution was formulated to deliver premium results in cleaning cases inside and out.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/31mM7sSumvL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YUAIJI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Lyman", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Accessories", "Cleaning & Maintenance Products"]], "price": 21.89}}
{"item_id": "B006YVT0R8", "title": "Nikon P-223 3-9x40 Mate BDC 600", "description": "Nikon P-223 3-9x40 AR RiflescopeThe new P-223 Series broadens Nikon’s line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy for AR platform rifles and .223 cartridges, the P-223’s entire optical system is fully multicoated for extreme brightness and provides light transmission up to 98%.The P-223 3-9x40 features the patented Nikon BDC 600 reticle and tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature to simplify field adjustments. It’s popular and versatile magnification range makes it the ideal optic for a wide range of AR platforms and uses from range work to hunting applications. The 3-9x40, like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC 600 reticle for your exact ammunition and load.Note: May appear blurry in ambient light conditions. This is most likely to occur indoors with artificial light.", "text": "Nikon P-223 3-9x40 Mate BDC 600 Nikon P-223 3-9x40 AR RiflescopeThe new P-223 Series broadens Nikon’s line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy for AR platform rifles and .223 cartridges, the P-223’s entire optical system is fully multicoated for extreme brightness and provides light transmission up to 98%.The P-223 3-9x40 features the patented Nikon BDC 600 reticle and tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature to simplify field adjustments. It’s popular and versatile magnification range makes it the ideal optic for a wide range of AR platforms and uses from range work to hunting applications. The 3-9x40, like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC 600 reticle for your exact ammunition and load.Note: May appear blurry in ambient light conditions. This is most likely to occur indoors with artificial light.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41Pu%2B51eKmL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YVT0R8.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 158.95}}
{"item_id": "B006YVT1JU", "title": "Nikon P-22 2-7x32 Matte BDC150", "description": "Nikon P-22 AR Rimfire 2-7x32 Riflescope The new P-22 Series riflescopes is the Rimfire optimized variant of Nikon’s growing line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior accuracy from Rimfire AR platform rifles and the .22 long rifle cartridge, the P-22 is offered in 2-7x32 with BDC 150 reticle or 2-7x32 with Nikoplex reticle and Nikon’s Rapid Action Turret system. Both P-22s features tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature and are parallax set at 50 yards. With fully multicoated optics for extreme brightness, the P-22 provides incredibly high light transmission for most light conditions.", "text": "Nikon P-22 2-7x32 Matte BDC150 Nikon P-22 AR Rimfire 2-7x32 Riflescope The new P-22 Series riflescopes is the Rimfire optimized variant of Nikon’s growing line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior accuracy from Rimfire AR platform rifles and the .22 long rifle cartridge, the P-22 is offered in 2-7x32 with BDC 150 reticle or 2-7x32 with Nikoplex reticle and Nikon’s Rapid Action Turret system. Both P-22s features tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature and are parallax set at 50 yards. With fully multicoated optics for extreme brightness, the P-22 provides incredibly high light transmission for most light conditions.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41B1bL4HGmL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006YVT1JU.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 179.95}}
{"item_id": "B006Z07JTE", "title": "Nikon P-223 3x32 Matte BDC Carbine", "description": "Nikon P-223 3x32cvAR RiflescopesThe new P-223 Series broadens Nikon’s line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy for AR platform rifles and .223 cartridges, the P-223’s entire optical system is fully multicoated for extreme brightness and provides light transmission up to 98%.The P-223 3x32 Carbine is an incredibly compact optic designed specifically for fast-handling, shorter barrel ARs. The all-new, fast-sighting BDC Carbine reticle was developed specifically for the 3x32 and .223 Remington cartridge to make engaging targets quickly and accurately both in-close and out to 600 yards. With tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature to simplify field adjustments, the 3x32, like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC carbine reticle for your exact ammunition and load.", "text": "Nikon P-223 3x32 Matte BDC Carbine Nikon P-223 3x32cvAR RiflescopesThe new P-223 Series broadens Nikon’s line-up of precision optics for AR rifles. Designed for extreme sighting speed and superior long-range accuracy for AR platform rifles and .223 cartridges, the P-223’s entire optical system is fully multicoated for extreme brightness and provides light transmission up to 98%.The P-223 3x32 Carbine is an incredibly compact optic designed specifically for fast-handling, shorter barrel ARs. The all-new, fast-sighting BDC Carbine reticle was developed specifically for the 3x32 and .223 Remington cartridge to make engaging targets quickly and accurately both in-close and out to 600 yards. With tactical-style turrets with Zero-Reset feature to simplify field adjustments, the 3x32, like all Nikon AR riflescopes, is optimized for use with Nikon Spot On Ballistic Match Technology. Spot On allows you to discover all of the exact aiming points on the BDC carbine reticle for your exact ammunition and load.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41V03dRie3L._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z07JTE.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Nikon", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]], "price": 119.95}}
{"item_id": "B006Z6JT1E", "title": "Timbuk2 Shagg Accessory Bag (Gunmetal/Rev Red, Medium)", "description": "Zip it up and strap it on. The strap-friendly Shagg Bag gives you easy access to little things you need on the move.", "text": "Timbuk2 Shagg Accessory Bag (Gunmetal/Rev Red, Medium) Zip it up and strap it on. The strap-friendly Shagg Bag gives you easy access to little things you need on the move.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/5181hdOV6WL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z6JT1E.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Outdoor Gear", "Camping & Hiking", "Backpacks & Bags", "Hiking Daypacks"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006Z6Z6Z2", "title": "Time to Run Men's Pace Running Short", "description": "Cut specifically short for maximum ease of movement, these lightweight running short are great for those weekday speedwork sessions and Sunday race days.", "text": "Time to Run Men's Pace Running Short Cut specifically short for maximum ease of movement, these lightweight running short are great for those weekday speedwork sessions and Sunday race days.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41YuAj8B5TL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z6Z6Z2.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Exercise & Fitness", "Running", "Clothing", "Men", "Shorts"]], "price": 14.99}}
{"item_id": "B006Z7P9YY", "title": "Real Avid The Ruger Gun Tool", "description": "Specially made to fit Rugerfirearms. Now the owners of Rugerfirearms have a multi-tool all their own. Designed by Real Avid and Rugerengineers, this 18-in-one multi-tool includes a special Rugerscope ring blade, and a tapered pin punch that fits Rugerrifles, shotguns and handguns.The founders of the company have had over 20 years of experience developing brands in the outdoor industry and are avid hunters themselves. Whether it is knives, multi-tools, gun cleaning kits, carriers or scales, Real Avid has and will continue to bring new, unique products to you in the gun care, shooting accessory, knife, archery and turkey hunting categories.", "text": "Real Avid The Ruger Gun Tool Specially made to fit Rugerfirearms. Now the owners of Rugerfirearms have a multi-tool all their own. Designed by Real Avid and Rugerengineers, this 18-in-one multi-tool includes a special Rugerscope ring blade, and a tapered pin punch that fits Rugerrifles, shotguns and handguns.The founders of the company have had over 20 years of experience developing brands in the outdoor industry and are avid hunters themselves. Whether it is knives, multi-tools, gun cleaning kits, carriers or scales, Real Avid has and will continue to bring new, unique products to you in the gun care, shooting accessory, knife, archery and turkey hunting categories.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41L5u91rKhL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z7P9YY.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "Real Avid", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Maintenance", "Gunsmithing Tools"]], "price": 12.95}}
{"item_id": "B006Z7PEZI", "title": "Pewter 1911 Grips", "description": "Stylish Pewter 1911 Grips with service branch. Upgrade your 1911 with a new look! Get these snazzy Pewter 1911 Grips to replace your oldies. Choose among 3 branch styles... Marine Corps, Army or U.S.M.C. Or for a modest look, choose the blank version. Diamond cut checkering for a sure grip; Raw pewter finish; Fit 1911 and 1911 clones.; State Style. Order Up! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Pewter 1911 Grips", "text": "Pewter 1911 Grips Stylish Pewter 1911 Grips with service branch. Upgrade your 1911 with a new look! Get these snazzy Pewter 1911 Grips to replace your oldies. Choose among 3 branch styles... Marine Corps, Army or U.S.M.C. Or for a modest look, choose the blank version. Diamond cut checkering for a sure grip; Raw pewter finish; Fit 1911 and 1911 clones.; State Style. Order Up! WARNING: Shipping restrictions apply to the product(s) above under some jurisdictions. Known Age, State and Local shipping restrictions are applied at Checkout and may result in changes to an order. Pewter 1911 Grips", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/511GfbwqiHL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z7PEZI.jpg", "metadata": {"brand": "PS Products", "categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Gun Accessories", "Grips"]], "price": 20.86}}
{"item_id": "B006Z7Q6YQ", "title": "AIM Sports 2 - 7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope Matte Black", "description": "AIM Sports 2 - 7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope for HUGE SAVINGS! An eagle-eyed Scout Scope for your forward-mount military-style rifle, boasting generous 8 1/2-10 1/2\" eye relief: Multi-coated lens for better light transmission, brighter images; Mil dot reticle; 1/4\" MOA; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 7.4' at 2X, 2.5' at 7X; Exit pupil: 21-6 mm. 11 1/4\"l. 14 ozs. No-glare matte black finish. Includes rings.; Ordering yours is easy... just order today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. AIM Sports 2-7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope, Matte Black", "text": "AIM Sports 2 - 7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope Matte Black AIM Sports 2 - 7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope for HUGE SAVINGS! An eagle-eyed Scout Scope for your forward-mount military-style rifle, boasting generous 8 1/2-10 1/2\" eye relief: Multi-coated lens for better light transmission, brighter images; Mil dot reticle; 1/4\" MOA; F.O.V. @ 100 yds. is 7.4' at 2X, 2.5' at 7X; Exit pupil: 21-6 mm. 11 1/4\"l. 14 ozs. No-glare matte black finish. Includes rings.; Ordering yours is easy... just order today! WARNING: This item cannot be shipped to Canada. Please check your State, County and City laws for restrictions before ordering this product. AIM Sports 2-7x42 mm Long Eye Relief Scope, Matte Black", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41FLXyFSCdL._SY300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z7Q6YQ.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Hunting & Fishing", "Hunting", "Hunting Optics", "Gun Scopes", "Rifle Scopes"]]}}
{"item_id": "B006Z7QTKM", "title": "Snugg High Quality Set of 2 Super Bright Bike Lights, 1 Red (Rear light) and 1 White (Front Light) for Safety - Fits all sized Handlebars and Installs in Seconds! 2 Settings - Flashing light or Constant Light", "description": "Snugg brings you these high quality super bright bike lights that installs in seconds! They fit any handlebars and are very easy to use. They have 2 different settings click once for flashing lights then click again for a constant light and again to turn them off, its that simple!", "text": "Snugg High Quality Set of 2 Super Bright Bike Lights, 1 Red (Rear light) and 1 White (Front Light) for Safety - Fits all sized Handlebars and Installs in Seconds! 2 Settings - Flashing light or Constant Light Snugg brings you these high quality super bright bike lights that installs in seconds! They fit any handlebars and are very easy to use. They have 2 different settings click once for flashing lights then click again for a constant light and again to turn them off, its that simple!", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41yFg1%2BNnUL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006Z7QTKM.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Lights & Reflectors", "Headlight-Taillight Combinations"]], "price": 14.99}}
