{"item_id": "B006ZH1H7M", "title": "VP Components Vice Downhill or Freeride Pedals (Pack of 2)", "description": "The Vice is an incredible all around trail flat. It is simple, thin, grippy, and durable. 12 pins per side are enough to bite into any shoe out there and stick you to the pedals. The wide, yet low profile bodies give you a planted feel yet stay out of the way of rocks and roots. VP Vice is fully rebuildable wth the available Rebuild Kit and you can also drop 70 grams off of the set with our Forged Titanium Axle upgrade kit.", "text": "VP Components Vice Downhill or Freeride Pedals (Pack of 2) The Vice is an incredible all around trail flat. It is simple, thin, grippy, and durable. 12 pins per side are enough to bite into any shoe out there and stick you to the pedals. The wide, yet low profile bodies give you a planted feel yet stay out of the way of rocks and roots. VP Vice is fully rebuildable wth the available Rebuild Kit and you can also drop 70 grams off of the set with our Forged Titanium Axle upgrade kit.", "image_url": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/41tfHhH1bJL._SX300_.jpg", "image_path": "data/images/sports/B006ZH1H7M.jpg", "metadata": {"categories": [["Sports & Outdoors", "Cycling", "Pedals & Cleats", "Pedals"]], "price": 77.08}}
